  ('almaty', 12, 84, 60, 58, 67.33, 'Excellent for early ski season, Shymbulak, Medeu, festive city atmosphere, winter photography and snow experiences, but holiday and ski demand progressively increase crowds and accommodation prices'),
  ('kok-tobe', 1, 55, 70, 72, 65.67, 'Good for snowy city panoramas, evening lights, cafés, and short cable-car visits, but cold temperatures, possible fog, ice, and reduced daylight make Kok Tobe less consistently comfortable than in spring or autumn'),
  ('kok-tobe', 2, 58, 74, 75, 69, 'Good winter option for quieter scenic visits, winter photography, cable-car rides, and city views; conditions remain cold, but visitor pressure and prices are generally more favorable than around New Year'),
  ('kok-tobe', 3, 64, 78, 78, 73.33, 'Good transitional month; temperatures gradually improve and crowds remain relatively low, although wind, rain, snow, haze, or variable visibility can affect panoramic views'),
  ('kok-tobe', 4, 78, 82, 80, 80, 'Very good for Kok Tobe; milder weather, greener city scenery, lower visitor pressure, cable-car rides, cafés, and photography create a strong balance of comfort and value'),
  ('kok-tobe', 5, 88, 74, 72, 78, 'Excellent for clear scenic visits, sunset photography, family outings, scenic dining, and combining Kok Tobe with central Almaty, though improving weather and holiday demand can raise crowds and prices'),
  ('kok-tobe', 6, 91, 68, 66, 75, 'Excellent for long daylight, evening cable-car rides, sunsets, panoramic city views, family recreation, and outdoor dining, but summer travel demand begins to reduce crowd and value scores'),
  ('kok-tobe', 7, 86, 58, 58, 67.33, 'Very good for evening visits and sunset views, especially as the hilltop can feel more comfortable than central Almaty during hot afternoons; summer holidays, weekend demand, and higher visitor numbers reduce crowd and price scores'),
  ('kok-tobe', 8, 87, 60, 60, 69, 'Very good for sunset, cityscape photography, cable-car experiences, and relaxed evening leisure, although warm weather and continued summer holiday travel keep crowds and prices relatively elevated'),
  ('kok-tobe', 9, 94, 76, 74, 81.33, 'Outstanding; one of the best months for Kok Tobe, with comfortable temperatures, strong visibility potential, long enough daylight, photography, scenic dining, and lower demand after peak summer'),
  ('kok-tobe', 10, 89, 82, 80, 83.67, 'Excellent; autumn colours, comfortable daytime temperatures, clearer-feeling conditions, city panoramas, sunset photography, and relatively lighter crowds make this one of the year''s strongest periods'),
  ('kok-tobe', 11, 62, 88, 86, 78.67, 'Good value for short scenic and evening visits, cafés, city lights, and photography when skies are clear; colder weather, shorter days, fog, and reduced visibility can limit the panoramic experience'),
  ('kok-tobe', 12, 57, 64, 62, 61, 'Fair to good for festive city lights, winter scenery, cable-car rides, and couples seeking an evening experience, but cold weather and New Year demand can reduce comfort, availability, crowd scores, and value'),
