  ('manali', 3, 88, 72, 76, 78, 'Very good for sightseeing, photography, temple visits, cafés, and early spring scenery. Higher areas may still have snow, while valley conditions gradually become more comfortable.'),
  ('manali', 4, 91, 78, 72, 80, 'Excellent for families and first-time visitors, with pleasant weather, accessible local attractions, apple-blossom scenery, and good conditions for nearby excursions.'),
  ('manali', 5, 86, 92, 88, 88, 'Good for escaping the plains’ heat and enjoying outdoor activities, but peak-season crowds, traffic, and higher accommodation prices can reduce comfort.'),
  ('manali', 6, 82, 90, 84, 85, 'Good for pleasant mountain weather, Solang Valley, Rohtang-area excursions, and family holidays, though school vacations, long weekends, and road traffic are common.'),
  ('manali', 7, 70, 58, 62, 63, 'Fair for budget travellers, quiet stays, and misty-landscape photography, but heavy rain may disrupt road journeys, trekking, rafting, and mountain excursions.'),
  ('manali', 8, 68, 52, 60, 60, 'Fair for quiet, green, and budget-friendly stays. Less suitable for fixed outdoor itineraries because of rain, slippery paths, landslide risk, and reduced visibility.'),
  ('manali', 9, 82, 64, 72, 72, 'Good as the monsoon eases; greenery remains attractive, crowds are manageable, and sightseeing and photography conditions gradually improve.'),
  ('manali', 10, 94, 72, 78, 81, 'Excellent all-round month with clear skies, pleasant temperatures, fresh mountain scenery, and strong conditions for photography, local sightseeing, and excursions. October is widely considered one of Manali’s best months.'),
  ('manali', 11, 93, 68, 76, 80, 'Excellent for clear mountain views, Hadimba Temple, Vashisht, Old Manali cafés, couples, families, and relaxed travel before the winter peak. Nights become noticeably colder.'),
  ('manali', 12, 89, 96, 94, 93, 'Excellent for Christmas atmosphere, winter photography, cosy stays, and snowfall possibilities, but peak prices, traffic, and crowds require advance booking and flexible plans. Christmas and New Year are among Manali’s busiest periods.'),
  ('dharamshala', 1, 90, 80, 82, 84, 'Excellent; cool, dry, and very comfortable for sightseeing and mountain views.'),
  ('dharamshala', 2, 92, 82, 84, 86, 'Excellent; one of the best-balanced months with pleasant weather and strong visibility.'),
  ('dharamshala', 3, 88, 76, 78, 84, 'Very good; clear, mild, and ideal for outdoor time before peak warmth builds.'),
  ('dharamshala', 4, 84, 72, 74, 76, 'Very good; warm but still comfortable, especially for relaxed sightseeing.'),
  ('dharamshala', 5, 78, 66, 70, 71, 'Good; warmer and busier, but still workable for shorter sightseeing days.'),
  ('dharamshala', 6, 72, 58, 62, 64, 'Fair; monsoon influence starts, with mist and rain but better value.'),
  ('dharamshala', 7, 68, 54, 58, 60, 'Fair; wet and cloudy, best for slow travel, cafés, and budget stays.'),
  ('dharamshala', 8, 70, 56, 60, 62, 'Fair; similar to July, with rain but manageable off-season value.'),
  ('dharamshala', 9, 80, 64, 68, 70, 'Good; rain eases and the weather becomes more reliable.'),
  ('dharamshala', 10, 90, 74, 78, 80, 'Excellent; one of the best months for views, walking, and photography.'),
  ('dharamshala', 11, 91, 78, 82, 83, 'Excellent; clear, pleasant, and a very strong overall month.'),
  ('dharamshala', 12, 89, 84, 88, 87, 'Very good; festive and comfortable, though peak travel demand can push prices up.'),
