  ('batu-cave:poi:climbing-the-iconic-272-colorful-rainbow-steps-to-reach-the-main-cathedral-cave-taking-in-panoramic-views-of-the-kuala-lumpur-skyline-along-the-way', 'batu-cave', 'Climbing the iconic 272 colorful rainbow steps to reach the main Cathedral Cave, taking in panoramic views of the Kuala Lumpur skyline along the way.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:admiring-and-photographing-the-towering-42-7-meter-golden-lord-murugan-statue-standing-dramatically-at-the-base-of-the-staircase', 'batu-cave', 'Admiring and photographing the towering 42.7-meter golden Lord Murugan statue standing dramatically at the base of the staircase.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:exploring-the-soaring-main-cathedral-cave-temple-cave-featuring-100-meter-high-ceilings-dramatic-open-sky-light-shafts-and-active-hindu-prayer-shrines', 'batu-cave', 'Exploring the soaring main Cathedral Cave (Temple Cave), featuring 100-meter-high ceilings, dramatic open-sky light shafts, and active Hindu prayer shrines.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:visiting-the-ramayana-cave-located-near-the-entrance-plaza-to-walk-through-life-sized-illuminated-dioramas-narrating-the-hindu-epic-marked-by-the-giant-15-meter-green-hanuman-statue-outside', 'batu-cave', 'Visiting the Ramayana Cave located near the entrance plaza to walk through life-sized illuminated dioramas narrating the Hindu epic, marked by the giant 15-meter green Hanuman statue outside.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:sampling-authentic-south-indian-vegetarian-cuisine-such-as-fresh-dosas-thalis-and-cold-coconut-water-at-the-traditional-banana-leaf-stalls-surrounding-the-ground-plaza', 'batu-cave', 'Sampling authentic South Indian vegetarian cuisine, such as fresh dosas, thalis, and cold coconut water, at the traditional banana leaf stalls surrounding the ground plaza.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:observing-the-wild-long-tailed-macaque-monkeys-playing-along-the-limestone-cliffs-and-staircases-while-maintaining-a-safe-distance-and-keeping-personal-belongings-secure', 'batu-cave', 'Observing the wild long-tailed macaque monkeys playing along the limestone cliffs and staircases (while maintaining a safe distance and keeping personal belongings secure).', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:browsing-the-ground-level-market-stalls-for-traditional-flower-garlands-brassware-incense-and-hindu-religious-souvenirs', 'batu-cave', 'Browsing the ground-level market stalls for traditional flower garlands, brassware, incense, and Hindu religious souvenirs.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:visiting-the-sri-venkatachalapathi-and-alamelu-temple-near-the-ground-entrance-to-observe-traditional-morning-pooja-rituals-and-dravidian-architectural-details', 'batu-cave', 'Visiting the Sri Venkatachalapathi & Alamelu Temple near the ground entrance to observe traditional morning pooja rituals and Dravidian architectural details.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:strolling-through-the-ground-level-cave-villa-grounds-to-view-the-outdoor-koi-ponds-small-artificial-waterfalls-and-cultural-murals-integrated-into-the-rock-face', 'batu-cave', 'Strolling through the ground-level Cave Villa grounds to view the outdoor koi ponds, small artificial waterfalls, and cultural murals integrated into the rock face.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:taking-the-direct-ktm-komuter-train-line-from-kl-sentral-experiencing-one-of-kuala-lumpurs-easiest-and-most-scenic-public-transit-connections', 'batu-cave', 'Taking the direct KTM Komuter train line from KL Sentral, experiencing one of Kuala Lumpur''s easiest and most scenic public transit connections.', 60),
  ('batu-cave:poi:participating-in-or-observing-the-massive-world-famous-annual-thaipusam-festival-typically-occurring-in-late-january-or-early-february-featuring-elaborate-kavadi-processions-and-thousands-of-devotees', 'batu-cave', 'Participating in or observing the massive, world-famous annual Thaipusam festival (typically occurring in late January or early February), featuring elaborate kavadi processions and thousands of devotees.', 50),
  ('batu-cave:poi:arranging-a-combined-private-half-day-tour-to-pair-batu-caves-with-nearby-regional-highlights-like-the-royal-selangor-pewter-factory-or-the-batu-caves-selayang-hot-springs', 'batu-cave', 'Arranging a combined private half-day tour to pair Batu Caves with nearby regional highlights like the Royal Selangor Pewter Factory or the Batu Caves Selayang hot springs.', 50),
  ('batu-cave:poi:exploring-the-detailed-tamil-hindu-art-and-literary-history-displays-housed-inside-the-interior-galleries-of-the-cave-villa-precinct', 'batu-cave', 'Exploring the detailed Tamil Hindu art and literary history displays housed inside the interior galleries of the Cave Villa precinct.', 50),
  ('batu-cave:poi:hiring-a-local-private-guide-at-the-plaza-base-to-gain-deep-insights-into-tamil-culture-hindu-mythology-and-the-400-million-year-old-limestone-geology-of-the-site', 'batu-cave', 'Hiring a local private guide at the plaza base to gain deep insights into Tamil culture, Hindu mythology, and the 400-million-year-old limestone geology of the site.', 50),
  ('batu-cave:poi:early-morning-sunrise-photography-sessions-at-the-base-plaza-to-capture-the-golden-lord-murugan-statue-bathed-in-first-light-without-peak-tourist-crowds', 'batu-cave', 'Early morning sunrise photography sessions at the base plaza to capture the golden Lord Murugan statue bathed in first light without peak tourist crowds.', 50),
  ('penang:poi:hunting-for-world-famous-street-art-murals-and-wire-artworks-along-the-heritage-alleys-of-george-town-including-ernest-zacharevics-iconic-kids-on-bicycle', 'penang', 'Hunting for world-famous street art murals and wire artworks along the heritage alleys of George Town, including Ernest Zacharevic’s iconic "Kids on Bicycle."', 60),
  ('penang:poi:sampling-penangs-world-class-street-food-at-legendary-hawker-hubs-like-gurney-drive-chulia-street-and-presgrave-street-must-tries-include-char-kway-teow-asam-laksa-and-hokkien-mee', 'penang', 'Sampling Penang’s world-class street food at legendary hawker hubs like Gurney Drive, Chulia Street, and Presgrave Street (must-tries include Char Kway Teow, Asam Laksa, and Hokkien Mee).', 60),
  ('penang:poi:riding-the-historic-funicular-railway-up-penang-hill-to-enjoy-panoramic-island-views-cooler-breezes-and-the-rainforest-canopy-walks-at-the-habitat', 'penang', 'Riding the historic funicular railway up Penang Hill to enjoy panoramic island views, cooler breezes, and the rainforest canopy walks at The Habitat.', 60),
  ('penang:poi:exploring-kek-lok-si-temple-in-air-itam-the-largest-buddhist-temple-complex-in-malaysia-featuring-the-massive-bronze-statue-of-kuan-yin-and-a-multi-tiered-pagoda', 'penang', 'Exploring Kek Lok Si Temple in Air Itam, the largest Buddhist temple complex in Malaysia, featuring the massive bronze statue of Kuan Yin and a multi-tiered pagoda.', 60),
  ('penang:poi:visiting-the-majestic-khoo-kongsi-clan-hall-and-the-pinang-peranakan-mansion-to-admire-intricate-19th-century-straits-chinese-architecture-and-heritage-treasures', 'penang', 'Visiting the majestic Khoo Kongsi clan hall and the Pinang Peranakan Mansion to admire intricate 19th-century Straits Chinese architecture and heritage treasures.', 60),
  ('penang:poi:walking-along-the-historic-wooden-stilts-of-the-clan-jetties-especially-chew-jetty-to-witness-authentic-floating-waterfront-communities', 'penang', 'Walking along the historic wooden stilts of the Clan Jetties (especially Chew Jetty) to witness authentic floating waterfront communities.', 60),
  ('penang:poi:touring-cheong-fatt-tze-mansion-the-blue-mansion-on-a-guided-heritage-walk-to-learn-about-its-feng-shui-design-and-historic-indigo-blue-courtyard-architecture', 'penang', 'Touring Cheong Fatt Tze Mansion (The Blue Mansion) on a guided heritage walk to learn about its Feng Shui design and historic indigo-blue courtyard architecture.', 60),
  ('penang:poi:taking-a-scenic-day-trip-to-the-northern-coast-to-explore-the-interactive-tropical-exhibits-at-entopia-butterfly-farm-or-the-high-adrenaline-obstacle-courses-at-escape-theme-park', 'penang', 'Taking a scenic day trip to the northern coast to explore the interactive tropical exhibits at Entopia Butterfly Farm or the high-adrenaline obstacle courses at ESCAPE Theme Park.', 60),
  ('penang:poi:strolling-through-the-vibrant-batu-ferringhi-night-market-along-the-northern-beach-strip-for-outdoor-shopping-street-snacks-and-oceanfront-dining', 'penang', 'Strolling through the vibrant Batu Ferringhi Night Market along the northern beach strip for outdoor shopping, street snacks, and oceanfront dining.', 60),
  ('penang:poi:visiting-fort-cornwallis-and-the-surrounding-esplanade-waterfront-to-explore-penangs-british-colonial-military-origins', 'penang', 'Visiting Fort Cornwallis and the surrounding Esplanade waterfront to explore Penang''s British colonial military origins.', 60),
  ('penang:poi:trekking-through-penang-national-park-the-smallest-national-park-in-malaysia-to-reach-secluded-spots-like-monkey-beach-or-the-rare-meromictic-lake-at-pantai-kerachut', 'penang', 'Trekking through Penang National Park (the smallest national park in Malaysia) to reach secluded spots like Monkey Beach or the rare meromictic lake at Pantai Kerachut.', 50),
  ('penang:poi:indulging-in-a-traditional-colonial-style-high-tea-experience-at-the-historic-eastern-and-oriental-e-and-o-hotel-overlooking-the-penang-strait', 'penang', 'Indulging in a traditional colonial-style high tea experience at the historic Eastern & Oriental (E&O) Hotel overlooking the Penang Strait.', 50),
  ('penang:poi:taking-a-trip-to-the-quiet-town-of-balik-pulau-on-the-islands-western-slope-during-durian-season-june-to-august-for-authentic-fruit-orchard-tastings', 'penang', 'Taking a trip to the quiet town of Balik Pulau on the island''s western slope during durian season (June to August) for authentic fruit orchard tastings.', 50),
  ('penang:poi:taking-a-leisure-ride-on-a-traditional-pedal-powered-trishaw-through-the-narrow-historic-shophouse-streets-of-george-town', 'penang', 'Taking a leisure ride on a traditional pedal-powered trishaw through the narrow, historic shophouse streets of George Town.', 50),
  ('penang:poi:visiting-the-quirky-wonderfood-museum-to-see-giant-hyper-realistic-replicas-of-malaysias-rich-culinary-heritage', 'penang', 'Visiting the quirky Wonderfood Museum to see giant, hyper-realistic replicas of Malaysia’s rich culinary heritage.', 50),
