  ('bohol:poi:taking-a-refreshing-plunge-into-the-natural-limestone-sinkhole-and-subterranean-waters-of-cabagnow-cave-pool', 'bohol', 'Taking a refreshing plunge into the natural limestone sinkhole and subterranean waters of Cabagnow Cave Pool.', 50),
