  ('nainital:poi:riding-the-aerial-ropeway-cable-car-from-mallital-up-to-snow-view-point-for-sweeping-panoramic-vistas-of-nanda-devi-trishul-and-nanda-kot-peaks', 'nainital', 'Riding the Aerial Ropeway cable car from Mallital up to Snow View Point for sweeping panoramic vistas of Nanda Devi, Trishul, and Nanda Kot peaks.', 60),
  ('nainital:poi:trekking-or-taking-a-pony-ride-up-to-tiffin-top-dorothys-seat-at-2-292-meters-for-360-degree-views-of-nainital-town-and-the-surrounding-kumaon-valley', 'nainital', 'Trekking or taking a pony ride up to Tiffin Top (Dorothy’s Seat) at 2,292 meters for 360-degree views of Nainital town and the surrounding Kumaon valley.', 60),
  ('nainital:poi:exploring-the-interconnected-animal-shaped-rocky-natural-tunnels-and-hanging-gardens-at-the-family-friendly-eco-cave-gardens', 'nainital', 'Exploring the interconnected, animal-shaped rocky natural tunnels and hanging gardens at the family-friendly Eco Cave Gardens.', 60),
  ('nainital:poi:embarking-on-a-day-trip-lake-hopping-circuit-to-explore-bhimtal-the-birdwatching-haven-of-sattal-and-the-lotus-filled-naukuchiatal', 'nainital', 'Embarking on a day-trip lake hopping circuit to explore Bhimtal, the birdwatching haven of Sattal, and the lotus-filled Naukuchiatal.', 60),
  ('nainital:poi:visiting-the-high-altitude-pandit-g-b-pant-high-altitude-zoo-to-observe-himalayan-wildlife-like-snow-leopards-tibetan-wolves-and-red-pandas', 'nainital', 'Visiting the high-altitude Pandit G.B. Pant High Altitude Zoo to observe Himalayan wildlife like snow leopards, Tibetan wolves, and red pandas.', 60),
  ('nainital:poi:hiking-up-naina-peak-china-peak-the-highest-point-in-nainital-2-615-meters-through-dense-oak-and-rhododendron-forests-for-sunrise-mountain-views', 'nainital', 'Hiking up Naina Peak (China Peak), the highest point in Nainital (2,615 meters), through dense oak and rhododendron forests for sunrise mountain views.', 60),
  ('nainital:poi:touring-the-colonial-era-raj-bhavan-governors-house-built-in-a-scottish-gothic-castle-style-with-expansive-manicured-golf-grounds', 'nainital', 'Touring the colonial-era Raj Bhavan (Governor''s House), built in a Scottish Gothic castle style with expansive manicured golf grounds.', 60),
  ('nainital:poi:browsing-the-vibrant-tibetan-market-bhotia-bazaar-near-the-flats-for-authentic-woolen-clothes-winter-wear-and-steaming-momos', 'nainital', 'Browsing the vibrant Tibetan Market (Bhotia Bazaar) near the Flats for authentic woolen clothes, winter wear, and steaming momos.', 60),
  ('nainital:poi:taking-a-peaceful-nature-walk-and-birdwatching-tour-through-the-quiet-forested-trails-of-pangot-and-kilbury-bird-sanctuary', 'nainital', 'Taking a peaceful nature walk and birdwatching tour through the quiet, forested trails of Pangot and Kilbury Bird Sanctuary.', 50),
  ('nainital:poi:visiting-gurney-house-the-historic-former-residence-of-legendary-hunter-turned-conservationist-jim-corbett', 'nainital', 'Visiting Gurney House, the historic former residence of legendary hunter-turned-conservationist Jim Corbett.', 50),
  ('nainital:poi:experiencing-quiet-reflection-at-the-church-of-st-john-in-the-wilderness-one-of-the-towns-oldest-colonial-structures-tucked-into-pine-woods', 'nainital', 'Experiencing quiet reflection at the Church of St. John in the Wilderness, one of the town''s oldest colonial structures tucked into pine woods.', 50),
  ('nainital:poi:seeking-spiritual-solace-at-the-revered-neem-karoli-baba-ashram-in-kainchi-dham-located-a-short-drive-outside-town', 'nainital', 'Seeking spiritual solace at the revered Neem Karoli Baba Ashram in Kainchi Dham, located a short drive outside town.', 50),
  ('nainital:poi:taking-a-scenic-day-drive-to-khurpatal-or-lovers-leap-lands-end-to-gaze-down-into-the-terraced-agricultural-valleys-below', 'nainital', 'Taking a scenic day drive to Khurpatal or Lover''s Leap / Land''s End to gaze down into the terraced agricultural valleys below.', 50),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:undertaking-the-sacred-darshan-of-adi-kailash-peak-5-945-m-at-jolingkong-base-camp-marveling-at-the-revered-pyramid-shaped-mountain-considered-the-abode-of-lord-shiva', 'adi-kailash', 'Undertaking the sacred darshan of Adi Kailash Peak (5,945 m) at Jolingkong Base Camp, marveling at the revered pyramid-shaped mountain considered the abode of Lord Shiva.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:viewing-the-natural-snow-pattern-formation-of-the-sacred-symbol-on-om-parvat-5-590-m-from-nabhidhang-viewpoint', 'adi-kailash', 'Viewing the natural snow-pattern formation of the sacred "ॐ" symbol on Om Parvat (5,590 m) from Nabhidhang viewpoint.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:performing-prayers-and-taking-in-reflections-of-the-holy-peak-at-parvati-sarovar-parvati-kund-an-emerald-green-glacial-tarn-situated-at-the-foot-of-adi-kailash', 'adi-kailash', 'Performing prayers and taking in reflections of the holy peak at Parvati Sarovar (Parvati Kund), an emerald-green glacial tarn situated at the foot of Adi Kailash.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:trekking-up-to-gauri-kund-a-high-altitude-sacred-lake-located-right-at-the-base-of-adi-kailash-deeply-revered-in-hindu-mythology', 'adi-kailash', 'Trekking up to Gauri Kund, a high-altitude sacred lake located right at the base of Adi Kailash, deeply revered in Hindu mythology.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:visiting-kuti-village-the-last-inhabited-bhotiya-settlement-before-the-border-named-after-mata-kunti-with-its-ancient-timber-architecture-and-historical-pandav-fort-ruins', 'adi-kailash', 'Visiting Kuti Village, the last inhabited Bhotiya settlement before the border, named after Mata Kunti with its ancient timber architecture and historical Pandav Fort ruins.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:stopping-at-gunji-village-the-main-cultural-hub-and-acclimatization-station-featuring-traditional-bhotiya-lifestyle-and-the-revered-kali-temple', 'adi-kailash', 'Stopping at Gunji Village, the main cultural hub and acclimatization station, featuring traditional Bhotiya lifestyle and the revered Kali Temple.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:visiting-kalapani-the-sacred-origin-point-of-the-kali-river-housing-ancient-temples-and-the-legendary-vyas-gufa-cave-associated-with-maharshi-ved-vyas', 'adi-kailash', 'Visiting Kalapani, the sacred origin point of the Kali River, housing ancient temples and the legendary Vyas Gufa cave associated with Maharshi Ved Vyas.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:staying-in-authentic-community-run-bhotiya-homestays-in-nabi-village-to-experience-traditional-mountain-hospitality-local-organic-cuisine-and-starry-night-skies', 'adi-kailash', 'Staying in authentic community-run Bhotiya homestays in Nabi Village to experience traditional mountain hospitality, local organic cuisine, and starry night skies.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:seeking-blessings-at-kainchi-dham-ashram-near-bhowali-dedicated-to-lord-hanuman-and-the-revered-guru-neem-karoli-baba-a-popular-starting-stopover-along-the-route', 'adi-kailash', 'Seeking blessings at Kainchi Dham Ashram near Bhowali, dedicated to Lord Hanuman and the revered guru Neem Karoli Baba, a popular starting stopover along the route.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:stopping-at-narayan-ashram-near-dharchula-a-tranquil-spiritual-retreat-built-in-1936-amidst-lush-himalayan-surroundings', 'adi-kailash', 'Stopping at Narayan Ashram near Dharchula, a tranquil spiritual retreat built in 1936 amidst lush Himalayan surroundings.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:exploring-the-border-town-of-dharchula-walking-across-the-footbridge-over-the-kali-river-to-glimpse-the-indo-nepal-border-culture', 'adi-kailash', 'Exploring the border town of Dharchula, walking across the footbridge over the Kali River to glimpse the Indo-Nepal border culture.', 60),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:taking-a-detour-to-the-jageshwar-dham-temple-complex-near-almora-featuring-over-100-ancient-9th-13th-century-nagara-style-stone-temples-set-in-deodar-forests', 'adi-kailash', 'Taking a detour to the Jageshwar Dham temple complex near Almora, featuring over 100 ancient 9th–13th century Nagara-style stone temples set in deodar forests.', 50),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:visiting-the-unique-chitai-golu-devta-temple-famous-for-thousands-of-brass-bells-and-written-petitions-to-the-kumaoni-god-of-justice', 'adi-kailash', 'Visiting the unique Chitai Golu Devta Temple, famous for thousands of brass bells and written petitions to the Kumaoni God of Justice.', 50),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:descending-into-the-underground-limestone-cave-shrine-of-patal-bhuvaneshwar-to-view-natural-rock-formations-representing-various-hindu-deities', 'adi-kailash', 'Descending into the underground limestone cave shrine of Patal Bhuvaneshwar to view natural rock formations representing various Hindu deities.', 50),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:watching-panoramic-himalayan-sunrise-vistas-over-nanda-devi-and-panchachuli-peaks-from-the-ridge-top-station-of-chaukori', 'adi-kailash', 'Watching panoramic Himalayan sunrise vistas over Nanda Devi and Panchachuli peaks from the ridge-top station of Chaukori.', 50),
  ('adi-kailash:poi:taking-short-side-hikes-to-observe-unique-geological-formations-such-as-pandav-parvat-ganesh-parvat-and-bheem-ki-kheti-along-the-vyas-valley-trek', 'adi-kailash', 'Taking short side-hikes to observe unique geological formations such as Pandav Parvat, Ganesh Parvat, and Bheem Ki Kheti along the Vyas Valley trek.', 50),
  ('om-parvat:poi:experiencing-the-world-famous-evening-ganga-aarti-at-har-ki-pauri-watching-hundreds-of-floating-lit-diya-lamps-illuminate-the-ganges-at-dusk', 'om-parvat', 'Experiencing the world-famous evening Ganga Aarti at Har Ki Pauri, watching hundreds of floating lit diya lamps illuminate the Ganges at dusk.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:taking-a-holy-ritual-bath-in-the-brahma-kund-the-sacred-primary-pool-at-har-ki-pauri-where-drops-of-divine-nectar-amrit-are-believed-to-have-fallen', 'om-parvat', 'Taking a holy ritual bath in the Brahma Kund, the sacred primary pool at Har Ki Pauri where drops of divine nectar (Amrit) are believed to have fallen.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:visiting-the-hilltop-mansa-devi-temple-via-the-udan-khatoola-cable-car-on-bilwa-parvat-for-panoramic-aerial-views-of-haridwar-and-the-ganges-valley', 'om-parvat', 'Visiting the hilltop Mansa Devi Temple via the Udan Khatoola cable car on Bilwa Parvat for panoramic aerial views of Haridwar and the Ganges valley.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:seeking-blessings-at-chandi-devi-temple-on-neel-parvat-reaching-the-twin-siddha-peeth-shrine-via-ropeway-across-the-river-channel', 'om-parvat', 'Seeking blessings at Chandi Devi Temple on Neel Parvat, reaching the twin Siddha Peeth shrine via ropeway across the river channel.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:exploring-the-legendary-daksha-mahadev-temple-in-kankhal-an-ancient-site-associated-with-satis-yajna-and-lord-shiva-in-vedic-mythology', 'om-parvat', 'Exploring the legendary Daksha Mahadev Temple in Kankhal, an ancient site associated with Sati''s Yajna and Lord Shiva in Vedic mythology.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:visiting-the-unique-8-story-bharat-mata-mandir-dedicated-to-mother-india-featuring-dedicated-floors-honoring-freedom-fighters-saints-and-indian-history', 'om-parvat', 'Visiting the unique 8-story Bharat Mata Mandir, dedicated to Mother India, featuring dedicated floors honoring freedom fighters, saints, and Indian history.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:visiting-saptrishi-ashram-and-sapt-sarovar-where-the-ganges-river-naturally-split-into-seven-streams-to-avoid-disturbing-seven-meditating-sages', 'om-parvat', 'Visiting Saptrishi Ashram and Sapt Sarovar, where the Ganges river naturally split into seven streams to avoid disturbing seven meditating sages.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:exploring-shanti-kunj-the-global-headquarters-of-all-world-gayatri-pariwar-renowned-for-its-peaceful-ashram-gardens-spiritual-learning-and-yajna-rituals', 'om-parvat', 'Exploring Shanti Kunj, the global headquarters of All World Gayatri Pariwar, renowned for its peaceful ashram gardens, spiritual learning, and Yajna rituals.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:taking-a-quiet-retreat-to-ma-anandamayi-ashram-in-kankhal-for-serene-meditation-viewing-her-memorial-shrine-and-experiencing-peaceful-grounds', 'om-parvat', 'Taking a quiet retreat to Ma Anandamayi Ashram in Kankhal for serene meditation, viewing her memorial shrine, and experiencing peaceful grounds.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:walking-through-the-vibrant-bustling-lanes-of-bara-bazaar-and-moti-bazaar-to-sample-authentic-north-indian-sweets-purchase-brass-pooja-items-and-try-local-street-snacks-like-kachoris', 'om-parvat', 'Walking through the vibrant, bustling lanes of Bara Bazaar and Moti Bazaar to sample authentic North Indian sweets, purchase brass pooja items, and try local street snacks like kachoris.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:visiting-maya-devi-temple-one-of-the-three-ancient-shakti-peeths-in-haridwar-believed-to-be-the-spot-where-the-goddess-satis-heart-fell', 'om-parvat', 'Visiting Maya Devi Temple, one of the three ancient Shakti Peeths in Haridwar, believed to be the spot where the Goddess Sati''s heart fell.', 60),
  ('om-parvat:poi:taking-a-wildlife-jungle-safari-at-the-motichur-gate-of-rajaji-national-park-to-spot-wild-asian-elephants-deer-species-and-native-birdlife', 'om-parvat', 'Taking a wildlife jungle safari at the Motichur Gate of Rajaji National Park to spot wild Asian elephants, deer species, and native birdlife.', 50);
INSERT INTO attraction (id, place_id, name, priority) VALUES
  ('om-parvat:poi:visiting-pawan-dham-a-striking-temple-famous-for-its-intricate-glasswork-elaborate-mirror-mosaics-and-reflective-idol-displays', 'om-parvat', 'Visiting Pawan Dham, a striking temple famous for its intricate glasswork, elaborate mirror mosaics, and reflective idol displays.', 50),
  ('om-parvat:poi:taking-a-scenic-day-trip-north-along-the-highway-to-explore-the-yoga-capital-of-rishikesh-visiting-triveni-ghat-and-walking-across-ram-jhula', 'om-parvat', 'Taking a scenic day trip north along the highway to explore the yoga capital of Rishikesh, visiting Triveni Ghat and walking across Ram Jhula.', 50),
  ('om-parvat:poi:exploring-the-canal-centenary-bridge-and-ranipur-jhal-where-major-water-headworks-split-the-ganges-into-engineered-irrigation-canals', 'om-parvat', 'Exploring the Canal Centenary Bridge and Ranipur Jhal, where major water headworks split the Ganges into engineered irrigation canals.', 50),
  ('om-parvat:poi:taking-short-morning-walks-along-the-serene-uncrowded-riverbanks-of-saptarishi-ghat-for-peaceful-photography-away-from-city-crowds', 'om-parvat', 'Taking short morning walks along the serene, uncrowded riverbanks of Saptarishi Ghat for peaceful photography away from city crowds.', 50),
  ('haridwar:poi:attending-the-grand-evening-ganga-aarti-at-har-ki-pauri-watching-thousands-of-brass-lamps-floating-diyas-and-rhythmic-chants-mirror-across-the-ganges-at-dusk', 'haridwar', 'Attending the grand Evening Ganga Aarti at Har Ki Pauri, watching thousands of brass lamps, floating diyas, and rhythmic chants mirror across the Ganges at dusk.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:taking-a-holy-dip-in-the-sacred-waters-of-brahma-kund-at-har-ki-pauri-believed-to-be-the-exact-spot-where-drops-of-divine-nectar-fell', 'haridwar', 'Taking a holy dip in the sacred waters of Brahma Kund at Har Ki Pauri, believed to be the exact spot where drops of divine nectar fell.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:riding-the-udan-khatoola-cable-car-up-bilwa-parvat-to-seek-blessings-at-the-hilltop-mansa-devi-temple-one-of-haridwars-revered-siddha-peeths', 'haridwar', 'Riding the Udan Khatoola cable car up Bilwa Parvat to seek blessings at the hilltop Mansa Devi Temple, one of Haridwar''s revered Siddha Peeths.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:crossing-the-river-via-cable-car-to-chandi-devi-temple-on-neel-parvat-for-panoramic-aerial-views-of-the-entire-shivalik-range-and-haridwar-city-skyline', 'haridwar', 'Crossing the river via cable car to Chandi Devi Temple on Neel Parvat for panoramic aerial views of the entire Shivalik range and Haridwar city skyline.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:exploring-the-ancient-daksha-mahadev-temple-in-kankhal-the-legendary-site-of-king-dakshas-yajna-and-a-primary-pilgrimage-hub-for-lord-shiva-devotees', 'haridwar', 'Exploring the ancient Daksha Mahadev Temple in Kankhal, the legendary site of King Daksha''s Yajna and a primary pilgrimage hub for Lord Shiva devotees.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:visiting-the-unique-bharat-mata-mandir-an-8-story-temple-dedicated-to-mother-india-showcasing-indian-history-freedom-fighters-and-cultural-heritage', 'haridwar', 'Visiting the unique Bharat Mata Mandir, an 8-story temple dedicated to Mother India showcasing Indian history, freedom fighters, and cultural heritage.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:seeking-quiet-meditation-and-peaceful-riverbank-darshan-at-saptrishi-ashram-and-sapt-sarovar-where-the-ganges-naturally-splits-into-seven-streams', 'haridwar', 'Seeking quiet meditation and peaceful riverbank darshan at Saptrishi Ashram & Sapt Sarovar, where the Ganges naturally splits into seven streams.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:taking-an-early-morning-rajaji-national-park-jungle-safari-motichur-or-chilla-gate-to-spot-wild-asian-elephants-leopards-and-diverse-bird-species', 'haridwar', 'Taking an early morning Rajaji National Park Jungle Safari (Motichur or Chilla Gate) to spot wild Asian elephants, leopards, and diverse bird species.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:visiting-the-serene-anandamayi-ma-ashram-in-kankhal-to-experience-traditional-ashram-quietude-meditation-halls-and-the-samadhi-shrine', 'haridwar', 'Visiting the serene Anandamayi Ma Ashram in Kankhal to experience traditional ashram quietude, meditation halls, and the samadhi shrine.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:walking-through-the-vibrant-moti-bazar-and-upper-road-markets-to-shop-for-brass-idols-rudraksha-beads-glass-bangles-and-authentic-ayurvedic-herbs', 'haridwar', 'Walking through the vibrant Moti Bazar and Upper Road Markets to shop for brass idols, rudraksha beads, glass bangles, and authentic Ayurvedic herbs.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:relishing-famous-local-street-foods-including-hot-kachoris-at-kashyap-kachori-bhandar-and-fresh-puris-with-halwa-at-mathura-walon-ki-prachin-dukan', 'haridwar', 'Relishing famous local street foods, including hot kachoris at Kashyap Kachori Bhandar and fresh puris with halwa at Mathura Walon Ki Prachin Dukan.', 60),
  ('haridwar:poi:visiting-shantikunj-gayatri-parivar-a-massive-spiritual-and-social-organization-offering-holistic-living-courses-scientific-spirituality-workshops-and-yajna-rituals', 'haridwar', 'Visiting Shantikunj Gayatri Parivar, a massive spiritual and social organization offering holistic living courses, scientific spirituality workshops, and Yajna rituals.', 50),
  ('haridwar:poi:taking-a-short-30-kilometer-day-trip-to-rishikesh-to-walk-across-the-iconic-lakshman-jhula-and-ram-jhula-suspension-bridges', 'haridwar', 'Taking a short 30-kilometer day trip to Rishikesh to walk across the iconic Lakshman Jhula & Ram Jhula suspension bridges.', 50),
  ('haridwar:poi:visiting-pawan-dham-a-striking-modern-temple-famous-for-its-intricate-glasswork-and-mirror-mosaic-idols', 'haridwar', 'Visiting Pawan Dham, a striking modern temple famous for its intricate glasswork and mirror-mosaic idols.', 50),
  ('haridwar:poi:exploring-parad-shivling-at-harihar-ashram-featuring-a-rare-151-kg-sacred-shiva-lingam-crafted-entirely-from-pure-mercury', 'haridwar', 'Exploring Parad Shivling at Harihar Ashram, featuring a rare 151 kg sacred Shiva Lingam crafted entirely from pure mercury.', 50),
  ('haridwar:poi:strolling-along-the-quiet-walking-paths-of-neel-dhara-pakshi-vihar-along-the-main-ganges-canal-for-seasonal-migratory-bird-watching-in-winter', 'haridwar', 'Strolling along the quiet walking paths of Neel Dhara Pakshi Vihar along the main Ganges canal for seasonal migratory bird watching in winter.', 50),
  ('srinagar:poi:taking-an-early-morning-shikara-ride-on-dal-lake-floating-through-the-morning-vegetable-market-and-tranquil-lotus-filled-channels-as-the-sun-rises-over-the-zabarwan-range', 'srinagar', 'Taking an early morning Shikara ride on Dal Lake, floating through the morning vegetable market and tranquil lotus-filled channels as the sun rises over the Zabarwan range.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:experiencing-a-stay-in-a-traditional-hand-carved-wooden-houseboat-on-dal-or-nigeen-lake-enjoying-classic-kashmiri-hospitality-and-views-over-the-water', 'srinagar', 'Experiencing a stay in a traditional hand-carved wooden Houseboat on Dal or Nigeen Lake, enjoying classic Kashmiri hospitality and views over the water.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:exploring-the-iconic-mughal-gardens-nishat-bagh-garden-of-joy-and-shalimar-bagh-abode-of-love-celebrated-for-their-terraced-lawns-stone-fountains-and-historic-chinar-trees', 'srinagar', 'Exploring the iconic Mughal Gardens—Nishat Bagh (Garden of Joy) and Shalimar Bagh (Abode of Love)—celebrated for their terraced lawns, stone fountains, and historic Chinar trees.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:visiting-the-sacred-white-marble-hazratbal-shrine-on-the-northern-banks-of-nigeen-lake-housing-the-revered-relic-of-the-prophet-muhammad', 'srinagar', 'Visiting the sacred white-marble Hazratbal Shrine on the northern banks of Nigeen Lake, housing the revered relic of the Prophet Muhammad.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:ascending-the-hill-to-the-ancient-6th-century-shankaracharya-temple-dedicated-to-lord-shiva-offering-a-breathtaking-360-degree-panoramic-view-of-srinagar-city-and-dal-lake', 'srinagar', 'Ascending the hill to the ancient 6th-century Shankaracharya Temple dedicated to Lord Shiva, offering a breathtaking 360-degree panoramic view of Srinagar city and Dal Lake.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:walking-through-the-vibrant-spring-blooms-at-the-indira-gandhi-memorial-tulip-garden-seasonal-in-march-april-asias-largest-tulip-garden-set-against-the-zabarwan-mountains', 'srinagar', 'Walking through the vibrant spring blooms at the Indira Gandhi Memorial Tulip Garden (seasonal in March–April), Asia''s largest tulip garden set against the Zabarwan mountains.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:exploring-the-historic-old-city-srinagar-on-a-heritage-walk-visiting-the-14th-century-wooden-architectural-marvels-of-jamia-masjid-and-khanqah-e-moula', 'srinagar', 'Exploring the historic Old City (Srinagar) on a heritage walk, visiting the 14th-century wooden architectural marvels of Jamia Masjid and Khanqah-e-Moula.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:strolling-along-polo-view-market-and-residency-road-to-shop-for-government-certified-pashmina-shawls-walnut-wood-carvings-paper-mache-and-kashmiri-saffron', 'srinagar', 'Strolling along Polo View Market and Residency Road to shop for government-certified Pashmina shawls, walnut wood carvings, paper-mâché, and Kashmiri saffron.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:indulging-in-a-traditional-multi-course-kashmiri-wazwan-feast-including-rogan-josh-gustaba-and-yakhni-followed-by-a-hot-cup-of-saffron-infused-kahwa-tea', 'srinagar', 'Indulging in a traditional multi-course Kashmiri Wazwan feast (including Rogan Josh, Gustaba, and Yakhni) followed by a hot cup of saffron-infused Kahwa tea.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:visiting-pari-mahal-palace-of-fairies-a-seven-terraced-garden-built-by-prince-dara-shikoh-for-elevated-views-and-historic-ruin-exploration', 'srinagar', 'Visiting Pari Mahal (Palace of Fairies), a seven-terraced garden built by Prince Dara Shikoh, for elevated views and historic ruin exploration.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:crossing-the-historic-wooden-bridges-kadals-over-the-jhelum-river-such-as-zainakadal-to-photograph-local-riverbank-life-and-vernacular-architecture', 'srinagar', 'Crossing the historic wooden bridges (Kadals) over the Jhelum River, such as Zainakadal, to photograph local riverbank life and vernacular architecture.', 60),
  ('srinagar:poi:taking-a-day-excursion-to-pampore-the-saffron-town-of-kashmir-during-the-autumn-harvest-season-october-november-to-witness-purple-saffron-fields-in-bloom', 'srinagar', 'Taking a day excursion to Pampore, the "Saffron Town of Kashmir," during the autumn harvest season (October–November) to witness purple saffron fields in bloom.', 50),
  ('srinagar:poi:exploring-badamwari-park-in-the-old-city-during-early-spring-to-see-the-historic-almond-orchards-covered-in-delicate-pink-and-white-blossoms', 'srinagar', 'Exploring Badamwari Park in the Old City during early spring to see the historic almond orchards covered in delicate pink and white blossoms.', 50),
  ('srinagar:poi:visiting-the-sri-pratap-singh-sps-museum-in-lal-mandi-to-view-ancient-buddhist-bronzes-gandharan-sculptures-and-royal-kashmiri-textiles', 'srinagar', 'Visiting the Sri Pratap Singh (SPS) Museum in Lal Mandi to view ancient Buddhist bronzes, Gandharan sculptures, and royal Kashmiri textiles.', 50),
  ('srinagar:poi:taking-a-quiet-canoe-or-shikara-trip-through-anchar-lake-or-the-inner-wetlands-of-hokersar-for-seasonal-migratory-bird-watching-in-winter', 'srinagar', 'Taking a quiet canoe or Shikara trip through Anchar Lake or the inner wetlands of Hokersar for seasonal migratory bird watching in winter.', 50),
  ('srinagar:poi:taking-a-day-trip-up-to-the-hilltop-shrine-of-hari-parbat-fort-durrani-fort-and-the-adjacent-sharika-devi-temple-overlooking-the-city', 'srinagar', 'Taking a day trip up to the hilltop shrine of Hari Parbat Fort (Durrani Fort) and the adjacent Sharika Devi Temple overlooking the city.', 50),
  ('pahalgam:poi:exploring-the-iconic-picture-postcard-scenery-of-betaab-valley-walking-through-its-manicured-lawns-pine-forests-and-crystal-clear-streams-made-famous-by-classic-bollywood-cinema', 'pahalgam', 'Exploring the iconic, picture-postcard scenery of Betaab Valley, walking through its manicured lawns, pine forests, and crystal-clear streams made famous by classic Bollywood cinema.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:taking-a-scenic-drive-through-the-pine-groves-up-to-aru-valley-enjoying-its-serene-rolling-alpine-meadows-traditional-wooden-houses-and-snow-capped-mountain-backdrops', 'pahalgam', 'Taking a scenic drive through the pine groves up to Aru Valley, enjoying its serene rolling alpine meadows, traditional wooden houses, and snow-capped mountain backdrops.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:taking-a-pony-ride-or-hiking-up-through-dense-pine-trails-to-baisaran-valley-famously-dubbed-mini-switzerland-for-its-sprawling-elevated-hilltop-pastures-overlooking-the-pahalgam-valley', 'pahalgam', 'Taking a pony ride or hiking up through dense pine trails to Baisaran Valley, famously dubbed "Mini Switzerland" for its sprawling, elevated hilltop pastures overlooking the Pahalgam valley.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:relaxing-along-the-banks-of-the-roaring-lidder-river-taking-in-the-crisp-mountain-air-enjoying-riverbank-picnics-or-staying-at-a-riverside-resort', 'pahalgam', 'Relaxing along the banks of the roaring Lidder River, taking in the crisp mountain air, enjoying riverbank picnics, or staying at a riverside resort.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:visiting-chandanwari-the-official-starting-base-camp-of-the-holy-shri-amarnath-yatra-to-witness-dramatic-river-gorges-and-early-summer-snow-bridges', 'pahalgam', 'Visiting Chandanwari, the official starting base camp of the holy Shri Amarnath Yatra, to witness dramatic river gorges and early-summer snow bridges.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:offering-prayers-at-the-historic-mamleshwar-shiva-temple-a-protected-12th-century-stone-temple-standing-on-the-banks-of-the-lidder-river', 'pahalgam', 'Offering prayers at the historic Mamleshwar Shiva Temple, a protected 12th-century stone temple standing on the banks of the Lidder River.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:experiencing-thrilling-white-water-rafting-on-the-lidder-river-movera-to-ganeshpora-stretch-during-the-summer-season', 'pahalgam', 'Experiencing thrilling white-water rafting on the Lidder River (Movera to Ganeshpora stretch) during the summer season.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:shopping-in-the-bustling-pahalgam-main-bazaar-for-authentic-kashmiri-pashmina-shawls-saffron-walnut-wood-carvings-and-dry-fruits', 'pahalgam', 'Shopping in the bustling Pahalgam Main Bazaar for authentic Kashmiri Pashmina shawls, saffron, walnut wood carvings, and dry fruits.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:savoring-an-authentic-multi-course-kashmiri-wazwan-meal-featuring-rogan-josh-yakhni-and-gustaba-paired-with-hot-kashmiri-kahwa', 'pahalgam', 'Savoring an authentic multi-course Kashmiri Wazwan meal (featuring Rogan Josh, Yakhni, and Gustaba) paired with hot Kashmiri Kahwa.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:playing-a-round-of-golf-or-taking-a-scenic-walk-at-the-18-hole-lidder-valley-golf-course-in-laripora-surrounded-by-majestic-pine-hills', 'pahalgam', 'Playing a round of golf or taking a scenic walk at the 18-hole Lidder Valley Golf Course in Laripora, surrounded by majestic pine hills.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:enjoying-a-quiet-evening-stroll-through-club-park-and-pahalgam-amusement-park-along-the-riverbanks-with-family', 'pahalgam', 'Enjoying a quiet evening stroll through Club Park and Pahalgam Amusement Park along the riverbanks with family.', 60),
  ('pahalgam:poi:embarking-on-a-day-trek-to-the-pristine-high-altitude-tarn-tulian-lake-at-3-680-m-set-amidst-jagged-snow-bound-peaks', 'pahalgam', 'Embarking on a day trek to the pristine high-altitude tarn Tulian Lake (at 3,680 m) set amidst jagged, snow-bound peaks.', 50),
  ('pahalgam:poi:setting-off-on-a-multi-day-alpine-wilderness-trek-to-the-tarsar-marsar-lakes-or-the-kolahoi-glacier-starting-from-aru-valley', 'pahalgam', 'Setting off on a multi-day alpine wilderness trek to the Tarsar-Marsar Lakes or the Kolahoi Glacier starting from Aru Valley.', 50),
  ('pahalgam:poi:trying-your-hand-at-trout-fishing-and-angling-in-the-lidder-river-after-securing-permits-from-the-local-fisheries-department', 'pahalgam', 'Trying your hand at trout fishing and angling in the Lidder River after securing permits from the local fisheries department.', 50),
  ('pahalgam:poi:visiting-the-nearby-historical-ruins-of-awantipora-temples-along-the-srinagar-pahalgam-highway-route', 'pahalgam', 'Visiting the nearby historical ruins of Awantipora Temples along the Srinagar-Pahalgam highway route.', 50),
  ('pahalgam:poi:exploring-the-saffron-fields-and-walnut-orchards-around-pampore-and-bijbehara-during-the-drive-in-or-out-of-pahalgam', 'pahalgam', 'Exploring the saffron fields and walnut orchards around Pampore and Bijbehara during the drive in or out of Pahalgam.', 50),
  ('amarnath:poi:obtaining-the-mandatory-compulsory-health-certificate-chc-and-securing-official-shri-amarnathji-shrine-board-sasb-registration-yatra-permit-prior-to-setting-out', 'amarnath', 'Obtaining the mandatory Compulsory Health Certificate (CHC) and securing official Shri Amarnathji Shrine Board (SASB) Registration/Yatra Permit prior to setting out.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:standing-inside-the-holy-amarnath-cave-at-12-756-ft-3-888-m-for-solemn-darshan-of-the-naturally-formed-ice-shivlinga-alongside-the-ice-formations-representing-goddess-parvati-and-lord-ganesha', 'amarnath', 'Standing inside the holy Amarnath Cave (at 12,756 ft / 3,888 m) for solemn Darshan of the naturally formed Ice Shivlinga, alongside the ice formations representing Goddess Parvati and Lord Ganesha.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:experiencing-the-traditional-deeply-spiritual-45-km-multi-day-trek-starting-from-chandanwari-pahalgam-base-camp-through-scenic-alpine-landscapes-and-high-passes', 'amarnath', 'Experiencing the traditional, deeply spiritual 45 km multi-day trek starting from Chandanwari (Pahalgam base camp) through scenic alpine landscapes and high passes.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:marveling-at-the-pristine-high-altitude-glacial-waters-of-sheshnag-lake-11-730-ft-legendary-resting-place-of-the-thousand-headed-serpent-king', 'amarnath', 'Marveling at the pristine, high-altitude glacial waters of Sheshnag Lake (11,730 ft), legendary resting place of the thousand-headed serpent king.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:crossing-the-highest-mountain-pass-of-the-pilgrimage-mahagunas-top-mg-top-at-approximately-14-000-ft-testing-physical-endurance-amidst-dramatic-snowy-peaks', 'amarnath', 'Crossing the highest mountain pass of the pilgrimage, Mahagunas Top (MG Top) at approximately 14,000 ft, testing physical endurance amidst dramatic snowy peaks.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:reaching-the-vast-cold-confluence-valley-of-panchtarni-the-final-major-campsite-where-five-holy-rivers-converge-and-lord-shiva-left-the-five-elements', 'amarnath', 'Reaching the vast, cold confluence valley of Panchtarni, the final major campsite where five holy rivers converge and Lord Shiva left the five elements.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:taking-the-alternative-shorter-14-km-but-much-steeper-single-day-route-via-baltal-valley-along-the-roaring-sindh-river', 'amarnath', 'Taking the alternative, shorter (14 km) but much steeper single-day route via Baltal Valley along the roaring Sindh River.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:conquering-the-sharp-challenging-incline-of-pissu-top-early-in-the-pahalgam-route-trek-rewarded-with-panoramic-views-of-the-lidder-valley', 'amarnath', 'Conquering the sharp, challenging incline of Pissu Top early in the Pahalgam route trek, rewarded with panoramic views of the Lidder Valley.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:participating-in-selfless-community-service-by-accepting-hot-meals-herbal-teas-and-shelter-at-volunteer-run-bhandaras-langars-set-up-along-both-routes', 'amarnath', 'Participating in selfless community service by accepting hot meals, herbal teas, and shelter at volunteer-run Bhandaras/Langars set up along both routes.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:booking-a-non-scheduled-helicopter-ride-to-panchtarni-from-neelgrath-baltal-or-pahalgam-for-a-rapid-ascent-and-reduced-trekking-physical-burden', 'amarnath', 'Booking a non-scheduled Helicopter ride to Panchtarni (from Neelgrath/Baltal or Pahalgam) for a rapid ascent and reduced trekking physical burden.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:taking-a-ritual-holy-dip-in-the-icy-waters-of-the-sangam-point-or-amaravati-river-stream-just-below-the-cave-shrine-before-entering-for-darshan', 'amarnath', 'Taking a ritual holy dip in the icy waters of the Sangam point or Amaravati River stream just below the cave shrine before entering for Darshan.', 60),
  ('amarnath:poi:spending-a-extra-acclimatization-day-exploring-the-meadows-and-rivers-of-pahalgam-lidder-valley-or-sonamarg-baltal-before-starting-the-ascent', 'amarnath', 'Spending a extra acclimatization day exploring the meadows and rivers of Pahalgam (Lidder Valley) or Sonamarg/Baltal before starting the ascent.', 50),
  ('amarnath:poi:hiring-a-government-registered-pony-palki-palanquin-or-pithu-porter-at-designated-base-stations-to-support-journey-logistics-or-carry-heavy-backpacks', 'amarnath', 'Hiring a government-registered Pony, Palki (palanquin), or Pithu (porter) at designated base stations to support journey logistics or carry heavy backpacks.', 50),
  ('amarnath:poi:visiting-the-historic-martand-sun-temple-ruins-near-anantnag-en-route-from-srinagar-to-the-pahalgam-base-camp', 'amarnath', 'Visiting the historic Martand Sun Temple ruins near Anantnag en route from Srinagar to the Pahalgam base camp.', 50),
  ('amarnath:poi:taking-a-brief-spiritual-detour-to-bhairav-mandir-perched-on-the-ridge-overlooking-the-holy-cave-complex', 'amarnath', 'Taking a brief spiritual detour to Bhairav Mandir, perched on the ridge overlooking the holy cave complex.', 50),
  ('amarnath:poi:experiencing-tented-overnight-stays-at-barari-marg-or-domel-baltal-route-to-watch-dramatic-himalayan-starry-nights', 'amarnath', 'Experiencing tented overnight stays at Barari Marg or Domel (Baltal route) to watch dramatic Himalayan starry nights.', 50),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:completing-the-holy-pilgrimage-to-the-mata-vaishno-devi-cave-shrine-bhawan-nestled-in-the-trikuta-mountains-seeking-darshan-of-the-sacred-natural-rock-formations-pindis-representing-maha-kali-maha-lakshmi-and-maha-saraswati', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Completing the holy pilgrimage to the Mata Vaishno Devi Cave Shrine (Bhawan) nestled in the Trikuta Mountains, seeking darshan of the sacred natural rock formations (Pindis) representing Maha Kali, Maha Lakshmi, and Maha Saraswati.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:obtaining-the-mandatory-rfid-yatra-card-at-katra-base-camp-registration-centers-before-commencing-the-trek-via-the-traditional-banganga-route-or-the-clean-pony-free-tarakote-marg', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Obtaining the mandatory RFID Yatra Card at Katra base camp registration centers before commencing the trek via the traditional Banganga route or the clean, pony-free Tarakote Marg.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:taking-the-quick-bhawan-to-bhairon-ghati-ropeway-ride-to-visit-the-historic-bhairon-nath-temple-fulfilling-the-traditional-belief-that-the-pilgrimage-is-complete-only-after-visiting-bhairon-baba', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Taking the quick Bhawan to Bhairon Ghati Ropeway ride to visit the historic Bhairon Nath Temple, fulfilling the traditional belief that the pilgrimage is complete only after visiting Bhairon Baba.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:visiting-the-historic-raghunath-temple-in-central-jammu-city-one-of-the-largest-temple-complexes-in-northern-india-dedicated-to-lord-rama-with-complex-inner-sanctuaries-lined-with-gold-plating', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Visiting the historic Raghunath Temple in central Jammu City, one of the largest temple complexes in Northern India, dedicated to Lord Rama with complex inner sanctuaries lined with gold plating.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:experiencing-the-scenic-skyview-by-empyrean-ropeway-at-patnitop-taking-indias-highest-cable-car-ride-from-sanget-to-patnitop-over-pine-covered-valleys', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Experiencing the scenic Skyview by Empyrean Ropeway at Patnitop, taking India''s highest cable car ride from Sanget to Patnitop over pine-covered valleys.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:stopping-at-the-sacred-adhkuwari-temple-midpoint-along-the-trek-to-seek-blessings-near-the-garbhjoon-cave-where-goddess-vaishnavi-is-believed-to-have-meditated', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Stopping at the sacred Adhkuwari Temple midpoint along the trek to seek blessings near the Garbhjoon Cave, where Goddess Vaishnavi is believed to have meditated.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:exploring-the-grand-mubarak-mandi-palace-complex-in-jammu-showcasing-a-fusion-of-rajasthani-mughal-and-european-architecture-overlooking-the-tawi-river', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Exploring the grand Mubarak Mandi Palace Complex in Jammu, showcasing a fusion of Rajasthani, Mughal, and European architecture overlooking the Tawi River.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:taking-an-excursion-to-the-ancient-bahu-fort-and-bawe-wali-mata-temple-in-jammu-followed-by-a-stroll-through-the-terrace-garden-of-bagh-e-bahu', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Taking an excursion to the ancient Bahu Fort & Bawe Wali Mata Temple in Jammu, followed by a stroll through the terrace garden of Bagh-e-Bahu.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:taking-an-aerial-shuttle-via-helicopter-from-katra-to-sanjichhat-helipad-enjoying-views-over-the-trikuta-range-while-skipping-the-steep-mountain-climb', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Taking an aerial shuttle via Helicopter from Katra to Sanjichhat Helipad, enjoying views over the Trikuta range while skipping the steep mountain climb.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:strolling-through-raghunath-bazaar-and-katra-main-market-to-shop-for-high-quality-kashmiri-dry-fruits-walnut-kernels-premium-saffron-and-dogra-handicrafts', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Strolling through Raghunath Bazaar and Katra Main Market to shop for high-quality Kashmiri dry fruits, walnut kernels, premium saffron, and Dogra handicrafts.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:sampling-authentic-local-dogra-street-snacks-such-as-kaladi-kulcha-traditional-kashmiri-artisan-cheese-ambal-and-hot-sund-panjiri', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Sampling authentic local Dogra street snacks such as Kaladi Kulcha (traditional Kashmiri artisan cheese), Ambal, and hot Sund Panjiri.', 60),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:taking-a-day-pilgrimage-excursion-from-katra-to-the-mystical-shivkhori-cave-temple-in-reasi-to-see-the-natural-4-foot-tall-lord-shiva-lingam-inside-a-stalagmite-cave', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Taking a day pilgrimage excursion from Katra to the mystical Shivkhori Cave Temple in Reasi to see the natural 4-foot-tall Lord Shiva Lingam inside a stalagmite cave.', 50),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:taking-a-scenic-day-trip-to-sanasar-lake-an-alpine-meadow-ringed-by-deodar-trees-near-patnitop-to-experience-paragliding-and-nature-walks', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Taking a scenic day trip to Sanasar Lake, an alpine meadow ringed by deodar trees near Patnitop, to experience paragliding and nature walks.', 50),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:visiting-the-ranbireshwar-temple-in-jammu-renowned-for-its-massive-crystal-shiva-lingams-and-twelve-stone-lingams-representing-the-jyotirlingas', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Visiting the Ranbireshwar Temple in Jammu, renowned for its massive crystal Shiva Lingams and twelve stone Lingams representing the Jyotirlingas.', 50),
  ('katra-vaishno-devi:poi:taking-a-excursion-to-jhajjar-kotli-a-natural-mountain-stream-picnic-spot-located-along-the-jammu-srinagar-national-highway', 'katra-vaishno-devi', 'Taking a excursion to Jhajjar Kotli, a natural mountain stream picnic spot located along the Jammu-Srinagar national highway.', 50),
