  ('leh:poi:obtaining-the-mandatory-inner-line-permit-ilp-and-strictly-observing-48-hours-of-high-altitude-acclimatization-in-leh-11-500-ft-before-attempting-high-mountain-passes', 'leh', 'Obtaining the mandatory Inner Line Permit (ILP) and strictly observing 48 hours of high-altitude acclimatization in Leh (11,500 ft) before attempting high mountain passes.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:witnessing-the-color-changing-waters-of-high-altitude-pangong-tso-lake-13-940-ft-4-250-m-along-the-indo-china-border', 'leh', 'Witnessing the color-changing waters of high-altitude Pangong Tso Lake (13,940 ft / 4,250 m) along the Indo-China border.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:traversing-khardung-la-pass-17-982-ft-5-480-m-one-of-the-worlds-highest-motorable-roads-connecting-leh-to-the-nubra-valley', 'leh', 'Traversing Khardung La Pass (17,982 ft / 5,480 m), one of the world''s highest motorable roads, connecting Leh to the Nubra Valley.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:exploring-nubra-valley-to-ride-double-humped-bactrian-camels-across-the-cold-desert-sand-dunes-at-hunder', 'leh', 'Exploring Nubra Valley to ride double-humped Bactrian camels across the cold desert sand dunes at Hunder.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:marveling-at-the-massive-106-foot-maitreya-buddha-statue-and-historic-cliffside-complex-at-diskit-monastery', 'leh', 'Marveling at the massive 106-foot Maitreya Buddha statue and historic cliffside complex at Diskit Monastery.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:catching-panoramic-sunset-vistas-of-leh-town-the-stok-kangri-range-and-the-indus-valley-from-the-white-domed-shanti-stupa', 'leh', 'Catching panoramic sunset vistas of Leh town, the Stok Kangri range, and the Indus Valley from the white-domed Shanti Stupa.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:standing-at-sangam-point-nimmu-to-view-the-dramatic-confluence-of-the-emerald-indus-river-and-the-muddy-green-zanskar-river', 'leh', 'Standing at Sangam Point (Nimmu) to view the dramatic confluence of the emerald Indus River and the muddy-green Zanskar River.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:exploring-the-12-storey-thiksey-monastery-renowned-for-its-striking-architectural-resemblance-to-tibets-potala-palace', 'leh', 'Exploring the 12-storey Thiksey Monastery, renowned for its striking architectural resemblance to Tibet''s Potala Palace.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:visiting-hemis-monastery-the-largest-and-wealthiest-monastery-in-ladakh-home-to-a-rich-museum-of-ancient-relics-and-thangkas', 'leh', 'Visiting Hemis Monastery, the largest and wealthiest monastery in Ladakh, home to a rich museum of ancient relics and thangkas.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:touring-the-17th-century-royal-leh-palace-and-hiking-up-to-the-hilltop-namgyal-tsemo-gompa-overlooking-old-town', 'leh', 'Touring the 17th-century Royal Leh Palace and hiking up to the hilltop Namgyal Tsemo Gompa overlooking Old Town.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:crossing-chang-la-pass-17-590-ft-the-second-major-high-pass-along-the-road-to-pangong-lake', 'leh', 'Crossing Chang La Pass (17,590 ft), the second major high pass along the road to Pangong Lake.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:experiencing-the-optical-illusion-at-magnetic-hill-along-the-srinagar-leh-highway-where-vehicles-appear-to-defy-gravity', 'leh', 'Experiencing the optical illusion at Magnetic Hill along the Srinagar–Leh Highway where vehicles appear to defy gravity.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:paying-homage-and-partaking-in-warm-community-langar-at-the-historic-gurudwara-pathar-sahib-maintained-by-the-indian-army', 'leh', 'Paying homage and partaking in warm community langar at the historic Gurudwara Pathar Sahib maintained by the Indian Army.', 60),
  ('leh:poi:journeying-further-to-the-remote-border-village-of-turtuk-one-of-the-northernmost-villages-in-india-to-experience-balti-culture-and-apricot-orchards', 'leh', 'Journeying further to the remote border village of Turtuk, one of the northernmost villages in India, to experience Balti culture and apricot orchards.', 50),
  ('leh:poi:taking-an-extended-overland-trip-to-the-serene-high-altitude-alpine-lake-tso-moriri-on-the-changthang-plateau', 'leh', 'Taking an extended overland trip to the serene, high-altitude alpine lake Tso Moriri on the Changthang Plateau.', 50),
  ('leh:poi:experiencing-white-water-river-rafting-along-the-rapid-stretches-of-the-zanskar-river-or-indus-river', 'leh', 'Experiencing white-water river rafting along the rapid stretches of the Zanskar River or Indus River.', 50),
  ('leh:poi:paying-respects-to-fallen-soldiers-at-the-hall-of-fame-war-museum-on-the-outskirts-of-leh', 'leh', 'Paying respects to fallen soldiers at the Hall of Fame War Museum on the outskirts of Leh.', 50),
  ('leh:poi:visiting-the-moonlike-yellow-clay-rock-formations-and-ancient-11th-century-gompa-at-lamayuru-monastery-along-nh1', 'leh', 'Visiting the moonlike yellow-clay rock formations and ancient 11th-century gompa at Lamayuru Monastery along NH1.', 50),
  ('leh:poi:shopping-for-authentic-pashmina-shawls-silver-jewelry-prayer-wheels-and-tibetan-artifacts-in-leh-main-bazaar', 'leh', 'Shopping for authentic Pashmina shawls, silver jewelry, prayer wheels, and Tibetan artifacts in Leh Main Bazaar.', 50),
  ('kargil:poi:paying-solemn-homage-at-the-kargil-war-memorial-drass-featuring-the-wall-of-remembrance-captain-manoj-pandey-war-gallery-and-an-epitaph-framed-against-tololing-peak-and-tiger-hill', 'kargil', 'Paying solemn homage at the Kargil War Memorial (Drass), featuring the Wall of Remembrance, Captain Manoj Pandey War Gallery, and an epitaph framed against Tololing Peak and Tiger Hill.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:marveling-at-the-massive-30-foot-ancient-rock-carved-maitreya-buddha-at-mulbekh-chamba-along-national-highway-1', 'kargil', 'Marveling at the massive, 30-foot ancient rock-carved Maitreya Buddha at Mulbekh (Chamba) along National Highway 1.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:journeying-into-the-picturesque-suru-valley-to-witness-the-breathtaking-twin-ice-and-rock-sentinels-the-nun-kun-mountain-massif-7-135-m-and-7-077-m', 'kargil', 'Journeying into the picturesque Suru Valley to witness the breathtaking twin ice-and-rock sentinels, the Nun-Kun Mountain Massif (7,135 m and 7,077 m).', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:driving-across-the-high-altitude-pensi-la-pass-14-430-ft-to-view-the-sweeping-serpentine-expanse-of-the-drang-drung-glacier', 'kargil', 'Driving across the high-altitude Pensi La Pass (14,430 ft) to view the sweeping, serpentine expanse of the Drang Drung Glacier.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:exploring-the-dramatic-fortress-like-18th-century-rangdum-monastery-perched-on-a-solitary-hillock-in-the-wild-high-altitude-plains-of-upper-suru-valley', 'kargil', 'Exploring the dramatic, fortress-like 18th-century Rangdum Monastery, perched on a solitary hillock in the wild high-altitude plains of upper Suru Valley.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:visiting-hunderman-border-village-and-museum-of-memories-an-offbeat-partition-era-village-overlooking-the-line-of-control-loc-just-outside-kargil-town', 'kargil', 'Visiting Hunderman Border Village & Museum of Memories, an offbeat partition-era village overlooking the Line of Control (LoC) just outside Kargil town.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:driving-to-parkachik-glacier-for-a-close-up-look-at-massive-ice-falls-and-glacial-melt-streams-flowing-into-the-suru-river', 'kargil', 'Driving to Parkachik Glacier for a close-up look at massive ice falls and glacial melt streams flowing into the Suru River.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:stopping-at-the-kartse-khar-rock-statue-a-giant-7th-century-rock-cut-standing-buddha-tucked-away-in-a-quiet-village-near-sankoo', 'kargil', 'Stopping at the Kartse Khar Rock Statue, a giant 7th-century rock-cut standing Buddha tucked away in a quiet village near Sankoo.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:exploring-the-dramatic-ruins-of-chiktan-fort-an-ancient-16th-century-wooden-and-stone-castle-perched-precariously-on-a-craggy-cliffside', 'kargil', 'Exploring the dramatic ruins of Chiktan Fort, an ancient 16th-century wooden-and-stone castle perched precariously on a craggy cliffside.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:visiting-sankoo-town-known-as-the-gulmarg-of-ladakh-for-its-lush-green-meadows-dense-poplar-groves-and-pristine-picnic-streams-along-the-suru-river', 'kargil', 'Visiting Sankoo Town, known as the "Gulmarg of Ladakh" for its lush green meadows, dense poplar groves, and pristine picnic streams along the Suru River.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:visiting-the-historic-kargil-main-market-and-baroo-sampling-local-ladakhi-balti-dried-apricots-raktsey-karpo-herbal-teas-and-regional-noodles', 'kargil', 'Visiting the historic Kargil Main Market & Baroo, sampling local Ladakhi/Balti dried apricots (Raktsey Karpo), herbal teas, and regional noodles.', 60),
  ('kargil:poi:visiting-the-mysterious-shergol-cave-monastery-built-directly-into-a-steep-vertical-cliff-face', 'kargil', 'Visiting the mysterious Shergol Cave Monastery, built directly into a steep vertical cliff face.', 50),
  ('kargil:poi:embarking-on-a-pilgrimage-trek-to-fokar-urgyan-rzong-a-sacred-cliffside-cave-hermitage-associated-with-guru-padmasambhava', 'kargil', 'Embarking on a pilgrimage trek to Fokar Urgyan Rzong, a sacred cliffside cave hermitage associated with Guru Padmasambhava.', 50),
  ('kargil:poi:taking-a-scenic-detour-into-the-cold-high-altitude-mushkoh-valley-behind-drass-during-summer-when-alpine-wildflowers-bloom-across-war-era-terrains', 'kargil', 'Taking a scenic detour into the cold, high-altitude Mushkoh Valley behind Drass during summer when alpine wildflowers bloom across war-era terrains.', 50),
  ('kargil:poi:setting-out-on-a-multi-day-mountaineering-or-trekking-expedition-toward-the-base-camps-of-mount-nun-or-mount-kun-from-panikhar-and-tangole-villages', 'kargil', 'Setting out on a multi-day mountaineering or trekking expedition toward the base camps of Mount Nun or Mount Kun from Panikhar and Tangole villages.', 50),
  ('kargil:poi:stopping-at-damsna-or-panikhar-for-river-rafting-along-the-icy-white-water-stretches-of-the-suru-river', 'kargil', 'Stopping at Damsna or Panikhar for river rafting along the icy, white-water stretches of the Suru River.', 50),
