  ('johannesburg', 'family', 'Navigating treetop obstacle courses, zip-lines, and rope bridges together at Acrobranch in Sandton.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'honeymoon', 'Taking a romantic hot-air balloon flight over the scenic landscapes of the Cradle of Humankind at sunrise.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'honeymoon', 'Booking a luxury private helicopter flight over the Johannesburg skyline paired with a mountaintop champagne picnic.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'honeymoon', 'Staying in exclusive boutique suites with private plunge pools at luxury properties like Saxon Hotel or Fairlawns Boutique Hotel & Spa.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'honeymoon', 'Indulging in a synchronized couples'' spa ritual amidst tranquil garden retreats in Craighall Park or Sandton.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'honeymoon', 'Embarking on a luxury multi-day rail journey on the Rovos Rail or Blue Train departing from Pretoria.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'romantic', 'Strolling through the manicured pathways and peaceful rose gardens of the Johannesburg Botanical Garden at Emmarentia Dam.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'romantic', 'Sipping craft cocktails while taking in sweeping city views from upscale rooftop bars in Rosebank and Sandton.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'romantic', 'Enjoying an intimate fine-dining experience at top-tier culinary restaurants along the Parks corridor.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'romantic', 'Browsing contemporary art galleries together followed by coffee along the tree-lined streets of Parkhurst.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'romantic', 'Packing a sunset picnic basket to watch the sun dip below the city horizon from Northcliff Ridge.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'luxury', 'Shopping for international luxury fashion brands and high-end jewelry at Sandton City and Diamond Walk.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'luxury', 'Experiencing exclusive multi-course tasting menus prepared by renowned South African chefs in Rosebank and Hyde Park.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'luxury', 'Chartering a private VIP safari transfer directly from Johannesburg to luxury Big Five reserves in Pilanesberg or Kruger.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'luxury', 'Booking private chauffeured luxury SUV transfers for seamless door-to-door transit across the metropolis.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'luxury', 'Enjoying high tea services, vintage wines, and fine dining at historic estate hotels in Westcliff.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'budget', 'Taking a self-guided walking tour around Nelson Mandela Square to view the iconic 6-meter bronze statue.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'budget', 'Visiting the Johannesburg Art Gallery (JAG) in Joubert Park to view historic and African art collections.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'budget', 'Exploring vibrant weekend artisanal food and craft markets like the Rosebank Sunday Market.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'budget', 'Hiking the scenic public trails and heritage paths across the Melville Koppies Nature Reserve.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'budget', 'Attending affordable open-air planetarium shows and science displays at the Wits Digital Dome.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'culture', 'Exploring South Africa''s 20th-century political history through powerful exhibitions at the Apartheid Museum.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'culture', 'Taking a guided heritage tour of Soweto to visit Vilakazi Street, the Nelson Mandela National Museum, and Hector Pieterson Memorial.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'culture', 'Walking through Constitution Hill to learn about South Africa''s transition to democracy inside a former prison complex.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'culture', 'Immersing in contemporary African design, street art, and studios in the urban Maboneng Precinct.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'culture', 'Learning about pre-colonial African civilizations and ancient rock art at the Origins Centre.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'adventure', 'Bungee jumping or swinging between the colorful, iconic cooling towers at Orlando Towers in Soweto.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'adventure', 'Quad biking and off-road dirt trails through the rugged terrain of the Magaliesberg foothills.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'adventure', 'Tackling indoor rock climbing routes and bouldering walls at CityROCK in Randburg.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'adventure', 'Taking tandem skydiving jumps over the scenic farmland regions outside the Johannesburg metro area.'),
  ('johannesburg', 'adventure', 'Mountain biking through dedicated trail networks and forested single-tracks at Wolwespruit or Northern Farm.'),
  ('cape-town', 'family', 'Taking a scenic ride on the Table Mountain Aerial Cableway and exploring the safe, flat summit walking paths with 360-degree views.'),
  ('cape-town', 'family', 'Visiting the Boulders Beach Penguin Colony in Simon''s Town to observe wild African penguins from close-up wooden boardwalks.'),
  ('cape-town', 'family', 'Discovering touch pools, sharks, and marine life exhibits at the Two Oceans Aquarium situated at the V&A Waterfront.'),
  ('cape-town', 'family', 'Riding the iconic Cape Wheel, taking harbor seal-watching boat tours, and playing at the outdoor playgrounds around the V&A Waterfront.'),
  ('cape-town', 'family', 'Walking across the elevated "Boomslang" Tree Canopy Walkway and enjoying open-air picnic lawns at Kirstenbosch National Botanical Garden.'),
  ('cape-town', 'honeymoon', 'Retiring to luxury coastal suites or private hillside villas in Camps Bay with uninterrupted views of the Atlantic Ocean and Twelve Apostles.'),
  ('cape-town', 'honeymoon', 'Taking a private romantic sunset cruise from the V&A Waterfront into Table Bay, complete with South African sparkling wine (Cap Classique).'),
  ('cape-town', 'honeymoon', 'Indulging in a luxurious couples'' spa treatment using indigenous fynbos botanicals at top five-star hotel retreats.'),
  ('cape-town', 'honeymoon', 'Experiencing fine-dining multi-course tasting menus at world-renowned vineyard restaurants in the nearby Constantia or Stellenbosch wine valleys.'),
  ('cape-town', 'honeymoon', 'Booking a private sidecar tour along the winding cliffside curves of Chapman’s Peak Drive during the golden hour.'),
  ('cape-town', 'romantic', 'Strolling hand-in-hand through the lush, manicured gardens and shaded forest pathways of Kirstenbosch National Botanical Garden.'),
  ('cape-town', 'romantic', 'Sipping craft cocktails or local wine while watching dramatic Atlantic sunsets from rooftop bars in the City Bowl or beachfront lounges in Camps Bay.'),
  ('cape-town', 'romantic', 'Exploring world-class contemporary African art together inside the architectural masterpiece of the Zeitz MOCAA museum.'),
  ('cape-town', 'romantic', 'Enjoying an intimate picnic with wine and local artisanal cheeses on the slopes of Signal Hill overlooking the city lights.'),
  ('cape-town', 'romantic', 'Packing a blanket for an evening open-air summer concert or movie screening under the stars at Kirstenbosch.'),
  ('cape-town', 'luxury', 'Staying in high-end five-star waterfront hotels or exclusive estate properties featuring private butler service and helicopter pads.'),
  ('cape-town', 'luxury', 'Booking a private helicopter flight over the Cape Peninsula for aerial views of Table Mountain, Cape Point, and two oceans.'),
  ('cape-town', 'luxury', 'Shopping for high-end South African diamonds, fine jewelry, and luxury designer fashion at the V&A Waterfront’s Silo District and Victoria Wharf.'),
  ('cape-town', 'luxury', 'Booking private wine-tasting experiences and cellar tours led by master winemakers at historic, award-winning estates.'),
  ('cape-town', 'luxury', 'Hiring a private chauffeur-driven luxury vehicle for customized day trips along Chapman''s Peak Drive and the Winelands.'),
  ('cape-town', 'budget', 'Hiking up Lion''s Head or taking the Platteklip Gorge trail up Table Mountain for spectacular, zero-cost panoramic views.'),
  ('cape-town', 'budget', 'Wandering through the vibrant, colorful streets of Bo-Kaap to photograph the Cape Malay architecture for free.'),
  ('cape-town', 'budget', 'Spending a low-cost day sunbathing, swimming, and watching surfers along the public beaches of Clifton and Camps Bay.'),
  ('cape-town', 'budget', 'Exploring the craft stalls, street food vendors, and live music at the weekend Bay Harbour Market in Hout Bay.'),
  ('cape-town', 'budget', 'Visiting the District Six Museum or Iziko South African National Gallery for very nominal entry fees.'),
  ('cape-town', 'culture', 'Taking the historic ferry to Robben Island for a poignant tour of the maximum-security prison led by former political prisoners.'),
  ('cape-town', 'culture', 'Learning about Cape Malay history, heritage, and traditional spice-infused cuisine on a guided walking and cooking tour in Bo-Kaap.');
