  ('bohol', 'budget', 'Swimming in the crystal-clear freshwater subterranean basin of Cabagnow Cave Pool in Anda for a minimal entry fee.'),
  ('bohol', 'budget', 'Sampling cheap local Filipino dishes (carinderia style), sweet calamay, and fresh tropical fruits at Tagbilaran City night markets.'),
  ('bohol', 'budget', 'Trekking through the lush trails and scenic viewpoints of Alicia Panoramic Park for low-cost outdoor adventures.'),
  ('bohol', 'culture', 'Visiting the historic Baclayon Church, one of the oldest coral-stone Catholic churches in the Philippines, and its colonial museum.'),
  ('bohol', 'culture', 'Viewing the historic Sandugo monument in Tagbilaran City, commemorating the 1565 Blood Compact between Spanish explorer Miguel López de Legazpi and Chieftain Sikatuna.'),
  ('bohol', 'culture', 'Touring local artisan workshops to learn how traditional Boholano calamay (sticky sweet treat in coconut shells) and loom-woven fabrics are crafted.'),
  ('bohol', 'culture', 'Exploring the heritage towns of Loboc and Maribojoc to admire Spanish colonial architecture and watch local choir performances.'),
  ('bohol', 'culture', 'Participating in local town fiestas or attending cultural dance presentations during Loboc River cruises.'),
  ('bohol', 'adventure', 'Ziplining, plunge-swinging, and rock climbing across deep river gorges at Danao Adventure Park.'),
  ('bohol', 'adventure', 'Scuba diving along the dramatic marine drop-offs and vibrant coral walls surrounding Balicasag Island Marine Sanctuary.'),
  ('bohol', 'adventure', 'Riding ATVs (all-terrain vehicles) along rugged dirt trails around the base of the Chocolate Hills.'),
  ('bohol', 'adventure', 'Cliff jumping into natural limestone sinkholes and exploring dark cavern networks in Anda.'),
  ('bohol', 'adventure', 'Stand-up paddleboarding or night kayaking down the full length of the Loboc River system.'),
  ('manila', 'family', 'Taking an educational and interactive walk through the National Museum of Natural History and National Museum of Fine Arts.'),
  ('manila', 'family', 'Renting a family pedal boat or taking a horse-drawn kalesa ride around the historic grounds of Rizal Park (Luneta).'),
  ('manila', 'family', 'Spending a fun-filled afternoon exploring interactive science exhibits and outdoor play zones at The Mind Museum in Bonifacio Global City.'),
  ('manila', 'family', 'Enjoying an oceanfront walk and watching the colorful street performances along the Manila Baywalk during late afternoon.'),
  ('manila', 'family', 'Exploring the lush greenery, picnic grounds, and children''s play areas inside the historic Washington SyCip Park and Jaime Velasquez Park in Makati.'),
  ('manila', 'honeymoon', 'Staying in ultra-luxury heritage suites at iconic properties like The Manila Hotel or modern high-rise luxury hotels in BGC and Makati.'),
  ('manila', 'honeymoon', 'Booking a private dinner cruise along Manila Bay to enjoy multi-course dining with front-row views of the famous Manila Bay sunset.'),
  ('manila', 'honeymoon', 'Indulging in synchronized couples'' traditional hilot massages and luxury spa therapies at world-class wellness centers.'),
  ('manila', 'honeymoon', 'Enjoying an intimate fine-dining experience at upscale chef-driven restaurants and romantic glasshouse eateries in Bonifacio Global City.'),
  ('manila', 'honeymoon', 'Taking a private, horse-drawn carriage tour through the atmospheric cobblestone streets of Intramuros illuminated by night lamps.'),
  ('manila', 'romantic', 'Strolling hand-in-hand through the tranquil, European-style stone courtyards and tropical gardens of Plaza San Luis and Casa Manila.'),
  ('manila', 'romantic', 'Sipping craft cocktails while taking in panoramic 360-degree night views of the metropolitan skyline from chic rooftop lounges in Makati and BGC.'),
  ('manila', 'romantic', 'Wandering together through the contemporary art galleries, outdoor sculpture garden, and boutique shops inside the Ayala Museum.'),
  ('manila', 'romantic', 'Enjoying an afternoon tea service or sunset glass of wine at historic bayfront lounges overlooking Manila Bay.'),
  ('manila', 'romantic', 'Catching a live orchestral concert, theatrical play, or ballet performance at the Cultural Center of the Philippines or Samsung Performing Arts Theater.'),
  ('manila', 'luxury', 'Staying in high-end 5-star international hotel suites featuring dedicated butler service, executive lounge access, and private helipads.'),
  ('manila', 'luxury', 'Shopping for world-renowned haute couture brands and luxury jewelry at Greenbelt in Makati or Central Square in BGC.'),
  ('manila', 'luxury', 'Experiencing exclusive multi-course tasting menus prepared by Michelin-starred and top international chefs in BGC and Makati.'),
  ('manila', 'luxury', 'Utilizing private, chauffeured luxury SUV or limousine airport transfers to bypass city transit queues smoothly.'),
  ('manila', 'luxury', 'Booking a private helicopter charter for a aerial tour over Manila Bay, Tagaytay, and the surrounding volcano landscapes.'),
  ('manila', 'budget', 'Embarking on a self-guided historical walking tour through the walled district of Intramuros and Fort Santiago for nominal entry fees.'),
  ('manila', 'budget', 'Joining a self-guided culinary crawl through Binondo to sample authentic hopia, pan-fried pork buns, and handmade noodles for low prices.'),
  ('manila', 'budget', 'Visiting the National Museum Complex, which offers free admission to all public galleries and exhibitions.');
