  ('nainital', 'family', 'Crawling and exploring through animal-themed interconnected rock formations at the Eco Cave Gardens.'),
  ('nainital', 'family', 'Riding a colorful pedal boat or traditional wooden rowboat together across Naini Lake.'),
  ('nainital', 'family', 'Spotting rare Himalayan wildlife—including snow leopards, red pandas, and royal Bengal tigers—at the High Altitude Zoo.'),
  ('nainital', 'family', 'Taking the thrilling Aerial Ropeway cable car ride up to Snow View Point for panoramic mountain vistas.'),
  ('nainital', 'family', 'Enjoying short pony rides up the scenic forested trail to Tiffin Top (Dorothy’s Seat).'),
  ('nainital', 'honeymoon', 'Booking a private early-morning wooden boat ride on Naini Lake surrounded by morning mountain mist.'),
  ('nainital', 'honeymoon', 'Taking the aerial cable car to Snow View Point to share sweeping views of Nanda Devi and Trishul peaks.'),
  ('nainital', 'honeymoon', 'Staying in historic heritage lakeside resorts or cozy hill-view suites along Ayarpatta and Mallital.'),
  ('nainital', 'honeymoon', 'Planning a romantic private day excursion to the tranquil, secluded waters of Naukuchiatal and Sattal.'),
  ('nainital', 'honeymoon', 'Enjoying candlelit dinners with views of the illuminated town and lake along upper Mall Road.'),
  ('nainital', 'romantic', 'Walking hand-in-hand along the quiet, pine-scented forest trails of Thandi Sadak on the peaceful side of Naini Lake.'),
  ('nainital', 'romantic', 'Sipping local hot filter coffee and herbal tea at cozy hillside cafes overlooking the valley.'),
  ('nainital', 'romantic', 'Packing a sunset picnic basket to watch the sun dip behind the Kumaon hills from Hanuman Garhi temple grounds.'),
  ('nainital', 'romantic', 'Exploring historic colonial architecture and peaceful manicured gardens at the Raj Bhavan estate.'),
  ('nainital', 'romantic', 'Taking an evening stroll past twinkling street markets along Mall Road after vehicle traffic closes.'),
  ('nainital', 'luxury', 'Staying at premier heritage properties like The Naini Retreat or Manu Maharani featuring luxury spa services.'),
  ('nainital', 'luxury', 'Booking private chauffeured SUV transfers for customized lake-hopping tours to Bhimtal, Sattal, and Mukteshwar.'),
  ('nainital', 'luxury', 'Retaining private certified naturalists for customized birdwatching expeditions in the Pangot and Kilbury forest reserves.'),
  ('nainital', 'luxury', 'Reserving private lakefront dining setups with curated Kumaoni and international multi-course menus.'),
  ('nainital', 'luxury', 'Purchasing fine handcrafted brassware and high-end artisanal scented candles directly from heritage craftsmen.'),
  ('nainital', 'budget', 'Taking a self-guided walking tour around Naini Lake along the flat pedestrian promenade.'),
  ('nainital', 'budget', 'Visiting the sacred Shree Maa Naina Devi Temple on the northern lake bank with no admission fees.'),
  ('nainital', 'budget', 'Browsing cheap winter wear, authentic woolen scarves, and local trinkets at the Tibetan Market.'),
  ('nainital', 'budget', 'Hiking up the nature trail to Naina Peak (China Peak) for high-elevation views without spending on transport.'),
  ('nainital', 'budget', 'Sampling affordable local street food delicacies like Aloo Ke Gutke, steaming momos, and Bal Mithai.'),
  ('nainital', 'culture', 'Learning about regional Kumaoni folklore and Shakti Peeth legends at the Shree Maa Naina Devi Temple.'),
  ('nainital', 'culture', 'Visiting Gurney House, the preserved former residence of hunter and conservationist Jim Corbett.'),
  ('nainital', 'culture', 'Exploring the colonial British governance history and Scottish Gothic architecture of Raj Bhavan.'),
  ('nainital', 'culture', 'Visiting the historic Church of St. John in the Wilderness tucked away in dense pine forests.'),
  ('nainital', 'culture', 'Immersing in authentic Tibetan refugee heritage and local crafts at the Bhotia and Tibetan Market stalls.'),
  ('nainital', 'adventure', 'Trekking through dense oak and rhododendron forests to reach the summit of Naina Peak (2,615 m).'),
  ('nainital', 'adventure', 'Trying tandem paragliding over clear blue lakes and terraced fields in nearby Naukuchiatal and Bhimtal.'),
  ('nainital', 'adventure', 'Rock climbing, abseiling, and rappelling under professional guidance around the cliffs of Tiffin Top.'),
  ('nainital', 'adventure', 'Kayaking and water sports on the expanses of Bhimtal and Naukuchiatal lakes.'),
  ('nainital', 'adventure', 'Embarking on multi-day high-altitude treks leading deeper into the Kumaon Himalayas from nearby base towns.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'family', 'Taking a comfortable multi-day 4x4 expedition through the scenic Vyas Valley to view the sacred peaks together without strenuous long-distance walking.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'family', 'Exploring the serene gardens, heritage architecture, and spiritual library at Narayan Ashram in Kailash-Manasarovar region foothills.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'family', 'Visiting the suspension bridge at Dharchula to experience the unique open Indo-Nepal border crossing over the Kali River.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'family', 'Gathering around evening bonfires at traditional Bhotiya homestays in Nabi village to learn about local Himalayan mountain folklore.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'family', 'Pausing for family photographs at the scenic Chirkila Dam reservoir along the Dhauliganga River.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'honeymoon', 'Sharing a serene sunrise view of Mount Adi Kailash reflecting on the mirror-like surface of Parvati Sarovar.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'honeymoon', 'Booking a private customized 4x4 vehicle trip with personal homestay arrangements for an off-the-beaten-path romantic mountain escape.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'honeymoon', 'Stargazing under zero-light-pollution alpine skies from the peaceful high-altitude village of Kuti.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'honeymoon', 'Taking a scenic couple''s walk through dense pine and oak forests around Narayan Ashram and surrounding Kumaon foothills.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'honeymoon', 'Experiencing high-altitude mountain solitude together at the tranquil Jolingkong valley base camp.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'romantic', 'Enjoying quiet morning walks along the pristine banks of the Kali River in the upper Vyas Valley.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'romantic', 'Sitting together near the tranquil waters of Gauri Kund at the base of Mount Adi Kailash.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'romantic', 'Taking in breathtaking 360-degree Himalayan views at the Nabhidhang viewpoint facing Om Parvat.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'romantic', 'Sharing hot local Kumaoni tea while admiring traditional wood-carved alpine houses in heritage villages like Nabi.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'romantic', 'Watching the evening sun illuminate the snow-clad peak of Baba Kailash from Jolingkong.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'luxury', 'Booking high-end helicopter-assisted pilgrimage tours from Pithoragarh or Dharchula to bypass long mountain road journeys.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'luxury', 'Securing dedicated private SUV transfers (Innova or Scorpio) with personal guides, porters, and emergency oxygen support throughout the circuit.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'luxury', 'Arranging private VIP darshan access and personalized priest-led pujas at Parvati Sarovar and Kali Temple at Kalapani.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'luxury', 'Staying in exclusive private room upgrades in upgraded village homestays with customized warm meals.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'luxury', 'Combining the Adi Kailash circuit with premium private heritage resort stays in Kausani or Bhimtal on the transit route.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'budget', 'Joining shared 4x4 Bolero or Tempo Traveller vehicles organized from Dharchula to split transportation expenses.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'budget', 'Staying in affordable village homestays or KMVN tourist rest houses in Dharchula, Gunji, and Nabi.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'budget', 'Dining on simple, nourishing local vegetarian food like dal-rice, roti, and herbal tea at local village dhabas.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'budget', 'Taking self-guided walking treks between neighboring border villages like Nabi and Kuti.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'budget', 'Completing the short 2 to 3 km hike from Jolingkong to Shiva-Parvati Temple on foot instead of hiring ponies.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'culture', 'Visiting the ancient cave site of Vyas Gufa at Kalapani, where Sage Ved Vyas is believed to have meditated.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'culture', 'Staying with local Bhotiya families in Nabi and Kuti to experience authentic border-zone Himalayan lifestyle and culture.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'culture', 'Exploring 500-year-old traditional stone-and-timber architectural homes in Kuti village.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'culture', 'Offering prayers at the historic Kali Temple located at the source of the Mahakali River in Kalapani.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'culture', 'Visiting the heritage Pandav Fort ruins in Kuti village associated with the Mahabharata legends.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'adventure', 'Marveling at the natural snow formation taking the shape of the sacred "ॐ" symbol on Om Parvat.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'adventure', 'Tackling rugged off-road dirt tracks and high-mountain passes aboard 4x4 vehicles in the remote Vyas Valley.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'adventure', 'Trekking to Gauri Kund at an elevation of 15,000 feet right at the foot of Mount Adi Kailash.'),
  ('adi-kailash', 'adventure', 'Embarking on high-altitude acclimatization hikes around Gunji village (~3,200 m).');
INSERT INTO purpose_activity (place_id, purpose, description) VALUES
  ('adi-kailash', 'adventure', 'Completing the sacred parikrama walk around Parvati Sarovar Lake at Jolingkong Base Camp (~4,500 m).'),
  ('om-parvat', 'family', 'Taking a scenic ropeway ride on the Udan Khatoola cable car up Bilwa Parvat to visit the Mansa Devi Temple with children and elders.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'family', 'Watching the evening Ganga Aarti together from the paved seating steps at Har Ki Pauri as hundreds of floating diya lamps light up the river.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'family', 'Exploring the 8-story Bharat Mata Mandir, using elevators to visit themed floors dedicated to Indian history, freedom fighters, and saints.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'family', 'Feeding holy fish and river turtles from safe, guarded walkways along the Upper Ganges Canal near Ranipur Jhal.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'family', 'Strolling through the peaceful, well-manicured garden pathways and lotus ponds at Shanti Kunj spiritual complex.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'honeymoon', 'Enjoying a quiet early morning walk along the serene, uncrowded banks of Saptarishi Ghat during sunrise over the Ganges.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'honeymoon', 'Booking a private riverfront luxury resort stay along the peaceful Motichur-Raiwala forest corridor near Rajaji National Park.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'honeymoon', 'Taking a romantic cable car trip up Neel Parvat to view panoramic 360-degree vistas of the Shivalik hills and Ganges valley from Chandi Devi Temple.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'honeymoon', 'Attending a private, priest-led evening Ganga puja along the quieter private ghats of a riverside heritage hotel.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'honeymoon', 'Combining a Haridwar spiritual retreat with a cozy private getaway trip to the nearby foothill towns of Rishikesh or Mussoorie.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'romantic', 'Sitting together on the steps of the riverbank at dusk to watch the golden light reflect on the fast-flowing Ganges.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'romantic', 'Sharing traditional hot Kumaoni and North Indian sweets like rabri, kulhad milk, and hot jalebis in the historic lanes of Moti Bazaar.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'romantic', 'Taking in scenic landscape views of the surrounding Shivalik forest range from the hilltop viewpoints near Chandi Devi.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'romantic', 'Enjoying an intimate, tranquil evening amidst the calm open green lawns of Ma Anandamayi Ashram in Kankhal.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'romantic', 'Watching the morning sun illuminate the ancient temple spires and ghat reflections along the riverfront.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'luxury', 'Staying at premium 5-star riverfront heritage hotels or boutique eco-resorts featuring private Ganges access, spa treatments, and fine dining.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'luxury', 'Booking private VIP boat rides or reserved front-row seating platforms for the main Ganga Aarti at Har Ki Pauri with dedicated pandits.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'luxury', 'Arranging private luxury SUV transfers (Innova Crysta) with personal guides, custom temple itineraries, and priority access passes.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'luxury', 'Experiencing customized Ayurvedic wellness programs, panchakarma therapies, and private yoga sessions at top-tier wellness retreats.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'luxury', 'Chartering private helicopter transfers from Dehradun''s Jolly Grant Airport or local helipads directly to regional pilgrimage circuits.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'budget', 'Taking a free or low-cost holy dip in the sacred Ganges waters at public bathing ghats like Brahma Kund and Subhash Ghat.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'budget', 'Staying in affordable dhabas, local pilgrim dharamsalas, or budget guest houses located along Ashram Road and Bupatwala.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'budget', 'Enjoying fresh, nourishing vegetarian meals, puri-aloo, and thalis at famous budget eateries like Mathura Walo Ki Prachin Dukan.'),
  ('om-parvat', 'budget', 'Using shared e-rickshaws and public auto-rickshaws (Vikrams) to navigate between major points like Har Ki Pauri, Kankhal, and Bupatwala.'),
