  ('leh', 'family', 'Marveling at the optical illusion of vehicles rolling uphill against gravity along the famous Magnetic Hill on the Srinagar–Leh Highway (NH1).'),
  ('leh', 'family', 'Watching the dramatic, color-changing confluence of the muddy Indus River and turquoise Zanskar River at Sangam Point (Nimmoo).'),
  ('leh', 'family', 'Feeding friendly marmots and taking family photos alongside decorated yaks along the shores of the world''s highest saltwater lake, Pangong Tso.'),
  ('leh', 'family', 'Enjoying a safe, double-humped Bactrian camel ride across the sand dunes of Hunder in Nubra Valley.'),
  ('leh', 'family', 'Exploring the massive, 108-foot golden outdoor statue of Maitreya Buddha overlooking the valley at Diskit Monastery.'),
  ('leh', 'honeymoon', 'Stargazing under light-pollution-free Himalayan skies inside cozy luxury dome tents or glamping sites at Pangong Tso or Nubra Valley.'),
  ('leh', 'honeymoon', 'Taking a romantic, slow-paced stroll together along the quiet, poplar-lined village trails and apple orchards of Turtuk.'),
  ('leh', 'honeymoon', 'Watching the sun cast warm golden light over Leh town from the whitewashed terraces of Shanti Stupa at dusk.'),
  ('leh', 'honeymoon', 'Sharing warm Tibetan butter tea, fresh apple pies, and artisan coffee in the garden cafes of Changspa.'),
  ('leh', 'honeymoon', 'Driving across Khardung La (17,982 ft), holding hands at one of the world''s highest motorable mountain passes.'),
  ('leh', 'romantic', 'Watching the early morning sun light up the red-and-white tiered facades of Thiksey Monastery, reminiscent of the Potala Palace.'),
  ('leh', 'romantic', 'Capturing couple portraits against the brilliant turquoise waters and snow-capped peak backdrops of high-altitude Tso Moriri Lake.'),
  ('leh', 'romantic', 'Relaxing together in the natural, warm mineral-rich thermal waters at Panamik Hot Springs in upper Nubra Valley.'),
  ('leh', 'romantic', 'Enjoying a quiet, private candlelight dinner featuring authentic Ladakhi and international cuisine at a boutique eco-resort in Sankar or Shey.'),
  ('leh', 'romantic', 'Watching clouds drift across the high-altitude cold desert landscape from the hilltop ruins of Namgyal Tsemo Gompa.'),
  ('leh', 'luxury', 'Booking an exclusive glamping experience in luxury heated geodesic domes or safari tents with The Ultimate Travelling Camp (TUTC) at Thiksey or Diskit.'),
  ('leh', 'luxury', 'Chartering private, chauffeured high-ground-clearance luxury SUVs (such as top-spec Toyota Innova Crysta) for all inter-valley highway crossings.'),
  ('leh', 'luxury', 'Arranging private, exclusive early-morning monastic prayer ceremonies (Puja) at Thiksey or Hemis Monastery.'),
  ('leh', 'luxury', 'Staying at high-end eco-luxury properties like The Grand Dragon Ladakh, Chamba Camp, or Indus River Camp with personalized butler services.'),
  ('leh', 'luxury', 'Private shopping tours for ultra-fine handwoven Cashmere Pashmina, certified organic sea buckthorn products, and antique Tibetan silver art.'),
  ('leh', 'budget', 'Staying in authentic, family-run Ladakhi homestays across villages like Turtuk, Hanle, and Spangmik for affordable rooms and homemade meals.'),
  ('leh', 'budget', 'Renting a budget mountain bike or scooter in Leh Main Bazaar to independently tour local sights like Spituk Monastery, Hall of Fame, and Zorawar Fort.'),
  ('leh', 'budget', 'Utilizing shared Tata Sumos or public UT Ladakh buses leaving from the Leh General Bus Stand to reach Diskit, Pangong Tso, and Kargil.'),
  ('leh', 'budget', 'Feasting on filling, low-cost regional dishes like Thukpa, Skyu, and steaming vegetable Momos at local eateries along Leh Main Bazaar.'),
  ('leh', 'budget', 'Attending vibrant, free-entry monastic festival mask dances (Cham) at historic gompas like Hemis, Gustor, or Dosmoche.'),
  ('leh', 'culture', 'Exploring the 9-story 17th-century Leh Palace, discovering royal artifacts, ancient mural frescoes, and architectural heritage.'),
  ('leh', 'culture', 'Touring the vast museum collection at Hemis Monastery, housing centuries-old thangkas, gold statues, and sacred Buddhist relics.'),
  ('leh', 'culture', 'Visiting Turtuk Village, immersing in the unique Indo-Aryan Balti culture, distinct architecture, and centuries-old wooden stone houses near the LoC.'),
  ('leh', 'culture', 'Walking through the historic Old Town Leh (Lhanchu), discovering ancient mud-brick alleyways, heritage stupas, and Central Asian trade history.'),
  ('leh', 'culture', 'Watching traditional Ladakhi archery matches, folk dance performances, and handicraft weaving during the annual Ladakh Festival.'),
  ('leh', 'adventure', 'Motorcycling across legendary high-altitude mountain passes including Khardung La, Chang La, and Umba La on a Royal Enfield Himalayan.'),
  ('leh', 'adventure', 'Trekking the world-famous winter Chadar Trek along the frozen surface of the Zanskar River.'),
  ('leh', 'adventure', 'Rafting down the thrilling Class III and IV white-water rapids of the Zanskar River from Chilling to Sangam.'),
  ('leh', 'adventure', 'Embarking on high-altitude wilderness treks across the Markha Valley or crossing mountain passes toward Tso Moriri.'),
  ('leh', 'adventure', 'Visiting the remote astronomical hub of Hanle, exploring the High Altitude Gamma Ray Telescope and Night Sky Sanctuary.'),
  ('kargil', 'family', 'Paying tribute to fallen national heroes together at the Kargil War Memorial (Drass), exploring the Manoj Pandey War Gallery and viewing iconic battle peaks like Tiger Hill.'),
  ('kargil', 'family', 'Stopping along National Highway 1 to marvel at the 30-foot ancient rock-carved Mulbekh Maitreya Buddha statue and exploring the adjoining monastery.'),
  ('kargil', 'family', 'Taking family picnics alongside the peaceful, willow-lined riverbanks and lush green meadows of Sankoo and Panikhar in the lower Suru Valley.'),
  ('kargil', 'family', 'Exploring the interactive exhibits, wartime artifacts, and historic photos at the Munshi Aziz Bhat Museum of Central Asian Artifacts in Kargil town.'),
  ('kargil', 'family', 'Visiting the Hunderman Border Village & Museum of Memories to view preserved partition-era family heirlooms and look out over the Line of Control.'),
  ('kargil', 'honeymoon', 'Staying in cozy riverside eco-resorts or mountain camps along the scenic Suru River, enjoying private views of snow-capped Himalayan ridges.'),
  ('kargil', 'honeymoon', 'Taking quiet, hand-in-hand evening walks through rural hamlets and fragrant apricot orchards in Shafat, Hardas, and Pashkum.'),
  ('kargil', 'honeymoon', 'Embarking on a picturesque, slow-paced road trip across high mountain passes like Fotu La and Namka La, taking couple portraits against raw trans-Himalayan backdrops.'),
  ('kargil', 'honeymoon', 'Watching the golden sunset illuminate the 18th-century cliffside Rangdum Monastery in the pristine, remote wilderness of upper Suru Valley.'),
  ('kargil', 'honeymoon', 'Sharing quiet moments under crystal-clear, unpolluted night skies with prime stargazing over the dramatic mountain ranges surrounding Kargil.'),
  ('kargil', 'romantic', 'Watching the early morning sun light up the towering, snowy double peaks of the Nun-Kun Massif (7,135 m) from scenic valley viewpoints near Tangole.'),
  ('kargil', 'romantic', 'Sipping hot, local saffron or butter tea (Gur Gur Chai) accompanied by fresh Ladakhi bread at cozy cafes along the Kargil Main Market.'),
  ('kargil', 'romantic', 'Capturing stunning couple photography at the foot of the massive Parkachik Glacier where ice walls meet the alpine valley floor.'),
  ('kargil', 'romantic', 'Strolling around the peaceful grounds of the Kartse Khar 7th-century rock-cut Buddha, surrounded by fluttering colorful prayer flags and mountain vistas.'),
  ('kargil', 'romantic', 'Enjoying scenic drives through the secluded, flower-filled Mushkoh Valley behind Drass during the vibrant summer bloom.'),
  ('kargil', 'luxury', 'Organizing custom, chauffeured private 4x4 SUV expeditions (such as Mahindra Scorpio or Toyota Fortuner) with dedicated mountain drivers to traverse the rugged Kargil-Zanskar corridor.'),
  ('kargil', 'luxury', 'Staying at exclusive high-end boutique lodges and luxury tented camps in Suru Valley and Drass, equipped with private heating and personalized dining.'),
  ('kargil', 'luxury', 'Booking private guided heritage tours through ancient, offbeat sites including the Chiktan Fort ruins and cliffside Shergol Cave Monastery.'),
  ('kargil', 'luxury', 'Arranging bespoke private tastings of rare regional delicacies, including organic sweet Ladakhi apricots (Raktsey Karpo) and wild mountain herbal teas.'),
  ('kargil', 'luxury', 'Securing VIP access and expert historian guides for private walkthroughs at the Kargil War Memorial in Drass.'),
  ('kargil', 'budget', 'Staying in clean, economical local family homestays, budget guest houses, or JKTDC tourist bungalows across Kargil, Drass, and Sankoo.'),
  ('kargil', 'budget', 'Traveling affordably across the district using shared Tata Sumos, regional shared cabs, and UT Ladakh public buses connecting Kargil town to outer villages.'),
  ('kargil', 'budget', 'Relishing low-cost, hearty regional dishes like thukpa, momos, and vegetable skyu at local dhabas in the Kargil Main Market.'),
  ('kargil', 'budget', 'Taking self-guided walking tours through the historic Kargil Old Bazaar and traditional Balti wood-and-stone residential quarters.'),
  ('kargil', 'budget', 'Exploring ancient open-air heritage sites with zero entry fees, such as the Mulbekh Buddha, Kartse Khar Buddha, and various high-altitude pass viewpoints.'),
  ('kargil', 'culture', 'Visiting the distinct Drokpa / Aryan Valley villages (Dah and Hanu) to learn about the unique customs, traditional headgear (Tepi), and heritage of the local Brokpa community.'),
  ('kargil', 'culture', 'Exploring the unique Islamic and Buddhist syncretic architecture of Kargil, including ancient Imambaras and wooden mosques featuring Kashmiri and Persian artistic influences.'),
  ('kargil', 'culture', 'Touring ancient monastic complexes such as Rangdum Monastery and the rock-cut Shergol Cave Monastery to experience high-altitude monastic life.'),
  ('kargil', 'culture', 'Sampling authentic Balti and Ladakhi culinary specialties, including Mamtu (dumplings), Paba & Tspar (barley dishes), and fresh apricot jams.'),
  ('kargil', 'culture', 'Participating in local summer cultural events, watching traditional Ladakhi archers and horse polo matches held on the grounds of Kargil town.'),
  ('kargil', 'adventure', 'Embarking on challenging mountaineering expeditions to the base camps and summits of Mount Nun (7,135 m) and Mount Kun (7,077 m) starting from Panikhar and Tangole.'),
  ('kargil', 'adventure', 'Trekking across high-altitude wilderness passes like Pensi La (14,430 ft) or the multi-day alpine trail connecting Suru Valley to Wardwan or Zanskar.'),
  ('kargil', 'adventure', 'White-water river rafting along the icy, thrilling rapids of the Suru River amidst dramatic mountain scenery.'),
