  ('nairobi', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 96 romance_score: 98 privacy_score: 90 luxury_score: 95 Recommended: Itinerary rule: Limit to **2 major activities per day**. Prefer: One memorable wildlife, cultural, or dining experience + free time. Over: Three or four rushed activities, long cross-city journeys, or excessive hotel changes. Recommended areas:', 339),
  ('nairobi', 20, 'luxury-travel', 'LUXURY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'luxury_score: 97 Recommended: Luxury should increase: Comfort, privacy, service, convenience, and exclusivity—not simply the number of activities. Prefer: One private wildlife or cultural experience + premium dining or relaxation. Over: Crowded group tours, poorly located hotels, peak-hour traffic, and overly busy itineraries. Recommended areas:', 340),
  ('nairobi', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, 'adventure_score: 82 Nairobi offers **urban, nature-based, and wildlife adventure**, rather than extreme high-adrenaline activities. Nairobi National Park provides the most convenient wildlife experience, while Karura Forest and Ngong Hills are better for outdoor exploration. Top experiences: Recommended areas: Best for: Avoid expecting:', 341),
  ('nairobi', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 86 walking_intensity: LOW → MEDIUM (mostly vehicle-based) Rules: Prefer: Avoid:', 342),
  ('nairobi', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: PARTIAL_TO_GOOD depending on attraction and transport public_transport_accessibility: VARIABLE hotel_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_HOTEL attraction_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Never infer accessibility from destination-level accessibility. Each hotel and attraction must carry its own accessibility data.', 343),
  ('nairobi', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'food_score: 84 Nairobi is an excellent food destination, offering Kenyan cuisine, international restaurants, cafés, markets, and premium dining. Food choices are widely available across Karen, Westlands, Gigiri, Riverside, and the city centre. Food experiences: Best for: Recommended areas: Travel-agent note: Nairobi offers much greater food variety than the Masai Mara, so food-focused travelers should allow at least one dedicated restaurant or local-cuisine experience. Confirm dietary requirements, restaurant opening times, reservations, and transport arrangements before booking.', 344),
  ('nairobi', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'shopping_score: 82 Nairobi is a strong shopping destination, offering modern malls, artisan markets, crafts, souvenirs, fashion, local products, and premium retail. It is far better suited to dedicated shopping than the Masai Mara. Best buys: Prefer: Avoid: Best for: Recommended areas:', 345),
  ('nairobi', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 76 Nairobi offers varied nightlife, including restaurants, lounges, rooftop venues, live music, cultural performances, and late-evening entertainment. The strongest nightlife areas are generally Westlands, Kilimani, Karen, Gigiri, and Riverside. Best for: Prefer: Recommended areas: Best evening experiences: Avoid:', 346),
  ('nairobi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS – NAIROBI HIGHLIGHTS', NULL, 'Day 1: Arrival at JKIA → Private transfer to hotel → Check-in and rest → Dinner in Karen, Westlands, or Gigiri Day 2: Morning: Nairobi National Park game drive Afternoon: Lunch and hotel rest Evening: Giraffe Centre or sunset dining Day 3: Morning: Karen Blixen Museum or Nairobi National Museum Afternoon: Maasai Market, shopping, or local food experience → Transfer to airport or onward safari', 347),
  ('nairobi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS – NAIROBI CULTURE, WILDLIFE & FOOD', NULL, 'Day 1: Arrival → Transfer to hotel → Relaxed lunch → Evening rooftop dinner or hotel dining Day 2: Morning: Nairobi National Park wildlife drive Afternoon: Lodge or hotel rest Evening: Local Kenyan dinner and cultural experience Day 3: Morning: Giraffe Centre → Karen Blixen Museum Afternoon: Lunch in Karen → Boutique shopping or gallery visit Evening: Relaxed dinner Day 4: Morning: Nairobi National Museum or Karura Forest → Airport transfer or onward safari', 348),
  ('nairobi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS – FAMILY NAIROBI', 'family', 'Day 1: Arrival → Private family transfer to hotel → Check-in and rest → Early child-friendly dinner Day 2: Morning: Short Nairobi National Park game drive Afternoon: Hotel pool and downtime Evening: Early dinner Day 3: Morning: Giraffe Centre Afternoon: Nairobi National Museum or family-friendly mall Evening: Relaxed meal near the hotel Day 4: Breakfast → Final short activity, if time allows → Airport transfer or onward journey', 349),
  ('nairobi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS – LUXURY NAIROBI', 'luxury', 'Day 1: Arrival at JKIA → Chauffeured private transfer → Luxury hotel check-in → Spa or private relaxation → Fine-dining dinner Day 2: Morning: Private Nairobi National Park game drive Afternoon: Hotel lunch and spa time Evening: Rooftop sundowner or private dinner Day 3: Morning: Private cultural, art, or shopping tour → Concierge-arranged airport transfer or scenic flight to a safari camp', 350),
  ('nairobi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS – HONEYMOON NAIROBI', 'honeymoon', 'Day 1: Arrival → Private airport transfer → Boutique hotel check-in → Couples’ spa or relaxed hotel time → Romantic dinner Day 2: Morning: Private Nairobi National Park game drive Afternoon: Leisurely lunch and downtime Evening: Sunset rooftop dinner Day 3: Morning: Giraffe Centre and Karen experience Afternoon: Boutique shopping or private art tour Evening: Private dining or relaxed hotel evening Day 4: Breakfast → Scenic flight or private transfer to the Masai Mara → Continue honeymoon safari', 351),
  ('nairobi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '1 NIGHT – TRANSIT STOP', NULL, 'Day 1: Arrival at JKIA → Airport-area hotel transfer → Check-in and rest → Dinner at the hotel Day 2: Breakfast → Complimentary or private shuttle to JKIA → Continue to the next destination', 352),
  ('nairobi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '4 NIGHTS – DEEPER NAIROBI EXPLORATION', NULL, 'Day 1: Arrival → Hotel transfer → Check-in and rest → Dinner nearby Day 2: Morning: Nairobi National Park game drive Afternoon: Hotel rest Evening: Kenyan dining experience Day 3: Morning: Giraffe Centre and Karen Blixen Museum Afternoon: Lunch and boutique shopping in Karen Evening: Relaxed dinner Day 4: Morning: Nairobi National Museum Afternoon: Karura Forest nature walk Evening: Rooftop dining or live music Day 5: Morning: Maasai Market, Railway Museum, or Nairobi Gallery Afternoon: Final shopping → Airport transfer or onward safari', 353),
  ('nairobi', 29, '7-night-honeymoon-pattern-amboseli', '7‑Night Honeymoon Pattern: Amboseli', 'Rift Valley → Masai Mara', NULL, '**Day 1 – Arrival Nairobi → Amboseli** **Day 2 – Amboseli (romance & photography focus)** **Day 3 – Amboseli → Lake Naivasha → Elementeita** **Day 4 – Elementeita → Masai Mara** **Day 5 – Masai Mara (full safari day)** **Day 6 – Masai Mara (deep wildlife & romance)** **Day 7 – Masai Mara → Nairobi** **Day 8 – Nairobi Departure**', 354),
  ('nairobi', 30, '7-nights-8-days-family-safari', '7 Nights / 8 Days Family Safari', 'Day 1 – Arrival Nairobi → Amboseli National Park', NULL, '> Family tip: Keep Day 1 light after travel – one short/medium game drive, early dinner, and rest.', 355),
  ('nairobi', 30, '7-nights-8-days-family-safari', '7 Nights / 8 Days Family Safari', 'Day 2 – Amboseli National Park (Elephants & Kilimanjaro)', NULL, '> Family pacing: Two game drives max, with a long midday break for kids to rest.', 356),
  ('nairobi', 30, '7-nights-8-days-family-safari', '7 Nights / 8 Days Family Safari', 'Day 3 – Amboseli → Lake Naivasha → Elementeita', NULL, '> This is a longer travel day; plan for breaks and keep afternoon activity to the boat ride only.', 357),
  ('nairobi', 30, '7-nights-8-days-family-safari', '7 Nights / 8 Days Family Safari', 'Day 4 – Elementeita → Masai Mara Game Reserve', NULL, '', 358),
  ('nairobi', 30, '7-nights-8-days-family-safari', '7 Nights / 8 Days Family Safari', 'Day 5 – Masai Mara Game Reserve (Full Safari Day)', NULL, '> Family focus: Big cats, herds of zebra/wildebeest, and plenty of “wow” moments; keep drives well‑timed around meals.', 359),
