  ('uplistsikhe', 31, 'four-nights-luxury-pattern', 'FOUR-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast at the hotel → Private luxury excursion from Tbilisi to Gori → Explore the historic city of Gori → Visit the Stalin Museum → Discover the museum''s historic collection and Stalin''s personal railway carriage Afternoon: Premium lunch experience → Continue to Uplistsikhe Cave City → Private exploration of the ancient rock-carved settlement → Discover historic cave temples, halls, dwellings and streets → Enjoy the dramatic landscapes surrounding Uplistsikhe Evening: Private return transfer to Tbilisi → Relax and unwind at the hotel → Fine Georgian dinner → Overnight at Tbilisi', 776),
