  ('shamakhi', 30, 'six-nights-family-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 7', NULL, 'Breakfast at the hotel → Leisure morning → Ganjlik Mall → Family shopping and entertainment → Children''s recreation / indoor entertainment where suitable → Continue to Deniz Mall → Shopping, cafés and family leisure → Last-minute souvenir shopping Afternoon: Return to hotel → Hotel checkout → Private transfer to Heydar Aliyev International Airport → Departure', 907),
  ('shamakhi', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 1', NULL, 'Arrival at Heydar Aliyev International Airport → VIP / premium airport assistance where arranged → Chauffeured premium transfer to Baku → Five-star hotel check-in → Premium room / suite → Relax and enjoy the hotel Afternoon: Private panoramic Baku city tour → Highland Park → Alley of Martyrs → Panoramic Baku Bay and Caspian Sea views → Flame Towers → National Assembly / Milli Majlis surroundings → Baku Boulevard → Private waterfront experience → Baku Eye / Ferris Wheel where operating Evening: Premium Azerbaijani / fine-dining experience → Optional rooftop or luxury hotel lounge → Chauffeured return to hotel → Overnight at Baku', 908),
  ('shamakhi', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast at the hotel → Private guided Baku heritage tour → Icherisheher / Old City → Palace of the Shirvanshahs → Maiden Tower → Historic streets, caravanserais and architecture → Private cultural interpretation and photography Afternoon: Premium lunch → Fountain Square → Nizami Street → Luxury shopping / leisure → Heydar Aliyev Center → Architecture and private photography experience Evening: Private / premium Caspian Sea boat experience where available and conditions permit → Fine-dining dinner → Optional premium lounge / rooftop experience → Overnight at Baku', 909),
