  ('moscow', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose - History = Red Square + Kremlin + Armoury + Diamond Fund + Lenin + Historical Museum + Gulag + Victory Park + Armoury, Culture = Tretyakov + Pushkin + Bolshoi + Metro palace + Kolomenskoye + Novodevichy, Family = GUM ice cream + Metro + VDNH + Zoo + Aquarium + River cruise + Gorky + Izmailovo + Sparrow Hills. 2. Groups by geography: Core Red Square/Kremlin/GUM/Zaryadye/Nikolskaya/Bolshoi 10min walk flat together, West Arbat/Pushkin/Cathedral of Christ/Gogolevsky together, South Tretyakov/New Tretyakov/Gorky/Red October/Muzeon together, North-East VDNH/Ostankino/Izmailovo together, South-West Sparrow Hills/MSU/Victory Park/Kolomenskoye together. 3. Uses hotel location strategically: RED SQUARE / KITAY-GOROD for first-timers/history/luxury + walk to Red Square + Kremlin + GUM + Zaryadye + Nikolskaya + Bolshoi. ARBAT for culture/cafes/quieter + boutique + Pushkin + Cathedral + Old Arbat. ZAMOSKVORECHYE for art/budget-mid + Tretyakov + Gorky + Red October + cheaper + art + bars. TVERSKAYA for business + mid-range + Mayakovskaya metro palace + shopping. 4. Places Red Square morning 9-11AM less crowd + Kremlin morning 10AM Armoury first slot + Zaryadye sunset 6-8PM + floating bridge sunset + river cruise sunset 7-9PM + Metro tour 11AM-3PM off-peak + Bolshoi evening 7PM + Tretyakov morning 10AM + Pushkin morning 10AM + Izmailovo Market weekend morning best. 5. Treats Moscow as 2 clusters/day + Metro tour separate half day + Bolshoi separate evening - Not checklist 6 clusters same day + Max 2 clusters + need metro + taxi + need private car family. 6. Always includes metro palace tour + Red Square night lights + Zaryadye floating bridge sunset + river cruise sunset + GUM ice cream + Kremlin + Armoury advance tickets + Bolshoi advance + private guide for Kremlin + Tretyakov + Pushkin + Yandex taxi + Aeroexpress + Sapsan train to St Petersburg.', 1205),
  ('moscow', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Red Square night + St Basil''s night lights + GUM + Zaryadye floating bridge night + Nikolskaya lights + river cruise night + Kremlin outside + GUM ice cream + Metro 2 stations Komsomolskaya + Mayakovskaya quick. No Kremlin inside Armoury + Diamond Fund. Reason: 1N too short for Kremlin inside + Armoury needs half day + queue + advance ticket. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Day1 City Red Square + St Basil''s + Lenin + GUM + Zaryadye + Nikolskaya + river cruise sunset, Day2 Kremlin + Armoury + Diamond Fund + Cathedral Square + Metro palace tour + Arbat + Cathedral of Christ + Tretyakov or Pushkin + Bolshoi evening. Reason: Core Moscow + Kremlin + Metro + Bolshoi + Zaryadye + river cruise + perfect quick 2N. IF: `trip_length >= 3 nights` THEN: Day 1: City Red Square cluster + Zaryadye + river cruise; Day 2: Kremlin + Armoury + Diamond Fund + Metro + Arbat + Cathedral + Sparrow Hills; Day 3: Tretyakov + Pushkin + Gorky + VDNH + Kolomenskoye + Izmailovo Market + Bunker-42 + Gulag + Victory Park + Bolshoi night + day trip Sergiev Posad Golden Ring optional. Reason: Complete Moscow + museums + parks + market + bunker + Golden Ring Day trip + Bolshoi. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: GUM ice cream + Red Square flat + Kremlin flat with help + Zaryadye flat + Metro palace flat + Arbat flat + Gorky Park flat + VDNH flat + Aquarium + Zoo + River cruise + Sparrow Hills car view + Kolomenskoye flat + Izmailovo Market flat + Circus + Bolshoi family show. Reason: Family favourites flat + fun + ice cream + zoo + aquarium + river + parks + safe + flat + easy + offbeat + safe. IF: `traveler_type == LUXURY / HONEYMOON` THEN: Four Seasons Kremlin view + Ritz Carlton O2 Lounge + St Regis + Ararat Park Hyatt + Metropol + private Red Square + private Kremlin + private Armoury + private Diamond Fund + Bolshoi VIP box + private Metro + private Tretyakov + White Rabbit + Pushkin Cafe + river private cruise + TsUM private shopping. Reason: Luxury Kremlin view + private + VIP + fine dining + rooftop + river private + best luxury Russia. IF: `traveler_type == BASE_TRAVELER_GOLDEN_RING` THEN: Moscow hotel Kitay-Gorod as hub + day trips Sergiev Posad Golden Ring 1.5hr + Vladimir/Suzdal 2.5hr + New Jerusalem + Kolomenskoye + day trips by train/bus + metro to station + Sapsan to St Petersburg. Reason: Best hub for Golden Ring + St Petersburg + Kazan + Suzdal + Vladimir + New Jerusalem.', 1206),
  ('moscow', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | Family | 84 Honeymoon | 78 Luxury | 92 Budget | 65 Adventure | 50 Culture | 96 Food | 76 Shopping | 84 Nightlife | 78 Relaxation | 70 Nature | 60 Accessibility | 70 Safety | 78 First-time visitor | 90 Photography | 90', 1207),
  ('moscow', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. First-time visitors + History lovers - Red Square + Kremlin + St Basil''s + Armoury Diamond Fund + Lenin + 240 museums + must-see capital + history + power 2. Culture + Museums + Ballet lovers - Tretyakov + Pushkin + Bolshoi ballet + Metro palaces + 7 Sisters Stalin skyscrapers + Kolomenskoye + history + culture + art 3. Luxury travellers - Four Seasons Kremlin view + Ritz Carlton + St Regis + Ararat Park Hyatt + Metropol + best luxury in Russia + fine dining White Rabbit + Pushkin Cafe + rooftop O2 Lounge 4. Photographers - Red Square night + St Basil''s colors + Kremlin night + Metro palaces + Zaryadye floating bridge + Moskva River night + Sparrow Hills night view + GUM lights 5. Golden Ring Base travellers - Best hub for Sergiev Posad 1.5hr + Vladimir/Suzdal 2.5hr + New Jerusalem + Kolomenskoye + day trips + Sapsan to St Petersburg + Kazan + Sochi extension Best duration: 3 nights ideal - 2 nights quick, 4 nights with Golden Ring day trip Sergiev Posad Best season: Jun-Aug warm + long days + river cruise + parks + festivals - Dec-Jan snow + Red Square Christmas market + GUM lights + ice rink + festive winter wonderland Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Metro $0.7 + day pass $2.5 + Yandex Go taxi $5-$15 + private driver $25-$35/day + walking Red Square-Kremlin-GUM-Zaryadye-Nikolskaya flat 10-12k steps + Aeroexpress $6-$7 to airport + Sapsan train to St Petersburg 3.5-4hrs $30-$80 Must-do: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Russia''s heart + history + power - Best Red Square + St Basil''s + Kremlin + Armoury Diamond Fund + Metro palaces most beautiful metro in world + Bolshoi ballet + 240 museums + luxury hotels Kremlin view + GUM + Zaryadye floating bridge + river cruise + Golden Ring base + best history + culture + luxury in Russia + photography + shopping + business + gateway. Biggest disadvantage: Huge megacity 12.5M + traffic 2hrs + expensi