  ('moscow', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 92/100 last_updated: 2026-08-29 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: RUSSIA_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: This Moscow file is suitable for itinerary design, traveller profiling, hotel-area strategy, and initial package planning. Prices, hotel inventory, Kremlin + Armoury + Diamond Fund + Bolshoi tickets, Metro timings, Aeroexpress timings, Sapsan train timings, Yandex taxi rates must be live-verified before quotation. Do not rely on generic Moscow package inclusions without confirming exact Red Square + St Basil''s + Kremlin + Armoury + Diamond Fund + GUM + Lenin + Zaryadye + Metro palace + Tretyakov + Pushkin + Bolshoi + Arbat + Cathedral of Christ + Sparrow Hills + Gorky + VDNH + Kolomenskoye + Izmailovo + Victory Park + river cruise + Bunker-42 + hotel area Red Square/Arbat/Zamoskvorechye/Tverskaya, Kremlin + Armoury + Diamond Fund tickets included or not, Bolshoi tickets included or not, Metro tour included, river cruise included, Golden Ring day trips included.', 1209),
