  ('st-petersburg', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', NULL, NULL, 'Family: Private driver $20-$30 door-to-door van to Belmond Grand Europe/Four Seasons Lion Palace area near Nevsky/Palace Square + family room + safe + near Hermitage + flat + elevator. Honeymoon: Private sedan + meet & greet + flower + direct to Belmond Grand Hotel Europe suite Palace Square view + Four Seasons Lion Palace suite + luxury + private + champagne + White Nights. Luxury: Chauffeured Mercedes $40-$60 to Belmond Grand Hotel Europe $400-$800 + Four Seasons Lion Palace $500-$1000 + Lotte $300-$600 + Astoria Rocco Forte $350-$700 + luxury + butler + fast track. Budget: Bus 39 $1 to Moskovskaya metro + metro $0.7 to Nevsky Prospekt/Gostiny Dvor + walk to hostel/hotel - Cheapest $1.5 + 1hr total + frequent. Senior: Private taxi $20-$30 door-to-door + hotel near Nevsky/Palace Square flat + elevator + private car for Hermitage + Peterhof + Catherine + minimal walking + driver helps luggage.', 1215),
