  ('st-petersburg', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'St Petersburg is particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. BIRCH - Signature tasting menu + modern Russian + $50-$80 + must + #1 St Petersburg + modern + Russian + must 2. COCOCOUTURE - Fine dining + $60-$100 + must + New Holland + modern + Russian + must 3. DUO GASTRO - Gastro + $40-$70 + must + modern + Russian + must 4. PYSHECHNAYA_DONUTS - Donuts $2 + Soviet + $2 + must + Bolshaya Konyushennaya 25 + historic + donuts + must + budget + Russian + must 5. MARKETPLACE_CAFE - Cafeteria + cheap $6-$10 + blini + pelmeni + borscht + must + budget + everywhere + Nevsky + must Family: Prioritise AC + Marketplace + Pyshechnaya + Teremok + early dining 7PM + buffet + kids menu + canal view + Nevsky Honeymoon: Include Birch + Cococouture + Duo Gastro + Belmond Grand Europe bar + Four Seasons Lion Palace XO bar + rooftop Terrasa + fine dining + White Nights dinner + canal view Budget: Pyshechnaya donuts $2 + Teremok blini $3 + Marketplace $6 + Stolovaya $6 + street food + local + $3-$6', 1222),
  ('st-petersburg', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: DLT + Galeria + Grand Palace + Nevsky + luxury brands + premium + high fashion + best + Nevsky + central + luxury + high fashion Budget: Nevsky market + Church of Spilled Blood market + Palace Square market + bargaining + best for souvenirs + cheap $5-$30 + must + Nevsky + Spilled Blood + Palace Square', 1223),
