+ bus 45min + train 30min + taxi $25 + Faberge Museum + Russian Museum + Summer Garden + New Holland + shopping Nevsky + DLT + Galeria. Check out + Sapsan train to Moscow 3.5-4hrs $30-$80 or flight or LED flight to Kazan/Sochi.', 1225),
