  ('teriberka', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Teriberka is particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. KING_CRAB - Signature king crab + Arctic + Barents Sea + fresh + $20-$40 + must + best Arctic + must 2. ARCTIC_FISH - Murmansk cod + fresh + $10-$15 + must + Arctic + Barents Sea + fresh 3. GUESTHOUSE_FOOD - Guesthouse included + basic + $0 + must + small village + basic 4. CAFE_BASIC - Cafe $8-$12 + basic + $8-$12 + must + small village + basic Family: Prioritise guesthouse included + cafe + warm + safe + early dining 7PM + king crab Honeymoon: Guesthouse Arctic Ocean view + king crab + Arctic fish + private + offbeat Arctic + cold -25°C Budget: Guesthouse included + cafe $8-$12 + king crab $20-$40 + Arctic fish $10-$15 + basic $10', 1276),
  ('teriberka', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: None - Small village 1000 people + no market + Murmansk 120km market Budget: No shopping - Murmansk 120km market + souvenirs $5-$20 + woolens $10-$20 + amber $10-$30', 1277),
  ('teriberka', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 15 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Honeymoon travellers should generally prefer: Aurora hunting zero light 9PM-3AM + Arctic Ocean night + ship cemetery night + waterfall night + beach night + Dragon Beach night + tundra night + cliffs night + guesthouse Arctic Ocean view night + early sleep + offbeat Arctic over: late-night clubs till 3 AM', 1278),
  ('teriberka', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS MURMANSK + TERIBERKA + AURORA - BEST FOR FIRST TIME - SEP-MAR', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive MMK + taxi $20 40-60min to Lenin Ave Azimut 4★ $80-$150 best + Kongress $60-$100 center. Afternoon Alyosha Monument 35.5m view Kola Bay + Lenin Nuclear Icebreaker Museum + Murmansk port ice-free + Oceanarium seals show + Lenin Ave + evening Aurora hunting 9PM-3AM Sep-Mar warm bus guide KP forecast zero light best Aurora. Overnight: Murmansk Lenin Ave - Azimut / Kongress Meals: Breakfast + King crab $20-$40 Day 2 Morning Teriberka 120km 2hr 4x4 tour $80-$150 group / $200-$300 private + Arctic Ocean Barents Sea + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + Dragon Beach + tundra + northernmost + Sami village Lovozero + husky + reindeer + king crab + evening Aurora hunting #2 second chance. Overnight: Teriberka guesthouse $50-$80 Arctic Ocean view - Aurora #2 Meals: Breakfast + Sami + Husky + Reindeer + King crab Day 3 Morning Teriberka sunrise + Arctic Ocean + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + photography + transfer to MMK 25km 40min + flight to Moscow 2.5hrs $80-$150 / St Petersburg 1.5hrs $60-$120', 1279),
  ('teriberka', 29, 'three-night-murmansk-teriberka-sami-aurora-perfect-pattern-best-aurora-3-chances', 'THREE-NIGHT MURMANSK + TERIBERKA + SAMI + AURORA PERFECT PATTERN - BEST AURORA 3 CHANCES', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive MMK + taxi $20 to Azimut best + center + Alyosha + Lenin Icebreaker + port + Oceanarium + evening Aurora #1 9PM-3AM Sep-Mar warm bus guide KP forecast zero light best Aurora. Overnight: Murmansk Azimut / Kongress - Aurora #1 Day 2 Morning Teriberka 120km 2hr + Arctic Ocean + Barents Sea + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + Dragon Beach + Sami village Lovozero + husky + reindeer + king crab + evening Aurora #2. Overnight: Teriberka guesthouse Arctic Ocean view - Aurora #2 Day 3 Morning Kola Peninsula tundra Lovozero + Khibiny + Sami village + husky + reindeer + snowmobile + afternoon Teriberka Arctic Ocean + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + evening Aurora #3 best 3 chances. Overnight: Murmansk Azimut / Kongress - Aurora #3 Day 4 Transfer to MMK + flight to Moscow / St Petersburg', 1280),
  ('teriberka', 30, 'two-night-arctic-ocean-teriberka-family-pattern', 'TWO-NIGHT ARCTIC OCEAN TERIBERKA FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive MMK + taxi $20 to Azimut family room $80-$150 + Kongress family room $60-$100 centre. Check-in rest + warm + acclimatization cold -25°C + need warmest -30°C clothes. Afternoon Alyosha car view + Lenin Icebreaker flat with help + port flat + Oceanarium flat + evening Aurora warm bus family. Overnight: Murmansk Azimut family room - Aurora warm bus Meals: Breakfast + King crab family Day 2 Morning Teriberka 120km 2hr 4x4 warm family + Arctic Ocean + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + Dragon Beach + tundra + Sami village flat + husky flat + reindeer flat + king crab + evening Aurora warm bus family #2. Overnight: Teriberka guesthouse $50-$80 family room Arctic Ocean view - Aurora family #2 Day 3 sunrise + photography + transfer to MMK + flight with family memories', 1281),
  ('teriberka', 31, 'three-night-aurora-hunting-sami-king-crab-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT AURORA HUNTING + SAMI + KING CRAB PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 MMK 25km -> Murmansk 68°N largest beyond Arctic Circle + Alyosha + Lenin Icebreaker + port + Oceanarium + evening Aurora #1 9PM-3AM Sep-Mar warm bus KP forecast zero light Day 2 Teriberka 120km 2hr + Arctic Ocean + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + tundra + Sami village + husky + reindeer + king crab + evening Aurora #2 Day 3 Kola Peninsula tundra Lovozero + Khibiny + Sami village + husky + reindeer + snowmobile + Teriberka Arctic Ocean + evening Aurora #3 best 3 chances Day 4 Transfer to MMK + flight', 1282),
  ('teriberka', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 1283),
  ('teriberka', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose - Aurora = Aurora hunting Sep-Mar KP3-5 Polar Night Dec best 9PM-3AM warm bus guide KP forecast zero light Teriberka + 2-3 nights 2-3 chances. Arctic Ocean = Teriberka 120km ship cemetery waterfall beach Dragon Beach tundra best Arctic Ocean Russia. Arctic city = Alyosha + Lenin Icebreaker + port + WWII + Oceanarium. 2. Groups by geography: City core Lenin Ave + Alyosha + Lenin Icebreaker + port + Oceanarium together flat walkable 5-10k steps. Teriberka 120km + Arctic Ocean + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + Dragon Beach + tundra + Sami + husky + reindeer + Kola Peninsula together Arctic cluster 100-300km + 4x4 + warm bus + warm clothes -30°C. 3. Uses hotel location strategically: LENIN AVE AZIMUT/KONGRESS for first-timers/Aurora base/best hotels + near Alyosha + Lenin Icebreaker + port + central + flat + safe + warm + 2-3N #1. TERIBERKA GUESTHOUSE $50-$80 Arctic Ocean view for Arctic Ocean + Aurora zero light + 1N + best + must. 4. Places Alyosha 11 AM Polar Night light 2-4hrs + Lenin Icebreaker 10AM + Teriberka 8AM start 120km 2hr + Sami morning + Aurora hunting 9PM-3AM Sep-Mar warm bus guide KP forecast zero light best Aurora + 2-3 chances. 5. Treats Murmansk as 1-2 activities/day + Aurora separate night + Teriberka separate day + Sami separate day + need 2-3N minimum + 2-3 chances Aurora + need warm bus + 4x4 + warm clothes -30°C 6. Always includes warm clothes rental -30°C + thermal + boots + hat + gloves + warm bus for Aurora + 4x4 for Teriberka Nov-Apr snow + guide for Aurora + Teriberka + Sami + KP forecast + Polar Night Dec 2-20 darkness + Midnight Sun May-Jul', 1284),
  ('teriberka', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Alyosha + Lenin Icebreaker + port + Oceanarium + city + evening Aurora 9PM-3AM Sep-Mar warm bus KP forecast zero light + 1 chance Aurora + risky clouds + no Teriberka. Reason: 1N too short for Teriberka + 1 chance Aurora risky + need 2-3N + 2-3 chances. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Day1 City Alyosha + Lenin Icebreaker + port + Oceanarium + evening Aurora #1, Day2 Teriberka 120km Arctic Ocean + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + tundra + Sami + husky + reindeer + king crab + evening Aurora #2 + 2 chances best for first time. Reason: Core Murmansk + Teriberka + Aurora 2 chances best for first time. IF: `trip_length >= 3 nights` THEN: Day1 City + Aurora #1, Day2 Teriberka Arctic Ocean + Sami + husky + reindeer + king crab + Aurora #2, Day3 Kola Peninsula tundra Lovozero + Khibiny + Sami + snowmobile + Teriberka + Aurora #3 + 3 chances best for Aurora chasers. Reason: Complete Murmansk + Teriberka + Sami + Kola + Aurora 3 chances best. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Alyosha car view + Lenin Icebreaker flat with help + port flat + Oceanarium flat + Aurora warm bus + Sami village flat + husky flat + reindeer flat + king crab flat + Teriberka 4x4 with help + tundra flat with help + warm bus + warm clothes -30°C + warm + safe + flat + easy IF: `traveler_type == AURORA_CHASER` THEN: Aurora hunting Sep-Mar KP3-5 Polar Night Dec best 9PM-3AM warm bus guide KP forecast zero light pollution Teriberka Kola Sami tundra best Aurora must + 2-3N + 2-3 chances + warm bus + warm clothes -30°C + 4x4 + guide + KP forecast IF: `traveler_type == ARCTIC_OCEAN_OFFBEAT` THEN: Teriberka 120km Arctic Ocean Barents Sea ship cemetery waterfall beach tundra northernmost best Arctic Ocean Russia must + tour $80-$150 private $200-$300 + Sami + husky + reindeer + king crab + snowmobile + Kola Peninsula tundra', 1285),
