  ('teriberka', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. Aurora chasers + photographers - #1 Aurora in Russia Sep-Mar + Polar Night Dec 2-20 darkness 24hr best darkness + KP3-5 + zero light pollution Teriberka + Kola + best Aurora + 2-3N + 2-3 chances + warm bus + guide + KP forecast 2. Arctic Ocean + offbeat Arctic lovers - Teriberka 120km 2hr + Arctic Ocean + Barents Sea + ship cemetery + waterfall + beach + tundra + northernmost + best Arctic Ocean Russia + tour $80-$150 private $200-$300 + must 3. Arctic city + icebreakers + military history - Largest city beyond Arctic Circle 68°N 300K + ice-free port + nuclear icebreakers + Lenin Nuclear Icebreaker + Alyosha Monument 35.5m + port + WWII + military + Soviet + Arctic history 4. Sami + husky + reindeer + king crab + adventure - Sami village Lovozero + Kola + Sami culture + Pomor + husky + reindeer + king crab fishing + snowmobile + sauna + Arctic fishing + Kola Peninsula tundra Lovozero + Khibiny + Kirovsk 5. Polar Night + Midnight Sun + offbeat Arctic - Polar Night Dec 2-20 darkness 24hr + Midnight Sun May-Jul 24hr light + never dark + never light + offbeat + Arctic + tundra + northernmost + must Best duration: 2-3 nights ideal - 2N quick city + Teriberka + Aurora 2 chances, 3N perfect city + Teriberka + Sami + Kola + Aurora 3 chances best Best season: Sep-Mar best Aurora - Sep-Oct best Aurora less clouds good + Nov-Mar best Aurora Polar Night Dec 2-20 darkness 24hr best darkness cold -25°C snow best Aurora must Sep-Mar KP3-5 zero light best must 2-3N 2-3 chances warm bus guide KP forecast. May-Jul Midnight Sun 24hr light never dark warmest Arctic Ocean Teriberka best tundra green but no Aurora. Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Taxi Yandex $5-$15 city + $15-$25 airport + private driver $100/day for Aurora + Teriberka + Sami + warm bus + 4x4 Nov-Apr snow + bus 106 $1.5 to airport + bus $0.8 city + walking city center flat 5-10k steps + but c