  ('dambulla', 20, 'luxury-travel', 'LUXURY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'luxury_score: 70 Recommended: Luxury should primarily increase: Note: Dambulla luxury = boutique + experiential, not big branded 5★', 1301),
