  ('nuwaraeliya', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Nuwara Eliya is particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. GREGORY_LAKE_FOOD_STALLS - Corn, kottu, short eats. $1-$3 2. TEA_ESTATE_HIGH_TEA - Tea + scones + cake with view 3. STRAWBERRY_FARM - Fresh strawberries + milkshake 4. HOTEL_BUFFET - Hill country + Western options 5. FINE-DINING - Heritance, Jetwing St. Andrew’s - Colonial fusion Family: Prioritise AC restaurants, early dining 6:30 PM. Hotel buffet, Town restaurants. Honeymoon: Include one dinner at tea bungalow + lake-view restaurant. Budget: Local rice & curry $3. Street food + market.', 1345),
