  ('nuwaraeliya', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 20 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Honeymoon travellers should generally prefer: Romantic dinner at tea estate bungalow with fireplace, lake-view hotel bar, private high tea at sunset, or spa + stargazing over: late-night club itinerary Note: Nuwara Eliya shuts down very early. Most restaurants and shops close 8-9 PM. Due to 10-15°C weather, evenings are spent indoors. Main evening activities are hotel dining, tea estate high tea, and stargazing. Bring a jacket even in summer.', 1347),
