  ('kataragama', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Kataragama is particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. TEMPLE_PRASADAM - Free rice + curry offered to devotees 2. LOCAL_RICE_CURRY - Banana leaf meals $2-$4 3. MENIK_GANGA_SHOPS - Short eats, juice, ice cream $1-$2 4. HOTEL_BUFFET - Basic Sri Lankan + Indian options 5. ECO_LODGE_DINING - Bush dinner near Yala Family: Prioritise hotel restaurants, early dining 7 PM. Bottled water only. Honeymoon: Include one dinner at eco-lodge + temple offering. Budget: Local rice & curry $2. Street food + temple prasadam.', 1369),
