  ('kataragama', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Temple + Evening puja only Reason: Core Kataragama experience IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Add Yala Safari Reason: Must-do wildlife experience IF: `trip_length >= 3 nights` THEN: Add Sithulpawwa + Bundala Reason: Full culture + nature immersion IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Max 1 major activity/day + Safari + Temple Reason: Heat + early starts tire kids IF: `traveler_type == PILGRIM` THEN: Temple area hotel + Multiple puja visits Reason: Spiritual focus IF: `travel_month == Jul-Aug` THEN: Book 3 months early + expect crowds Reason: Esala Festival peak', 1372),
  ('kataragama', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | Family | 75 Honeymoon | 55 Luxury | 50 Budget | 95 Adventure | 80 Culture | 96 Food | 65 Shopping | 60 Nightlife | 10 Relaxation | 60 Nature | 85 Accessibility | 60 Safety | 88 First-time visitor | 82 Photography | 88', 1373),
  ('kataragama', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. Religious + Pilgrimage travellers - One of Sri Lanka’s holiest sites 2. Wildlife + Photography lovers - Yala gateway 3. Cultural travellers - multi-Faith rituals + ancient temples 4. Budget travellers - Very cheap stays + food + safari 5. First-time Sri Lanka - Essential cultural + wildlife stops Best duration: 2 nights Best season: Dec-Feb, Jun-Aug Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Private driver + Group safari jeep Must-do: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Most spiritual town in Sri Lanka + Gateway to Yala. Biggest disadvantage: Hot, dusty, limited luxury, early closures. Overall destination score: 82/100 - Essential pilgrimage + wildlife combo. Perfect 2-night cultural stop.', 1374),
