  ('chitwan', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: LOW_TO_MODERATE public_transport_accessibility: LOW hotel_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD; LUXURY LODGES HAVE RAMPS + GROUND FLOOR attraction_accessibility: MODERATE; MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Verify lodge has ground floor + ramp + private jeep.', 1488),
  ('chitwan', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Chitwan is particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. LODGE_RIVER_BUFFET - BBQ + sunset. Included in package 2. THARU_LOCAL_KITCHEN - Dhikri + fish curry. NPR 300-NPR 500 3. SAURAHA_RESTAURANTS - Thakali, momo, pizza. NPR 400-NPR 800 4. RIVER_SIDE_BBQ - Lodges private setup 5. JUNGLE_LODGE_FINE_DINING - Barahi, Meghauli Serai chef menu Family: Prioritise lodge buffet + early dining 7 PM. Familiar + safe. Honeymoon: Include one private BBQ dinner on Rapti + lodge fine dining. Budget: Local Thakali thali in Sauraha $2-$4.', 1489),
  ('chitwan', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Lodge boutiques. Premium handmade items Budget: Sauraha Main Street. Bargain for souvenirs + t-shirts.', 1490),
  ('chitwan', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 50 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Honeymoon travellers should generally prefer: Tharu cultural dance 7 PM + lodge bar + bonfire + stargazing over: late-night club itinerary Note: Chitwan is very quiet after 9 PM. Main evening is Tharu dance show 7-8 PM + lodge dinner + river walk. No clubs. Most shops close 8-9 PM. For nightlife go to Kathmandu or Pokhara.', 1491),
  ('chitwan', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS CHITWAN JUNGLE SAFARI', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive from KTM/Pokhara. Check-in at Sauraha lodge. Afternoon Canoe + Jungle Walk + Elephant Breeding Center. Evening Tharu Cultural Show + Dinner. Day 2 Early morning Jeep Safari 6 AM-10 AM. Return. Afternoon Village tour + Elephant bathing at Rapti. Sunset river. Day 3 Morning Bird Watching. Breakfast, check out. Transfer to KTM/Pokhara/Lumbini. Package Includes: 2 nights stay with full board, 1 jeep safari, 1 canoe, jungle walk, Tharu show, transfers. Excludes: Luxury upgrade, park fees if not included, travel insurance.', 1492),
  ('chitwan', 29, 'three-night-business-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT BUSINESS PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive and transfer privately to luxury jungle lodge in Meghauli. Check in, spa + Rapti sunset cocktails. Private BBQ dinner on river. Optional evening add-on: Private bonfire. Overnight: Luxury Jungle Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 2 Late breakfast. Morning private canoe + elephant bathing. Afternoon: Private Jeep Safari. Return for spa. Evening private bush dinner. Overnight: Luxury Jungle Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 3 After breakfast, Tharu village cycle tour + Bird watching. Return for lodge leisure. Evening: Tharu cultural private show + farewell dinner. Overnight: Luxury Jungle Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 4 After breakfast, check out and transfer to Bharatpur Airport for flight or to Pokhara with jungle memories. Meals: Breakfast', 1493),
  ('chitwan', 30, 'three-night-family-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive from KTM. Private transfer to Sauraha lodge. Check-in and relax. Afternoon: Canoe + Breeding Centre + Tharu dance. Overnight: Riverfront Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 2 Breakfast. Morning Jeep Safari for rhino spotting + Deer. Afternoon: Pool + Rapti sunset + Elephant bathing fun for kids. Overnight: Riverfront Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 3 Breakfast. Village walk + Cycle + Bird watching + Souvenir shopping. Return for pool time. Overnight: Riverfront Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 4 Breakfast, check-out. Transfer to Kathmandu or Pokhara. Meals: Breakfast', 1494),
  ('chitwan', 31, 'three-night-transit-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT TRANSIT PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive and receive VIP garland meet-and-greet. Private transfer to Taj Meghauli Serai or Barahi Jungle Lodge. Evening private river sunset + wine. Overnight: Luxury Jungle Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 2 Breakfast. Morning private jeep safari with naturalist + tiger tracking. Afternoon private canoe + champagne. Evening spa ritual + private bush dinner. Overnight: Luxury Jungle Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 3 Breakfast. Morning bird watching + jungle walk inside buffer zone. Afternoon leisure at lodge pool. Evening Tharu cultural show + signature dinner. Alternative: Replace walk with private elephant bathing experience. Overnight: Luxury Jungle Lodge Meals: Full Board Day 4 Breakfast. Check-out and private transfer to Bharatpur Airport for departure. Meals: Breakfast', 1495),
  ('chitwan', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 1496),
  ('chitwan', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose 2. Groups by timing: Morning Jeep Safari 6AM, Afternoon Canoe 3PM, Evening Tharu Show 7PM 3. Uses lodge location strategically: SAURAHA GATE for budget/family, MEGHAULI for luxury 4. Places Chitwan in middle - Between Kathmandu + Pokhara. Easy transit 5. Treats as nature base, not activity rush - Max 2 safaris/day, more is tiring 6. Always includes full board - Outside restaurant limited + lodges include all meals', 1497),
  ('chitwan', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Evening Tharu show + Morning jeep only Reason: Too rushed IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Add Canoe + Breeding Centre + Village Reason: Core safari experience IF: `trip_length >= 3 nights` THEN: Add Birding + Village + Sunset canoe Reason: Complete jungle experience IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Riverfront lodge + Private jeep + No long jungle walk Reason: Safe + easy for kids IF: `traveler_type == HONEYMOON` THEN: Luxury lodge + Private safari + Slow pace Reason: Privacy + romantic river setting IF: `travel_month == Jun-Aug` THEN: Avoid OR Book luxury lodge with pool Reason: Monsoon + leeches', 1498),
  ('chitwan', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | Family | 88 Honeymoon | 85 Luxury | 85 Budget | 90 Adventure | 85 Culture | 80 Food | 78 Shopping | 60 Nightlife | 50 Relaxation | 85 Nature | 95 Accessibility | 65 Safety | 85 First-time visitor | 90 Photography | 92', 1499),
  ('chitwan', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. Wildlife lovers - Rhino + tiger tracking + birds 2. Families - Easy safari + canoe + culture 3. Honeymoon + Couples - Luxury jungle lodges + river sunset 4. Nature photographers - 500+ bird species + rhino closeups 5. First-time Nepal visitors - Must-do after KTM Best duration: 2-3 nights Best season: Oct-Mar Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Flight to Bharatpur + Private jeep transfer Must-do: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Only place in Nepal for guaranteed one-horned rhino + best jungle lodges. Easy access. Biggest disadvantage: Monsoon difficult. Tiger sighting rare. Limited nightlife/shopping. Overall destination score: 88/100 - Best wildlife park in Nepal. Must-do for nature lovers.', 1500),
  ('chitwan', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 92/100 last_updated: 2026-08-17 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: NEPAL_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: Verify jeep safari slots + park entry fees + canoe availability before booking. Park partially closes Jul-Sep. Tiger sighting not guaranteed. Book luxury lodges 2 months early Oct-Feb.', 1501),
