  ('pokhara', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 94 romance_score: 92 privacy_score: 88 luxury_score: 88 Recommended: Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than: 2 major activities/day. Prefer: Lake + mountains + slow over many temples. Recommended hotel areas:', 1512),
