  ('pokhara', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: MODERATE public_transport_accessibility: MODERATE hotel_accessibility: GOOD; LAKESIDE 3★-4★ HOTELS HAVE ELEVATORS attraction_accessibility: MODERATE; MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Verify accessible room + lakefront + elevator.', 1516),
  ('pokhara', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Pokhara is particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. LAKESIDE_CAFES - OR2K, Moondance, Busy Bee. $5-$15 2. THAKALI_KITCHEN - Dal bhat power. $3-$5 3. BAKERY - German bakery - Cinnamon rolls, apple pie 4. ROOFTOP_DINING - Mountain view dinner. $10-$25 5. FISH_GRILL_LAKE - Fresh Phewa fish Family: Prioritise lakeside AC restaurants, early dining at 7 PM. Pizza + momo + thali. Honeymoon: Include one rooftop lake view dinner + private resort BBQ. Budget: Local thali $2-$3, momo $1-$2, bakery $2.', 1517),
  ('pokhara', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Hotel boutiques, Lakeside premium pashmina shops Budget: Lakeside shops, Old Bazaar. Bargain 20-30%. Check quality.', 1518),
  ('pokhara', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 72 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Honeymoon travellers should generally prefer: Lakeside live music bar, rooftop dinner with lake view, quiet resort bar over: late-night loud pub crawl Note: Pokhara nightlife runs till 10-11 PM. Lakeside has pubs with live Nepali/English music, bars, hookah lounges. Quieter than Thamel. Most close 11 PM. Best evenings are lake walk + live music + dinner.', 1519),
  ('pokhara', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS POKHARA LAKE + ADVENTURE', 'adventure', 'Day 1 Arrive from KTM. Check-in at Lakeside. Afternoon Phewa Boating + Peace Pagoda. Evening lakeside dinner + live music. Day 2 Early morning Sarangkot Sunrise 4:30 AM. Return. Mid-morning Paragliding + Davis Fall + Gupteshwor Cave. Day 3 Breakfast, check out. Transfer to KTM/Chitwan or start trek. Package Includes: 2 nights stay with breakfast, Sarangkot jeep, boating, paragliding, private transfers. Excludes: Lunch/dinner, trekking gear, travel insurance.', 1520),
  ('pokhara', 29, 'three-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive and transfer privately to lakeside luxury resort. Check in, Phewa private boat sunset. Evening rooftop dinner. Optional evening add-on: Spa. Overnight: Lakeside Luxury Resort Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Early morning private jeep to Sarangkot for sunrise + Annapurna panorama. Return. Afternoon Davis Fall + Cave + Museum. Evening lakeside live music + café hopping. Overnight: Lakeside Luxury Resort Meals: Breakfast Day 3 After breakfast, Tandem Paragliding over Phewa + Zip Flyer or Ultra-light. Afternoon Tibetan Camp + Old Bazaar shopping. Evening farewell dinner on the lake. Overnight: Lakeside Luxury Resort Meals: Breakfast Day 4 After breakfast, check out and transfer to PKR Airport for flight to KTM or onward with mountain memories. Meals: Breakfast', 1521),
  ('pokhara', 30, 'three-night-family-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive from KTM. Private transfer to Lakeside hotel. Check-in. Afternoon Phewa boating + Peace Pagoda boat. Overnight: Lakeside Family Resort Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Morning Sarangkot sunrise jeep. Return. Afternoon Mountain Museum + Davis Fall + Gupteshwor Cave. Evening lakeside + ice cream. Overnight: Lakeside Family Resort Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. Day trip to Begnas Lake quiet boating + Rupakot viewpoint. Return for lakeside pool time. Overnight: Lakeside Family Resort Meals: Breakfast Day 4 Breakfast, check-out. Transfer to Chitwan/KTM. Meals: Breakfast', 1522),
  ('pokhara', 31, 'three-night-luxury-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive and receive VIP meet-and-greet at PKR. Private transfer to Rupakot Resort - Infinity pool + Annapurna view. Evening champagne sunset. Overnight: Rupakot Luxury Resort Meals: Breakfast, Dinner Day 2 Breakfast. Morning private Sarangkot sunrise with barista coffee. Afternoon private paragliding + video. Evening private lake dinner with mountain view. Overnight: Rupakot Luxury Resort Meals: Breakfast, Dinner Day 3 Breakfast. Private tour: Tibetan Camp + Mountain Museum + Old Bazaar. Return for spa ritual + infinity pool. Evening signature dining. Alternative: Replace with Australian Camp luxury lodge hike 1N. Overnight: Rupakot Luxury Resort Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Day 4 Breakfast. Check-out and private transfer to PKR Airport for departure. Meals: Breakfast', 1523),
  ('pokhara', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 1524),
  ('pokhara', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose 2. Groups by timing: Sunrise 4:30 AM Sarangkot, Morning 8-11 AM Paragliding, Afternoon Lake + Caves 3. Uses hotel location strategically: LAKESIDE EAST for lake views + walkability 4. Places Pokhara in middle - After Kathmandu/Chitwan, before trek or return flight 5. Treats as adventure + relax mix - 2 activities max + lakeside cafes downtime 6. Always books paragliding with licensed operator - Check APPI/Tandem license + insurance + weight limits', 1525),
  ('pokhara', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Phewa Lake + Peace Pagoda + Lakeside only Reason: Too short for adventure IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Add Sarangkot Sunrise + Paragliding OR Caves Reason: Core Pokhara IF: `trip_length >= 3 nights` THEN: Add Begnas + Adventure + Museum Reason: Complete lake + mountain experience IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Lakeside resort + Boating + Museum + No long trek Reason: Easy + safe + flat for kids IF: `traveler_type == HONEYMOON` THEN: Lake view luxury resort + Private boat + Sarangkot private Reason: Romantic + photogenic IF: `travel_month == Jun-Aug` THEN: Avoid OR focus on lakeside cafes + museum Reason: Monsoon clouds block views + paragliding cancelled', 1526),
  ('pokhara', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | Family | 90 Honeymoon | 94 Luxury | 88 Budget | 92 Adventure | 95 Culture | 78 Food | 85 Shopping | 75 Nightlife | 72 Relaxation | 88 Nature | 94 Accessibility | 72 Safety | 88 First-time visitor | 92 Photography | 94', 1527),
  ('pokhara', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. Honeymoon + Couples - Lake + mountains + private boats 2. Adventure seekers - Paragliding + Zip + Trek start 3. Families-Safe Lake + boating + museum 4. Nature photographers - Annapurna sunrise + lake reflections 5. Luxury relaxation - Hilltop resorts + infinity pools Best duration: 3 nights Best season: Oct-Nov, Mar-Apr Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Flight KTM→PKR + Private car/taxi in city Must-do: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Only city in Nepal where lake + 8000m peaks + adventure in one place. Very relaxed. Biggest disadvantage: Mountain views weather dependent. Crowded in peak Oct-Nov. Overall destination score: 92/100 - Best lake + adventure city in Nepal. Must-do.', 1528),
  ('pokhara', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 95/100 last_updated: 2026-08-17 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: NEPAL_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: Verify paragliding license, insurance, weight limits, and weather cancellation policy before booking. Sarangkot jeep needs 4:15 AM pickup. Mountain views not guaranteed in monsoon Jun-Aug. Book luxury resorts 60 days early Oct-Nov.', 1529),
