  ('kathmandu', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended: Travel-agent rule: A Thamel hotel for 3 nights beats 5 nights far away. Walk to shops + restaurants + tour pickup. Private car half-day for UNESCO sites saves 2hrs.', 1534),
