  ('osaka', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 72 - Fun 1-2N not main honeymoon romance_score: 70 privacy_score: 72 luxury_score: 82 Recommended: Osaka is a fun + food city, not a main romantic honeymoon. Use 1-2N fun stop then Kyoto luxury ryokan 3N for romance: Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than: 2 areas/day + USJ only if both like theme parks. Recommended hotel areas:', 1830),
