  ('osaka', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 78 walking_intensity: MEDIUM - Flat Dotonbori/Shinsaibashi but metro stations walking + Castle Park walking Rules:', 1833),
  ('osaka', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD public_transport_accessibility: GOOD - Metro has elevators + low floor + but crowded rush hotel_accessibility: GOOD; 4★-5★ HOTELS HAVE ELEVATORS + ACCESSIBLE ROOMS + RAMPS attraction_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD; MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Verify accessible room + elevator + private car.', 1834),
  ('osaka', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Osaka is particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. DOTONBORI_STREET_FOOD_NIGHT - Takoyaki $5 + okonomiyaki $8 + Gyoza + river view. 5-10 PM best. Must. 2. SHINSEKAI_KUSHIKATSU_DARUMA - Deep-fried skewers + no double dip sauce + beer $10-$15. Origin in Shinsekai. 3. KUROMON_MARKET_FOOD_TOUR - Tuna sashimi + wagyu skewer + scallop + strawberry $15-$30. 9 AM-3 PM. 4. KOBE_BEEF_TEPPANYAKI_LUNCH - Day trip 30min to Kobe + Kobe beef teppanyaki $80-$200. Best beef in the world. 5. OKONOMIYAKI_MIZUNO_DOTONBORI - Famous okonomiyaki since 1945 + Michelin Bib. $10-$15. Family: Prioritise takoyaki making + okonomiyaki + Kuromon market + conveyor sushi + USJ food. Honeymoon: Include private Dotonbori food tour + Kobe beef teppanyaki + private sake tasting + Umeda fine dining. Budget: Takoyaki $5 + okonomiyaki $8 + Kushikatsu $10 + Kuromon $10 + Conbini $5.', 1835),
  ('osaka', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Umeda department + Shinsaibashi Daimaru + luxury brands Budget: Shinsaibashi $10-$30 + America-mura vintage $10-$20 + Don Quijote $5-$20 + Dotonbori souvenirs.', 1836),
  ('osaka', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 92 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Honeymoon travellers should generally prefer: Umeda Sky sunset + night view + bar, Dotonbori River cruise night + Glico photo + fine dining Kitashinchi, Conrad/Waldorf rooftop bar + teppanyaki over: late-night clubs in Namba Note: Osaka nightlife = #1 fun in Japan after Tokyo. Dotonbori + Namba + Umeda + Kitashinchi. Dotonbori neon till 11 PM-12 AM + bars till 2-3 AM + clubs till 5 AM + izakaya + karaoke + street food night. Shinsaibashi clubs + Namba bars + Umeda sky bar + Kitashinchi jazz bars. Famous for friendly + funny + affordable vs Tokyo. Last train 12-12:30 AM - After that taxi $30-$50. For nightlife, go to Namba/Dotonbori; for romantic go to Umeda Sky + Kitashinchi.', 1837),
  ('osaka', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS OSAKA FUN + FOOD', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive KIX + Nankai to Namba. Check into Namba/Shinsaibashi hotel. Afternoon Osaka Castle + park + evening Dotonbori Street food (takoyaki/okonomiyaki) + Glico sign at night + Shinsaibashi shopping + river cruise at night + late Shinsekai kushikatsu. Day 2 Morning Kuromon Market breakfast + Hozenji Yokocho + afternoon Umeda Sky Building sunset + Grand Front shopping + evening Namba nightlife + bar + karaoke or Kobe beef day trip 30min. Day 3 Breakfast, check out. USJ full day if family or train to Kyoto 30min or KIX flight. Package Includes: 2 nights hotel + Osaka Amazing Pass + Umeda Sky ticket + Kuromon food. Excludes: USJ tickets + Express Pass + Kobe trip + private guide.', 1838),
  ('osaka', 29, 'three-night-family-usj-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT FAMILY USJ PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive at KIX and take the Nankai/private van to your Osaka hotel (Namba/Shinsaibashi) family room. Check-in rest. Afternoon Osaka Castle Park + museum + evening Dotonbori Street food + Glico + river cruise + Shinsaibashi shopping. Optional evening add-on: Umeda Sky sunset. Overnight: Osaka Namba Meals: Breakfast Day 2 After breakfast, full day Universal Studios Japan 9 AM-8 PM - Super Nintendo World Mario + Harry Potter + Minions + parade + rides + dinner inside park. Book tickets 1 month early + Express Pass 4/7 essential peak. Overnight: Osaka Namba or USJ Official Hotel Meals: Breakfast Day 3 After breakfast, Osaka Aquarium Kaiyukan + Tempozan Ferris Wheel + Legoland Discovery + afternoon Kuromon Market + Shinsekai kushikatsu + Tennoji Zoo + Abeno Harukas 300m view. Evening Dotonbori farewell. Overnight: Osaka Namba Meals: Breakfast Day 4 After breakfast, check out and train to Kyoto (30 min) or Nara deer (45 min) or KIX flight with Osaka memories. Meals: Breakfast', 1839),
  ('osaka', 30, 'two-night-food-base-pattern', 'TWO-NIGHT FOOD + BASE PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive KIX + Nankai to Namba hotel. Check-in. Afternoon Dotonbori Street food tour takoyaki + okonomiyaki + Kuromon Market + Shinsaibashi shopping + Hozenji Yokocho old alley + evening Dotonbori Glico night photo + river cruise + Shinsekai kushikatsu + bar hopping. Overnight: Osaka Namba Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Morning Osaka Castle + park + Umeda Sky Building sunset + Grand Front + afternoon day trips - Nara deer park 45min + Todai-ji or Kobe beef + harbour 30min or Kyoto Fushimi Inari + Kiyomizu 30min as base. Evening Kitashinchi fine dining. Overnight: Osaka Namba Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast, check-out. Train to Kyoto or KIX flight. Meals: Breakfast', 1840),
  ('osaka', 31, 'three-night-luxury-honeymoon-fun-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT LUXURY HONEYMOON + FUN PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive KIX + private luxury van 50min to Conrad Osaka suite sky view + butler welcome + high tea. Afternoon private Dotonbori food tour with chef - Takoyaki + okonomiyaki + Glico private photo + river cruise private sunset + Shinsaibashi private shopping + Hozenji Yokocho private + evening private teppanyaki Kobe beef + sake tasting + Umeda Sky private night view. Overnight: Conrad Osaka / Waldorf Astoria Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast at Conrad lounge sky view. Morning private Osaka Castle tour + private Kuromon Market with chef + private sake tasting + afternoon private car to Kobe 30min - Kobe beef private lunch + harbour cruise + Nada’s sake breweries + return evening Dotonbori farewell + Kitashinchi bar. Alternative: Replace with USJ VIP private tour + Mario World private + Express unlimited + Aquarium private. Overnight: Conrad Osaka Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. Morning private van to Kyoto 1hr - Hoshinoya Kyoto boat access + Arashiyama bamboo sunrise private + Gion geisha private dinner + tea ceremony private + luxury ryokan. Continue honeymoon in Kyoto. Meals: Breakfast', 1841),
  ('osaka', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 1842),
  ('osaka', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose 2. Groups by geography: South Namba/Dotonbori/Shinsaibashi/Kuromon together flat walking, North Umeda/Kita/Sky Building together, East Castle/Tennoji/Shinsekai together, Bay USJ/Kaiyukan together. 3. Uses hotel location strategically: NAMBA/SHINSAIBASHI for food/shopping/nightlife + budget-mid + walk to Dotonbori. UMEDA for luxury + business + sky view + department shopping + quieter. 4. Places Dotonbori evening 5-10 PM night neon + Glico + street food + river cruise night + Umeda Sky sunset 5-7 PM + Castle morning 9-11 AM to avoid heat. 5. Treats Osaka as 2 areas/day + USJ separate full day - Not checklist 5 areas same day. 6. Always includes Osaka Amazing Pass for city day + USJ Express Pass peak + private food tour + Kuromon morning + Kobe/Nara day trip as base advantage.', 1843),
  ('osaka', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Dotonbori night + Glico + street food + Shinsaibashi + Osaka Castle next morning + Umeda Sky sunset. No USJ. Reason: USJ needs a full day. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Day 1 City Dotonbori + Castle + Umeda Sky + Shinsekai + Kuromon, Day 2 USJ full day or Nara/Kobe day trip as base. Perfect. Reason: Core Osaka + USJ or base. IF: `trip_length >= 3 nights` THEN: Day 1 City, Day 2 USJ, Day 3 Nara deer + Todai-ji + Kobe beef as day trips from Osaka base. Reason: Complete Kansai base. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: USJ 1 full day + Kaiyukan + Castle + Dotonbori takoyaki + Kuromon + Tennoji Zoo + USJ official hotel if USJ focus. Reason: Family favourites. IF: `traveler_type == FOODIE` THEN: Dotonbori street food night + Kuromon Market + Shinsekai kushikatsu + Kobe beef day trip + Kitashinchi fine dining + takoyaki making. Reason: 1 street food city. IF: `traveler_type == BASE_TRAVELER` THEN: Osaka hotel Namba/Umeda as Kansai hub + day trips Kyoto 30min + Nara 45min + Kobe 30min + Koya-san 90min + Osaka Amazing Pass. Reason: Best connected hub in Kansai.', 1844),
  ('osaka', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | Family | 90 Honeymoon | 72 Luxury | 82 Budget | 80 Adventure | 60 Culture | 72 Food | 96 Shopping | 90 Nightlife | 92 Relaxation | 60 Nature | 50 Accessibility | 78 Safety | 90 First-time visitor | 90 Photography | 84', 1845),
  ('osaka', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. Foodies - #1 street food in Japan - Takoyaki, okonomiyaki, kushikatsu, Kuromon 2. Family with USJ - Mario World + Harry Potter + Aquarium Kaiyukan + Castle + Dotonbori 3. Nightlife + Shopping - Dotonbori neon + Namba + Shinsaibashi + Umeda + young + affordable 4. Kansai Base travelers - Best hub for Kyoto 30min + Nara 45min + Kobe 30min + Koya-san 5. First-time Japan 3rd city - Tokyo modern + Kyoto culture + Osaka fun/food 6. Budget travelers - Street food cheap + hostel + Osaka Amazing Pass value Best duration: 2 nights Best season: Mar-Apr sakura Castle Park + Oct-Nov autumn pleasant + Dec-Feb illuminations + cheap + USJ low queue. Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Metro Midosuji Line + day pass $6 + Osaka Amazing Pass $25 + walking Dotonbori-Shinsaibashi-Namba flat. Private car for Kobe/Nara/Kyoto day trips. Must-do: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Japan’s kitchen + fun capital - best street food + neon Dotonbori + Glico + USJ Mario World + best Kansai base for Kyoto/Nara/Kobe + affordable + friendly + nightlife. Biggest disadvantage: No deep culture like Kyoto + no modern wow like Tokyo + Dotonbori very crowded + touristy + loud + USJ queues long without Express + Shinsekai some run-down at night. Overall destination score: 88/100 - Must 2 nights for any Kansai trip. Best food + fun + USJ + base in Japan.', 1846),
  ('osaka', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 93/100 last_updated: 2026-08-17 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: JAPAN_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: This Osaka file is suitable for itinerary design, traveller profiling, hotel-area strategy, and initial package planning. Universal Studios Japan tickets + Express Pass 4/7 must be booked 1 month ahead peak - Sold out + 2-3hr queues without Express. Super Nintendo World Mario entry needs timed entry. Osaka Amazing Pass $25 best for city day - Castle + Umeda Sky + cruise + metro. Dotonbori best evening 5-10 PM night neon + street food + river cruise night. Last train 12-12:30 AM. Prices, hotel inventory, USJ availability, and attraction timings must be live-verified before quotation. Do not rely on generic Osaka package inclusions without confirming exact area Namba/Umeda/USJ, USJ tickets + Express included or not, Osaka Amazing Pass included, Dotonbori food tour included, and whether Kyoto/Nara/Kobe day trips included.', 1847),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Spring Mar-May', NULL, 'weather: 10-22°C, cherry blossom late Mar-early Apr at Peace Park + Miyajima best. crowd_level: HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 90 recommended: true reason: Sakura + pleasant + Miyajima + best overall. Peace Park cherry.', 1848),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer Jun-Aug', NULL, 'weather: 24-33°C, hot + humid + rainy Jun + Aug 6 memorial ceremonies + crowded. crowd_level: VERY HIGH Aug 6 & 9 price_level: HIGH overall_score: 76 recommended: true reason: Aug 6 Hiroshima + Aug 9 Nagasaki memorial ceremonies + peace + hot + humid.', 1849),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Autumn Sep-Nov', NULL, 'weather: 16-26°C, clear Oct-Nov, autumn colours mid-late Nov, Miyajima best. crowd_level: HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 88 recommended: true reason: Autumn Miyajima + pleasant + clear + good.', 1850),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter Dec-Feb', NULL, 'weather: 3-10°C, cold + clear + less crowd + oysters season best Dec-Feb. crowd_level: MEDIUM price_level: MEDIUM overall_score: 80 recommended: true reason: Oysters best + clear + cheap + illuminations + less crowd.', 1851),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended: Travel-agent rule: Hiroshima 1N $120-$200 mid + 2N $250-$400 with Miyajima ryokan 1N. Nagasaki 2N $200-$350 mid. Shinkansen Osaka→Hiroshima $70 + Hiroshima→Nagasaki via Hakata $80-$120 + tram + ferry cheap. Miyajima ryokan worth a splurge for torii view.', 1852),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Shinkansen to Hiroshima Station + tram + ferry to Miyajima + hotel near Peace Park or Miyajima ryokan family room. Private car not needed - Tram + train easy. For Nagasaki - Kamome Shinkansen from Hakata + tram Nagasaki.', 1853),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Private car from HIJ + luxury ryokan Miyajima Iwaso with floating torii view + private oyster dinner + peace cruise sunset. For Nagasaki - Garden Terrace + Mt Inasa private night view.', 1854),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Private luxury van + Iwaso Miyajima + Rihga Royal Hiroshima + Garden Terrace Nagasaki + private guide + Peace Park private.', 1855),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'JR Pass + tram day pass $6 + ferry + hostel near Peace Park / Hiroshima Station. For Nagasaki - Highway bus Hiroshima→Fukuoka $30 + Kamome to Nagasaki cheap.', 1856),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Senior', 'senior', 'Private car + hotel near Peace Park flat + tram low floor + ferry with elevator + Miyajima ropeway + avoid Mt Misen hike steep. For Nagasaki - Tram + Mt Inasa ropeway.', 1857),
