  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD public_transport_accessibility: GOOD - Hiroshima tram low floor + Nagasaki tram low floor + ferry elevator + JR elevator hotel_accessibility: GOOD; 4★-5★ HOTELS HAVE ELEVATORS + ACCESSIBLE ROOMS + RAMPS, RYOKAN FUTON LOW BUT IWASO HAS ELEVATOR + ACCESSIBLE attraction_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD; MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Verify accessible room + elevator + private car + ferry elevator.', 1863),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Hiroshima & Nagasaki particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. HIROSHIMA_OKONOMIYAKI_VILLAGE_MITCHAN + HENKUTSU - Famous okonomiyaki layered + noodles + egg. $8-$12. Must. 2. MIYAJIMA_OYSTERS_GRILLED + OYSTER_KAISEKI_IWASO + MOMIJI_MANJU - Grilled oysters $10 + kaiseki $40-$80 + momiji sweet $3. 3. NAGASAKI_CHAMPON + SARA_UDON + CASTELLA_FUKUSAYA + CHINATOWN - Champon $8 + sara udon $8 + castella $10 + Chinatown. 4. HIROSHIMA_OYSTER_OKONOMIYAKI + SETO_INLAND_SEA_SEAFOOD 5. NAGASAKI_SHIPPOKU_CUISINE + SASEBO_BURGER Family: Prioritise okonomiyaki + oysters + momiji manju + champon + castella + Chinatown + kids like. Honeymoon: Include oyster kaiseki at Iwaso + okonomiyaki private + Nagasaki champon + castella + Mt Inasa dinner.', 1864),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Not luxury shopping - Small boutique at Iwaso + Garden Terrace Budget: Miyajima street $5-$15 + Peace Park goods + Nagasaki castella $10 + Chinatown $5-$15.', 1865),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 55 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Travellers should generally prefer: Miyajima floating torii night illumination + private onsen + oyster dinner, Hiroshima Peace Park night + river + Hondori bar + okonomiyaki, Nagasaki Mt Inasa night view top 3 + bay view bar + Chinatown + Shianbashi bar over: late-night clubs Note: Hiroshima + Nagasaki nightlife = Quiet + peace cities + small bars + izakaya + okonomiyaki + champon + no clubs. Peace Park night quiet + reflective. Miyajima night very quiet after day trippers leave 6 PM + torii illumination + deer + ryokan dinner + onsen + early sleep + sunrise. Nagasaki Mt Inasa night view best night activity + romantic + bay. For nightlife, go to Osaka/Fukuoka, not peaceful cities. Main evening is reflection + dinner + early sleep + sunrise torii.', 1866),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '1 NIGHT HIROSHIMA + MIYAJIMA CORE', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive Hiroshima Station Shinkansen from Osaka 90min. Check into hotel near Peace Park. Afternoon Peace Memorial Park + A-Bomb Dome UNESCO + Cenotaph + Children''s Monument + Peace Memorial Museum 2hr with audio guide + Hondori arcade + Okonomiyaki Village dinner okonomiyaki + oysters. Day 2 Morning tram to Miyajimaguchi 30min + ferry 10min to Miyajima Island. Itsukushima Shrine + floating torii high tide + deer + shopping street momiji manju + oyster grill + Mt Misen ropeway + 360 view Seto Inland Sea + Daisho-in Temple. Afternoon ferry back + Shinkansen to Osaka/Kyoto 90min or stay overnight Miyajima ryokan Iwaso with torii sunset/sunrise. Package Includes: 1 night Hiroshima + Peace Park + Miyajima ferry + ropeway + okonomiyaki + museum. Excludes: Miyajima ryokan upgrade, Gunkanjima, Nagasaki.', 1867),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 29, 'two-night-hiroshima-miyajima-overnight-pattern-ideal', 'TWO-NIGHT HIROSHIMA + MIYAJIMA OVERNIGHT PATTERN (IDEAL)', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive at Hiroshima Station Shinkansen 90min from Osaka/Kyoto. Check into hotel near Peace Park Rihga Royal / Granvia. Afternoon Peace Memorial Park + A-Bomb Dome + Peace Museum 2hr audio guide + Children''s Monument + Cenotaph + Flame + Shukkeien Garden + Hiroshima Castle + evening Okonomiyaki Village okonomiyaki + oysters + Hondori bar. Optional evening add-on: Direct ferry Peace Park→Miyajima 45min sunset scenic. Overnight: Hiroshima City Meals: Breakfast + Okonomiyaki dinner Day 2 After breakfast, tram to Miyajimaguchi 30min + ferry 10min to Miyajima Island. Check into Iwaso ryokan luxury with floating torii view + garden + private onsen + luggage. Day Itsukushima Shrine + floating torii high tide floating photo + low tide walk to torii + deer + Momiji Manju + oyster grill + Mt Misen ropeway + Daisho-in Temple + shopping street + evening floating torii night illumination + oyster kaiseki dinner at Iwaso + private onsen with torii view + deer night + quiet island after day trippers leave 6 PM. Overnight: Miyajima Iwaso Ryokan Meals: Breakfast + Dinner kaiseki oyster Day 3 Early morning 6 AM floating torii sunrise empty without crowds + deer + shrine empty + private photos + Mt Misen sunrise hike optional + morning ferry back to Hiroshima + Shinkansen to Kyoto/Osaka 90min or to Nagasaki via Hakata 3.5hr or to Fukuoka 70min with peace memories. Meals: Breakfast at Iwaso', 1868),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 30, 'two-night-family-pattern', 'TWO-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive Hiroshima Station, private van to hotel near Peace Park family room. Afternoon Peace Park flat + A-Bomb Dome view + Peace Museum audio for teens + Children''s Monument + Shukkeien Garden + Hiroshima Castle + Okonomiyaki Village family dinner okonomiyaki + oysters mild + Hondori shopping. Overnight: Hiroshima Family Hotel near Peace Park Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Morning tram + ferry to Miyajima Island + deer feeding + floating torii + Itsukushima Shrine + shopping momiji manju + oyster grill + Miyajima Aquarium + Mt Misen ropeway + monkeys + Daisho-in Temple. Afternoon ferry back + overnight Hiroshima or stay Miyajima family ryokan with torii view. Overnight: Hiroshima or Miyajima Family Ryokan Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast, check-out. Shinkansen to Kyoto/Osaka 90min or to Fukuoka 70min for Kyushu. Meals: Breakfast', 1869),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 31, 'four-night-hiroshima-nagasaki-peace-kyushu-pattern', 'FOUR-NIGHT HIROSHIMA + NAGASAKI PEACE + KYUSHU PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive Hiroshima Station by Shinkansen. Check into Rihga Royal. Afternoon: Peace Park + A-Bomb Dome + Museum 2hr + Shukkeien + Okonomiyaki. Overnight: Hiroshima Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Full day Miyajima + overnight Iwaso ryokan with floating torii sunset + oyster kaiseki + private onsen + night illumination + deer. Overnight: Miyajima Iwaso Meals: Breakfast + Dinner kaiseki Day 3 Early morning torii sunrise empty + ferry back + Shinkansen Hiroshima→Hakata 70min + Kamome Hakata→Nagasaki 90min. Check into Garden Terrace Nagasaki Bay view. Afternoon Nagasaki Peace Park + Atomic Museum + Hypocenter + Dejima + Chinatown champon + castella + evening Mt Inasa ropeway night view top 3 Japan + romantic. Overnight: Nagasaki Garden Terrace Meals: Breakfast Day 4 After breakfast, Glover Garden + Oura Church + Dutch Slope + Meganebashi + morning Gunkanjima Battleship Island cruise 2.5hr landing if weather + Penguin Aquarium + afternoon Shianbashi bar + Chinatown. Overnight: Nagasaki Meals: Breakfast Day 5 After breakfast, check out and Kamome Nagasaki→Hakata 90min + Shinkansen Hakata→Kyoto 2.5hr or flight Nagasaki NGS→Tokyo or bus to Fukuoka 2hr with peace + torii memories. Meals: Breakfast', 1870),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 1871),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose 2. Groups by geography: Hiroshima Peace Park + Downtown + Castle + Shukkeien together flat walking, Miyajima Island separate overnight + ropeway + shrine, Nagasaki Peace Park + Dejima + Glover + Chinatown + Mt Inasa together tram, Gunkanjima cruise separate day. 3. Uses hotel location strategically: HIROSHIMA PEACE PARK AREA for peace + tram + flat, MIYAJIMA ISLAND IWASO for torii view + overnight + sunset/sunrise empty #1, NAGASAKI BAY VIEW for Mt Inasa night view + bay. 4. Places: Peace Museum morning 9-11 AM with audio + Miyajima afternoon + overnight for sunset/sunrise empty + Mt Inasa night view sunset 6-8 PM + Gunkanjima morning cruise + check tide table for floating torii high tide. 5. Treats as 2 sites/day + reflection + not checklist many sites same day - Peace heavy emotional + need time. 6. Always includes tide table for Miyajima floating torii high/low + audio guide + tram day pass + ferry + Iwaso booking 3 months early + Gunkanjima weather warning + Aug 6/9 booking 6 months early.', 1872),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == Day trip from Osaka/Kyoto` THEN: Shinkansen Osaka→Hiroshima 90min + Peace Park + Museum 2hr + Miyajima 3hr + return 90min. Very long 14hr + rushed but possible if short time + only Hiroshima. Reason: Minimum for peace + torii. IF: `trip_length == 1 night Hiroshima` THEN: Day 1 Peace Park + Museum + Okonomiyaki, Day 2 Miyajima floating torii + ropeway + return to Osaka/Kyoto. Covers core. Reason: Perfect core Hiroshima + Miyajima. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights Hiroshima` THEN: Add Miyajima overnight at Iwaso with floating torii sunset/sunrise empty + oyster kaiseki + Mt Misen hike + Daisho-in + direct ferry Peace Park → Miyajima scenic. Reason: Best for photo + honeymoon + family + complete. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights Nagasaki add-on` THEN: Peace Park + Atomic Museum + Dejima + Glover Garden + Chinatown + Mt Inasa night view + Gunkanjima cruise. Reason: Complete peace cities + Dutch history + night view. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Peace Park + Museum for teens + Miyajima deer + ropeway + aquarium + castle + okonomiyaki + Nagasaki penguin aquarium + Glover + Champon. Reason: Educational + fun + deer + aquarium. IF: `traveler_type == HONEYMOON` THEN: Miyajima Iwaso torii view overnight + floating torii sunset/sunrise private + oyster kaiseki + private onsen + Mt Inasa night view private. Reason: Most romantic floating torii + night view.', 1873),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | Family | 82 Honeymoon | 72 Luxury | 78 Budget | 78 Adventure | 60 Culture | 88 Food | 82 Shopping | 65 Nightlife | 55 Relaxation | 70 Nature | 82 Accessibility | 74 Safety | 92 First-time visitor | 90 Photography | 88', 1874),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. History + Peace travelers - #1 peace + WWII history in Japan + emotional + powerful 2. First-time Japan with Miyajima - Floating torii UNESCO #1 photo after Fuji + deer + shrine 3. Educational families - Peace Museum + A-Bomb Dome + Miyajima deer + ropeway + history 4. Honeymoon with Miyajima - Iwaso ryokan torii view + floating torii sunset/sunrise + oyster + private onsen + romantic island after day crowds’ leaves 5. Kyushu route travelers – Fukuoka → Nagasaki → Hiroshima → Kyoto → Tokyo west to east + Dejima Dutch + Gunkanjima + Mt Inasa night view 6. Photographers - Floating torii high tide + sunrise empty + A-Bomb Dome + Mt Inasa night top 3 + Gunkanjima battleship Best duration: 2 nights Hiroshima + Miyajima overnight ideal. 2 nights Nagasaki optional for Kyushu route. Best season: Late Mar-early Apr sakura Peace Park + Miyajima + Oct-Nov autumn Miyajima best + clear. Aug 6 & 9 memorial ceremonies powerful emotional but very crowded + book 6 months early. Dec-Feb oysters best + cheap + clear. Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Shinkansen Osaka/Kyoto → Hiroshima 90min $70 + tram day pass $6 + JR + ferry to Miyajima 10min $4 + JR Pass covers JR train + JR ferry. For Nagasaki - Hiroshima→Hakata Shinkansen 70min + Kamome Hakata → Nagasaki 90min $25 total 3.5hr. Must-do: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Japan’s peace + history heart + powerful emotional + educational + Miyajima floating torii #1 UNESCO photo + deer + Iwaso ryokan + oyster + okonomiyaki + Nagasaki Dutch history + Mt Inasa night view top 3 + Gunkanjima adventure. Biggest disadvantage: Far from Tokyo 4hr Shinkansen + Osaka 90min + need 1-2N minimum + Peace Museum heavy emotional + not for very small kids + Nagasaki far 3.5hr from Hiroshima + hotels near Peace Park limited + Gunkanjima landing depends weather. Overall destination score: 89/100 - Must 2N Hiroshima + Miyajima overnight for any Japan history + UNESCO trip. Nagasaki 2N optional for Kyushu route + peace + Dutch + night view.', 1875),
  ('hiroshima-and-nagasaki', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 92/100 last_updated: 2026-08-17 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: JAPAN_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: This Hiroshima & Nagasaki file is suitable for itinerary design, traveller profiling, hotel-area strategy, and initial package planning. Tide table for Miyajima floating torii high tide floating + low tide walk to torii - Check daily + plan 2hr stay for both. Peace Museum audio guide essential + 2hr. Miyajima ropeway may close in windy. Iwaso ryokan torii view book 3 months early + especially Nov/autumn + Aug 6/9 ceremonies book 6 months early. Gunkanjima landing depends on whether + waves; 50% chance of no landing. Prices, hotel inventory, ferry schedule, museum timings must be live-verified before quotation. Do not rely on generic Hiroshima package inclusions without confirming exact Peace Park timings, museum audio included, ferry type JR vs direct scenic, Miyajima overnight ryokan torii view or not, tide time high/low, ropeway included, and whether Nagasaki + Gunkanjima included.', 1876),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Spring Mar-May', NULL, 'weather: 10-23°C, cherry blossom late Mar-early Apr Nara Park + Nagoya Castle Park best. crowd_level: VERY HIGH price_level: VERY HIGH overall_score: 90 recommended: true reason: Sakura deer + Todai-ji + Castle Park best.', 1877),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer Jun-Aug', NULL, 'weather: 25-33°C, hot + humid + rainy Jun + deer summer + Nagoya very hot. crowd_level: HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 74 recommended: true reason: Hot + humid but deer + Legoland + indoor museums.', 1878),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Autumn Sep-Nov', NULL, 'weather: 16-26°C, clear Oct-Nov, autumn colors mid-late Nov Nara Park + Mt Wakakusa best. crowd_level: HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 88 recommended: true reason: Autumn deer + Todai-ji + Castle Park + pleasant.', 1879),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter Dec-Feb', NULL, 'weather: 2-11°C, cold + clear + less crowd + deer winter + illuminations Nagoya. crowd_level: LOW_MEDIUM price_level: MEDIUM overall_score: 78 recommended: true reason: Cheap + less crowd + deer + illuminations + Todai-ji clear.', 1880),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended: Travel-agent rule: Nara day trip $30-$50 (train + Todai-ji + Kasuga + mochi + deer crackers). Nagoya 1N $100-$180 mid + 2N with Legoland $250-$400. Tokyo→Nagoya Shinkansen 90min $70 + Nagoya→Kyoto 35min $30 + easy. Nagoya as base for Takayama/Shirakawa-go needs JR Takayama-Hokuriku Pass.', 1881),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Kyoto/Osaka→Nara Kintetsu 35min with kids + deer feeding + stroller + park flat + Nara Hotel family. For Nagoya - Meitetsu μ-Sky NGO→Nagoya 35min + taxi to hotel Sakae + Legoland official hotel shuttle + family room.', 1882),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Private car Kyoto→Nara 60min + Nara Park deer + Kasuga lanterns private + Todai-ji private + mochi pounding + Naramachi old town + tea. For Nagoya - Private car NGO→TIAD luxury + Nagoya Castle private + hitsumabushi private dinner + Sakae night.', 1883),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Private luxury van + Nara Hotel historic luxury + TIAD Nagoya + private guide + deer feeding private + Legoland VIP if needed.', 1884),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Kintetsu day pass + JR Pass + bus NGO→Nagoya $10 + metro day pass + hostel near Nagoya Station + Nara day trip.', 1885),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Senior', 'senior', 'Private car Kyoto→Nara 60min + Nara Park flat + Todai-ji flat + Kasuga with steps but manageable + bench + deer. For Nagoya - Private car + Nagoya Castle elevator + Toyota Museum flat + SCMaglev flat.', 1886),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 18, 'family-travel', 'FAMILY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'child_friendly_score: 90 best_ages: Rules: For young children: Prefer: Avoid:', 1887),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 60 Nara day trip + 65 Nagoya romance_score: 62 privacy_score: 68 luxury_score: 68 Recommended: Nara + Nagoya not main honeymoon base - Use Nara as romantic day trip from Kyoto + Nagoya 1N for Nagoya meshi + Ghibli + Toyota if interest: Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than: Nara half-day + 1 temple + deer + mochi. Nagoya 1-2 areas/day. Recommended hotel areas:', 1888),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 20, 'luxury-travel', 'LUXURY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'luxury_score: 68 Recommended: Luxury should primarily increase:', 1889),
