  ('nara-and-nagoya', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 82 walking_intensity: LOW_TO_MEDIUM Rules:', 1891),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD public_transport_accessibility: GOOD - Kintetsu + JR + Nagoya metro elevators + low floor + bus hotel_accessibility: GOOD; 4★-5★ HOTELS HAVE ELEVATORS + ACCESSIBLE ROOMS + RAMPS, NARA_HOTEL_HISTORIC_OLD_BUT_HAS_ELEVATOR attraction_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD; MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Verify accessible room + elevator + private car.', 1892),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Nara & Nagoya particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. NARA_NAKATANIDOU_MOCHI_POUNDING + MOCHI - Famous high-speed mochi pounding + fresh mochi $5. Must see. 2. NAGOYA_HITSUMABUSHI_ATSUTA_HORAIKEN - Famous eel hitsumabushi 4 ways - Eat plain + with wasabi + with dashi + mix. $20-$30. Must. 3. NAGOYA_MISO_KATSU_YABATON + TEBASAKI_FURAIBO - Miso katsu $10 + tebasaki chicken wings $8. Nagoya meshi must. 4. NARA_KAKINOHA_SUSHI + SAKE_TASTING_HARUSHIKA + NARAZUKE 5. NAGOYA_KISHIMEN + MISO_NIKOMI + OGURA_TOAST + TAIWAN_RAMEN Family: Prioritise Nara mochi + deer crackers (for deer) + kakinoha sushi + Nagoya hitsumabushi mild + miso katsu + Legoland food + kids like tebasaki. Honeymoon: Include hitsumabushi private + miso katsu + sake tasting Nara + mochi + tea ceremony.', 1893),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Sakae + JR Gate Tower + Takashimaya luxury brands Budget: Nara Higashimuki $5-$15 deer + mochi + Osu $10-$30 + Sakae sale + Don Quijote.', 1894),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 60 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Travellers should generally prefer: Nara Naramachi bar + sake + Kasuga lanterns Feb/Aug night festival, Nagoya Sakae TV Tower night + Oasis 21 + Nishiki bars + Sakae izakaya + hitsumabushi dinner + Osu night over: late-night clubs Note: Nara nightlife = Very quiet + Naramachi bars + sake + early sleep 9 PM + deer night park closed. Kasuga lantern festival Feb/Aug night lit. Nagoya nightlife = Sakae + Nishiki bars + izakaya + clubs + young + industrial city but not Osaka/Tokyo level. Sakae closes 11 PM-12 AM + clubs till 2 AM. For nightlife go to Osaka 50min away. Main evening is Nara deer sunset + Todai-ji illumination sometimes + Nagoya meshi dinner + Sakae bar.', 1895),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', 'NARA DAY TRIP FROM KYOTO/OSAKA', NULL, 'Day trip Morning Kyoto 8 AM Kintetsu 35min to Kintetsu Nara or Osaka-Namba 35min. Arrive Nara 9 AM. Nara Park deer crackers $2 + bowing deer + Todai-ji Big Buddha $8 + museum + Kofuku-ji + Isuien Garden + Kasuga Taisha 3000 lanterns $5 + Naramachi old town + Nakatanidou mochi pounding + kakinoha sushi lunch + Higashimuki shopping deer goods + afternoon 3 PM Kintetsu back to Kyoto/Osaka 35min. Package Includes: Train + Todai-ji + Kasuga + deer crackers + mochi + guide Excludes: Private car, Mt Wakakusa hike.', 1896),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 29, 'one-night-nagoya-city-pattern', 'ONE-NIGHT NAGOYA CITY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive at Nagoya NGO airport 35min Meitetsu μ-Sky to Nagoya Station or Shinkansen from Tokyo 90min / Kyoto 35min. Check into hotel Nagoya Station/Sakae. Afternoon Nagoya Castle Honmaru Palace + park + Atsuta Shrine + Toyota Commemorative Museum free + Sakae TV Tower + Oasis 21 + Osu shopping arcade 1200 shops + evening Nagoya meshi hitsumabushi Atsuta Horaiken + miso katsu Yabaton + tebasaki Furaibo. Optional evening add-on: Sakae bar + Nishiki nightlife. Overnight: Nagoya Station / Sakae Meals: Breakfast Day 2 After breakfast, SCMaglev and Railway Park + Legoland Japan or Ghibli Park + Port Aquarium or Toyota City factory tour or day trip Ise Shrine 90min or Takayama/Shirakawa-go start 2D1N. Afternoon Shinkansen Nagoya→Kyoto 35min / Tokyo 90min / NGO flight. Meals: Breakfast', 1897),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 30, 'two-night-nara-nagoya-family-pattern', 'TWO-NIGHT NARA + NAGOYA FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Morning Kyoto/Osaka→Nara 35-45min Kintetsu/JR. Nara Park deer crackers + Todai-ji Big Buddha + Kasuga lanterns + Naramachi mochi pounding + Isuien Garden + lunch kakinoha sushi + afternoon train Nara→Nagoya 90min via Kyoto or direct Kintetsu. Check into Nagoya Sakae family hotel. Evening Sakae TV Tower + Oasis 21 + Nagoya meshi hitsumabushi. Overnight: Nagoya Family Hotel Sakae Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Full day Legoland Japan Resort 10 AM-5 PM - 7 areas + Miniland + rides + lunch inside + afternoon SCMaglev and Railway Park + Port Aquarium + Science Museum planetarium biggest. Evening Osu shopping + tebasaki + miso katsu. Overnight: Nagoya Family Hotel Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast, check-out. Nagoya Castle Honmaru Palace + park + Toyota Museum free + Ghibli Park if booked + afternoon Shinkansen to Kyoto/Tokyo or NGO flight with deer + Lego memories. Meals: Breakfast', 1898),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 31, 'two-night-nagoya-base-takayama-pattern', 'TWO-NIGHT NAGOYA BASE + TAKAYAMA PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive NGO + Meitetsu to Nagoya Station. Check into TIAD luxury. Afternoon Nagoya Castle + Atsuta Shrine + Sakae + Osu + Toyota Museum + evening Nagoya meshi hitsumabushi + Sakae night view + bar. Overnight: TIAD Nagoya / Prince Sky Tower Meals: Breakfast Day 2 After breakfast, day trip Ise Shrine 90min + Okage Yokocho + Ise seafood or Ghibli Park Totoro + Spirited Away full day or Toyota City factory tour + SCMaglev + Science Museum. Evening Sakae farewell. Overnight: TIAD Nagoya Meals: Breakfast Day 3 After breakfast, check out and Hida Wide View Express Nagoya→Takayama 2.5hr scenic + Takayama old town + Shirakawa-go 1hr bus + overnight Takayama ryokan or Shinkansen Nagoya→Kyoto 35min with Nagoya memories. Meals: Breakfast', 1899),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 1900),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose 2. Groups by geography: Nara Park + Todai-ji + Kasuga + Kofuku-ji + Naramachi + Isuien together walking flat, Nagoya Station + Toyota Museum + Sakae + Osu + Science Museum together metro, Castle + Atsuta + Higashiyama Zoo + Tokugawa together metro, Legoland + SCMaglev + Aquarium + Ghibli Park Bay area + Aonami/Linimo. 3. Uses hotel location strategically: NARA near Kintetsu Nara Station 10min walk to park for day trip, NAGOYA STATION/SAKAE for city + base + metro hub + Nagoya meshi + shopping. 4. Places Nara morning 8-11 AM deer + Todai-ji before crowds + Kasuga morning + mochi pounding + Nagoya Castle morning + Sakae evening night view + Legoland full day 10 AM-5 PM. 5. Treats Nara as half-day to full day walking + deer + temples + mochi + not 2 days + Nagoya as 1-2N city + base + Legoland/Ghibli full day. 6. Always includes deer crackers $2 + bowing + Todai-ji $8 + Kasuga $5 + Nagoya Castle Honmaru Palace open only + Ghibli Park 3 months booking + Legoland 1 week booking + Nagoya meshi hitsumabushi/miso katsu/tebasaki.', 1901),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == Nara day trip from Kyoto/Osaka` THEN: Kintetsu 35min + Nara Park deer + Todai-ji + Kasuga + mochi pounding + Naramachi + return 35min. 4-5hr. Perfect. Reason: Core Nara in half-day. IF: `trip_length == Nara 1 night` THEN: Add Mt Wakakusa sunset + Kasuga lanterns evening + Isuien Garden + Nara National Museum + Naramachi slow + sake tasting + early morning deer empty. Reason: Slow Nara + lanterns + sunset. IF: `trip_length == Nagoya 1 night` THEN: Castle Honmaru Palace + Atsuta Shrine + Toyota Museum + Sakae + Osu + Nagoya meshi hitsumabushi + miso katsu + tebasaki. Reason: Core Nagoya city + food. IF: `trip_length == Nagoya 2 nights` THEN: Add Legoland Japan + SCMaglev + Aquarium + Science Museum + Ghibli Park or day trip Ise/Takayama start. Reason: Complete family + industrial + Ghibli + base. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Nara deer crackers + Todai-ji + mochi pounding + Nagoya Legoland + SCMaglev + Aquarium + Ghibli Park + Science Museum planetarium + Higashiyama Zoo. Reason: Deer + Lego + Ghibli + trains + family favourites. IF: `traveler_type == BUSINESS + INDUSTRIAL` THEN: Nagoya Toyota Museum + Toyota City factory tour + SCMaglev + Nagoya Castle + Sakae business dinner + hitsumabushi. Reason: Toyota City + industrial heart.', 1902),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | Family | 90 Honeymoon | 62 Luxury | 68 Budget | 82 Adventure | 55 Culture | 90 Food | 84 Shopping | 75 Nightlife | 60 Relaxation | 68 Nature | 76 Accessibility | 76 Safety | 92 First-time visitor | 88 Photography | 84', 1903),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. Family with deer + Legoland - Nara 1200 deer + bowing + Todai-ji big + Nagoya Legoland + Ghibli Park + SCMaglev + Aquarium 2. First-time Japan day trip - Nara must from Kyoto/Osaka 45min + ancient capital 710 + Todai-ji biggest wooden 3. Industrial + car lovers - Nagoya Toyota city + Toyota Museum + factory tour + SCMaglev + maglev 4. Culture + History - Nara first capital + UNESCO Todai-ji + Kasuga lanterns + ancient + Nagoya Castle samurai 5. Base for Chubu Alps - Nagoya best hub for Takayama + Shirakawa-go + Ise + Ghibli + Legoland 6. Foodies - Nagoya meshi hitsumabushi eel + miso katsu + tebasaki wings + Nara mochi pounding + kakinoha sushi Best duration: Nara half-day trip from Kyoto/Osaka + Nagoya 1-2 nights Best season: Late Mar-early Apr sakura Nara Park + Nagoya Castle Park best + Oct-Nov autumn Nara Park + Mt Wakakusa best + clear. Dec-Feb cheap + deer + illuminations Nagoya. Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Kyoto/Osaka→Nara Kintetsu 35min $6 best + JR 45min $6 + walking Nara Park flat + loop bus $5. For Nagoya - NGO airport→Nagoya Station Meitetsu μ-Sky 35min $12 + metro day pass $6 + Aonami Line to Legoland/SCMaglev 25min + Linimo to Ghibli Park 30min + Shinkansen Tokyo→Nagoya 90min $70 + Nagoya→Kyoto 35min $30. Must-do: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Nara ancient capital 710 + 1200 free deer + bowing + Todai-ji Big Buddha biggest wooden + Kasuga lanterns + mochi pounding + UNESCO + half-day from Kyoto/Osaka + Nagoya industrial Toyota + Legoland + Ghibli Park + SC Maglev + Nagoya meshi Hitsumabushi + best base for Takayama/Shirakawa-go/Alps. Biggest disadvantage: Nara few luxury hotels + day trippers crowded 10 AM-3 PM + deer may bite if tease + Nagoya industrial not charming like Kyoto + Nagoya Castle main keep closed reconstruction + Ghibli Park sold out 3 months + Nagoya traffic + business city not romantic honeymoon. Overall destination score: 84/100 - Must Nara half-day day trip from Kyoto/Osaka for deer + Big Buddha. Nagoya 1-2N for Legoland + Toyota + Ghibli + base for Chubu Alps.', 1904),
  ('nara-and-nagoya', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 90/100 last_updated: 2026-08-17 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: JAPAN_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: This Nara & Nagoya file is suitable for itinerary design, traveller profiling, hotel-area strategy, and initial package planning. Nara Park deer 1200 + deer crackers $2 + bowing + deer may bite if teased + Todai-ji $8 + Kasuga $5 + Mt Wakakusa hike 40min. Nagoya Castle main keep closed for reconstruction till 2028 - Only Honmaru Palace open + park. Ghibli Park tickets booked 3 months early sold out + Legoland 1 week early + SCMaglev $10. Toyota Commemorative Museum free but closed Mondays. Prices, hotel inventory, Ghibli/Legoland availability, and castle timings must be live-verified before quotation. Do not rely on generic Nara/Nagoya package inclusions without confirming exact train Kintetsu vs JR, deer crackers included, Todai-ji/Kasuga tickets included, Nagoya Castle Honmaru Palace only, Toyota Museum included, Legoland/Ghibli tickets included, hotel area Nara Park vs Nagoya Station/Sakae, and whether Takayama/Shirakawa-go/Ise day trip included.', 1905),
