  ('poland', 30, 'seven-nights-family-pattern', 'SEVEN-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 1', NULL, 'Arrival at Kraków → Private airport transfer → Family hotel check-in → Relax and refresh Evening: → Main Market Square → Old Town → Vistula riverfront → Family dinner → Overnight at Kraków', 2701),
