  ('poland', 30, 'seven-nights-family-pattern', 'SEVEN-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast Morning: → Royal Route → Łazienki Park → Palace on the Isle Afternoon: Choose ONE: FAMILY_FUN: → Copernicus Science Centre → Interactive activities OR LEISURE: → Warsaw Zoo → Family activities → Leisure time Evening: → Free time → Overnight at Warsaw', 2705),
