  ('portugal', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 1', NULL, 'Arrival at Lisbon → Private chauffeured transfer to Sintra → Luxury / heritage hotel check-in → Relax and refresh Evening: → Private Sintra orientation → Historic Centre → Scenic viewpoints → Premium Portuguese dinner → Overnight at Sintra', 2804),
  ('portugal', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast Morning: → Privately guided Pena Palace → Quinta da Regaleira → Romantic gardens and heritage Afternoon: → Cabo da Roca → Guincho coastline → Cascais → Private scenic coastal drive Evening: → Spa / leisure → Fine dining → Overnight at Sintra', 2805),
