  ('portugal', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast Morning: → Private guided Lisbon tour → Belém → Jerónimos Monastery → Belém Tower → Monument to the Discoveries Afternoon: → Chiado → Avenida da Liberdade → Premium shopping → Hotel spa / leisure Evening: → Sunset rooftop / Tagus views → Michelin-level / fine-dining experience → Overnight at Lisbon', 2809),
