  ('athens', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', NULL, NULL, 'Family: Metro Line 3 $10 45min ATH to Syntagma + Metro $1.20 to Plaka Monastiraki + taxi $10-$15 to Plaka hotel + private car $30 + family room + safe + flat + history + culture + city + food + family + safe + Metro + taxi + modern + family + safe Honeymoon: Private car $30-$45 + taxi $30-$45 + luxury hotel Grande Bretagne $300-$500 + King George $250-$400 + Four Seasons Astir Palace $400-$800 + boutique $100-$250 + Plaka + Anafiotika + Mount Lycabettus sunset + Acropolis sunset + Plaka dinner + boutique + romantic history + best romantic history Greece Luxury: Private car $30-$50 + Hotel Grande Bretagne $300-$500 + King George $250-$400 + Four Seasons Astir Palace $400-$800 + boutique $100-$250 + Kolonaki + Glyfada + luxury + best luxury history Greece + private car + luxury + best Budget: Metro Line 3 $10 45min ATH to Syntagma + bus X95 $6 60min + hostel $20-$40 + 3★ $60-$120 + cheapest + best budget Athens + Metro + bus + cheapest + best budget Athens + Metro + bus Senior: Taxi $30-$45 + private car $30-$45 + hotel flat near Plaka + Acropolis flat with help + Acropolis Museum flat + Ancient Agora flat + Plaka flat + Monastiraki flat + Syntagma flat + Changing Guard flat + Panathenaic Stadium flat + Lycabettus cable car + private car best + but steps Acropolis + need car + need elevator', 2822),
  ('athens', 18, 'family-travel', 'FAMILY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'child_friendly_score: 84 best_ages: 5-12 Acropolis + Parthenon + Acropolis Museum + Ancient Agora + Plaka + Monastiraki + Syntagma + Changing Guard + Panathenaic Stadium + Lycabettus cable car + safe + flat with help + family + history + culture + city + food. TEENAGERS: Acropolis + Parthenon + Acropolis Museum + Ancient Agora + Plaka + Monastiraki + Syntagma + Changing of the Guard + Temple of Olympian Zeus + Panathenaic Stadium + Mount Lycabettus + Anafiotika + National Archaeological Museum + National Garden + Kolonaki + Ermou Street + Glyfada Beach + Vouliagmeni Beach + Piraeus Port + shopping + photography + history + culture + nightlife + rooftop bars. Rules: Max 3-4 attractions/day. Athens is small + need Metro + need taxi + need private car. Plan outdoor 8-11AM or after 4PM avoid midday 11AM-4PM summer hot 38°C Acropolis hot need hat, sunscreen water. Schedule lunch: street food $3-$8 + souvlaki $3-$5 + gyros $3-$6 + Plaka $8-$15 + safe. Prefer hotel near Plaka + near Monastiraki + near Syntagma + near Acropolis + near Acropolis Museum + near Ancient Agora + central + flat safe modern city history culture food shopping. Use Metro $1.20 + bus $1.20 + tram $1.20 + taxi $5-$15 + private car $50/day vs bus family safe flat history culture city.', 2823),
