  ('athens', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 80 walking_intensity: LOW → MEDIUM Rules: HOTEL near Plaka flat near Monastiraki flat near Syntagma flat near Acropolis flat with help near Acropolis Museum flat near Ancient Agora flat near Plaka flat near Monastiraki flat near Syntagma flat near Changing Guard flat near Panathenaic Stadium flat near Lycabettus cable car flat car near private car $50/day all transfers avoid Metro crowded avoid long walk avoid summer hot 38°C need hat sunscreen water need Metro elevator need taxi need private car avoid midday 11AM-4PM summer hot Acropolis hot need private car avoid crowded Apr-Oct need private car. Prioritise low-effort: Acropolis with help + Acropolis Museum flat + Ancient Agora flat + Plaka flat + Monastiraki flat + Syntagma flat + Changing of the Guard flat + Temple of Olympian Zeus flat + Panathenaic Stadium flat + Lycabettus cable car + Anafiotika flat with help + National Garden flat + Kolonaki flat + Ermou Street flat + Glyfada Beach flat + Vouliagmeni Beach flat + Piraeus Port flat + Cape Sounion flat.', 2827),
  ('athens', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: HIGH-MODERATE 74 public_transport_accessibility: HIGH 78 hotel_accessibility: HIGH-MODERATE 4★ $100-$200 flat + 5★ $150-$400 flat + boutique $100-$250 flat + near Plaka + near Monastiraki + near Syntagma + near Acropolis + near Acropolis Museum + near Ancient Agora + near Plaka + near Monastiraki + near Syntagma + near Changing Guard + near Temple of Olympian Zeus + near Panathenaic Stadium + near Lycabettus + near Anafiotika + flat + modern + history + culture + city + food + shopping + accessible + best + history + culture + city + food + shopping attraction_accessibility: HIGH-MODERATE MUST_BE_VERIFIED Acropolis with help elevator + Acropolis Museum flat + Ancient Agora flat + Plaka flat + Monastiraki flat + Syntagma flat + Changing Guard flat + Temple of Olympian Zeus flat + Panathenaic Stadium flat + Lycabettus cable car + Anafiotika flat with help + National Garden flat + Kolonaki flat + Ermou Street flat + Glyfada Beach flat + Vouliagmeni Beach flat + Piraeus Port flat + Cape Sounion flat + but steps Acropolis + Anafiotika + Lycabettus hike + but Metro elevator + taxi + private car + flat + accessible + modern city history + culture + city + food + shopping + but steps Acropolis + Anafiotika + Lycabettus hike', 2828),
