  ('dubai', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Senior:', 'senior', 'Taxi $10-$15 + private car $15-$30 + hotel flat near Downtown + Dubai Mall flat + Burj Khalifa elevator + Dubai Fountain flat + Marina cruise flat + Desert Safari car + Jumeirah Beach flat + Gold Souk flat + private car best + but heat + need car + need indoor', 3407),
