  ('dubai', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS DUBAI - BEST FOR FIRST TIME', NULL, 'Day 1: Arrive DXB. 10 km, 15 min to Downtown hotel $150-$300. Afternoon: Burj Khalifa 828m tallest building world + Dubai Mall biggest mall in the world + Dubai Fountain + Dubai Aquarium + Souk Al Bahar + Armani Hotel + Dubai Opera + evening: Burj Khalifa sunset + Dubai Fountain show + Dubai Mall + luxury shopping + Michelin. Overnight: Downtown hotel $150-$300 / Marina $150-$300 / Palm $300-$1000 Meals: Breakfast + Arabic $10-$30 + Indian $8-$20 + Dubai Mall food $10-$30 + Desert camp BBQ $10-$20 Day 2 Morning Dubai Marina + JBR Beach + Palm Jumeirah man-made island + Atlantis + Atlantis The Royal + The Pointe + Burj Al Arab photo + Jumeirah Beach + Marina Beach + Kite Beach + Palm Beach + Atlantis Beach + private beach + luxury hotels + luxury beach clubs + Marina cruise + Ain Dubai + Bluewaters + afternoon Atlantis Aquaventure + Wild Wadi + Ski Dubai + Miracle Garden + Global Village + evening Marina cruise dinner + JBR evening + Palm evening + Atlantis evening + Burj Al Arab evening + luxury nightlife. Overnight: Marina / Palm / Downtown hotel Day 3 Morning Dubai Creek + Gold Souk + Spice Souk + Al Fahidi Historical + Dubai Museum + Abra $0.3 + Deira + Bur Dubai + Dubai Frame + Museum of Future + afternoon Desert Safari evening 3 PM pickup + Dune bashing + Camel + Quad Bike + Desert camp BBQ + belly dance + Tanoura + fire show + henna + shisha + evening 9 PM back Downtown Marina JBR Palm. Overnight: Downtown / Marina hotel Day 4 Morning shopping + transfer to DXB 10 km 15 min + DWC 40 km 45 min + AUH 140 km 1.5 hrs + SHJ 30 km 45 min + Abu Dhabi 140km + Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque + Louvre + Ferrari World + Yas Island + Sharjah + Al Ain + Hatta + Oman + Maldives.', 3417),
