  ('dubai', 30, 'five-night-luxury-honeymoon-beach-abu-dhabi-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY + HONEYMOON + BEACH + ABU DHABI PATTERN', 'TRIP TYPE: LUXURY + HONEYMOON + BEACH + DESERT', 'honeymoon', 'Best For: Honeymoon Couple + Luxury + Beach Lovers + Desert Experience + 1st Time UAE Hotel Strategy: #### DAY 1: ARRIVE DUBAI (DXB) / ABU DHABI (AUH) - ABU DHABI CITY - LUXURY Morning: Arrive DXB 140km 1.5hr to Abu Dhabi / AUH Airport 20km 30min to Abu Dhabi City + private car $40-$60 transfer to Abu Dhabi luxury hotel. Afternoon: Check-in 5★ Abu Dhabi - Emirates Palace $400-$800 + St Regis Saadiyat $300-$600 + Four Seasons $300-$600 + Qasr Al Sarab style luxury + Saadiyat Beach + Louvre Abu Dhabi + Qasr Al Watan + Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque sunset #1 must. Evening: Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque sunset #1 must + Louvre Abu Dhabi night view + Saadiyat Beach sunset + Abu Dhabi Corniche + private dinner at Emirates Palace + honeymoon romantic dinner + infinity pool + private pool. Overnight: Abu Dhabi Luxury - Emirates Palace / St Regis Saadiyat / Four Seasons / Rosewood Meals: Breakfast + fine dining $40-$100 + Emirates Palace lunch $50-$80 #### DAY 2: ABU DHABI CITY + SAADIYAT ISLAND BEACH + LOUVRE + YAS ISLAND Morning: Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque morning 9AM + Qasr Al Watan 10AM + Louvre Abu Dhabi 11AM + Saadiyat Beach + Saadiyat Cultural District. Afternoon: Yas Island + Ferrari World + Warner Bros + Yas Beach + Saadiyat Beach Club + luxury beach + private beach + honeymoon beach + infinity pool. Evening: Saadiyat Beach sunset + Louvre sunset + Qasr Al Watan light show + Abu Dhabi Corniche night + Yas Marina dinner + luxury yacht dinner $100-$200 optional + honeymoon private dinner. Overnight: Abu Dhabi Luxury - Emirates Palace / St Regis Saadiyat Meals: Breakfast + casual $20-$40 + fine dining $40-$100 #### DAY 3: ABU DHABI - QASR AL SARAB DESERT - LIWA DESERT - EMPTY QUARTER - ULTRA LUXURY DESERT Morning: Abu Dhabi 200km 2.5hrs to Qasr Al Sarab Desert Resort by Anantara + Liwa