  ('melbourne', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast → Hotel checkout → Flight to Cairns → Romantic hotel check-in Choose ONE: REEF → Green Island / Great Barrier Reef experience → Snorkelling / glass-bottom boat → Tropical island leisure OR RAINFOREST → Skyrail Rainforest Cableway → Barron Gorge → Scenic rainforest experience Evening: → Cairns Esplanade → Farewell romantic dinner → Overnight at Cairns', 3716),
