  ('melbourne', 30, 'six-nights-family-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast → Hotel checkout → Flight to Cairns → Family hotel check-in Choose ONE: FAMILY_REEF → Green Island cruise → Great Barrier Reef → Glass-bottom boat → Snorkelling / beach time OR FAMILY_RAINFOREST → Skyrail Rainforest Cableway → Barron Falls → Rainforest experience → Wildlife activities Evening: → Cairns Esplanade → Farewell family dinner → Overnight at Cairns', 3723),
