  ('melbourne', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Early Morning: → Private / premium Melbourne hot-air balloon flight → Sunrise aerial experience → Champagne breakfast → Scenic photography Afternoon: → Private Melbourne city orientation → Federation Square → Flinders Street → Premium laneway experience Evening: → Rooftop fine dining → Overnight at Melbourne', 3726),
  ('melbourne', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 3', NULL, 'Breakfast → Curated Melbourne lifestyle experience Morning: → Queen Victoria Market → Artisan food tasting → Private shopping Afternoon: → Royal Botanic Gardens → Spa / wellness → Luxury afternoon tea Evening: → Fine dining → Overnight at Melbourne', 3727),
  ('melbourne', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 4', NULL, 'Breakfast → Private Phillip Island excursion → Scenic coastal touring → Premium wildlife experience Evening: → Penguin Parade premium viewing → Return to Melbourne → Melbourne Skydeck → Private / premium city views → Overnight at Melbourne', 3728),
  ('melbourne', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast → Private Yarra River / River Gardens cruise → Melbourne skyline photography Afternoon: → Hotel checkout → Premium flight to Gold Coast → Private luxury transfer → Luxury beachfront resort check-in Evening: → Surfers Paradise / Broadbeach → Sunset cocktails → Fine dining → Overnight at Gold Coast', 3729),
  ('melbourne', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast → Hotel checkout → Premium flight to Cairns → Private luxury transfer → Premium resort check-in Choose ONE: PREMIUM_REEF → Luxury Great Barrier Reef / Green Island experience → Premium snorkelling → Marine viewing → Island leisure OR PREMIUM_RAINFOREST → Skyrail Rainforest Cableway → Barron Gorge → Private rainforest experience → Spa / wellness Evening: → Cairns waterfront → Farewell fine-dining experience → Overnight at Cairns', 3730),
