  ('suva', 30, 'eight-nights-family-pattern', 'EIGHT-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast → Hotel checkout → Scenic drive towards the Coral Coast → Pacific Harbour stop → Continue towards Sigatoka Afternoon: → Sigatoka Sand Dunes National Park → Family nature experience → Coral Coast resort check-in Evening: → Beach leisure → Family dinner → Overnight around Sigatoka / Coral Coast', 3818),
  ('suva', 30, 'eight-nights-family-pattern', 'EIGHT-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast Choose ONE: FAMILY_FUN → Kula Wild Adventure Park → Wildlife & nature experiences → Resort pool / beach → Family activities CULTURE → Sigatoka cultural experience → Fijian village visit → Local traditions → River landscapes BEACH_DAY → Coral Coast beach → Snorkelling → Resort activities → Family relaxation Evening: → Family beachfront dinner → Overnight at Coral Coast', 3819),
