  ('suva', 31, 'eight-nights-luxury-pattern', 'EIGHT-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast → Hotel checkout → Private chauffeured journey along southern Viti Levu → Pacific Harbour scenic stop → Continue to Sigatoka / Coral Coast Afternoon: → Private guided Sigatoka Sand Dunes experience → Premium beachfront resort check-in → Spa & relaxation Evening: → Sunset cocktails → Fine-dining beachfront experience → Overnight at Coral Coast', 3827),
  ('suva', 31, 'eight-nights-luxury-pattern', 'EIGHT-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast Choose ONE: LUXURY_LEISURE → Private beachfront cabana → Couple / premium spa treatment → Snorkelling → Resort leisure → Private sunset dinner PRIVATE_CULTURE → Private Sigatoka cultural excursion → Fijian village experience → River landscapes → Curated local lunch ADVENTURE → Private river / rainforest excursion → Tropical landscapes → Premium guided experience Evening: → Resort cocktails → Fine dining → Overnight at Coral Coast', 3828),
