  ('ha-long-bay', 31, '8-days-7-nights-luxury-vietnam-itinerary', '8 DAYS / 7 NIGHTS LUXURY VIETNAM ITINERARY', 'DAY 1 — HANOI ARRIVAL', NULL, '**Arrival & Transfer:** Upon arrival at Noi Bai International Airport (HAN), meet your private driver in the arrivals hall. Experience a smooth, chauffeured transfer directly to your luxury hotel in the heart of Hanoi’s French Quarter or Old Quarter. **Afternoon & Evening:** Key Details:', 3893),
