  ('hochiminh', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: GOOD public_transport_accessibility: FAIR - Metro good, buses no hotel_accessibility: GOOD_TO_EXCELLENT; MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_HOTEL attraction_accessibility: GOOD_TO_EXCELLENT; Major sites have ramps Rule: Verify accessible room, step-free, elevator before booking. 5★ hotels best.', 3951),
  ('hochiminh', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Paris is particularly strong for: Food experiences: Family: Clean AC restaurants, Vin-com Food Court, early 7 PM dinner. Honeymoon: 1 rooftop/seafood dinner. Luxury: Fine dining, private dining. Budget: Street food $2, reserve 1 premium meal.', 3952),
  ('hochiminh', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Vin-com Centre, Union Square, Takashimaya. Budget: Prefer: Ben Thanh Market, Binh Tay Market, Saigon Square, Dong Khoi boutiques, Japanese Town.', 3953),
  ('hochiminh', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 82 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Honeymoon travellers should generally prefer: Romantic rooftop dinner, riverfront drinks, Bitexco light show, sunset cruise over late-night Bui Vien clubs. Top Spots: EON51, Chill Skybar, Social Club, Bui Vien Walking Street.', 3954),
  ('hochiminh', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS', NULL, '### Day 1 Arrive at Tan Son Nhat Airport and private transfer to D1 hotel. Check in, welcome drink. Rest of the day free. Evening Optional: Nguyen Hue Walking Street + Dinner at Ben Thanh Food Court Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast ### Day 2 Breakfast at hotel. Half-day City Core Tour: Reunification Palace + War Remnants Museum + Notre Dame + Post Office. Afternoon: Thao Dien Resort Time - Pool + Cafe + Shopping Evening: Bitexco Skydeck Sunset + EON51 Rooftop Cocktails Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast ### Day 3 Breakfast at hotel. Full-day Mekong Delta Private Tour with boat ride, coconut candy, lunch on the river. Return 6 PM. Evening: Free for shopping Dong Khoi / Vincom Mall Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast, Lunch ### Day 4 Breakfast, check out. Private transfer to Tan Son Nhat Airport for departure. Meals: Breakfast Package Includes: 3 nights 4★ hotel with breakfast, visa, all mentioned tours, private transfers Excludes: Flight fare and travel insurance', 3955),
  ('hochiminh', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 1', NULL, 'Arrive at Tan Son Nhat Airport and private chauffeured transfer to 5★ hotel. Check in, spa welcome. Evening at leisure. Optional evening add-on: Saigon River Dinner Cruise for romantic dinner Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast', 3956),
  ('hochiminh', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'After breakfast, Half-day City Core Photo Tour: Book Street + Central Post Office + Notre Dame. Later: Thao Dien - Resort pool day + Couple cafe hopping Evening: Bitexco Skydeck + Chill Skybar sunset drinks Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast', 3957),
  ('hochiminh', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 3', NULL, 'After breakfast, Visit Cholon Chinatown: Thien Hau Pagoda + Binh Tay Market + Dimsum lunch. Evening: Free time for couple photos + Fine dining at HUM or El Gaucho Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast, Lunch', 3958),
  ('hochiminh', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 4', NULL, 'After breakfast, Private Mekong Delta Day Trip. Boat, rowing, lunch, return. OR Couples option: Spa ritual 90min + Shopping Dong Khoi + Rooftop dinner Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast, Lunch', 3959),
  ('hochiminh', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'After breakfast, Check out and transfer to Mui Ne/Phu Quoc by flight or coach for beach extension. Check in and relax. Evening: Beach walk + Seafood dinner Overnight: Mui Ne / Phu Quoc Meals: Breakfast', 3960),
  ('hochiminh', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'After breakfast, Check out and transfer to airport for return flight with sweet honeymoon memories. Meals: Breakfast', 3961),
  ('hochiminh', 30, 'five-night-family-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 1', NULL, 'Arrive at Tan Son Nhat Airport, private transfer to D1 hotel, check-in and relax. Optional: Evening Nguyen Hue + Ice cream Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast', 3962),
  ('hochiminh', 30, 'five-night-family-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast at hotel. Half-day City Core: War Museum + Reunification Palace AM. Afternoon: Saigon Zoo + Botanical Gardens + Pool time Evening: Return to hotel Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast', 3963),
  ('hochiminh', 30, 'five-night-family-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 3', NULL, 'Breakfast at hotel. Full-day Dam Sen Water Park. Slides, wave pool, kids rides. OR Option: Cu Chi Tunnels for teens + Shopping Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast', 3964),
  ('hochiminh', 30, 'five-night-family-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 4', NULL, 'Breakfast and check-out. Full-day Mekong Delta Family Tour. Boat, bikes, fruit farm, lunch. Evening: Check in hotel + Rest Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast, Lunch', 3965),
  ('hochiminh', 30, 'five-night-family-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast at hotel. Vinpearl Aquarium + Vincom Mall + Shopping Afternoon: Free time for pool / packing Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City Meals: Breakfast', 3966),
  ('hochiminh', 30, 'five-night-family-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast, check-out and airport transfer for return flight. Meals: Breakfast', 3967),
  ('hochiminh', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 1', NULL, 'Arrive at Tan Son Nhat Airport and receive VIP meet-and-greet. Private Mercedes transfer to 5★ hotel in D1. Evening at leisure, followed by premium rooftop dinner at EON51. Overnight: The Reverie Saigon / Park Hyatt', 3968),
  ('hochiminh', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast at hotel. Enjoy a private half-day City Core tour with guide: Palace, Museum, Colonial. Continue to: Thao Dien - Private pool villa day + Spa Evening: Sunset yacht on Saigon River + Fine dining Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City', 3969),
  ('hochiminh', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 3', NULL, 'Breakfast at hotel. Private shopping tour: Dong Khoi boutiques + Personal tailor 24hr suit. Afternoon: 5★ Spa ritual for couple Evening: Bitexco VIP Skydeck + Signature dinner at HUM Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City', 3970),
  ('hochiminh', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 4', NULL, 'Breakfast and check-out. Private car to Mekong Delta. Private yacht charter, lunch, return. OR Alternative: Can Gio Mangrove private tour + Seafood Evening: Return for farewell dinner Overnight: Ho Chi Minh City', 3971),
  ('hochiminh', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast at hotel. Free day: Club lounge, pool, personal shopping, concierge booked experiences. Evening: Private car transfer to airport for departure Overnight: On flight Luxury Includes: Suite, club-level, private guide, chauffeured car, premium experiences', 3972),
  ('hochiminh', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 3973),
  ('hochiminh', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '', 3974),
  ('hochiminh', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', 'BY TRAVELER TYPE', NULL, '#### IF: traveler_type == FAMILY AND: children_age <= 6 THEN: schedule a maximum of one major attraction per day + include afternoon hotel pool, mall, or downtime Reason: Heat 36°C, traffic, queues. Young kids melt down after 2PM. Pool + AC needed. #### IF: traveler_type == HONEYMOON THEN: limit itinerary to two major activities per day + increase free-time allocation Reason: Saigon honeymoon value = Rooftop dinners, River Cruise, Spa, slow cafe. Not maximum attraction count. #### IF: traveler_type == BUDGET THEN: Use GrabBike/GrabCar, select D3/D10 mid-range hotel, mix paid attractions with free experiences Reason: Saigon can be cheap. Street food $2, free walking streets, parks, temple visits help protect budget without reducing quality. #### IF: traveler_type == LUXURY THEN: prioritise D1 Dong Khoi or Thao Dien for hotel selection Reason: These areas have the strongest concentration of 5★ hotels, skyline views, spa, fine dining, private guides, and high-touch service. #### IF: traveler_type == SENIOR THEN: Hotel in D1, private car for all transfers, 1 activity morning only, elevator attractions only Reason: Avoid stairs, long walks, peak traffic. River Cruise + Museum + Bitexco best.', 3975),
  ('hochiminh', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | | Family | 88 | | Honeymoon | 92 | | Luxury | 90 | | Budget | 95 | | Adventure | 65 | | Culture | 90 | | Food | 96 | | Shopping | 85 | | Nightlife | 88 | | Relaxation | 75 | | Nature | 70 | | Accessibility | 75 | | Safety | 85 | | First-time visitor | 90 | | Photography | 88 |', 3976),
  ('hochiminh', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', 'Best travellers profiles:', NULL, '1. First-time Vietnam travellers 2. Honeymooners and romantic couples 3. Budget travellers and Backpackers 4. Food and culture-focused travellers 5. Families with kids 8+ 6. Luxury travellers wanting value Best duration: 4–5 nights Best season: Dec–April - Dry, cool 25-30°C Avoid: May–Nov heavy rain, flooding Best hotel strategy: Stay in D1 Dong Khoi/Nguyen Hue. Walkable, Metro, safe. Options: D1 for first-time/luxury, Thao Dien for resort, D3 for budget/culture Avoid: Airport area, D7 for short trips Best transportation: Use MRT and public buses. Private transfer for: Must-do for first-time visitor: 1. Saigon River Dinner Cruise - "Marina Bay" moment 2. D1 Colonial Walk - Notre Dame, Post Office, Book Street 3. Bitexco Skydeck Sunset - Skyline view 4. One food experience - Ben Thanh or Street food tour 5. One themed choice: Mekong Delta, Cu Chi, or Thao Dien resort day Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Value for money. 5★ luxury. Incredible street food, French + Asian culture mix, friendly people, very "Instagram-able" colonial architecture. Biggest disadvantage: Traffic + Heat + Crossing roads. Air quality and safety need attention at night in some areas. Overall destination score: 90/100 — A high-energy, romantic, culturally rich city. Best for couples, foodies, budget travellers, and first-time Vietnam. Perfect "Asia with character" trip.', 3977),
  ('hochiminh', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 82/100 last_updated: 2026-08-07 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: VIETNAM_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: This Ho Chi Minh City destination file is suitable for itinerary design, travellers profiling, hotel-area strategy, and initial package planning. Prices, hotel inventory, flight schedules, attraction operating hours, river cruise timings, maintenance closures, ticket availability, visa and entry rules, traffic notices, rain/flood alerts, and supplier cancellation policies MUST be live*verified before quotation, payment collection, or ticket issuance.', 3978),
  ('mekong-delta', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Autumn Season', NULL, 'months: September–November weather: Warm, comfortable temperatures (20–28°C), low humidity, clear skies, and calm waters. crowd_level: HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 92–98 recommended: true reason: Peak conditions for cruising with pleasant temperatures, crisp views of the limestone karsts, minimal rain, and ideal sea conditions for kayaking.', 3979),
  ('mekong-delta', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Spring Season', NULL, 'months: March–May weather: Warm, pleasant days (22–30°C) with clear skies and occasional light mist; temperatures gradually increase toward May. crowd_level: HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 90–95 recommended: true reason: Excellent weather for cruising and outdoor water sports before summer humidity and storms set in.', 3980),
  ('mekong-delta', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter Season', NULL, 'months: December–February weather: Cool to cold (12–20°C), dry, with persistent fog, mist, and occasional overcast drizzle. crowd_level: MEDIUM → HIGH price_level: MEDIUM → HIGH overall_score: 75–82 recommended: true reason: Atmospheric and moody landscape photography with mist-shrouded karsts, though cooler temperatures mean swimming is less appealing.', 3981),
  ('mekong-delta', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer Season', NULL, 'months: June–August weather: Hot and humid (28–35°C) with heavy tropical downpours and occasional monsoon storms or typhoons. crowd_level: MEDIUM price_level: LOW → MEDIUM overall_score: 65–72 recommended: false reason: High chance of sudden cruise cancellations or itinerary disruptions due to tropical storms, though prices drop and domestic travel discounts abound.', 3982),
  ('mekong-delta', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, '****Where saving money is not recommended:****', 3983),
  ('mekong-delta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Private MPV/SUV from **Ho Chi Minh City or Can Tho Airport**, with direct hotel transfer and luggage space. For families, avoid excessive ferry/bus changes.', 3984),
  ('mekong-delta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Private chauffeured car from Can Tho Airport or Ho Chi Minh City followed by a boutique riverside resort/homestay and private sampan experience.', 3985),
  ('mekong-delta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Private chauffeur + premium river cruise or exclusive riverside resort. For a multi-day experience, combine Can Tho and Chau Doc with a private boat itinerary.', 3986),
  ('mekong-delta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Shared minivan or public bus from Ho Chi Minh City to My Tho/Ben Tre/Can Tho, followed by local taxi, bicycle, ferry and shared boat services.', 3987),
  ('mekong-delta', 18, 'family-travel', 'FAMILY TRAVEL', 'Family rating format', 'family', '****child_friendly_score:**** 90 ****best_ages:**** ****Rules:****', 3988),
  ('mekong-delta', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, '****Best areas**** Ben Tre: best for private canals, coconut groves and peaceful homestays. Cai Be: best for intimate orchard stays, cycling and sampan rides. Can Tho: best for upscale riverside hotels and private river experiences. Chau Doc: best for cultural immersion and scenic wetlands. Sa Dec: best for romantic photography, flowers and heritage architecture. ****Honeymoon rules**** Prefer private boat excursions, boutique riverside accommodation and slower rural experiences over large group tours. Avoid trying to cover the entire Delta in 2–3 days; the region rewards slower travel.', 3989),
  ('mekong-delta', 20, 'luxury-travel', 'LUXURY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, '****luxury_score:**** 88 Best-value luxury pattern: Base in **Can Tho** and combine an upscale riverside hotel with private boat excursions, chauffeured transfers and curated culinary experiences. For a more immersive journey, choose a **private or premium multi-day Mekong cruise** connecting Can Tho and Chau Doc. Use private vehicles between distant towns rather than relying on multiple public transfers. ****Luxury rules****', 3990),
  ('mekong-delta', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, '****adventure_score:**** 82 The Mekong Delta is a **soft-adventure destination**, with its strongest experiences centered on waterways, cycling, wetlands, rural exploration and wildlife rather than extreme sports. ****Top experiences:**** ****Recommended areas:**** ****Best for:****', 3991),
  ('mekong-delta', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, '****senior_suitability:**** 88 ****walking_intensity:**** LOW → MEDIUM The Mekong Delta is generally senior-friendly when the itinerary uses private transfers, comfortable riverside hotels and short boat excursions. ****Rules:**** ****Prefer:**** ****Avoid:****', 3992),
  ('mekong-delta', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: PARTIAL public_transport_accessibility: VARIABLE hotel_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_HOTEL attraction_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Never infer accessibility from destination-level accessibility. Boat boarding, narrow sampans, uneven village paths, temple steps and rural infrastructure can create significant accessibility limitations.', 3993),
  ('mekong-delta', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, '****food_score:**** 91 The Mekong Delta is one of Vietnam''s strongest regional food destinations, combining freshwater fish, tropical fruit, coconut, rice products, fermented foods and Khmer-influenced cuisine. ****Food experiences:**** ****Best for:****', 3994),
  ('mekong-delta', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, '****shopping_score:**** 72 Shopping is primarily focused on **food products, agricultural specialties, handicrafts and regional souvenirs**, rather than fashion or large shopping malls. ****Best buys:**** ****Prefer:**** ****Avoid:****', 3995),
  ('mekong-delta', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, '****nightlife_level:**** 38 The Mekong Delta is primarily a **slow-evening destination**, not a nightlife destination. Evenings revolve around riverside walks, night markets, cafés, local restaurants and relaxed hotel/homestay environments. ****Best for:**** ****Prefer:**** ****Avoid:**** ****Best evening areas:****', 3996),
  ('mekong-delta', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', 'HALF-DAY – CAN THO FLOATING MARKET & RIVER LIFE', NULL, '****Early Morning**** Pickup from your hotel in Can Tho → Take a local boat toward ****Cai Rang Floating Market****, best experienced early when trading activity is at its peak → Continue through smaller canals and waterways to observe local river life → Return toward ****Ninh Kieu Wharf**** for a riverside walk ****Late Morning**** → Enjoy ****Mekong Delta breakfast and tropical fruits**** → Return to your hotel', 3997),
  ('mekong-delta', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '1 DAY – MY THO, THOI SON ISLAND & BEN TRE', NULL, '****Morning**** Depart from your hotel toward ****My Tho**** → Visit ****Vinh Trang Pagoda**** → Take a boat across the Mekong to ****Thoi Son Island**** → Explore narrow canals by sampan through nipa-palm waterways ****Afternoon**** Continue toward ****Ben Tre**** → Visit a local ****coconut-candy workshop**** → Enjoy tropical fruits and traditional refreshments → Take a short cycling or walking experience through the countryside ****Evening**** Return to My Tho/Can Tho or continue to your overnight accommodation → Enjoy a traditional Mekong Delta dinner', 3998),
  ('mekong-delta', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 DAYS – CAN THO & BEN TRE RIVER EXPERIENCE', NULL, '****Day 1**** Early morning boat trip to ****Cai Rang Floating Market**** → Explore Can Tho''s canals and local food culture → Visit ****Binh Thuy Ancient House**** → Afternoon relaxation at a riverside hotel or homestay → Evening walk around ****Ninh Kieu Wharf**** ****Day 2**** Transfer toward ****Ben Tre**** → Explore coconut waterways by boat and sampan → Visit local handicraft and coconut-processing workshops → Enjoy cycling through fruit orchards and village roads → Finish with a peaceful riverside lunch before departure', 3999);
INSERT INTO destination_guidance (place_id, section, topic, section_title, heading, audience, body, position) VALUES
  ('mekong-delta', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 1 – ROMANTIC ARRIVAL & CAN THO RIVERSIDE ESCAPE', 'honeymoon', '****Morning / Afternoon**** Arrive at ****Can Tho International Airport**** or reach Can Tho by private road transfer → Meet your private chauffeur and transfer to a romantic riverside boutique hotel or resort → Check-in and relax ****Lunch**** Enjoy a relaxed Mekong Delta lunch featuring fresh tropical ingredients ****Evening**** Take a private sunset boat ride along the Mekong waterways → Walk around ****Ninh Kieu Wharf**** → Enjoy a romantic riverside dinner', 4000),
  ('mekong-delta', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 2 – CAI RANG FLOATING MARKET & PRIVATE CANAL EXPERIENCE', NULL, '****Early Morning**** Take a private boat to ****Cai Rang Floating Market**** → Experience the market before the main crowds arrive → Continue through quieter canals and fruit-growing areas ****Afternoon**** Return to the hotel → Couple''s spa treatment → Poolside relaxation and leisure ****Evening**** Enjoy a private dinner overlooking the river', 4001),
  ('mekong-delta', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 3 – CAN THO TO BEN TRE & COCONUT WATERWAYS', NULL, '****Morning**** Private transfer toward ****Ben Tre**** → Check into a riverside boutique stay → Explore coconut-palm waterways by private boat → Continue by sampan through narrow canals ****Lunch**** Enjoy a traditional Mekong Delta meal ****Afternoon**** Cycle or walk through orchards and peaceful village lanes → Return for couple''s leisure ****Evening**** Enjoy a private riverside dinner and sunset experience', 4002),
  ('mekong-delta', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 4 – CAI BE, ORCHARDS & SLOW ROMANCE', NULL, '****Morning**** Transfer toward ****Cai Be**** → Take a private sampan through canals and fruit orchards → Explore ****Tan Phong Islet**** and its rural waterways ****Lunch**** Enjoy a locally prepared Mekong Delta lunch ****Afternoon**** Return to the hotel → Private spa or pool time → Relaxed couple''s evening ****Evening**** Candlelit dinner at your riverside accommodation', 4003),
  ('mekong-delta', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 5 – CHAU DOC, TRA SU & ROMANTIC FINALE', 'honeymoon', '****Morning**** Transfer toward ****Chau Doc**** → Visit ****Tra Su Cajuput Forest****, particularly atmospheric during high-water months → Continue to the ****Chau Doc floating village**** ****Afternoon**** Visit ****Sam Mountain**** and surrounding cultural sites → Return to your hotel for relaxation ****Evening**** Enjoy a final romantic dinner with local Mekong cuisine', 4004),
  ('mekong-delta', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 6 – LEISURE BREAKFAST & DEPARTURE', NULL, '****Morning**** Enjoy a slow breakfast → Complete checkout → Optional short riverside walk and final souvenir shopping ****Late Morning / Afternoon**** Private transfer toward ****Can Tho International Airport****, Ho Chi Minh City, or your onward destination → Depart the Mekong Delta with a final river journey', 4005),
  ('mekong-delta', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 1 – FAMILY ARRIVAL & CAN THO RIVERFRONT', 'family', '****Morning / Afternoon**** Arrive at ****Can Tho International Airport**** or reach Can Tho by road → Meet your private family vehicle and transfer to your hotel → Check-in and lunch ****Evening**** Explore ****Ninh Kieu Wharf**** → Enjoy a relaxed family dinner → Return to hotel for rest', 4006),
  ('mekong-delta', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 2 – CAI RANG FLOATING MARKET & CAN THO', NULL, '****Early Morning**** Take a family-friendly boat trip to ****Cai Rang Floating Market**** → Experience the floating market and local breakfast → Continue through quieter canals ****Afternoon**** Visit ****Binh Thuy Ancient House**** → Return to hotel for swimming and family leisure ****Evening**** Enjoy dinner near the riverfront', 4007),
  ('mekong-delta', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 3 – MY THO & BEN TRE FAMILY EXPERIENCE', 'family', '****Morning**** Transfer toward ****My Tho**** → Visit ****Vinh Trang Pagoda**** → Take a boat toward the Mekong islands → Continue to ****Ben Tre**** for coconut-waterway exploration ****Afternoon**** Visit a coconut-candy workshop → Enjoy tropical fruits and a short countryside cycling experience ****Evening**** Check into a family-friendly riverside stay → Relax and enjoy dinner', 4008),
  ('mekong-delta', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 4 – CAI BE ORCHARDS & VILLAGE LIFE', NULL, '****Morning**** Travel toward ****Cai Be**** → Explore fruit orchards and canals by boat → Visit ****Tan Phong Islet**** ****Lunch**** Enjoy a traditional family-style Mekong meal ****Afternoon**** Cycling or walking through the countryside → Return to accommodation for leisure ****Evening**** Family dinner and relaxation', 4009),
  ('mekong-delta', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 5 – CHAU DOC & TRA SU NATURE EXPERIENCE', NULL, '****Morning**** Transfer to ****Chau Doc**** → Visit ****Tra Su Cajuput Forest**** and explore its waterways by boat ****Afternoon**** Visit ****Sam Mountain**** and nearby cultural attractions → Return to the hotel for family rest ****Evening**** Enjoy local dinner and an easy evening', 4010),
  ('mekong-delta', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 6 – RELAXED MORNING & DEPARTURE', NULL, '****Morning**** Breakfast at the hotel → Complete checkout → Optional final market visit for tropical fruits and packaged local products ****Late Morning / Afternoon**** Private transfer to ****Can Tho International Airport**** or onward destination → Continue your journey', 4011),
  ('mekong-delta', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 1 – VIP ARRIVAL & RIVERSIDE LUXURY RETREAT', 'luxury', '****Morning / Afternoon**** Arrive at ****Can Tho International Airport**** or transfer privately from Ho Chi Minh City → Meet your dedicated luxury chauffeur → Transfer to an exclusive riverside resort or boutique luxury property → Private check-in with welcome refreshments ****Lunch**** Enjoy a curated Mekong Delta lunch ****Evening**** Private sunset boat experience → Return to the resort for spa and pool relaxation → Finish with an elegant riverside dinner', 4012),
  ('mekong-delta', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 2 – PRIVATE CAI RANG & MEKONG RIVER EXPERIENCE', NULL, '****Early Morning**** Depart by private boat for ****Cai Rang Floating Market**** → Explore the market with a private local guide → Continue through smaller canals and fruit-growing communities ****Afternoon**** Return to the resort → Private spa treatment → Poolside relaxation → Afternoon tea or curated local refreshments ****Evening**** Private fine-dining experience beside the river', 4013),
  ('mekong-delta', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 3 – PRIVATE BEN TRE COCONUT & COUNTRYSIDE EXPERIENCE', NULL, '****Morning**** Private chauffeur transfer toward ****Ben Tre**** → Board a private boat through coconut-lined waterways → Continue by private sampan through narrow canals → Visit selected traditional craft and coconut-processing workshops ****Lunch**** Enjoy a premium regional lunch using local ingredients ****Afternoon**** Private cycling or countryside excursion → Return to your luxury accommodation → Spa and leisure ****Evening**** Private riverside dinner with curated Vietnamese cuisine', 4014),
  ('mekong-delta', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 4 – CAI BE ORCHARDS & PRIVATE SLOW-TRAVEL DAY', NULL, '****Morning**** Transfer toward ****Cai Be**** → Private boat through orchards and traditional canals → Explore ****Tan Phong Islet**** at a relaxed pace → Enjoy a private fruit-tasting experience ****Afternoon**** Return to the resort → Wellness treatment → Pool and suite leisure ****Evening**** Private sunset cruise followed by fine dining', 4015),
  ('mekong-delta', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 5 – CHAU DOC, TRA SU & EXCLUSIVE FINALE', NULL, '****Morning**** Private transfer toward ****Chau Doc**** → Explore ****Tra Su Cajuput Forest**** by private boat → Continue toward ****Sam Mountain**** and selected cultural sites ****Lunch**** Enjoy an elegant regional lunch ****Afternoon**** Return to your luxury accommodation → Private wellness and relaxation → Optional curated shopping for regional handicrafts and food products ****Evening**** Celebrate the final night with an ****exclusive riverside dinner**** → Private setting → Premium Vietnamese and Mekong Delta cuisine → Optional traditional music performance', 4016),
  ('mekong-delta', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 6 – LUXURY BREAKFAST & VIP DEPARTURE', 'luxury', '****Morning**** Enjoy a leisurely final breakfast → Complete checkout → Optional private riverside walk or final shopping ****Late Morning / Afternoon**** Meet your dedicated chauffeur → Transfer to ****Can Tho International Airport**** or Ho Chi Minh City for your onward international connection → Depart the Mekong Delta after a carefully paced combination of ****private river experiences, luxury hospitality, authentic culture, nature and refined Vietnamese cuisine****.', 4017),
  ('mekong-delta', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 4018),
  ('mekong-delta', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '', 4019),
  ('mekong-delta', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'Best planning rule', NULL, '', 4020),
  ('mekong-delta', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, '****IF:**** `trip_length <= 1 night` ****THEN:**** Choose **Can Tho + Cai Rang Floating Market** or **My Tho + Ben Tre** depending on the arrival point. ****Reason:**** A short stay should minimise road transfers and focus on one compact river region rather than attempting multiple Delta destinations. ****IF:**** `trip_length == 2 nights` ****THEN:**** Base in **Can Tho** and combine Cai Rang, local canals and countryside, or pair **Ben Tre + Can Tho**. ****Reason:**** Two nights allow an early floating-market experience plus slower village, orchard and river activities without excessive hotel changes. ****IF:**** `trip_length >= 3 nights` ****THEN:**** Combine **Ben Tre/Cai Be → Can Tho → Chau Doc** with private road transfers and selected boat excursions. ****Reason:**** Three or more nights allow the traveller to experience different Delta landscapes, markets, wetlands, cultural communities and rural waterways. ****IF:**** `trip_type == FIRST_TIME_VISITOR` ****THEN:**** Prioritize **Cai Rang Floating Market, Can Tho, Ben Tre, Mekong canals and a countryside/orchard experience**. ****Reason:**** These provide the clearest introduction to the Delta''s floating-market culture, waterways, tropical agriculture and everyday river life. ****IF:**** `trip_type == HONEYMOON` ****THEN:**** Choose a **private riverside stay in Ben Tre, Cai Be or Can Tho outskirts**, with private sampan rides, sunset cruises and couple''s dining. ****Reason:**** Quiet canals, tropical gardens and intimate riverside accommodation provide a more peaceful experience than crowded group tours. ****IF:**** `traveler_type == FAMILY` ****THEN:**** Base in **Can Tho or Ben Tre** and use private vehicles, short boat rides, orchards, cycling and hands-on local experiences. ****Reason:**** These areas offer manageable travel distances and a mix of educational and gentle outdoor activities suitable for families. ****IF:**** `traveler_type == LUXURY` ****THEN:**** Combine a **luxury riverside resort or boutique hotel** with private chauffeur service, private boats, personal guides and a premium Mekong river-cruise experience. ****Reason:**** Luxury in the Delta is best created through privacy, personalised guiding, comfortable transfers and exclusive river experiences rather than relying only on hotel category. ****IF:**** `traveler_type == BUDGET` ****THEN:**** Base in **Can Tho, Ben Tre or My Tho**, using local buses, homestays, bicycles, shared boat tours and local restaurants. ****Reason:**** The Mekong Delta is relatively budget-friendly, with inexpensive local transport, accommodation and food compared with major Vietnamese resort destinations. ****IF:**** `traveler_interest == NATURE` ****THEN:**** Prioritize **Tra Su Cajuput Forest, Ca Mau, U Minh wetlands, Ben Tre waterways and rural orchards**. ****Reason:**** High-water and wet-season conditions can create especially lush waterways and rewarding wetland scenery; Tra Su is particularly suited to boat-based nature exploration. ****IF:**** `traveler_interest == FOOD` ****THEN:**** Focus on **Can Tho, Chau Doc and Soc Trang**, sampling floating-market breakfasts, tropical fruits, *bun nuoc leo*, elephant-ear fish, *hu tieu* and other regional dishes. ****Reason:**** Delta cuisine is strongly shaped by river fish, tropical agriculture and distinct Khmer and southern Vietnamese culinary traditions. ****IF:**** `traveler_interest == SHOPPING` ****THEN:**** Focus on **Can Tho, Ben Tre, Sa Dec and Chau Doc** for coconut products, tropical fruit products, local handicrafts, flowers, textiles and regional foods. ****Reason:**** Shopping in the Delta is more about agricultural products, handmade goods and regional specialties than conventional luxury retail. ****IF:**** `traveler_type == SENIOR` ****THEN:**** Choose **Can Tho or Ben Tre** as a base with private transfers, short boat journeys, comfortable riverside accommodation and limited walking. ****Reason:**** A private vehicle and carefully selected boat operators reduce unnecessary transfers, while early-morning sightseeing avoids the strongest daytime heat. ****IF:**** `traveler_type == TRANSIT` ****THEN:**** Stay around **Can Tho** when using Can Tho International Airport, or choose **My Tho/Ben Tre** when connecting directly from Ho Chi Minh City. ****Reason:**** Keeping the overnight base close to the arrival/departure corridor reduces unnecessary backtracking and protects tight onward travel schedules. Can Tho Airport is approximately 20 minutes from central Can Tho. ****IF:**** `trip_length >= 4 nights` ****THEN:**** Split the stay between **Ben Tre/Cai Be, Can Tho and Chau Doc**, with optional extensions toward **Sa Dec, Tra Vinh or Ca Mau**. ****Reason:**** Four or more nights make it practical to combine the Delta''s major river, orchard, floating-market, wetland and cultural zones without turning the trip into a continuous series of long transfers.', 4021),
  ('mekong-delta', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | --- | --- | | Family | 91 | | Honeymoon | 86 | | Luxury | 79 | | Budget | 96 | | Adventure | 84 | | Culture | 95 | | Food | 94 | | Shopping | 75 | | Nightlife | 68 | | Relaxation | 93 | | Nature | 94 | | Accessibility | 74 | | Safety | 91 | | First-time visitor | 91 | | Photography | 97 |', 4022),
  ('mekong-delta', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, '****Best for:**** Honeymooners, families, photographers, food lovers, eco-tourists, culture seekers, slow-travel enthusiasts, and travellers looking for an **authentic tropical river-and-village experience**. ****Best duration:**** 3–5 days / 2–4 nights ****Best season:**** December–April for drier weather; September–November for high-water landscapes and wetland experiences. ****Best stay:**** Riverside boutique resort or homestay in Ben Tre/Cai Be, Can Tho riverside hotel, or a premium Mekong river cruise ****Best transport:**** Private chauffeur, small-group river boats, sampans, bicycles, and regional buses ****Must-do:**** ****Avoid:**** ****Biggest advantage:**** A highly authentic combination of **river life, floating markets, tropical orchards, wetlands, local food and rural Vietnamese culture**, with experiences that feel substantially different from Vietnam''s major urban and coastal destinations. ****Biggest disadvantage:**** Long road distances between some regions, limited premium infrastructure outside major hubs, and weather-dependent boat experiences during the wetter months. ****Overall destination score:**** ****88/100****', 4023),
  ('mekong-delta', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 94/100 last_updated: 2026-09-06 last_verified: NOT_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: TRAVEL_ENGINE_INITIAL_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: Prices, opening hours, schedules, visa requirements, availability, accessibility and operational conditions must NOT be treated as permanently valid from this document. These must be sourced from structured, refreshable data.', 4024),
  ('phu-quoc', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', '## Dry Season / Peak', NULL, 'months: November, December, January, February, March, April weather: Sunny, dry, calm sea 26-32°C. Humidity 70%. Perfect beach weather. Sea flat for island hopping. crowd_level: MEDIUM → VERY HIGH. Peak Dec-Jan + Tet. Chinese/Korean/Indian tourists high. price_level: MEDIUM → VERY HIGH overall_score: 90-95 recommended: true reason: Best weather of the year. Ideal for beach, swimming, boat trips, photography. Dec 20 - Jan 5 + Tet: Hotels 2.5x-3x, book 60 days ahead. Feb: Post-Tet sweet spot. Weather still perfect, prices drop 20%. Best for honeymoon + families. Mar-Apr: Hotter 32-34°C but still dry. Great for families before summer rush.', 4025),
  ('phu-quoc', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', '## Shoulder / Transition', NULL, 'months: May, October weather: May: Hot 30-35°C. Start of afternoon showers. Sea still ok. Oct: Rain reduces. Sea calms down. 28-32°C. Humidity high. crowd_level: MEDIUM → LOW price_level: MEDIUM → LOW overall_score: 84-87 recommended: true reason: May: Last month for good weather before monsoon. Good deals start. Oct: Best value month. 30% cheaper hotels. Resorts empty. Sea improving. Risk: 1-2 days of rain possible. Check forecast before island hopping. Pro: Empty Bai Sao beach, no queues at VinWonders.', 4026),
  ('phu-quoc', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', '## Wet Season / Low', NULL, 'months: June, July, August, September weather: Hot + Humid 28-33°C. Daily rain 2-4 PM. Rough Sea on the West Coast. East coast calmer. Occasional storm. crowd_level: LOW → MEDIUM. June is busy with Korean school holidays. price_level: LOW → MEDIUM overall_score: 76-82 recommended: true with caveats reason: Best value season. Resorts 40% off. Flights cheapest from India/SEA. Rains are predictable: Morning sun, 1-2hr downpour, then clear. Pros: Empty beaches, no queue at Cable Car, spa deals, lush green jungle. Cons: Island hopping often cancelled Jun-Sep. Rough Sea. Some beach clubs closed. Tip: Stay in East/North resorts. Book resorts with indoor activities: Vin-Wonders, Spa. Avoid late Sep if typhoon in the Gulf of Thailand.', 4027),
  ('phu-quoc', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended: Travel-agent rule: A slightly more expensive beachfront 4★ in Long Beach or Vin-pearl generally delivers better total value than a cheaper Duong Dong property once you factor in taxi costs, time lost, and "beach access every day".', 4028),
  ('phu-quoc', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Pre*booked private MPV / Van. Door-to-door to Vin-pearl/North or Long Beach. Space for stroller + 4 luggage + beach gear.', 4029),
  ('phu-quoc', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Pre-booked private car with meet-and-greet + Flower garland. Direct to South Island resort. First impression = resort pool + beach. reason: Island time starts at airport. Private transfer avoids taxi hassle.', 4030),
  ('phu-quoc', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Chauffeured SUV/Van to resort. Cold towel, water, direct check*in. JW Marriott/InterContinental have private transfer desks.', 4031),
  ('phu-quoc', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Airport taxi meter to Duong Dong. Or Grab Car if available. For Vin-pearl: use resort shuttle.', 4032),
  ('phu-quoc', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Senior', 'senior', 'Pre-booked Private Transfer with Assistance. Minimal walking. Resort buggy pickup if needed.', 4033),
  ('phu-quoc', 18, 'family-travel', 'FAMILY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'child_friendly_score: 90 best_ages: Rules: For young children: Prefer: VinWonders, Safari, Resort pool, Beach, Grand World show Avoid: Island hopping rough sea, Long car rides, Pepper farm boring', 4034),
  ('phu-quoc', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 94 romance_score: 96 privacy_score: 92 luxury_score: 93 Recommended: Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than: 2 major activities/day. Prefer: One memorable experience + free time Recommended hotel areas:', 4035),
  ('phu-quoc', 20, 'luxury-travel', 'LUXURY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'luxury_score: 93 Recommended: Luxury should primarily increase: Comfort, Privacy, Service, Convenience, Exclusivity', 4036),
  ('phu-quoc', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, 'adventure_score: 65 Adventure-like experiences should be interpreted as:', 4037),
  ('phu-quoc', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 85 walking_intensity: LOW-MEDIUM Rules:', 4038),
  ('phu-quoc', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: FAIR_TO_GOOD public_transport_accessibility: POOR - No metro, limited bus. Private car default hotel_accessibility: GOOD_TO_EXCELLENT; MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_HOTEL. 5★ resorts best attraction_accessibility: FAIR_TO_GOOD; VinWonders + Cable Car have ramps. Beaches = sand challenge Rule: Verify accessible room, step-free access, beach wheelchair, elevator before booking. South Island 5★ resorts + Vinpearl best for mobility. Scooter not suitable.', 4039),
  ('phu-quoc', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Paris is particularly strong for: Food experiences: Family: Resort buffets, Vincom food court, clean AC restaurants. Early 6:30 PM dinner recommended. Honeymoon: 1 beachfront dinner + 1 resort fine dining. Private setup available. Luxury: JW Marriott/InterContinental fine dining, private beach BBQ, wine pairing. Budget: Night market $5*$10, local quan $3*$5. Resort meals expensive so mix 1 resort + 2 local.', 4040),
  ('phu-quoc', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Grand World shops, JW Marriott boutiques, InterContinental shops. Budget: Prefer: Duong Dong Night Market, Dinh Cau Market, Local shops for pepper/pearls', 4041),
  ('phu-quoc', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 68 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Honeymoon travellers should generally prefer: Romantic beach dinner, resort bar, Sunset Town light show, Grand World evening show over late-night bars. Top Spots: Grand World shows, Ocean Bay Beach Bar, Mango Bay, Resort bars, Night Market', 4042),
  ('phu-quoc', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive at PQC Airport and private transfer to Long Beach resort. Check in, beach time. Evening: Duong Dong Night Market Overnight: Phu Quoc Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Full-day South Tour: Hon Thom Cable Car + Sun World + Sunset Town + Bai Sao Beach Evening: Resort dinner Overnight: Phu Quoc Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. Half-day Island Hopping OR Vin-Wonders. Afternoon: Pool + Packing Evening: Transfer to PQC Airport Meals: Breakfast Package: 3N 4★, breakfast, tours, transfers', 4043),
  ('phu-quoc', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive PQC, private transfer to South 5★ resort. Villa check-in, spa welcome. Beach walk. Overnight: JW Marriott / InterContinental Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Lazy beach morning. Afternoon: Couple spa. Evening: Sunset Town + Kiss Bridge photos + Dinner Overnight: Phu Quoc Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. Hon Thom Cable Car + Sun World + Private lunch. Evening: Resort private beach dinner Overnight: Phu Quoc Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Day 4 Breakfast. Private Island Hopping + Snorkeling + Beach BBQ. Evening: Resort Overnight: Phu Quoc Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Day 5 Breakfast. Free day: Pool, bike, Grand World. Evening: Transfer to airport Meals: Breakfast', 4044),
  ('phu-quoc', 30, 'five-night-family-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive, transfer to Vinpearl. Check-in, pool, dinner. Overnight: Vinpearl Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Full-day VinWonders + Water Park Overnight: Vinpearl Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Morning Safari. Afternoon Grand World show. Overnight: Vinpearl Meals: Breakfast Day 4 Transfer to Long Beach resort. Island Hopping or Beach day. Overnight: Long Beach Meals: Breakfast Day 5 Bai Sao Beach + Cable Car. Night Market. Overnight: Long Beach Meals: Breakfast Day 6 Breakfast, airport transfer Meals: Breakfast', 4045),
  ('phu-quoc', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1-3 South 5★ Villa. Private pool, butler, spa, beach dinner, Cable Car VIP Day 4 Private yacht island hopping + picnic Day 5 Grand World shopping + Golf + Farewell dinner Includes: Suite, private car, premium tours', 4046),
  ('phu-quoc', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', NULL, NULL, 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong What an experienced planner does differently', 4047),
  ('phu-quoc', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', 'IF:', NULL, 'trip length <= 2 nights THEN: Stay Long Beach. 1 beach + 1 Night Market. Skip VinWonders Reason: Too short for island. Travel time eats day.', 4048),
  ('phu-quoc', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', 'IF:', NULL, 'trip length == 3 nights THEN: South 1 day + Beach 2 days. OR Vinpearl 2 days Reason: Pick North OR South. Don''t do both.', 4049),
  ('phu-quoc', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', 'IF: trip length >= 4 nights', NULL, 'THEN: Add Cable Car OR Island Hopping Reason: Time for 1 major + relaxation', 4050),
