  ('nathrang', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 87 romance_score: 85 privacy_score: 80 luxury_score: 88 Recommended: Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than: 2 major activities/day. Prefer: One memorable experience + free time Recommended hotel areas:', 4068),
