  ('nathrang', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: FAIR public_transport_accessibility: FAIR - Grab good, buses poor hotel_accessibility: GOOD in 4★/5★. MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_HOTEL attraction_accessibility: FAIR. VinWonders + Mud Bath have ramps. Islands = boat challenge Rule: Verify accessible room, step-free access, elevator before booking. Tran Phu 4★/5★ best for mobility. Boats require assistance.', 4072),
  ('nathrang', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Paris is particularly strong for: Food experiences: Family: Resort buffets, Vincom food court, clean AC restaurants. Early 6:30 PM dinner. Honeymoon: 1 beachfront dinner + 1 rooftop fine dining. Private setup available. Luxury: InterContinental/ Sheraton fine dining, private beach BBQ, wine pairing. Budget: Night market $3-$6, local quan. Resort meals expensive so mix 1 resort + 2 local.', 4073),
