  ('nathrang', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive at CXR Airport and private transfer to Tran Phu hotel. Check in, beach time. Evening: Tran Phu Beach walk + Night Market + Dinner Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Full-day: 4 Islands Tour with snorkeling + Floating Bar + lunch. Evening: Skylight Rooftop sunset drinks Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Day 3 Breakfast. Morning: VinWonders + Cable Car. Afternoon: I-Resort Mud Bath. Pool + Packing. Evening: Transfer to CXR Airport Meals: Breakfast Package Includes: 3N 4★ hotel with breakfast, tours, private transfers Excludes: Flight fare and travel insurance', 4076),
  ('nathrang', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT HONEYMOON PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive CXR, private transfer to North Beach 5★ resort. Ocean view check-in, spa welcome. Beach walk. Overnight: InterContinental / Sheraton Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Lazy beach morning. Afternoon: Couple Mud Bath + Spa at I-Resort. Evening: Hon Chong sunset + Rooftop dinner at Skylight Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. VinWonders + Cable Car day. Private lunch in park. Evening: Resort dinner Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Day 4 Breakfast. Private Island Hopping + Snorkeling + Beach picnic. Evening: Back to hotel. Couple massage Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Day 5 Breakfast. Free day: Pool, shopping Vincom, photos. Evening: Transfer to airport Meals: Breakfast', 4077),
  ('nathrang', 30, 'five-night-family-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive, transfer to Tran Phu 4★. Check-in, pool, beach, dinner. Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Full-day VinWonders + Water Park + Cable Car Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. Morning 4 Islands Tour. Afternoon: Pool / Rest Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Day 4 Breakfast. I-Resort Mud Bath + Yang Bay Waterfall. Evening: Night Market + Ice cream Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast Day 5 Breakfast. Po Nagar + Long Son + Shopping Dam Market. Afternoon: Free time for pool / packing Overnight: NA Trang Meals: Breakfast Day 6 Breakfast, airport transfer for return flight. Meals: Breakfast', 4078),
  ('nathrang', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1-2 North 5★ Ocean Suite. Private pool, spa, beach dinner, golf Day 3 Private yacht island hopping + picnic + diving Day 4 VinWonders VIP + Cable Car + Private lunch Day 5 I-Resort VIP Mud Bath + Shopping + Farewell rooftop dinner Includes: Suite, club-level, private car, premium tours', 4079),
