  ('bali', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 3', NULL, 'Private South Bali experience → Nusa Dua / Uluwatu → Luxury beach experience → Premium dinner', 4470),
