  ('bali', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: do not recommend Nusa Penida as a default day trip. Reason: The boat transfer and travel time can make a short Bali stay unnecessarily rushed. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: increase romance_weight by 30% increase privacy_weight by 20% increase free_time_weight by 20% decrease activity_density by 20% Reason: The objective is a romantic and relaxing Bali experience rather than maximum sightseeing. IF: traveler_type == FAMILY AND: children_age <= 6 THEN: reduce travel_intensity_target by 20% increase downtime by 20% prefer beach/resort-based activities Reason: Young children reduce practical daily activity capacity and long road journeys can be tiring. IF: hotel_is_far_from_preferred_attractions AND: hotel_saving < additional_transport_cost + value_of_lost_time THEN: prefer_hotel_in_preferred_area Reason: A cheaper hotel may not provide better total value once transport costs and travel time are considered. IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: prefer_one_hotel Reason: Hotel changes consume valuable short-trip time. IF: trip_length >= 5 nights AND: traveler_interest == CULTURE_AND_NATURE THEN: consider_ubud + SOUTH_BALI_COMBINATION Reason: A longer stay makes it practical to experience both Ubud''s cultural/natural attractions and South Bali''s beaches and coastal experiences. IF: traveler_type == LUXURY THEN: prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel_or_resort AND: prefer_private_or_exclusive_experiences Reason: Luxury value in Bali is strongly supported by convenience, privacy, service and resort quality. IF: traveler_type == BUDGET THEN: prefer_efficient_hotel_location AND: use_shared_or_app_based_transport_where_practical AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions Reason: Maintain experience quality while reducing unnecessary transportation and activity costs. IF: traveler_interest == BEACH_AND_RELAXATION THEN: prefer_sanur_or_nusa_dua_or_SEMINYAK AND: reduce_daily_sightseeing_density Reason: These areas provide convenient access to beaches, hotels, restaurants and leisure experiences. IF: traveler_interest == CULTURE_AND_NATURE THEN: prefer_UBUD AND: group_rice_terraces + temples + cultural_experiences Reason: Ubud is particularly suited to Bali''s cultural, artistic and natural experiences. IF: traveler_interest == NIGHTLIFE_AND_DINING THEN: prefer_SEMINYAK_or_CANGGU Reason: These areas offer strong concentrations of restaurants, cafés, nightlife and lifestyle experiences. IF: trip_length >= 5 nights AND: traveler_interest == BEACH + CULTURE THEN: consider_split_stay BETWEEN: UBUD + SOUTH_BALI Reason: A split stay can reduce repeated long-distance travel while allowing both inland and coastal Bali experiences.', 4476),
  ('bali', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | | Family | 92 | | Honeymoon | 97 | | Luxury | 94 | | Budget | 82 | | Adventure | 91 | | Culture | 98 | | Food | 93 | | Shopping | 91 | | Nightlife | 88 | | Relaxation | 97 | | Nature | 96 | | Accessibility | 68 | | Safety | 82 | | First-time visitor | 96 | | Photography | 99 |', 4477),
  ('bali', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveler profiles: 1. Honeymoon 2. Romantic couple 3. Beach & relaxation traveler 4. Culture/nature traveler 5. Luxury traveler 6. Family with appropriate pacing Best duration: 5–7 nights Best season: May–June September–October Best hotel strategy: Choose the hotel based on the main travel purpose and area. Best transportation: App-based taxis/private drivers for sightseeing and general travel. Private transfer for: Must-do for first-time visitor: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Exceptional combination of beaches, tropical nature, Balinese culture, temples, wellness, adventure, food and luxury resorts. Biggest disadvantage: Traffic congestion, seasonal rainfall, tourist crowds in popular areas and significant travel times between different parts of the island. Overall destination score: 93/100', 4478),
  ('bali', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 90/100 last_updated: 2026-08-13 last_verified: PARTIALLY_WEB_VERIFIED verified_by: OFFICIAL_INDONESIA_TRAVEL_AND_INDONESIAN_IMMIGRATION_SOURCES sources: IMPORTANT: Prices, opening hours, schedules, visa requirements, availability, accessibility, traffic conditions and operational conditions must NOT be treated as permanently valid from this document. Visa and entry requirements must be checked against the latest official Indonesian Immigration information before travel. Attraction opening hours, ticket prices, transport schedules, weather conditions and accessibility should be sourced from structured, refreshable data. Bali traffic and road conditions can vary significantly by area, time of day and ceremonial activity. This dataset should be refreshed regularly before production use.', 4479),
  ('yogyakarta', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Spring', NULL, 'months: March – May weather: Hot and Humid. crowd_level: MEDIUM → HIGH price_level: MEDIUM → HIGH overall_score: 88-90 recommended: true reason: Hot and humid; good weather and a full event calendar, but crowds and prices can rise.', 4480),
  ('yogyakarta', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer', NULL, 'months: June July August weather: Warm and humid with Southwest Monsoon. crowd_level: MEDIUM → HIGH price_level: HIGH in June; MEDIUM in July–August overall_score: 85-88 recommended: true reason: Warm and humid with monsoon influence; good for family trips, though June is busier and more expensive.', 4481),
  ('yogyakarta', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Autumn', NULL, 'months: September October November weather: Still warm (25–32°C) but rainfall increases. crowd_level: LOW → MEDIUM price_level: LOW → MEDIUM overall_score: 82-86 recommended: true reason: Still warm, but rainfall increases; best value season with lower prices and fewer crowds.', 4482),
  ('yogyakarta', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter', NULL, 'months: December January February weather: Cool/cold; shorter daylight. crowd_level: VERY HIGH in late Dec–early price_level: VERY HIGH in late Dec–early overall_score: 80-90 recommended: true reason: Cooler and rainy; festive atmosphere, but peak crowds and peak prices in late December and early January.', 4483),
  ('yogyakarta', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended: Travel-agent rule: A slightly higher-priced,centrally located and well-reviewed hotel near reliable transport usually gives better total value than a cheaper, peripheral property once you add daily transport costs and the value of lost time.', 4484),
  ('yogyakarta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Airport taxi or pre-booked private MPV / van from Yogyakarta International Airport (YIA); door-to-door service, space for luggage, and easier travel with children.', 4485),
  ('yogyakarta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Pre-booked private car; meet-and-greet, comfortable hotel drop-off, and a relaxed start after arrival. reason: The first impression of the trip matters, and a private transfer provides comfort, privacy, and a smooth arrival experience.', 4486),
  ('yogyakarta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Chauffeured premium sedan, luxury MPV, or private airport transfer; priority pickup, luggage assistance, premium comfort, and direct access to boutique or heritage hotels.', 4487),
  ('yogyakarta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Airport train, public bus, shared shuttle, or official airport taxi; lowest-cost options, best for light luggage and younger travelers comfortable with a longer journey.', 4488),
  ('yogyakarta', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Senior', 'senior', 'Airport taxi or pre-booked private transfer; minimal walking, luggage assistance, easy vehicle access, and direct drop-off at the hotel entrance.', 4489),
  ('yogyakarta', 18, 'family-travel', 'FAMILY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'child_friendly_score: 84 best_ages: Rules: For young children: Prefer: Avoid:', 4490),
