  ('yogyakarta', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'FIVE-NIGHT LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Private guided Borobudur experience → Premium countryside lunch → Free afternoon at the hotel → Fine dining or private cultural evening', 4516),
