  ('cochin', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: do not recommend Cherai Beach or a backwater day trip by default. Reason: Short Kochi stays work best when time is concentrated around Fort Kochi and Mattancherry rather than spread across multiple outlying experiences. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: increase romance_weight by 30% increase privacy_weight by 20% increase free_time_weight by 20% decrease activity_density by 20% Reason: Kochi honeymoon value comes from atmosphere, waterfront experiences, and slow pacing rather than maximum sightseeing. IF: traveler_type == FAMILY AND: children_age <= 6 THEN: reduce walking_intensity_target by 20% increase downtime by 20% prefer short transfers and predictable meal breaks Reason: Young children handle Kochi better with compact sightseeing blocks and fewer long walks. IF: hotel_is_far_from_fort_kochi_and_heritage_core AND: hotel_saving < additional_transport_cost + value_of_lost_time THEN: prefer_central_hotel Reason: A cheaper hotel outside the main visitor zone often creates worse overall trip value in Kochi. IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: prefer_one_hotel Reason: Hotel changes consume valuable time on a short Kochi trip. IF: trip_length >= 5 nights AND: traveler_interest == RELAXATION THEN: consider_Cherai_Beach_or_backwater_add_on Reason: Longer stays make a slower scenic extension more practical and more rewarding. IF: traveler_type == LUXURY THEN: prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_exclusive_or_private_experiences Reason: Luxury value in Kochi is created through comfort, privacy, and service rather than through more sightseeing stops. IF: traveler_type == BUDGET THEN: prefer_public_transport_or_walkable_base AND: prefer_high_value_hotel_location AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions Reason: Kochi offers strong value when the itinerary uses compact heritage zones, local food, and fewer paid transfers. IF: trip_type == FIRST_TIME_VISITOR THEN: anchor the trip around Fort Kochi AND: add Mattancherry / Jew Town AND: include one waterfront or sunset experience Reason: These three elements give the clearest first impression of Kochi’s culture, history, and atmosphere. IF: trip_type == FAMILY THEN: limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include one leisure block daily Reason: Kochi family trips work best when the pace stays relaxed and manageable. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: schedule premium dinner or cruise in the evening Reason: Kochi is strongest at sunset, on the waterfront, and during quiet evening experiences. IF: weather == MONSOON THEN: reduce outdoor_walking AND: increase indoor_culture_or_food_time Reason: Rain and humidity make a slower, more flexible Kochi plan perform better. IF: traveler_interest == HISTORY OR traveler_interest == CULTURE THEN: combine Fort Kochi and Mattancherry on the same day Reason: These areas cluster well and create a more coherent heritage experience. IF: traveler_type == SENIOR THEN: prefer_central_hotel AND: use_taxi_or_private_transfer_when_helpful AND: avoid_multiple_walking_heavy_stops Reason: Kochi’s heritage areas are rewarding, but they are easier when movement and walking are controlled. IF: trip_length >= 4 nights THEN: add one flexible half-day Reason: Kochi benefits from breathing room, especially for cafés, shopping, spa time, or weather adjustments.', 4844),
  ('cochin', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----- | | Family | 88 | | Honeymoon | 91 | | Luxury | 88 | | Budget | 91 | | Adventure | 68 | | Culture | 97 | | Food | 96 | | Shopping | 83 | | Nightlife | 70 | | Relaxation | 92 | | Nature | 90 | | Accessibility | 86 | | Safety | 82 | | First-time visitor | 91 | | Photography | 98 |', 4845),
  ('cochin', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveler profiles: 1. Honeymoon 2. Romantic couple 3. Culture/first-time visitor 4. Luxury traveler 5. Food traveler 6. Family with appropriate pacing Best duration: 4–5 nights Best season: September–February Best hotel strategy: Central or highly connected location,ideally Fort Kochi for atmosphere or Bolgatty for privacy and premium stays. Best transportation: Walk, ferry, taxi, or short private transfers depending on trip style. Private transfer for: Must-do for first-time visitor: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Extremely high concentration of culture, history, food, romance, photography, and relaxed waterfront experiences in a compact area. Biggest disadvantage: Walking friction in heritage zones, seasonal humidity, and crowd pressure in peak months. Overall destination score: 94/100', 4846),
  ('cochin', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 90/100 last_updated: 2026-08-14 last_verified: NOT_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: TRAVEL_ENGINE_INITIAL_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: Prices, opening hours, schedules, visa requirements, availability, accessibility and operational conditions must NOT be treated as permanently valid from this document. These must be sourced from structured, refreshable data.', 4847),
  ('munnar', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Spring', NULL, 'months: March-May weather: Cool to pleasantly warm, with increasing humidity and occasional showers. crowd_level: MEDIUM → HIGH price_level: MEDIUM overall_score: 82-86 recommended: true reason: Good for tea gardens, viewpoints, and photography before the monsoon arrives.', 4848),
  ('munnar', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer', NULL, 'months: June-August weather: Warm, humid, and rainy, with mist, heavy showers, and low visibility at times. crowd_level: LOW → MEDIUM price_level: LOW → MEDIUM overall_score: 74-82 recommended: true reason: Best for lush greenery, waterfalls, and lower prices, but rain can disrupt travel plans.', 4849),
  ('munnar', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Autumn', NULL, 'months: September-November weather: Rain starts easing, and conditions improve for sightseeing and outdoor time. crowd_level: MEDIUM price_level: MEDIUM overall_score: 86-90 recommended: true reason: One of the best all-round periods for Munnar, with better weather and strong scenery.', 4850),
  ('munnar', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter', NULL, 'months: December-February weather: Cool, dry, and very comfortable, especially for viewpoints and long scenic drives. crowd_level: HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 88-92 recommended: true reason: Best weather for first-time visitors, photography, and relaxed hill-station travel, though it is also the busiest season.', 4851),
  ('munnar', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Travel-agent rule: Munnar is best positioned as a good-value hill station with strong mid-range and premium appeal. It is not the cheapest destination, but it delivers excellent experience quality when the trip is built around scenery, comfort, and smart transport planning.', 4852),
  ('munnar', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Airport taxi or pre-booked private SUV/van; door-to-door, luggage-friendly, and the easiest way to handle the hill transfer after arrival.', 4853),
  ('munnar', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Pre-booked private car or premium SUV; best for privacy, comfort, and a smooth first impression on the way into the hills reason: The first impression matters on a honeymoon, and a private transfer gives comfort, privacy, and less stress after landing.', 4854),
  ('munnar', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Chauffeured sedan or luxury MPV; ideal for premium stays, added comfort, and seamless service on the mountain road .', 4855),
  ('munnar', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Prepaid taxi or airport bus to Kochi/Aluva first, then shared cab or local transport to Munnar; best value for cost-conscious travelers.', 4856),
  ('munnar', 18, 'family-travel', 'FAMILY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'child_friendly_score: 84 best_ages: Rules: For young children: Prefer: Avoid:', 4857),
  ('munnar', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 96 romance_score: 98 privacy_score: 90 luxury_score: 95 Recommended: Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than: 2 major activities/day. Prefer: One memorable experience + free time over: Three or four attractions. Recommended hotel areas: Tea-estate stays work best for romance and atmosphere, while quieter valley-facing resorts are better for privacy and a more premium feel.', 4858),
  ('munnar', 20, 'luxury-travel', 'LUXURY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'luxury_score: 97 Recommended: Luxury travelers should not be given an itinerary that simply contains more activities. Luxury should primarily increase: Recommended hotel areas:', 4859),
  ('munnar', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, 'adventure_score: 76 Munnar is not a high-adrenaline adventure destination. Adventure-like experiences should be interpreted as: Recommended adventure-style areas: Best for:', 4860),
  ('munnar', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 78 walking_intensity: MEDIUM_HIGH Rules: Recommended hotel areas:', 4861),
  ('munnar', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: PARTIAL_TO_GOOD depending on attraction and transport public_transport_accessibility: VARIABLE hotel_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_HOTEL attraction_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Never infer accessibility from destination-level accessibility. Each hotel and attraction must carry its own accessibility data.', 4862),
  ('munnar', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Munnar is particularly strong for: Food experiences: Family: Prioritize clean, convenient restaurants with familiar and flexible menus. Honeymoon: At least one memorable dinner, café stop, or scenic resort meal is recommended. Luxury: Fine dining, premium resort dining, tea-tasting, and curated local experiences may be important. Budget: Mix local eateries, casual restaurants, tea shops, and selected paid dining experiences.', 4863),
  ('munnar', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Prefer premium resort boutiques, curated tea-and-spice gift stores, and higher-end handicraft or wellness products. Prefer:', 4864),
  ('munnar', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 85 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Honeymoon travelers should generally prefer: romantic evening over: late-night club itinerary unless nightlife is explicitly requested.', 4865),
  ('munnar', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', NULL, NULL, '3 NIGHTS Day 1 Arrival → Hotel → Munnar town light exploration → Dinner Day 2 Morning: Tea gardens / estate belt Afternoon: Mattupetty Dam / lake side Evening: Sunset viewpoint or relaxed café stop Day 3 Morning: Eravikulam / Rajamalai side Afternoon: One relaxed activity or tea museum stop Evening: Free time / romantic dinner Day 4 Breakfast → Checkout → Departure', 4866),
  ('munnar', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'Five-Night Honeymoon Pattern', 'Honeymoon Focus', 'honeymoon', 'This pattern works well for couples because it combines:', 4867),
  ('munnar', 30, 'five-night-family-itinerary', 'Five-Night Family Itinerary', 'Family Travel Style', 'family', 'This pattern is designed for a relaxed family trip with **no more than 2 major activities per day**. It keeps travel light, includes downtime, and works well for children and elders. The main focus is backwaters, beach time, and a little culture without rushing.', 4868),
  ('munnar', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'Five-Night Luxury Pattern', NULL, NULL, 'Arrive in Cochin, take a private transfer to a luxury stay in Marari Beach, Punnamada, or Alleppey Town, and relax with a premium dinner. Check into a luxury houseboat, enjoy a scenic backwater cruise with gourmet meals, sunset tea, and a candlelight dinner on board. After breakfast, move to a premium resort for spa/Ayurveda, pool time, and waterfront fine dining. Take a private backwater or village cruise, enjoy canal photography, a premium lunch, free time, sunset at Marari Beach or the backwaters, and an elegant dinner. Have a late breakfast, do some flexible luxury activities like boutique shopping or a wellness treatment, and finish with a farewell high-end dinner. Private airport transfer for departure.', 4869),
  ('munnar', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 4870),
  ('munnar', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '', 4871),
  ('munnar', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: do not recommend Top Station or Kolukkumalai by default. Reason: Short Munnar stays work best when time is concentrated around town-core access, tea gardens, Mattupetty, and Rajamalai rather than long hill transfers. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: increase romance_weight by 30% increase privacy_weight by 20% increase free_time_weight by 20% decrease activity_density by 20% Reason: Munnar honeymoon value comes from atmosphere, scenic stays, and slow pacing rather than maximum sightseeing. IF: traveler_type == FAMILY AND: children_age <= 6 THEN: reduce walking_intensity_target by 20% increase downtime by 20% prefer short transfers and predictable meal breaks Reason: Young children handle Munnar better with compact sightseeing blocks and fewer long hill-road journeys. IF: hotel_is_far_from_munnar_town_core AND: hotel_saving < additional_transport_cost + value_of_lost_time THEN: prefer_central_hotel Reason: A cheaper hotel outside the main visitor zone often creates worse overall trip value in Munnar. IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: prefer_one_hotel Reason: Hotel changes consume valuable time on a short hill-station trip. IF: trip_length >= 5 nights AND: traveler_interest == RELAXATION THEN: consider_estate_stay_or_slow_scenic_add_on Reason: Longer stays make a slower, more immersive hill-station experience practical and more rewarding. IF: traveler_type == LUXURY THEN: prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_exclusive_or_private_experiences Reason: Luxury value in Munnar is created through comfort, privacy, and service rather than through more sightseeing stops. IF: traveler_type == BUDGET THEN: prefer_public_transport_or_walkable_base AND: prefer_high_value_hotel_location AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions Reason: Munnar offers strong value when the itinerary uses compact scenic zones, local food, and fewer paid transfers. IF: trip_type == FIRST_TIME_VISITOR THEN: anchor the trip around tea gardens AND: add Eravikulam / Rajamalai AND: include one viewpoint or lake-side experience Reason: These elements give the clearest first impression of Munnar’s scenery, nature, and hill-station character. IF: trip_type == FAMILY THEN: limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include one leisure block daily Reason: Munnar family trips work best when the pace stays relaxed and manageable. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: schedule premium dinner or sunset experience in the evening Reason: Munnar is strongest at sunset, in the tea estates, and during quiet evening experiences. IF: weather == MONSOON THEN: reduce outdoor_walking AND: increase indoor_culture_or_food_time Reason: Rain and mist make a slower, more flexible Munnar plan perform better. IF: traveler_interest == NATURE OR traveler_interest == PHOTOGRAPHY THEN: combine tea gardens and viewpoints on the same day Reason: These areas cluster well and create a more coherent scenic experience. IF: traveler_type == SENIOR THEN: prefer_central_hotel AND: use_taxi_or_private_transfer_when_helpful AND: avoid_multiple_walking_heavy_stops Reason: Munnar’s scenic areas are rewarding, but they are easier when movement and walking are controlled. IF: trip_length >= 4 nights THEN: add one flexible half-day', 4872),
  ('munnar', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----- | | Family | 88 | | Honeymoon | 91 | | Luxury | 88 | | Budget | 91 | | Adventure | 68 | | Culture | 97 | | Food | 96 | | Shopping | 83 | | Nightlife | 70 | | Relaxation | 92 | | Nature | 90 | | Accessibility | 86 | | Safety | 82 | | First-time visitor | 91 | | Photography | 98 |', 4873),
  ('munnar', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveler profiles: 1. Honeymoon 2. Romantic couple 3. Culture/first-time visitor 4. Luxury traveler 5. Food traveler 6. Family with appropriate pacing Best duration: 4–5 nights Best season: September–February Best hotel strategy: Central or highly connected location, ideally Munnar town core or a scenic tea-estate stay with easy access to main sightseeing routes. Best transportation: Private driver, taxi, or short private transfers depending on trip style. Private transfer for: Must-do for first-time visitor: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Extremely high concentration of tea estates, scenery, romance, photography, and relaxed nature experiences in a compact hill-station setting. Biggest disadvantage: Winding hill roads, seasonal mist or rain, and crowd pressure in peak months. Overall destination score: 92/100', 4874),
  ('munnar', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 92/100 last_updated: 2026-08-14 last_verified: NOT_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: TRAVEL_ENGINE_INITIAL_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: Prices, opening hours, schedules, visa requirements, availability, accessibility and operational conditions must NOT be treated as permanently valid from this document. These must be sourced from structured, refreshable data.', 4875),
  ('alleppey', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Spring', NULL, 'months: March-May weather: Hot and increasingly humid; late May can feel oppressive, especially on open boats and beaches. crowd_level: MEDIUM → HIGH price_level: MEDIUM → HIGH overall_score: 82-86 recommended: true reason: Good for backwater cruises, photography, and relaxed resort stays, but heat and humidity build quickly. Prioritize early-morning or late-afternoon boat time and shaded experiences.', 4876),
  ('alleppey', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer', NULL, 'months: June-August weather: Warm and very humid with Southwest Monsoon; frequent heavy rain, overcast skies, and occasional rough water. crowd_level: LOW → MEDIUM price_level: LOW → MEDIUM overall_score: 78–84 recommended: true reason: Strong value season if you do not mind rain. The backwaters and paddy fields are at their greenest, houseboat rates drop, and crowds thin. Best for relaxed, indoor-heavy, or rain-tolerant trips; some boat routes may be restricted in heavy rain.', 4877),
  ('alleppey', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Autumn (Post-Monsoon)', NULL, 'months: September-November weather: Warm and humid, with monsoon easing by October; outdoor conditions improve steadily. crowd_level: LOW → MEDIUM price_level: LOW → MEDIUM overall_score: 84–89 recommended: true reason: One of the best all-around periods for Alleppey: greener landscapes, fewer crowds than winter, and better value. Backwaters are full, boat operations are stable, and the overall experience feels fresh and uncrowded.', 4878),
  ('alleppey', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter', NULL, 'months: December-February weather: Pleasant, drier, and more comfortable for boat rides, beaches, and outdoor time. crowd_level: HIGH → VERY HIGH price_level: HIGH → VERY HIGH overall_score: 88-92 recommended: true reason: Best weather for first-time visitors, houseboat stays, beach time, and photography, but also the busiest and most expensive period. January–February is the sweet spot: excellent conditions with slightly less peak-season pressure than late December.', 4879),
  ('alleppey', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Travel-agent rule: Alleppey is best positioned as a good-value backwater and relaxation destination, not an ultra-cheap backpacker hub and not a purely luxury-only stop. It offers strong experience quality for the money, especially when the trip is built around houseboats, beaches, nature, and slow-paced Kerala experiences.', 4880),
  ('alleppey', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Airport taxi or pre-booked private MPV / Innova-type van; door-to-door, luggage-friendly, and easiest after arrival.', 4881),
  ('alleppey', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Pre-booked private car or limo; best for privacy, comfort, and a smooth first impression. reason: The first impression of the trip matters, and a private transfer provides comfort, privacy, and a relaxed start to the backwater holiday.', 4882),
  ('alleppey', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Chauffeured sedan or luxury MPV; ideal for premium stays, added comfort, and seamless service.', 4883),
  ('alleppey', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Prepaid taxi or airport bus to the city, then local transport if needed; best value for cost-conscious travelers.', 4884),
  ('alleppey', 18, 'family-travel-alleppey', 'FAMILY TRAVEL (ALLEPPEY)', NULL, NULL, 'child_friendly_score: 86 best_ages: Rules: For young children: Prefer: Avoid:', 4885),
  ('alleppey', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 96 romance_score: 98 privacy_score: 90 luxury_score: 95 Recommended: **Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than:** Prefer: over: Recommended hotel areas:', 4886),
