  ('alleppey', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, 'adventure_score: 62 Alleppey is not a primary high-adrenaline adventure destination. **Adventure-like experiences should be interpreted as:** Recommended adventure-style areas: Best for:', 4888),
  ('alleppey', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 78 walking_intensity: MEDIUM_HIGH Rules: Recommended hotel areas:', 4889),
  ('alleppey', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: PARTIAL_TO_GOOD depending on attraction and transport public_transport_accessibility: VARIABLE hotel_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_HOTEL attraction_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Never infer accessibility from destination-level accessibility. Each hotel and attraction must carry its own accessibility data.', 4890),
  ('alleppey', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Alleppey is particularly strong for: Food experiences: Family: Prioritize clean, convenient restaurants with familiar and flexible menus; local Kerala meals and simple seafood dishes work well for all ages. Honeymoon: At least one memorable dinner or waterfront/backwater meal is recommended; romantic resort dining or a curated houseboat dinner adds a special touch. Luxury: Fine dining, premium seafood, and curated tasting experiences may be important; premium houseboats and backwater resorts often provide high-end, personalized dining. Budget: Mix local eateries, casual restaurants, and selected paid dining experiences; small town restaurants and Kerala meal spots offer excellent value compared to resort pricing.', 4891),
  ('alleppey', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Prefer premium malls, high-end jewellery stores, and curated handicraft boutiques. Prefer:', 4892),
  ('alleppey', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 55 Alleppey is not a primary nightlife destination; evenings are generally quiet and early-to-settle. Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: **Honeymoon travelers should generally prefer:** over: unless nightlife is explicitly requested.', 4893),
  ('alleppey', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1: Arrival → Hotel (Alleppey Town or Marari) → Alleppey Beach & Pier walk → Dinner Day 2: Morning: Houseboat or backwater cruise (half-day or full-day) Afternoon: Lunch on board / at waterfront restaurant Evening: Relaxed resort time or sunset at Marari Beach Day 3: Breakfast → Checkout → Departure transfer', 4894),
  ('alleppey', 29, 'five-night-honeymoon-pattern', 'Five-Night Honeymoon Pattern', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1: Arrive in Cochin, visit Fort Kochi/Mattancherry, then stay overnight in Cochin. Day 2: Travel to Munnar, enjoy the tea plantation hill station, and visit Rajamala. Overnight in Munnar. Day 3: Full day in Munnar with Kundala Dam, Echo Point, and Mattupetty Dam. Overnight in Munnar. Day 4: Proceed to Thekkady, enjoy Periyar Lake boating and wildlife viewing. Overnight in Thekkady. Day 5: Travel to Kumarakom/Alleppey, check in to a resort, and spend the evening at leisure. Overnight in Kumarakom or Alleppey. Day 6: After breakfast, transfer to Cochin for departure. Honeymoon Focus This pattern works well for couples because it combines: Cochin for sightseeing and shopping. Munnar for scenic hill-station romance. Thekkady for wildlife and boating. Kumarakom/Alleppey for relaxed backwater-style leisure.', 4895),
  ('alleppey', 30, 'five-night-family-itinerary', 'Five-Night Family Itinerary', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1: Arrive in Cochin, transfer to Alleppey, check in, dinner, and rest. Day 2: Visit Alleppey Beach, Pier, and Lighthouse; enjoy a relaxed afternoon at the hotel; evening sunset by the backwaters or beach. Day 3: Take a houseboat or backwater cruise, see scenic canals and village views, then relax at the hotel. Day 4: Visit Ambalappuzha Sree Krishna Temple or Krishnapuram Palace, followed by leisure time and an evening at Marari Beach or Alleppey promenade. Day 5: Keep the day flexible for shopping, a short boat ride, or one optional attraction. Day 6: Breakfast and departure. Family Travel Style This pattern is designed for a relaxed family trip with no more than 2 major activities per day. It keeps travel light, includes downtime, and works well for children and elders. The main focus is backwaters, beach time, and a little culture without rushing.', 4896),
  ('alleppey', 31, 'five-night-luxury-pattern', 'Five-Night Luxury Pattern', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1: Arrive in Cochin, take a private transfer to a luxury stay in Marari Beach, Punnamada, or Alleppey Town, and relax with a premium dinner. Day 2: Check into a luxury houseboat, enjoy a scenic backwater cruise with gourmet meals, sunset tea, and a candlelight dinner on board. Day 3: After breakfast, move to a premium resort for spa/Ayurveda, pool time, and waterfront fine dining. Day 4: Take a private backwater or village cruise, enjoy canal photography, a premium lunch, free time, sunset at Marari Beach or the backwaters, and an elegant dinner. Day 5: Have a late breakfast, do some flexible luxury activities like boutique shopping or a wellness treatment, and finish with a farewell high-end dinner. Day 6: Private airport transfer for departure.', 4897),
  ('alleppey', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 4898),
  ('alleppey', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '', 4899),
  ('alleppey', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: do not recommend a full-day houseboat + multiple temple/beach stops by default. Reason: Short Alleppey stays work best when time is concentrated around one signature backwater experience plus one relaxed scenic stop rather than spread across too many activities. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: increase romance_weight by 30% increase privacy_weight by 20% increase free_time_weight by 20% decrease activity_density by 20% Reason: Alleppey honeymoon value comes from private houseboats, sunset backwaters, and slow pacing rather than maximum sightseeing. IF: traveler_type == FAMILY AND: children_age <= 6 THEN: reduce walking_intensity_target by 20% increase downtime by 20% prefer short transfers and predictable meal breaks Reason: Young children handle Alleppey better with compact sightseeing blocks, short boat rides, and fewer long hot-weather walks. IF: hotel_is_far_from_backwater_core_and_houseboat_zone AND: hotel_saving < additional_transport_cost + value_of_lost_time THEN: prefer_central_hotel_or_backwater_base Reason: A cheaper hotel away from the main backwater or beach zone often creates worse overall trip value in Alleppey. IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: prefer_one_hotel Reason: Hotel changes consume valuable time on a short Alleppey trip. IF: trip_length >= 5 nights AND: traveler_interest == RELAXATION THEN: consider_Marari_Beach_or_rural_backwater_add_on Reason: Longer stays make a slower scenic extension more practical and more rewarding in Alleppey. IF: traveler_type == LUXURY THEN: prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_exclusive_or_private_experiences Reason: Luxury value in Alleppey is created through comfort, privacy, premium houseboats, and service rather than through more sightseeing stops. IF: traveler_type == BUDGET THEN: prefer_public_transport_or_value_base AND: prefer_high_value_hotel_location AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions Reason: Alleppey offers strong value when the itinerary uses compact backwater zones, local food, and fewer paid transfers. IF: trip_type == FIRST_TIME_VISITOR THEN: anchor the trip around one houseboat experience AND: add Alleppey Beach AND: include one temple, church, or village stop Reason: These three elements give the clearest first impression of Alleppey’s backwater, coastal, and local Kerala character. IF: trip_type == FAMILY THEN: limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include one leisure block daily Reason: Alleppey family trips work best when the pace stays relaxed and manageable. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: schedule premium dinner or sunset cruise in the evening Reason: Alleppey is strongest at sunset, on the water, and during quiet evening experiences. IF: weather == MONSOON THEN: reduce outdoor_walking AND: increase indoor_or_boat_based_time Reason: Rain and humidity make a slower, more flexible Alleppey plan perform better. IF: traveler_interest == HISTORY OR traveler_interest == CULTURE THEN: combine Ambalappuzha Temple, Krishnapuram Palace, and a local village/coir stop on the same day Reason: These places work well together and create a more coherent cultural experience. IF: traveler_type == SENIOR THEN: prefer_central_hotel_or_easy_access_resort AND: use_taxi_or_private_transfer_when_helpful AND: avoid_multiple_walking_heavy_stops Reason: Alleppey’s backwater areas are rewarding, but they are easier when movement and walking are controlled. IF: trip_length >= 4 nights THEN: add one flexible half-day Reason: Alleppey benefits from breathing room, especially for spa time, beach time, village visits, or weather adjustments.', 4900),
  ('alleppey', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----- | | Family | 86 | | Honeymoon | 94 | | Luxury | 90 | | Budget | 89 | | Adventure | 62 | | Culture | 82 | | Food | 88 | | Shopping | 68 | | Nightlife | 55 | | Relaxation | 96 | | Nature | 94 | | Accessibility | 78 | | Safety | 82 | | First-time visitor | 88 | | Photography | 93 |', 4901),
  ('alleppey', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveler profiles: 1. Honeymoon 2. Romantic couple 3. Culture / first-time visitor 4. Luxury traveler 5. Food traveler 6. Family with relaxed pacing Best duration: 2–4 nights for most travelers, with 3 nights as the sweet spot. 4–5 nights only if the traveler wants slow travel, premium leisure, or a fuller Kerala backwater experience. Best season: September–February Best hotel strategy: Choose a central or backwater-connected stay, ideally near Alleppey Town, Punnamada, or Marari Beach depending on trip style. For honeymoon and luxury, a premium houseboat or quiet beachfront resort works best. Best transportation: Walk, short taxi rides, private transfers, and boat-based movement depending on the plan. Private transfer for: Must-do for first-time visitor: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Extremely strong concentration of backwaters, romance, nature, photography, food, and slow-travel experiences in one destination. Biggest disadvantage: Heat, humidity, limited nightlife, and slower movement between attractions can reduce comfort if the trip is overplanned. Overall destination score: 94/100.', 4902),
  ('alleppey', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 94/100 last_updated: 2026-08-15 last_verified: NOT_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: TRAVEL_ENGINE_INITIAL_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: Prices, opening hours, schedules, visa requirements, availability, accessibility and operational conditions must NOT be treated as permanently valid from this document. These must be sourced from structured, refreshable data.', 4903),
  ('thekkady', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer', NULL, 'months: March-May weather: Hot and increasingly dry; wildlife sightings can improve as animals gather near water sources, but daytime heat rises sharply by late April and May crowd_level: MEDIUM price_level: LOW → MEDIUM overall_score: 84-89 recommended: true reason: Very good for wildlife enthusiasts and photographers, especially early morning safaris and lake-side viewing. Less comfortable than winter, but often better for budget travelers and animal sightings.', 4904),
  ('thekkady', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Autumn (Post-Monsoon)', NULL, 'months: October-November weather: Warm, fresh, and increasingly pleasant as the rains ease; forests and plantations remain especially green. crowd_level: LOW → MEDIUM price_level: LOW → MEDIUM overall_score: 84–89 recommended: true reason: Excellent shoulder season for balanced weather, strong scenery, and manageable crowds. A very good time for nature lovers, photographers, and relaxed sightseeing.', 4905),
  ('thekkady', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter', NULL, 'months: December-February weather: Pleasant, dry, and cool enough for forest walks, boating, and sightseeing. This is the most comfortable season for outdoor activities in Thekkady. crowd_level: HIGH → VERY HIGH price_level: HIGH → VERY HIGH overall_score: 90-94 recommended: true reason: Best overall season for first-time visitors, wildlife viewing, boating at Periyar Lake, trekking, and plantation visits. This is the most popular period, so book early for better hotel and safari availability.', 4906),
  ('thekkady', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Travel-agent rule: Thekkady is best positioned as a good-value nature and wildlife destination, not an ultra-cheap backpacker hub and not a purely luxury-only stop. It offers strong experience quality for the money, especially when the trip is built around Periyar wildlife experiences, spice plantations, scenic resorts, and slow-paced Kerala hill-station time.', 4907),
  ('thekkady', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Airport taxi or pre-booked private MPV / Innova-type van; door-to-door, luggage-friendly, and easiest after arrival.', 4908),
  ('thekkady', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Pre-booked private car or sedan; best for privacy, comfort, and a smooth first impression. reason: The first impression of the trip matters, and a private transfer provides comfort, privacy, and a relaxed start to the wildlife-and-hills holiday.', 4909),
  ('thekkady', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Chauffeured sedan or luxury MPV; ideal for premium stays, added comfort, and seamless service.', 4910),
  ('thekkady', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Prepaid taxi or shared cab from the airport; best value for cost-conscious travelers while still keeping the long road journey comfortable.', 4911),
