  ('madurai', 30, 'six-nights-family-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Doddabetta Peak → Botanical Garden → Lunch → Ooty Lake → Optional boating / horse riding → Hotel rest → Family dinner', 5288),
