  ('madurai', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: trip_length <= 2 nights THEN: do not recommend Azhagar Kovil or Samanar Hills as default day trips. Reason: The additional travel and sightseeing time can make a short Madurai stay unnecessarily rushed. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: increase romance_weight by 20% increase privacy_weight by 15% increase free_time_weight by 25% decrease activity_density by 20% Reason: The objective is a peaceful and romantic cultural/heritage experience rather than maximum sightseeing. IF: traveler_type == FAMILY AND: children_age <= 6 THEN: reduce travel_intensity_target by 20% increase downtime by 20% prefer_short_sightseeing + family_friendly_activities Reason: Young children can find heat, temple crowds, long walks and extended road journeys tiring. IF: hotel_is_far_from_meenakshi_amman_temple AND: hotel_saving < additional_transport_cost + value_of_lost_time THEN: prefer_hotel_near_central_madurai Reason: A cheaper hotel may not provide better total value once daily transport costs, traffic and travel time are considered. IF: trip_length <= 3 nights THEN: prefer_one_hotel Reason: Hotel changes consume valuable short-trip time. IF: trip_length >= 4 nights AND: traveler_interest == PILGRIMAGE_AND_CULTURE THEN: consider_madurai + NEARBY_PILGRIMAGE_SITES Reason: A longer stay makes it practical to explore Madurai''s central temples along with destinations such as Thirupparankundram, Azhagar Kovil and Pazhamudircholai. IF: traveler_type == LUXURY THEN: prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_private_or_personalized_experiences Reason: Luxury value in Madurai is primarily created through comfort, convenience, privacy, service, premium accommodation and personalized cultural experiences. IF: traveler_type == BUDGET THEN: prefer_central_hotel_location AND: use_local_bus_or_auto_where_practical AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions Reason: Maintain pilgrimage, heritage and food experiences while reducing unnecessary transportation and accommodation costs. IF: traveler_interest == PILGRIMAGE_AND_SPIRITUALITY THEN: prefer_CENTRAL_MADURAI AND: group_meenakshi_amman_temple + koodal_azhagar_temple + nearby_temples Reason: Central Madurai provides convenient access to the city''s principal pilgrimage attractions and temple heritage. IF: traveler_interest == HISTORY_AND_HERITAGE THEN: prefer_CENTRAL_MADURAI AND: group_meenakshi_amman_temple + thirumalai_nayak_palace + gandhi_memorial_museum Reason: These attractions provide a strong combination of religious heritage, royal history, architecture and modern Indian history. IF: traveler_interest == NATURE_AND_SCENERY THEN: prefer_ALAGAR_KOVIL_AND_ALAGAR_HILLS AND: group_alagar_kovil + pazhamudircholai + hill_scenery Reason: The Alagar Hills area provides a combination of temple heritage, hill landscapes and outdoor scenery beyond central Madurai. IF: traveler_interest == FOOD_AND_SHOPPING THEN: prefer_CENTRAL_MADURAI AND: group_local_food + sungudi_textiles + temple_market_streets Reason: Central Madurai provides convenient access to traditional food, textile shopping, temple-area markets and local cultural experiences. IF: trip_length >= 4 nights AND: traveler_interest == PILGRIMAGE + HERITAGE THEN: consider_split_itinerary BETWEEN: CENTRAL_MADURAI + OUTER_MADURAI_ATTRACTIONS Reason: Separating central heritage attractions from Thirupparankundram, Azhagar Kovil and other outer-area sightseeing reduces unnecessary backtracking and keeps the itinerary comfortable.', 5303),
  ('madurai', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | | Family | 91 | | Honeymoon | 76 | | Luxury | 68 | | Budget | 92 | | Adventure | 58 | | Culture | 99 | | Food | 95 | | Shopping | 86 | | Nightlife | 35 | | Relaxation | 78 | | Nature | 74 | | Accessibility | 67 | | Safety | 82 | | First-time visitor | 95 | | Photography | 94 |', 5304),
  ('madurai', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveler profiles: 1. Culture / heritage traveler 2. Pilgrimage traveler 3. Family traveler 4. Spiritual traveler 5. Food traveler 6. Photography traveler 7. Budget traveler 8. History traveler 9. Solo traveler 10. Senior traveler with appropriate pacing Best duration: 2–3 nights Best season: December–February September–March Best hotel strategy: Choose a clean, well-reviewed hotel based on proximity to the Meenakshi Amman Temple, railway station, major sightseeing areas, transport access, and the main purpose of the trip. Best transportation: Auto-rickshaws, taxis, app-based cabs, local buses and private drivers depending on distance, budget and comfort. Private transfer for: Must-do for first-time visitor: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: Exceptional combination of Tamil culture, ancient temple heritage, Dravidian architecture, pilgrimage, history, traditional food, local markets and strong photography opportunities. The Meenakshi Amman Temple forms the cultural heart of the city, while Thirumalai Nayak Palace, Gandhi Museum, Azhagar Kovil and Thirupparankundram add historical, religious and architectural depth. Biggest disadvantage: Hot weather for much of the year, urban traffic and crowds around major attractions, limited nightlife compared with major metropolitan leisure destinations, and variable accessibility at individual heritage and religious sites. Overall destination score: 88/100', 5305),
  ('madurai', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 90/100 last_updated: 2026-08-15 last_verified: PARTIALLY_WEB_VERIFIED verified_by: OFFICIAL_MADURAI_DISTRICT_AND_GOVERNMENT_OF_INDIA_TOURISM_SOURCES sources: IMPORTANT: Prices, opening hours, temple schedules, availability, accessibility, transport schedules, weather conditions and operational conditions must NOT be treated as permanently valid from this document. Temple timings, darshan procedures, special pooja schedules and religious-event conditions must be checked against the latest official temple or local authority information before travel. Attraction opening hours, ticket prices, sound-and-light show schedules, transport schedules, road conditions and accessibility should be sourced from structured, refreshable data. Madurai''s major festivals, including the Chithirai Festival, can significantly affect crowd levels, accommodation demand, traffic, temple access and local transport conditions. Weather conditions can become particularly hot during the warmer months, so outdoor sightseeing should be planned with appropriate heat, hydration and timing considerations. Accessibility should be verified individually for hotels, temples, heritage buildings, museums and other attractions because facilities can vary significantly by location. Madurai travel conditions can vary during major religious festivals, public holidays, weekends and peak tourist periods. This dataset should be refreshed regularly before production use.', 5306),
  ('bengaluru', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter Oct-Feb - PEAK', NULL, 'weather: 16-28°C, pleasant + cool + best for gardens + Nandi Hills + pubs + outdoor. crowd_level: VERY HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 94 recommended: true reason: Best season + pleasant weather #1 in India + flower show Jan/Aug Lalbagh + Nandi Hills sunrise clear.', 5307),
  ('bengaluru', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer Mar-May', NULL, 'weather: 20-32°C, warm + pleasant vs rest of India 40°C + still pleasant + flower show May + Nandi still cool. crowd_level: HIGH price_level: HIGH overall_score: 82 recommended: true reason: Warm but pleasant vs North India + still gardens + Nandi Hills + pubs + indoor.', 5308),
  ('bengaluru', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Monsoon Jun-Sep', NULL, 'weather: 19-28°C, pleasant + rain + green + Lalbagh + Cubbon lush + Nandi misty + occasional rain. crowd_level: MEDIUM_HIGH price_level: MEDIUM overall_score: 86 recommended: true reason: Green + pleasant + rain + gardens lush + Nandi misty sunrise + pubs + breweries + beer + less crowd.', 5309),
  ('bengaluru', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended: Travel-agent rule: Bengaluru budget = $30/day budget (hostel + dosa + coffee + auto + metro + pub $5), $80-$130/day mid (3★ + dosa + brewery + Nandi Hills car + Wonderla), $180-$350/day luxury (5★ Taj West End + Oberoi + private car + Nandi private + UB City fine dining). Metro best for MG Road to Whitefield.', 5310),
  ('bengaluru', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Family', 'family', 'Airport→Koramangala/Indiranagar family hotel by AC taxi $14 or Vayu Vajra bus $3 + metro + auto + Wonderla by private AC bus + family room + pool + Nandi Hills private car 4:30 AM sunrise.', 5311),
  ('bengaluru', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Private taxi to Taj West End Garden bungalow / Oberoi / Ritz-Carlton + private garden + pool + Nandi Hills private sunrise + UB City private dinner + brewery private + Lalbagh private.', 5312),
  ('bengaluru', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Private luxury car + Taj West End / Oberoi / Ritz-Carlton / ITC Gardenia / JW Marriott / Four Seasons + airport VIP lounge + private guide + Nandi private + brewery VIP.', 5313),
  ('bengaluru', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Vayu Vajra airport bus $2-$4 + metro $0.5 + auto $1-$2 + hostel near Koramangala/Indiranagar/Majestic + Nandi by shared car $10 + dosa $2 + filter coffee $1.', 5314),
