  ('bengaluru', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 65 romance_score: 68 privacy_score: 72 luxury_score: 82 Recommended: Bengaluru is a city + pubs + gardens + not a beach/hill honeymoon primary, but Taj West End Garden bungalow + Nandi Hills sunrise romantic can be 1-2N: Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than: 2-3 attractions per day + Nandi sunrise + brewery + garden + palace + shopping. Prefer: Garden + sunrise + brewery + rooftop dinner. Recommended hotel areas:', 5317),
