  ('bengaluru', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD public_transport_accessibility: GOOD - Metro has elevators + low floor + BMTC + auto + but crowded hotel_accessibility: GOOD; 4★-5★ HOTELS HAVE ELEVATORS + ACCESSIBLE ROOMS + RAMPS attraction_accessibility: MODERATE_TO_GOOD; MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Verify accessible room + elevator + private car.', 5321),
  ('bengaluru', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Bengaluru is particularly strong for: Food experiences: 1. DOSA_CTR_MTR + FILTER_COFFEE - CTR Benne masala dosa + MTR ghee roast + 1920/1924 oldest + filter coffee + $2-$4 + must breakfast 8-11 AM + Malleshwaram + Basavanagudi. 2. BREWERY_TOIT_ARBOR_PECOS + PUBS_INDIRANAGAR_KORAMANGALA_UB_CITY - Toit brewery #1 + Arbor + Pecos + Gyl + craft beer + $10-$15 + must evening 7-11 PM + Indiranagar 100ft + Koramangala + UB City rooftop. 3. VV_PURAM_FOOD_STREET + NAGARATHPET + COMMERCIAL_STREET_STREET_FOOD - VV Puram Food Street 6-10 PM + chaat + dosa + idli + bajji + gobi + pav bhaji + $2-$5 + must night + family + Nagarathpet biryani + kebabs. 4. BIRYANI_DONNE + ANDHRA + KARAVALI + MANGALORE + COASTAL + NAGARATHPET + SHIVAJI_NAGAR + KEBABS 5. UB_CITY_FINE_DINING + 5★_ROOFTOP + ITC_GARDENIA + TAJ_WEST_END + OBEROI + RITZ + FILTER_COFFEE + THIRD_WAVE + CAFE_HOPPING_INDIRANAGAR_KORAMANGALA Family: Prioritise dosa CTR/MTR + filter coffee + VV Puram Food Street + Nagarathpet + mild biryani + Wonderla food court + Bannerghatta + ISKCON prasadam + Lalbagh + Cubbon picnic. Honeymoon: Include Taj West End high tea + private brewery Toit + private UB City rooftop dinner + private dosa tasting CTR/MTR + private filter coffee + private VV Puram + private Lalbagh picnic.', 5322),
  ('bengaluru', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: UB City luxury + Phoenix + Forum + Garuda + high-end + branded + luxury + fine dining + rooftop Budget: Commercial Street $5-$20 + MG Road + Brigade sale + Jayanagar 4th Block $10-$30 + VV Puram + Nagarathpet + Indiranagar 100ft sale + Koramangala $10-$30 + street.', 5323),
  ('bengaluru', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 90 Suitable for: Not a primary requirement for: Travellers should generally prefer: Indiranagar 100ft Toit + Arbor + Pecos + 100s pubs + breweries + Koramangala pubs + cafes + MG Road + Brigade pubs + UB City rooftop + luxury + Taj West End Garden bar + Oberoi bar + brewery hopping + Indiranagar + Koramangala + UB City + MG Road + Brigade + 7 PM-12 AM over: early sleep Note: Bengaluru nightlife = #1 pub capital of India + 100s pubs + breweries + Toit + Arbor + Pecos + Gyl + Indiranagar + Koramangala + MG Road + Brigade + UB City + rooftop + fine dining + 5 PM-12 AM best + pubs close 11:30 PM-12:30 AM + 5★ bars till 1 AM + young + IT + start-ups + youth + affordable vs Mumbai + beer + craft + must at least 1 brewery + Toit + Arbor. For big nightlife go to Indiranagar 100ft + Koramangala + UB City + MG Road. Main evening is brewery + pub + dosa + VV Puram Food Street + MG Road night + UB City rooftop.', 5324),
  ('bengaluru', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS BENGALURU CITY + NANDI HILLS', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive BLR airport. Transfer to MG Road/Koramangala/Indiranagar hotel. Afternoon Lalbagh Botanical Garden + Glass House + Cubbon Park + Toy Train + Vidhan Soudha photo + Bangalore Palace Tudor + Tipu Summer Palace + ISKCON Temple + Bull Temple big Nandi + evening MG Road + Brigade Road shopping + Commercial Street + UB City luxury mall rooftop + brewery Toit Indiranagar + VV Puram Food Street dosa + filter coffee. Day 2 Early morning 4:30 AM private car to Nandi Hills 60km 60min sunrise best in South India + mist + clouds + Tipu Drop + fort + temple + breakfast + return 10 AM. Afternoon Wonderla Amusement Park 30km water + land rides + family or Bannerghatta Zoo Safari 25km tiger + lion + bear safari + butterfly park + HAL Museum + Visvesvaraya Museum + evening Indiranagar 100ft pubs + Koramangala + brewery hopping. Day 3 Morning shopping MG Road + Brigade + Commercial Street + Jayanagar 4th Block + CTR/MTR dosa + filter coffee + departure BLR with gardens + palace + brewery + Nandi sunrise memories. Package Includes: 2 nights MG Road/Koramangala/Indiranagar hotel + private car + Nandi Hills + Lalbagh + Cubbon + Palace + Tipu + ISKCON + MG Road + brewery + Wonderla/Bannerghatta. Excludes: Skandagiri trek, Mysore day trip.', 5325),
  ('bengaluru', 29, 'three-night-city-family-nandi-pattern-ideal', 'THREE-NIGHT CITY + FAMILY + NANDI PATTERN (IDEAL)', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive at BLR Airport/Railway and private transfer to hotel near MG Road / Koramangala / Indiranagar. Check-in rest. Afternoon Lalbagh Botanical Garden + Glass House + Cubbon Park + Toy Train + Vidhan Soudha + High Court + Attara Kacheri photo + Bangalore Palace Tudor + Tipu Sultan Summer Palace + Bangalore Fort + evening MG Road + Brigade Road + Commercial Street shopping + UB City luxury mall rooftop + brewery Toit/Arbor/Pecos Indiranagar + VV Puram Food Street. Optional evening add-on: Indiranagar 100ft pub hopping + Koramangala + UB City rooftop. Overnight: Bengaluru - MG Road / Koramangala / Indiranagar - Taj West End / Oberoi / Ritz-Carlton / ITC Gardenia / JW Marriott / budget 3★ Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Early morning 4:30 AM private car to Nandi Hills 60km 60min sunrise best in South India + mist + clouds + Tipu Drop + fort + temple + cycling + breakfast + return 10 AM rest. Afternoon Wonderla Amusement Park 30km water + land rides + family full day or Bannerghatta Biological Park + Zoo + Safari + tiger + lion + bear + butterfly park + HAL Museum + Visvesvaraya Museum + evening Koramangala + Indiranagar pubs + breweries. Overnight: Bengaluru - MG Road / Koramangala / Indiranagar Meals: Breakfast Day 3 After breakfast, ISKCON Temple + Bull Temple big Nandi + Gavi Gangadhareshwaram Cave Temple + Jayanagar 4th Block + Basavanagudi + VV Puram Food Street + CTR/MTR dosa + filter coffee + Ulsoor Lake boating + Visvesvaraya + HAL Museum + Planetarium + afternoon shopping MG Road + Brigade + Commercial Street + Jayanagar + Forum + Phoenix + evening UB City fine dining + brewery + farewell. Overnight: Bengaluru - MG Road Meals: Breakfast Day 4 Morning at leisure - Shopping + dosa + filter coffee + check out and transfer to BLR airport 60-90min for departure with gardens + palace + Nandi sunrise + brewery + dosa memories. Meals: Breakfast', 5326),
  ('bengaluru', 30, 'three-night-family-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive BLR, private van to MG Road/Koramangala family hotel with pool. Check-in rest. Afternoon Lalbagh Botanical Garden + Glass House + Cubbon Park Toy Train + Vidhan Soudha photo + Bangalore Palace + Tipu Summer Palace + ISKCON Temple + Bull Temple + evening MG Road + Commercial Street shopping + VV Puram Food Street. Overnight: Bengaluru Family Hotel MG Road/Koramangala Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Early morning 4:30 AM Nandi Hills sunrise private car + mist + Tipu Drop + fort + breakfast + return 10 AM rest. Afternoon Bannerghatta Zoo Safari + butterfly park + zoo + safari tiger + lion + bear + Innovative Film City + Planetarium + evening Koramangala/Indiranagar pubs family restaurant + brewery non-alcoholic. Overnight: Bengaluru Family Hotel Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. Full day Wonderla Amusement Park 30km water + land rides + family + kids love + lunch inside + evening UB City + MG Road + Brigade + Commercial Street + shopping + dosa CTR/MTR + filter coffee + farewell brewery. Overnight: Bengaluru Family Hotel Meals: Breakfast Day 4 Breakfast. Check-out + shopping + dosa + departure BLR. Meals: Breakfast', 5327),
  ('bengaluru', 31, 'three-night-business-pubs-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT BUSINESS + PUBS PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive BLR Airport + private car to Whitefield/Electronic City/MG Road business hotel ITC Gardenia/JW Marriott/Ritz-Carlton/Oberoi/Taj West End + check-in + business meetings Whitefield/Electronic City/Manyata + evening MG Road + Brigade + UB City rooftop + brewery Toit/Arbor/Pecos business dinner + Indiranagar 100ft pub + team dinner. Overnight: Bengaluru Business Hotel - Whitefield / MG Road / UB City - ITC Gardenia / JW Marriott / Ritz-Carlton / Oberoi / Taj West End Meals: Breakfast Day 2 Breakfast. Morning meetings business + afternoon Lalbagh + Cubbon Park + Bangalore Palace + Tipu + ISKCON + Vidhan Soudha + evening Koramangala + Indiranagar brewery hopping + UB City fine dining + pub. Overnight: Bengaluru Business Hotel Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. Early morning Nandi Hills sunrise private car 4:30 AM + team outing + breakfast + return + afternoon Mysore day trip 150km 3hr Mysore Palace + Chamundi Hills + Srirangapatna or shopping MG Road + Brigade + Commercial Street + Jayanagar + Forum + Phoenix + evening farewell UB City rooftop + brewery. Overnight: Bengaluru Business Hotel Meals: Breakfast Day 4 Breakfast. Check-out + transfer BLR airport with business + pub + Nandi + gardens memories. Meals: Breakfast', 5328),
  ('bengaluru', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 5329),
  ('bengaluru', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose 2. Groups by geography: MG Road + Brigade + UB City + Cubbon Park + Vidhan Soudha + Commercial Street + Bangalore Palace + Tipu + ISKCON + Lalbagh + Bull Temple + Jayanagar + VV Puram together city center 6-8km, Indiranagar + Koramangala + Jayanagar + VV Puram + CTR/MTR + pubs together south-east 6-8km, Nandi Hills 60km + Skandagiri 70km + Ramanagara 55km + Savandurga 60km together outskirts north/west, Wonderla 30km + Bannerghatta 25km + Electronic City + Whitefield together south/west outskirts. 3. Uses hotel location strategically: MG ROAD / CUBBON / UB CITY for city + shopping + business + luxury + metro + near Lalbagh/Cubbon + Palace + shopping + 5★ Taj West End/Oberoi/Ritz. INDIRANAGAR / KORAMANGALA for pubs + breweries + cafes + youth + nightlife + boutique + 3★-4★ + near Toit + brewery + young + affordable. WHITEFIELD / ELECTRONIC CITY for business + IT + business hotels + near airport + conventions + IT + start-ups. 4. Places Lalbagh + Cubbon morning 8-11 AM + Bangalore Palace + Tipu morning + ISKCON morning + MG Road shopping evening 4-7 PM + VV Puram Food Street night 7-9 PM + Indiranagar/Koramangala pubs breweries night 7 PM-12 AM + Nandi Hills sunrise early 4:30 AM-10 AM + Wonderla full day 10 AM-6 PM + Bannerghatta half day morning. 5. Treats Bengaluru as 2-3 areas/day + Nandi Hills separate early morning + Wonderla/Bannerghatta separate full/half day + not checklist 6 areas same day + traffic 10km 60min peak. 6. Always includes metro + auto + private car for Nandi/Wonderla/Bannerghatta/Mysore + Nandi sunrise 4:30 AM + brewery booking + Lalbagh flower show Jan/Aug + dosa CTR/MTR + filter coffee + VV Puram Food Street + water + hat + jacket for Nandi early morning cold + traffic buffer 60min.', 5330),
  ('bengaluru', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Lalbagh + Cubbon Park + Vidhan Soudha + Bangalore Palace + Tipu Summer Palace + ISKCON + MG Road + Brigade + Commercial Street shopping + UB City + brewery Toit + dosa CTR/MTR + VV Puram Food Street. No Nandi/Wonderla. Reason: Nandi needs 4:30 AM + Wonderla full day. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Day 1: City gardens + palace + MG Road + brewery, Day 2 Nandi Hills sunrise 4:30 AM + Wonderla or Bannerghatta Safari + shopping + VV Puram Food Street. Core. Reason: Covers gardens + palace + pubs + sunrise + family. IF: `trip_length >= 3 nights` THEN: Add Wonderla full day + Bannerghatta Safari half day + Skandagiri night trek + Ramanagara + Savandurga + day trip Mysore 150km 3hr Mysore Palace + Chamundi Hills + Srirangapatna + shopping + brewery hopping + base for Coorg/Ooty/Hampi. Reason: Complete family + adventure + base + shopping + pubs. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Lalbagh + Cubbon Park toy train + Wonderla + Bannerghatta Safari + butterfly park + ISKCON + Visvesvaraya + HAL + Planetarium + Innovative Film City + Nandi Hills + Ulsoor Lake boating + VV Puram Food Street. Reason: Family gardens + safari + amusement + museums + sunrise + food street. IF: `traveler_type == BUSINESS` THEN: Whitefield/Electronic City/Manyata + MG Road + UB City + 5★ business hotels + meetings + conventions + brewery business dinner Toit/Arbor + team dinner Indiranagar + weekend Nandi Hills + Mysore day trip. Reason: Silicon Valley + business hub + pubs + team dinner + weekend hills. IF: `traveler_type == NIGHTLIFE` THEN: Indiranagar 100ft Toit + Arbour + Pecos + 100s pubs + Koramangala + UB City rooftop + MG Road + Brigade + breweries + cafe hopping + VV Puram Food Street + brewery hopping + nightlife 7 PM-12 AM. Reason: 1 pub capital + breweries + youth + nightlife.', 5331),
  ('bengaluru', 34, 'destination-scoring', 'DESTINATION SCORING', NULL, NULL, '| Factor | Score | | ------------------ | ----: | Family | 88 Honeymoon | 65 Luxury | 82 Budget | 86 Adventure | 66 Culture | 72 Food | 88 Shopping | 84 Nightlife | 90 Relaxation | 76 Nature | 68 Accessibility | 76 Safety | 84 First-time visitor | 86 Photography | 80', 5332),
  ('bengaluru', 35, 'final-travel-agent-verdict', 'FINAL TRAVEL AGENT VERDICT', NULL, NULL, 'Best traveller profiles: 1. Business + Silicon Valley + start-ups + IT + Whitefield + Electronic City + Manyata + 5★ + conventions + team dinner + brewery business dinner + base 2. Nightlife + pub capital + 100s pubs + breweries Toit + Arbor + Pecos + Indiranagar + Koramangala + UB City + MG Road + youth + nightlife + cafes + breweries + must 3. Family weekend + Lalbagh + Cubbon Park + Wonderla + Bannerghatta Safari + Nandi Hills sunrise + ISKCON + museums + VV Puram Food Street + gardens + weather pleasant 4. Weather + garden city + pleasant year-round 20-28°C + Lalbagh + Cubbon + Ulsoor Lake + Nandi Hills + best weather in India + gardens + parks + jogging + green 5. Foodies + dosa + filter coffee + CTR + MTR + VV Puram Food Street + Nagarathpet + biryani + pubs + breweries + UB City fine dining + Indiranagar + Koramangala + cafe hopping 6. Gateway South Karnataka + base for Mysore 150km + Coorg 250km + Ooty 270km + Hampi 340km + Chikmagalur 240km + Wayanad + Nandi Hills + weekend + circuit Best duration: 2 nights (3 nights with Nandi + Wonderla family) Best season: Oct-Feb best + pleasant 16-28°C + gardens + Nandi Hills sunrise clear + flower show Jan + pubs + outdoor. Jun-Sep monsoon green + pleasant + misty Nandi + gardens lush + pubs + breweries + less crowd. Mar-May warm but pleasant vs North India 40°C + flower show May. Best hotel strategy: Best transportation: Metro $0.5-$1 + auto $1-$3 + Ola/Uber $5-$12 + private car $30-$50/day for Nandi Hills + Wonderla + Bannerghatta + Mysore + Vayu Vajra airport bus $2-$4 + metro Purple + Green Line MG Road to Whitefield/Electronic City + traffic heavy 10km 60min peak + need buffer. Must-do: Don''t-do: Biggest advantage: India''s Silicon Valley + Garden City + pub capital + pleasant weather year-round 20-28°C best in India + Lalbagh + Cubbon Park + gardens + Nandi Hills sunrise best + Bangalore Palace + Tipu + ISKCON + MG Road + Brigade + Commercial Street shopping + UB City luxury + 100s pubs + breweries Toit + Arbor + Pecos + Indiranagar + Koramangala + dosa CTR/MTR + filter coffee + VV Puram Food Street + Wonderla + Bannerghatta Safari + business hub + start-ups + base for Mysore + Coorg + Ooty + Hampi + family + business + nightlife + weather + gardens. Biggest disadvantage: No beach 350km to Mangalore + no big historical like Mysore/Hampi + traffic heavy 10km 60min peak + pollution + MG Road + Brigade crowded + Nandi Hills 60km 4:30 AM early + cold + need car + weekend crowded + Wonderla/Bannerghatta far 25-30km + need car + pubs close 11:30 PM-12:30 AM + not late night like Goa + no snow + no desert + city + gardens + pubs + base. Overall destination score: 86/100 - Must 2N city + gardens + palace + pubs + breweries + dosa + filter coffee + Nandi Hills sunrise + 3N with Wonderla + Bannerghatta + base for Mysore + Coorg + Ooty + Hampi.', 5333),
  ('bengaluru', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 92/100 last_updated: 2026-08-17 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: INDIA_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: This Bengaluru file is suitable for itinerary design, traveller profiling, hotel-area strategy, and initial package planning. Nandi Hills sunrise 4:30 AM start + 60 km 60 min + mist + clouds + best Oct-Feb clear + monsoon misty + weekend crowded + queue + need private car $30 + shared $10 + jacket + cold + breakfast. Wonderla full day 10 AM-6 PM + $20 + queue weekend + water + land rides + family. Bannerghatta Safari half day + $8 + tiger + lion + bear + butterfly park + 25km + bus $1 + car $30. Lalbagh flower show Jan/Aug + $1 + crowded. Bangalore Palace $8 + Tipu $1 + ISKCON free + Lalbagh $0.5 + Cubbon free. Toit brewery #1 + book table weekend + cover charge sometimes + pub closes 11:30 PM-12:30 AM. Prices, hotel inventory, Wonderla/Bannerghatta/Nandi availability, and palace/museum timings must be live-verified before quotation. Do not rely on generic Bengaluru package inclusions without confirming exact areas MG Road/Indiranagar/Koramangala/Whitefield, Nandi Hills sunrise private car or shared, Wonderla/Bannerghatta tickets included, Lalbagh/Cubbon/Palace tickets included, brewery included or not, hotel 5★ Taj West End/Oberoi/Ritz or 3★, dosa + VV Puram Food Street included, and whether Mysore/Coorg/Ooty day trip included.', 5334),
  ('mysuru', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter Oct-Feb - PEAK + DASARA', NULL, 'weather: 16-28°C, pleasant + cool + best for palace + Dasara Sep-Oct #1 in India + flower show + illumination. crowd_level: VERY HIGH - Dasara Sep-Oct price_level: VERY HIGH - Dasara overall_score: 94 recommended: true reason: Best season + Dasara festival #1 + palace + Brindavan + pleasant + palace illumination Sunday best.', 5335),
