  ('mysuru', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended: Travel-agent rule: Mysuru budget = $25/day budget (hostel + dosa + auto + Palace + Brindavan), $50-$80/day mid (3★ + Palace + Brindavan + Chamundi + auto + silk shopping), $120-$250/day luxury (Lalitha Mahal Palace heritage + private car + Palace illumination private + Brindavan boat private + silk + sandalwood). Auto + bus best for city.', 5338),
