  ('mysuru', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '1 NIGHT MYSORE PALACE + CHAMUNDI + BRINDAVAN', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive Mysore from Bengaluru 150km 3hr expressway, 6 AM. Transfer to Palace area hotel. Morning Mysore Palace + durbar hall + illumination prep + Devaraja Market silk + sandalwood + Mysore Pak + Mysore Zoo + Karanji Lake + Jaganmohan Palace art gallery + St Philomena''s Church + afternoon Chamundi Hills Temple + Big Nandi + 1000 steps + city view sunset + evening Brindavan Gardens + KRS Dam + musical fountain 7-8 PM + boating + night Palace illumination Sunday 7-8 PM + Devaraja Market night + Mysore Pak. Day 2 Morning Lalitha Mahal Palace heritage high tea + Karanji Lake boating + Kukkarahalli Lake jogging + Railway Museum + GRS Fantasy Park + shopping KSIC silk saree + sandalwood oil factory + departure to Bengaluru 150 km 3 hr or Coorg 120 km 3 hr. Package Includes: 1 night Palace area hotel + private car + Palace + Chamundi + Brindavan + Zoo + Karanji + Devaraja Market + Mysore Pak. Excludes: Srirangapatna, Ranganathittu, Somnathpur, Lalitha Mahal stays.', 5353),
