  ('mysuru', 30, 'two-night-family-pattern', 'TWO-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive in Mysore from Bengaluru; private van to Palace family hotel with pool. Check-in rest. Afternoon Mysore Palace + Devaraja Market Mysore Pak + Zoo + Karanji Lake boating + birds + Jaganmohan Palace + St Philomena''s + evening Chamundi Hills city view sunset + Brindavan Gardens musical fountain 7-8 PM + boating + night Palace illumination Sunday. Overnight: Mysore Family Hotel Palace area Meals: Breakfast + Mysore Pak Day 2 Breakfast. Morning Srirangapatna Tipu Summer Palace + Tipu Tomb + Ranganathittu Bird Sanctuary boating + birds + crocodile + Balmuri + Edmuri Falls picnic + Somnathpur Hoysala Temple + afternoon GRS Fantasy Park water + land + Railway Museum toy + Karanji Lake + Kukkarahalli Lake + shopping silk + sandalwood + Channapatna toys. Overnight: Mysore Family Hotel Meals: Breakfast Day 3 Breakfast. Morning Lalitha Mahal Palace high tea + Karanji + Kukkarahalli + shopping + departure Bengaluru/Coorg. Meals: Breakfast', 5355),
  ('mysuru', 31, 'three-night-heritage-yoga-coorg-base-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT HERITAGE + YOGA + COORG BASE PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive Mysore + private car to Lalitha Mahal Palace heritage + check-in + palace welcome + high tea + heritage + afternoon Mysore Palace + Devaraja Market silk + sandalwood + Mysore Pak + Zoo + Karanji Lake + evening Chamundi Hills sunset + city view + Brindavan Gardens musical fountain + boating + night Palace illumination Sunday. Overnight: Lalitha Mahal Palace - Heritage Room Meals: Breakfast + High tea + Mysore Pak Day 2 Breakfast palace. Morning yoga shala Ashtanga + GSS + Mysore yoga + Karanji Lake + Kukkarahalli Lake jogging + afternoon Srirangapatna Tipu Summer Palace + Tipu Tomb + Ranganathaswamy Temple + Ranganathittu Bird Sanctuary boating + Balmuri + Edmuri Falls + Somnathpur Hoysala Temple + evening shopping KSIC silk + sandalwood oil factory + Channapatna toys + Mysore Pak. Alternative: Replace afternoon with Bylakuppe Tibetan Golden Temple + Namdroling + Buddhist + 80km + near Coorg. Overnight: Lalitha Mahal Palace Meals: Breakfast + Mysore Pak Day 3 Breakfast palace. Morning at leisure - Palace gardens + yoga + Karanji + Kukkarahalli + Railway Museum + GRS Fantasy Park + St Philomena''s + Jaganmohan + shopping Devaraja Market + KSIC silk + sandalwood + Mysore Pak + afternoon departure to Coorg 120km 3hr + check into Coorg coffee resort + coffee plantation + valley view + private cottage + bonfire + 2N Coorg + Nagarhole Safari 90km + Ooty 130km + Bandipur + circuit from Mysore base. Overnight: Coorg Coffee Resort / Mysore - Lalitha Mahal Palace Meals: Breakfast + Mysore Pak Day 4 Breakfast. Check-out + departure Bengaluru 150 km 3 hr or Coorg/Ooty/Nagarhole with palace + silk + sandalwood + Brindavan + Chamundi + Dasara + yoga memories. Meals: Breakfast', 5356),
