  ('mysuru', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == Day trip from Bengaluru` THEN: Bengaluru 6 AM drive 150 km 3 hr expressway + Palace + Chamundi + Brindavan + Devaraja Market + Zoo quick + return 9 PM. Rushed + no illumination Sunday + no Srirangapatna/Somnathpur. Reason: Possible but rushed + need 1 night for illumination + Brindavan evening. IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Day 1 Palace + Chamundi sunset + Zoo + Karanji + Devaraja Market + evening Brindavan musical fountain + night Palace illumination Sunday if Sunday, Day 2 St Philomena''s + Jaganmohan + Lalitha Mahal high tea + Karanji + Kukkarahalli + shopping silk + sandalwood + Mysore Pak + departure Bengaluru/Coorg. Core. Reason: Covers palace + hills + gardens + zoo + market. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Add Srirangapatna Tipu + Ranganathittu Bird Sanctuary boating + Somnathpur Hoysala Temple + Balmuri + Edmuri Falls + Bylakuppe Tibetan Golden Temple + yoga shala + GRS Fantasy Park + Railway Museum + shopping KSIC silk + sandalwood oil factory + Channapatna toys + Dasara if Sep-Oct. Reason: Complete heritage + birds + Hoysala + Tibetan + yoga + family + palace + hills + gardens. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Palace + Zoo + Brindavan Gardens musical fountain + Karanji Lake boating + Railway Museum + GRS Fantasy Park + Chamundi + Srirangapatna Tipu + Ranganathittu boating + Somnathpur + Devaraja Market Mysore Pak + St Philomena''s + Jaganmohan + Lalitha Mahal high tea + yoga + lakes. Reason: Family palace + zoo + gardens + birds + toys + fantasy park + hills + lakes + market + heritage + yoga. IF: `traveler_type == HERITAGE + YOGA` THEN: Palace + Wadiyar + Chamundi + Srirangapatna Tipu + Somnathpur Hoysala + Jaganmohan + Lalitha Mahal + St Philomena''s + Devaraja Market + yoga shalas Ashtanga + GSS + Mysore yoga + retreats 1 week + Karanji + Kukkarahalli + Brindavan + slow royal city. Reason: Heritage + yoga capital + royal + Wadiyar +