  ('coorg', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS COORG COFFEE + WATERFALLS + ELEPHANT', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive Coorg from Mysore 120km 3hr / Bengaluru 270km 6hr. Transfer to Madikeri coffee resort / homestay + valley view + plantation. Afternoon coffee plantation tour + Abbey Falls 8km 70ft + Madikeri Fort + Omkareshwara Temple + evening Raja''s Seat sunset 6 PM valley view + musical fountain + bonfire + coffee + plantation + valley + misty + Kodava pandi curry + kadumbuttu. Day 2 Morning 9 AM Dubare Elephant Camp 30km elephant bathing + feeding + 9-11 AM best + Cauvery Nisargadhama island + bamboo + deer + afternoon Namdroling Golden Temple Bylakuppe 40km Tibetan + 40ft Buddha + Tibetan market momos + thukpa + evening coffee resort bonfire + spa. Day 3 Morning Talacauvery birthplace of Cauvery 45km + Bhagamandala Triveni Sangama 35km + Iruppu Falls 75km 170ft + Chelavara Falls 40km + Mallalli Falls 55km + coffee shopping coffee powder + spices + honey + chocolate + wine + departure Mysore 120km 3hr or Bengaluru 270km 6hr with coffee + waterfalls + elephant + Tibetan + valley memories. Package Includes: 2 nights Madikeri coffee resort/homestay + private car + coffee plantation + Abbey + Raja''s Seat + Dubare + Golden Temple + Talacauvery + Bhagamandala + Iruppu + coffee shopping. Excludes: Tadiandamol trek, Brahmagiri, Pushpagiri, Barapole rafting, Nagarhole safari.', 5381),
  ('coorg', 29, 'three-night-honeymoon-coffee-waterfalls-pattern-ideal', 'THREE-NIGHT HONEYMOON + COFFEE + WATERFALLS PATTERN (IDEAL)', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive at Coorg from Mysore 120km 3hr / Bengaluru 270km 6hr and private transfer to luxury coffee resort near Madikeri - Taj Madikeri / Evolve Back / Tamara / Orange County. Check-in rest + private cottage valley view + coffee plantation + misty + valley + coffee + plantation + private balcony + bonfire. Afternoon coffee plantation tour + Abbey Falls 8km + Madikeri Fort + Omkareshwara Temple + evening Raja''s Seat sunset 6 PM valley view + musical fountain + bonfire + Kodava pandi curry + kadumbuttu + filter coffee. Optional evening add-on: Private bonfire + private spa + private valley view + private misty + private coffee + private plantation. Overnight: Coorg - Madikeri Coffee Resort - Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa / Evolve Back Chikkana Halli Estate / The Tamara Coorg / Orange County Meals: Breakfast + Kodava dinner Day 2 After breakfast, morning 9 AM Dubare Elephant Camp 30km elephant bathing + feeding + 9-11 AM best + Cauvery Nisargadhama island + bamboo + deer + afternoon Namdroling Golden Temple Bylakuppe 40km Tibetan + 40ft Buddha + Tibetan market momos + thukpa + evening coffee resort bonfire + spa + private valley view + misty + coffee + plantation. Overnight: Coorg - Madikeri Coffee Resort Meals: Breakfast + Bonfire Day 3 After breakfast, Talacauvery birthplace of Cauvery 45km + temple + kundike + Brahmagiri Hill + Bhagamandala Triveni Sangama 35km + temple + river confluence + Iruppu Falls 75km 170ft + Chelavara Falls 40km + Mallalli Falls 55km 200ft + offbeat + waterfalls monsoon best + afternoon coffee shopping coffee powder + spices + honey + chocolate + wine + Tibetan shopping thangkas + carpets + evening bonfire + farewell Kodava dinner. Overnight: Coorg - Madikeri Coffee Resort Meals: Breakfast + Kodava dinner Day 4 Morning at leisure - Coffee plantation walk + valley view + misty + Raja''s Seat sun