  ('coorg', 30, 'two-night-family-pattern', 'TWO-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive Coorg from Mysore/Bengaluru, private van to Madikeri family coffee resort/homestay with pool + valley view + plantation + family cottage + bonfire. Check-in rest. Afternoon coffee plantation tour + Abbey Falls 8km + Madikeri Fort + Omkareshwara Temple + evening Raja''s Seat sunset 6 PM + musical fountain + bonfire + Kodava food. Overnight: Coorg Family Coffee Resort/Homestay Madikeri Meals: Breakfast + Kodava dinner Day 2 Breakfast. Morning 9 AM Dubare Elephant Camp elephant bathing + feeding + Cauvery Nisargadhama island + bamboo + deer + afternoon Golden Temple Bylakuppe Tibetan + 40ft Buddha + Tibetan market momos + thukpa + evening coffee resort bonfire + family. Overnight: Coorg Family Coffee Resort/Homestay Meals: Breakfast + Bonfire Day 3 Breakfast. Morning Talacauvery + Bhagamandala + Iruppu Falls + Chelavara + Mallalli Falls + coffee shopping + departure Mysore/Bengaluru. Meals: Breakfast + Coffee', 5383),
  ('coorg', 31, 'three-night-adventure-trek-rafting-pattern', 'THREE-NIGHT ADVENTURE + TREK + RAFTING PATTERN', NULL, NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive Coorg + private jeep to Madikeri coffee resort + check-in + coffee plantation tour + Abbey Falls + Raja''s Seat sunset + Madikeri Fort + Omkareshwara Temple + evening bonfire + coffee + plantation + valley + misty + Kodava dinner + trek briefing. Overnight: Coorg - Madikeri Coffee Resort - Taj Madikeri / Evolve Back / Tamara / Orange County Meals: Breakfast + Kodava dinner Day 2 Breakfast. Early morning 6 AM jeep + guide to Nalknad Palace base + Tadiandamol trek 1748m highest in Coorg 8km one way 4-5hr + valley + misty + coffee + forest + Western Ghats + lunch packed + return 2 PM + rest + evening Barapole River Rafting grade 2-4 monsoon best Jul-Sep + adventure + 30km + bonfire + spa. Alternative: Brahmagiri trek 1608m 9km Talacauvery to Iruppu or Pushpagiri trek 1712m 6km + forest + wildlife + offbeat. Overnight: Coorg - Madikeri Coffee Resort Meals: Breakfast + Packed lunch + Bonfire dinner Day 3 Breakfast. Morning Dubare Elephant Camp + Golden Temple Bylakuppe + Cauvery Nisargadhama + afternoon Talacauvery + Bhagamandala + Iruppu Falls + Chelavara + Mallalli Falls + offbeat + waterfalls + evening Nagarhole Safari 90km tiger + leopard + elephant + gaur + jeep + morning/evening safari + offbeat + wildlife + nature + adventure + bonfire + farewell. Overnight: Coorg - Madikeri Coffee Resort Meals: Breakfast + Dinner Day 4 Breakfast. Morning coffee plantation walk + valley view + misty + Raja''s Seat sunrise + Abbey Falls morning + shopping coffee + spices + honey + wine + check out + transfer Mysore 120km 3hr or Bengaluru 270km 6hr with trek + rafting + elephant + waterfalls + coffee + valley memories. Meals: Breakfast', 5384),
