  ('coorg', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, '1. Starts with purpose 2. Groups by geography: Madikeri town + Raja''s Seat + Abbey Falls + Madikeri Fort + Omkareshwara Temple + coffee plantation tour together town core 1-8km walkable + auto + car, Dubare 30km + Bylakuppe Golden Temple 40km + Cauvery Nisargadhama 30km + Chiklihole 35km together elephant + Tibetan + island + river + 30-40km + car, Talacauvery 45km + Bhagamandala 35km + Iruppu 75km + Chelavara 40km + Mallalli 55km together pilgrimage + waterfalls + 35-75km + car + ghats, Tadiandamol 35km + Brahmagiri 45km + Pushpagiri 55km + Barapole 30km + Nagarhole 90km together trek + rafting + safari + adventure + offbeat + jeep + guide. 3. Uses hotel location strategically: MADIKERI TOWN + COFFEE RESORTS VALLEY VIEW for honeymoon + family + coffee + plantation + valley + misty + near Abbey + Raja''s Seat + Madikeri Fort + Omkareshwara + 2-5km from Madikeri + coffee plantation + valley view + private cottage + valley + misty + bonfire + pool + spa + honeymoon + #1 honeymoon luxury. DUBARE + BYLAKUPPE + CAUVERY for elephant + Tibetan + river + offbeat + river + forest + valley + quiet + honeymoon + offbeat + 30-40km from Madikeri + offbeat + river + forest + valley + quiet + honeymoon + offbeat. TALACAUVERY + BHAGAMANDALA + IRUPPU for pilgrimage + waterfall + offbeat + pilgrimage + waterfall + 35-75km from Madikeri + offbeat + pilgrimage + waterfall + quiet + honeymoon + offbeat + pilgrimage + waterfall + nature + offbeat. 4. Places Raja''s Seat sunset 6 PM + Abbey morning 9-11 AM + coffee plantation morning 10 AM-12 PM + Dubare 9-11 AM elephant bathing + Golden Temple 11 AM-12 PM + Talacauvery morning + Bhagamandala morning + Iruppu morning + Chelavara morning + Mallalli morning + Tadiandamol early 6 AM trek + Brahmagiri early + Pushpagiri early + Barapole morning rafting + Nagarhole morning safari. 5. Treats Coorg as 2-3 areas/day + coffee p