  ('chikkaballapur', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Winter Oct-Feb - PEAK + BEST', NULL, 'weather: 12-28°C, cool + misty + pleasant + best for Nandi Hills sunrise cloud bed + Skandagiri cloud trek + clear views + best for bikers + family. crowd_level: VERY HIGH weekend - Traffic jam Nandi ghats 5-7 AM price_level: HIGH overall_score: 94 recommended: true reason: Best season + cool + cloud bed + Nandi sunrise + Skandagiri above clouds + Adiyogi pleasant + bikers best + family best + clear + photography best.', 5391),
  ('chikkaballapur', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Summer Mar-May', NULL, 'weather: 22-35°C, hot + dry + Nandi sunrise still good but cloud bed less + Skandagiri hot + trek hard. crowd_level: HIGH weekend price_level: MEDIUM_HIGH overall_score: 70 recommended: true reason: Hot but still Nandi sunrise + Bhoga Temple + Adiyogi + bikers early morning okay + cloudless + trek hot + avoid afternoon.', 5392),
  ('chikkaballapur', 7, 'seasonality', 'SEASONALITY', 'Monsoon Jun-Sep - GREEN + MISTY + OFFBEAT', NULL, 'weather: 18-26°C, cool + rain + misty + green + Nandi Hills green + Skandagiri green + waterfalls + lush + rain + leeches + slippery trek. crowd_level: MEDIUM price_level: MEDIUM overall_score: 86 recommended: true reason: Green + misty + Nandi Hills lush + Skandagiri green + photography + offbeat + less crowd + Adiyogi pleasant + but trek slippery + leeches + need raincoat + need leech socks + road slippery.', 5393),
  ('chikkaballapur', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended:', 5394),
  ('chikkaballapur', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', NULL, NULL, 'Family: BLR Airport/Bengaluru -> Nandi Hills -> Chikkaballapur private AC car $20-$25 1-1.5hr + family resort near Nandi base + valley view + pool + family cottage + near Nandi + Bhoga + Adiyogi. Honeymoon/Weekend Couple: Private car + Discovery Village Nandi Hills / Q-Stays private cottage + valley view + bonfire + Nandi sunrise private + Adiyogi private + Skandagiri private trek + bonfire private. Luxury: Private luxury car + Discovery Village + private cottage + valley view + pool + butler + private guide + Nandi sunrise private + Bhoga private + Adiyogi private + Skandagiri private + Lepakshi private. Budget/Bikers: Bike rental Bengaluru $10/day + 4 AM ride to Nandi Hills sunrise + KSRTC bus + auto $2-$3 + homestay near Nandi base $20 + Nandi dosa $1 + filter coffee $1. Senior: AC taxi door-to-door + resort near Nandi base flat + elevator + valley view + car for Nandi + Bhoga + Adiyogi + Muddenahalli + Lepakshi + avoid Skandagiri trek + Gudibande steps.', 5395),
  ('chikkaballapur', 18, 'family-travel', 'FAMILY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'child_friendly_score: 84 best_ages: 3-15 - Nandi Hills drive + Adiyogi light show + Bhoga Temple flat + Muddenahalli museum + Gudibande easy + Lepakshi flat Rules: For young children: Prefer: Nandi Hills drive + top flat + Bhoga Temple flat + Adiyogi flat + Muddenahalli flat + Gudibande easy base + Lepakshi flat + Nandi dosa + filter coffee + Adiyogi cafe + resort pool + bonfire Avoid: Skandagiri night trek 8km + Kalavara Durga 3km + Gudibande Fort steps with toddler + stroller + steep + night + forest + leeches + risky + need fitness + avoid trek with small kids', 5396),
  ('chikkaballapur', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 68 romance_score: 70 privacy_score: 72 luxury_score: 60 Recommended: Chikkaballapur is a good weekend honeymoon from Bengaluru + not a main honeymoon like Coorg but a weekend romantic 1N:', 5397),
