  ('sarahan', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night/gateway` THEN: Bhimakali Temple 51 Shakti Peeth + wooden architecture + 800 years old + Bhimakali Palace + Bird Pheasantry + Jujurana + monal + HPTDC Srikhand + Shrikhand Mahadev view 5155m + apple orchards + Sutlej Valley + deodar + small market + woolens + Kinnauri cap + evening aarti + HPTDC lawn + Shrikhand view + bonfire + stars + quiet + offbeat + gateway Kinnaur + acclimatization for Kinnaur 2758m + Kalpa + Sangla + Chitkul. Reason: 1N enough + temple + gateway + acclimatisation + offbeat + quiet + apple orchards + Shrikhand view + birding + safe + family + offbeat + temple + Shrikhand + apple orchards + gateway + Kinnaur + Spiti. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Too much for Sarahan alone unless adding Shrikhand Mahadev trek base 5-6 days + Buran Ghati trek base 3-4 days + birding + village walk + apple orchards stay + rest + acclimatisation. Reason: 1N enough for temple + gateway + Shrikhand view + bird park + apple orchards + village walk + offbeat + quiet + silence + temple town. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Bhimakali Temple flat + Palace flat + Bird Park flat + HPTDC lawn flat + apple orchards flat + village walk flat + small market flat + safe + offbeat + acclimatisation for Kinnaur 2758m + Kalpa + Sangla + Chitkul + family + safe + flat + easy + offbeat + temple + Shrikhand + apple orchards + birding. Reason: Family temple + bird park + HPTDC lawn + apple orchards + village walk + safe + flat + easy + offbeat + acclimatisation for Kinnaur + gateway + temple + Shrikhand + apple orchards. IF: `traveler_type == TEMPLE + CULTURE` THEN: Bhimakali Temple 51 Shakti Peeth + wooden architecture + 800 years old + Bhimakali Palace + museum + Rampur Bushahr history + Bird Pheasantry + Jujurana + monal + Western Tragopan + HPTDC Srikhand + Shrikhand Mahadev view 5155m + apple orchards + Sutlej Valley + deodar + small market + woolens + Ki