  ('kasol', 36, 'data-quality', 'DATA QUALITY', NULL, NULL, 'information_completeness: 90/100 last_updated: 2026-08-29 last_verified: PARTIALLY_LIVE_VERIFIED verified_by: INDIA_DESTINATION_KNOWLEDGE_DATASET sources: IMPORTANT: This Kasol file is suitable for itinerary design, travellers profiling, hotel-area strategy, and initial package planning. Kasol best + Parvati River + Nature Park + Chalal 2km + Chalal Village + flea market + Israeli cafes + hummus + shakshuka + falafel + Manikaran 5km Gurudwara + hot springs + langar + Barshaini 16km + Kheerganga trek 12km 2960m hot springs + camping + meadows + Tosh Village 20km 2400m + cafe + party + meadows + Malana Village 21km ancient + oldest democracy + Rasol 5km + Grahan 8km + Sar Pass 13km 4200m + Pin Parvati 11 days + best trekking base Parvati Valley + backpacker + solo + budget + hostel $8-$15 + cottage $20-$40 + cafe $4-$6 + shared jeep $2-$5 + beer $3 + party + trance + riverside + offbeat + quiet + silence + nature. Prices, hotel inventory, HRTC bus timings, shared/private jeep timings, Kheerganga trek opening, Tosh/Malana jeep timings, Parvati Valley Road condition must be live-verified before quotation. Do not rely on generic Kasol package inclusions without confirming exact Kasol Market + Parvati River + Nature Park + Chalal + flea market + Israeli cafes + Manikaran Gurudwara hot springs + Barshaini + Kheerganga trek + Tosh Village + Malana Village + Rasol + Grahan + Sar Pass + Pin Parvati + hotel area Kasol market/riverside cottage/hostel / Tosh guesthouse / Kheerganga camping, and whether private jeep / shared jeep/guide/trek guide/camping/bonfire/riverside included.', 6000),
