  ('jispa', 10, 'budget-strategy', 'BUDGET STRATEGY', NULL, NULL, 'Where money can be saved: Where saving money is usually NOT recommended: Travel-agent rule: 1N in premium camps $70 Bhaga River view + green meadows + bonfire + Milky Way beats 2N in far basic camps. You pay for river location + green meadows + last green + acclimatisation + Baralacha La base.', 6005),
  ('jispa', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', NULL, NULL, 'Family: Private car/Innova from Manali 100km $60-$80 4hr / Bhuntar KUU 100km $70 4hr to premium camps $60-$90 / Hotel Ibex $50-$70 Bhaga River view + green meadows + family room + safe + acclimatisation + bonfire + Milky Way. Honeymoon: NOT ideal honeymoon - If adventure honeymoon only - Private car + premium camps $80 Bhaga River view + green meadows + bonfire + Milky Way + offbeat + 1N + quiet + river side. Luxury: No luxury - Premium camps $60-$90 + Hotel Ibex $50-$70 best + private car $80 + Bhaga River view + green meadows + last green + offbeat + best in Jispa. Budget: HRTC bus Manali-Jispa $10 4hr / Manali-Leh bus $20 6hr to Jispa / Keylong + shared jeep Manali-Jispa $15 + basic camps $35-$50 + dhaba $3-$5. Senior: Private car door-to-door + Hotel Ibex / premium camps flat + near river + near village + minimal walking + car helps + acclimatisation + easy + safe + avoid Baralacha La direct + need 1N Jispa.', 6006),
