  ('kausani', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Honeymoon', 'honeymoon', 'Private sedan/SUV with scenic stops; better privacy and a smoother hill journey. reason: Kausani involves a substantial road transfer after the airport or railway station, so pre-arranged transport reduces arrival stress.', 6124),
  ('kausani', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Luxury', 'luxury', 'Premium private SUV with professional driver; prioritize comfort, luggage space, and flexible sightseeing.', 6125),
  ('kausani', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Train to Kathgodam followed by shared taxi/bus where practical; cheapest but slower and less flexible. Local buses and taxis are available from the Kumaon region.', 6126),
