  ('dirang', 12, 'airport-transfer-logic', 'AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Budget', 'budget', 'Shared taxi or economical cab via Tezpur/Bhalukpong. *****reason:***** Dirang is fundamentally a *****road-based Himalayan destination*****. Public buses and shared taxis are available, but private vehicles offer considerably greater flexibility for valleys and mountain attractions.', 6751),
