  ('lucknow', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast Morning: → Privately guided Lucknow heritage experience → Bara Imambara → Bhul Bhulaiya → Shahi Baoli → Rumi Darwaza Afternoon: → Chota Imambara → Husainabad heritage precinct → Curated architectural photography Evening: → Premium Awadhi culinary experience → Overnight at Lucknow', 6924),
