  ('ayodhya', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast → Privately guided Ayodhya heritage experience → Shri Ram Janmabhoomi Mandir → Hanuman Garhi → Kanak Bhawan Afternoon: → Dashrath Mahal → Curated cultural exploration Evening: → Sarayu Ghat aarti experience → Fine dining → Overnight at Ayodhya', 7065),
