  ('ayodhya', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast → Curated Ayodhya cultural experience → Heritage & temple exploration Afternoon: → Spa / wellness → Premium afternoon leisure → Private shopping Evening: → Private Sarayu sunset experience → Fine dining → Overnight at Ayodhya', 7068),
