  ('mumbai', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: MODERATE public_transport_accessibility: VARIABLE hotel_accessibility: GENERALLY_HIGH_IN_MODERN_PREMIUM_HOTELS attraction_accessibility: MUST_BE_VERIFIED_PER_ATTRACTION Rule: Do not assume heritage buildings, ferry infrastructure, Elephanta Caves, markets or railway stations are completely step-free. Additional notes: Mumbai accessibility should therefore be classified as: MODERATE_WITH_SIGNIFICANT_LOCATION_SPECIFIC_VARIATION.', 7092),
