  ('mumbai', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS', NULL, '### Day 1 Arrival at Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport (BOM), Mumbai → Private AC car / prepaid taxi / app cab transfer to South Mumbai or central Mumbai hotel → Hotel check-in & relax after arrival Afternoon: → Begin at the Gateway of India overlooking Mumbai Harbour → Explore the heritage architecture around Colaba → Walk through the Kala Ghoda arts & heritage district → Continue towards Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Terminus (CSMT), a UNESCO World Heritage Site → Scenic drive along Marine Drive towards Nariman Point Evening: → Sunset experience at Marine Drive / Queen''s Necklace → Explore Colaba Causeway → Dinner featuring Mumbai''s diverse Maharashtrian, coastal or contemporary cuisine → Hotel BOM is Mumbai''s principal international and domestic aviation gateway and provides convenient access to Mumbai''s major business, heritage and entertainment districts. Mumbai also acts as the primary gateway for excursions towards Thane and Navi Mumbai within the metropolitan region and the Sahyadri hill destinations of Lonavala and Khandala. ### Day 2 Morning: Breakfast → Ferry from Gateway of India towards Elephanta Island → Explore the UNESCO World Heritage-listed Elephanta Caves → Discover the rock-cut cave temples and monumental sculptures → Return by ferry to Gateway of India Afternoon: → Lunch around Colaba / Fort → Explore Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Vastu Sangrahalaya area → Continue through Kala Ghoda and Mumbai''s heritage precincts → Drive past Marine Drive → Visit Hanging Gardens / Malabar Hill viewpoints according to available time Evening: → Bandra-Worli Sea Link scenic drive → Bandstand / Carter Road → Mumbai café, rooftop or coastal dining experience → Hotel Optional alternative instead of Elephanta Island: BOLLYWOOD_AND_BANDRA: → Guided Bollywood / film-industry experience where available → Bandra heritage neighbourhoods → Bandstand → Mount Mary area → Carter Road → Juhu Beach NAVI_MUMBAI: → Drive across the Mumbai metropolitan region towards Navi Mumbai → Explore Palm Beach Road → Nerul / Seawoods urban precinct → Jewel of Navi Mumbai → Belapur waterfront / recreational areas → Return to Mumbai THANE: → Upvan Lake → Yeoor Hills surroundings → Thane Creek / urban nature experience according to access and timing → Local shopping & dining → Return to Mumbai ### Day 3 Recommended first-time option: → Early morning private AC car departure from Mumbai → Drive towards Lonavala & Khandala in the Sahyadri Hills → Explore Lonavala''s scenic hill landscapes → Visit Bhushi Dam area according to season and local access conditions → Continue towards Tiger Point / Tiger''s Leap viewpoints → Explore scenic valleys and monsoon landscapes according to season Afternoon: → Continue towards Khandala → Visit accessible valley viewpoints → Relaxed hill-station lunch → Local Chikki & fudge shopping in Lonavala → Return towards Mumbai by evening Evening: → Farewell Mumbai dinner → Marine Drive / Bandra evening experience → Hotel Optional alternative instead of Lonavala & Khandala: KANHERI_AND_SANJAY_GANDHI_NATIONAL_PARK: → Sanjay Gandhi National Park → Kanheri Caves → Forest landscapes → Ancient Buddhist rock-cut heritage → Nature photography NAVI_MUMBAI_AND_THANE: → Navi Mumbai urban sightseeing → Palm Beach Road → Nerul / Seawoods → Continue towards Thane → Upvan Lake → Metropolitan leisure & dining HERITAGE: → Gateway of India → CSMT → Kala Ghoda → Fort heritage district → Mani Bhavan → Marine Drive NATURE: → Sanjay Gandhi National Park → Kanheri Caves → Maharashtra Nature Park / urban nature experience → Thane Creek region → Lonavala & Khandala landscapes FAMILY: → Elephanta Caves → Nehru Science Centre → Sanjay Gandhi National Park → Navi Mumbai leisure areas → Lonavala & Khandala excursion HONEYMOON: → Marine Drive sunset → Bandra waterfront couple photography → Private Lonavala–Khandala scenic drive → Couple spa experience → Romantic rooftop / sea-view dinner LUXURY: → Chauffeured Mumbai heritage tour → Luxury harbour / yacht experience where available → Premium South Mumbai hotel → Private Lonavala–Khandala excursion → Spa & fine dining FOOD: → Vada Pav & Mumbai street-food tasting → Pav Bhaji → Maharashtrian cuisine → Coastal seafood → Irani café experience → Lonavala Chikki For only 3 nights, prioritize: SOUTH_MUMBAI_HERITAGE_AND_MARINE_DRIVE + ELEPHANTA_AND_BANDRA + LONAVALA_AND_KHANDALA OR MUMBAI_HERITAGE + NAVI_MUMBAI_AND_THANE + LONAVALA_KHANDALA_DAY_TRIP rather than trying to add Pune, Nashik, Mahabaleshwar and other distant Maharashtra destinations within the same short stay. ### Day 4 Breakfast → Leisurely morning / final Mumbai exploration → Souvenir, handicraft or fashion shopping → Hotel checkout → Private transfer / taxi to Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport (BOM) → Departure', 7096),
