  ('chandigarh', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast Choose ONE: ROMANTIC_LEISURE → Couple spa & wellness → Luxury hotel relaxation → Premium afternoon tea → Sukhna Lake sunset NATURE_AND_PHOTOGRAPHY → Sukhna Lake sunrise → Chandigarh gardens → Leisure Valley → Couple photography CITY_LIFESTYLE → Sector 17 → Elante / premium shopping → Café hopping → Relaxed city exploration Evening: → Rooftop / fine-dining experience → Overnight at Chandigarh', 7404),
  ('chandigarh', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast → Relaxed Chandigarh exploration → Government Museum & Art Gallery → Le Corbusier Centre / architecture experience → Local shopping Afternoon: → Hotel leisure → Final couple photography Evening: → Sukhna Lake → Farewell romantic dinner → Overnight at Chandigarh', 7405),
  ('chandigarh', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 7', NULL, 'Breakfast → Leisure morning → Hotel checkout → Private transfer to Chandigarh Airport (IXC) → Departure', 7406),
