  ('ahmedabad', 30, 'six-nights-family-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 4', NULL, 'Early Breakfast → Transfer towards Bhuj / Kutch → Continue by private vehicle to Dhordo → Family resort / tent accommodation check-in Afternoon: → Dhordo → White Rann → Family photography → Local handicrafts Evening: → White Rann sunset → Cultural programme → Family dinner → Overnight at Dhordo / White Rann', 7457),
  ('ahmedabad', 30, 'six-nights-family-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast → Kutch sightseeing Morning: → Kala Dungar / Black Hill → Panoramic Rann landscapes Afternoon: → Kutchi village experience → Handicraft demonstrations → Family cultural activities Evening: → Resort leisure → Cultural entertainment → Overnight at Dhordo / White Rann', 7458),
  ('ahmedabad', 30, 'six-nights-family-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS FAMILY PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast → Hotel checkout → Transfer towards Bhuj → Flight / onward journey to Ahmedabad → Family hotel check-in Afternoon: → Hazrat-style? No — Ahmedabad local leisure → Riverfront / shopping → Gujarati handicrafts & souvenirs Evening: → Farewell family dinner → Overnight at Ahmedabad', 7459),
