  ('ahmedabad', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 1', NULL, 'Arrival at Ahmedabad Airport (AMD) → Private luxury airport transfer → Premium / heritage hotel check-in → Relax and refresh Afternoon: → Private Sabarmati Ashram experience → Chauffeured Riverfront orientation Evening: → Premium Gujarati fine dining → Overnight at Ahmedabad', 7461),
  ('ahmedabad', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast Morning: → Privately guided Historic Ahmedabad tour → Traditional Pol neighbourhoods → Sidi Saiyyed Mosque → Jama Masjid → Architectural heritage Afternoon: → Private Adalaj Stepwell visit → Curated textile / handicraft experience → Premium shopping Evening: → Spa & wellness → Fine dining → Overnight at Ahmedabad', 7462),
  ('ahmedabad', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 3', NULL, 'Breakfast → Private chauffeured excursion to Modhera & Patan → Modhera Sun Temple → Rani ki Vav → Curated Patola textile experience Afternoon: → Premium regional lunch → Heritage photography Evening: → Return to Ahmedabad → Fine dining / leisure → Overnight at Ahmedabad', 7463),
  ('ahmedabad', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 4', NULL, 'Early Breakfast → Private airport transfer → Premium flight / preferred connection to Bhuj → Private luxury SUV transfer to Dhordo → Premium resort / luxury tent check-in Afternoon: → Curated Dhordo & White Rann experience → Private Kutchi handicraft interaction → Scenic photography Evening: → Premium White Rann sunset experience → Private / curated cultural programme → Fine dining → Overnight at Dhordo / White Rann', 7464),
  ('ahmedabad', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast → Private Kutch exploration Morning: → Kala Dungar / Black Hill → Panoramic Great Rann views → Chauffeured scenic touring Afternoon: → Curated artisan village experience → Premium local handicraft shopping → Resort spa / relaxation Evening: → Sunset over the Rann → Private dining / luxury resort experience → Overnight at Dhordo / White Rann', 7465),
  ('ahmedabad', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast → Leisure morning → Private transfer to Bhuj → Premium onward connection to Ahmedabad → Private hotel transfer → Luxury hotel check-in Afternoon: → Spa & wellness → Premium Ahmedabad shopping → Leisure time Evening: → Farewell fine-dining Gujarati experience → Overnight at Ahmedabad', 7466),
  ('ahmedabad', 31, 'six-nights-luxury-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS LUXURY PATTERN', 'Day 7', NULL, 'Breakfast → Leisure morning → Hotel checkout → Private luxury transfer to Ahmedabad Airport (AMD) → Departure', 7467),
  ('ahmedabad', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong', NULL, '', 7468),
  ('ahmedabad', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', 'What an experienced planner does differently', NULL, 'UNESCO_OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM_AND_SULTANATE_HERITAGE + FOOD_RIVERFRONT_AND_CITY_CULTURE rather than maximum attraction count.', 7469),
  ('ahmedabad', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: trip_length <= 1 night THEN: prioritize_OLD_CITY_HERITAGE + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE AND: include_RIVERFRONT_OR_ONE_GUJARATI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE_IF_TIME_ALLOWS Reason: Very short Ahmedabad stays gain the greatest value from the city''s UNESCO heritage, Gandhi history, distinctive architecture and Gujarati cultural identity. IF: trip_length == 2_OR_3_nights AND: traveler_interest == FIRST_TIME_AHMEDABAD THEN: prioritize_OLD_CITY_HERITAGE_WALK + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + JAMA_MASJID + SABARMATI_RIVERFRONT AND: add_KANKARIA_OR_SCIENCE_CITY + ONE_GUJARATI_FOOD_AND_SHOPPING_EXPERIENCE Reason: This creates the strongest balanced introduction to Ahmedabad through UNESCO heritage, Gandhi history, Sultanate architecture, contemporary recreation, Gujarati food and everyday city culture. IF: trip_length >= 4 nights AND: traveler_interest == FIRST_TIME_AHMEDABAD THEN: prefer_OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SULTANATE_HERITAGE + RIVERFRONT + KANKARIA_OR_SCIENCE_CITY AND: add_CALICO_MUSEUM + SARKHEJ_ROZA + DADA_HARIR + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE + TEXTILE_SHOPPING_AND_LOCAL_FOOD Reason: Longer stays should move beyond headline attractions into Ahmedabad''s textiles, stepwells, specialist architecture, museums, religious heritage and neighborhood culture. IF: trip_length >= 5 nights THEN: consider_AHMEDABAD_CITY + ADALAJ_GANDHINAGAR + MODHERA_OR_PATAN Reason: Ahmedabad has substantial depth, but longer Gujarat itineraries become stronger when the city is combined with important nearby stepwell, temple, museum and regional heritage destinations. IF: trip_type == HONEYMOON THEN: prefer_PREMIUM_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_OR_HERITAGE_STYLE_HOTEL + PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER + RIVERFRONT_EVENING AND: increase_PRIVATE_HERITAGE_TOUR + FINE_DINING + SPA + ADALAJ_OR_SARKHEJ + FREE_TIME Reason: Ahmedabad works best for honeymooners as a culturally rich premium city break with food, architecture and private sightseeing rather than as a conventional secluded resort destination. IF: traveler_type == FAMILY THEN: prioritize_SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA_LAKE + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + RIVERFRONT AND: include_SHORT_OLD_CITY_HERITAGE + SELECTED_MUSEUM_OR_RELIGIOUS_SITE + FAMILY_DINING AND: reduce_LONG_HERITAGE_WALKS + PEAK_SUMMER_HEAT Reason: Families generally enjoy Ahmedabad most when heritage and education are balanced with Science City, recreational attractions, lakefront activity and comfortable food breaks. IF: traveler_type == FAMILY_WITH_YOUNG_CHILDREN THEN: prefer_SHORT_SIGHTSEEING_BLOCKS + CAB + SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA + RECREATIONAL_STOPS AND: include_AQUATIC_GALLERY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + RIVERFRONT + CHILD_FRIENDLY_FOOD AND: reduce_LONG_OLD_CITY_WALKS + MULTIPLE_STEPWELLS + MIDDAY_SUMMER_SIGHTSEEING Reason: Young children benefit from Ahmedabad''s interactive science attractions and recreational areas more than from long architecture-heavy walking schedules. IF: traveler_type == LUXURY THEN: prefer_FIVE_STAR_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_HOTEL AND: increase_CHAUFFEURED_CAR + PRIVATE_HERITAGE_GUIDE + SPECIALIST_ARCHITECTURE_OR_TEXTILE_EXPERIENCE + PREMIUM_DINING + SPA + CURATED_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS Reason: Ahmedabad luxury travel is strongest through premium accommodation, private transport, expert cultural interpretation, textile and architecture experiences and high-quality dining. IF: traveler_type == BUDGET THEN: prefer_WELL_CONNECTED_BUDGET_HOTEL + METRO_BRTS_AMTS + AUTO_RICKSHAW + SELECTIVE_APP_CAB AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_OLD_CITY_WALKING + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + PUBLIC_HERITAGE + RIVERFRONT + LOCAL_FOOD Reason: Ahmedabad is highly suitable for budget travelers because its historic neighborhoods, public spaces, local food and public transport can provide substantial destination value at relatively low cost. IF: traveler_interest == UNESCO_HERITAGE THEN: prioritize_OLD_CITY_POLS + JAMA_MASJID + BHADRA + TEEN_DARWAZA AND: include_SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + TRADITIONAL_HAVELIS + HINDU_AND_JAIN_HERITAGE Reason: UNESCO recognizes Ahmedabad''s historic walled city for its surviving urban structure, Sultanate architecture, traditional pol settlement pattern and multicultural religious heritage. IF: traveler_interest == OLD_CITY_HERITAGE THEN: prefer_OFFICIAL_OR_SPECIALIST_GUIDED_HERITAGE_WALK AND: include_KALUPUR_SWAMINARAYAN_TEMPLE + POLS + KAVI_DALPATRAM_CHOWK + MANEK_CHOWK + JAMA_MASJID Reason: Ahmedabad''s heritage value lies not only in individual monuments but in the interconnected streets, pols, community spaces, religious structures and domestic architecture of the historic city. IF: traveler_interest == HERITAGE_WALK THEN: allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS AND: prefer_EARLY_MORNING_OR_OFFICIAL_WALK_TIMING AND: verify_CURRENT_BOOKING + MEETING_POINT + DURATION + OPERATIONAL_STATUS Reason: The municipal Morning Heritage Walk follows an interpreted route from the Kalupur area through pol neighborhoods and historic landmarks toward Jama Masjid and is considerably more informative than unguided monument hopping. IF: traveler_interest == GANDHI_HERITAGE THEN: prioritize_SABARMATI_ASHRAM AND: include_HRIDAY_KUNJ + GANDHI_MUSEUM_CONTEXT + DANDI_MARCH_HISTORY + KHADI_AND_FREEDOM_MOVEMENT_INTERPRETATION Reason: Sabarmati Ashram was Gandhi''s home from 1917 until 1930 and functioned as one of the principal centres of India''s freedom movement. IF: traveler_interest == SULTANATE_ARCHITECTURE THEN: prioritize_JAMA_MASJID + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + BHADRA + TEEN_DARWAZA AND: include_SARKHEJ_ROZA + DADA_HARIR_STEPWELL_IF_TIME_ALLOWS Reason: Ahmedabad preserves an exceptional concentration of Gujarat Sultanate architecture and a distinctive architectural synthesis visible across mosques, tombs, gateways and water structures. IF: traveler_interest == ISLAMIC_ARCHITECTURE THEN: prioritize_JAMA_MASJID + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + SARKHEJ_ROZA AND: include_BHADRA + TEEN_DARWAZA + DADA_HARIR Reason: These sites provide the strongest introduction to Ahmedabad''s Sultanate-era religious and civic architecture. IF: traveler_interest == JAIN_HERITAGE THEN: prioritize_HUTHEESING_JAIN_TEMPLE + OLD_CITY_JAIN_TEMPLES AND: include_POL_ARCHITECTURE + CALICO_MUSEUM_JAIN_COLLECTIONS_WHERE_RELEVANT Reason: Jain religious institutions and mercantile communities form an important component of Ahmedabad''s multicultural historic urban fabric. IF: traveler_interest == STEPWELLS THEN: prioritize_DADA_HARIR_STEPWELL + ADALAJ_STEPWELL AND: allocate_ROAD_TRANSFER + WALKING_AND_STAIR_TIME Reason: The Ahmedabad region contains exceptional historic water architecture, but stepwell visits involve stairs and should not be treated as universally accessible attractions. IF: traveler_interest == ADALAJ_STEPWELL THEN: allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS_WITH_TRANSFERS AND: combine_WITH_GANDHINAGAR_OR_NORTHERN_AHMEDABAD_IF_ROUTING_IS_EFFICIENT Reason: Adalaj lies outside Ahmedabad''s central sightseeing core and works most efficiently as part of a northern regional excursion. IF: traveler_interest == TEXTILES THEN: prioritize_CALICO_MUSEUM + TRADITIONAL_TEXTILE_SHOPPING AND: include_LAW_GARDEN + OLD_CITY_MARKETS + SELECTED_SPECIALIST_TEXTILE_STORES Reason: Ahmedabad''s historic relationship with textile production, merchant patronage, handloom traditions and textile scholarship is fundamental to the city''s cultural identity. IF: traveler_interest == CALICO_MUSEUM THEN: verify_PRE_REGISTRATION + CURRENT_TOUR_AVAILABILITY + WEEKLY_CLOSURE AND: allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS_DEPENDING_ON_SELECTED_GALLERY_TOUR AND: do_not_treat_AS_DROP_IN_MUSEUM Reason: The Calico Museum operates through structured guided gallery tours, with visitor numbers and access procedures controlled through advance registration. IF: traveler_interest == MODERN_ARCHITECTURE THEN: prioritize_MILL_OWNERS_ASSOCIATION_BUILDING + SELECTED_BV_DOSHI_AND_MODERNIST_CONTEXT AND: include_SANSKAR_KENDRA + TAGORE_HALL + CEPT_ARCHITECTURAL_ENVIRONMENT_WHERE_ACCESSIBLE Reason: Ahmedabad occupies an internationally important position in twentieth-century architecture through buildings and institutions associated with Le Corbusier, B. V. Doshi and other leading architects. IF: traveler_interest == LE_CORBUSIER THEN: prioritize_MILL_OWNERS_ASSOCIATION_BUILDING AND: include_OTHER_ACCESSIBLE_MODERNIST_ARCHITECTURE + SPECIALIST_ARCHITECTURAL_CONTEXT AND: verify_CURRENT_BUILDING_ACCESS_BEFORE_VISIT Reason: Le Corbusier''s Ahmedabad work forms a major part of the city''s modern architectural identity, but individual buildings may have restricted or institution-specific visitor access. IF: traveler_interest == ARCHITECTURE THEN: combine_UNESCO_OLD_CITY + SULTANATE_MONUMENTS + STEPWELLS + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE Reason: Ahmedabad is unusually strong because its architectural narrative extends from medieval Sultanate and vernacular pol architecture through Jain heritage, stepwells and internationally important modernism. IF: traveler_interest == ART_AND_DESIGN THEN: prioritize_CALICO_MUSEUM + TEXTILES + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE AND: include_POL_WOODWORK + STONE_CARVING + SELECTED_CONTEMPORARY_DESIGN_SPACES Reason: Ahmedabad''s design identity combines textiles, carved historic architecture, traditional craftsmanship and major twentieth-century architectural experimentation. IF: traveler_interest == SCIENCE_AND_TECHNOLOGY THEN: prioritize_GUJARAT_SCIENCE_CITY AND: include_AQUATIC_GALLERY + ROBOTICS_GALLERY + ASTRONOMY_AND_SPACE_SCIENCE_GALLERY Reason: Gujarat Science City provides Ahmedabad''s strongest concentration of interactive science attractions and includes major aquatic, robotics, astronomy, nature and educational facilities. IF: traveler_interest == SCIENCE_CITY THEN: allocate_HALF_DAY_TO_FULL_DAY AND: preselect_AQUATIC + ROBOTICS + ASTRONOMY_OR_OTHER_PRIORITY_GALLERIES AND: verify_CURRENT_FEES + LAST_ENTRY + SHOW_TIMINGS + TEMPORARY_CLOSURES Reason: Science City extends over more than 107 hectares and contains numerous separate galleries, making unrealistic attraction stacking a common planning mistake. IF: traveler_interest == AQUARIUM THEN: prioritize_SCIENCE_CITY_AQUATIC_GALLERY AND: allow_SEPARATE_ENTRY_AND_VISIT_TIME Reason: Science City''s Aquatic Gallery is a major standalone visitor experience with numerous aquatic zones and hundreds of species, so it should not be treated as a brief incidental exhibit. IF: traveler_interest == FAMILY_AND_SCIENCE THEN: prioritize_SCIENCE_CITY AND: combine_WITH_KANKARIA_OR_RIVERFRONT_ON_A_SEPARATE_HALF_DAY Reason: Science City is substantial enough to require dedicated time, while Kankaria and the Riverfront provide complementary outdoor and recreational experiences. IF: traveler_interest == KANKARIA_LAKE THEN: prefer_LATE_AFTERNOON_OR_EVENING AND: include_LAKEFRONT + SELECTED_FAMILY_ATTRACTIONS AND: verify_CURRENT_WEEKLY_CLOSURES + INDIVIDUAL_ACTIVITY_STATUS Reason: Kankaria is most rewarding as a recreational family and evening cluster rather than as an exposed midday sightseeing stop during hotter months. IF: traveler_interest == SABARMATI_RIVERFRONT THEN: prefer_LATE_AFTERNOON_OR_EVENING AND: include_WALKING + PHOTOGRAPHY + RECREATION_IF_OPERATIONAL Reason: The Riverfront functions primarily as Ahmedabad''s contemporary outdoor leisure and public-space experience and is more comfortable outside peak daytime heat. IF: traveler_interest == FAMILY_AND_RECREATION THEN: prioritize_SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA + RIVERFRONT AND: include_SHORT_SABARMATI_ASHRAM_OR_HERITAGE_VISIT Reason: Ahmedabad''s strongest family itineraries balance cultural education with interactive and recreational attractions. IF: traveler_interest == PHOTOGRAPHY THEN: prioritize_OLD_CITY_POLS + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + SARKHEJ_ROZA + STEPWELLS AND: include_RIVERFRONT + TRADITIONAL_MARKETS + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE AND: prefer_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + EVENING Reason: Ahmedabad offers unusually diverse photographic subjects including carved wood, stone latticework, pol streets, religious architecture, stepwells, markets, modernist geometry and contemporary riverfront landscapes. IF: traveler_interest == STREET_AND_URBAN_PHOTOGRAPHY THEN: prefer_OLD_CITY_POLS + MANEK_CHOWK + BHADRA_MARKETS + LAW_GARDEN AND: respect_RELIGIOUS_SITE + RESIDENTIAL_POL + PEOPLE_PHOTOGRAPHY_RESTRICTIONS Reason: The strongest street photography comes from Ahmedabad''s living neighborhoods and markets, but the historic city remains a residential and religious environment rather than an open-air photography set. IF: traveler_interest == GASTRONOMY THEN: prefer_OLD_CITY + MANEK_CHOWK + TRADITIONAL_GUJARATI_RESTAURANTS + SELECTED_WESTERN_CITY_DINING AND: include_GUJARATI_THALI + FARSAN + FAFDA_JALEBI + KHAMAN + KHANDVI + SEASONAL_LOCAL_DISHES Reason: Ahmedabad is one of India''s strongest vegetarian city-food destinations and rewards travelers who explore both traditional Gujarati cuisine and contemporary dining. IF: traveler_interest == VEGETARIAN_FOOD THEN: include_GUJARATI_THALI + KHAMAN + DHOKLA + KHANDVI + THEPLA + HANDVO + DAL_DHOKLI + FARSAN + SWEETS AND: do_not_assume_NON_VEGETARIAN_FOOD_IS_REQUIRED_FOR_A_COMPLETE_AHMEDABAD_CULINARY_EXPERIENCE Reason: Vegetarian traditions are central rather than peripheral to Ahmedabad''s culinary identity. IF: traveler_interest == STREET_FOOD THEN: prioritize_MANEK_CHOWK + SELECTED_LOCAL_FARSAN_AND_SNACK_SHOPS AND: balance_POPULAR_NIGHT_FOOD_WITH_TRADITIONAL_DAYTIME_GUJARATI_FOOD Reason: Ahmedabad''s culinary identity extends well beyond late-night Manek Chowk and includes breakfast foods, farsan, thalis, sweets and neighborhood specialties. IF: traveler_interest == SHOPPING THEN: prioritize_LAW_GARDEN + DHALGARWAD + SELECTED_OLD_CITY_MARKETS AND: include_CG_ROAD_OR_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_IF_MODERN_BRANDS_ARE_REQUIRED Reason: Ahmedabad shopping is strongest when traditional textiles and handicrafts are combined with contemporary urban retail. IF: traveler_interest == TEXTILE_SHOPPING THEN: prefer_LAW_GARDEN + DHALGARWAD + SPECIALIST_TEXTILE_STORES AND: include_BANDHANI + EMBROIDERY + BLOCK_PRINTS + TRADITIONAL_GUJARATI_CLOTHING Reason: Textiles are one of Ahmedabad and Gujarat''s defining shopping categories and deserve dedicated market selection rather than generic mall shopping. IF: traveler_interest == RELAXATION THEN: choose_PREMIUM_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_HOTEL AND: combine_RIVERFRONT + QUALITY_DINING + SPA + LIGHT_HERITAGE + FREE_TIME Reason: Ahmedabad can support a relaxed urban break, but itineraries become tiring when dense Old City walking and distant attractions are scheduled continuously. IF: traveler_interest == NIGHTLIFE THEN: prefer_SINDHU_BHAVAN_ROAD + PRAHLAD_NAGAR + BODAKDEV + SG_HIGHWAY + SELECTED_PREMIUM_HOTELS AND: focus_ON_RESTAURANTS + CAFES + DESSERTS + LATE_EVENING_FOOD + SOCIAL_SPACES AND: do_not_position_AHMEDABAD_AS_ALCOHOL_CENTRIC_NIGHTLIFE_DESTINATION Reason: Ahmedabad''s evening economy is strongest through dining, cafés, dessert culture, shopping and social venues, while Gujarat''s prohibition framework substantially shapes conventional nightlife. IF: trip_length <= 4 nights THEN: prefer_ONE_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_UNNECESSARY_HOTEL_CHANGES_BETWEEN_OLD_AND_WEST_AHMEDABAD Reason: Ahmedabad''s major tourism areas can be covered effectively from one well-connected hotel using Metro, BRTS, cabs and geographically clustered sightseeing. IF: hotel_priority == FIRST_TIME_SIGHTSEEING THEN: prefer_ASHRAM_ROAD + NAVRANGPURA + ELLISBRIDGE + PALDI_OR_OTHER_WELL_CONNECTED_CENTRAL_WESTERN_LOCATION Reason: Central-western Ahmedabad provides practical access to the old city, Sabarmati Ashram, Riverfront and western dining / commercial districts without requiring accommodation inside congested heritage lanes. IF: hotel_priority == HERITAGE_ATMOSPHERE THEN: consider_OLD_CITY_OR_HERITAGE_STYLE_ACCOMMODATION AND: verify_VEHICLE_ACCESS + LUGGAGE_HANDLING + ELEVATOR + PARKING + NIGHT_ACCESS Reason: Historic-city accommodation can provide stronger atmosphere but may involve narrow access, pedestrian segments and less convenient vehicle movement. IF: hotel_priority == LUXURY THEN: prefer_PREMIUM_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_OR_SG_HIGHWAY_FIVE_STAR_HOTEL AND: retain_CHAUFFEURED_CAR_FOR_HERITAGE + SCIENCE_CITY + SARKHEJ + REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS Reason: Western Ahmedabad generally provides stronger premium hotel infrastructure, road access, modern dining and airport / highway convenience. IF: hotel_priority == FAMILY THEN: prefer_WELL_CONNECTED_MODERN_HOTEL AND: verify_FAMILY_ROOM + ELEVATOR + BREAKFAST + PARKING + AIR_CONDITIONING + POOL_IF_REQUIRED Reason: Families benefit more from modern infrastructure, air-conditioning and convenient transport than from choosing accommodation solely for old-city atmosphere. IF: route == AHMEDABAD_AIRPORT_TO_CENTRAL_CITY THEN: choose_APP_CAB + TAXI + PRIVATE_CAR_OR_HOTEL_TRANSFER ACCORDING_TO: HOTEL_LOCATION + LUGGAGE + TRAVELER_COUNT + ARRIVAL_TIME Reason: As of September 2026, Ahmedabad''s direct Metro airport extension is a sanctioned / developing project rather than an operational airport-rail connection, so road transfer remains the simplest general visitor option. IF: route == OLD_CITY_TO_SABARMATI_ASHRAM THEN: prefer_METRO_BRTS_OR_CAB_WITH_LAST_MILE_CONNECTION Reason: The two clusters should normally be treated as separate sightseeing blocks rather than as one continuous heritage walk. IF: route == OLD_CITY_TO_RIVERFRONT THEN: prefer_SHORT_CAB_AUTO_OR_METRO_BASED_CONNECTION_DEPENDING_ON_EXACT_POINT Reason: The Riverfront extends over a substantial north–south corridor, so transport should be selected according to the exact promenade segment rather than treating it as one single access point. IF: route == OLD_CITY_TO_SCIENCE_CITY THEN: prefer_METRO_PLUS_LAST_MILE_OR_DIRECT_CAB Reason: Science City lies well west of Ahmedabad''s historic core and should not be combined with dense Old City sightseeing through repeated short transfers. IF: route == SARKHEJ_TO_ADALAJ THEN: avoid_PLANNING_AS_SHORT_SAME_CLUSTER_TRANSFER AND: use_PRIVATE_CAR_IF_COMBINING_WITH_OTHER_REGIONAL_SIGHTSEEING Reason: Sarkhej and Adalaj lie on different sides of the metropolitan region and are better handled through deliberate road routing than casual attraction stacking. IF: traveler_type == SENIOR OR: traveler_mobility == LIMITED THEN: prefer_ACCESSIBLE_MODERN_HOTEL + PRIVATE_CAR + SHORT_OLD_CITY_WALKING_BLOCKS AND: reduce_LONG_POL_WALKS + STEPWELL_STAIRS + PEAK_HEAT + EXTENDED_MARKET_WALKING Reason: Ahmedabad can work well for senior travelers with private transport, but its most historically significant environments include narrow lanes, uneven surfaces, stairs and substantial heat exposure. IF: traveler_uses_WHEELCHAIR THEN: prefer_MODERN_HOTELS + PRIVATE_ROAD_TRANSPORT + METRO_WHERE_SUITABLE + VERIFIED_ACCESSIBLE_ATTRACTIONS AND: do_not_assume_OLD_CITY_POLS + STEPWELLS + EVERY_TEMPLE + EVERY_MOSQUE_IS_STEP_FREE Reason: Ahmedabad Metro provides wheelchair-oriented entrance infrastructure at many stations, but historic-city and monument-level accessibility remains highly variable. IF: weather == EXTREME_SUMMER_HEAT THEN: prioritize_EARLY_OLD_CITY + EARLY_SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SCIENCE_CITY + CALICO_OR_OTHER_INDOOR_EXPERIENCE + HOTEL_BREAK AND: shift_RIVERFRONT + KANKARIA + MARKETS_TO_EVENING AND: reduce_MIDDAY_HERITAGE_WALKS + SARKHEJ + STEPWELLS + EXPOSED_OUTDOOR_TOURING Reason: IMD climate data show Ahmedabad''s mean maximum temperature rising to approximately 39.8°C in April, 42.2°C in May and 39.4°C in June, making day-part planning essential. IF: weather == MONSOON_RAIN THEN: increase_SCIENCE_CITY + CALICO_MUSEUM + SHOPPING + FOOD + SELECTED_INDOOR_ARCHITECTURE AND: reduce_TIGHTLY_TIMED_OLD_CITY + RIVERFRONT + STEPWELL + OUTDOOR_PHOTOGRAPHY_PLANS AND: allow_TRAFFIC + WATERLOGGING + WEATHER_BUFFER Reason: Monsoon rainfall and humidity can affect pedestrian comfort, old-city streets and road travel, so Ahmedabad itineraries should retain weather flexibility. IF: weather == WINTER THEN: increase_OLD_CITY_WALKING + SARKHEJ + STEPWELLS + RIVERFRONT + REGIONAL_DAY_TRIPS Reason: Ahmedabad''s winter months provide the strongest general conditions for long outdoor heritage days and extended walking. IF: festival == NAVRATRI THEN: increase_GARBA_AND_CULTURAL_EVENINGS AND: book_HOTELS + PREMIUM_EVENTS + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT_EARLY AND: reduce_OVERLOADED_DAYTIME_SIGHTSEEING_IF_LATE_NIGHT_GARBA_IS_PLANNED Reason: Navratri is one of Gujarat''s defining cultural periods and can significantly change Ahmedabad''s evening schedule, accommodation demand and traveler energy requirements. IF: festival == UTTARAYAN THEN: increase_KITE_FESTIVAL_AND_LOCAL_CULTURAL_PLANNING AND: expect_CROWD + ROAD + ROOFTOP_ACTIVITY_CHANGES AND: use_LOCAL_GUIDANCE_FOR_SAFE_VIEWING Reason: Ahmedabad''s January kite-flying culture creates a distinctive seasonal experience but requires crowd, mobility and safety-aware planning. IF: traveler_interest == FIRST_TIME_AHMEDABAD THEN: prioritize_OLD_CITY_HERITAGE_WALK + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + JAMA_MASJID AND: add_RIVERFRONT + ONE_GUJARATI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE + KANKARIA_OR_SCIENCE_CITY Reason: This provides the strongest introduction to Ahmedabad through UNESCO heritage, Gandhi history, Sultanate architecture, Gujarati cuisine and contemporary urban recreation. IF: traveler_interest == HERITAGE_AND_RELAXATION_BALANCE THEN: allocate_50_TO_60_PERCENT_TO_OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SELECTED_ARCHITECTURE AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_RIVERFRONT + DINING + SHOPPING + SPA + FREE_TIME Reason: Ahmedabad becomes more enjoyable when intensive heritage walking is balanced with food, modern public spaces and relaxed evening experiences. IF: traveler_interest == FAMILY_AND_CULTURE_BALANCE THEN: allocate_40_TO_50_PERCENT_TO_OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SELECTED_HERITAGE AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA + RIVERFRONT + FOOD + FREE_TIME Reason: Families generally enjoy Ahmedabad more when UNESCO and Gandhi heritage are balanced with interactive science, recreation and relaxed food experiences. IF: traveler_interest == ARCHITECTURE_AND_DESIGN_BALANCE THEN: allocate_OLD_CITY + SULTANATE_ARCHITECTURE + STEPWELL_DAY AND: include_CALICO_MUSEUM + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE + TEXTILE_OR_DESIGN_CONTEXT Reason: Ahmedabad''s greatest architectural strength comes from the ability to connect vernacular, Sultanate, Jain, water, textile and modernist design traditions within one destination. IF: traveler_interest == AHMEDABAD_PLUS_GANDHINAGAR THEN: use_AHMEDABAD_AS_PRIMARY_HOTEL_BASE AND: combine_ADALAJ + GANDHINAGAR_ATTRACTIONS_AS_NORTHERN_EXCURSION Reason: Ahmedabad and Gandhinagar are increasingly integrated through road and Metro connectivity, making a single Ahmedabad base practical for many short combined itineraries. IF: traveler_interest == AHMEDABAD_PLUS_NORTH_GUJARAT_HERITAGE THEN: use_AHMEDABAD_AS_ARRIVAL_AND_CITY_SIGHTSEEING_BASE AND: continue_BY_PRIVATE_CAR_TO_ADALAJ + MODHERA + PATAN_OR_OTHER_NORTH_GUJARAT_DESTINATIONS Reason: Ahmedabad''s airport, hotel inventory and road connectivity make it one of the strongest gateways for wider Gujarat heritage circuits.', 7470),
