  ('jabalpur', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, '***adventure_score:*** ***78*** Jabalpur is a ***soft-adventure and nature destination*** rather than a dedicated extreme-adventure base. ***Adventure experiences:*** ***Strongest adventure zones:*** ***Bhedaghat + Dhuandhar + Bargi + Dumna***', 7487),
