  ('pachmarhi', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, '***honeymoon_score:*** ***89*** ***privacy_score:*** ***86*** ***luxury_score:*** ***74*** ***Recommended:*** ***Honeymoon itinerary should NOT contain more than:*** ***2–3 major activities/day.*** Prefer: ***Nature + sunsets + pine forests*** over: ***Continuous cave hopping.***', 7532),
  ('pachmarhi', 20, 'luxury-travel', 'LUXURY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, '***luxury_score:*** ***74*** ***Recommended:*** Luxury here primarily means:', 7533),
  ('pachmarhi', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, '***adventure_score:*** ***87*** Pachmarhi is an ***outdoor hill adventure and eco-trekking destination***. ***Adventure experiences:*** ***Strongest adventure zones:*** ***Chauragarh + Duchess Falls + Satpura Reserve + Reechgarh***', 7534),
  ('pachmarhi', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, '***senior_suitability:*** ***81*** ***walking_intensity:*** ***MEDIUM*** ***Rules:*** ***Easier options:*** ***Avoid:***', 7535),
  ('pachmarhi', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, '***wheelchair_accessibility:*** ***LIMITED*** ***public_transport_accessibility:*** ***MODERATE*** ***hotel_accessibility:*** ***VERIFY_PER_HOTEL*** ***attraction_accessibility:*** ***VERIFY_PER_ATTRACTION*** ***Rule:*** Do not assume accessibility at ***hilltop peaks, ravines, waterfall bases or natural caves***. ***Check:***', 7536),
  ('pachmarhi', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Pachmarhi is strongest for: ***Food experiences:*** ***Budget:*** Market eateries. ***Premium:*** MP Tourism resort dining.', 7537),
  ('pachmarhi', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, '***Strong categories:*** ***Prefer:*** Pachmarhi main market is particularly known for local organic forest products and tribal handicrafts.', 7538),
  ('pachmarhi', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, '***nightlife_level:*** ***35*** Pachmarhi has ***minimal urban nightlife*** and is strictly oriented toward nature, early rest, and quiet hill evenings. ***Suitable for:*** ***Night experiences:*** ***Best for:*** ***Early nights & quiet nature*** rather than: ***Late-night partying.***', 7539),
  ('pachmarhi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', 'HALF-DAY – BHEDAGHAT MARBLE ROCKS & DHUANDHAR FALLS', NULL, '****Morning / Afternoon**** Pickup from your hotel in Jabalpur → Drive to ****Bhedaghat Marble Rocks**** and experience the towering marble cliffs along the Narmada River → Enjoy a ****Narmada River boat ride**** through the marble gorge → Continue to ****Dhuandhar Falls**** to see the Narmada cascading dramatically through the rocky landscape → Visit the nearby ****Chausath Yogini Temple**** if time and mobility permit → Browse local ****marble and soapstone handicrafts**** before returning to Jabalpur', 7540),
  ('pachmarhi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '1 DAY – BHEDAGHAT, DHUANDHAR & CHAUSATH YOGINI', NULL, '****Morning**** Morning pickup from your hotel for Jabalpur''s principal nature circuit → Drive to ****Bhedaghat Marble Rocks**** → Enjoy a ****Narmada boat ride**** between the dramatic marble cliffs → Continue to ****Chausath Yogini Temple**** for its historic temple complex and panoramic views ****Afternoon**** Lunch near Bhedaghat → Visit ****Dhuandhar Falls**** and explore the viewing areas around the waterfall → Browse the nearby ****marble handicraft markets**** ****Evening**** Return toward Jabalpur → Stop at ****Gwarighat**** for a peaceful Narmada riverside experience and evening aarti → Return to your hotel for dinner', 7541),
  ('pachmarhi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 DAYS – JABALPUR NARMADA, NATURE & HERITAGE CIRCUIT', NULL, '****Day 1**** Full-day exploration of the Bhedaghat region → Begin at ****Bhedaghat Marble Rocks**** and enjoy the Narmada boat ride → Visit ****Chausath Yogini Temple**** → Continue to ****Dhuandhar Falls**** for waterfall views and photography → Explore local marble and soapstone handicrafts → Return to Jabalpur for an evening visit to ****Gwarighat**** ****Day 2**** Begin with ****Madan Mahal Fort**** and explore its historic hilltop ruins associated with Jabalpur''s Gond heritage → Continue to ****Balancing Rock**** near Madan Mahal → Visit ****Rani Durgavati Museum**** for regional history, tribal culture and archaeological collections → Proceed to ****Dumna Nature Reserve**** for a relaxed nature and birdwatching experience → Return to Jabalpur for dinner', 7542),
  ('pachmarhi', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 1 – ROMANTIC ARRIVAL & NARMADA EVENING', 'honeymoon', '****Morning / Afternoon**** Arrive at ****Jabalpur Airport**** or ****Jabalpur Railway Station**** → Meet your private chauffeur and transfer to your romantic hotel or boutique property → Complete check-in and relax ****Lunch**** Enjoy a relaxed lunch featuring Central Indian and local Jabalpur specialities ****Evening**** Drive to ****Gwarighat**** → Spend a peaceful evening beside the Narmada River → Experience the evening ****Narmada aarti**** → Return to the hotel for a romantic dinner', 7543),
  ('pachmarhi', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 2 – BHEDAGHAT MARBLE ROCKS & DHUANDHAR ROMANCE', NULL, '****Morning**** After breakfast, depart for ****Bhedaghat Marble Rocks**** → Enjoy a scenic ****Narmada boat ride**** through the marble gorge → Take couple photographs beside the dramatic marble cliffs ****Afternoon**** Enjoy lunch near Bhedaghat → Visit ****Chausath Yogini Temple**** for its historic setting and panoramic surroundings ****Evening**** Continue to ****Dhuandhar Falls**** → Enjoy the waterfall views and surrounding landscape → Return to Jabalpur for a relaxed romantic dinner', 7544),
  ('pachmarhi', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 3 – MADAN MAHAL, BALANCING ROCK & COUPLE''S LEISURE', 'honeymoon', '****Morning**** Visit ****Madan Mahal Fort**** → Explore the historic hilltop fort and its panoramic surroundings → Continue to ****Balancing Rock**** for photographs ****Lunch**** Enjoy lunch at a comfortable city restaurant ****Afternoon**** Return to the hotel → Private couple''s spa or wellness session → Poolside relaxation and leisure ****Evening**** Enjoy a private dinner at the hotel → Optional romantic room or terrace setup', 7545),
  ('pachmarhi', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 4 – DUMNA NATURE & PEACEFUL JABALPUR', NULL, '****Morning**** Enjoy a relaxed breakfast → Visit ****Dumna Nature Reserve**** for a peaceful forest and wildlife experience → Enjoy nature photography and birdwatching ****Lunch**** Return toward the city for lunch ****Afternoon**** Relax at the hotel → Enjoy private leisure time → Optional couple''s massage or pool session ****Evening**** Take a relaxed drive through Jabalpur → Enjoy dinner at a refined local restaurant', 7546),
  ('pachmarhi', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 5 – BARGI DAM & ROMANTIC NARMADA ESCAPE', 'honeymoon', '****Morning**** After breakfast, drive toward ****Bargi Dam**** → Enjoy views of the Narmada reservoir → Take a scenic ****boat ride**** or other available water-based experience → Spend relaxed couple time beside the reservoir ****Lunch**** Enjoy lunch near the Bargi Dam area ****Afternoon**** Return to Jabalpur → Rest at the hotel ****Evening**** Celebrate the final night with a ****private candlelit dinner**** → Optional couple photography and romantic hotel setup', 7547),
  ('pachmarhi', 29, '6-days-and-5-nights-honeymoon-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS HONEYMOON ITINERARY', 'DAY 6 – LEISURE BREAKFAST & DEPARTURE', NULL, '****Morning**** Enjoy a slow breakfast → Complete checkout → Optional last-minute shopping for ****marble handicrafts and local souvenirs**** ****Late Morning / Afternoon**** Meet your private chauffeur → Transfer to ****Jabalpur Airport**** or ****Jabalpur Railway Station**** → Depart Jabalpur for your onward destination', 7548),
  ('pachmarhi', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 1 – FAMILY ARRIVAL & GWARIGHAT EVENING', 'family', '****Morning / Afternoon**** Arrive at ****Jabalpur Airport**** or ****Jabalpur Railway Station**** → Meet your family vehicle and transfer to your hotel → Complete check-in and enjoy lunch ****Evening**** Visit ****Gwarighat**** → Enjoy a relaxed riverside family experience → Experience the evening ****Narmada aarti**** → Return to the hotel for dinner and rest', 7549),
  ('pachmarhi', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 2 – BHEDAGHAT, BOATING & DHUANDHAR FALLS', NULL, '****Morning**** Depart after breakfast for ****Bhedaghat Marble Rocks**** → Enjoy the ****Narmada boat ride**** through the marble cliffs → Explore the riverside scenery and photography points ****Lunch**** Enjoy lunch near Bhedaghat ****Afternoon**** Visit ****Dhuandhar Falls**** → Explore the designated viewing areas → Continue to nearby ****marble handicraft markets**** for family shopping ****Evening**** Return to Jabalpur → Family dinner and overnight stay', 7550),
  ('pachmarhi', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 3 – CHAUSATH YOGINI, MADAN MAHAL & BALANCING ROCK', NULL, '****Morning**** Visit ****Chausath Yogini Temple**** → Explore the historic temple and surrounding views → Continue to ****Madan Mahal Fort**** → Introduce children to Jabalpur''s Gond and regional history ****Lunch**** Enjoy a family-friendly lunch ****Afternoon**** Visit ****Balancing Rock**** → Stop for family photographs → Return to the hotel for rest ****Evening**** Enjoy a relaxed family dinner', 7551),
  ('pachmarhi', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 4 – RANI DURGAVATI MUSEUM & DUMNA NATURE', NULL, '****Morning**** Visit ****Rani Durgavati Museum**** → Explore regional archaeological, tribal and cultural collections ****Lunch**** Enjoy lunch in Jabalpur ****Afternoon**** Proceed to ****Dumna Nature Reserve**** → Enjoy a gentle nature outing → Look for birds and wildlife in the forested surroundings → Allow children time for relaxed outdoor activities ****Evening**** Return to the hotel → Family leisure and dinner', 7552),
  ('pachmarhi', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 5 – BARGI DAM & NARMADA LEISURE', NULL, '****Morning**** After breakfast, drive to ****Bargi Dam**** → Enjoy reservoir views → Take a family-friendly ****boat ride**** or other available water activity → Spend time enjoying the scenic surroundings ****Lunch**** Enjoy lunch near the dam ****Afternoon**** Return to Jabalpur → Hotel leisure, swimming or indoor family activities ****Evening**** Enjoy an early dinner → Prepare for departure', 7553),
  ('pachmarhi', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 6 – RELAXED MORNING & DEPARTURE', NULL, '****Morning**** Enjoy breakfast at the hotel → Complete checkout → Optional final shopping for ****marble souvenirs, handicrafts and local sweets**** ****Late Morning / Afternoon**** Transfer by family vehicle to ****Jabalpur Airport**** or ****Jabalpur Railway Station**** → Continue to your next Madhya Pradesh destination', 7554),
  ('pachmarhi', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 1 – VIP ARRIVAL & NARMADA RIVERSIDE EVENING', NULL, '****Morning / Afternoon**** Arrive at ****Jabalpur Airport**** → Meet your dedicated chauffeur and premium vehicle → Transfer to an upscale hotel or premium riverside/property accommodation → Private check-in with welcome refreshments → Settle into your premium room or suite ****Lunch**** Enjoy a curated Central Indian lunch ****Evening**** Private transfer to ****Gwarighat**** → Experience the peaceful Narmada riverside atmosphere → Witness the evening ****Narmada aarti**** → Return to your hotel for a refined dinner', 7555),
  ('pachmarhi', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 2 – PRIVATE BHEDAGHAT & DHUANDHAR EXPERIENCE', NULL, '****Early Morning**** Depart with your private chauffeur for ****Bhedaghat Marble Rocks**** → Enjoy a carefully planned ****Narmada boat experience**** through the marble gorge → Private photography stops along the riverside ****Afternoon**** Continue to ****Chausath Yogini Temple**** → Explore the historic temple and panoramic landscape → Enjoy a premium lunch near Bhedaghat or return toward Jabalpur ****Evening**** Visit ****Dhuandhar Falls**** → Enjoy sunset-hour photography where conditions permit → Return to your luxury hotel → Fine-dining dinner', 7556),
  ('pachmarhi', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 3 – ROYAL HERITAGE & PRIVATE CULTURAL TOUR', NULL, '****Morning**** Private guided visit to ****Madan Mahal Fort**** → Explore the historic hilltop ruins and Gond-era heritage → Continue to ****Balancing Rock**** for a short photography stop ****Lunch**** Enjoy an elegant regional lunch ****Afternoon**** Visit ****Rani Durgavati Museum**** with a knowledgeable cultural guide → Explore archaeological, tribal and regional collections ****Evening**** Return to your premium hotel → Private spa or wellness session → Relaxed dinner at the property', 7557),
  ('pachmarhi', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 4 – DUMNA NATURE & PRIVATE WELLNESS', NULL, '****Morning**** Enjoy a leisurely premium breakfast → Private drive to ****Dumna Nature Reserve**** → Explore the forested landscape and observe local birds and wildlife → Enjoy a relaxed nature-photography experience ****Lunch**** Return to your hotel for a refined lunch ****Afternoon**** Reserve the afternoon for exclusive wellness → Private spa treatment → Poolside relaxation → Afternoon tea → Suite leisure ****Evening**** Enjoy a private dinner at the property', 7558),
  ('pachmarhi', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 5 – BARGI DAM & EXCLUSIVE NARMADA ESCAPE', NULL, '****Morning**** Depart by premium vehicle for ****Bargi Dam**** → Enjoy panoramic views of the Narmada reservoir → Take an available ****private or premium boat experience**** → Enjoy the scenic landscape and birdwatching opportunities Bargi Dam officially offers boating and other water-based activities, making it Jabalpur''s strongest option for a relaxed premium outdoor day. ****Lunch**** Enjoy a leisurely lunch overlooking the reservoir where suitable arrangements are available ****Afternoon**** Return to Jabalpur → Relax at the hotel → Optional private shopping assistance for ****marble and soapstone handicrafts**** ****Evening**** Celebrate the final night with an ****exclusive dinner**** → Premium setting → Curated Central Indian menu → Optional private cultural performance', 7559),
  ('pachmarhi', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 6 – PREMIUM BREAKFAST & VIP DEPARTURE', 'luxury', '****Morning**** Enjoy a leisurely final breakfast → Complete checkout → Optional final shopping for ****Jabalpur marble handicrafts and regional souvenirs**** ****Late Morning / Afternoon**** Meet your dedicated chauffeur → Transfer in a premium vehicle to ****Jabalpur Airport**** or ****Jabalpur Railway Station**** → Continue onward to your next Madhya Pradesh destination ****Departure**** Depart Jabalpur after a carefully paced combination of ****Narmada landscapes, marble-rock scenery, waterfalls, Gond heritage, spiritual experiences, nature and premium hospitality****.', 7560),
