  ('omkareshwar', 30, '6-days-and-5-nights-family-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS FAMILY ITINERARY', 'DAY 3 – CHAUSATH YOGINI, MADAN MAHAL & BALANCING ROCK', NULL, '****Morning**** Visit ****Chausath Yogini Temple**** → Explore the historic temple and surrounding views → Continue to ****Madan Mahal Fort**** → Introduce children to Jabalpur''s Gond and regional history ****Lunch**** Enjoy a family-friendly lunch ****Afternoon**** Visit ****Balancing Rock**** → Stop for family photographs → Return to the hotel for rest ****Evening**** Enjoy a relaxed family dinner', 7645),
