  ('omkareshwar', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 1 – VIP ARRIVAL & NARMADA RIVERSIDE EVENING', NULL, '****Morning / Afternoon**** Arrive at ****Jabalpur Airport**** → Meet your dedicated chauffeur and premium vehicle → Transfer to an upscale hotel or premium riverside/property accommodation → Private check-in with welcome refreshments → Settle into your premium room or suite ****Lunch**** Enjoy a curated Central Indian lunch ****Evening**** Private transfer to ****Gwarighat**** → Experience the peaceful Narmada riverside atmosphere → Witness the evening ****Narmada aarti**** → Return to your hotel for a refined dinner', 7649),
  ('omkareshwar', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 2 – PRIVATE BHEDAGHAT & DHUANDHAR EXPERIENCE', NULL, '****Early Morning**** Depart with your private chauffeur for ****Bhedaghat Marble Rocks**** → Enjoy a carefully planned ****Narmada boat experience**** through the marble gorge → Private photography stops along the riverside ****Afternoon**** Continue to ****Chausath Yogini Temple**** → Explore the historic temple and panoramic landscape → Enjoy a premium lunch near Bhedaghat or return toward Jabalpur ****Evening**** Visit ****Dhuandhar Falls**** → Enjoy sunset-hour photography where conditions permit → Return to your luxury hotel → Fine-dining dinner', 7650),
  ('omkareshwar', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 3 – ROYAL HERITAGE & PRIVATE CULTURAL TOUR', NULL, '****Morning**** Private guided visit to ****Madan Mahal Fort**** → Explore the historic hilltop ruins and Gond-era heritage → Continue to ****Balancing Rock**** for a short photography stop ****Lunch**** Enjoy an elegant regional lunch ****Afternoon**** Visit ****Rani Durgavati Museum**** with a knowledgeable cultural guide → Explore archaeological, tribal and regional collections ****Evening**** Return to your premium hotel → Private spa or wellness session → Relaxed dinner at the property', 7651),
