  ('omkareshwar', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 5 – BARGI DAM & EXCLUSIVE NARMADA ESCAPE', NULL, '****Morning**** Depart by premium vehicle for ****Bargi Dam**** → Enjoy panoramic views of the Narmada reservoir → Take an available ****private or premium boat experience**** → Enjoy the scenic landscape and birdwatching opportunities Bargi Dam officially offers boating and other water-based activities, making it Jabalpur''s strongest option for a relaxed premium outdoor day. ****Lunch**** Enjoy a leisurely lunch overlooking the reservoir where suitable arrangements are available ****Afternoon**** Return to Jabalpur → Relax at the hotel → Optional private shopping assistance for ****marble and soapstone handicrafts**** ****Evening**** Celebrate the final night with an ****exclusive dinner**** → Premium setting → Curated Central Indian menu → Optional private cultural performance', 7653),
  ('omkareshwar', 31, '6-days-and-5-nights-luxury-itinerary', '6 DAYS & 5 NIGHTS LUXURY ITINERARY', 'DAY 6 – PREMIUM BREAKFAST & VIP DEPARTURE', 'luxury', '****Morning**** Enjoy a leisurely final breakfast → Complete checkout → Optional final shopping for ****Jabalpur marble handicrafts and regional souvenirs**** ****Late Morning / Afternoon**** Meet your dedicated chauffeur → Transfer in a premium vehicle to ****Jabalpur Airport**** or ****Jabalpur Railway Station**** → Continue onward to your next Madhya Pradesh destination ****Departure**** Depart Jabalpur after a carefully paced combination of ****Narmada landscapes, marble-rock scenery, waterfalls, Gond heritage, spiritual experiences, nature and premium hospitality****.', 7654),
