  ('puri', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, 'adventure_score: 63 Puri primarily offers soft coastal adventure. Adventure experiences: Best regions: PURI_COAST + MARINE_DRIVE + RAMACHANDI + CHILIKA + CHANDRABHAGA. Travel-agent positioning: Puri should be treated as: SOFT_COASTAL_ADVENTURE + BOATING + WATER_SPORTS + NATURE_EXCURSIONS rather than a high-adrenaline destination.', 7722),
  ('puri', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 84 walking_intensity: LOW_MEDIUM generally. HIGHER during temple crowds, major festivals and longer heritage excursions. Rules: Puri works especially well for seniors as a: PILGRIMAGE + BEACH + TEMPLE_HERITAGE + ODIA_FOOD + RELAXED_COASTAL_STAY destination.', 7723),
  ('puri', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: MODERATE public_transport_accessibility: LOW_MEDIUM → MODERATE hotel_accessibility: GOOD_IN_MANY_MODERN_HOTELS_BUT_MUST_BE_VERIFIED attraction_accessibility: HIGHLY_VARIABLE Rule: Do not assume temples, traditional neighborhoods, beaches or boats are completely step-free. Additional notes: Puri accessibility should therefore be classified as: MODERATE_WITH_ATTRACTION_SPECIFIC_VERIFICATION.', 7724),
  ('puri', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Puri is particularly strong for: Food experiences: Travel-agent rule: Position Puri food around: JAGANNATH_MAHAPRASAD + ODIA_CUISINE + TEMPLE_FOOD + SEAFOOD + TRADITIONAL_SWEETS.', 7725),
  ('puri', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: Prefer: Local shopping: Prefer: Travel-agent rule: Use: RAGHURAJPUR for AUTHENTIC_PATTACHITRA, BADA_DANDA for PILGRIMAGE_SOUVENIRS, SWARGADWAR for TOURIST_MARKETS, PIPILI for APPLIQUE_WORK.', 7726),
  ('puri', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 66 Suitable for: Best areas: Evening activities: Puri nightlife is strongest for: BEACH_EVENINGS + DINING + MARKETS + RELAXED_RESORT_ACTIVITY rather than: CLUBBING_AND_ALL_NIGHT_PARTYING.', 7727),
  ('puri', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS', NULL, '### Day 1 Arrival at Biju Patnaik International Airport, Bhubaneswar (BBI) → Private AC car / resort transfer towards Puri → Drive to Puri & beachfront hotel / resort check-in → Relax and refresh after arrival Afternoon: → Begin exploring the sacred coastal city of Puri → Visit the Shri Jagannath Temple precinct → Explore the surrounding Grand Road / Bada Danda area → Continue towards Puri''s beachfront → Relax along Golden Beach / Puri Beach Evening: → Sunset experience along the Bay of Bengal → Explore the beach market & local shopping areas → Traditional Odia dinner featuring regional coastal cuisine → Relaxed beachfront evening → Hotel BBI at Bhubaneswar serves as the principal aviation gateway for Puri. Odisha Tourism commonly routes visitors from Bhubaneswar Airport directly to Puri by road, making BBI the most practical airport for Puri-based itineraries. ### Day 2 Morning: Breakfast → Visit Shri Jagannath Temple / temple precinct → Continue towards Gundicha Temple → Explore additional sacred sites and traditional neighbourhoods of Puri according to interest → Experience the spiritual and cultural atmosphere surrounding Bada Danda Afternoon: → Drive towards Raghurajpur Heritage Crafts Village → Discover traditional Pattachitra painting → Observe local artisans working with palm-leaf engraving and other Odia crafts → Continue towards Konark → Visit the UNESCO World Heritage-listed Sun Temple → Explore its monumental stone architecture & sculptural heritage Evening: → Continue towards Chandrabhaga Beach → Sunset along the Odisha coastline → Return to Puri → Traditional dinner → Hotel Optional alternative instead of combining Raghurajpur & Konark: KONARK_AND_COAST: → Konark Sun Temple → Chandrabhaga Beach → Ramachandi area → Scenic Puri-Konark coastal route → Relaxed sunset experience PURI_CULTURE: → Jagannath Temple precinct → Gundicha Temple → Local markets → Traditional Odia handicrafts → Extended beach leisure ### Day 3 Recommended first-time option: → Early breakfast → Private road excursion from Puri to Satapada → Arrive at Chilika Lake → Boat cruise through the lagoon → Explore the Satapada side of Chilika''s aquatic landscape → Look for Irrawaddy dolphins in their natural habitat → Continue towards the lagoon / sea-mouth area according to permitted boat routing and conditions Afternoon: → Return towards Puri → Traditional Odia / seafood lunch → Leisure at Puri Beach → Shopping for handicrafts, Pattachitra, appliqué work & regional souvenirs Evening: → Final sunset along Puri Beach → Relaxed beachfront walk → Farewell Odia dinner → Hotel Optional alternative instead of Chilika Lake: BHUBANESWAR_HERITAGE: → Dhauli Peace Pagoda → Udayagiri & Khandagiri Caves → Mukteswar Temple → Rajarani Temple → Bhubaneswar heritage exploration KONARK_AND_RAGHURAJPUR: → Raghurajpur Heritage Crafts Village → Pattachitra artisan experience → Konark Sun Temple → Chandrabhaga Beach → Coastal photography SPA & WELLNESS: → Beachfront resort spa → Ayurvedic / wellness treatment → Poolside relaxation → Sunrise yoga → Sunset beach walk NATURE: → Chilika Lake at Satapada → Lagoon boat experience → Irrawaddy dolphin watching → Chandrabhaga Beach → Puri-Konark coastal landscapes FAMILY: → Puri Beach → Raghurajpur artisan demonstrations → Konark Sun Temple → Chilika boat cruise → Beach market & souvenir shopping HONEYMOON: → Sunrise couple photography at Puri Beach → Private Chilika Lake excursion → Chandrabhaga sunset → Couple spa treatment → Romantic beachfront dinner LUXURY: → Private BBI-Puri transfers → Premium beachfront resort → Privately guided Konark heritage experience → Private / premium Chilika boat experience → Spa & fine dining FOOD: → Traditional Odia thali → Dalma & regional vegetable preparations → Coastal seafood according to preference → Khaja & traditional sweets → Beachside regional snacks For only 3 nights, prioritize: PURI_JAGANNATH_AND_GOLDEN_BEACH + KONARK_AND_RAGHURAJPUR + CHILIKA_LAKE_AT_SATAPADA OR PURI_SPIRITUAL_AND_BEACH_EXPERIENCE + KONARK_COASTAL_HERITAGE + CHILIKA_NATURE_EXCURSION rather than attempting to add too many distant Odisha destinations within a short stay. ### Day 4 Breakfast → Sunrise / leisurely morning at Puri Beach → Final local handicraft & souvenir shopping → Hotel checkout → Private road transfer from Puri to Biju Patnaik International Airport, Bhubaneswar (BBI) → Departure', 7728),
