  ('daringbadi', 12, 'arrival-transfer-logic', 'ARRIVAL TRANSFER LOGIC', 'Senior', 'senior', 'Prefer: DIRECT_PRIVATE_CAB + CENTRAL_RESORT + DOOR_TO_DOOR_SIGHTSEEING. Road transport is essential for most Daringbadi itineraries.', 7765),
