  ('daringbadi', 19, 'honeymoon-travel', 'HONEYMOON TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'honeymoon_score: 90 romance_score: 92 privacy_score: 90 luxury_score: 67 Recommended: Honeymoon itineraries should generally stay at: 2–3 major experiences/day. Prefer: RESORT + FORESTS + VIEWPOINTS + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT + WATERFALLS + FREE_TIME over: Continuous long-distance sightseeing.', 7767),
  ('daringbadi', 20, 'luxury-travel', 'LUXURY TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'luxury_score: 67 Recommended: Daringbadi is strongest for: NATURE_BASED_PREMIUM_TRAVEL + PRIVATE_ROAD_TRANSPORT + SCENIC_RESORT_STAYS + RELAXATION rather than ultra-luxury tourism.', 7768),
  ('daringbadi', 21, 'adventure', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, NULL, 'adventure_score: 74 Daringbadi offers primarily soft nature adventure. Adventure experiences: Best regions: DARINGBADI + PINE_FOREST + WATERFALL_ZONES + MANDASARU + BELGHAR Travel-agent positioning: Daringbadi should be treated as: SOFT_ADVENTURE + FORESTS + WATERFALLS + SCENIC_DRIVING + NATURE_WALKS rather than extreme adventure.', 7769),
  ('daringbadi', 22, 'senior-travel', 'SENIOR TRAVEL', NULL, NULL, 'senior_suitability: 79 walking_intensity: LOW around viewpoints, parks and plantations. MEDIUM around waterfalls and uneven nature trails. Rules: Daringbadi works well for seniors as a: COOL_WEATHER + NATURE + VIEWPOINTS + SCENIC_DRIVES + RELAXED_RESORT destination.', 7770),
  ('daringbadi', 23, 'accessibility', 'ACCESSIBILITY', NULL, NULL, 'wheelchair_accessibility: LOW → MODERATE public_transport_accessibility: LOW → MODERATE hotel_accessibility: VARIABLE_AND_MUST_BE_VERIFIED attraction_accessibility: VARIABLE Rule: Do not assume waterfalls, forest paths, viewpoints or plantation trails are step-free. Additional notes: Daringbadi accessibility should therefore be classified as: ROAD_ACCESSIBLE_BUT_NATURE_SITE_LIMITED.', 7771),
  ('daringbadi', 24, 'food', 'FOOD', NULL, NULL, 'Daringbadi is particularly suitable for: Food experiences: Family: Prioritize rice, dal, vegetables, chicken and familiar Indian dishes. Honeymoon: Prefer resort dining and relaxed coffee experiences. Luxury: Use premium resort meals and customized local menus where available. Budget: Local restaurants and simple Odia meals provide best value. Travel-agent rule: Position Daringbadi food around: ODIA_HOME_STYLE_FOOD + LOCAL_PRODUCE + COFFEE + SIMPLE_REGIONAL_DINING.', 7772),
  ('daringbadi', 25, 'shopping', 'SHOPPING', NULL, NULL, 'Strong categories: Luxury shopping: LIMITED Local shopping: Prefer: Budget: Local produce and food products offer the strongest shopping value. Travel-agent rule: Daringbadi is a: LOCAL_PRODUCE + COFFEE + SPICES + SMALL_MARKET shopping destination rather than a major retail centre.', 7773),
  ('daringbadi', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level: 36 Suitable for: Best evening activities: Daringbadi nightlife is strongest for: QUIET_RESORT_EVENINGS + COOL_WEATHER + DINNER + RELAXATION rather than: BARS + CLUBS + LATE_NIGHT_ENTERTAINMENT.', 7774),
  ('daringbadi', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '3 NIGHTS', NULL, '### Day 1 Arrival at Biju Patnaik International Airport, Bhubaneswar (BBI) → Meet & greet at the airport → Private AC car transfer from Bhubaneswar to Daringbadi → Scenic road journey towards the Eastern Ghats and Kandhamal hills → Arrival at Daringbadi → Nature resort / hotel check-in & relax after the journey Afternoon / Evening: → Explore Nature Park → Visit Hill View Park → Enjoy panoramic views across Daringbadi''s surrounding hills and valleys → Continue towards Sunset Point → Golden-hour landscape photography → Traditional Odia dinner / relaxed resort evening → Hotel / nature resort BBI serves as the principal aviation gateway for this itinerary. Daringbadi lies in Odisha''s Kandhamal district at roughly 3,000 feet above sea level and is surrounded by hills, valleys, forests, coffee and pepper plantations. Because the road journey from Bhubaneswar is substantial, the arrival day should remain relatively light rather than attempting intensive sightseeing. ### Day 2 Morning: Breakfast → Begin full-day Daringbadi local sightseeing → Explore the Pine Forest → Walk through the Coffee & Pepper Plantation area → Learn about coffee cultivation in Daringbadi''s cool hill environment → Continue towards Doluri River / Duluri picnic landscape Afternoon: → Visit Lover''s Point / Dadubada → Forest, rocky riverbed & valley scenery → Continue towards Midubanda / Daringbadi Waterfall → Short nature walk & waterfall photography → Explore additional viewpoints according to road and weather conditions Evening: → Return to Daringbadi → Local coffee experience → Relaxed nature-resort evening → Optional bonfire subject to resort, season & weather → Traditional dinner → Hotel / nature resort Optional alternative instead of covering all local attractions: SLOW_NATURE_DAY: → Pine Forest → Coffee Plantation → Nature Park → Hill View Point → Sunset Point → Resort leisure WATERFALL_AND_PHOTOGRAPHY: → Midubanda Waterfall → Lover''s Point → Doluri River → Pine Forest photography → Sunset Point ### Day 3 Recommended first-time option: → Early breakfast → Scenic excursion towards Mandasaru Valley → Explore the dramatic Eastern Ghats landscape → Forested valley viewpoints → Nature photography → Guided nature walk / trekking according to local conditions Afternoon: → Continue the Mandasaru nature experience → Relaxed picnic / local lunch → Explore surrounding forest and hill landscapes → Return towards Daringbadi Evening: → Final sunset experience around Daringbadi → Coffee / local produce shopping → Relaxed farewell dinner → Hotel Optional alternative instead of Mandasaru: BELGHAR_AND_KANDHAMAL: → Scenic drive through Kandhamal → Belghar forest landscapes → Nature-oriented exploration → Local cultural landscapes → Return to Daringbadi according to road conditions WATERFALLS: → Putudi Waterfall excursion → Forest landscapes → Nature photography → Relaxed countryside exploration NATURE & ECO-WALKS: → Daringbadi Pine Forest → Coffee & Pepper Garden → Nature Park → Mandasaru Valley → Bird watching & guided trekking FAMILY: → Nature Park → Hill View Park → Coffee Garden → Pine Forest → Easy waterfall sightseeing → Family nature photography HONEYMOON: → Pine Forest couple photography → Coffee plantation walk → Lover''s Point → Sunset Point → Private resort dinner / bonfire LUXURY: → Private chauffeured Bhubaneswar–Daringbadi transfers → Premium nature resort / seasonal luxury eco-retreat → Private guided sightseeing → Curated coffee plantation experience → Private sunset dinner / premium resort leisure FOOD & LOCAL EXPERIENCE: → Traditional Odia cuisine → Local Kandhamal produce → Daringbadi coffee → Pepper & spice products → Regional home-style meals For only 3 nights, prioritize: DARINGBADI_HILL_VIEW_AND_SUNSET + PINE_FOREST_COFFEE_GARDEN_AND_WATERFALL + MANDASARU_VALLEY OR DARINGBADI_LOCAL_NATURE + LOVERS_POINT_AND_WATERFALL + MANDASARU_NATURE_EXCURSION rather than trying to include Puri, Konark, Chilika and other distant Odisha destinations within the same short hill-station itinerary. ### Day 4 Breakfast → Leisurely early morning around Daringbadi → Final hill / forest photography → Hotel checkout → Private AC car transfer towards Bhubaneswar → Scenic return journey through Odisha → Arrival at Biju Patnaik International Airport (BBI) → Departure', 7775),
  ('daringbadi', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 1', NULL, 'Arrival at Biju Patnaik International Airport, Bhubaneswar (BBI) → Private airport pickup → Scenic private drive to Daringbadi → Romantic nature resort check-in → Relax and refresh Evening: → Hill View Park → Sunset Point → Couple photography → Romantic dinner → Overnight at Daringbadi', 7776),
  ('daringbadi', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 2', NULL, 'Breakfast Morning: → Pine Forest → Coffee & Pepper Plantation → Couple nature photography Afternoon: → Doluri River → Lover''s Point → Midubanda / Daringbadi Waterfall Evening: → Local coffee experience → Resort leisure → Romantic dinner → Overnight at Daringbadi', 7777),
  ('daringbadi', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 3', NULL, 'Breakfast → Mandasaru Valley excursion → Forested Eastern Ghats landscapes → Valley viewpoints → Nature walk / trekking → Couple photography Afternoon: → Relaxed countryside lunch → Forest & valley exploration Evening: → Return to Daringbadi → Private resort leisure → Overnight at Daringbadi', 7778),
