  ('daringbadi', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 5', NULL, 'Breakfast → Kandhamal countryside excursion → Scenic drive towards Belghar region → Forest & valley landscapes → Local cultural surroundings → Nature photography Afternoon: → Relaxed forest / countryside experience → Local lunch Evening: → Return to Daringbadi → Resort relaxation → Overnight at Daringbadi', 7780),
  ('daringbadi', 29, 'six-nights-honeymoon-pattern', 'SIX-NIGHTS HONEYMOON PATTERN', 'Day 6', NULL, 'Breakfast → Leisurely final Daringbadi exploration → Nature Park → Hill View Point → Pine Forest / Coffee Garden revisit Afternoon: → Local coffee, spices & souvenir shopping → Couple leisure Evening: → Final sunset → Farewell romantic dinner → Overnight at Daringbadi', 7781),
