  ('kolkata', 26, 'nightlife', 'NIGHTLIFE', NULL, NULL, 'nightlife_level:70 Suitable for: young couples, business travellers, solo travellers, foodies, Park Street, locals Park Street Not for: Families, young children early sleep, Seniors, early sleep, Religious, People wanting Mumbai Delhi till 3 AM Honeymoon prefer: Park Street dinner Flurys Peter Cat Mocambo Trincas Oly Pub Someplace Else Roxy + Victoria night lights + Prinsep Ghat sunset + river cruise sunset + Maidan evening over late-night clubs till 3 AM Note: Kolkata nightlife = Park Street bars pubs Trincas Someplace Else Oly Pub Roxy Tantra Shisha Nocturne early close 11 PM-12 AM not Mumbai Delhi level + Park Street Christmas lights New Year best + must. For nightlife, go to Park Street, Camac Street, Salt Lake Sector 5, South Kolkata, early close 11 PM-12 AM.', 7869),
  ('kolkata', 28, 'sample-itinerary-patterns', 'SAMPLE ITINERARY PATTERNS', '2 NIGHTS KOLKATA CLASSIC - BEST FOR FIRST TIME', NULL, 'Day 1 Arrive CCU. 15km, 45-75min taxi, $8-$15 to Park Street, Esplanade, Maidan, Sudder Street. Check-in Oberoi Grand $150-$300 / Taj Bengal $120-$250 / 4★ $50-$100 / 3★ $25-$50 / hostel $8-$15 Sudder Street. Afternoon: Victoria Maidan, St. Paul''s, Indian Museum, South Park, Cemetery, Fort William, Writers'' Esplanade, New Market, Park Street, Flurys, Peter Cat, Mocambo, Trincas, Park Street dinner, Victoria night lights, Maidan evening. Overnight: Kolkata Park Street Esplanade - Oberoi Grand / Taj Bengal / 4★ / 3★ / hostel Meals: Breakfast + Park Street Flurys Peter Cat Mocambo Day 2 Morning Howrah Bridge Flower Market Mullik Ghat Ferry $0.1 Kumartuli idol makers College Street Boi Para Jorasanko Tagore House Marble Palace Mother House Shyambazar Bagbazar Sovabazar Rajbari North Kolkata heritage culture photography yellow taxi trams lunch Kathi Roll $1 Puchka $0.5 afternoon Dakshineswar 12 Shiva Kalighat Shakti Peetha Belur Math ferry evening Prinsep Ghat sunset river cruise sunset $10-$20 Howrah view Alipore Zoo Planetarium Science City Eco Park South City Quest Gariahat shopping. Overnight: Kolkata Park Street Esplanade Meals: Breakfast + Kathi Roll Puchka Biryani Arsalan Zeeshan Day 3 Morning Eco Park 480 acres Nicco Park Botanical Howrah Second Hooghly Bridge Vidyasagar Setu Biswa Bangla Gate Mother Wax Museum Shopping New Market Gariahat College Street City Centre Quest South City + transfer to CCU 15km 45-75min + train Howrah Sealdah + Sundarbans 1-2N + Darjeeling 3N + Puri 2N + Shantiniketan 1N + Mayapur 1N. 29. THREE-NIGHT FAMILY PATTERN Day 1 Arrive CCU taxi $8-$15 Park Street Esplanade Maidan family room. Afternoon Victoria Maidan St Paul''s Indian Museum South Park Cemetery Park Street Flurys Peter Cat Mocambo New Market Esplanade Sudder Street yellow taxi tram Maidan Victoria night lights. Day 2 Howrah Flower Market Ferry