  ('kolkata', 32, 'travel-agent-insights', 'TRAVEL AGENT INSIGHTS', NULL, NULL, 'What inexperienced planners often do wrong What an experienced planner does differently 1. Starts with purpose - Culture = Victoria Indian Museum Jorasanko Marble Palace South Park Cemetery Fort William Writers College Street Kumartuli Mother House Durga Puja Bengali culture Tagore Netaji Satyajit Ray Mother Teresa. Food = Kathi Roll Puchka Jhalmuri Rosogolla Mishti Doi Sandesh Biryani Kosha Mangsho Park Street Flurys Peter Cat Mocambo Trincas Arsalan Zeeshan. Heritage = Victoria Howrah Writers Fort William Marble Palace Jorasanko North Kolkata heritage trams yellow taxi. 2. Groups by geography: City core Park Street Esplanade Maidan Victoria St Pauls Indian Museum New Market Sudder Street together flat walkable 10-12k steps central, North Kolkata Howrah Flower Market Ferry Kumartuli College Street Jorasanko Marble Palace Mother House Shyambazar Bagbazar Sovabazar Rajbari together north heritage 6-8k steps, South Kolkata Dakshineswar Kalighat Belur Math Zoo Planetarium Science City Eco Park Nicco Park South City Quest Gariahat together south religious family shopping, Salt Lake New Town Rajarhat Eco Park Nicco Park City Centre Mani Square Biswa Bangla Gate together new Kolkata business MICE. 3. Uses hotel location strategically: PARK STREET / ESPLANADE / MAIDAN / SUDDER STREET for first-timers foodies heritage shopping central near Victoria Park Street New Market Esplanade Maidan Indian Museum St Pauls central flat safe best must city core best location 2-3N #1. NORTH KOLKATA for heritage photography books culture offbeat Kumartuli College Street Jorasanko Marble Palace Mother House Howrah Flower Market heritage culture photography offbeat 1 day trip. SOUTH KOLKATA for religious, family, shopping: Dakshineswar, Kalighat, Belur Zoo, Planetarium, Science City, Eco Park, Gariahat, South City Quest. 1-day. SALT LAKE NEW TOWN for business MICE Eco Park Nicco Park IT hub modern new business M