  ('kolkata', 33, 'destination-decision-rules', 'DESTINATION DECISION RULES', NULL, NULL, 'IF: `trip_length == 1 night` THEN: Victoria Maidan St Pauls Park Street Flurys Peter Cat Mocambo New Market Esplanade Yellow Taxi Tram Howrah car view Park Street dinner Victoria night lights Maidan evening. No Dakshineswar, Kalighat, Belur, Kumartuli, College Street, Jorasanko, Marble Palace, Mother House, Science City, Eco Park, Zoo, Planetarium, Prinsep Ghat river cruise. IF: `trip_length == 2 nights` THEN: Day1 City core Park Street Esplanade Maidan Victoria St Pauls Indian Museum New Market Sudder Street yellow taxi tram Park Street dinner Victoria night lights, Day2 North Kolkata Howrah Flower Market Ferry Kumartuli College Street Jorasanko Marble Palace Mother House South Kolkata Dakshineswar Kalighat Belur Math Prinsep Ghat sunset river cruise sunset food Kathi Roll Puchka Biryani Rosogolla Mishti Doi. IF: `trip_length >= 3 nights` THEN: Day1 City core Park Street Esplanade Maidan Victoria St Pauls Indian Museum New Market Sudder Street yellow taxi tram Park Street dinner Victoria night lights, Day2 North Kolkata Howrah Flower Market Ferry Kumartuli College Street Jorasanko Marble Palace Mother House North Kolkata heritage culture photography, Day3 South Kolkata Dakshineswar Kalighat Belur Math Zoo Planetarium Science City Eco Park Nicco Park Prinsep Ghat sunset river cruise sunset shopping New Market Gariahat City Centre Quest South City College Street food tour Durga Puja pandal hopping Sep-Oct. IF: `traveler_type == FAMILY` THEN: Victoria flat + Maidan flat + St Pauls flat + Indian Museum flat with help + Park Street flat + New Market flat + Howrah car view + Flower Market flat + Ferry flat + Dakshineswar flat + Kalighat with help + Belur flat + Science City flat + Eco Park flat + Zoo flat + Planetarium flat + Nicco Park flat + Tram flat + Yellow Taxi flat + Prinsep Ghat flat + River Cruise flat + College Street flat + Kumartuli flat + food Kathi Roll Puchka Rosogol