  ('cairo', 61, 23, 'One food experience: Egyptian breakfast, koshari, grilled cuisine, or a traditional café.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 24, 'One Nile experience: sunset felucca ride, Nile dinner cruise, or Nile-view dinner.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 25, 'One unstructured period: hotel relaxation, shopping, café time, or a leisurely evening.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 26, 'Choose Zamalek, Garden City, or a premium Nile-view hotel.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 27, 'Arrange a private airport transfer and private Egyptologist guide.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 28, 'Include a sunset felucca ride or private Nile dinner cruise.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 29, 'Schedule one premium Nile-view or pyramid-view dinner.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 30, 'Keep the itinerary to a maximum of two major activities per day.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 31, 'Prioritize one memorable experience plus free time over three or four additional attractions.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 32, 'Visit the Pyramids early in the day.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 33, 'Keep major activities to a maximum of two per day.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 34, 'Limit the Pyramids and Sphinx visit to approximately 90 minutes to two hours.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 35, 'Use private, air-conditioned transport.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 36, 'Include a midday hotel, pool, or rest break.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 37, 'Choose clean restaurants with familiar food options.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 38, 'Add Al-Azhar Park, a short felucca ride, or a child-friendly museum visit.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 39, 'Avoid long exposed visits, excessive walking, late-night activities, and unplanned transfers.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 40, 'Do not try to cover every pyramid, museum, mosque, church, market, and neighborhood in a short stay.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 41, 'Do not schedule outdoor archaeological sites during the hottest part of the day.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 42, 'Do not underestimate Cairo traffic when planning airport transfers or domestic flights.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 43, 'Do not change hotels unnecessarily during a two- to four-night stay.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 44, 'Do not stay far from the main sightseeing areas solely to save on room cost.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 45, 'Do not combine too many walking-heavy historic districts on one day.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 46, 'Do not plan a major final-day tour before an early departure.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 47, 'Do not assume that every attraction, hotel, or transport option is fully accessible.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 48, 'Do not treat the Nile cruise, domestic flights, and Cairo hotel as separate bookings without checking their timing connections.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 49, 'Do not give luxury travelers a schedule with simply more activities.'),
  ('cairo', 61, 50, 'Do not treat Cairo as a quiet beach, wellness, or nature destination.'),
  ('cairo', 62, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 0, 'Stay on the East Bank (Luxor Temple/Karnak side) or West Bank (Valley of the Kings side) according to your priorities, but avoid paying a premium for a Nile view unless you will genuinely use it.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 1, 'Choose the East Bank Corniche for central access, restaurants, and ferry connections to the West Bank; choose the West Bank near the ferries for a quieter atmosphere and convenient access to the Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut’s Temple, and other tombs.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 2, 'Use local eateries for koshari, ful, ta’ameya (falafel), grilled meats, and Egyptian breakfasts instead of relying only on hotel restaurants.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 3, 'Combine low-cost experiences (Nile walks, local markets, temple exteriors, neighborhood exploration) with a few paid highlights such as Karnak Temple, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut’s Temple, and guided archaeological tours.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 4, 'Use walking for compact areas, bicycles or bicycles-with-driver for short West Bank routes, and taxis/ride-hailing or pre-arranged transfers for longer journeys or when heat, traffic, or convenience makes it worthwhile.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 5, 'Group attractions by area: East Bank (Karnak + Luxor Temple + museum) together; West Bank (Valley of the Kings + Hatshepsut + Colossi of Memnon + optional additional tombs) together, to reduce backtracking and unnecessary transport costs.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 6, 'Travel during the summer or shoulder season (June–August, September–October) for better hotel pricing, but plan outdoor sightseeing early in the morning because Luxor’s summer heat can be intense. Budget travelers can commonly keep daily costs around USD 40–60 before international flights and major tours.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 7, 'Keep a compact itinerary and avoid changing hotels during a short 2–4-night stay; use one base on either the East or West Bank and do day clusters from there.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 8, 'Where saving money is usually not recommended:'),
  ('luxor', 67, 9, 'Choosing a poorly located hotel that creates daily taxi costs, long waits for transport, and lost sightseeing time, especially when crossing between East and West Bank repeatedly.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 10, 'Booking the absolute cheapest accommodation without checking cleanliness, reviews, air-conditioning, hot water, reception reliability, and proximity to ferries or main sights.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 11, 'Avoiding a licensed guide at key sites (Valley of the Kings, Karnak, Hatshepsut) if it results in confusion, negotiation stress with vendors, or missed historical context.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 12, 'Using unlicensed or unmetered taxis without agreeing on the fare beforehand; a reputable ride-hailing service, hotel-arranged taxi, or pre-arranged transfer may provide better value and predictability.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 13, 'Spending the entire trip in Western-style or hotel restaurants when local restaurants offer more authentic food at substantially lower prices.'),
  ('luxor', 67, 14, 'Overloading the itinerary with distant day trips (e.g., multiple far-flung temples or desert excursions) when the main purpose is a short Luxor city break focused on the main temples and tombs.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 0, 'Maximum 2 major attractions/day.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 1, 'Visit outdoor attractions early, especially Karnak and West Bank sites.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 2, 'Avoid excessive walking in heat, crowds, and uneven areas.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 3, 'Schedule lunch at a predictable time.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 4, 'Prefer hotels on the East Bank Corniche, Luxor Town Center, or West Bank near the ferries with reliable transport access.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 5, 'Avoid changing hotels during short stays.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 6, 'Use private transfers or reputable ride-hailing services for family convenience.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 7, 'Include at least one child-oriented activity.'),
  ('luxor', 72, 8, 'Allow a midday hotel break, pool time, or downtime.'),
