  ('luxor', 122, 0, 'Try to cover the Pyramids, Saqqara, museums, Islamic Cairo, Coptic Cairo, and shopping in one or two rushed days.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 1, 'Treat Cairo, Aswan, and Luxor as if they are close together instead of allowing time for flights, airport procedures, transfers, and check-in.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 2, 'Schedule the Pyramids, Saqqara, and other outdoor archaeological sites during the hottest part of the day.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 3, 'Book domestic flights or a Nile cruise without checking how the flight timings connect with cruise embarkation and sightseeing schedules.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 4, 'Include too many temples and museums without allowing time for rest, meals, and hotel relaxation.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 5, 'Ignore Cairo’s traffic when planning airport transfers, museum visits, and return flights.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 6, 'Stay near the airport for the entire trip, creating long daily journeys to the main historical attractions.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 7, 'Choose a Nile cruise based only on the ship’s appearance without checking cabin quality, sailing dates, embarkation arrangements, and onboard service.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 8, 'Plan Luxor’s West Bank as a casual afternoon visit, even though it involves early starts, outdoor walking, uneven surfaces, and heat exposure.'),
  ('luxor', 122, 9, 'Add a late-night dinner or entertainment experience before an early domestic flight or full sightseeing day.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 0, 'Builds the itinerary around the traveler’s purpose, comfort level, interests, and preferred pace.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 1, 'Uses Cairo as the arrival and departure gateway, while arranging Aswan and Luxor as a logical Nile-cruise sequence.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 2, 'Groups nearby attractions together, such as Giza and Saqqara, the Egyptian Museum and Downtown Cairo, or the Citadel and Islamic Cairo.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 3, 'Places outdoor sightseeing early in the morning, especially at the Pyramids, Saqqara, Luxor’s West Bank, and other exposed archaeological sites.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 4, 'Protects travel buffers for Cairo traffic, airport procedures, domestic flights, cruise embarkation, and hotel check-in.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 5, 'Chooses a well-located Cairo hotel in Giza, Zamalek, Garden City, Downtown, or the Nile Corniche according to the traveler’s priorities.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 6, 'Selects the Nile cruise based on sailing dates, cabin comfort, food quality, service standards, itinerary reliability, and embarkation convenience.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 7, 'Uses private air-conditioned vehicles and professional guides for major sightseeing days, airport transfers, and multi-site excursions.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 8, 'Limits each day to one major sightseeing block plus one lighter experience whenever possible.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 9, 'Balances ancient monuments with hotel downtime, spa treatments, pool time, relaxed meals, and Nile-based evenings.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 10, 'Keeps the Pyramids and Sphinx visit focused, comfortable, and flexible rather than extending it into an exhausting full-day schedule.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 11, 'Combines Luxor’s East Bank temples on one day and the West Bank monuments on another to reduce unnecessary backtracking.'),
  ('luxor', 123, 12, 'Arranges selected tombs and temples according to the traveler’s interests instead of attempting to visit every available site.'),
