  ('alexandria', 194, 9, 'Uses the tram as a local experience or budget transport option when the route is practical, rather than depending on it for the entire itinerary.'),
  ('alexandria', 194, 10, 'Arranges a private guide or specialist cultural guide for the Catacombs, Pompey’s Pillar, Qaitbay Citadel, Kom El-Dikka, and other major heritage sites.'),
  ('alexandria', 194, 11, 'Combines important attractions with authentic local experiences such as seafood restaurants, Egyptian cafés, bakeries, markets, traditional desserts, and harbour walks.'),
  ('alexandria', 194, 12, 'Keeps honeymoon itineraries to approximately two major activities per day, balancing one special experience with free time, privacy, cafés, hotel relaxation, and sunset views.'),
  ('alexandria', 194, 13, 'Designs family itineraries around shorter attraction visits, predictable meal times, air-conditioned transport, gardens, aquariums, planetarium visits, and midday hotel breaks.'),
  ('alexandria', 194, 14, 'Checks whether children, seniors, or mobility-sensitive travellers can comfortably manage stairs, uneven pavements, crowded streets, archaeological interiors, and long vehicle journeys.'),
  ('alexandria', 194, 15, 'Uses Montaza, Stanley, and eastern beaches as a separate coastal day rather than combining them with western archaeological sites.'),
  ('alexandria', 194, 16, 'Adds Rosetta, El Alamein, Wadi El Natrun, or the North Coast only when the traveller has at least five nights, a specific interest, and enough flexibility for a longer excursion.'),
  ('alexandria', 194, 17, 'Keeps one flexible period in the itinerary for weather, traffic, museum closures, shopping, photography, or revisiting a favourite waterfront area.'),
