  ('ile-aux-cerfs', 411, 0, 'Choose pre-arranged private car transfers or licensed taxis.- Use private vehicles for hotel pickup and mainland excursions.- Limit the itinerary to 1–2 major activities daily, with a midday rest.- Choose hotels with lifts, accessible rooms, reliable bathrooms, and minimal stairs.- Confirm accessibility at each hotel and attraction before booking.- Schedule outdoor activities during cooler morning or late-afternoon hours.- Prioritize comfort, shorter journeys, and relaxed pacing.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs', 411, 1, 'Short, well-organized island visits with boat transfers handled in advance.- Calm lagoon time, beach relaxation, and light sightseeing.- Chauffeured transfers to reduce walking and navigation stress.- Hotel-based relaxation, spa treatments, and comfortable dining.- Experienced guides and reputable tour operators.- Staying on the east coast or in a comfortable base with easy transfer access.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs', 411, 2, 'Long cross-island journeys during peak traffic.- Frequent hotel changes.- Extended walking tours or steep outdoor trails.- Hotels and attractions with unverified accessibility.- Unlicensed transport or poorly planned transfers.- Very early starts or late evenings without adequate rest.'),
