  ('mahe-island', 482, 7, 'Petite Anse & Baie Lazare (Luxury resort sky lounges, cocktail pavilions, sunset bars)'),
  ('mahe-island', 482, 8, 'Victoria & Suburban Hubs (Local pub gatherings, sports bars, weekend night spots)'),
  ('mahe-island', 482, 9, 'Watching the sunset over the Indian Ocean from Beau Vallon Beach or Anse Intendance'),
  ('mahe-island', 482, 10, 'Scenic evening cocktails at high-end resort lounges overlooking private bays'),
  ('mahe-island', 482, 11, 'Enjoying live Creole band performances and traditional Moutya dancing at resort cultural nights'),
  ('mahe-island', 482, 12, 'Casual beachfront bar-hopping along the Beau Vallon promenade'),
  ('mahe-island', 482, 13, 'Starlight dining at oceanfront bistros with the sound of breaking waves'),
  ('mahe-island', 482, 14, 'Cocktail sessions at Eden Island Marina overlooking luxury yachts'),
  ('mahe-island', 482, 15, 'Late-night local seafood suppers at seaside taverns'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 0, 'Treat Mahé Island as only Beau Vallon beach + Victoria clock tower and miss Port Launay marine heritage, Morne Blanc panoramas, Anse Intendance waves, and UNESCO-nominated Morne Seychellois National Park sites.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 1, 'Overload Day 1 with Victoria Market, Clock Tower, Botanical Gardens, Mission Lodge, and a sunset catamaran cruise all within a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 2, 'Try to combine Mahé + Praslin + La Digue + Silhouette + Bird Island in a short itinerary simply because Inner Island sea connections look short on a map.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 3, 'Rely entirely on narrow coastal road taxis during peak rush hours, or ignore Mahé''s budget public SPTC bus network and accessible car rental options.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 4, 'Underestimate advance-booking rules and strict daily ticket limits for top creole fine-dining restaurants, Sainte Anne Marine Park diving trips, and ziplining activities during peak holiday seasons.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 5, 'Treat Mahé''s climate as uniform and ignore seasonal extremes between humid northwest monsoon rains, trade-wind choppy seas, and drier southeast trade-wind windows.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 6, 'Plan outdoor Victoria Market walks, open-air beach dining, or Morne Seychellois coastal hikes without checking weather forecasts, heavy rain days, or extreme seasonal tourist crowds.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 7, 'Ignore Seychellois Creole gastronomy by treating meals only as mega-resort international buffets instead of scheduling authentic Ladob, Octopus Curry, Grilled Jobfish, Fresh Coconut Water, and Shark Chutney.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 8, 'Schedule excessive hotel moves between North Mahé and South Mahé even when a single central base in Eden Island or Grand Anse serves the entire island efficiently.'),
  ('mahe-island', 508, 9, 'Assume every jungle trail, granite peak lookout, and secluded cove path is automatically step-free or fully accessible.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around VICTORIA_CLOCK_TOWER_AND_MARKET + BEAU_VALLON_BEACH + MORNE_SEYCHELLOIS_NATIONAL_PARK + ANSE_INTENDANCE_AND_SOUTH_MAHE.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 1, 'Gives Victoria Town Centre & the Botanical Gardens enough time for heritage walks, colonial architecture photography, and afternoon shaded strolls without rushing.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 2, 'Gives Anse Royale or Port Launay trips enough time for HISTORIC_VILLAGE_STROLL + COASTAL_SEAFOOD_DINING + CREOLE_DISTILLERY_VISITS rather than treating them as rushed side trips.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 3, 'Adds MISSION_LODGE & TAKAMAKA_RUM_DISTILLERY for colonial heritage, mountain history, and traditional rum-tasting culture.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 4, 'Uses NATIONAL_MUSEUM_OF_HISTORY / SEYCHELLES_NATURAL_HISTORY_MUSEUM selectively when local art, island biodiversity, and Seychellois heritage exhibitions are the focus.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 5, 'Uses BAIE_LAZARE / SAINTE_ANNE_MARINE_PARK / MORNE_BLANC_TRAIL when coastal walks, marine nature trails, and giant tortoise viewing are preferred.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 6, 'Uses RENTAL_CARS and SPTC_BUSES for island transit, and private transfers or luxury MPVs for airport arrivals and late-night moves.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 7, 'Keeps time for Eden Island cafes, traditional tea taverns, waterfront parks, and relaxed island-style strolling.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 8, 'Matches outdoor sightseeing, marine snorkeling, and mountain observation decks to seasonal weather, sea visibility, and daylight conditions.'),
  ('mahe-island', 509, 9, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 0, 'WALKING + SELF_DRIVE_CAR_RENTALS for Beau Vallon, Victoria, Anse Royale, and South Mahé coastal road access'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 1, 'SPTC_PUBLIC_BUSES for budget transit between major towns, beaches, and ferry terminals'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 2, 'TAXIS / PRIVATE_MPV selectively for late-night airport transfers, mountain passes, and luggage-heavy moves'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 3, 'CAT_COCOS_FERRIES for direct maritime cross-island transit to Praslin Jetty and La Digue'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 4, 'AIR_SEYCHELLES_DOMESTIC_FLIGHTS for rapid air links between Seychelles International Airport (SEZ) and Praslin Island'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 5, 'GLASS_BOTTOM_BOATS selectively for quick access to Sainte Anne Marine National Park and snorkeling reefs'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 6, 'Victoria Clock Tower & Sir Selwyn Selwyn-Clarke Market sensory exploration'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 7, 'Beau Vallon Beach crescent bay walk & water sports experience'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 8, 'Morne Blanc trail summit panoramic view over Mahé''s west coast'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 9, 'Signature Seychelles Creole Octopus Curry tasting at local takeaway stalls or beachside bistros'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 10, 'Mission Lodge historic heritage site exploration & mountain viewing deck'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 11, 'Takamaka Rum Distillery guided tour & heritage estate rum tasting'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 12, 'Anse Intendance wild granite boulder beach walk & surf viewing'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 13, 'Victoria Botanical Gardens interactive tour & Giant Aldabra Tortoise feeding'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 14, 'Sainte Anne Marine National Park glass-bottom boat tour & marine snorkeling'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 15, 'Domaine de Val des Prés traditional Creole Craft Village cultural tour'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 16, 'Do not treat Mahé as only resort pools while skipping local Creole heritage sites and preserved southern beaches.'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 17, 'Do not force Victoria Market + Morne Blanc + Anse Intendance + Sainte Anne Marine Park + Praslin day trip all into a single day.'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 18, 'Do not underestimate advance online booking rules for popular fine dining, marine park charters, and peak holiday car rentals.'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 19, 'Do not rely solely on public buses during late evening hours when routes run infrequently and car rentals offer fixed convenience.'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 20, 'Do not visit Morne Blanc observation decks on heavy cloud or rainy days without checking live mountain weather.'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 21, 'Do not plan extensive outdoor mountain hikes without checking seasonal weather, tropical storm warnings, and intense humidity.'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 22, 'Do not miss Seychellois Creole fusion gastronomy by eating only standard Western resort buffets.'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 23, 'Do not assume historic jungle trails, temple thresholds, and granite beach rocks are fully step-free or barrier-free.'),
  ('mahe-island', 512, 24, 'Do not ignore physical scale; winding island mountain roads and expansive national park trails require reasonable physical stamina.'),
  ('mahe-island', 513, 0, 'Tourism Seychelles (seychelles.travel) — Official government tourism board details covering national parks, island beaches, cultural events, and heritage itineraries.'),
  ('mahe-island', 513, 1, 'Seychelles Heritage Foundation & National Museum of History — Official entry guidelines, opening schedules, reservation policies, and preservation updates for island heritage sites.'),
  ('mahe-island', 513, 2, 'Seychelles Public Transport Corporation (SPTC) & Seychelles Ports Authority — Urban bus transit networks, ferry terminal schedules, and harbor accessibility updates.'),
  ('mahe-island', 513, 3, 'Seychelles Meteorological Authority (SMA) — Seasonal climate data, tropical rain warning protocols, and monsoon weather patterns.'),
  ('mahe-island', 513, 4, 'Official venue operators — Takamaka Rum Distillery, Constance Ephelia Zipline Park, Cat Cocos Ferry Services, and Seychelles National Parks Authority (SNPA).'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 0, 'Withdraw South African Rand (ZAR) cash at major bank ATMs (such as Standard Bank, FNB, ABSA, or Nedbank) located inside secure shopping malls (like Sandton City or Rosebank Mall) or directly inside O.R. Tambo International Airport (JNB); local bank ATMs charge a standard foreign withdrawal fee of approximately ZAR 30 to ZAR 80 ($1.60–$4.50 USD), and mall locations provide optimal security.'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 1, 'Dine at local *shisa nyama* spots (traditional township braais) like Kozonzo or Busy Corner Imbizo Shisa Nyama, craft food hubs like the Neighbourgoods Market in Braamfontein, or casual neighborhood eateries, where full local meals cost between ZAR 80 and ZAR 180 ($4.50–$10.00 USD), compared to high-end upscale steakhouses charging ZAR 400 to ZAR 1,000+ per dish.'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 2, 'Take the Gautrain rapid rail system for airport transfers and travel between key nodes like Sandton, Rosebank, and Park Station (ZAR 40 to ZAR 220 / $2.20–$12.00 USD per trip), which avoids unpredictable highway traffic jams and is significantly cheaper and safer than flag-down street taxis.'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 3, 'Book shared small-group walking tours in Maboneng, street art crawls in Braamfontein, or guided township tours in Soweto (ZAR 300 to ZAR 650 / $16–$35 USD per person) instead of hiring private, exclusive day drivers, which charge heavy single-traveler premiums.'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 4, 'Reserve entry tickets online in advance for major cultural attractions like the Apartheid Museum, Constitution Hill, or Sterkfontein Caves to secure standard pricing and guarantee timed entry slots without queuing.'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 5, 'Hailing unmetered street taxis or accepting informal private rides outside transport hubs instead of using trusted ride-hailing apps like Uber/Bolt or official Gautrain lines, as security risks and overcharging are high.'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 6, 'Booking cheap budget accommodation in isolated or high-risk outer suburbs purely to save money on nightly rates, as high private transit costs and safety concerns will quickly outweigh room savings.'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 7, 'Relying exclusively on credit cards when visiting local craft markets, informal street stalls, or township vendors, where small cash denominations (ZAR 10, ZAR 20, and ZAR 50 notes) are strictly required.'),
  ('johannesburg', 517, 8, 'Skipping comprehensive travel and emergency medical insurance, as top-tier private medical facilities in Johannesburg (like Netcare or Life Healthcare) demand guaranteed international coverage or substantial cash deposits before admitting foreign patients.'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 0, '4+'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 1, '6+'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 2, '8+'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 3, 'Teenagers'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 4, 'Rely on trusted ride-hailing apps like Uber or book private, air-conditioned vehicle charters rather than taking local commuter trains or unguided minibus taxis; point-to-point transfers ensure a safer, smoother, and far more comfortable journey across the city with kids.'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 5, 'Schedule outdoor activities—such as exploring the Johannesburg Botanical Garden or visiting gold rush heritage sites—for the morning hours, saving indoor museums and climate-controlled venues for peak afternoon temperatures or sudden highveld rain showers.'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 6, 'Utilize a sturdy, large-wheeled stroller for manicured botanical gardens, sprawling zoo grounds, and modern shopping complexes, but switch to a child carrier when navigating sites with uneven terrain, high steps, or outdoor trail paths.'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 7, 'Incorporate interactive, educational stops like science centers, planetariums, and hands-on wildlife sanctuaries to keep children engaged while balancing historical and cultural sightseeing.'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 8, 'Base your stay in family-friendly, secure commercial hubs such as Sandton, Rosebank, or Melrose Arch, which offer gated pedestrian zones, lush green parks, easy access to shopping and dining, and quick links to transit.'),
  ('johannesburg', 518, 9, 'Pack key essentials for day trips, including plenty of bottled water, child-safe insect repellent, high-SPF sunscreen, wide-brimmed hats, and light jackets, as highveld weather can shift quickly and UV exposure remains strong year-round.'),
  ('johannesburg', 519, 0, 'honeymoon_score: 86'),
  ('johannesburg', 519, 1, 'romance_score: 88'),
  ('johannesburg', 519, 2, 'privacy_score: 90'),
  ('johannesburg', 519, 3, 'luxury_score: 92'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 0, 'Bungee jumping, SCAD diving, or zip-lining between the iconic 100-meter-tall Orlando Towers in Soweto.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 1, 'Floating high above the Magaliesberg biosphere on a sunrise hot-air balloon flight, or skydiving over the scenic country grid.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 2, 'Navigating white-water rapids and river rafting down the Vaal River near Parys or the Crocodile River.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 3, 'Riding quads and off-road ATVs through rugged bushveld trails and dirt tracks in the Magaliesberg foothills.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 4, 'Canopy zip-lining through ancient cliff faces and forest ravines in the Magaliesberg Mountains.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 5, '**Soweto (Orlando Towers)** — best for urban extreme sports, cooling tower bungee jumping, and SCAD free-falling.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 6, '**Magaliesberg & Hartbeespoort** — best for tree-canopy zip-lining, mountain trail quad biking, and hot-air ballooning.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 7, '**Parys & Vaal River Basin** — best for white-water rafting, kayaking, river boarding, and rock climbing.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 8, '**Cradle of Humankind & Pretoria Outer Reserves** — best for trail running, mountain biking, cave exploring (Sterkfontein), and wildlife tracking.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 9, 'Weekend warriors and thrill-seekers looking for fast day-trip outdoor escapes.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 10, 'Bungee jumpers, extreme sports junkies, and aerial adventurers.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 11, 'Off-road drivers, quad bike riders, and trail enthusiasts.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 12, 'Mountain hikers, trail runners, and nature explorers.'),
  ('johannesburg', 521, 13, 'Active travelers who want urban luxury paired with high-adrenaline outdoor excursions.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 0, 'Book private air-conditioned vehicle transfers or reliable ride-hailing services (Uber) for all city movements to ensure safety, avoid unassisted walking along busy roads, and bypass public transit complexities.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 1, 'Select accommodations in modern, secure districts like Sandton, Rosebank, Melrose Arch, or Hyde Park that feature high-speed elevators, step-free entrances, wheelchair accessibility, and excellent concierge support.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 2, 'Schedule outdoor excursions—such as visiting the Walter Sisulu National Botanical Garden or heritage sites—during crisp morning hours to enjoy pleasant weather and comfortable walking conditions.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 3, 'Utilize internal transport options at large nature reserves and historical sites, such as golf carts or guided shuttle tours, to minimize walking over long distances or uneven terrain.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 4, 'Pack supportive walking shoes, high-SPF sunscreen, wide-brimmed hats, prescription medications, and health insurance documentation; world-class medical facilities like Netcare Olivedale and Rosebank Clinic are easily accessible in main hubs.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 5, 'Incorporate climate-controlled indoor attractions—such as the Johannesburg Art Gallery, Wits Art Museum, or high-end shopping centers—into afternoon schedules for relaxing indoor breaks.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 6, 'Guided cultural tours of historic landmarks with accessible pathways, including the Constitution Hill Precinct, Apartheid Museum, and Liliesleaf Farm.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 7, 'Experiencing afternoon tea, fine dining, and live piano music inside premier 5-star hotels like The Saxon Hotel, Four Seasons The Westcliff, or Mount Grace.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 8, 'Taking leisurely morning strolls through secure, beautifully landscaped green spaces like the Johannesburg Botanical Garden or Melrose Arch piazza.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 9, 'Attending evening orchestral performances, theater shows, or ballet presentations at the Joburg Theatre or Montecasino Teatro.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 10, 'Enjoying panoramic highveld sunset views over the city canopy from comfortable hilltop hotel lounges or fine-dining terraces.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 11, 'Attempting to navigate public transit networks like unguided commuter trains or local minibus taxis.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 12, 'Walking alone through central business district streets after dark or through dense, unguided commercial markets without personal local assistance.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 13, 'Staying in multi-story boutique guesthouses or older suburban lodges that lack elevators or step-free ground floor access.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 14, 'Scheduling strenuous outdoor walking tours during midday summer heat spikes.'),
  ('johannesburg', 522, 15, 'Accepting unsolicited transportation offers or street taxi flag-downs from unverified operators at airports or transit hubs.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 0, 'Visit a bustling township *shisa nyama* (like Sakhumzi or Kwa Lichaba in Soweto) to choose raw cuts of beef, chicken, or boerewors to be grilled over open coals, served with *pap* (maize porridge) and spicy *chakalaka* relish.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 1, 'Savor iconic South African comfort dishes, including Cape Malay **Bobotie** (spiced minced meat baked with an egg custard topping), **Boerewors** (coriander-spiced beef sausage), **Potjiekos** (slow-cooked cast-iron pot stew), and spicy **Bunny Chow** (hollowed-out loaf of bread filled with rich curry).'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 2, 'Indulge in traditional sweet treats and street snacks, like warm **Malva Pudding** served with custard, sticky syrup-infused **Koeksisters**, savory savory-filled **Vetkoek** (fried dough bread), and cured **Biltong** or **Droëwors** dried meats.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 3, 'Explore Pan-African cuisines across the city, sampling fiery Mozambican piri-piri prawns and chicken, communal Ethiopian *injera* platters topped with *kitfo*, and Nigerian *egusi* or pepper soup.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 4, 'Experience Joburg''s world-class open-fire fine dining (at celebrated tables like *Marble* in Rosebank), where premium local Wagyu beef, seafood, and game meats are elevated over open flames.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 5, '**Families:** Vibrant open-air weekend markets (like Prison Break Market or Victoria Yards), family-friendly steak houses, and relaxed dining in Melrose Arch or Sandton.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 6, '**Honeymooners:** Intimate candlelit dinners in Westcliff ridges, romantic rooftop dining in Rosebank, and high-end hotel tasting rooms at The Saxon.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 7, '**Luxury travelers:** High-end wood-fired tasting menus, private wine-pairing cellars in Sandton and Rosebank, and chef-driven contemporary African gastronomy.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 8, '**Budget travelers:** Street food vendors in Maboneng, local township *shisa nyama* braais, and casual Ethiopian eateries in Jeppestown.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 9, '**Foodies:** Township culinary tours in Soweto, artisan weekend food markets, craft brewery taprooms, and progressive fine-dining meat joints.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 10, '**Rosebank & Sandton:** Best for high-end open-fire dining, international steak houses, luxury hotel restaurants, and upscale cafes.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('johannesburg', 524, 11, '**Soweto (Vilakazi Street & Orlando):** Best for authentic *shisa nyama* braai experiences, township street food, local beers, and traditional South African comfort food.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 12, '**Melville & Parkhurst (7th Street & 4th Avenue):** Best for bohemian sidewalk bistros, independent coffee shops, craft cocktail bars, and cozy neighborhood haunts.'),
  ('johannesburg', 524, 13, '**Maboneng & Braamfontein:** Best for eclectic urban street food, Saturday artisan markets, African fusion pop-ups, and vibrant rooftop food lounges.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 0, '**Traditional African Crafts & Beadwork:** Intricately handcrafted Zulu beadwork, carved wooden sculptures, woven baskets, and traditional African masks from across the continent.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 1, '**South African Fine Diamonds & Tanzanite:** High-grade, locally mined loose diamonds, Tanzanite gemstones, and custom-designed luxury jewelry from certified diamond houses.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 2, '**Premium South African Wines & Spirits:** Award-winning Stellenbosch and Franschhoek vintages, South African craft gins, and traditional marula liqueur (Amarula).'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 3, '**Local Designer Fashion & Contemporary Leather Goods:** High-end ostrich and game-skin leather accessories, bespoke boots, and contemporary fashion from top South African designers.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 4, '**Artisanal Food Souvenirs & Biltong:** Vacuum-sealed gourmet cured meats (biltong and droëwors), Rooibos tea blends, local honey, and artisanal hot sauces.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 5, '**Sandton City & Nelson Mandela Square:** Preferred for luxury high-fashion houses, global designer boutiques, fine jewelry stores, and upscale dining surrounding the iconic Nelson Mandela statue.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 6, '**Rosebank Mall & The Zone @ Rosebank:** Ideal for modern indoor shopping, open-air pedestrian arcades, and the famous Sunday Rosebank Flea Market for African crafts and antiques.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 7, '**Melrose Arch & Hyde Park Corner:** Preferred for open-air, high-end lifestyle shopping, European-style piazza dining, luxury boutique stores, and elite bookshops.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 8, '**44 Stanley & Victoria Yards:** Best for indie boutique browsing, local designer fashion, artisanal coffee shops, handmade ceramics, and creative studio workshops.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 9, 'Carrying large amounts of visible cash or wearing high-value luxury jewelry while shopping in busy open-air street markets or inner-city shopping strips.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 10, 'Purchasing uncertified gemstones, raw diamonds, or protected animal-skin products from unauthorized street sellers without proper export certificates.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 11, 'Expecting small craft market stalls or independent street vendors to accept international credit cards; keep small cash amounts in South African Rand (ZAR) handy for craft purchases.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 12, '**Luxury & High-Street Shoppers:** Visitors looking for world-class, air-conditioned mega-malls packed with international luxury labels, high-end jewelry houses, and department stores.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 13, '**Art & Craft Collectors:** Travelers seeking high-quality African beadwork, hand-carved wooden sculptures, woven basketry, and contemporary local artwork.'),
  ('johannesburg', 525, 14, '**Indie & Fashion Enthusiasts:** Shoppers interested in local South African fashion designers, bespoke leather goods, artisanal home decor, and creative market concepts.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 0, '**Amapiano & Afro-house fans** looking for world-class local DJ sets, infectious dance rhythms, and energetic dance floors that bump until the early hours.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 1, '**Cocktail connoisseurs & rooftop seekers** hunting for chic skyline views, mixology lounges, and sunset sundowners over the city’s green canopy.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 2, '**Live music & jazz lovers** seeking intimate venues, soulful African jazz performances, and energetic local bands.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 3, '**Township nightlife enthusiasts** wanting authentic open-air braais, live entertainment, and vibrant community bar setups in Soweto.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 4, 'Enjoying stylish rooftop bars, high-end cocktail lounges, and chic dining spots in **Rosebank and Sandton**.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 5, 'Experiencing bohemian sidewalk bars, craft beer spots, and cozy live music haunts along 7th Street in **Melville**.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 6, 'Exploring trendsetting African electronic music venues, hip-hop clubs, and rooftop lounges in **Braamfontein and Rosebank**.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 7, 'Soaking up vibrant township culture, open-coal braais, and live music along Vilakazi Street in **Soweto**.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 8, 'Walking through quiet, unlit, or unfamiliar city streets late at night; always rely on ride-hailing apps like Uber or Bolt for door-to-door transport.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 9, 'Leaving drinks or personal belongings unattended in crowded nightclubs or busy street venues.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 10, 'Displaying expensive jewelry, cameras, or large amounts of cash while out at night in crowded urban pockets.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 11, '**Rosebank & Sandton:** Modern, safe, and sophisticated hubs packed with upscale rooftop bars, fine-dining lounges, and high-energy dance clubs catering to a stylish crowd.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 12, '**Melville (7th Street):** A bohemian, eclectic strip featuring relaxed pubs, indie live-music spots, cocktail lounges, and intimate neighborhood bars.'),
  ('johannesburg', 526, 13, '**Braamfontein & Maboneng:** Creative urban districts popular with students, young creatives, and music lovers, offering hip rooftop venues, craft beer hubs, and vibrant Afro-beat/Amapiano dance floors.'),
  ('johannesburg', 540, 0, '**Morning / Afternoon:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 540, 1, 'Arrive at O.R. Tambo International Airport (JNB) in Johannesburg.'),
  ('johannesburg', 540, 2, 'Take the complimentary Peermont shuttle from the airport directly to your hotel complex.'),
  ('johannesburg', 540, 3, 'Check into **Peermont Metcourt Suites at Emperors Palace** (Bed & Breakfast).'),
  ('johannesburg', 540, 4, 'Spend the afternoon relaxing at the hotel complex after your flight.'),
  ('johannesburg', 540, 5, '**Lunch & Dinner:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 540, 6, 'Enjoy authentic Indian cuisine for both lunch and dinner at **Taste of Mumbai** (located within the Emperors Palace complex).'),
  ('johannesburg', 540, 7, '**Overnight:** Peermont Metcourt Suites at Emperors Palace, Johannesburg.'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 1, 'Enjoy breakfast at the hotel.'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 2, 'Depart on a private half-day **Gold Reef City Tour** (1–7 seater vehicle).'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 3, 'Explore the surface tour of Gold Reef City, experience the historic gold pour demonstration, and enjoy the family amusement park rides. *(Note: Underground mine tour available on your own account).*'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 4, '**Lunch:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 5, 'Lunch at **The Raj Restaurant** at Gold Reef City.'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 6, '**Afternoon:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 7, 'Return to Emperors Palace for leisure time, exploring the casino, gardens, and entertainment concourse.'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 8, '**Dinner:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 541, 9, 'Dinner at **Taste of Mumbai** in the Emperors Palace complex.'),
