  ('johannesburg', 547, 3, 'Take the **Table Mountain Aerial Cableway** (return ticket included) to the summit for 360-degree views of the Mother City, Atlantic coastline, and Lion''s Head.'),
  ('johannesburg', 547, 4, '**Lunch:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 547, 5, 'Lunch at an **Indian Restaurant** in Cape Town.'),
