  ('johannesburg', 547, 7, 'Explore historic inner-city highlights, including the colorful streets of **Bo-Kaap** and the **Company''s Garden**.'),
  ('johannesburg', 547, 8, '**Evening:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 547, 9, 'Experience an immersive cultural evening at **GOLD Restaurant**, featuring an interactive Djembe drumming session, live African entertainment, and a 14-course African tasting feast served to your table.'),
  ('johannesburg', 547, 10, '**Overnight:** The Capetonian Hotel, Cape Town CBD.'),
