  ('johannesburg', 548, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel.'),
  ('johannesburg', 548, 2, 'Depart on a full-day private **Cape Peninsula Tour** via your dedicated vehicle.'),
  ('johannesburg', 548, 3, 'Arrive in Hout Bay and board the **Nauticat Catamaran Cruise** to **Duiker Island (Seal Island)** to see thousands of wild Cape fur seals.'),
  ('johannesburg', 548, 4, 'Drive along the spectacular coastal cliffs of **Chapman’s Peak Drive** (entrance fee included).'),
  ('johannesburg', 548, 5, '**Afternoon:**'),
  ('johannesburg', 548, 6, 'Continue to **Cape Point** inside Table Mountain National Park; take the **Flying Dutchman Funicular** up to the lighthouse and visit the iconic **Cape of Good Hope** sign.'),
  ('johannesburg', 548, 7, 'Stop at **Boulders Beach** in Simon''s Town (entrance fee included) to walk along the wooden boardwalks beside wild African penguins.'),
