  ('johannesburg', 549, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel and check-out.'),
  ('johannesburg', 549, 2, 'Private transfer in a 7-seater vehicle from **The Capetonian Hotel** to **Cape Town International Airport (CPT)** for your onward flight home.'),
  ('johannesburg', 560, 0, 'Treat Johannesburg merely as an unavoidable transit hub or flight transfer point on the way to Kruger National Park or Cape Town, overlooking its rich anti-apartheid history, thriving contemporary art scene, and bold culinary culture.'),
  ('johannesburg', 560, 1, 'Severely underestimate the vast geographical spread of Gauteng, attempting to combine distant districts like Soweto, the Cradle of Humankind, and Sandton in a single day without accounting for highway traffic gridlock during peak commute hours.'),
  ('johannesburg', 560, 2, 'Attempt to walk unescorted between major neighborhoods or through the inner-city central business district late in the afternoon or evening, assuming standard urban walkability applies across all zones.'),
  ('johannesburg', 560, 3, 'Rely on unguided informal transit or attempt to hail random street cabs instead of booking pre-arranged private chauffeur transfers or utilizing trusted ride-hailing apps like Uber and Bolt.'),
  ('johannesburg', 560, 4, 'Fail to pre-book timed entry tickets for key historical landmarks like the Apartheid Museum or Constitution Hill, leading to long entry delays or missed time slots during busy travel periods.'),
  ('johannesburg', 561, 0, 'Precinct-clusters all activities into logical geographic loops—pairing Soweto heritage tours with the Apartheid Museum, and Sandton/Rosebank shopping with local art galleries and fine dining.'),
  ('johannesburg', 561, 1, 'Pre-books accredited local guides and private chauffeured vehicles for half-day or full-day tours, ensuring safe, seamless door-to-door transit and deep local context.'),
  ('johannesburg', 561, 2, 'Selects secure, self-contained commercial hubs like Sandton, Rosebank, or Melrose Arch as accommodation bases, allowing clients to enjoy walkable access to high-end dining, retail, and Gautrain airport links.'),
  ('johannesburg', 561, 3, 'Schedules outdoor excursions and township tours for clear morning hours, leaving indoor museums, shopping arcades, and spa retreats for peak afternoon heat or sudden highveld summer thunder showers.'),
  ('johannesburg', 561, 4, 'Reserves tables at top-tier open-fire fine dining establishments and rooftop lounges weeks in advance, particularly for weekend dining in Rosebank and Sandton.'),
  ('johannesburg', 562, 0, 'For **Geographical Pacing**, split Greater Johannesburg into clear operational zones—Historic South (Soweto, Gold Reef City, Apartheid Museum), Modern North (Sandton, Rosebank, Melrose Arch), and Outer West/North (Cradle of Humankind, Magaliesberg)—and never schedule transfers across zones during peak rush hours (7:00 AM–9:30 AM and 4:30 PM–7:00 PM).'),
  ('johannesburg', 562, 1, 'For **Transit Management**, always allocate a 45- to 60-minute buffer when traveling between different commercial nodes or heading to O.R. Tambo International Airport (JNB), even when using the high-speed Gautrain rail link.'),
  ('johannesburg', 562, 2, 'For **Itinerary Balance**, dedicate at least 2 full days to Johannesburg—1 day focused on anti-apartheid history, township culture, and national museums, and 1 day dedicated to contemporary African art galleries, open-fire dining, and luxury retail.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 0, 'Take an immersive guided tour of **Soweto**, visiting the historic Vilakazi Street, Nelson Mandela''s former home, and the Hector Pieterson Memorial.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 1, 'Experience a deeply moving journey through South Africa''s struggle for freedom at the world-renowned **Apartheid Museum** and **Constitution Hill**.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 2, 'Ride the high-speed **Gautrain** between Sandton and Rosebank to explore contemporary art galleries, high-end retail malls, and vibrant outdoor plazas like **Melrose Arch**.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 3, 'Indulge in open-fire South African gastronomy, craft mixology, and rooftop skyline views in **Rosebank** or **Sandton**.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 4, 'Take a day trip into the **Cradle of Humankind** (Maropeng and Sterkfontein Caves) to trace early human origins at a UNESCO World Heritage site.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 5, 'Walking unescorted between major neighborhoods or through the central business district (CBD) on foot, especially after dark; always utilize pre-arranged private transport or ride-hailing apps.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 6, 'Hailing unmetered street cabs outside major transit hubs; rely strictly on trusted ride-hailing services (Uber/Bolt) or pre-booked hotel transfers.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 7, 'Displaying high-value jewelry, unwatched cameras, or visible smartphones while walking through busy public market zones or street corners.'),
  ('johannesburg', 565, 8, 'Scheduling tight land transfers across Greater Johannesburg during peak morning (7:00 AM – 9:30 AM) and afternoon (4:30 PM – 7:00 PM) rush-hour traffic corridors.'),
  ('johannesburg', 566, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 0, 'Withdraw local currency (ZAR) at major bank branch ATMs—such as Standard Bank, FNB, ABSA, or Capitec—located inside secure shopping centers (like the V&A Waterfront or Cavendish Square) or at Cape Town International Airport (CPT); foreign card withdrawals usually incur a fixed local ATM fee of R50 to R75 ($2.70–$4.10 USD), so opt to withdraw larger sums at once and always decline dynamic currency conversion (DCC).'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 1, 'Eat at informal neighborhood eateries, bakery cafes, fish-and-chip shops along Kalk Bay harbour, or vibrant food markets like the Mojo Market in Point or the Oranjezicht City Farm Market, where a delicious meal costs R90 to R180 ($5–$10 USD), compared to fine-dining winery restaurants charging R600 to R1,500+ ($33–$82+ USD) per head.'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 2, 'Utilize the MyCiTi bus service or shared minibus routes for city transit (R10 to R35 / $0.55–$1.90 USD per trip) and stick to hiking routes like Lion''s Head or Table Mountain''s Platteklip Gorge on foot, which is drastically cheaper than taking peak-rate Uber rides or private day tours (R400 to R1,200+ / $22–$65+ USD).'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 3, 'Join free or budget walking tours through the colorful streets of Bo-Kaap or historical downtown Cape Town (tipping around R50 to R150 / $2.70–$8.20 USD per person) rather than hiring private, exclusive city guides, which carry heavy markups for individual travelers or small groups.'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 4, 'Purchase city attraction passes or major site tickets online in advance through official vendor platforms to secure discounted bundled rates and skip long ticket queues for high-demand spots like the Table Mountain Aerial Cableway or Robben Island Ferry.'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 5, 'Booking cheap accommodation in isolated, high-crime outer townships or non-walkable suburbs purely for lower nightly rates, as costly Uber rides to core areas like Green Point, Camps Bay, or the V&A Waterfront will quickly eliminate any room savings while compromising personal safety.'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 6, 'Relying exclusively on cash transactions in remote areas or carrying large amounts of physical money on your person, as Cape Town is largely a cashless city where credit/debit cards are accepted almost everywhere, and carrying excess cash increases security risks.'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 7, 'Attempting solo unguided hikes up secluded or less-trafficked mountain trails on Table Mountain or Silvermine without proper maps or a group, as getting lost or encountering safety incidents can happen quickly; paying for a guide or staying on heavily populated paths is strongly advised.'),
  ('cape-town', 571, 8, 'Skipping comprehensive travel and health insurance, as private hospital facilities in Cape Town (such as Mediclinic or Netcare) deliver top-tier emergency medical treatment but require immediate credit authorization or proof of international insurance coverage prior to admission.'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 0, '2+'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 1, '4+'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 2, '8+'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 3, 'Teenagers'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 4, 'Rely on trusted ride-hailing apps like Uber or rent a private car with child safety seats instead of using local informal minibus taxis; minibus taxis lack set schedules, fixed routes, and standard child safety restraints, making private transfers far safer and more comfortable.'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 5, 'Pack warm, windproof layers even on warm sunny days, especially when ascending Table Mountain or taking coastal boat trips, as microclimates change rapidly and high-altitude winds can drop temperatures significantly.'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 6, 'Use a lightweight, compact stroller for flat paved areas like the V&A Waterfront and Sea Point Promenade, but bring an ergonomic baby carrier when visiting rocky coastal reserves, mountain boardwalks, or historic cobblestone areas like Bo-Kaap.'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 7, 'Schedule major outdoor attractions—such as Boulders Beach or Table Mountain Aerial Cableway—early in the morning to avoid long queues, peak afternoon heat, and strong summer "Cape Doctor" winds.'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 8, 'Stay in secure, family-friendly coastal or inner-city hubs like Sea Point, Green Point, or the V&A Waterfront, which feature walkable promenades, fenced playgrounds, proximity to pediatric care, and direct access to top attractions.'),
  ('cape-town', 572, 9, 'Maintain active safety precautions when exploring nature reserves and parks; keep children at a safe distance from wild baboons at Cape Point and African penguins at Boulders Beach, and never feed or approach wildlife.'),
  ('cape-town', 573, 0, 'honeymoon_score: 95'),
  ('cape-town', 573, 1, 'romance_score: 96'),
  ('cape-town', 573, 2, 'privacy_score: 92'),
  ('cape-town', 573, 3, 'luxury_score: 95'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 0, 'Paragliding tandem off the slopes of Signal Hill or Lion''s Head, soaring high above the Atlantic coastline before landing on the Sea Point promenade.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 1, 'Abseiling (rappelling) 112 meters down a sheer vertical cliff face from the summit of Table Mountain with sweeping views of the ocean below.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 2, 'Snorkeling or free-diving with wild Cape fur seals and navigating through dense kelp forests in the chilly Atlantic waters off Hout Bay.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 3, 'Hiking up the steep, technical knife-edge ridge of India Venster or ascending Platteklip Gorge to reach the top of Table Mountain.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 4, 'Surfing the iconic point breaks of Muizenberg for beginners or tackling the heavy swells of Noordhoek and Dunes for experienced surfers.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 5, '**Table Mountain National Park** — best for vertical cliff abseiling, technical mountain hiking, trail running, and rock climbing.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 6, '**Signal Hill & Lion''s Head** — best for tandem paragliding, sunrise/sunset scrambles, and panoramic coastal trail runs.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 7, '**Hout Bay & False Bay** — best for ocean seal snorkeling, sea kayaking alongside marine life, and coastal boat excursions.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 8, '**Muizenberg & Atlantic Beaches** — best for surfing, kite-surfing, bodyboarding, and open-ocean water sports.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 9, 'Adrenaline junkies and extreme sports enthusiasts seeking diverse terrain within minutes of the city center.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 10, 'Mountain hikers, trail runners, and rock climbers looking for world-class technical routes.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 11, 'Surfers, kiteboarders, and ocean sports lovers wanting varied coastal conditions.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 12, 'Sky and air sports enthusiasts seeking unforgettable tandem paragliding experiences.'),
  ('cape-town', 575, 13, 'Outdoor adventurers who want top-tier nature experiences combined with cosmopolitan dining and lodging.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 0, 'Book private air-conditioned vehicle transfers, dedicated day-chauffeurs, or reliable ride-hailing services (Uber) for all movements to avoid long walks on steep inclines and navigation of public commuter transit lines.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 1, 'Select accommodations in flat, highly secure districts like the V&A Waterfront, Sea Point, or Constantia that feature elevators, step-free entrances, wheelchair accessibility, and excellent concierge support.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 2, 'Reserve Table Mountain Cableway tickets online in advance with fast-track or priority access options, scheduling visits for clear, low-wind mornings to avoid long queues and midday weather changes.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 3, 'Utilize accessible boardwalk paths at major natural sites, such as the wheelchair-friendly wooden walkways at Boulders Beach penguin colony and the paved routes at Kirstenbosch Botanical Garden.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 4, 'Pack supportive, non-slip walking shoes, a wind-resistant jacket, a sunhat, high-SPF sunscreen, and prescription medications; top-tier private medical facilities like Netcare Christiaan Barnard Memorial Hospital are readily accessible in the city core.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 5, 'Incorporate scenic drives—such as Chapman''s Peak Drive or the Constantia Wine Valley route—into afternoon schedules to enjoy breathtaking panoramas without physical exertion.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 6, 'Guided cultural tours of historic and artistic landmarks with step-free paths and frequent seating, including the Zeitz MOCAA, Iziko South African National Gallery, and Kirstenbosch National Botanical Garden (utilizing golf cart shuttle tours).'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 7, 'Experiencing fine dining, traditional afternoon tea, and wine tastings inside premier 5-star properties like Mount Nelson (A Belmond Hotel), The Silo, or historic Constantia wine estates.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 8, 'Taking leisurely morning strolls along flat, paved oceanfront promenades like the Sea Point Promenade or the pedestrian-only V&A Waterfront harbor paths.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 9, 'Relaxed day trips along the Cape Peninsula to Cape Point, utilizing the Flying Dutchman Funicular to reach the upper lighthouse without steep climbing.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 10, 'Enjoying panoramic sunset views over the Atlantic Ocean from comfortable seaside hotel lounges, harbor restaurants, or gentle sunset boat cruises.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 11, 'Attempting to climb steep, strenuous hiking trails such as Lion''s Head or Platteklip Gorge without proper guide assistance and high physical fitness.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 12, 'Walking alone through central business district streets or unlit areas late in the evening after shops and businesses have closed.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 13, 'Staying in hillside accommodations in Camps Bay or Bo-Kaap that feature steep multi-tiered staircases and lack elevator access.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('cape-town', 576, 14, 'Relying on local informal shared minibus taxis, which operate without fixed schedules and lack accessible seating or safety harnesses for seniors.'),
  ('cape-town', 576, 15, 'Scheduling outdoor coastal excursions during severe South Easterly wind ("Cape Doctor") warnings.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 0, 'Savor authentic **Cape Malay Cuisine** in the colorful Bo-Kaap district, sampling fragrant **Bobotie** (spiced minced meat baked with an egg-based topping), savory **Samoosas**, crisp **Chilli Bites (Daltjies)**, and sweet **Koesisters** infused with cinnamon and coconut.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 1, 'Feast on wild-caught ocean delicacies and iconic coastal comfort food, including golden **Cape Hake and Chips** wrapped in paper, fresh **West Coast Rock Lobster (Crayfish)**, and local **Oysters** served right by the fishing harbor.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 2, 'Experience a traditional South African **Braai** (wood-fired barbecue) or township feast, indulging in char-grilled **Boerewors** (spiced farmer''s sausage), tender **Flame-grilled Meats**, and **Pap with Chakalaka** (spicy vegetable relish).'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 3, 'Sample artisanal street food and regional delicacies like **Biltong** and **Droëwors** (cured, spiced dried meats) while exploring vibrant weekend food halls and craft markets like the Oranjezicht City Farm Market and Bay Harbour Market.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 4, 'Experience world-class modern fine dining along the Winelands or V&A Waterfront, where internationally acclaimed chefs construct multi-course tasting menus paired with award-winning local Cap Classique and regional wines.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 5, '**Families:** Relaxed harbor seafood spots, spacious picnic lawns on Winelands estates, and vibrant weekend food halls with live music.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 6, '**Honeymooners:** Romantic candlelit dining overlooking Atlantic sunsets, intimate vineyard glasshouse restaurants, and exclusive harbor tasting rooms.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 7, '**Luxury travelers:** Multi-course fine-dining tasting menus by award-winning chefs, private wine cellar pairings in Constantia, and chef''s table experiences in the Silo District.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 8, '**Budget travelers:** Local fish-and-chips shacks along Hout Bay or Kalk Bay harbors, Bo-Kaap street takeaways, and affordable weekend market food stalls.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 9, '**Foodies:** Cutting-edge gastronomy along Bree Street, artisanal third-wave coffee roasters, authentic Cape Malay food walks, and craft wine bars.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 10, '**Bree Street & City Bowl:** Best for trendy third-wave cafes, modern African bistros, craft cocktail lounges, and cutting-edge foodie hotspots.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 11, '**Bo-Kaap:** Best for traditional Cape Malay spice tours, heritage home-cooking classes, and authentic local street snacks.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 12, '**V&A Waterfront & Silo District:** Best for oceanfront harbor dining, fresh oyster bars, high-end international restaurants, and curated artisanal food halls.'),
  ('cape-town', 578, 13, '**Constantia Wine Valley:** Best for historic vineyard estate dining, fine-dining wine pairings, and idyllic open-air garden picnics.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 0, '**South African Wine & Cap Classique:** Premium single-estate vintages, Syrah, Pinotage, and sparkling wines sourced directly from nearby Constantia, Stellenbosch, and Franschhoek estates.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 1, '**Contemporary African Art & Design:** High-end original paintings, sculptures, ceramics, and prints from emerging and established artists across the African continent.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 2, '**Artisanal Leather Goods & Accessories:** Handcrafted leather bags, shoes, belts, and ostrich leather goods produced by local South African artisans.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 3, '**Handmade African Crafts & Textiles:** Intricately beaded jewelry, hand-woven baskets, wood carvings, contemporary textiles, and Cape Malay spice blends.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 4, '**Local Designer Fashion & Jewelry:** Cutting-edge clothing from acclaimed South African fashion houses, alongside ethical South African diamonds and gemstone jewelry.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 5, '**V&A Waterfront & The Watershed:** Preferred for an all-in-one shopping experience, featuring international luxury brands at Victoria Wharf alongside over 150 local artisans, crafters, and designers under one roof at The Watershed.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 6, '**Bree Street & Kloof Street (City Bowl):** Preferred for independent boutique shopping, local designer fashion studios, artisanal concept stores, and trendy third-wave coffee shops.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 7, '**Greenmarket Square:** Ideal for a historic open-air flea market vibe right in the city center, offering traditional African wooden carvings, beadwork, paintings, and souvenirs.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 8, '**Bay Harbour Market (Hout Bay):** Best for weekend travelers seeking energetic covered market culture with live music, artisanal fashion, handmade crafts, and gourmet street food stalls.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 9, 'Buying unregulated animal products, shell crafts, or uncertified wildlife souvenirs that violate international CITES export regulations; always purchase from verified, ethical sellers.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 10, 'Relying exclusively on cash for high-value items or, conversely, expecting credit card acceptance at small, informal street vendor stalls; carry a mix of card and smaller South African Rand (ZAR) notes.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 11, 'Leaving purchased shopping bags visible on car seats when parked at open-air beach lots or mountain trailheads; keep all valuables hidden in the vehicle trunk.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 12, '**Luxury & High-Street Shoppers:** Visitors looking for oceanfront shopping complexes filled with global luxury designer houses, fine jewelers, and high-end South African diamond boutiques.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 13, '**Craft & Design Enthusiasts:** Collectors seeking high-quality, ethically produced African beadwork, contemporary ceramics, hand-woven textiles, and original artwork.'),
  ('cape-town', 579, 14, '**Food & Wine Connoisseurs:** Travelers wanting to purchase award-winning local wines, artisanal chocolates, specialty coffee beans, and authentic Cape Malay spice kits to take home.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 0, '**Sunset ritual & beach lounge lovers** wanting early-evening cocktails, seaside views, and glam Atlantic Ocean golden-hour vibes.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 1, '**Craft cocktail & speakeasy seekers** hunting for hidden mixology bars, secret courtyards, natural wine spots, and rooftop lounges.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 2, '**Electronic music & club enthusiasts** looking for underground electronic, house, and Afro-beats venues with high-end sound systems.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 3, '**Live music & casual socializers** seeking live jazz, acoustic acoustic sessions, open-air food hall music markets, and craft beer bars.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 4, 'Bar-hopping along **Bree Street & Kloof Street (City Bowl/Gardens)** for trendy craft cocktail lounges, speakeasies, and lively post-dinner drinking spots.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 5, 'Starting the evening with golden-hour drinks along the **Camps Bay Strip** overlooking the beach.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 6, 'Experiencing live music performances, artisanal street food, and casual evening drinks at **Mojo Market (Sea Point)**.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 7, 'Exploring curated contemporary art galleries, street bars, and popping open-air venues on the first Thursday of every month during **First Thursdays** along the CBD grid.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 8, 'Walking alone on unlit or quiet city streets late at night; always use ride-hailing apps like Uber or Bolt for transfers between venues.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 9, 'Flashing expensive smartphones, cameras, or jewelry in crowded bar strips or outside late-night venues.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 10, 'Staying late on unescorted stretches of Long Street without keeping a close eye on personal belongings, as pickpocketing and opportunistic theft are common.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 11, '**Bree Street & Kloof Street:** The premier nightlife spine of central Cape Town, packed with stylish gin bars, secret speakeasies, rooftop terraces, and upscale gastropubs.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 12, '**Camps Bay Strip:** Cape Town''s glamorous Riviera-style beachfront strip, ideal for Atlantic sunsets, high-end cocktail lounges, and chic oceanfront dining.'),
  ('cape-town', 580, 13, '**Long Street & Green Point:** Long Street offers a gritty, high-energy mix of backpacker bars, craft beer halls, and dance venues, while neighboring Green Point features vibrant LGBTQ+-friendly bars and late-night clubs.'),
  ('cape-town', 595, 0, '**Morning / Afternoon:**'),
  ('cape-town', 595, 1, 'Arrive at O.R. Tambo International Airport (JNB) in Johannesburg.'),
  ('cape-town', 595, 2, 'Take the complimentary Peermont shuttle from the airport directly to your hotel complex.'),
  ('cape-town', 595, 3, 'Check into **Peermont Metcourt Suites at Emperors Palace** (Bed & Breakfast).'),
  ('cape-town', 595, 4, 'Spend the afternoon relaxing at the hotel complex after your flight.'),
  ('cape-town', 595, 5, '**Lunch & Dinner:**'),
  ('cape-town', 595, 6, 'Enjoy authentic Indian cuisine for both lunch and dinner at **Taste of Mumbai** (located within the Emperors Palace complex).'),
  ('cape-town', 595, 7, '**Overnight:** Peermont Metcourt Suites at Emperors Palace, Johannesburg.'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 1, 'Enjoy breakfast at the hotel.'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 2, 'Depart on a private half-day **Gold Reef City Tour** (1–7 seater vehicle).'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 3, 'Explore the surface tour of Gold Reef City, experience the historic gold pour demonstration, and enjoy the family amusement park rides. *(Note: Underground mine tour available on your own account).*'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 4, '**Lunch:**'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 5, 'Lunch at **The Raj Restaurant** at Gold Reef City.'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 6, '**Afternoon:**'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 7, 'Return to Emperors Palace for leisure time, exploring the casino, gardens, and entertainment concourse.'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 8, '**Dinner:**'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 9, 'Dinner at **Taste of Mumbai** in the Emperors Palace complex.'),
  ('cape-town', 596, 10, '**Overnight:** Peermont Metcourt Suites at Emperors Palace, Johannesburg.'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel followed by check-out.'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 2, 'Private transfer via a 7-seater vehicle from Peermont Metcourt Hotel to **Sun City Resort** (~2.5 to 3 hours drive).'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 3, '**Afternoon:**'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 4, 'Check into **Sun City Hotel** (Luxury Room, Bed & Breakfast).'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 5, 'Take advantage of complimentary entry to the **Valley of Waves** water park or explore the resort shuttle network to visit resort amenities.'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 6, '**Lunch & Dinner:**'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 7, 'Lunch and Dinner at **The Raj Restaurant** at Sun City.'),
  ('cape-town', 597, 8, '**Overnight:** Sun City Hotel, Sun City.'),
  ('cape-town', 598, 0, '**Morning / Afternoon:**'),
  ('cape-town', 598, 1, 'Breakfast at the resort.'),
  ('cape-town', 598, 2, 'Embark on an exciting **Game Drive in Pilanesberg National Park** (scheduled morning or afternoon drive) to spot Big Five wildlife in an malaria-free reserve adjacent to Sun City.'),
  ('cape-town', 598, 3, 'Spend the rest of the day enjoying Sun City’s family activities, pools, and recreational areas.'),
  ('cape-town', 598, 4, '**Lunch & Dinner:**'),
  ('cape-town', 598, 5, 'Lunch and Dinner at **The Raj Restaurant** at Sun City.'),
  ('cape-town', 598, 6, '**Overnight:** Sun City Hotel, Sun City.'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel and check-out.'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 2, 'Private 7-seater vehicle transfer from Sun City to O.R. Tambo International Airport (JNB).'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 3, 'Fly from Johannesburg to **George Airport (GRJ)** *(flight booked independently)*.'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 4, '**Afternoon:**'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 5, 'Meet your private driver at George Airport for a transfer to **Knysna** (~1 hour drive).'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 6, 'Check into **Knysna Log-Inn** (Bed & Breakfast).'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 7, 'Board the **John Benn Cruise** for a scenic boat trip across the lagoon to the iconic Knysna Heads.'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 8, '**Lunch & Dinner:**'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 9, 'Lunch and Dinner at **The Raasoie Restaurant** in Knysna.'),
  ('cape-town', 599, 10, '**Overnight:** Knysna Log-Inn, Knysna.'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel.'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 2, 'Depart on a full-day private guided **Oudtshoorn Tour** across the scenic Garden Route.'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 3, 'Explore the subterranean limestone formations of the **Cango Caves**.'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 4, 'Visit the **Cango Wildlife Ranch** for interactive animal education and conservation experiences.'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 5, '**Lunch:**'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 6, 'Enjoy a specialized 4-course Eastern lunch (Menu 3) at the **Safari Ostrich Farm** during your classic ostrich farm tour.'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 7, '**Afternoon / Evening:**'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 8, 'Transfer to your hotel in Oudtshoorn and check into **Oudtshoorn Inn** (Bed & Breakfast).'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 9, '**Dinner:**'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 10, 'Dinner at **Oudtshoorn Inn** (Hotel Complex).'),
  ('cape-town', 600, 11, '**Overnight:** Oudtshoorn Inn, Oudtshoorn.'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel and check-out.'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 2, 'Private 7-seater transfer from Oudtshoorn to **George Airport (GRJ)**.'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 3, 'Fly from George Airport to **Cape Town International Airport (CPT)** *(flight booked independently)*.'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 4, '**Afternoon:**'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 5, 'Meet your full-day private 7-seater vehicle driver at Cape Town International Airport.'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 6, 'Private transfer to central Cape Town and check into **The Capetonian Hotel** (Superior Room, Bed & Breakfast).'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 7, 'Begin exploring central Cape Town with your dedicated vehicle.'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 8, '**Lunch & Dinner:**'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 9, 'Lunch and Dinner at a selected **Indian Restaurant** in Cape Town.'),
  ('cape-town', 601, 10, '**Overnight:** The Capetonian Hotel, Cape Town CBD.'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel.'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 2, 'Embark on a half-day **Cape Town City Tour** with your dedicated 7-seater vehicle.'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 3, 'Take the **Table Mountain Aerial Cableway** (return ticket included) to the summit for 360-degree views of the Mother City, Atlantic coastline, and Lion''s Head.'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 4, '**Lunch:**'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 5, 'Lunch at an **Indian Restaurant** in Cape Town.'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 6, '**Afternoon:**'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 7, 'Explore historic inner-city highlights, including the colorful streets of **Bo-Kaap** and the **Company''s Garden**.'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 8, '**Evening:**'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 9, 'Experience an immersive cultural evening at **GOLD Restaurant**, featuring an interactive Djembe drumming session, live African entertainment, and a 14-course African tasting feast served to your table.'),
  ('cape-town', 602, 10, '**Overnight:** The Capetonian Hotel, Cape Town CBD.'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel.'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 2, 'Depart on a full-day private **Cape Peninsula Tour** via your dedicated vehicle.'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 3, 'Arrive in Hout Bay and board the **Nauticat Catamaran Cruise** to **Duiker Island (Seal Island)** to see thousands of wild Cape fur seals.'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 4, 'Drive along the spectacular coastal cliffs of **Chapman’s Peak Drive** (entrance fee included).'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 5, '**Afternoon:**'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 6, 'Continue to **Cape Point** inside Table Mountain National Park; take the **Flying Dutchman Funicular** up to the lighthouse and visit the iconic **Cape of Good Hope** sign.'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 7, 'Stop at **Boulders Beach** in Simon''s Town (entrance fee included) to walk along the wooden boardwalks beside wild African penguins.'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 8, '**Lunch & Dinner:**'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 9, 'Lunch and Dinner at an **Indian Restaurant** in Cape Town.'),
  ('cape-town', 603, 10, '**Overnight:** The Capetonian Hotel, Cape Town CBD.'),
  ('cape-town', 604, 0, '**Morning:**'),
  ('cape-town', 604, 1, 'Breakfast at the hotel and check-out.'),
  ('cape-town', 604, 2, 'Private transfer in a 7-seater vehicle from **The Capetonian Hotel** to **Cape Town International Airport (CPT)** for your onward flight home.'),
  ('cape-town', 615, 0, 'Treat Cape Town purely as a quick 1- or 2-day stopover before a safari, underestimating the sheer volume of world-class natural, coastal, and culinary experiences across the Cape Peninsula.'),
  ('cape-town', 615, 1, 'Fail to account for Cape Town''s microclimates and unpredictable weather, booking weather-dependent activities like Table Mountain cableway or Robben Island ferries on fixed days without building in weather-flexible buffer slots.'),
  ('cape-town', 615, 2, 'Underestimate distances along the Cape Peninsula, attempting to rush Table Mountain, Chapman''s Peak Drive, Cape Point, Boulders Beach, and the Winelands into a single exhausting day.'),
  ('cape-town', 615, 3, 'Rely on informal transit options or unguided walks late at night in unfamiliar commercial districts, rather than using pre-arranged private chauffeured vehicles or trusted ride-hailing apps like Uber.'),
  ('cape-town', 615, 4, 'Forget to book high-demand tickets—such as Robben Island ferries, Table Mountain cableway priority passes, and fine-dining tasting menus—well in advance, leading to sold-out excursions during peak summer months.'),
  ('cape-town', 616, 0, 'Groups sight-seeing strictly into logical geographical clusters—dedicating specific full days to the City Bowl & V&A Waterfront, the Atlantic Seaboard & Peninsula loop, and the Cape Winelands valleys.'),
  ('cape-town', 616, 1, 'Recommends booking Table Mountain tickets for the very first clear morning of the trip, leaving subsequent days open as weather backup options in case of strong winds ("Cape Doctor") or cloud cover ("tablecloth").'),
  ('cape-town', 616, 2, 'Pre-arranges private air-conditioned vehicle transfers for Peninsula day trips and Winelands excursions, allowing clients to relax without worrying about navigating winding coastal roads or driving after wine tastings.'),
  ('cape-town', 616, 3, 'Tailors neighborhood bases to client profiles—placing first-time travelers and luxury seekers at the secure V&A Waterfront, beach enthusiasts in Camps Bay, and nature/wine lovers in Constantia or Stellenbosch.'),
  ('cape-town', 616, 4, 'Incorporates local cultural nuances, such as arranging interactive drum dinners at GOLD Restaurant, guided Bo-Kaap Malay cooking classes, and curator tours at Zeitz MOCAA.'),
  ('cape-town', 617, 0, 'For **Weather Flexibility**, book Table Mountain cableway tickets and Robben Island ferry tours for the first available morning of the stay, keeping subsequent days flexible to adjust for wind closures or heavy cloud cover.'),
  ('cape-town', 617, 1, 'For **Geographical Pacing**, divide the Cape region into three distinct operational days—1 day for City Center & V&A Waterfront, 1 full day for the Cape Peninsula coastal circuit (Chapman''s Peak, Cape Point, Boulders Beach), and 1 day for Cape Winelands tasting estates.'),
  ('cape-town', 617, 2, 'For **Safety & Transit**, use trusted ride-hailing services (Uber) or private chauffeured transfers for all evening outings, and avoid walking unescorted after dark outside secure pedestrian enclaves like the V&A Waterfront.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 0, 'Ride the revolving **Table Mountain Aerial Cableway** to the summit for 360-degree panoramic views of Table Bay and the Atlantic Seaboard.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 1, 'Drive the scenic cliffside curves of **Chapman’s Peak Drive** down to **Cape Point** and the landmark sign at the **Cape of Good Hope**.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 2, 'Walk along the wooden boardwalks among wild African penguins at the **Boulders Beach Penguin Colony** in Simon''s Town.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 3, 'Explore the vibrant Cape Malay culture, colorful houses, and spice market cafes of the historic **Bo-Kaap** neighborhood.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 4, 'Experience world-class contemporary art at **Zeitz MOCAA** and indulge in fine dining and oceanfront shopping at the **V&A Waterfront**.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 5, 'Walking unescorted along quiet city streets, isolated mountain hiking trails, or unlit beach promenades late at night; stick to well-lit, busy tourist areas or use ride-hailing services.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 6, 'Leaving high-value personal belongings visible inside parked vehicles at scenic overlooks, beach parking lots, or trailheads.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 7, 'Underestimating sudden weather changes on Table Mountain; always carry a windbreaker or warm layer as summit temperatures can drop rapidly and heavy cloud cover ("tablecloth") can set in quickly.'),
  ('cape-town', 620, 8, 'Planning high-altitude outdoor activities or coastal helicopter rides without checking the daily wind and weather forecast first, as cable car operations and outdoor flights close during high wind conditions.'),
  ('cape-town', 621, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 0, 'Avoid peak summer periods, major festivals, Christmas/New Year holidays, and other high-demand dates when accommodation prices can increase'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 1, 'Choose a centrally located budget or mid-range hotel in Tbilisi instead of staying far outside the city solely for a lower room rate, especially if you plan frequent sightseeing'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 2, 'Use the Tbilisi Metro and municipal buses for regular city travel instead of using taxis for every journey; public transport is particularly inexpensive.'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 3, 'Walk between nearby Old Tbilisi attractions such as Freedom Square, Sololaki, Abanotubani, Metekhi, and the riverside where practical to reduce short-distance transport costs'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 4, 'Use local Georgian restaurants, bakeries, cafés, and casual eateries instead of relying on premium hotel restaurants for every meal'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 5, 'Select a clean, well-reviewed budget hotel, hostel, guesthouse, or 2–3 star property with convenient access to Old Tbilisi, Rustaveli Avenue, metro stations, restaurants, and major transport routes'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 6, 'Use taxi apps or compare taxi fares before booking longer journeys rather than accepting an unpriced street taxi'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 7, 'Group nearby attractions into the same sightseeing route to reduce repeated taxi costs'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 8, 'Book accommodation in advance during high-demand summer periods and major holiday dates'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 9, 'Use the airport municipal bus or airport train where practical instead of taking a private airport transfer; the airport bus connects directly with central Tbilisi, while the airport railway provides another low-cost option.'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 10, 'Extremely remote accommodation, as reaching central Tbilisi and major attractions can add unnecessary taxi costs and travel time'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 11, 'Ignoring hotel reviews, cleanliness, heating/cooling, hot-water facilities, safety, or basic amenities simply because the room is cheaper'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 12, 'Choosing accommodation far from the city centre if daily taxi costs become significant'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 13, 'Booking unreliable or unofficial taxi services simply to save a small amount'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 14, 'Cutting transport costs excessively when visiting destinations outside Tbilisi such as Mtskheta, Kakheti, or other regional excursions'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 15, 'Choosing the cheapest accommodation during peak season if the property has poor access to public transport or consistently poor reviews'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 16, 'Planning too many distant day trips into one day solely to reduce transportation costs'),
  ('tbilisi', 626, 17, 'Sacrificing location and convenience when the saving is small, particularly on a short 2–3 night city break'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 0, '3+'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 1, '6+'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 2, 'TEENAGERS'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 3, 'Maximum 2–4 major attractions/day.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 4, 'Prefer centrally located accommodation around Old Tbilisi, Freedom Square, Rustaveli Avenue, or Avlabari to reduce daily travel time.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 5, 'Schedule regular breaks, meals, hydration and restroom stops, especially during longer walking days.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 6, 'Prioritize Old Tbilisi, Rike Park, Narikala Fortress, Mtatsminda, Tbilisi Zoo, museums, and other family-friendly attractions.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 7, 'Avoid packing too many attractions into one day because walking on cobbled streets, slopes, stairs, and hilly areas can be tiring.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 8, 'Allow extra time for queues, cable-car waiting times, parking, walking, and weather changes.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 9, 'Prefer taxis or private cars for longer excursions outside central Tbilisi, particularly for Mtskheta, Jvari, and other surrounding destinations.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 10, 'Avoid changing hotels frequently during a short Tbilisi holiday.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 11, 'Include at least one child-friendly cultural, scenic, educational, or recreational experience.'),
  ('tbilisi', 632, 12, 'Allow downtime between activities because Tbilisi is best experienced at a comfortable walking and sightseeing pace.'),
