  ('batumi', 698, 0, 'Try to cover every Batumi attraction plus Gonio, Batumi Botanical Garden, Mtirala National Park, waterfalls, mountain villages, and other Adjara destinations in a very short trip.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 1, 'Schedule Old Batumi, Europe Square, Batumi Boulevard, Ali & Nino, Botanical Garden, Gonio Fortress, and multiple excursions without allowing enough time for each.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 2, 'Underestimate travel time caused by traffic, coastal congestion, weather, and mountain roads outside Batumi.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 3, 'Stay far outside central Batumi merely to save on hotel cost, without considering additional taxi costs and daily travel time.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 4, 'Plan Batumi Botanical Garden, Gonio Fortress, Mtirala National Park, waterfalls, and other regional attractions together without considering their locations and travel time.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 5, 'Plan outdoor and mountain excursions without checking weather, rainfall, visibility, and road conditions.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 6, 'Plan every day as a full sightseeing day without sufficient time for the beach, Batumi Boulevard, cafés, Georgian dining, shopping, nightlife, or hotel relaxation.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 7, 'Forget attraction opening hours, cable-car schedules, museum timings, restaurant reservations, traffic buffers, and seasonal operating conditions.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 8, 'Schedule too much sightseeing on departure day, especially when traveling to Batumi International Airport.'),
  ('batumi', 698, 9, 'Ignore the traveler''s actual purpose, especially when the trip is primarily for honeymoon, family, beach, relaxation, culture, food, nightlife, nature, or photography.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 0, 'Builds the trip around the traveler''s purpose.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 1, 'Groups attractions geographically around Old Batumi, Europe Square, Batumi Boulevard, Miracle Park, and central Batumi before adding regional excursions.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 2, 'Uses hotel location strategically, especially around Old Batumi, Europe Square, the Boulevard, or other central areas for short trips.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 3, 'Protects free time for beach relaxation, cafés, Georgian dining, shopping, photography, nightlife, and leisurely seaside walks.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 4, 'Controls daily walking, driving time, road intensity, and sightseeing density.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 5, 'Uses taxis, private cars, or organized tours selectively for Gonio Fortress, Batumi Botanical Garden, Mtirala National Park, waterfalls, and other Adjara excursions.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 6, 'Places beach and outdoor experiences during comfortable weather periods and adjusts plans around rain, humidity, strong sun, and visibility.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 7, 'Leaves flexibility for weather, traffic, attraction timings, cable-car operations, and seasonal conditions.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 8, 'Avoids unnecessary hotel changes on short trips.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 9, 'Uses a smaller number of meaningful Batumi experiences rather than trying to cover every attraction and surrounding destination.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 10, 'Keeps at least one relaxed period in the itinerary for enjoying the beach, Batumi Boulevard, hotel facilities, cafés, parks, viewpoints, or Georgian dining.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 11, 'Treats mountain and nature excursions separately when rainfall or road conditions may affect access.'),
  ('batumi', 699, 12, 'Avoids combining multiple distant destinations such as Gonio, Mtirala, waterfalls, and mountain villages on the same day when doing so creates excessive road travel.'),
