  ('gori', 717, 31, 'Central Gori is better suited to light walking, fortress exploration, cultural sightseeing, and photography than high-intensity adventure.'),
  ('gori', 717, 32, 'The Ateni Valley is the strongest nearby option for combining hiking, waterfalls, countryside scenery, historic monuments, and outdoor exploration. The valley begins roughly 10 km from Gori, while the Biisi Waterfall trail is approximately 2.5 km.'),
  ('gori', 717, 33, 'The Ateni Sioni–Damchkeri Waterfall route provides a relatively accessible hiking experience through forest and along the Tana River, making it suitable for travelers wanting outdoor activity without a highly technical trek.'),
  ('gori', 717, 34, 'Uplistsikhe provides a different type of adventure: walking through a large rock-hewn archaeological landscape with carved streets, caves, tunnels, stairs, and cliffside terrain.'),
  ('gori', 717, 35, 'Gori Fortress adds a short uphill walking experience and panoramic views over the city and surrounding Caucasus landscape.'),
  ('gori', 717, 36, 'Wider Shida Kartli provides additional opportunities for forests, mountain landscapes, waterfalls, lakes, and nature-focused excursions, including Bateti Lake, Nadarbazevi Lake, Jamjama Mountain, and other natural areas.'),
  ('gori', 717, 37, 'Cycling can be incorporated into longer regional itineraries, but it should not be treated as one of Gori''s primary city activities. Dedicated cycling infrastructure and established cycling routes are more limited than in major cycling destinations.'),
  ('gori', 717, 38, 'Adventure itineraries should account for uneven archaeological terrain, exposed cliff areas, stairs, hiking conditions, rainfall, and seasonal trail conditions.'),
  ('gori', 717, 39, 'Private transport is generally preferable for nature and mountain excursions outside central Gori because many outdoor destinations are dispersed across the surrounding countryside.'),
  ('gori', 718, 0, 'Prefer hotels in or near central Gori, especially around the city centre, Stalin Avenue, Gori Fortress, or the main pedestrian and commercial areas, to reduce daily travel and provide easier access to restaurants, pharmacies, shops, cafés, and transport.'),
  ('gori', 718, 1, 'Use taxis, private cars, or reliable local transport for longer sightseeing journeys and attractions outside central Gori.'),
  ('gori', 718, 2, 'Avoid stacking multiple walking-intensive heritage attractions or long excursions in one day.'),
  ('gori', 718, 3, 'Include regular seating, rest, meals, hydration, and comfortable breaks during sightseeing.'),
  ('gori', 718, 4, 'Check hotel accessibility, lifts, ground-floor rooms, bathroom facilities, heating/air-conditioning, and vehicle access before booking.'),
  ('gori', 718, 5, 'Prefer senior-friendly attractions such as Gori Fortress viewpoints where accessible, central Gori streets, Stalin Museum, Gori Historical-Ethnographical Museum, local parks, cafés, and selected cultural sites.'),
  ('gori', 718, 6, 'Use a private car or taxi where appropriate to reduce unnecessary walking between central Gori attractions.'),
  ('gori', 718, 7, 'Avoid unnecessary long walks on steep, uneven, cobbled, or poorly surfaced streets and paths.'),
  ('gori', 718, 8, 'Schedule major outdoor sightseeing during comfortable daytime hours and avoid prolonged exposure during very hot summer afternoons, cold winter periods, or heavy rainfall.'),
  ('gori', 718, 9, 'Allow additional transition time between attractions because road conditions, pedestrian areas, walking distances, and local traffic can affect travel time.'),
  ('gori', 718, 10, 'Avoid unnecessarily long public-transport journeys when comfort or mobility is a concern.'),
  ('gori', 718, 11, 'Keep the itinerary flexible around weather, temperature, walking ability, and attraction conditions.'),
  ('gori', 718, 12, 'Give extra consideration to Gori Fortress and archaeological or heritage sites because stairs, slopes, uneven surfaces, and exposed outdoor sections may make access more difficult for some senior travelers.'),
  ('gori', 718, 13, 'Treat Uplistsikhe Cave Town as a higher-effort excursion because the archaeological site contains rocky, uneven, and stepped terrain that can be difficult for travelers with limited mobility.'),
  ('gori', 718, 14, 'Prefer private transport for longer excursions to Uplistsikhe, Mtskheta, Borjomi, or other destinations outside Gori when comfort and mobility are priorities.'),
  ('gori', 718, 15, 'Avoid combining Gori Fortress, Stalin Museum, Uplistsikhe, and other regional attractions into an excessively dense day.'),
  ('gori', 718, 16, 'For travelers with limited mobility, prioritize the Stalin Museum and accessible central-city experiences over physically demanding archaeological or hilltop sites.'),
  ('gori', 718, 17, 'Consider visiting Gori Fortress only when weather, mobility, and access conditions are suitable.'),
  ('gori', 718, 18, 'Keep at least one relaxed period in the itinerary for cafés, local dining, hotel rest, or an easy central-city experience.'),
  ('gori', 719, 0, 'Georgia has made progress toward accessible tourism, including adapted public infrastructure and improved accessibility at selected museums, tourist sites and public spaces, but accessibility remains uneven across destinations.'),
  ('gori', 719, 1, 'The Stalin Museum in Gori is specifically listed by Georgia Travel among Georgian museums with a ramp, making it one of the more suitable major cultural attractions for visitors with mobility requirements.'),
  ('gori', 719, 2, 'Central Gori provides relatively convenient access to several major attractions, including the Stalin Museum and Gori Historical and Ethnographic Museum, but individual entrances, internal circulation, toilets and other facilities should still be confirmed before travel.'),
  ('gori', 719, 3, 'Gori Fortress is located on a rocky hill in the centre of the city. Its elevated terrain, slopes and uneven historic surfaces can make access difficult for wheelchair users and travelers with significant mobility limitations.'),
  ('gori', 719, 4, 'The Gori Fortress viewpoint should therefore not be treated as universally wheelchair accessible even though the surrounding central area is relatively convenient.'),
  ('gori', 719, 5, 'Uplistsikhe Cave Town presents substantially greater accessibility challenges because the archaeological settlement is carved into cliffs and includes historic streets, caves, tunnels and uneven terrain.'),
  ('gori', 719, 6, 'The Uplistsikhe Museum has a ramp according to Georgia Travel, but this should not be interpreted as full wheelchair accessibility throughout the wider archaeological reserve.'),
  ('gori', 719, 7, 'Travelers with significant mobility requirements should distinguish between accessibility of the Uplistsikhe museum facilities and accessibility of the archaeological site itself.'),
  ('gori', 719, 8, 'Gori''s historic and archaeological attractions can contain slopes, stairs, rocky surfaces, uneven paths and exposed outdoor sections; practical accessibility should be assessed separately for each site.'),
  ('gori', 719, 9, 'Hotels in Gori should be checked individually for step-free entrance, elevator availability, accessible room dimensions, bathroom configuration, accessible parking/drop-off and assistance requirements.'),
  ('gori', 719, 10, 'Taxis or private vehicles can provide greater flexibility for travelers with mobility requirements, particularly when visiting Uplistsikhe, Gorisjvari, Ateni Sioni, Tsedisi Fortress and other destinations outside the central city. Gori''s surrounding attractions are spread across the wider Shida Kartli region.'),
  ('gori', 719, 11, 'Public transport should not automatically be assumed to provide wheelchair boarding or sufficient space for mobility equipment; verify the specific service before relying on it.'),
  ('gori', 719, 12, 'For visitors with limited mobility, prioritize accessible hotels, the Stalin Museum, accessible central-city areas, verified museums and other attractions with confirmed step-free facilities.'),
  ('gori', 719, 13, 'For travelers using wheelchairs, mobility scooters or walking aids, consider private transport for regional excursions because road access, drop-off points and site terrain can vary considerably.'),
  ('gori', 719, 14, 'The Gori Tourist Information Center can provide current local tourism guidance and is listed by Georgia Travel in Gori Municipality. Current accessibility information should be confirmed before travel.'),
  ('gori', 719, 15, 'Accessibility information should be confirmed directly with hotels, attractions, transport operators or official Georgia tourism information services before booking or travel.'),
