  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 13, 'Major rock-cut halls and chambers'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 14, 'Central monumental architectural structures'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 15, 'Pagan and Christian religious remains'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 16, 'Rock-cut basilica structures'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 17, 'Uplistsuli Church / Eklesia'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 18, 'Ancient wine presses and wine cellars'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 19, 'Secret Tunnel'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 20, 'Mtkvari River valley viewpoints'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 21, 'Uplistsikhe Museum / archaeological interpretation'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 22, 'Panoramic archaeological-landscape photography'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 23, 'Do not treat Uplistsikhe as only a 20–30 minute photo stop.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 24, 'Do not treat Uplistsikhe as a conventional cave or natural-cave attraction.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 25, 'Do not expect the site to provide enough experiences for a conventional multi-night standalone holiday.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 26, 'Do not underestimate the amount of walking over natural rock, slopes, steps, and uneven archaeological terrain.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 27, 'Do not assume the entire archaeological complex is wheelchair or stroller accessible.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 28, 'Do not interpret accessibility of selected visitor facilities as accessibility of the entire cave town.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 29, 'Do not schedule the visit during extreme summer midday heat when an earlier or later visit is practical.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 30, 'Do not ignore rain, frost, snow, ice, or slippery rock conditions.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 31, 'Do not visit in unsuitable footwear.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 32, 'Do not allow young children to explore elevated or uneven rock areas without close supervision.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 33, 'Do not overload the same day with Uplistsikhe and several physically demanding regional attractions.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 34, 'Do not market Uplistsikhe as a nightlife, shopping, luxury-resort, spa, or major culinary destination.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 35, 'Do not treat archaeological wine presses and cellars as a modern wine-tasting attraction.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 36, 'Do not depend on substantial shopping, dining, or evening entertainment immediately around the archaeological complex.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 37, 'Do not rush history-focused travelers who want detailed archaeological interpretation.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 38, 'Do not describe Uplistsikhe as a UNESCO World Heritage Site; it is currently on Georgia''s UNESCO World Heritage Tentative List.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 784, 39, 'Do not rely on old opening hours, admission prices, transport schedules, or access conditions without current verification.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 785, 0, 'Georgia Travel / Georgian National Tourism Administration — Official information on Uplistsikhe Cave Town, its history, archaeological structures, visitor context, location, access from Gori, cultural significance, surrounding Shida Kartli region and recommended regional itineraries.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 785, 1, 'UNESCO World Heritage Centre — Official Tentative List information on Uplistsikhe Cave Town, including archaeological significance, historical development, cultural importance, rocky setting, architectural remains and heritage status.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 785, 2, 'Georgia Travel Accessibility — Official accessibility information confirming that the Uplistsikhe Museum has a ramp, while accessibility of the wider archaeological complex must be assessed separately.'),
  ('uplistsikhe', 785, 3, 'Official Georgian cultural-heritage and tourism sources — Operational information relating to archaeological-site management, admission, visitor services, guiding and site conditions where available.'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 0, 'Avoid Christmas, New Year, weekends, and other peak winter periods when accommodation demand and prices can rise significantly'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 1, 'Travel in March or other shoulder periods when suitable snow conditions remain but demand may be lower'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 2, 'Book accommodation early for January–February and major holiday periods'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 3, 'Choose a clean, well-reviewed guesthouse, apartment, or mid-range hotel rather than premium ski-in / ski-out accommodation'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 4, 'Stay within practical walking distance of the required ski lift to reduce daily transport costs'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 5, 'Compare ski-equipment rental prices before committing to a rental shop'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 6, 'Use multi-day ski passes when they provide better value for the planned number of ski days'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 7, 'Use shared transfers from Tbilisi instead of private transfers when comfort and schedule permit'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 8, 'Use casual Georgian restaurants, cafés, bakeries, and self-catering apartments instead of premium hotel dining for every meal'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 9, 'Book ski lessons strategically rather than unnecessary full-day private instruction'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 10, 'Group nearby viewpoints and Georgian Military Road attractions into the same transfer or excursion'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 11, 'Visit during summer for a significantly different mountain experience without the full cost structure of a ski holiday'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 12, 'Very cheap accommodation far from the required ski lifts if daily transport becomes inconvenient'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 13, 'Poor-quality ski or snowboard equipment solely because it is cheaper'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 14, 'Skipping appropriate winter clothing, helmets, or necessary safety equipment'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 15, 'Using inexperienced or unqualified instructors or guides simply to reduce costs'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 16, 'Attempting freeriding, off-piste skiing, or high-mountain activities without appropriate professional guidance and safety planning'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 17, 'Booking unreliable mountain transfers during difficult winter road conditions'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 18, 'Ignoring hotel heating, hot water, location, reviews, road access, or luggage storage because the room is cheaper'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 19, 'Sacrificing a convenient location on a short 2–4 night ski trip'),
  ('gudauri', 790, 20, 'Choosing the cheapest paragliding or adventure operator without considering licensing, weather conditions, safety standards, and current operating status'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 0, '4+'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 1, '6+'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 2, 'TEENAGERS'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 3, 'Maximum 2–4 major activities/day.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 4, 'Prefer accommodation in New Gudauri or close to suitable ski lifts, beginner slopes, restaurants, ski schools, and equipment-rental facilities to reduce daily transfers.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 5, 'Schedule regular warming breaks, meals, hydration, restroom stops, and indoor rest periods, especially during winter.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 6, 'Prioritize beginner skiing, snowboarding lessons, easy slopes, gondola rides, snow play, scenic viewpoints, and relaxed mountain experiences.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 7, 'Use professional ski instructors for children who are beginners rather than attempting difficult slopes without appropriate instruction.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 8, 'Match ski slopes to the child''s actual skiing ability; Gudauri provides green, blue, red, and black pistes for different skill levels.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 9, 'Ensure children use appropriate helmets, winter clothing, gloves, goggles, and properly fitted ski or snowboard equipment.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 10, 'Monitor mountain weather, snowfall, visibility, wind, lift operations, and road conditions before outdoor activities.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 11, 'Avoid packing skiing, long sightseeing excursions, paragliding, and extensive road trips into the same family day.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 12, 'Allow extra time for ski-equipment rental, lift queues, lessons, changing clothes, meals, weather changes, and transportation.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 13, 'Prefer private transfers for families with young children, luggage, ski equipment, or multiple bags.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 14, 'Avoid changing hotels frequently during a short Gudauri holiday.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 15, 'Include at least one non-ski experience such as a scenic gondola ride, mountain photography, snow play, or Georgian dining.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 16, 'Allow downtime because Gudauri is an active high-altitude mountain destination and children may tire faster than during a conventional city holiday.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 17, 'Treat off-piste skiing, freeriding, heli-skiing, and difficult mountain routes as unsuitable for young or inexperienced children.'),
  ('gudauri', 796, 18, 'Follow ski-patrol instructions, piste signs, weather information, and avalanche warnings at all times.'),
