  ('shamakhi', 915, 0, 'Treat Shamakhi as only a quick Juma Mosque stop and miss Yeddi Gumbaz, Pirgulu, the Astrophysical Observatory, Safari Park, Meysari, countryside scenery, and wider Shirvanshah heritage.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 1, 'Try to cover Juma Mosque, Yeddi Gumbaz, Observatory, Safari Park, Alpaca Farm, Meysari Winery, Gulustan Fortress, Bughurt Fortress, and several rural areas in one short stay.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 2, 'Underestimate Shamakhi''s geography. Central heritage sites are relatively easy to combine, but Pirgulu, Meysari, Safari Park, and remote fortresses require road travel.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 3, 'Schedule Observatory + Safari Park + Meysari + mountain hiking together without allowing enough time for driving, meals, photography, and rest.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 4, 'Treat Gulustan and Bughurt fortresses as easy roadside attractions. Official tourism material describes them as remote mountain fortresses, with hiking forming an important part of the experience. :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 5, 'Rush Juma Mosque and Yeddi Gumbaz without understanding Shamakhi''s importance as a former capital of the Shirvanshahs and a major Silk Road centre. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 6, 'Assume the Astrophysical Observatory is in central Shamakhi. It is located about 22 km north of the city in Pirgulu and requires additional road travel. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 7, 'Plan stargazing as a guaranteed activity without considering cloud cover, visibility, weather, visitor schedules, or nighttime transport.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 8, 'Treat Safari Park as a small city attraction instead of a separate mountain-area wildlife excursion.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 9, 'Choose accommodation only by price without considering whether the itinerary is focused on central Shamakhi, Pirgulu, Meysari, or resort relaxation.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 10, 'Plan too many historical sites for young children while ignoring family-oriented experiences such as the Alpaca Farm and Safari Park.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 11, 'Ignore weather when planning mountain roads, fortress hikes, wildlife activities, countryside photography, and night-sky experiences.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 12, 'Assume Shamakhi has Baku-style shopping, nightlife, public transport, and entertainment infrastructure.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 13, 'Overload departure day with Pirgulu, winery, or mountain excursions without allowing sufficient road-transfer time toward Baku or the airport.'),
  ('shamakhi', 915, 14, 'Ignore the traveler''s actual purpose, especially when the trip is primarily for history, family, honeymoon, nature, astronomy, wine, photography, hiking, or relaxation.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 0, 'Builds the Shamakhi itinerary around the traveler''s main purpose rather than trying to include every regional attraction.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 1, 'Groups Juma Mosque + Yeddi Gumbaz + central Shamakhi heritage into one efficient historical circuit.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 2, 'Gives proper context to Shamakhi as a former Shirvanshah capital with major Silk Road and medieval heritage.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 3, 'Treats Pirgulu as a separate mountain cluster and combines the Astrophysical Observatory with scenic mountain experiences rather than repeatedly driving back and forth.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 4, 'Allows sufficient time for the Observatory because it is around 22 km north of central Shamakhi and can include a museum, telescope experience, and stargazing after dark where conditions permit.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 5, 'Uses Safari Park as a dedicated family / wildlife experience rather than squeezing it between unrelated heritage attractions.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 6, 'Combines Meysari Winery + Alpaca Farm logically because the Alpaca Farm is promoted together with the vineyards of Meysari, making this a strong countryside cluster.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 7, 'Uses Meysari strategically for honeymoon, premium, food, and wine travelers. The winery includes vineyards, wine tours, a museum, restaurant, guesthouse, and local-food experiences.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 8, 'Treats Gulustan and Bughurt as active historical / hiking products for suitable travelers instead of mandatory first-time sightseeing.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 9, 'Uses private cars or drivers selectively for Pirgulu, Meysari, Safari Park, Demirchi, and remote heritage sites because Shamakhi''s strongest attractions are dispersed.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 10, 'Keeps at least one lower-intensity period for resort relaxation, local dining, countryside photography, spa time, or scenic driving.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 11, 'Adjusts the itinerary by traveler type: Alpaca Farm and Safari Park for families, Observatory + Meysari for couples, fortresses for active history travelers, and private scenic touring for seniors or luxury travelers.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 12, 'Checks attraction operating hours, weather, road conditions, winery reservations, Observatory availability, and mountain access before finalizing the itinerary.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 13, 'Places outdoor and mountain activities during comfortable weather periods and keeps flexible alternatives for rain, fog, snow, or poor visibility.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 14, 'Avoids unnecessary hotel changes on short Shamakhi stays and uses one convenient base for central sightseeing and regional excursions.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 15, 'For short stays, prioritizes **JUMA MOSQUE + YEDDI GUMBAZ + ONE SIGNATURE EXPERIENCE such as PIRGULU / OBSERVATORY, SAFARI PARK, or MEYSARI**.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 16, 'For 2–3 night stays, adds **PIRGULU + OBSERVATORY + SAFARI PARK + MEYSARI / ALPACA FARM** according to traveler interests.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 17, 'For longer stays, adds **GULUSTAN / BUGHURT HIKING + DEMIRCHI + DEEPER SHIRVANSHAH HERITAGE + REGIONAL ROAD-TRIP EXTENSIONS**.'),
  ('shamakhi', 916, 18, 'Uses Shamakhi primarily as a **HISTORY, CULTURE, NATURE, ASTRONOMY, WINE, PHOTOGRAPHY, FAMILY, COUNTRYSIDE, AND RELAXATION DESTINATION**, rather than positioning it as a major shopping or nightlife city.'),
