  ('gabala', 962, 0, 'Treat Gabala as only a Tufandag cable-car stop and miss Nohur Lake, Yeddi Gozel Waterfall, Old Gabala, Nij Village, Savalan Winery, family attractions, spa resorts, and wider mountain experiences.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 1, 'Try to cover Tufandag, Nohur Lake, Yeddi Gozel, Old Gabala, Nij, Gabaland, Savalan Winery, rafting, paragliding, and multiple regional stops in one short stay.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 2, 'Underestimate Gabala''s geography. Tufandag is close to the city, but Nohur Lake, waterfalls, Nij, Old Gabala, Savalan, Shooting Club, and countryside attractions require separate road planning.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 3, 'Schedule Tufandag + Nohur Lake + Yeddi Gozel + Nij + Old Gabala together without allowing enough time for driving, meals, photography, queues, and rest.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 4, 'Treat Yeddi Gozel Waterfall as a completely easy-access attraction without considering steps, natural surfaces, weather, and current access conditions.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 5, 'Assume every Tufandag activity operates year-round. Skiing, snowboarding, cable cars, paragliding, hiking, and other mountain activities depend on season, weather, wind, snow, and resort operations.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 6, 'Plan skiing or snowboarding without considering traveler ability, ski-school needs, equipment rental, snow conditions, and appropriate clothing.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 7, 'Plan paragliding, rafting, or jeep safari as guaranteed activities without checking weather, operator schedules, age requirements, and safety conditions.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 8, 'Ignore Old Gabala and Nij because Gabala is often marketed primarily as a mountain resort, thereby missing the region''s Caucasian Albanian and Udi cultural heritage.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 9, 'Treat Nohur Lake as a full-day destination rather than a relaxed scenic stop best combined with nearby nature or countryside experiences.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 10, 'Choose accommodation only by price without considering access to Tufandag, restaurants, resort facilities, and the traveler''s main activities.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 11, 'Plan too many adventure activities for families with young children instead of balancing cable cars, lakes, Gabaland, easy snow experiences, resort time, and short nature visits.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 12, 'Ignore seasonal crowd and price differences. Summer holidays and strong winter ski periods can increase resort demand and accommodation prices.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 13, 'Plan every day as an intensive mountain or road-based sightseeing day without enough time for spa, hotel relaxation, Azerbaijani dining, lake views, or resort leisure.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 14, 'Assume Gabala has Baku-style nightlife, shopping, or public transport.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 15, 'Overload departure day with Tufandag, Nij, Savalan, or remote countryside attractions without allowing enough transfer time toward Baku / GYD.'),
  ('gabala', 962, 16, 'Ignore the traveler''s actual purpose, especially when the trip is primarily for family, honeymoon, skiing, nature, adventure, photography, wellness, culture, or relaxation.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 0, 'Builds the Gabala itinerary around the traveler''s main purpose and season rather than trying to include every attraction.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 1, 'Treats Tufandag as the core mountain cluster and allows enough time for cable cars, viewpoints, skiing, snowboarding, hiking, photography, or seasonal activities.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 2, 'Groups Nohur Lake + Yeddi Gozel Waterfall as a logical nature circuit rather than creating repeated road transfers.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 3, 'Keeps Old Gabala + Nij Village together for travelers interested in archaeology, Caucasian Albania, Udi culture, and regional heritage.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 4, 'Uses Savalan Winery strategically for honeymoon, premium, food, wine, and countryside-focused travelers.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 5, 'Treats Gabaland as a family-focused recreational product rather than a mandatory attraction for every traveler.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 6, 'Uses skiing and snowboarding primarily in winter, while warmer months are better for hiking, paragliding, rafting, jeep safari, cycling, and mountain exploration.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 7, 'Treats paragliding, rafting, and other adventure activities as conditional products requiring suitable weather, reputable operators, and traveler suitability.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 8, 'Uses hotel location strategically. Travelers focused on skiing and mountain views should prioritize convenient Tufandag access, while broader sightseeing travelers should evaluate road access to Nohur, Nij, Old Gabala, and other regional attractions.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 9, 'Keeps at least one lower-intensity period for spa, resort relaxation, lake scenery, cafés, local dining, or hotel leisure.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 10, 'Adjusts the itinerary by traveler type: Gabaland + Nohur + easy Tufandag experiences for families; Tufandag + Nohur + Savalan + spa for honeymoon travelers; adventure sports for active travelers; and scenic drives + wellness for seniors.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 11, 'Checks Tufandag lift operations, ski conditions, weather, waterfall access, rafting season, paragliding availability, and attraction timings before finalizing the itinerary.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 12, 'Places mountain and nature activities during suitable weather periods and keeps flexible alternatives for rain, fog, snow, strong wind, or poor visibility.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 13, 'Avoids unnecessary hotel changes during short Gabala stays and uses one practical resort or city base.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 14, 'For short stays, prioritizes **TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE / YEDDI_GOZEL + ONE SIGNATURE EXPERIENCE**.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 15, 'For 2–3 night stays, adds **OLD_GABALA / NIJ + FAMILY, ADVENTURE, SPA, OR WINE EXPERIENCE** according to traveler interests.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 16, 'For longer stays, adds **SAVALAN + RAFTING / SHOOTING CLUB + THERMAL WELLNESS + REGIONAL ROAD-TRIP EXTENSIONS TOWARD OGUZ / SHEKI**.'),
  ('gabala', 963, 17, 'Uses Gabala primarily as a **NATURE, MOUNTAIN, FAMILY, ADVENTURE, SKI, HONEYMOON, PHOTOGRAPHY, WELLNESS, AND RESORT DESTINATION**, with culture and archaeology as valuable secondary layers rather than positioning it as a major urban sightseeing, shopping, or nightlife destination.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 0, 'honeymoon'),
  ('gabala', 966, 1, 'family convenience'),
  ('gabala', 966, 2, 'luxury'),
  ('gabala', 966, 3, 'senior travelers'),
  ('gabala', 966, 4, 'airport / Baku transfers'),
  ('gabala', 966, 5, 'Tufandag'),
  ('gabala', 966, 6, 'Nohur Lake'),
  ('gabala', 966, 7, 'Yeddi Gozel Waterfall'),
  ('gabala', 966, 8, 'Old Gabala'),
  ('gabala', 966, 9, 'Nij Village'),
  ('gabala', 966, 10, 'Savalan Winery'),
  ('gabala', 966, 11, 'Gabala Shooting Club'),
  ('gabala', 966, 12, 'rafting / adventure transfers'),
  ('gabala', 966, 13, 'wider countryside exploration'),
  ('gabala', 966, 14, 'Oguz / Sheki regional extensions'),
  ('gabala', 966, 15, 'Tufandag Mountain Resort'),
  ('gabala', 966, 16, 'Tufandag cable-car experience'),
  ('gabala', 966, 17, 'Nohur Lake'),
  ('gabala', 966, 18, 'Yeddi Gozel Waterfall'),
  ('gabala', 966, 19, 'One Caucasus Mountain photography experience'),
  ('gabala', 966, 20, 'One Azerbaijani food experience'),
  ('gabala', 966, 21, 'Old Gabala or Nij Village for cultural depth'),
  ('gabala', 966, 22, 'One seasonal signature experience such as skiing, paragliding, hiking, rafting, spa, or Savalan Winery'),
  ('gabala', 966, 23, 'Relaxed resort / mountain-view time'),
  ('gabala', 966, 24, 'Do not treat Gabala only as a Tufandag cable-car stop.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 25, 'Do not try to cover Tufandag, Nohur Lake, Yeddi Gozel, Old Gabala, Nij, Savalan, rafting, paragliding, and multiple regional excursions in one short stay.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 26, 'Do not assume every Tufandag activity operates year-round.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 27, 'Do not plan skiing without checking snow, piste, lift, equipment, and instructor availability.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 28, 'Do not treat paragliding, rafting, jeep safari, or other adventure activities as guaranteed regardless of weather or operator conditions.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 29, 'Do not underestimate road travel between Gabala''s dispersed attractions.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 30, 'Do not assume Yeddi Gozel has completely flat or easy access; natural terrain and steps can affect suitability.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 31, 'Do not choose accommodation only by price without considering access to Tufandag and the planned sightseeing areas.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 32, 'Do not overload families with adventure activities while ignoring Gabaland, Nohur Lake, easy cable-car experiences, and resort relaxation.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 33, 'Do not plan every day as a high-intensity mountain or road-trip day.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 34, 'Do not ignore weather, visibility, snow, rain, and road conditions when planning mountain experiences.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 35, 'Do not assume Gabala offers Baku-level nightlife, shopping, urban public transport, or entertainment.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 36, 'Do not schedule distant regional excursions immediately before a tightly timed airport transfer.'),
  ('gabala', 966, 37, 'Do not assume every natural, archaeological, or mountain attraction is suitable for travelers with limited mobility.'),
  ('gabala', 967, 0, 'Azerbaijan Travel / State Tourism Agency — Official information on Gabala, Tufandag Mountain Resort, Nohur Lake, Yeddi Gozel Waterfall, family tourism, nature, outdoor activities, wellness, accommodation, regional travel, and seasonal visitor experiences.'),
  ('gabala', 967, 1, 'Azerbaijan Travel / Tufandag sources — Information on skiing, snowboarding, cable cars, ski-school services, mountain activities, summer hiking, paragliding, cycling, and jeep experiences.'),
  ('gabala', 967, 2, 'Azerbaijan Travel / Old Gabala and Nij sources — Information on Old Gabala / Chukhur Gabala, Caucasian Albanian heritage, archaeology, Nij Village, Udi culture, and religious heritage.'),
  ('gabala', 967, 3, 'Azerbaijan Travel / Savalan Winery — Information on vineyards, wine production, winery tours, museum, restaurant, tastings, and countryside wine tourism.'),
  ('gabala', 967, 4, 'Azerbaijan Travel / adventure and wellness sources — Information on rafting, Gabala Shooting Club, thermal springs, spa resorts, outdoor recreation, and seasonal adventure activities.'),
  ('almaty', 972, 0, 'Travel outside New Year, peak ski weekends, major holidays, and the busiest summer travel periods when accommodation and activity demand can increase'),
  ('almaty', 972, 1, 'Choose a clean, well-reviewed hostel, apartment, budget hotel, or mid-range property rather than an international luxury hotel'),
  ('almaty', 972, 2, 'Stay near a useful metro station or central public-transport corridor instead of relying on taxis for every city journey'),
  ('almaty', 972, 3, 'Use Almaty Metro, buses, and trolleybuses for regular city transportation'),
  ('almaty', 972, 4, 'Use public bus connections toward Medeu before transferring to the Shymbulak gondola where practical; Shymbulak currently lists bus routes 12 and 21 to Medeu.'),
  ('almaty', 972, 5, 'Walk between nearby central attractions such as Panfilov Park, Ascension Cathedral, Green Bazaar, pedestrian streets, cafés, and selected museums'),
  ('almaty', 972, 6, 'Eat at local Kazakh / Central Asian restaurants, canteens, bakeries, cafés, markets, and casual eateries instead of premium restaurants for every meal'),
  ('almaty', 972, 7, 'Use Green Bazaar and local food shops for snacks, fruit, dried products, and inexpensive local food experiences'),
  ('almaty', 972, 8, 'Compare Kok Tobe, Shymbulak, museum, zoo, and other attraction costs before purchasing individual tickets'),
  ('almaty', 972, 9, 'Consider the Almaty Pass when the included attractions closely match the itinerary; the city promotes it as a bundled product covering attractions such as Kok Tobe cable car, Shymbulak gondola, zoo, botanical garden, and museums.'),
  ('almaty', 972, 10, 'Use Shymbulak pedestrian tickets only for the mountain sections actually required rather than automatically purchasing the highest-priced option'),
  ('almaty', 972, 11, 'Travel in April, late October, or November when the traveler''s interests suit the season and visitor pressure is generally lower'),
  ('almaty', 972, 12, 'Use group tours for Charyn Canyon, Kolsai, Kaindy, Issyk, or other distant excursions when they provide better value than a private vehicle'),
  ('almaty', 972, 13, 'Group geographically related mountain and regional destinations rather than paying for repeated long transfers'),
  ('almaty', 972, 14, 'Balance paid attractions with parks, architecture, city walks, markets, viewpoints, and independent food exploration'),
  ('almaty', 972, 15, 'Very cheap accommodation in an inconvenient outer district when repeated taxi costs and travel time remove the saving'),
  ('almaty', 972, 16, 'Poor-quality accommodation solely because it is cheaper'),
  ('almaty', 972, 17, 'Choosing unreliable mountain-transfer or excursion operators solely for a lower price'),
  ('almaty', 972, 18, 'Booking the cheapest skiing, snowboarding, trekking, climbing-related, or other adventure service without checking safety and guide quality'),
  ('almaty', 972, 19, 'Cutting ski-equipment, helmet, clothing, instructor, or safety-related costs excessively'),
  ('almaty', 972, 20, 'Attempting remote Tian Shan or regional excursions with unsuitable vehicles'),
  ('almaty', 972, 21, 'Ignoring heating during winter or air-conditioning during hot summer periods'),
  ('almaty', 972, 22, 'Cutting private-transport costs excessively for families, seniors, luxury travelers, or travelers with significant mobility limitations'),
  ('almaty', 972, 23, 'Choosing the cheapest Charyn / Kolsai / Kaindy excursion without considering route design, vehicle condition, guide quality, timing, and what is actually included'),
  ('almaty', 972, 24, 'Sacrificing a convenient location on a short 3–4 night Almaty stay'),
  ('almaty', 972, 25, 'Assuming Shymbulak is inexpensive because it is close to the city; cable cars, skiing, equipment, lessons, dining, and transport should be considered together'),
  ('almaty', 972, 26, 'Ignoring current weather, snow, lift, road, and mountain conditions simply to preserve a prepaid itinerary'),
  ('almaty', 978, 0, '3+'),
  ('almaty', 978, 1, '6+'),
  ('almaty', 978, 2, 'TEENAGERS'),
  ('almaty', 978, 3, 'Maximum 2–4 major activities/day.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 4, 'Prefer a well-reviewed central or south-Almaty hotel with practical access to Kok Tobe, parks, restaurants, Medeu, and Shymbulak.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 5, 'Schedule regular meals, hydration, restroom stops, indoor breaks, and hotel rest.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 6, 'Prioritize Kok Tobe, Panfilov Park, Botanical Garden, Almaty Zoo, Medeu, Shymbulak gondola, easy snow activities, and manageable cultural sightseeing.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 7, 'Include at least one interactive or recreational experience rather than only museums and monuments.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 8, 'Use metro, buses, or taxis for city movement and direct transport for longer mountain journeys.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 9, 'Use professional Shymbulak ski instructors for beginner children.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 10, 'Match ski terrain and winter activities to the child''s actual ability.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 11, 'Children aged 3–5 and 6–10 can currently book dedicated ski lessons at Shymbulak, while snowboard lessons begin from age 8.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 12, 'Ensure appropriate winter clothing, helmets, gloves, goggles, and properly fitted equipment during ski activities.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 13, 'Monitor temperature, snowfall, visibility, gondola operations, and mountain weather before visiting Medeu or Shymbulak.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 14, 'Avoid combining full-day skiing with Charyn Canyon, Kolsay, Kaindy, or another long regional excursion on the same family day.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 15, 'Allow extra time for gondolas, ski-equipment fitting, lessons, meals, traffic, and changing clothes in winter.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 16, 'Keep at least one relaxed period for parks, cafés, shopping, Kids Club, hotel facilities, or family dining.'),
  ('almaty', 978, 17, 'Avoid frequent hotel changes during short stays.');
