  ('almaty', 1009, 0, 'Treat Almaty only as a gateway to Shymbulak or nearby mountains and miss Panfilov Park, Ascension Cathedral, Green Bazaar, museums, food, café culture, shopping, Kok Tobe, nightlife, and the city''s broader urban identity.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 1, 'Try to cover central Almaty, Kok Tobe, Medeu, Shymbulak, Big Almaty Lake, Charyn Canyon, Kolsay Lakes, Kaindy Lake, shopping, museums, and nightlife in one short stay.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 2, 'Underestimate Almaty''s geography. Central attractions are relatively easy to combine, but Medeu / Shymbulak, Big Almaty Lake, Oi-Qaragai, Charyn, Kolsay, Kaindy, and other regional attractions require separate planning and substantial travel time.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 3, 'Schedule Medeu + Shymbulak + Kok Tobe + multiple city attractions together without allowing enough time for gondolas, traffic, meals, photography, weather changes, and relaxation.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 4, 'Treat Charyn Canyon, Kolsay Lakes, and Kaindy Lake as simple extensions of city sightseeing instead of substantial regional excursions.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 5, 'Attempt Charyn + Kolsay + Kaindy + multiple additional stops in a single day without considering long driving distances, walking, daylight, road conditions, and traveler fatigue.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 6, 'Assume every Shymbulak activity operates throughout the year. Skiing, snowboarding, gondolas, hiking, and mountain recreation depend on season, weather, snow, wind, visibility, and resort operations.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 7, 'Plan skiing or snowboarding without considering ability, equipment rental, ski-school requirements, appropriate clothing, altitude, and current slope conditions.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 8, 'Plan long mountain hikes without considering fitness, elevation, weather, trail conditions, appropriate equipment, daylight, or whether professional guiding is advisable.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 9, 'Assume Big Almaty Lake always has straightforward private-vehicle access. Access regulations and protected-area arrangements can change and should be checked before travel.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 10, 'Ignore altitude differences between central Almaty and mountain attractions. Medeu, Shymbulak, Big Almaty Lake, and higher hiking routes are substantially higher than the city.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 11, 'Choose accommodation only by price without considering access to metro stations, restaurants, central attractions, nightlife, and mountain-transfer routes.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 12, 'Focus only on nature and miss Almaty''s major urban strengths. Official tourism material emphasizes both its mountain setting and its cafés, restaurants, shops, green avenues, historic streets, and modern metropolitan environment.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 13, 'Focus only on city sightseeing and underestimate Almaty''s exceptional access to the Trans-Ili Alatau and regional nature attractions such as Big Almaty Lake, Charyn, Kolsay, and Kaindy.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 14, 'Treat food merely as a meal stop even though Almaty is one of Central Asia''s strongest gastronomy destinations; in 2026 the city was highlighted by Eater as a notable international food destination.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 15, 'Assume Almaty has limited shopping because it is often marketed internationally around mountains. In reality, it is Kazakhstan''s largest commercial centre with a substantial modern retail ecosystem.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 16, 'Plan every evening around sightseeing and miss Almaty''s restaurants, cafés, bars, lounges, nightlife, shopping, Kok Tobe views, and urban evening atmosphere.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 17, 'Overload departure day with Medeu, Shymbulak, Kok Tobe, or a regional excursion without allowing enough time for traffic, luggage, checkout, and the airport transfer.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 18, 'Ignore seasonal differences. Winter creates strong ski demand, while summer and early autumn increase demand for hiking, lakes, canyons, and mountain travel.'),
  ('almaty', 1009, 19, 'Ignore the traveler''s actual purpose, especially when the trip is primarily for family, honeymoon, skiing, food, nightlife, shopping, culture, adventure, photography, luxury, or nature.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 0, 'Builds the Almaty itinerary around the traveler''s primary purpose and season rather than treating every visitor as a standard city-and-mountain client.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 1, 'Groups Panfilov Park + Ascension Cathedral + Green Bazaar + nearby pedestrian areas into one efficient central cultural circuit.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 2, 'Gives central Almaty enough time because the city itself is a major tourism product rather than merely a transit base for the mountains.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 3, 'Treats Kok Tobe as a strategic sunset / evening experience rather than simply another daytime attraction.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 4, 'Groups Medeu + Shymbulak into one logical mountain circuit and allows enough time for gondola travel, mountain scenery, skiing, dining, photography, and weather flexibility.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 5, 'Uses Shymbulak differently by season: skiing and snowboarding in winter; mountain views, gondolas, hiking, dining, and outdoor recreation during warmer months.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 6, 'Keeps Big Almaty Lake / Ile-Alatau as a separate mountain-nature product and verifies current access conditions before confirming it.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 7, 'Treats Charyn Canyon as a dedicated full-day excursion rather than squeezing it between city attractions.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 8, 'Treats Kolsay / Kaindy as a major extended nature circuit. For comfort-focused itineraries, an overnight or dedicated regional day is often more appropriate than attempting to combine everything with central Almaty.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 9, 'Uses private transport or organized excursions strategically for distant regional nature attractions while relying on walking, metro, buses, and taxis for the city.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 10, 'Uses hotel location strategically. Central or metro-connected accommodation works best for city-heavy itineraries, while premium south-Almaty hotels can suit luxury travelers wanting stronger restaurant, shopping, and mountain-road access.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 11, 'Protects substantial time for Kazakh and Central Asian food, Green Bazaar, cafés, modern restaurants, and specialty coffee because gastronomy is one of Almaty''s strongest urban products.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 12, 'Uses shopping according to traveler type: Green Bazaar and Arbat for local products, major malls for mainstream retail, and premium districts for luxury shopping. Almaty''s current retail activity remains substantial, with official 2026 data showing continued growth in city retail turnover.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 13, 'Treats nightlife as a genuine destination strength rather than an optional afterthought, particularly for couples, solo travelers, younger visitors, luxury travelers, and food-focused clients.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 14, 'Keeps at least one lower-intensity period for cafés, spa, shopping, parks, hotel relaxation, or an unhurried dinner.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 15, 'Adjusts the itinerary substantially by traveler type: Kok Tobe + parks + easy Shymbulak experiences for families; Kok Tobe + Shymbulak + fine dining + spa for honeymoon travelers; private mountain guiding and premium city experiences for luxury travelers; Charyn / Kolsay / hiking for active travelers.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 16, 'Checks Shymbulak operations, mountain weather, snow conditions, trail conditions, regional road conditions, protected-area access, museum hours, and event schedules before finalizing the itinerary.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 17, 'Uses seasonal logic carefully: winter prioritizes Shymbulak and snow experiences; spring emphasizes city culture and gradually improving mountain access; summer prioritizes hiking, lakes, canyons, and high-altitude escapes; autumn combines city sightseeing, food, photography, and excellent mountain scenery.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 18, 'Avoids unnecessary hotel changes during short Almaty stays because the city works effectively as a single base for central sightseeing and several nearby mountain experiences.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 19, 'For short stays, prioritizes **CENTRAL_ALMATY + KOK_TOBE + MEDEU / SHYMBULAK + ONE FOOD / CULTURAL EXPERIENCE**.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 20, 'For 4–5 night stays, adds **ONE MAJOR NATURE EXCURSION such as CHARYN or BIG_ALMATY_LAKE / ILE_ALATAU** according to access, season, and interests.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 21, 'For longer stays, adds **CHARYN + KOLSAY / KAINDY + DEEPER TIAN_SHAN EXPLORATION + SHOPPING + GASTRONOMY + NIGHTLIFE** without sacrificing city time.'),
  ('almaty', 1010, 22, 'Uses Almaty primarily as a **CITY, CULTURE, FOOD, SHOPPING, NIGHTLIFE, MOUNTAIN, NATURE, SKI, ADVENTURE, PHOTOGRAPHY, FAMILY, HONEYMOON, AND LUXURY DESTINATION**, rather than positioning it only as a mountain gateway.'),
