  ('samarkand', 1076, 0, 'Prefer a comfortable central or south-Almaty hotel with elevators, good vehicle access, restaurants, and convenient transport.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 1, 'Use taxis or private cars selectively for longer city journeys and mountain sightseeing.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 2, 'Avoid stacking several walking-intensive city attractions and mountain excursions into one day.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 3, 'Include regular seating, meals, hydration, restroom stops, and hotel rest.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 4, 'Check hotel elevators, step-free entrances, accessible bathrooms, climate control, and vehicle drop-off before booking.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 5, 'Prioritize Panfilov Park, Ascension Cathedral, museums, Green Bazaar with controlled walking, Kok Tobe, scenic drives, restaurants, and carefully selected Medeu / Shymbulak experiences.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 6, 'Use cable cars / gondolas for panoramic mountain access rather than demanding hikes where appropriate.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 7, 'Treat Kok Tobe, Medeu, and Shymbulak individually according to weather, altitude, snow, slopes, and mobility.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 8, 'Avoid difficult mountain hikes, long canyon walks, steep trails, advanced skiing, and remote outdoor routes for travelers with significant mobility or balance limitations.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 9, 'Use private transport for Charyn Canyon, Kolsay, Kaindy, Big Almaty Lake area, and longer nature excursions.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 10, 'Schedule outdoor sightseeing during comfortable weather and daylight.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 11, 'During winter, consider snow, ice, freezing temperatures, and slippery pavements before planning walking-heavy days.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 12, 'During summer, avoid excessive midday walking during hot conditions.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 13, 'Keep the itinerary flexible around energy level, weather, altitude tolerance, and mountain conditions.'),
  ('samarkand', 1076, 14, 'Include at least one relaxed period for cafés, spa, parks, shopping, dining, or hotel leisure.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 0, 'Modern hotels and newer facilities such as Silk Road Samarkand generally provide stronger accessibility potential than older heritage environments, but exact facilities must still be checked individually.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 1, 'Registan and other major heritage complexes can involve large walking areas, thresholds, historic paving, steps, and uneven surfaces.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 2, 'Shah-i-Zinda is one of the more physically demanding major attractions because of its stairways, slopes, and historic surfaces.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 3, 'Afrasiab archaeological areas should not be assumed wheelchair accessible.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 4, 'Siab Bazaar can involve crowding, uneven surfaces, and narrow market movement.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 5, 'The pedestrian corridor between Registan and Shah-i-Zinda is useful for walking, but a car-free zone does not automatically mean a fully accessible route. Uzbekistan Travel confirms that approximately 1.5 km of Islam Karimov Street connecting these areas is car-free.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 6, 'Konigil has a 2.5 km car-free visitor road, but exact accessible surfaces, toilets, and workshop entrances should still be checked.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 7, 'Private vehicles generally provide the greatest flexibility for seniors and travelers with significant mobility requirements.'),
  ('samarkand', 1077, 8, 'Step-free entrances, ramps, accessible toilets, parking, room configuration, and vehicle drop-off should always be confirmed before travel.'),
