  ('bishkek', 1179, 0, 'Treat Bishkek only as a quick city stop and miss Ala-Too Square, Osh Bazaar, Panfilov Park, Victory Square, the State History Museum, cafés, Soviet-era urban character, and the mountain backdrop.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 1, 'Try to pack Ala-Too Square, Osh Bazaar, Panfilov Park, Victory Square, the State History Museum, and Ala-Archa into one rushed day.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 2, 'Underestimate Bishkek''s identity. The city is a Soviet-planned capital with parks, wide boulevards, bazaars, museums, food, and easy mountain access rather than a compact monument city.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 3, 'Schedule too many outdoor walks in one day without allowing time for cafés, meals, rest, traffic, and seasonal weather.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 4, 'Treat Osh Bazaar only as shopping rather than combining it with Kyrgyz food, bakery products, dried fruits, spices, and everyday city life.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 5, 'Ignore the importance of parks, relaxed urban walking, and café culture in Bishkek''s best travel experience.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 6, 'Assume every attraction is best reached on foot. Bishkek is walkable in the core, but longer distances, weather, and mountain excursions often need taxis or private transport.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 7, 'Choose accommodation only by price without considering access to Ala-Too Square, restaurants, evening dining, and the main sightseeing zone.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 8, 'Treat Ala-Archa, Burana, Chon-Kemin, and Kashka-Suu as if they were part of the compact city core.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 9, 'Ignore winter cold or summer heat when planning long walking days.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 10, 'Focus only on museums and miss Bishkek''s food, cafés, bazaars, shopping, nightlife, and relaxed leisure.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 11, 'Assume Bishkek offers a classic heritage-old-town atmosphere. Its strength is urban culture, not dense medieval sightseeing.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 12, 'Ignore Bishkek''s value as a base for mountain day trips, nature, and regional exploration.'),
  ('bishkek', 1179, 13, 'Ignore the traveler''s purpose, especially when the trip is primarily for culture, food, shopping, business, family, honeymoon, relaxation, or mountain access.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 0, 'Builds the itinerary around Bishkek''s strongest identity: CITY + CULTURE + FOOD + SHOPPING + MOUNTAIN ACCESS + RELAXATION + PHOTOGRAPHY.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 1, 'Uses Ala-Too Square and the central Bishkek area as the core first-time sightseeing zone.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 2, 'Combines Osh Bazaar with Kyrgyz food, dried fruits, spices, bakery stops, and local atmosphere.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 3, 'Uses Panfilov Park and Dubovy Park as low-intensity breaks between bigger sightseeing blocks.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 4, 'Uses Victory Square and the State History Museum as easy central cultural stops.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 5, 'Treats Ala-Archa as the main nature day trip rather than a city sight.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 6, 'Uses Burana or Chon-Kemin for travelers who want a regional excursion beyond the capital.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 7, 'Keeps time for cafés, restaurants, local food, shopping, and relaxed evenings.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 8, 'Uses summer mornings and evenings for sightseeing and avoids too much midday walking.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 9, 'Keeps one slower period for café time, shopping, hotel rest, or a flexible dinner.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('bishkek', 1180, 10, 'Checks current opening hours, road conditions, weather, and transport before finalizing the itinerary.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 11, 'Adjusts the itinerary by traveler type: parks and short museum visits for families; mountain-view dining and spa time for honeymoon travelers; private drivers and premium hotels for luxury travelers.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 12, 'For short stays, prioritizes **ALA-TOO SQUARE + OSH BAZAAR + PANFILOV PARK + VICTORY SQUARE + STATE HISTORY MUSEUM**.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 13, 'For 3–4 night stays, adds **ALA-ARCHA + DUBOVY PARK + CAFE / DINING TIME + ONE REGIONAL EXCURSION** according to traveler profile.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 14, 'For longer stays, adds **BURANA + CHON-KEMIN / COUNTRYSIDE + KASHKA-SUU + DEEPER FOOD / SHOPPING / RELAXATION EXPERIENCES** without overloading the city core.'),
  ('bishkek', 1180, 15, 'Uses Bishkek primarily as a **CITY, CULTURE, FOOD, SHOPPING, BUSINESS, NATURE-ACCESS, FAMILY, HONEYMOON, RELAXATION, AND PHOTOGRAPHY DESTINATION**.'),
