  ('shanghai', 2030, 0, 'Major modern sights (Shanghai Tower, Shanghai Museum, Bund Promenade, Shanghai Disneyland) feature fully accessible main routes and wheelchair rentals.'),
  ('shanghai', 2030, 1, 'Modern transit hubs (PVG, SHA, Shanghai Hongqiao Railway Station) provide full step-free infrastructure and assistance.'),
