  ('shanghai', 2030, 3, 'Elevator access at Shanghai Tower and Oriental Pearl Tower allows wheelchair users to reach observation decks effortlessly.'),
  ('shanghai', 2030, 4, 'Accessible hotel rooms, roll-in showers, and ramped vehicle transfers must be pre-verified.'),
