  ('hong-kong', 2076, 0, 'Take advantage of the park''s small, flat geographic footprint compared to other international Disney resorts.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2076, 1, 'Utilize the free, continuous resort hotel shuttle buses to avoid walking between hotels and the main entrance.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2076, 2, 'Focus on high-capacity, climate-controlled indoor theater shows (*Festival of the Lion King*, *Mickey and the Wondrous Book*, *PhilharMagic*).'),
  ('hong-kong', 2076, 3, 'Rent wheelchairs or electric mobility scooters at the park entrance for guests with limited mobility.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2076, 4, 'Schedule quiet mid-day sit-down lunches at Plaza Inn or Main Street Corner Cafe.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2076, 5, 'Choose cross-platform MTR transfers at Sunny Bay Station when traveling from downtown Hong Kong.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2076, 6, 'Utilize Priority Access passes to minimize standing for long durations in outdoor queues.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2077, 0, 'All major attraction queues are fully accessible; board through standard lines or dedicated accessible load zones.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2077, 1, 'Wheelchairs and strollers are available for daily rental at the City Hall building inside the Main Street U.S.A. entrance.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2077, 2, 'Major theaters (*Festival of the Lion King*, *Mickey and the Wondrous Book*) provide designated wheelchair seating sections.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2077, 3, 'The MTR Disneyland Resort Line and Sunny Bay Interchange Station offer 100% step-free elevator access and level train boarding.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2077, 4, 'Accessible guest rooms with roll-in showers and grab bars are available across all three official Disney resort hotels.'),
