  ('hong-kong', 2103, 0, 'Treat Hong Kong as only Victoria Harbour + Victoria Peak and miss West Kowloon Cultural District art museums, Lantau Island heritage, Central alleyways, and outlying fishing villages.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 1, 'Overload Day 1 with Victoria Peak, Peak Tram, Central Market, Hong Kong Palace Museum, Castle of Magical Dreams, and an evening Symphony of Lights cruise all within a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 2, 'Try to combine Hong Kong Disneyland + Lantau Big Buddha + Macao + Shenzhen + Guangzhou in a short itinerary simply because high-speed rail and bridge connections look fast on a map.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 3, 'Rely entirely on surface road taxis during peak rush hours, or ignore Hong Kong MTR''s fast, ultra-efficient, traffic-proof urban network.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 4, 'Underestimate advance-booking rules and strict daily ticket limits for Hong Kong Disneyland, Peak Tram Sky Pass, M+ Museum, and Ngong Ping 360 Crystal Cabins during peak travel seasons.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 5, 'Treat Hong Kong''s climate as uniform and ignore seasonal extremes between muggy summer heat with typhoon rainstorms, cool damp winter days, and pleasant autumn/spring windows.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 6, 'Plan outdoor Peak walks, open-air harbor cruises, or fishing village canal strolls without checking weather forecasts, heavy fog/smog days, or extreme seasonal holiday crowds.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 7, 'Ignore Cantonese gastronomy by treating meals only as international hotel buffets instead of scheduling authentic Dim Sum, Siu Mei roast goose, wonton noodles, and Cha Chaan Teng egg tarts.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 8, 'Schedule excessive hotel moves between Hong Kong Island and Kowloon even when a single central base near Central, Tsim Sha Tsui, or Wan Chai serves the entire territory efficiently.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2103, 9, 'Assume every ancient temple stone step, historic Tai O stilt house, and traditional heritage building is automatically step-free or fully accessible.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around VICTORIA_HARBOUR_AND_THE_PEAK + WEST_KOWLOON_AND_CENTRAL + HONG_KONG_DISNEYLAND + LANTAU_BIG_BUDDHA_OR_MACAO.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 1, 'Gives Victoria Harbour & Victoria Peak enough time for day walks, Star Ferry crossings, and sunset/evening illumination viewing without rushing.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 2, 'Gives Lantau Island or Macao trips enough time for BIG_BUDDHA_OR_MACAO + CABLE_CAR_RIDE + UNESCO_HERITAGE rather than treating them as rushed side trips.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 3, 'Adds MAN_MO_TEMPLE & WONG_TAI_SIN_TEMPLE for spiritual heritage, Qing dynasty history, and traditional incense culture.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 4, 'Uses WEST_KOWLOON_CULTURAL_DISTRICT / PMQ_CREATIVE_HUB selectively when contemporary art, design exhibitions, and modern architecture are the focus.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 5, 'Uses TAI_O_FISHING_VILLAGE / CHEUNG_CHAU / LAMMA_ISLAND when coastal village charm, boat cruises, and island stays are preferred.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 6, 'Uses HONG_KONG_MTR for urban transit and Uber or private MPVs for Disneyland, Lantau Island, and regional day trips.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 7, 'Keeps time for Central coffee shops, traditional tea house ceremonies, waterfront parks, and relaxed neighborhood street market strolling.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 8, 'Matches outdoor sightseeing, waterfront promenades, and skyscraper observation decks to seasonal weather, visibility, and daylight conditions.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2104, 9, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 0, 'WALKING + HONG_KONG_MTR for central urban sites (Victoria Harbour, Central, West Kowloon, Causeway Bay)'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 1, 'UBER / PRIVATE_MPV selectively for Hong Kong Disneyland, Lantau Island, airport transfers, and group travel'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 2, 'HIGH_SPEED_RAIL (HSR) / HZMB_BUS for regional excursions (Macao, Shenzhen, Guangzhou)'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 3, 'PUBLIC_STAR_FERRIES selectively for direct budget crossings between Hong Kong Island and Kowloon'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 4, 'SCENIC_TRAMS_AND_CABLE_CARS for hillside ascents (Peak Tram, Ngong Ping 360 Cable Car)'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 5, 'CITYWALK / BICYCLE selectively for historic Central lanes and waterfront promenades'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 6, 'Victoria Harbour promenade & Avenue of Stars futuristic skyscraper view'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 7, 'Peak Tram ride to Victoria Peak Sky Terrace 428 & high-altitude panorama'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 8, 'Hong Kong Palace Museum & M+ Museum modern art tour in West Kowloon'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 9, 'Central & Sheung Wan leafy Citywalk around Hollywood Road & Tai Kwun'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 10, 'Signature Dim Sum & Siu Mei roast goose tasting feast'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 11, 'Evening Star Ferry harbor ride to view illuminated skyline and light show'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 12, 'Lantau Island Big Buddha (Tian Tan) cable car ride and monastery visit'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 13, 'Hong Kong Disneyland World of Frozen and Momentous Nighttime Spectacular'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 14, 'Man Mo Temple or Wong Tai Sin Temple incense and spiritual heritage tour'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 15, 'Central Market or Temple Street urban renewal street market exploration'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 16, 'Do not treat Hong Kong as only Victoria Harbour + Peak Tram while skipping local Sheung Wan life and Lantau heritage.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 17, 'Do not force Victoria Harbour + Victoria Peak + M+ Museum + Disneyland + Macao all into a single day.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 18, 'Do not underestimate advance online ticket booking and real-name passport reservation rules for major sites.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 19, 'Do not rely solely on road taxis during peak rush hours when the Hong Kong MTR is faster and immune to traffic.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 20, 'Do not visit Victoria Peak observation decks on heavy mist or rainy days without checking live visibility screens.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 21, 'Do not plan extensive outdoor citywalks without checking seasonal weather, typhoon warnings, and summer humidity.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 22, 'Do not miss Cantonese gastronomy by eating only Western hotel food.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 23, 'Do not assume historic temple stone steps and village paths are fully step-free or barrier-free.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2107, 24, 'Do not ignore physical scale; massive waterfront promenades and sprawling theme parks require several miles of daily walking.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2108, 0, 'Hong Kong Tourism Board (discoverhongkong.com) — Official municipal and national tourism board details covering Victoria Harbour, Victoria Peak, Disneyland, and cultural itineraries.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2108, 1, 'Hong Kong Palace Museum & West Kowloon Cultural District Authority — Official ticketing guidelines, capacity limits, opening schedules, and reservation policies for major museums and cultural venues.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2108, 2, 'Hong Kong MTR Corporation & MTR High Speed Rail — Transportation networks, urban metro schedules, high-speed rail connections, and station accessibility updates.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2108, 3, 'Hong Kong Observatory — Seasonal climate data, air quality indexing, and seasonal weather patterns.'),
  ('hong-kong', 2108, 4, 'Official venue operators — Hong Kong Disneyland Resort, Ocean Park Hong Kong, Peak Tramways, Ngong Ping 360, and Star Ferry Company.'),
