  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 0, 'Treat Kailash Mansarovar as a standard leisure sightseeing trip and ignore the severe physiological demands of high-altitude trans-Himalayan trekking.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 1, 'Overload Day 1–2 with rapid elevation gains, skipping compulsory acclimatization stopovers in Lhasa, Saga, Purang, or Simikot.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 2, 'Try to complete the full 52 km Parikrama (Kora) across Dolma La Pass (5,630 m) in 2 days without dedicated porter, horse, or medical support.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 3, 'Rely on unverified local transport or attempt independent travel, ignoring Chinese TAR regulations mandating licensed guides, group permits, and designated tourist vehicles.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 4, 'Underestimate long permit lead times (Tibet Travel Permit, Alien''s Travel Permit, Foreign Affairs Military Clearance) and strict group visa rules.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 5, 'Treat Western Tibet''s weather as predictable and ignore sudden snowstorms, high UV exposure, gale-force winds, and sub-zero night temperatures.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 6, 'Plan the high-altitude Parikrama or Lake Mansarovar dip without monitoring daily oxygen saturation (SpO2), blood pressure, and severe AMS/HAPE/HACE symptoms.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 7, 'Ignore local dietary constraints by expecting elaborate hotel buffets instead of packing high-energy snacks, electrolytes, and simple vegetarian meals (*Dal Bhat*, *Thukpa*, *Tsampa*).'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 8, 'Schedule frequent hotel changes on the plateau instead of using established acclimatization bases in Saga, Purang, or Darchen.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2197, 9, 'Assume ancient monastery steps, high mountain passes, and guesthouse latrines are step-free or accessible.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around KAILASH_NORTH_FACE_VIEW + LAKE_MANSAROVAR_CHIU_GOMPA + YAM_DWAR_GATEWAY + DOLMA_LA_PASS_ACCLIMATIZED_TREK.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 1, 'Gives Kathmandu/Lhasa border arrivals enough time for medical checks, group visa processing, and altitude adaptation without rushing.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 2, 'Gives the Kailash Parikrama enough time for YAM_DWAR_TO_DIRAPUK + DOLMA_LA_CROSSING + ZUTHULPUK_DESCENT + DARCHEN_RETURN rather than treating it as a rushed side hike.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 3, 'Adds GUGE_KINGDOM & THOLING_MONASTERY for ancient Buddhist heritage, cave murals, and Zanda earth forest photography.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 4, 'Uses TIRTHAPURI_HOT_SPRINGS / ASTHAPAD selectively when geothermal baths, spiritual history, and south face views are the focus.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 5, 'Uses CHARTERED_HELICOPTER_VIA_HILSA when short-duration travel, senior pilgrims, and bypassing long Nepal driving sectors are preferred.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 6, 'Uses CHINESE_TOURIST_COACH / 4WD_LAND_CRUISER for plateau transit and ECO_BUS_SHUTTLES for Lake Mansarovar and Yam Dwar access.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 7, 'Keeps time for sacred lakeshore meditation, monastery butter lamp offerings, and relaxed high-altitude acclimatization.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 8, 'Matches trekking dates, full moon departures, and mountain pass ascents to seasonal weather, snow conditions, and wind windows.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2198, 9, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 0, 'HIGH-ALTITUDE TOURING BUS / PRIVATE 4WD (4WD/MPV) for Tibetan Plateau highway transfers (G219 Highway)'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 1, 'ECO-BUS (Mandated Environmental Buses) for Lake Mansarovar Parikrama and scenic zones'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 2, 'HELICOPTER TRANSFERS for Nepal border crossings (Nepalgunj – Simikot – Hilsa)'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 3, 'DOMESTIC TIBET FLIGHTS (Tibet Airlines / China Eastern) via Ngari Gunsa Airport (NGQ) for direct access to Western Tibet'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 4, 'YAKS AND LOCAL PORTERS selectively for baggage carrying and support during the 52km Kora trek'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 5, 'HORSE / PONY RENTALS selectively for pilgrims needing trekking assistance up to Dolma La Pass'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 6, 'Perform Lake Mansarovar *Holy Dip* / *Parikrama* (Circuit) with views of Mt. Gurla Mandhata'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 7, 'Complete the sacred 52km Mt. Kailash Outer Kora over 3 days (Darchen -> Dirapuk -> Zuthulpuk -> Darchen)'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 8, 'Experience sunrise over the formidable North Face of Mt. Kailash from Dirapuk Monastery'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 9, 'Cross the highest point of the pilgrimage at Dolma La Pass (5,630m / 18,471ft) marked by vast prayer flag fields'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 10, 'Darshan of Gauri Kund (Jade Lake / Lake of Compassion) located just below Dolma La Pass'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 11, 'Visit ancient Chiu Monastery perched on a cliff edge overlooking Lake Mansarovar'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 12, 'Visit Yam Dwar (Tarboche) – the official gateway flag-pole site and starting point of the trek'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 13, 'Stop at Lake Rakshastal (Demon Lake) to view its contrasting dark blue waters opposite Mansarovar'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 14, 'Explore Pashupatinath Temple and Budhanilkantha in Kathmandu as traditional pre-Yatra spiritual preparation'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 15, 'Collect holy *Mansarovar Jal* (sacred water) in approved sealed containers'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 16, 'Do not attempt independent or solo travel; Tibet Autonomous Region strictly requires authorized group permits, guides, and pre-booked transport.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 17, 'Do not skip dedicated acclimatization days in Kathmandu, Lhasa, Kyirong, or Purang before attempting high passes.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 18, 'Do not ignore strict age caps (often capped at 70 years for certain entry permits) and compulsory high-altitude medical screenings.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 19, 'Do not attempt to touch or ascend Mount Kailash itself; climbing the sacred peak is strictly prohibited and disrespectful to four religions.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 20, 'Do not underestimate extreme weather shifts; sunny mornings can rapidly turn into sub-zero blizzards at Dolma La Pass.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 21, 'Do not attempt the Inner Kora (Charan Sparsh / Nandi Kora) without prior high-altitude trekking experience and guide clearance.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 22, 'Do not rely on credit cards or international digital wallets in remote Tibet; carry sufficient cash (CNY) for local porter fees and personal needs.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 23, 'Do not photograph Chinese military checkpoints, border bridges, or security personnel under any circumstances.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2201, 24, 'Do not rush the trek velocity; high altitude pulmonary/cerebral edema (HAPE/HACE) risks increase drastically with aggressive pacing.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2202, 0, 'Tibet Autonomous Region Tourism Bureau & China National Tourism Administration — Official regulatory framework governing group visas, Tibet Travel Permits (TTP), Alien Travel Permits, and military zone access clearance.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2202, 1, 'Ministry of External Affairs (India - kmy.gov.in) — Official government pilgrimage registration guidelines, medical protocols, and route allocations via Lipulekh and Nathu La passes.'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2202, 2, 'Nepal Tourism Board & Immigration Department — Transit rules via Kathmandu, Rasuwagadhi/Kyirong border, Simikot-Hilsa helicopter corridors, and Humla Restricted Area Permits (RAP).'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2202, 3, 'Civil Aviation Administration of China (CAAC) & Tibet Airlines — Aviation network updates for Lhasa Gonggar Airport and Ngari Gunsa Airport (Shiquanhe).'),
  ('lake-mansarovar', 2202, 4, 'High-Altitude Medical & Meteorological Institutes — Regional weather indexing, oxygen saturation standards, and seasonal safety protocols.'),
