  ('luxembourg', 2335, 0, 'Treat Luxembourg as only Luxembourg City and miss Vianden, Mullerthal, Echternach, Moselle, Éislek, Guttland and Minett.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 1, 'Assume the country''s small size means every important attraction should be packed into one or two days.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 2, 'Change hotels repeatedly even though Luxembourg City works extremely well as a base for regional day trips.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 3, 'Overload one city day with Bock Casemates + museums + Kirchberg + Grund + shopping + nightlife.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 4, 'Treat Vianden Castle, Mullerthal and Moselle as quick city-centre stops rather than separate regional experiences.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 5, 'Plan difficult Mullerthal hiking without checking trail length, terrain, weather and traveler fitness.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 6, 'Ignore Luxembourg''s major advantage of free nationwide standard-class public transport.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 7, 'Rent a car automatically even when trains and buses can serve much of the itinerary.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 8, 'Focus only on castles and miss gastronomy, vineyards, forests, cycling, museums and modern European identity.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 9, 'Treat Moselle only as sightseeing instead of wine, Crémant, gastronomy and relaxed river travel.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 10, 'Ignore family products such as Parc Merveilleux, Minett Park, playgrounds and interactive museums.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 11, 'Assume all castles, fortifications and hiking routes are step-free.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2335, 12, 'Ignore the traveler''s actual purpose: family, honeymoon, hiking, wine, culture, photography or slow travel.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 0, 'Builds the itinerary around **LUXEMBOURG_CITY + CASTLES + NATURE + WINE + GASTRONOMY + EASY_TRANSPORT**.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 1, 'Uses Luxembourg City as the principal first-time base.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 2, 'Groups Old Town + Bock Casemates + Corniche + Grund into one logical city heritage circuit.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 3, 'Treats Vianden as a dedicated castle excursion.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 4, 'Groups Mullerthal + Echternach naturally for nature and heritage.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 5, 'Uses Moselle strategically for honeymoon, wine, gastronomy and relaxed travel.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 6, 'Uses Éislek for deeper hiking, castles and countryside.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 7, 'Uses Guttland for castle circuits and rural cycling.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 8, 'Uses Minett for industrial heritage, hiking and family experiences.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 9, 'Uses free public transport wherever practical and private transport only when it materially improves convenience.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 10, 'Keeps at least one lower-intensity period for cafés, dining, vineyards, parks or free time.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 11, 'For short stays, prioritizes **LUXEMBOURG_CITY + VIANDEN_OR_MULLERTHAL**.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 12, 'For 4–5 nights, adds **VIANDEN + MULLERTHAL / ECHTERNACH + MOSELLE**.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 13, 'For 6–7 nights, adds **ÉISLEK / GUTTLAND / MINETT** according to traveler interests.'),
  ('luxembourg', 2336, 14, 'Uses Luxembourg primarily as a **CULTURE, CASTLE, NATURE, HIKING, WINE, GASTRONOMY, FAMILY, PHOTOGRAPHY, ROMANTIC, AND SLOW-TRAVEL DESTINATION**.'),
