  ('linchestine', 2570, 0, 'Treat Liechtenstein as only a quick Vaduz photo stop and miss Malbun, Triesenberg, Steg, Balzers, and the Liechtenstein Trail.'),
  ('linchestine', 2570, 1, 'Overload one day with every Vaduz museum, Vaduz Castle viewpoint, winery, Malbun, and multiple villages.'),
  ('linchestine', 2570, 2, 'Assume Vaduz Castle is normally open for interior visits.'),
  ('linchestine', 2570, 3, 'Ignore Malbun even though the mountains are only around 30 minutes from Vaduz by public bus.'),
  ('linchestine', 2570, 4, 'Rent a car automatically despite the country''s short distances and useful LIEmobil network.'),
  ('linchestine', 2570, 5, 'Plan high-Alpine hikes without considering weather, season, fitness, snow conditions, and route difficulty.'),
  ('linchestine', 2570, 6, 'Schedule too many hotel changes within a country of only about 160 km².'),
  ('linchestine', 2570, 7, 'Treat Liechtenstein like a major nightlife, shopping, or large-scale ski destination rather than a compact Alpine and cultural short-break destination.'),
  ('linchestine', 2571, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around VADUZ + MALBUN + ONE_ADDITIONAL_HERITAGE_OR_NATURE_AREA.'),
  ('linchestine', 2571, 1, 'Gives Vaduz enough time for Museum Mile, princely heritage, viewpoints, dining, and optional wine tasting.'),
  ('linchestine', 2571, 2, 'Uses MALBUN for Alpine scenery, hiking, family activities, skiing, and winter experiences.'),
  ('linchestine', 2571, 3, 'Adds TRIESENBERG / STEG for mountain atmosphere and BALZERS / GUTENBERG_CASTLE for heritage.'),
  ('linchestine', 2571, 4, 'Uses selected sections of the 75-km Liechtenstein Trail rather than forcing the complete route into a short trip.'),
  ('linchestine', 2571, 5, 'Uses LIEMOBIL + WALKING for normal touring and private transfers mainly when comfort, luggage, or luxury justifies them.'),
  ('linchestine', 2571, 6, 'Keeps time for mountain views, regional food, vineyards, photography, and relaxed travel.'),
  ('linchestine', 2571, 7, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
