  ('czech', 2580, 0, 'Take advantage of *denní menu* (fixed-price weekday lunch specials) at traditional Czech pubs and restaurants.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 1, 'Travel on České dráhy (national rail) or RegioJet buses and trains using advance digital tickets.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 2, 'Purchase integrated city transport passes (e.g., Prague Visitor Pass) for unlimited public transit and included entry to key sights.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 3, 'Explore secondary historic cities (Brno, Olomouc, Pilsen, České Budějovice) for lower accommodation and dining costs than Prague.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 4, 'Prioritize free outdoor attractions, including sandstone rock cities, castle gardens, national parks, and public spa colonnades.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 5, 'Enjoy local Czech beers (*pivo*) at neighbourhood pubs, which are often significantly cheaper than soft drinks or wine.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 6, 'Booking lodging far outside central Prague or historic town centers, leading to unnecessary transit friction during short stays.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 7, 'Skipping advance reservations for high-demand UNESCO attractions like Prague Castle interiors or the Klementinum Library.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 8, 'Unregulated airport taxis or street money exchange booths; rely instead on official apps/cards or certified banks.'),
  ('czech', 2580, 9, 'Cutting costs on proper footwear or tour arrangements for sandstone rock hiking (Bohemian Switzerland/Paradise).'),
  ('czech', 2584, 0, 'PRAGUE: Public Bus 119 to Nádraží Veleslavín (Metro Line A) or the Airport Express (AE) bus to Main Railway Station (Praha hlavní nádraží).'),
