  ('hungery', 2627, 0, 'Take advantage of *napi menü* (fixed-price daily lunch menus) offered by local Hungarian bistros and restaurants for affordable multi-course meals.'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 1, 'Grab quick budget snacks from local bakeries (*pékség*) selling fresh *pogácsa* (savory scones) and *lángos* stalls outside tourist centers.'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 2, 'Purchase a 24-hour, 72-hour, or 7-day BKK transit pass in Budapest for unlimited travel on trams, buses, and metro lines instead of individual tickets.'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 3, 'Travel between major cities via MÁV-Start trains or intercity buses instead of expensive private transfer taxis.'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 4, 'Travel during shoulder seasons (April–May, September–October) for pleasant sightseeing weather with lower accommodation rates.'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 5, 'Base yourself in charming secondary historic cities (Eger, Pécs, Szeged, Győr) for significantly lower lodging costs than central Budapest.'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 6, 'Skipping advance online skip-the-line ticket bookings for top-tier sites like the Hungarian Parliament, Széchenyi Thermal Bath, or Buda Castle funicular.'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 7, 'Booking hotels far outside central Budapest (Districts V, VI, VII, or VIII) simply to save a small amount, leading to long late-night transit commutes after ruin bar visits.'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 8, 'Choosing unaccredited street taxis over ride-hailing app services (Bolt) or official airport transfers (MiniBUD / Airport Express Bus 100E).'),
  ('hungery', 2627, 9, 'Skimping on ticket tiers at major thermal baths by opting out of private cabins for changing/storage, resulting in less secure locker arrangements.'),
  ('hungery', 2631, 0, 'BUDAPEST: Direct BKK Airport Express Bus 100E to central transport hubs (Kálvin tér, Deák Ferenc tér), or Bus 200E connecting to Metro Line M3 at Kőbánya-Kispest / Ferihegy train station.'),
  ('hungery', 2631, 1, 'DEBRECEN: Direct municipal airport express buses connecting the terminal directly to the central train station (Nagyállomás) and downtown.'),
  ('hungery', 2633, 0, '3+');
