  ('poland', 2688, 0, 'Major Polish museums (POLIN, Oskar Schindler''s Factory, Copernicus Science Centre) offer fully adapted step-free services.'),
  ('poland', 2688, 1, 'Modern shopping centers and central railway stations (Warszawa Centralna, Kraków Główny) feature elevators and braille paths.'),
  ('poland', 2688, 2, 'Flagship historic sites offer adapted routes, but medieval cobblestones (Kraków Main Square, Toruń) present vibration and mobility challenges.'),
  ('poland', 2688, 3, 'Wieliczka Salt Mine has a specialized, pre-bookable accessible route using mine lifts (bypassing the 800 entry stairs).'),
