  ('spain', 2727, 0, 'Take advantage of *menú del día* (fixed-price lunch menus) for affordable, multi-course authentic meals.'),
  ('spain', 2727, 1, 'Take advantage of designated free entry hours at top museums (e.g., Prado and Reina Sofía in Madrid).'),
  ('spain', 2727, 2, 'Book high-speed AVE train tickets and major attraction passes (Alhambra, Sagrada Família) well in advance.'),
  ('spain', 2727, 3, 'Use regional city transit cards or public buses and Metros instead of taxis for urban transfers.'),
  ('spain', 2727, 4, 'Travel during shoulder seasons (April–May, September–October) for ideal weather at reduced rates.'),
  ('spain', 2727, 5, 'Explore secondary cities (Seville, Granada, Valencia, Zaragoza) for lower lodging and dining costs than Barcelona or Madrid.'),
  ('spain', 2727, 6, 'Booking accommodations far outside city centers to save money, resulting in long commuting times and higher transit expenses.'),
