  ('spain', 2727, 8, 'Sacrificing central locations when visiting hilly or historic quarters with heavy luggage.'),
  ('spain', 2727, 9, 'Relying on cheap, unaccredited street tours or unverified watersports operators.'),
  ('spain', 2731, 0, 'MADRID: Cercanías train (C1 / C10) from Terminal T4 to Atocha / Chamartín, or Metro Line 8 / Express Airport Bus (Express Aeropuerto).'),
