  ('venice', 2869, 0, 'Walk extensively within the historic centre rather than using a vaporetto for every short journey.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 1, 'Purchase ACTV time-limited transport passes when multiple waterbus trips or lagoon-island visits are planned.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 2, 'Current standard ACTV visitor pricing includes €9.50 for a 75-minute ticket, €25 for 24 hours, €35 for 48 hours, €45 for 72 hours and €65 for 7 days.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 3, 'Consider Mestre for significantly broader accommodation choice when historic-centre rates are excessive.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 4, 'Stay in Cannaregio, Santa Croce or eastern Castello rather than paying maximum San Marco or Grand Canal premiums.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 5, 'Eat cicchetti, sandwiches, tramezzini, bakery products and simple dishes at neighborhood bacari instead of relying entirely on landmark-facing restaurants.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 6, 'Combine Murano, Burano and Torcello efficiently with a transport pass instead of buying multiple isolated water journeys.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 7, 'Use churches, campi, bridges, waterfront promenades and neighborhood walks as major free sightseeing components.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 8, 'Booking accommodation so far from convenient rail, bus or vaporetto connections that substantial daily time is lost.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 9, 'Purchasing repeated €9.50 single vaporetto tickets when a time-based pass would clearly cost less.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 10, 'Skipping the Grand Canal water journey entirely; public Line 1 or Line 2 can provide the experience without private-boat pricing.'),
  ('venice', 2869, 11, 'Selecting unofficial or poor-quality Murano glass purely because it is cheaper.'),
