  ('rome', 2959, 0, 'Treat Rome as only Colosseum + Vatican and miss Pantheon, Piazza Navona, Trastevere, Villa Borghese, Appian Way, Testaccio, and Rome''s major basilicas.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 1, 'Overload one day with Colosseum, Roman Forum, Vatican Museums, Trevi Fountain, Spanish Steps, and Trastevere.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 2, 'Combine Vatican City + Ancient Rome + Appian Way in one rushed sightseeing day simply because they appear relatively close on a map.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 3, 'Depend entirely on taxis instead of combining walking with Rome Metro, buses, trams, and short taxi transfers.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 4, 'Underestimate advance booking requirements for the Colosseum, Vatican Museums, Galleria Borghese, and other high-demand attractions.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 5, 'Treat Rome''s historic centre as completely flat and underestimate cobblestones, archaeological terrain, hills, stairs, and walking distances.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 6, 'Schedule Roman Forum, Palatine Hill, Appian Way, or long piazza walks during peak summer afternoon heat.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 7, 'Treat Roman cuisine as generic Italian food instead of including carbonara, cacio e pepe, amatriciana, supplì, Jewish-Roman cuisine, and Testaccio food culture.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 8, 'Book hotels far outside the historic centre purely for lower rates and lose significant sightseeing time through daily commuting.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 9, 'Assume every historic church, archaeological site, metro station, and cobbled lane provides universal step-free accessibility.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 10, 'Visit only monument interiors and leave no time for Rome''s piazzas, cafés, neighborhood streets, sunset viewpoints, and evening atmosphere.'),
  ('rome', 2959, 11, 'Add Tivoli, Ostia Antica, Florence, or Naples to a short Rome stay without protecting enough time for Rome itself.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around COLOSSEUM_FORUM_PALATINE + VATICAN_CITY + PANTHEON_NAVONA_TREVI + TRASTEVERE.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 1, 'Separates ANCIENT_ROME and VATICAN_CITY into dedicated half/full-day sightseeing blocks.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 2, 'Uses PANTHEON_NAVONA_TREVI_SPANISH_STEPS as a logical walking circuit rather than arranging repeated vehicle transfers.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 3, 'Adds VILLA_BORGHESE_AND_PINCIAN_TERRACE when relaxation, gardens, art, or family downtime is required.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 4, 'Uses TRASTEVERE + TESTACCIO for traditional Roman food and evening atmosphere.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 5, 'Uses MONTI for boutique streets, aperitivo, cafés, and easy access to Imperial Rome.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 6, 'Adds APPIAN_WAY_AND_CATACOMBS for archaeology, cycling, and quieter outdoor experiences.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 7, 'Uses OSTIA_ANTICA as a dedicated archaeological excursion for longer stays rather than squeezing it into a central Rome sightseeing day.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 8, 'Uses METRO_AND_WALKING for normal movement and TAXI_OR_PRIVATE_CAR selectively for luggage, seniors, late evenings, and complex transfers.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 9, 'Matches archaeological sightseeing and panoramic viewpoints to daylight, heat, rain, and seasonal crowd conditions.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 10, 'Keeps adequate unstructured time for espresso bars, gelato, piazza walks, aperitivo, and neighborhood dining.'),
  ('rome', 2960, 11, 'Pre-books the most important timed-entry attractions through official ticket channels.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 0, 'WALKING for Pantheon, Piazza Navona, Trevi Fountain, Spanish Steps, Campo de'' Fiori, Monti, and Trastevere sightseeing'),
  ('rome', 2963, 1, 'ROME_METRO for longer connections between Termini, Colosseum, Vatican/Prati, San Giovanni, and outer districts'),
  ('rome', 2963, 2, 'ATAC_BUSES_AND_TRAMS for areas without direct metro coverage'),
  ('rome', 2963, 3, 'TAXIS / PRIVATE_AC_CARS selectively for airport transfers, seniors, luggage, late-night travel, and complex routes'),
  ('rome', 2963, 4, 'LEONARDO_EXPRESS for direct Fiumicino Airport–Roma Termini rail transfers'),
  ('rome', 2963, 5, 'REGIONAL_RAIL for Ostia Antica and selected regional excursions'),
  ('rome', 2963, 6, 'Colosseum + Roman Forum + Palatine Hill archaeological exploration'),
  ('rome', 2963, 7, 'Vatican Museums + Sistine Chapel + St. Peter''s Basilica'),
  ('rome', 2963, 8, 'Pantheon + Piazza Navona historic-centre walk'),
  ('rome', 2963, 9, 'Trevi Fountain + Spanish Steps early-morning or evening visit'),
  ('rome', 2963, 10, 'Traditional Roman carbonara / cacio e pepe / supplì experience'),
  ('rome', 2963, 11, 'Trastevere evening walk and trattoria dining'),
  ('rome', 2963, 12, 'Villa Borghese + Pincian Terrace panoramic stroll'),
  ('rome', 2963, 13, 'Capitoline Hill + Jewish Ghetto exploration'),
  ('rome', 2963, 14, 'One Appian Way / Catacombs archaeological excursion'),
  ('rome', 2963, 15, 'One panoramic sunset at Gianicolo or Aventine Hill'),
  ('rome', 2963, 16, 'Do not treat Rome as only Colosseum + Vatican while ignoring its piazzas, neighborhoods, food culture, parks, and archaeological extensions.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 17, 'Do not force Colosseum + Roman Forum + Vatican Museums + Trevi Fountain + Spanish Steps into one rushed day.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 18, 'Do not underestimate timed-entry and advance-reservation requirements for major attractions.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 19, 'Do not buy Vatican Museum tickets from unofficial look-alike booking websites without verifying the official portal.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 20, 'Do not schedule long Roman Forum, Palatine Hill, or Appian Way walks during peak summer afternoon heat.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 21, 'Do not rely entirely on taxis inside Rome''s compact and often congested historic centre.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 22, 'Do not eat only around major monuments while ignoring Testaccio, Trastevere, Monti, and Jewish-Roman food traditions.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 23, 'Do not assume archaeological ruins, cobblestone streets, historic churches, or every metro station are fully step-free.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 24, 'Do not underestimate Rome''s walking intensity, especially across archaeological terrain and historic stone streets.'),
  ('rome', 2963, 25, 'Do not add Florence, Naples, Tivoli, and Ostia Antica to a short stay at the expense of Rome itself.'),
  ('rome', 2964, 0, 'Turismo Roma / Roma Capitale — Official destination information covering neighborhoods, attractions, parks, gastronomy, shopping, climate, accessibility, and travel planning.'),
  ('rome', 2964, 1, 'UNESCO World Heritage Centre — Official documentation for the Historic Centre of Rome, including Ancient Roman, Christian, Renaissance, and Baroque heritage.'),
  ('rome', 2964, 2, 'Parco archeologico del Colosseo — Official Colosseum, Roman Forum, Palatine Hill opening schedules, ticketing, and timed-entry requirements.'),
  ('rome', 2964, 3, 'Vatican Museums — Official museum opening times, ticketing portal, visitor services, accessibility information, and 2026 operating calendar.'),
  ('rome', 2964, 4, 'ATAC Roma — Official Metro, bus, tram, accessibility, service-status, journey-planning, and urban transport information.'),
  ('rome', 2964, 5, 'Official attraction authorities — Galleria Borghese, archaeological parks, museums, basilicas, and cultural institutions.'),
