  ('denmark', 3006, 0, 'Treat Denmark as only Copenhagen + Tivoli Gardens and miss Aarhus, Odense, Roskilde, Skagen, Bornholm, North Zealand, Ribe, Møns Klint, and the Wadden Sea National Park.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 1, 'Overload Copenhagen with Tivoli Gardens, Nyhavn, Amalienborg, Rosenborg Castle, Christiansborg, the Little Mermaid, and Strøget all in 1 to 1.5 days.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 2, 'Try to combine Copenhagen + Aarhus + Odense + Skagen + Bornholm + North Jutland + Wadden Sea in a short itinerary simply because bridge links and train routes look fast on a map.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 3, 'Rely unnecessarily on rental cars for high-speed city corridors (e.g., Copenhagen–Odense–Aarhus) where DSB InterCity Express trains are faster, crossing the Great Belt Bridge effortlessly while avoiding heavy toll fees, city center emission zones, and high urban parking rates.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 4, 'Underestimate strict advance-booking requirements and capacity limits for high-demand experiences like Alchemist/Geranium dining, LEGO House / LEGOLAND, Rosenborg Castle Crown Jewels slots, and popular Bornholm summer ferry sailings.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 5, 'Treat Denmark''s climate as uniform and ignore major seasonal weather differences between the windy North Sea west coast, temperate Baltic islands, and shorter winter daylight hours across Scandinavia.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 6, 'Plan Bornholm sunshine island or Danish Riviera beach stays in mid-winter expecting outdoor coastal relaxation, or expect guaranteed snow in low-altitude island regions.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 7, 'Ignore Danish gastronomy by eating only fast food instead of experiencing traditional open-faced smørrebrød at historic *Frokostbistros*, regional seafood specialties, hot dog stands (*pølsevogn*), craft beer brewpubs, and world-leading New Nordic fine dining.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 8, 'Schedule excessive daily hotel changes across islands even when Copenhagen, Odense, Aarhus, and Aalborg serve as ideal multi-night regional bases.'),
  ('denmark', 3006, 9, 'Assume every historic Renaissance castle tower, cobblestone medieval alleyway, coastal sand dune, chalk cliff stairway, and historic island ferry is automatically step-free or easily accessible without pre-arranged assistance.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around COPENHAGEN + ODENSE + ONE_CONTRASTING_REGION (Aarhus, North Zealand Castles, or Roskilde) when trip length permits.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 1, 'Gives Copenhagen enough time for Indre By Old Town, Nyhavn, Rosenborg Castle, Amalienborg, Christianshavn canals, Meatpacking District dining, Tivoli Gardens, and a harbor bath or boat cruise.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 2, 'Gives Aarhus enough time for ARoS Art Museum, Moesgaard Archaeology Museum, Den Gamle By (The Old Town), Latin Quarter courtyard cafes, and Marselisborg coastal forests rather than treating it as a quick stop.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 3, 'Adds NORTH_ZEALAND / DANISH_RIVIERA for Renaissance royal castles (Kronborg & Frederiksborg), seaside spa retreats, Louisiana Museum of Modern Art, and coastal dunes.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 4, 'Adds ODENSE / FUNEN for Hans Christian Andersen''s fairytale heritage, cobblestone old towns, Egeskov Castle mazes, and idyllic South Funen Archipelago island hopping.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 5, 'Adds SKAGEN / NORTH_JUTLAND for dramatic colliding seas at Grenen, migrating sand dunes (Råbjerg Mile), light-filled coastal art history, and fresh North Sea seafood.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 6, 'Uses BORNHOLM / MØNS_KLINT when Baltic granite cliffs, dark sky stargazing, turquoise waters, round churches, and smoked herring smokehouses (*røgerier*) are preferred.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 7, 'Uses DSB_INTERCITY_EXPRESS_RAIL for primary island/city corridors (Copenhagen–Odense–Aarhus–Aalborg) and rental cars or local buses for rural coastal dunes, Møns Klint, North Zealand Riviera, and remote fjord nature reserves.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 8, 'Keeps time for historic smørrebrød lunches, craft beer brewpubs (Mikkeller), sourdough bakery crawls, waterfront harbor saunas (*CopenHot*), and relaxed *hygge* cafe hours.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 9, 'Matches coastal windsurfing, island cycling, North Sea beach stays, and harbor swimming to actual seasonal conditions.'),
  ('denmark', 3007, 10, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 0, 'WALKING + METRO / S-TRAIN / BUS within major urban areas (Copenhagen, Aarhus, Odense)'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 1, 'DSB_INTERCITY_EXPRESS_RAIL between major high-speed rail corridors across bridges (Copenhagen–Odense–Aarhus–Aalborg)'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 2, 'REGIONAL_RAIL (DSB / Arriva / Lokaltog) for commuter links (e.g., Copenhagen Airport or North Zealand Riviera lines)'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 3, 'DOMESTIC_FLIGHT or ISLAND_FERRY for long cross-country or offshore island connections (e.g., Copenhagen to Bornholm / Aalborg)'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 4, 'RENTAL_CAR for rural coastal dunes, Møns Klint chalk cliffs, North Zealand manor trails, and remote nature reserves'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 5, 'BOAT / FERRY / CANAL_CRUISE for Baltic coast, Copenhagen canals, South Funen Archipelago, and Limfjord navigation'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 6, 'PRIVATE_TRANSFER selectively for luxury, luggage, mobility, airport transfers, or castle estate excursions'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 7, 'Copenhagen Indre By (Nyhavn, Strøget & Frederiks Staden)'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 8, 'Rosenborg Castle (Crown Jewels) & Amalienborg Palace'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 9, 'Christianshavn Canals & Tivoli Gardens evening experience'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 10, 'Roskilde Viking Ship Museum OR Kronborg Castle ("Hamlet''s Castle" in Elsinore)'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 11, 'Odense Hans Christian Andersen House & fairytale old town streets'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 12, 'ARoS Aarhus Art Museum ("Your rainbow panorama") OR Moesgaard Museum'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 13, 'Skagen Grenen colliding seas (or Møns Klint turquoise chalk cliffs)'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 14, 'One traditional smørrebrød lunch experience at a historic cellar *Frokostbistro*'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 15, 'One bakery crawl (*Wienerbrød* / sourdough) or craft beer brewpub experience (Mikkeller)'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 16, 'One harbor bath swim / electric canal boat cruise / CopenHot harbor sauna experience'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 17, 'Do not treat Denmark as only Copenhagen + Tivoli Gardens.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 18, 'Do not force Copenhagen + Odense + Aarhus + Skagen + Bornholm + Wadden Sea into a very short itinerary.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 19, 'Do not overload Rosenborg Castle, Amalienborg Guard Change, and day trips into a single rushed morning.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 20, 'Do not assume Denmark has uniform weather between the windy North Sea coast, Baltic islands, and urban basins.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 21, 'Do not rent a car automatically for city-to-city trips along high-speed DSB rail lines.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 22, 'Do not underestimate advance booking for high-demand experiences like Michelin New Nordic dining, LEGO House, or peak-season Bornholm ferries.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 23, 'Do not plan outdoor coastal beach stays without checking windy maritime weather conditions.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 24, 'Do not treat meals merely as quick fast-food stops and miss historic smørrebrød culture and New Nordic gastronomy.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 25, 'Do not assume every historic cobblestone alleyway, Renaissance castle tower, chalk cliff stairway, or sand dune is fully step-free.'),
  ('denmark', 3010, 26, 'Do not assume Baltic island beach resorts and inland cities operate on identical summer-versus-winter seasonality.'),
  ('denmark', 3011, 0, 'VisitDenmark — Official national tourism portal covering Copenhagen, Odense, Aarhus, North Zealand, Skagen, Bornholm, national parks, royal castles, and national travel routes.'),
  ('denmark', 3011, 1, 'DSB (Danske Statsbaner) — Current national passenger railway information, InterCity / InterCityLyn schedules, Great Belt Bridge routes, and fare structures (including DSB Orange) for rail travel across Denmark.'),
  ('denmark', 3011, 2, 'Danish Meteorological Institute (DMI) — Official weather and climate data covering seasonal variations between the North Sea coast, Baltic islands, Jutland peninsula, and urban regions.'),
  ('denmark', 3011, 3, 'Official regional tourism boards — Wonderful Copenhagen (visitcopenhagen.com), VisitAarhus, VisitOdense, VisitBornholm, VisitNorthZealand, and VisitJutland.'),
