  ('norway', 3016, 0, 'Book a self-catering mountain cabin (*hytte*) or coastal cabin (*rorbu*) with a fully equipped kitchen to cook meals using supermarket groceries, dramatically cutting daily food costs compared to eating out.'),
  ('norway', 3016, 1, 'Travel in late winter (March–April) or autumn (September–October) for excellent Northern Lights viewing, snow sports, or autumn foliage (*høstfarger*) at significantly lower accommodation and flight rates than peak December.'),
  ('norway', 3016, 2, 'Chase the Northern Lights independently by staying outside light-polluted town centers (like central Tromsø) and tracking Aurora apps, avoiding expensive daily guided minibus tours.'),
  ('norway', 3016, 3, 'Reserve Vy train tickets (e.g., Oslo–Bergen or Stockholm–Narvik) or Hurtigruten/Havila port-to-port coastal ferry tickets months in advance to secure low-fare tickets (*Minipris*).'),
  ('norway', 3016, 4, 'Limit luxury ice hotel or glass-dome cabin stays to a single bucket-list night, spending remaining nights in traditional timber cabins or standard city hotels.'),
  ('norway', 3016, 5, 'Rent cross-country skis or snowshoes for low-cost, self-guided exploration of marked mountain and fjord trail networks instead of motorized tours every day.'),
  ('norway', 3016, 6, 'Booking accommodations far away from major hubs (e.g., outside Tromsø or Alta) without renting a 4WD vehicle, leading to exorbitant taxi fares and restrictive bus schedules in freezing conditions.'),
  ('norway', 3016, 7, 'Skipping proper thermal outer gear (insulated sub-zero suits, waterproof Arctic boots, high-grade winter gloves), which can ruin outdoor trips or cost far more to buy last-minute.'),
  ('norway', 3016, 8, 'Opting for unaccredited, cheap safari operators with poor safety standards, inadequate thermal suits, or questionable animal welfare practices on husky and reindeer farms.'),
  ('norway', 3016, 9, 'Cutting out core bucket-list activities (like a real dog-sledding trek, whale watching cruise, or king crab safari) purely for budget reasons when visiting on a once-in-a-lifetime Arctic journey.'),
  ('norway', 3020, 0, 'TROMSØ: Flybussen Airport Express or local Svipper city buses (Routes 40 & 42) running directly from TOS Airport to city center hotels, Prostneset port, and main attractions.'),
  ('norway', 3020, 1, 'ALTA: Local Snelandia regional airport buses (Route 1 or 2) connecting ALF Airport to Alta city center and Sorrisniva junction in 10–15 minutes.'),
  ('norway', 3020, 2, 'KIRKENES: Snelandia regional buses and local airport express shuttles connecting KKN Airport directly to Kirkenes town center and Snowhotel Kirkenes.'),
  ('norway', 3022, 0, '3+'),
  ('norway', 3022, 1, '6+'),
