  ('norway', 3053, 0, 'Treat Northern Norway as only Tromsø + Fjellheisen Cable Car and miss the Lyngen Alps, Senja Scenic Route, Alta UNESCO Rock Art, Finnmark Plateau Sámi culture, Kirkenes, and the Varanger Peninsula.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 1, 'Overload Tromsø with Fjellheisen, Arctic Cathedral, Polaria, husky safaris, reindeer sleigh rides, fjord cruises, and late-night Northern Lights hunting all in a single 24-hour stay.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 2, 'Try to combine Tromsø + Lyngen Alps + Senja + Alta + Kirkenes in a very short itinerary simply because driving distances appear direct on a map.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 3, 'Rely entirely on rental cars across Arctic mountain passes in midwinter without local ice-driving experience, or ignore Svipper/Snelandia express buses and Hurtigruten/Havila coastal vessels for main hub connections.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 4, 'Underestimate advance-booking requirements and restricted capacity for glass-dome resorts, Sorrisniva Ice Hotel rooms, coastal express cabins, and prime winter husky safaris during peak December–February season.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 5, 'Treat Northern Norway''s Arctic climate as uniform and ignore seasonal differences between polar night (*mørketid*), early autumn aurora season, late spring crust-snow skiing, and the summer Midnight Sun.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 6, 'Plan Finnmark plateau trips, coastal fjord boat safaris, or Kirkenes King Crab tours without considering sea conditions, extreme arctic cold, limited daylight hours, and winter ferry/bus schedules.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 7, 'Ignore Arctic coastal gastronomy by treating meals only as quick hotel breaks instead of including traditional Sámi *lavvo* dinners, fresh Skrei cod, King Crab feasts, reindeer stew (*bidus*), and local cloudberry desserts.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 8, 'Schedule excessive hotel changes even when Tromsø, Alta, or Kirkenes can be structured into stable regional wilderness bases.'),
  ('norway', 3053, 9, 'Assume every glass dome, snowhotel, reindeer farm, wilderness trail, and aurora viewing boat is automatically step-free or accessible in heavy snow without specialized transfers.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around TROMSØ + ALTA / LYNGEN_ALPS + ONE_WILDERNESS_OR_CULTURAL_REGION when trip length permits.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 1, 'Gives Tromsø enough time for Fjellheisen Cable Car, Arctic Cathedral, Polaria, Polar Museum, husky and reindeer safaris, harbor sauna culture, and leisure without rushing.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 2, 'Gives Finnmark and Alta enough time for ALTA_MUSEUM_ROCK_ART + SORRISNIVA_SNOWHOTEL + KARASJOK_SÁMI_PARLIAMENT + KAUTOKEINO_DUODJI_CRAFTS rather than treating it as a rushed single-day loop.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 3, 'Adds KARASJOK / KAUTOKEINO / INARI-BORDER for authentic Sámi culture, Indigenous heritage, *Duodji* handicrafts, and Finnmark plateau wilderness.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 4, 'Uses KIRKENES_KING_CRAB / SNOWHOTEL selectively when Arctic ocean crab diving, snowhotel stays, and Russian border heritage are the focus.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 5, 'Uses HAMMERFEST / HONNINGSVÅG / NORTH_CAPE when coastal navigation history, Arctic plateau cliffs, and coastal fishing hubs are preferred.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 6, 'Uses HURTIGRUTEN_OR_HAVILA_COASTAL_SHIPS for long coastal corridor travel (Tromsø–Honningsvåg–Kirkenes) and rental cars or private 4x4 transfers for remote fjord chalets, national scenic routes, and glass domes.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 7, 'Keeps time for traditional *lavvo* fireside meals, floating fjord saunas, outdoor hot tubs, craft beer pubs (Ølhallen), and relaxed Aurora spotting.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 8, 'Matches outdoor snowmobiling, ice fishing, snowshoeing, and husky drives to actual seasonal temperature and daylight conditions.'),
  ('norway', 3054, 9, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('norway', 3057, 0, 'WALKING + LOCAL CITY BUSES (Svipper) within main hubs (Tromsø)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 1, 'HURTIGRUTEN / HAVILA COASTAL SHIPS between main coastal corridors (Tromsø–Honningsvåg–Kirkenes)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 2, 'REGIONAL_EXPRESS_BUS / SNELANDIA / SVIPPER for inter-resort and northern village connections'),
  ('norway', 3057, 3, 'DOMESTIC_FLIGHTS selectively for direct access to Tromsø (TOS), Alta (ALF), or Kirkenes (KKN)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 4, 'RENTAL_CAR / 4X4 selectively for remote fjord national scenic routes, private glass domes, and far northern wilderness'),
  ('norway', 3057, 5, 'SNOWMOBILE / REINDEER_SLEIGH / HUSKY_SLED for off-road wilderness safari transfers'),
  ('norway', 3057, 6, 'PRIVATE_TRANSFER selectively for luxury, airport transfers, gear transport, or remote Aurora hunting'),
  ('norway', 3057, 7, 'Fjellheisen Cable Car & Storsteinen Viewpoint (Tromsø)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 8, 'The Polar Museum & Arctic Cathedral (Tromsø)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 9, 'Overnight stay in a Glass Dome or Sorrisniva Snow Hotel Suite under the stars'),
  ('norway', 3057, 10, 'Guided Northern Lights hunt (by minibus, catamaran, or snowmobile)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 11, 'Husky dog sledding safari through coastal snowbound valleys'),
  ('norway', 3057, 12, 'Traditional reindeer sleigh ride & Sámi cultural experience'),
  ('norway', 3057, 13, 'World Heritage Rock Art Centre / Alta Museum (Alta)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 14, 'Authentic floating harbor sauna & Arctic fjord plunge (Pust Sauna)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 15, 'One traditional open-fire *lavvo* dinner with King Crab & reindeer stew (*bidus*)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 16, 'One fjord wildlife boat tour (Whale watching or Sea Eagle safari)'),
  ('norway', 3057, 17, 'Do not treat Northern Norway as only Tromsø + Fjellheisen Cable Car.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 18, 'Do not force Tromsø + Lyngen Alps + Senja + Alta + Kirkenes into a very short itinerary.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 19, 'Do not overload long winter snowmobile safaris, husky drives, and late-night Aurora hunts all into a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 20, 'Do not assume Northern Norway has uniform weather between the coastal fjords, alpine ranges, and Finnmark tundra.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 21, 'Do not rent a car without winter ice-driving experience when coastal express ships and Snelandia/Svipper buses service main routes efficiently.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 22, 'Do not underestimate advance booking for high-demand experiences like glass domes, coastal ship cabins, and peak-season husky safaris.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 23, 'Do not plan winter outdoor activities without verifying proper thermal clothing rentals and temperature safety limits.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 24, 'Do not treat meals merely as quick breaks and miss regional Arctic coastal gastronomy.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 25, 'Do not assume every ice hotel, reindeer farm, wilderness trail, or glass dome is fully step-free.'),
  ('norway', 3057, 26, 'Do not assume winter fjord tours and summer Midnight Sun activities operate on identical seasonality.'),
  ('norway', 3058, 0, 'Northern Norway (Visitnorway.com) / Visit Norway — Official national and regional destination information covering Tromsø, Alta, Senja, Kirkenes, Lyngen Alps, Sámi culture, glass domes, and winter safaris.'),
  ('norway', 3058, 1, 'Visit Tromsø / Visit Alta Tourist Information Networks — Official regional tourist information networks covering destination travel guides, weather, winter activities, Fjellheisen, and practical visitor rules.'),
  ('norway', 3058, 2, 'Hurtigruten / Havila Kystruten — Current coastal express shipping information, service schedules, coastal passenger transport corridors, and voyage structures across Northern Norway.'),
  ('norway', 3058, 3, 'Norwegian Meteorological Institute (YR.no) & Regional Tourism — Climate and weather data covering seasonal variations, snow depth, polar night (*mørketid*), and Aurora probability across Arctic Norway.'),
  ('norway', 3058, 4, 'Official regional tourism boards — Visit Tromsø, Visit Alta, Visit Lyngenfjord, Visit Senja, Visit Kirkenes, Visit Varanger, and Visit Svalbard.'),
