  ('sweden', 3100, 0, 'Treat Swedish Lapland as only Kiruna + Icehotel and miss Abisko National Park, Jokkmokk Sámi heritage, Luleå frozen sea ice, Harads design lodges, and Sarek wilderness.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 1, 'Overload Kiruna with the Icehotel, Kiruna Mine tour, Sámi reindeer camps, husky mushing, and late-night Northern Lights chases all within a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 2, 'Try to combine Kiruna + Abisko + Harads + Luleå + Jokkmokk + Narvik (Norway) in a short itinerary simply because driving routes look direct on a map.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 3, 'Rely entirely on rental cars in deep midwinter without local ice-driving experience, or ignore Vy Night Trains and regional Länstrafiken bus connections.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 4, 'Underestimate advance-booking requirements and restricted capacity for Icehotel Art Suites, Treehotel cabins, Arctic Bath, night train sleeper cabins, and prime winter husky safaris during peak December–February season.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 5, 'Treat Swedish Lapland''s Arctic climate as uniform and ignore seasonal differences between polar night (*kaamos*), autumn aurora season (*höstglöd*), late spring crust-snow skiing (*vårvinter*), and the Midnight Sun.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 6, 'Plan Luleå archipelago sea-ice walks or Bothnian icebreaker trips without considering seasonal sea-ice thickness, extreme cold temperatures, limited daylight hours, and winter transfer schedules.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 7, 'Ignore Northern Swedish gastronomy by treating meals only as quick hotel breaks instead of including open-fire *Lávvu* meals, smoked reindeer (*Souvas*), Kalix Löjrom, and local cloudberry specialties.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 8, 'Schedule excessive hotel changes even when Kiruna, Abisko, Luleå, or Harads can be structured into stable regional wilderness bases.'),
  ('sweden', 3100, 9, 'Assume every ice suite, timber cabin, reindeer farm, mountain trail, and aurora viewing spot is automatically step-free or accessible in heavy snow without specialized transfers.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around KIRUNA / JUKKASJÄRVI + ABISKO + ONE_DESIGN_OR_COASTAL_REGION when trip length permits.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 1, 'Gives Kiruna & Jukkasjärvi enough time for the Icehotel, LKAB Mine tour, Sámi reindeer camps, husky farms, and leisure without rushing.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 2, 'Gives Abisko and the mountain pass enough time for ABISKO_NATIONAL_PARK + MOUNT_NUOLJA + AURORA_SKY_STATION + RIKSGRÄNSEN_SKIING rather than treating it as a rushed day excursion.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 3, 'Adds JOKKMOKK for authentic Sámi culture, Indigenous heritage, *Duodji* handicrafts, and the Ájtte National Sámi Museum.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 4, 'Uses HARADS_DESIGN_LODGES / LULEÅ_ICE_ROADS selectively when treehouse architecture, floating river spas, and frozen sea ice packs are the focus.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 5, 'Uses KUNGSLEDEN_GATEWAYS / SAREK / KEBNEKAISE when Arctic trekking, mountaineering, and deep backcountry wilderness are preferred.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 6, 'Uses VY_NIGHT_TRAINS for long corridor travel (Stockholm–Luleå–Kiruna–Abisko) and rental 4x4 vehicles or private transfers for remote forest lodges, national parks, and design stays.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 7, 'Keeps time for traditional wood-fired saunas, ice-hole dips, outdoor hot tubs, craft beer pubs, and relaxed Aurora spotting.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 8, 'Matches outdoor snowmobiling, ice fishing, snowshoeing, and husky drives to actual seasonal temperature and daylight conditions.'),
  ('sweden', 3101, 9, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 0, 'WALKING + LOCAL SHUTTLES within main hubs (Kiruna town, Jukkasjärvi, Abisko Turiststation)'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 1, 'VY_NIGHT_TRAINS between main corridors (Stockholm–Luleå–Gällivare–Kiruna–Abisko–Narvik)'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 2, 'MALMBANAN_RAIL / REGIONAL_BUSES (Länstrafiken Norrbotten) for mountain and village connections'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 3, 'DOMESTIC_FLIGHTS selectively for direct access to Kiruna (KRN) or Luleå (LLA) via Stockholm Arlanda (ARN)'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 4, 'RENTAL_CAR / 4X4 selectively for remote forest design lodges, Laponia gateways, and coastal sea-ice routes'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 5, 'SNOWMOBILE / REINDEER_SLEIGH / HUSKY_SLED for off-road wilderness safari transfers'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 6, 'PRIVATE_TRANSFER selectively for luxury stays, airport connections, gear transport, or remote Aurora hunting'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 7, 'Original Icehotel Art Suites tour & overnight stay (Jukkasjärvi)'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 8, 'Abisko Aurora Sky Station night tour & Mount Nuolja views'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 9, 'Architectural Treehotel cabin or Arctic Bath floating spa experience (Harads)'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 10, 'Guided Northern Lights hunt (by snowmobile, minibus, or snowshoes)'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 11, 'Husky sled driving safari through snowy pine forests'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 12, 'Traditional reindeer sleigh ride & Nutti Sámi Siida cultural visit'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 13, 'Ájtte Sámi National Museum & cultural exploration (Jokkmokk)'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 14, 'Authentic Swedish wood-fired sauna & river ice-dip / hot tub session'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 15, 'One traditional open-fire Lávvu dinner featuring Souvas (smoked reindeer) & Kalix Löjrom'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 16, 'Frozen sea ice road walk or kicksleigh ride (Luleå Archipelago)'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 17, 'Do not treat Swedish Lapland as only Kiruna + Icehotel.'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 18, 'Do not force Kiruna + Abisko + Harads + Luleå + Jokkmokk + Narvik into a very short itinerary.'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 19, 'Do not overload long winter snowmobile safaris, husky drives, and late-night Aurora hunts all into a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 20, 'Do not assume Swedish Lapland has uniform weather between the Bothnian coast, mountain passes, and inland forest basins.'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 21, 'Do not rent a car without winter ice-driving experience when Vy trains and Länstrafiken buses service main routes efficiently.'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 22, 'Do not underestimate advance booking for high-demand experiences like Icehotel Art Suites, Treehotel, night train sleeper cabins, and peak-season husky safaris.'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 23, 'Do not plan winter outdoor activities without verifying proper thermal clothing rentals and temperature safety limits.'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 24, 'Do not treat meals merely as quick breaks and miss regional Arctic gastronomy (Kalix Löjrom, Souvas, cloudberries).'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 25, 'Do not assume every ice suite, timber cabin, reindeer farm, or wilderness trail is fully step-free.'),
  ('sweden', 3104, 26, 'Do not assume winter fell resorts and summer Midnight Sun activities operate on identical seasonality.'),
  ('sweden', 3105, 0, 'Swedish Lapland Visitors Board (swedishlapland.com) / Visit Sweden — Official regional and national destination information covering Kiruna, Abisko, Jokkmokk, Luleå, Harads, nature, design stays, and winter safaris.'),
  ('sweden', 3105, 1, 'Regional Tourist Information Networks (Visit Kiruna, Visit Luleå) — Official tourist guides, weather advisories, winter activities, Icehotel updates, and practical visitor guidelines.'),
  ('sweden', 3105, 2, 'Vy Tåg / SJ (vy.se) — Current national railway information, service schedules, Arctic night trains (Stockholm–Kiruna–Abisko–Narvik), regional rail corridors, and fare structures.'),
  ('sweden', 3105, 3, 'Swedish Meteorological and Hydrological Institute (SMHI) & Regional Tourism — Climate and weather data covering seasonal variations, snow depth, polar night (*kaamos*), and Aurora probability across Arctic Sweden.'),
  ('sweden', 3105, 4, 'Official regional tourism boards — Kiruna, Gällivare, Jokkmokk, Luleå, Piteå, Arjeplog, and Boden/Harads.'),
