  ('finland', 3110, 0, 'Book a self-catering log cabin (*mökki*) with a built-in kitchen and sauna to cook meals using supermarket groceries, sharply dropping daily food costs compared to eating out.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 1, 'Travel in late winter (March–April) or early autumn (September–October) for excellent Northern Lights viewing, snow activities, or fall foliage (*ruska*) at significantly lower accommodation and flight rates than peak December.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 2, 'Chase the Northern Lights independently by staying outside light-polluted resort centers and monitoring Aurora forecast apps, avoiding costly daily guided minibus tours.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 3, 'Reserve the VR overnight "Santa Claus Express" train from Helsinki to Rovaniemi months in advance, saving both on day travel time and one night''s accommodation.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 4, 'Limit glass igloo stays to a single bucket-list night, spending the remaining nights in traditional timber cabins or standard resort hotels.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 5, 'Rent cross-country skis or snowshoes for low-cost, full-day self-guided exploration of national park trail networks instead of motorized tours every day.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 6, 'Booking accommodations far away from resort hubs without renting a 4WD vehicle, leading to exorbitant local taxi fares and strict bus timing constraints in freezing conditions.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 7, 'Skipping proper thermal outer gear (heavy-duty snowsuits, insulated boots, sub-zero gloves), which can ruin outdoor experiences or cost significantly more to buy last-minute.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 8, 'Opting for unaccredited, ultra-cheap safari operators with poor safety standards, inadequate winter gear, or poor animal welfare practices on husky and reindeer farms.'),
  ('finland', 3110, 9, 'Cutting out core bucket-list activities (like one genuine husky or snowmobile safari) purely for budget reasons when visiting for a once-in-a-lifetime Arctic trip.'),
  ('finland', 3114, 0, 'ROVANIEMI: AirportExpress bus shuttle or local Linkki Bus Route 8 running directly from RVN Airport to Rovaniemi Railway Station, city center hotels, and Santa Claus Village.'),
  ('finland', 3114, 1, 'KITTILÄ / LEVI: Scheduled TunturiLines airport buses waiting directly outside arrivals to connect KTT Airport to Levi and Ylläs resort centers in 20–25 minutes.'),
  ('finland', 3114, 2, 'IVALO / SAARISELKÄ: Eskelisen Lapin Linjat express airport buses connecting IVL Airport directly to Saariselkä resorts and Inari.'),
