  ('london', 3247, 0, '**Bespoke Tailoring & Savile Row Suits:** Hand-crafted, made-to-measure suits and formalwear from world-famous tailors along Savile Row and fine men’s haberdashery on Jermyn Street.'),
  ('london', 3247, 1, '**Luxury Tea Blends & Food Hampers:** English loose-leaf teas, preserves, traditional biscuits, and wicker gift hampers from heritage Royal Warrant holders like Fortnum & Mason.'),
