  ('london', 3247, 4, '**Vintage Clothing & Antiques:** Unique retro fashion, rare vinyl records, mid-century decor, and silver antiques sourced from famous street markets across Portobello Road and Camden.'),
  ('london', 3247, 5, '**Bond Street & Mayfair:** Preferred for high-end luxury fashion houses, fine jewellers, haute couture flagships, and historic covered arcades like Burlington Arcade.'),
  ('london', 3247, 6, '**Liberty London & Regent Street:** Best for iconic architectural charm, high-end international fashion, curated beauty halls, and classic British retail institutions.'),
