  ('london', 3248, 7, 'Immersing yourself in London''s historic pub heritage with a pint of ale at historic taverns like **Ye Olde Cheshire Cheese** or riverside spots like **The Anchor Bankside**.'),
  ('london', 3248, 8, 'Relying on regular Underground trains late at night without checking the **Night Tube schedule** (running Friday and Saturday nights on select lines); pre-book licensed minicabs or use Uber/Black Cabs instead.'),
  ('london', 3248, 9, 'Expecting late-night door entry without photo ID; most major London clubs enforce strict scanning policies regardless of age.'),
