  ('liverpool', 3276, 4, 'Take advantage of Merseyrail''s affordable Family Tickets and the iconic Mersey Ferry cross-river services to move your group easily between central waterfront sites, Wirral attractions, and city districts without expensive parking fees.'),
  ('liverpool', 3276, 5, 'Always pack waterproof jackets and light windproof layers regardless of the weather forecast; coastal winds off the River Mersey can turn chilly quickly and bring sudden downpours during outdoor dock walks.'),
  ('liverpool', 3276, 6, 'Reserve ample time for Liverpool''s outstanding free national museums—such as the World Museum, Maritime Museum, and Museum of Liverpool—which feature dedicated hands-on discovery rooms, interactive exhibits, and full step-free accessibility.'),
  ('liverpool', 3276, 7, 'Pre-book popular ticketed venues—including the Anfield Stadium Tour, The Beatles Story, and interactive play spaces like *Imagine That!*—well in advance to secure preferred entry times and skip long queues.'),
  ('liverpool', 3276, 8, 'Pay close attention to matchday fixtures for Liverpool F.C. and Everton F.C., as local transit and waterfront roads become heavily congested around kickoff, and strict bag size limits are enforced near stadiums.'),
  ('liverpool', 3276, 9, 'Head to major parks like Sefton Park or Calderstones Park for outdoor downtime; these green spaces provide large adventure playgrounds, historic palm houses, and open lawns for kids to unwind away from central concrete areas.'),
