  ('liverpool', 3282, 0, 'Sample authentic **Scouse**, Liverpool''s iconic regional meat stew made with tender beef or lamb, potatoes, carrots, and onions, served piping hot with pickled red cabbage or beetroot and crusty bread.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 1, 'Enjoy a slice of **Wet Nelly**, a traditional Liverpudlian sweet suet pudding made with soaked bread scraps, dried fruits, brown sugar, and warm spices, best enjoyed doused in warm custard.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 2, 'Try **Everton Mints**, the city''s historic black-and-white striped peppermint hard candies created in the 19th century near the famous football club.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 3, 'Feast at the **Baltic Market** in the Cains Brewery Village, sampling artisanal street food, gourmet bao, wood-fired pizzas, halloumi fries, and local craft beers in a lively industrial warehouse.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 4, 'Savor innovative **Global Small Plates** along Bold Street, where local culinary pioneers serve everything from Indian street food tiffins to Venetian cicchetti and Middle Eastern small plates.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 5, '**Families:** Casual food market halls like Baltic Market and Duke Street Market, child-friendly waterfront fish-and-chip spots, and accessible family-friendly dining at Liverpool ONE.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 6, '**Honeymooners:** Intimate candlelit dining in converted Georgian bistros, modern Middle Eastern feast tables along the Royal Albert Dock, and high-altitude fine-dining pairings at Panoramic 34.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 7, '**Luxury travelers:** Refined British tasting menus at The Art School Restaurant, exclusive chef''s tables, and private chauffeur trips to regional Michelin-starred retreats like Moor Hall.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 8, '**Budget travelers:** Vibrant street-food counters along pedestrianized Bold Street, traditional pub Scouse specials around the Cavern Quarter, and affordable waterfront takeaway stalls.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 9, '**Foodies:** Artisan bakery crawls through the Baltic Triangle, craft ale pairings in historic Grade II-listed pubs, and tapas-hopping along Castle Street.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 10, '**Bold Street:** Best for eclectic global eateries, indie coffee roasters, authentic Indian street food, craft bakeries, and bohemian international dining.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 11, '**Castle Street & Commercial District:** Best for Venetian tapas bars, upscale steakhouses, elegant cocktail lounges, and polished European bistros.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 12, '**Royal Albert Dock:** Best for scenic waterside dining, high-end Middle Eastern sharing plates, authentic Mexican street food, and historic maritime charm.'),
  ('liverpool', 3282, 13, '**Baltic Triangle:** Best for vibrant street-food halls, craft microbreweries, urban bakehouses, and creative late-night food markets.'),
  ('liverpool', 3283, 0, '**Vintage & Retro Fashion:** Curated retro denim, 90s sportswear, mid-century leather jackets, and deadstock gear from Bold Street’s famed vintage strip.'),
  ('liverpool', 3283, 1, '**Indie Vinyl Records & Local Art:** Rare vinyl pressings, indie releases, local prints, and unique literature from iconic spots like Dig Vinyl and News From Nowhere.'),
