  ('amman', 3509, 0, 'Purchase the **Jordan Pass** prior to arrival to waive the 40 JOD visa fee and get free admission to major sights like the Amman Citadel, Roman Theater, and Petra.'),
  ('amman', 3509, 1, 'Eat local street food in **Al-Balad (Downtown)**—stables like Hashem Restaurant and Habibah Sweets offer world-class traditional meals for just 2–5 JOD.'),
  ('amman', 3509, 2, 'Utilize **Careem or Uber** instead of flagging unmetered street taxis or booking expensive hotel cabs for city transit.'),
  ('amman', 3509, 3, 'Stay in central historic areas like **Jabal Weibdeh or Downtown** to easily reach multiple major attractions on foot.'),
  ('amman', 3509, 4, 'Combine day trips efficiently by booking a single regional private driver or shared tour to cover **Jerash, Ajloun, Madaba, and Mount Nebo** in logical circuits.'),
  ('amman', 3509, 5, 'Skipping private transfers or reliable day tours when visiting out-of-city sites with limited public transport (e.g., Dead Sea, Desert Castles).'),
  ('amman', 3509, 6, 'Budgeting down on summer accommodation with poor air conditioning, as Amman''s summer heat can be extreme.'),
  ('amman', 3509, 7, 'Attempting to walk between distant jebels (hills) without checking elevation gains and steep stairways.'),
