  ('amman', 3544, 0, '**Underestimate Jordan Pass coverage:** Buy individual entrance tickets at sights or ignore the Jordan Pass, missing out on waived tourist visa fees and bundled entry to Amman Citadel, the Roman Theater, and Jerash.'),
  ('amman', 3544, 1, '**Misjudge Amman''s topography and traffic:** Plan back-to-back walking routes across different *jabals* (hills), forcing clients into exhausting uphill climbs or severe rush-hour traffic gridlocks between Downtown and Western Amman.'),
  ('amman', 3544, 2, '**Overlook airport taxi logistics:** Let clients rely on random taxis or unmetered street cabs at Queen Alia International Airport rather than booking official fixed-fare airport taxis or private hotel transfers.'),
  ('amman', 3544, 3, '**Assume Friday operates like standard weekdays:** Schedule morning museum tours or heavy shopping itineraries on Fridays, unaware that most shops, markets, and public transport close or operate on reduced hours around Friday prayers.'),
  ('amman', 3544, 4, '**Treat Amman as a mere layover:** Allocate less than 24 hours to Amman as just a sleeping base for Petra, missing its culinary scene, Roman heritage, and world-class museums like The Jordan Museum.'),
  ('amman', 3545, 0, '**Pre-arrange Jordan Pass integration:** Ensure clients purchase the Jordan Pass prior to arrival to cover both entry visas and major northern heritage sites in a single digital pass.'),
  ('amman', 3545, 1, '**Group itineraries by hill and district:** Cluster attractions logically—combining Amman Citadel, the Roman Theater, and Downtown markets into one flat/downhill loop before utilizing Uber or private drivers to cross between hills like Jabal Amman and Jabal Weibdeh.'),
  ('amman', 3545, 2, '**Brief clients on cash, dress codes, and customs:** Advise travelers to carry small Jordan Dinar notes for local markets and tips, while briefing them on modest attire for religious and historic sites.'),
  ('amman', 3545, 3, '**Leverage ride-hailing apps for city transit:** Recommend Uber or Careem over flagging yellow street cabs for hassle-free, pre-priced navigation across Amman''s complex hill roads.'),
  ('amman', 3545, 4, '**Timing the Dead Sea and Baptism Site:** Position day trips to the Baptism Site and Dead Sea for late morning or early afternoon to guarantee iconic sunset floating experiences without rushing back through mountain passes in the dark.'),
  ('amman', 3546, 0, '**For Geographical & Transit Pacing:** Group sights strictly by hill clusters (e.g., Downtown/Citadel together; Rainbow Street/Jabal Amman together) and use app-based rides or private drivers to bridge the gaps between Amman''s steep valleys.'),
  ('amman', 3546, 1, '**For Logistics & Safety Preparation:** Purchase the Jordan Pass online prior to arrival to streamline airport immigration, and ensure all day trips north (Jerash/Ajloun) or south (Madaba/Dead Sea) depart by early morning to maximize daylight.'),
  ('amman', 3546, 2, '**For Itinerary Balance:** Balance morning archaeological walking tours across Roman and Umayyad ruins with relaxed afternoon culinary sessions on Rainbow Street or cafe-hopping in leafy Jabal Weibdeh.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 0, 'Explore the hilltop ruins of the **Amman Citadel (Jabal al-Qala''a)** to view the colossal Temple of Hercules, Umayyad Palace, and 360-degree views across the city''s hills.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 1, 'Descend to the 2nd-century **Roman Theater** and test the ancient acoustic echoes in the heart of Downtown Al-Balad.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 2, 'Taste iconic street-food specialties, including hot falafel at **Hashem Restaurant** and fresh **knafeh** at **Habibah Sweets** in the central markets.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 3, 'Stroll past art galleries, boutique craft shops, and historic stone villas along **Rainbow Street** and leafy **Jabal Weibdeh**.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 4, 'Take a day trip north to the grand Greco-Roman colonnaded streets of **Jerash** and the medieval hilltop fortress of **Ajloun Castle**.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 5, 'Attempting to walk long distances across different hill districts on foot, as Amman''s steep topography and sparse sidewalk infrastructure make cross-valley walking exhausting.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 6, 'Relying on unmetered street taxis or unarranged airport cabs without confirming fixed rates or using ride-hailing apps to ensure fair pricing.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 7, 'Ignoring local modesty guidelines when visiting historic or religious sites; keep shoulders and knees covered, especially in traditional market areas and mosques.'),
  ('amman', 3549, 8, 'Forgetting to purchase the **Jordan Pass** online prior to arrival, which waives entry visa fees and covers entry to the Citadel, Roman Theater, and Jerash.'),
  ('amman', 3550, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
  ('petra', 3555, 0, 'Purchase the **Jordan Pass (Petra 1, 2, or 3-day option)** prior to entering Jordan—it covers the 50 JOD single-day Petra entry fee and waives the 40 JOD visa fee upon arrival.'),
  ('petra', 3555, 1, 'Choose a multi-day pass option if staying more than one day—a 2-day Petra ticket costs only 55 JOD, providing far better value than two single-day entries.'),
  ('petra', 3555, 2, 'Stay in **upper Wadi Musa town** for budget-friendly guesthouses and local eateries, or near the **Petra Visitor Center** to eliminate local taxi costs to the gate.'),
  ('petra', 3555, 3, 'Carry your own refillable water bottle and snacks into the archaeological park to avoid inflated prices at interior canyon kiosks.'),
  ('petra', 3555, 4, 'Walk the entire main trail and the Ad Deir steps on foot rather than paying extra for camel, horse, or donkey rides inside the site.'),
  ('petra', 3555, 5, 'Skipping the official local site guide at the entrance if visiting for the first time without prior historical context.'),
  ('petra', 3555, 6, 'Staying far outside Wadi Musa without guaranteed transportation, as steep hill ascents after a full day of hiking make walking back painful.'),
  ('petra', 3555, 7, 'Cutting corners on high-quality sturdy hiking footwear or sun protection equipment before entering the desert trails.'),
