  ('petra', 3590, 0, '**Underestimate Petra''s vast scale and physical demand:** Schedule only a few hours or a single half-day visit, treating Petra as a quick photo-stop rather than an expansive 264-square-kilometer archaeological park requiring extensive hiking.'),
  ('petra', 3590, 1, '**Misjudge time and physical effort for Ad Deir (The Monastery):** Attempt the steep 800-step mountain climb to the Monastery during peak afternoon sun without sufficient water, sturdy hiking footwear, or adequate rest breaks.'),
  ('petra', 3590, 2, '**Fail to utilize the Jordan Pass multi-day entry:** Purchase single-day tickets at the gate rather than buying the Jordan Pass online in advance, missing out on waived Jordan visa fees and discounted 2-day or 3-day Petra park access.'),
  ('petra', 3590, 3, '**Rely on unregulated inside transport:** Pay excessive fees for horse, donkey, or camel rides along steep, slippery rock trails without confirming prices beforehand or verifying animal welfare standards.'),
  ('petra', 3590, 4, '**Stay too far from the main site entrance:** Book accommodation high up in upper Wadi Musa town without arranging transportation, forcing clients into exhausting uphill walks after full days of site trekking.'),
  ('petra', 3591, 0, '**Strategize early dawn site entries:** Brief clients to enter through the Visitor Center gate at 6:00 AM opening to walk through the shaded Siq and reach Al-Khazneh (The Treasury) before tour bus crowds and mid-day heat arrive.'),
  ('petra', 3591, 1, '**Incorporate the Little Petra Back Door Trail:** Route active clients along the scenic backcountry trek from Little Petra (Siq al-Barid) to Ad Deir (The Monastery), allowing them to descend into the main valley rather than climbing 800 steps upward.'),
  ('petra', 3591, 2, '**Pace itineraries across multiple days:** Allocate 2 full days to Petra—dedicating Day 1 to the Main Trail, Royal Tombs, and Ad Deir, and Day 2 to high-level viewpoints like the High Place of Sacrifice or Al-Khubtha Trail.'),
  ('petra', 3591, 3, '**Equip clients for desert terrain and climate:** Advise travelers on essential gear—cushioned trail shoes, sun protection, refillable water bladders, layers for chilly desert mornings, and cash in small Jordanian Dinar notes for local Bedouin tea stalls.'),
  ('petra', 3591, 4, '**Optimize Petra by Night integration:** Schedule the candlelit Petra by Night experience only after clients have had a rest afternoon, ensuring they are not already exhausted from 15+ kilometers of daytime hiking.'),
  ('petra', 3592, 0, '**For Geographical & Transit Pacing:** Enter the site at 6:00 AM opening to experience the Siq and Treasury in relative solitude, grouping central valley monuments (Colonnaded Street, Great Temple, Royal Tombs) before attempting major climbs.'),
  ('petra', 3592, 1, '**For Logistics & Safety Preparation:** Secure the Jordan Pass prior to arrival in Jordan, stay at a hotel within short walking distance of the Visitor Center, and ensure sturdy footwear and ample hydration are carried into the park.'),
  ('petra', 3592, 2, '**For Itinerary Balance:** Balance a high-intensity morning hike to Ad Deir or the High Place of Sacrifice with a relaxed afternoon visiting the climate-controlled Petra Museum or enjoying a traditional Bedouin zarb dinner in Wadi Musa.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 0, 'Walk through the towering, shaded canyon walls of **The Siq** at 6:00 AM opening to witness your first iconic view of **Al-Khazneh (The Treasury)** in peaceful morning light.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 1, 'Ascend the ancient 800-step rock staircase carved into the mountain to reach the breathtaking monumental facade of **Ad Deir (The Monastery)**.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 2, 'Hike the **Al-Khubtha Trail** to stand on the high cliff edge directly above the Treasury for the ultimate aerial view.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 3, 'Explore the grand scale of the central valley, including the **Royal Tombs**, **Great Temple**, **Byzantine Church Mosaics**, and the **Colonnaded Street**.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 4, 'Experience **Petra by Night**, walking through the candlelit Siq to view the Treasury illuminated by over 1,500 paper lanterns under the stars.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 5, 'Attempting to see the entire site in a single half-day, as Petra covers over 260 square kilometers and requires miles of physical walking across uneven stone and sand terrain.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 6, 'Underestimating hydration and sun protection; always carry a refillable water bladder, sunscreen, a hat, and sturdy hiking shoes with strong grip.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 7, 'Paying for unauthorized or overpriced animal rides along steep, narrow cliff paths without checking animal welfare standards or agreeing on clear prices beforehand.'),
  ('petra', 3595, 8, 'Buying single-entry tickets at the gate; always secure the **Jordan Pass** online prior to arrival to waive visa fees and include multi-day Petra entry.'),
  ('petra', 3596, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
