  ('queenstown', 3689, 57, 'Do not underestimate alcohol-related driving risk after winery, après-ski or nightlife experiences.'),
  ('queenstown', 3689, 58, 'Do not assume every lakefront, alpine, trail or adventure environment provides uniform wheelchair accessibility.'),
  ('queenstown', 3689, 59, 'Do not treat Queenstown food only as burgers and pub meals; Central Otago wine, New Zealand produce, fine dining and multicultural restaurants are major destination strengths.'),
