  ('melbourne', 3695, 0, 'Take full advantage of the central Free Tram Zone within the CBD and Docklands for zero-cost daily inner-city travel.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 1, 'Purchase a Myki card and tap into public transport daily caps rather than using point-to-point taxis or rideshares.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 2, 'Eat at bustling market food stalls, Asian food courts (Chinatown, Swanston Street), and neighborhood bakeries or cheap eats hubs in Fitzroy and Footscray for lunch.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 3, 'Explore Melbourne''s world-class public attractions with free admission, such as NGV International''s permanent collection, the State Library Victoria, ACMI, and the Royal Botanic Gardens.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 4, 'Self-drive or join shared group day tours for regional excursions like the Great Ocean Road or Phillip Island rather than hiring expensive private chauffeured transfers.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 5, 'Take the SkyBus express shuttle between Melbourne Airport (Tullamarine) and Southern Cross Station instead of private taxis for single or solo travelers.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 6, 'Choosing low-cost accommodations far out in outer suburbs with poor public transit links, leading to lengthy commute times and added transport fees.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 7, 'Skipping Melbourne''s legendary café and dining experiences—such as specialty coffee tastings, laneway brunches, and multicultural dining—solely to cut basic food expenses.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 8, 'Skipping localized mobile connectivity or an eSIM, leaving you without real-time public transit apps (PTV) or GPS navigation through complex laneways.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 9, 'Foregoing pre-booked tickets for major peak-season events like the Australian Open, major theater shows, or popular regional tours, which leads to sold-out venues or inflated last-minute rates.'),
  ('melbourne', 3695, 10, 'Skipping iconic regional experiences—such as the Mornington Peninsula Thermal Springs or a Yarra Valley winery tour—solely due to tight daily excursion caps.'),
  ('melbourne', 3699, 0, 'MELBOURNE AIRPORT (TULLAMARINE): The **SkyBus Melbourne City Express** offers frequent, low-cost express transport directly to Southern Cross Station in the heart of the city.'),
  ('melbourne', 3699, 1, 'FREE TRAM ZONE TRANSIT: Upon arrival at Southern Cross Station, budget travelers can ride any tram within the designated CBD and Docklands Free Tram Zone at zero fare cost.'),
  ('melbourne', 3699, 2, 'PUBLIC TRAIN & BUS METRO NETWORK: For travel beyond the CBD (such as Fitzroy, Carlton, St Kilda, or Footscray), purchase or tap a digital **Myki card** on smartphones to utilize daily-capped fares across all metropolitan trains, trams, and buses.'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 0, '4+'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 1, '8+'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 2, 'TEENAGERS'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 3, 'Maximum 2 major city attractions or regional sites per day to avoid transport fatigue.'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 4, 'Balance outdoor park play with indoor museum or gallery downtime.'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 5, 'Avoid heavy peak-hour tram commuter rushes (8:00 AM – 9:00 AM & 5:00 PM – 6:00 PM) when traveling with prams.'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 6, 'Utilize the Free Tram Zone within the CBD for easy, zero-cost transfers between city stops.'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 7, 'Use Myki cards or digital transit taps for seamless family rail and bus travel beyond the CBD.'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 8, 'Verify stroller access before booking historic heritage boats or vintage steam trains.'),
  ('melbourne', 3701, 9, 'Shaded green spaces like the Royal Botanic Gardens, Fitzroy Gardens, and Carlton Gardens'),
