  ('melbourne', 3732, 0, 'Treat Melbourne as only CBD Laneways + St Kilda Beach and miss Great Ocean Road coastal heritage, Royal Botanic Gardens sunset panoramas, Royal Exhibition Building (UNESCO Site), and UNESCO-nominated Grampians National Park sites.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 1, 'Overload Day 1 with Queen Victoria Market, Melbourne Cricket Ground (MCG), Puffing Billy Railway, NGV International, and a West End theatre show all within a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 2, 'Try to combine Melbourne + Great Ocean Road + Yarra Valley + Mornington Peninsula + Phillip Island in a short itinerary simply because South Eastern regional road connections look short on a map.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 3, 'Rely entirely on city center taxis during peak morning rush hours, or ignore Melbourne''s free City Circle Tram network in non-fare CBD zones and convenient CityLink/Monash Freeway private car rentals.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 4, 'Underestimate advance online ticket booking rules and strict daily capacity limits for Healesville Sanctuary wildlife encounters, high-speed V/Line express train seats, and Puffing Billy steam railway rides during peak school holiday seasons.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 5, 'Treat Melbourne''s climate as uniform and ignore seasonal extremes between scorching summer heatwaves, unpredictable winter rain showers with "four seasons in one day" conditions, and cool southern ocean breezes.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 6, 'Plan outdoor Hosier Lane street art walks, open-air Royal Botanic Gardens, or Point Nepean coastal hikes without checking hourly rainfall forecasts, gusty coastal mornings, or extreme weekend crowd peaks.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 7, 'Ignore Victorian gastronomy by treating meals only as international hotel buffets instead of scheduling authentic Specialty Coffee, Smashed Avocado Cafe Breakfasts, Southbank Dining, Lygon Street Italian, and Yarra Valley Cool-Climate Wines.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 8, 'Schedule excessive hotel moves between Southbank and Docklands even when a single central base along Collins Street or near Flinders Street Station serves the entire city efficiently.'),
  ('melbourne', 3732, 9, 'Assume every Victorian-era terrace building, bluestone laneway step, and historic coastal boardwalk path is automatically step-free or fully accessible.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around MCG_SUNRISE + ROYAL_EXHIBITION_HERITAGE + GREAT_OCEAN_ROAD_SANCTUARY + BOTANIC_GARDENS_AND_NGV.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 1, 'Gives Degraves Street & Old Melbourne Laneways enough time for coffee walks, urban street art photography, and afternoon shaded arcade strolls without rushing.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 2, 'Gives Great Ocean Road or Yarra Valley trips enough time for HISTORIC_COASTAL_STROLL + VINEYARD_HERITAGE_DINING + LOCAL_ARTISAN_MARKET_VISITS rather than treating them as rushed side trips.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 3, 'Adds STATE_LIBRARY_VICTORIA & CARLTON_GARDENS for Victorian heritage, grand reading room architecture history, and traditional botanical culture.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 4, 'Uses MELBOURNE_MUSEUM / PRINCESS_THEATRE selectively when Australian history, indigenous art exhibitions, and world-class performing arts productions are the focus.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 5, 'Uses ROYAL_BOTANIC_GARDENS / PHILLIP_ISLAND_NATURE_PARKS / HEALESVILLE_SANCTUARY when riverfront walks, wetland nature trails, and native wildlife viewing are preferred.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 6, 'Uses PRIVATE_AC_CARS and V_LINE_EXPRESS_TRAINS for regional transit, and free City Circle Trams or luxury MPVs for urban arrival and local moves.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 7, 'Keeps time for Southbank riverfront cafes, Royal Botanic Gardens tea rooms, Yarra riverfront promenades, and relaxed heritage-style strolling.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 8, 'Matches outdoor sightseeing, skyline photography, and rooftop observation decks to seasonal weather, unpredictable rain shifts, and daylight conditions.'),
  ('melbourne', 3733, 9, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 0, 'WALKING + FREE_TRAM_ZONE for CBD Laneways, Federation Square, and Yarra Riverfront'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 1, 'METRO_TRAINS (CITY_LOOP) for fast transit between Flinders Street, Southern Cross, Melbourne Central, and Parliament'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 2, 'PRIVATE_AC_CARS / TAXIS selectively for Great Ocean Road, Yarra Valley, Mornington Peninsula day trips, and late-night movements'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 3, 'V_LINE_EXPRESS_TRAINS for rapid intercity transit between Southern Cross Station and Geelong, Ballarat, or Bendigo'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 4, 'SKYBUS_EXPRESS_TRANSFERS for direct highway connections to Melbourne Tullamarine Airport (MEL)'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 5, 'YARRA_TRAMS selectively for quick local connections across St Kilda, Chapel Street, and Docklands'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 6, 'Royal Exhibition Building & Carlton Gardens UNESCO heritage walk'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 7, 'Melbourne Cricket Ground (MCG) hallowed turf & sports heritage tour'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 8, 'Great Ocean Road dramatic limestone stacks & coastal highway drive'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 9, 'Signature Specialty Flat White & Smashed Avocado breakfast tasting at Degraves Street cafes'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 10, 'Royal Botanic Gardens Tan Track promenade & Yarra riverbank view'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 11, 'National Gallery of Victoria (NGV International) master art collection tour'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 12, 'Queen Victoria Market artisan stalls & historic deli hall walk'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 13, 'Healesville Sanctuary native Australian wildlife interactive tour'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 14, 'West End Theatre production at historic Princess or Regent Theatre'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 15, 'State Library Victoria La Trobe Reading Room dome walk among heritage collections'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 16, 'Do not treat Melbourne as only hotel amenities while skipping local Victorian heritage sites and historic gold rush architecture.'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 17, 'Do not force Melbourne CBD + Great Ocean Road + Yarra Valley + Healesville Sanctuary + Phillip Island day trip all into a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 18, 'Do not underestimate advance online ticket booking rules for Puffing Billy steam railway, high-speed regional V/Line seats, and peak holiday hotel bookings.'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 19, 'Do not rely solely on outer suburb buses during late evening hours when routes run infrequently and trains/rideshares offer fixed convenience.'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 20, 'Do not visit Eureka Skydeck observation decks on heavy winter rain days without checking live weather forecasts.'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 21, 'Do not plan extensive outdoor coastal hikes without checking seasonal weather, heat advisories (over 40°C during summer heatwaves), and rapid cold front rain shifts.'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 22, 'Do not miss local cafe & wine gastronomy by eating only standard hotel buffets.'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 23, 'Do not assume historic bluestone cobble lanes, heritage building entryways, and coastal trail pathways are fully step-free or barrier-free.'),
  ('melbourne', 3736, 24, 'Do not ignore physical scale; massive gallery complexes and sprawling coastal national parks require reasonable physical stamina.'),
