  ('sydney', 3779, 0, 'Treat Sydney as only Opera House + Harbour Bridge and miss Blue Mountains heritage, Mrs Macquarie''s Chair sunset panoramas, Queen Victoria Building (QVB), and UNESCO World Heritage-listed Greater Blue Mountains National Park sites.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 1, 'Overload Day 1 with Sydney Opera House, Harbour BridgeClimb, Taronga Zoo, QVB, and a Sydney Harbour dinner cruise all within a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 2, 'Try to combine Sydney CBD + Blue Mountains + Hunter Valley + Wollongong + Port Stephens in a short itinerary simply because New South Wales highway connections look short on a map.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 3, 'Rely entirely on narrow inner-city taxis during peak morning rush hours, or ignore Sydney''s light rail and Opal/contactless public transport network in pedestrianized foreshore zones and convenient Airport Link train connections.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 4, 'Underestimate advance online ticket booking rules and strict daily ticket limits for Sydney Opera House guided tours, high-demand Harbour BridgeClimb slots, and Scenic World rides in peak summer holiday seasons.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 5, 'Treat Sydney''s climate as uniform and ignore seasonal extremes between scorching summer heatwaves, sudden winter coastal southerly busters, and wet autumn afternoon downpours.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 6, 'Plan outdoor Bondi to Coogee coastal walks, open-air Royal Botanic Garden walks, or Blue Mountains cliff-edge hikes without checking UV index forecasts, high wind advisories, or extreme weekend beach crowds.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 7, 'Ignore modern Australian gastronomy by treating meals only as international hotel buffets instead of scheduling authentic specialty coffee, Pacific-rim seafood, Chinatown night market bites, fresh rock oysters, and local Australian wines.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 8, 'Schedule excessive hotel moves between Sydney CBD and Bondi Beach even when a single central base along Circular Quay or Darling Harbour serves the entire city efficiently.'),
  ('sydney', 3779, 9, 'Assume every sandstone heritage step, coastal cliff path, and historic harbour wharf is automatically step-free or fully accessible.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around OPERA_HOUSE_SUNRISE + HARBOUR_BRIDGE_HERITAGE + BLUE_MOUNTAINS_SANCTUARY + MRS_MACQUARIES_CHAIR_AND_ROCKS.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 1, 'Gives The Rocks & Circular Quay precinct enough time for heritage walks, harbour architecture photography, and afternoon shaded market strolls without rushing.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 2, 'Gives Blue Mountains or Hunter Valley trips enough time for HISTORIC_LOOKOUT_STROLL + MOUNTAIN_CAFE_DINING + BOUTIQUE_WINERY_VISITS rather than treating them as rushed side trips.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 3, 'Adds QUEEN_VICTORIA_BUILDING & ART_GALLERY_OF_NSW for colonial architecture heritage, Australian art history, and traditional Indigenous cultural exhibitions.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 4, 'Uses CAPITOL_THEATRE / SYDNEY_OPERA_HOUSE_HALL selectively when Australian performing arts, ballet, and major theatrical productions are the focus.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 5, 'Uses ROYAL_BOTANIC_GARDEN / KU_RING_GAI_CHASE_NATIONAL_PARK / BARANGAROO_RESERVE when harbourfront walks, coastal bushland trails, and native wildlife viewing are preferred.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 6, 'Uses LIGHT_RAIL_AND_OPAL_FERRIES and EXPRESS_TRAINS for regional transit, and private AC vehicles or luxury MPVs for airport arrival and suburban moves.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 7, 'Keeps time for Surry Hills cafes, harbourfront tea houses, Barangaroo promenades, and relaxed coastal-style strolling.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 8, 'Matches outdoor sightseeing, coastal photography, and rooftop observation decks to seasonal weather, coastal wind levels, and daylight conditions.'),
  ('sydney', 3780, 9, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 0, 'WALKING + SYDNEY_FERRIES for Circular Quay eco-zone, The Rocks, Barangaroo, and Manly Beach water crossings'),
