  ('sydney', 3783, 16, 'Do not treat Sydney as only hotel pools while skipping local coastal national parks and preserved historic precincts.'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 17, 'Do not force Sydney Opera House + Bondi Beach + Blue Mountains + Hunter Valley + Taronga Zoo all into a single 24-hour window.'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 18, 'Do not underestimate advance online ticket booking rules for Sydney Opera House flagship shows, BridgeClimb slots, and peak holiday accommodation.'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 19, 'Do not rely solely on outer buses during late evening hours when routes run infrequently and metro/trains offer fixed convenience.'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 20, 'Do not visit coastal cliffs and headland observation decks during severe swell and wind advisories without checking live weather warnings.'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 21, 'Do not plan extensive outdoor coastal walks without checking seasonal sun intensity, heat advisories (over 35°C in peak summer), and strong UV levels.'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 22, 'Do not miss fresh Pacific seafood and multicultural gastronomy by eating only standard Western hotel buffets.'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 23, 'Do not assume historic sandstone steps, cliffside paths, and coastal trails are fully step-free or barrier-free.'),
  ('sydney', 3783, 24, 'Do not ignore physical scale; massive national park walking tracks and headland coastal paths require reasonable physical stamina.'),
