  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 0, 'Book an overnight cruise package that includes all meals, kayaking, cave entries, and round-trip Hanoi expressway transfers to avoid separate piecemeal costs.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 1, 'Stay on Cat Ba Island or in Ha Long City and take a high-quality day cruise if overnight vessels fall outside your target budget.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 2, 'Travel during the summer shoulder/low season (June–August) to take advantage of significant cruise discounts, provided you keep flexible plans for potential weather shifts.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 3, 'Book directly with local Vietnamese operators or reputable Hanoi agencies rather than through third-party international booking portals with heavy markups.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 4, 'Opt for a Lan Ha Bay or Bai Tu Long Bay itinerary, which often offers competitive pricing and fewer crowded vessel traffic zones compared to central Ha Long Bay.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 5, 'Booking ultra-low-cost day-boats or cheap budget cruises that bypass proper maritime safety certifications, life jackets, and licensed crew standards.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 6, 'Skipping round-trip highway transfer add-ons from Hanoi, leading to unreliable local transit connections or expensive last-minute private taxis.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 7, 'Choosing a vessel without included kayaking, tender boat transport, or cave entry fees, resulting in hidden out-of-pocket surcharges on the water.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3870, 8, 'Skimping on cabin location or air conditioning quality during the humid summer months, which can severely compromise rest and overall comfort.'),
