  ('ha-long-bay', 3871, 3, 'Choose multi-cabin family suites or interconnecting rooms on larger cruise vessels with high safety railings and dedicated child safety gear.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3871, 4, 'Limit cave excursions to 1 per day to manage steep stairs and uneven footing for younger children.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3871, 5, 'Opt for gentle sea kayaking or guided bamboo boat transfers through calm lagoons instead of open-water activities.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3871, 6, 'Request child-friendly meal options onboard in advance and ensure availability of fresh water and snacks.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3871, 7, 'Book 2.5-hour direct expressway limousine transfers from Hanoi to minimize highway travel fatigue.'),
