  ('ha-long-bay', 3899, 0, '**07:30 – 07:45:** Morning drive from Ho Chi Minh City down to **My Tho** on the banks of the Mekong River.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3899, 1, 'Board a private motorboat to cruise along the Mekong River, passing the four iconic islands named Dragon, Unicorn, Phoenix, and Tortoise.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3899, 2, 'Stop at **Unicorn Island** to walk through fruit orchards, listen to traditional Southern Vietnamese folk music (*Đàn Ca Tài Tử*), and sample seasonal tropical fruits.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3899, 3, 'Ride a hand-rowed sampan through the shaded palm canals of Thoi Son. Visit a family-run honeybee farm and artisanal coconut candy workshop.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3899, 4, 'Lunch featuring Mekong Delta specialties (including Elephant Ear Fish) at a waterfront restaurant.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3899, 5, 'Afternoon bicycle ride through Tan Thach village to observe countryside daily life, or relax on hammocks under riverside palms.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3899, 6, 'Transfer back to Ho Chi Minh City by late afternoon. Enjoy your final evening in Vietnam at leisure.'),
