  ('ha-long-bay', 3901, 0, 'Book cheap day-trips from Hanoi, forcing clients into 7–8 hours of highway travel in a single day for only 3–4 rushed hours on crowded boats.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3901, 1, 'Treat **Ha Long Bay**, **Lan Ha Bay**, and **Bai Tu Long Bay** as identical experiences, ignoring significant differences in vessel quality, crowd density, and permits.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3901, 2, 'Overlook seasonal weather impacts, such as winter sea mist and cold temperatures (December to February) or monsoon/typhoon risks (July to August).'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3901, 3, 'Fail to check embarkation ports and transfer types, stranding luxury clients in slow shuttle buses or outdated public marina lounges.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3901, 4, 'Assume all overnight cruises follow quiet, secluded routes when many standard vessels line up nose-to-tail at heavily congested cave sites like Sung Sot.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3902, 0, 'Routes discerning clients toward **Lan Ha Bay** (via Cat Ba / Tuan Chau) or **Bai Tu Long Bay** for pristine waters, fewer tourist boats, and quieter kayaking routes.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3902, 1, 'Secures high-end luxury overnight vessels (e.g., Capella, Stellar of the Seas, Paradise Peak) featuring private balcony cabins and dedicated harbor lounge check-ins.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3902, 2, 'Pre-books private luxury limousine transfers via the modern Hanoi–Ha Long Expressway to trim land travel time down to under 2.5 hours each way.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3902, 3, 'Arranges alternative activities like private bamboo boat rowing or sea kayaking early in the morning before large tour groups arrive at sites like Luon Cave or Bright Cave.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3902, 4, 'Monitors weather windows continuously and builds flexible itinerary buffers to protect domestic flight connections during typhoon season.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3903, 0, 'For **Day Trips (1 Day)**, avoid Ha Long Bay entirely unless taking a private seaplane flight or high-speed express transfer; focus day trips on Ninh Binh (Tam Coc/Trang An) instead.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3903, 1, 'For **2 Days / 1 Night**, book a 5-star overnight cruise departing from Tuan Chau or Got Pier to cover major highlights like Sung Sot Cave, Titov Island, or Lan Ha Bay lagoons.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3903, 2, 'For **3+ Days**, choose a 3D2N extended bay cruise into deeper Lan Ha or Bai Tu Long waters, or pair a 2D1N cruise with an extra night spent at a premium resort on Cat Ba Island or in Ha Long City.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 0, 'Overnight cruise on a 5-star vessel through the limestone karsts of Lan Ha or Bai Tu Long Bay.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 1, 'Kayaking or guided bamboo boat tour through sea caves like Luon Cave and Dark & Bright Cave.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 2, 'Panoramic lookout climb to the summit of Titov Island or Ngu Lam Peak on Cat Ba Island.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 3, 'Exploration of Sung Sot (Surprise) Cave''s expansive stalactite and stalagmite chambers.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 4, 'Sunrise Tai Chi masterclass and evening squid fishing from the cruise deck.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 5, 'Tasting fresh local seafood specialties, particularly hand-pounded Ha Long squid patties (*Chả Mực*).'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 6, 'Booking ultra-cheap day tours from Hanoi that result in 7–8 hours of highway transit for only 3 hours on a crowded boat.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 7, 'Visiting during peak typhoon season (July–August) without flexible weather buffers and backup travel plans.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 8, 'Expecting wild night-clubbing or high-street shopping malls in harbor districts or onboard vessels.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 9, 'Purchasing uncertified pearls from unauthorized street vendors instead of accredited floating pearl farms.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 10, 'Attempting to climb steep cavern stairs or Titov peak without suitable footwear and adequate mobility.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3906, 11, 'Overpacking days with back-to-back cave visits instead of enjoying serene sun-deck downtime.'),
  ('ha-long-bay', 3907, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
