  ('mekong-delta', 3983, 3, 'Combine floating markets, orchards, cycling and local food into one regional itinerary instead of paying for multiple separate packaged tours.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 3983, 4, 'Travel during **May–October** for lower accommodation demand, while keeping flexible plans for rain.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 3983, 5, 'Choosing the absolute cheapest boat operator without checking safety equipment and licensing.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 3983, 6, 'Booking distant attractions as rushed day trips when a local overnight stay would provide substantially more time.'),
