  ('mekong-delta', 4018, 0, 'Treat the **Mekong Delta** as a single-day attraction from Ho Chi Minh City, creating long road transfers and only a few rushed hours on the waterways.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4018, 1, 'Focus only on **Can Tho** and **Cai Rang Floating Market**, missing quieter experiences around **Ben Tre, Cai Be, Chau Doc, Tra Vinh and Sa Dec**.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4018, 2, 'Visit floating markets late in the morning, when much of the wholesale activity has already finished; **Cai Rang is best visited around 5–7 AM**.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4018, 3, 'Ignore the wet-season advantages. May–October brings rain, but also greener landscapes, fuller canals and strong fruit-season experiences; high-water months can be particularly rewarding around **Tra Su and Chau Doc**.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4018, 4, 'Book generic package tours without checking whether the itinerary is dominated by souvenir/factory stops rather than genuine village, orchard and river experiences.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4019, 0, 'Uses **Can Tho** and **Chau Doc** as multi-night bases when the itinerary allows, rather than constantly changing hotels; Vietnam Tourism specifically identifies both as useful bases for exploring the Delta.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4019, 1, 'Combines destinations according to geography: **My Tho → Ben Tre → Cai Be → Can Tho** for a western/eastern river circuit, then adds **Chau Doc** for deeper cultural and wetland experiences.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4019, 2, 'Schedules floating-market visits at sunrise and arranges **private or small-group boats** for quieter canal exploration.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4019, 3, 'Uses **homestays, cycling, orchard visits and local cooking experiences** to give clients a stronger connection with everyday Mekong life rather than relying only on sightseeing stops.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4019, 4, 'Adjusts routes seasonally: prioritises dry-weather cruising and easy road transfers in **December–April**, while using **May–November** for lush scenery, fruit harvests and high-water nature experiences where appropriate.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4020, 0, 'For **1 Day**, choose **My Tho + Ben Tre** from Ho Chi Minh City for the easiest introduction, or **Can Tho + Cai Rang** if starting from the Delta; avoid trying to cover multiple distant Delta regions in one day.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4020, 1, 'For **2 Days / 1 Night**, choose **Ben Tre + Can Tho** or **Can Tho + Cai Be**, with an early-morning floating-market visit and at least one genuine canal/orchard experience.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4020, 2, 'For **3–4 Days**, combine **Ben Tre → Can Tho → Chau Doc** or **Cai Be → Can Tho → Chau Doc**, allowing enough time for markets, waterways, countryside and cultural sites.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4020, 3, 'For **5–6+ Days**, build a deeper circuit incorporating **Can Tho, Ben Tre, Cai Be, Chau Doc, Sa Dec or Tra Vinh**, rather than adding more rushed day trips.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 0, 'Early-morning **Cai Rang Floating Market** experience followed by a local breakfast on the river.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 1, 'Cruise through the narrow coconut-lined waterways of **Ben Tre** by boat and traditional sampan.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 2, 'Explore tropical orchards, village lanes and local craft workshops around **Cai Be and Tan Phong Islet**.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 3, 'Visit **Tra Su Cajuput Forest** and explore its flooded waterways by boat, particularly during high-water months.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 4, 'Experience authentic Mekong cuisine, tropical fruits and regional specialties such as *bun nuoc leo*, *hu tieu* and elephant-ear fish.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 5, 'Stay at least one night in a **riverside homestay or boutique property** for a closer experience of local Delta life.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 6, 'Treating the entire Mekong Delta as a one-day excursion from Ho Chi Minh City.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 7, 'Arriving at floating markets late in the morning when the principal trading activity has already diminished.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 8, 'Packing too many distant destinations into one itinerary and spending most of the trip on roads.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 9, 'Choosing generic factory-heavy tours when the primary objective is authentic rural and cultural immersion.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 10, 'Ignoring wet-season rain, humidity and water-level changes when planning remote transfers.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4023, 11, 'Expecting major nightlife, luxury shopping or large urban entertainment districts outside the main regional centres.'),
  ('mekong-delta', 4024, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
