  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 0, 'Trekking up **Gunung Brinchang-Barat** or **Gunung Irau** (Malaysia’s cloud forest peak) via root-strewn, high-altitude montane trails for panoramic wilderness views.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 1, 'Navigating the ancient, mist-shrouded boardwalks and muddy terrain of the protected **Mossy Forest** to observe rare pitcher plants, orchids, and high-altitude flora.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 2, 'Taking on technical jungle hikes along established heritage routes—such as **Trail 10** up Gunung Batu Brinchang or **Trail 1**—featuring steep climbs, dense bamboo groves, and lush canopy cover.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 3, 'Embarking on 4WD off-road jeep expeditions through private tea estate trails, remote hill passes, and deep forest terrain.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 4, 'Trekking to hidden highland cascades like **Robinson Falls** and **Parit Falls** along scenic river pathways.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 5, '**Gunung Irau & Mossy Forest Reserve** — best for high-altitude cloud forest hiking, mist-veiled trail runs, and unique montane biodiversity.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 6, '**Tanah Rata Trailheads (Trails 1, 6, 9, 10)** — best for self-guided or small-group forest hikes, waterfall scrambles, and peak ascents starting right near town.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 7, '**Sungei Palas & Northern Ridges** — best for 4WD off-road excursions, scenic tea trail biking, and rugged mountain ridge vistas.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 8, '**Ulu Telom & Outlying Rainforests** — best for deep jungle treks, guided Rafflesia flower tracking, and visits to remote Orang Asli settlements.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 9, 'Jungle hikers, peak baggers, and montane trail runners.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 10, 'Nature photographers and cloud forest explorers.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 11, 'Off-road 4WD expedition enthusiasts.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 12, 'Botanists and wilderness trekkers interested in rare flora.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4335, 13, 'Active solo travelers and small-group eco-adventurers.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 0, 'Select accessible ground-floor rooms or elevator-serviced suites in colonial heritage lodges or modern hotels around Tanah Rata or Ringlet (such as Cameron Highlands Resort or The Smokehouse Hotel) that feature walk-in showers and step-free access to dining areas.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 1, 'Schedule farm visits and tea estate excursions for early morning hours (8:30 AM–11:00 AM) to beat midday tourist buses, avoid traffic bottlenecks, and enjoy clear, crisp weather.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 2, 'Utilize private chauffeured vehicles or dedicated small-group 4WD tours with direct door-to-door drop-off rather than walking along narrow highland roads without dedicated footpaths.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 3, 'Reserve afternoon hours (1:00 PM–4:00 PM) for indoor relaxation, traditional high tea on resort lawns, or soothing spa sessions while afternoon rains roll in.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 4, 'Choose tranquil, flat sightseeing spots like the Sungei Palas BOH Tea Centre cafe, MARDI Agro Technology Park, or peaceful flower gardens over steep jungle treks.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 5, 'Prioritize cool-climate comfort, scenic driving loops, and unhurried dining over fast-paced multi-farm itineraries.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 6, 'Ensure travel timing avoids Malaysian public holiday weekends and school breaks when severe traffic jams can result in multi-hour vehicle delays on mountain passes.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 7, 'Visiting the Sungei Palas BOH Tea Centre using the accessible shuttle service or level elevator access leading directly up to the floating tea cafe and viewing deck.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 8, 'Scenic, flat garden walks through MARDI Agro Technology Park, the paved flower displays at Cameron Flora Park (utilizing their internal transfer shuttle), and flat strawberry farm cafes.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 9, 'Traditional English High Tea service on flat garden terraces or cozy colonial tea rooms with fireplace seating.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 10, 'Relaxed drives along the scenic mountain routes stopping at designated roadside lookouts for plantation photos.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 11, 'Private guided day tours tailored to a gentle walking pace with frequent seating breaks and easy vehicle boarding.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 12, 'Staying within easy reach of regional healthcare facilities like Hospital Sultanah Hajjah Kalsom in Tanah Rata for peace of mind.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 13, 'Attempting steep, unpaved jungle trekking routes (such as Trail 1 or Trail 6) or unassisted walks up to high mountain summits.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 14, 'Navigating the full unpaved Mossy Forest mud trails (opt instead for the brief, flat timber boardwalk section with proper handrail support).'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 15, 'Climbing steep, narrow stairs at multi-tiered terraced farms or older hillside cactus gardens without handrails.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 16, 'Walking long distances along the main arterial roads between towns due to lack of sidewalks, blind turns, and heavy vehicle traffic.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 17, 'Visiting high-density market strips like Kea Farm Market during peak weekend afternoon hours where dense crowds and tight spaces present trip hazards.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4336, 18, 'Budget guesthouses or multi-story walk-up chalets that lack elevators and rely on steep, narrow staircases.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 0, 'Gather around a bubbling **Highland Steamboat (Hot Pot)**, dipping fresh local vegetables, sliced meats, mushrooms, and seafood into steaming clear or spicy tom yum broth in the chilly mountain air.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 1, 'Indulge in traditional **English Afternoon High Tea**, savoring warm, freshly baked scones served with clotted cream, local strawberry jam, and freshly brewed highland tea overlooking rolling tea hills.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 2, 'Enjoy **Fresh Strawberry Desserts**, from chocolate-covered strawberries and strawberry tarts to freshly made strawberry ice cream and pancakes direct from local farms.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 3, 'Relish hearty **Indian Banana Leaf Rice & Chapatis** at local *mamaks* and eateries, featuring aromatic curries, tender tandoori chicken, and dal.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 4, 'Snack on **Highland Sweet Corn & Market Eats**, such as butter-brushed grilled corn, fried mushrooms, *apam balik* (peanut pancakes), and satay at bustling local night markets.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 5, '**Families:** Communal steamboat restaurants in Brinchang and interactive dessert spots at strawberry farms that cater easily to all generations.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 6, '**Honeymooners:** Romantic colonial afternoon tea experiences and private fireplace dining at historic heritage lodges like The Smokehouse or Cameron Highlands Resort.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 7, '**Luxury travelers:** Refined multi-course dinners and private tea-infused spa-and-dining experiences at five-star highland retreats.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 8, '**Budget travelers:** Casual Indian eateries, local Malay food stalls, and affordable cafe dining along the main strip of Tanah Rata.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 9, '**Foodies:** Exploring fresh produce stalls at Kea Farm Market, hunting for traditional charcoal steamboats, and tasting rare highland honey blends.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 10, '**Tanah Rata:** Best for budget-friendly dining, Indian banana leaf spots, cozy cafes, and accessible halal steamboat venues.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 11, '**Brinchang:** Best for classic Chinese-style steamboat hubs, charcoal hotpots, and vibrant evening food stalls.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 12, '**Sungei Palas & BOH Tea Estates:** Best for iconic cliffside tea cafe views, tea tasting, and scenic high tea breaks.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 13, '**Kea Farm Market Precinct:** Best for fresh highland fruit, sweet corn, strawberry treats, and farm-fresh snacks.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4338, 14, '**Golden Hills Night Market:** Best for weekend street food hunting, grilled local delicacies, and regional snacks.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 0, '**Highland Teas & Blends:** Premium loose-leaf teas, black teas, green teas, flavored varieties, and limited-edition tins directly from BOH and Cameron Valley (Bharat) tea estates.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 1, '**Fresh Strawberries & Strawberry Products:** Freshly picked strawberries, handmade strawberry jams, purees, chocolate-covered strawberries, and strawberry-infused pastries.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 2, '**Mountain Produce & Honey:** Farm-fresh vegetables (sweet corn, highland cabbages, zucchini), wild flora honey, bee pollen, and fresh tea-flower honey.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 3, '**Potted Plants, Orchids & Cacti:** Rare mountain succulents, flowering orchids, potted cacti, and ornamental garden plants from specialized nurseries.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 4, '**Highland Craft Souvenirs & Snacks:** Woven baskets, strawberry-themed novelties, fried mushroom snacks, homemade fruit wines, and local herbal infusions.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 5, '**Kea Farm Market:** The premier destination for fresh vegetables, fruits, flowers, potted plants, and local snacks straight from highland farms.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 6, '**Golden Hills Night Market (Brinchang Night Market):** Held on weekends and Malaysian school holidays; perfect for browsing local street food, souvenirs, clothes, and fresh produce under cool evening skies.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 7, '**BOH Sungei Palas Tea Centre Shop:** Ideal for purchasing exclusive tea leaves, specialty blends, elegant tea sets, and branded souvenirs directly from the source.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 8, '**MARDI Agro Technology Park Shop:** Great for purchasing certified agricultural products, processed fruits, and local plant species.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 9, '**Tanah Rata Main Street Souvenir Shops:** Convenient for casual handicraft shopping, local postcards, honey products, and highland trinkets within walking distance of guesthouses.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 10, 'Buying fresh fruit or produce right at the start of a multi-day trip if you lack proper refrigeration or cooling facilities in your room or vehicle.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 11, 'Purchasing delicate potted plants or cacti without checking your transportation and agricultural customs regulations if traveling internationally.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 12, 'Expecting massive air-conditioned retail shopping malls or high-end luxury fashion boutiques; retail here is strictly local, agricultural, and market-focused.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 13, '**Tea Lovers & Connoisseurs:** Exclusive tea leaves, gift tins, and specialized brewing accessories straight from plantation gift shops.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 14, '**Agro-Tourists & Foodies:** Mountain-fresh vegetables, sweet corn, berries, homemade jams, and artisanal highland honey.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 15, '**Souvenir & Gift Hunters:** Strawberry-themed plushies, local handicrafts, fruit wines, and traditional snacks at local night markets.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4339, 16, '**Plant & Garden Enthusiasts:** Cold-climate cacti, flowering succulents, orchids, and potted ornamental plants from specialized garden nurseries.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 0, '**Couples & honeymooners** seeking cozy fireplace cocktails, quiet heritage lounges, and intimate evening coffee breaks in cool mountain air.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 1, '**Families & groups** wanting social, long multi-hour steamboat (hotpot) dinners and evening strolls through local night markets.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 2, '**Relaxed travelers & hikers** looking to unwind after daytime treks with local beers, casual acoustic music, and quiet pub conversations.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 3, 'Gathering around a bubbling, multi-broth highland steamboat (hot pot) dinner in Brinchang or Tanah Rata as temperatures drop in the evening.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 4, 'Sipping craft cocktails, wine, or warm drinks by traditional brick fireplaces inside colonial heritage retreats like The Smokehouse Hotel or Cameron Highlands Resort.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 5, 'Browsing local snacks, grilled sweet corn, souvenirs, and warm apparel under cool night skies at the Golden Hills Night Market (weekends and holidays).'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 6, 'Hanging out at cozy, casual pub bars and relaxed cafes in central Tanah Rata for cold local beers, board games, and casual sports broadcasts.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 7, 'Expecting vibrant electronic dance clubs, late-night DJ party venues, or multi-story bar strips; nightlife here winds down relatively early.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 8, 'Driving along narrow mountain passes late at night during heavy fog or torrential rains, as visibility drops significantly.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 9, 'Heading out late for dinner without checking opening hours, as many standalone cafes and local eateries close by 9:00 PM or 10:00 PM.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 10, '**Tanah Rata Main Strip:** Best for casual sports pubs, cozy traveler lounges, Indian *mamak* stalls operating late, and relaxed coffee spots.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 11, '**Brinchang Town Center:** Best for the highest concentration of bustling Chinese-style steamboat and hotpot restaurants.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 12, '**Golden Hills:** Best for weekend evening street-market browsing, street-food snacking, and local shopping at the Brinchang Night Market.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4340, 13, '**Heritage Lodge Corridor (Ringlet / Tanah Rata Outskirts):** Best for upscale, quiet colonial bar lounges, fireplace drinks, and romantic evening tranquility.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4348, 0, 'Route clients to **Cameron Highlands** on local weekends or Malaysian public holidays, stranding them in multi-hour bumper-to-bumper traffic jams along narrow, single-lane mountain passes and market bottlenecks.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4348, 1, 'Misjudge mountain road driving conditions, failing to warn clients about steep, winding switchbacks that cause severe motion sickness, or recommending compact rental cars for steep off-road tracks.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4348, 2, 'Treat the **Mossy Forest** as a casual drop-in stop without checking permit requirements or booking high-clearance 4WD transport to handle the rough, narrow access road leading to the trailhead.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4348, 3, 'Expect high-speed urban ride-hailing app coverage, leaving clients stranded at remote locations like Sungei Palas BOH Tea Estate or Mossy Forest where Grab availability is extremely scarce.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4348, 4, 'Include closed, unpermitted, or non-viable viral spots (such as illegally constructed hilltop attractions demolished by local authorities) due to using outdated internet blog posts.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4349, 0, 'Books early-morning 4WD departures for **Sungei Palas BOH Tea Estate** and **Mossy Forest**, ensuring clients arrive before heavy tourist coaches block narrow roads and clouds obscure panoramic views.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4349, 1, 'Arranges dedicated private chauffeured transfers (MPVs or SUVs) straight from KLIA, Ipoh, or Penang, incorporating planned comfort stops along scenic mountain routes with motion-sickness precautions.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4349, 2, 'Pairs active morning jungle trekking or farm visits with quiet afternoon colonial high tea services or Spa Village treatments, aligning outdoor activities with optimal clear-weather windows before afternoon rains.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4349, 3, 'Curates accommodation strictly by persona—placing honeymooners and luxury travelers in secluded heritage retreats around **Ringlet** or **Tanah Rata outskirts**, families in **Brinchang** near main farms, and budget hikers in walkable **Tanah Rata**.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4349, 4, 'Verifies seasonal operations for specialized outdoor excursions, such as confirming active bloom sightings with local indigenous guides prior to booking deep-jungle **Rafflesia Flower** treks.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4350, 0, 'For **Highland Logistics & Transport**, strictly schedule mountain transit on weekdays, utilizing private pre-booked vehicles or 4WD charters instead of relying on local ride-hailing apps or self-driving on peak weekends.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4350, 1, 'For **Attraction & Nature Timing**, enforce early-morning starts (8:00 AM–10:30 AM) for tea estates, flower parks, and cloud forest boardwalks to maximize clear weather, beat crowd surges, and secure parking.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4350, 2, 'For **Dining & Accommodation**, reserve iconic colonial high tea and steamboat hotpot dinners well in advance, pairing heritage resort stays with relaxed, unhurried afternoon itineraries.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 0, 'Take an early morning 4WD tour to Sungei Palas BOH Tea Estate to enjoy freshly brewed black tea on the floating viewing deck with 360-degree views of rolling tea hills.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 1, 'Walk along the timber boardwalk through the mist-shrouded Mossy Forest (Gunung Brinchang) to see rare pitcher plants, montane orchids, and ancient moss-draped trees.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 2, 'Indulge in a piping-hot communal Highland Steamboat (Hot Pot) dinner in Brinchang to warm up during cool mountain evenings.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 3, 'Experience traditional English Afternoon High Tea at a heritage hotel or tea house, complete with warm, freshly baked scones, clotted cream, and local strawberry jam.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 4, 'Harvest your own fresh strawberries at a local self-pick farm like Big Red Strawberry Farm or Raju’s Hill.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 5, 'Browse the Golden Hills Night Market (Brinchang Night Market) on weekend evenings to sample steamed sweet corn, grilled satay, and local strawberry desserts.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 6, 'Traveling up or down the mountain roads on local Malaysian weekends, school holidays, or public holidays due to severe multi-hour traffic gridlocks.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 7, 'Relying on ride-hailing apps like Grab for remote attractions (such as BOH Tea Estate or Mossy Forest), as coverage and driver availability are extremely limited.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 8, 'Self-driving small or low-clearance rental cars up steep, narrow mountain tracks to high-altitude trailheads.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 9, 'Searching for or planning visits to permanently closed viral attractions like Cameron Santorini (demolished by local municipal councils).'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 10, 'Trekking deep jungle trails (like Trail 10 or Rafflesia routes) without a licensed local guide, proper footwear, and rain gear.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4353, 11, 'Visiting popular tea estates and market stalls late in the afternoon when heavy tourist coaches arrive and fog obscures valley views.'),
  ('cameron-highlands', 4354, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 0, 'Base yourself near Pantai Cenang or Pantai Tengah to access the widest selection of budget guesthouses, affordable hostels, local eateries, and walkable access to free public beaches.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 1, 'Rent a scooter (MYR 30–MYR 50 per day) or a compact car if traveling in a small group (MYR 50–MYR 80 per day) for the most cost-effective way to explore the island, as ride-hailing app prices can add up over multiple trips.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 2, 'Take advantage of Langkawi’s duty-free island status to save significantly on imported chocolates, snacks, and beverages by purchasing them at duty-free centers in Kuah Town or Pantai Cenang rather than tourist beach bars.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 3, 'Dine at local Malay hawker stalls, 24-hour Indian mamak spots, or rotating evening night markets (Pasar Malam) across the island for filling meals costing just MYR 7–MYR 15 per person.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 4, 'Book group join-in tours for major water activities—such as shared island hopping (MYR 35–MYR 50) or shared mangrove boat tours (MYR 80–MYR 100)—instead of hiring private boats.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 5, 'Booking unaccredited or ultra-cheap private boat operators for island hopping or mangrove tours, which often lack proper safety equipment, life jackets, and reliable insurance coverage.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 6, 'Renting scooters or cars from unlicensed roadside vendors who do not provide comprehensive insurance coverage or proper helmets, leaving you fully liable for accidental damages or police fines.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 7, 'Skipping standard express line passes or advance online tickets for high-demand attractions like the Langkawi SkyCab during peak travel months, leading to hours wasted waiting in long queues under the tropical heat.'),
  ('langkawi', 4358, 8, 'Relying exclusively on walk-in rates for accommodations and ferry transfers during major Malaysian national holidays or peak dry season months, as limited availability drives last-minute prices up sharply.'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 0, '2+'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 1, '4+'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 2, '8+'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 3, 'Teenagers'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 4, 'Reserve family suites, connected rooms, or spacious beachfront chalets in Pantai Cenang or Pantai Tengah to stay steps away from calm swimming waters, kid-friendly dining, and main tour departure jetties.'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 5, 'Pack child-safe reef-friendly sunscreen, lightweight UV-protection swim shirts, swim goggles, and gentle insect repellent to keep kids protected during long days on sunny beaches and mangrove tours.'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 6, 'Schedule outdoor activities like the Langkawi SkyCab, island hopping, or mangrove boat trips during morning hours to avoid peak mid-day tropical heat and potential late afternoon showers.'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 7, 'Focus on interactive, hands-on attractions for younger children, such as feeding animals at Langkawi Wildlife Park, exploring fish tanks at Underwater World, and posing with optical illusions at the 3D Art in Paradise Museum.'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 8, 'Ensure kids wear proper life jackets during all boat excursions, sea kayaking, and water sports, and double-check safety equipment on family boat charters.'),
  ('langkawi', 4359, 9, 'Opt for a sturdy baby carrier alongside a compact stroller; while resort grounds and main paved promenades are stroller-friendly, boat docks, waterfall hikes, and SkyBridge stairways feature uneven steps and narrow footpaths.'),
  ('langkawi', 4360, 0, 'honeymoon_score: 92'),
  ('langkawi', 4360, 1, 'romance_score: 90'),
  ('langkawi', 4360, 2, 'privacy_score: 94'),
  ('langkawi', 4360, 3, 'luxury_score: 94'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 0, 'Embarking on guided **guided open-water jet ski expeditions** across the Archipelago of the 99 Islands, navigating sea caves, hidden lagoons, and stopping at **Dayang Bunting** (Lake of the Pregnant Maiden).'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 1, 'Tackling demanding jungle climbs up **Gunung Raya** (Langkawi''s highest peak at 881m) via the steep **Thousand Memories Eagle Stairs** or trekking the jagged ridges of **Gunung Mat Cincang**.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 2, 'Navigating narrow sea-cave passages and winding mangrove rivers by **sea kayak** in the **Kilim Karst Geoforest Park**.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 3, 'Flying through ancient rainforest canopies and conquering high-altitude obstacle circuits at **Skytrex Adventure** near Mount Mat Cincang.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 4, 'Scuba diving and drift snorkeling off the protected offshore reef structures of **Pulau Payar Marine Park**.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 5, '**Kilim Karst Geoforest Park & Kubang Badak** — best for tidal river kayaking, exploring bat caves, and wildlife tracking through ancient limestone canyons.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 6, '**Southern Archipelago & Dayang Bunting** — best for offshore jet ski island hopping, freshwater lake swims, and coastal sea-cave exploration.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 7, '**Machinchang & Telaga Harbour** — best for high-altitude forest obstacle courses, steep ridge trekking, and waterfall scrambles at Seven Wells (Telaga Tujuh).'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 8, '**Pulau Payar Marine Sanctuary** — best for open-water marine adventures, reef diving, and coral habitat exploration.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 9, 'Water sports enthusiasts, sea kayakers, and jet-ski expeditioners.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 10, 'Tropical jungle hikers, ridge climbers, and trail runners.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 11, 'Canopy aerial adventurers and zipline enthusiasts.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 12, 'Marine wildlife observers, divers, and coastal eco-explorers.'),
  ('langkawi', 4362, 13, 'Active solo travelers and small-group thrill seekers.'),
