  ('bohol', 4768, 13, 'Proceed for Island Hopping Tour A aboard a private outrigger boat with a local grilled lunch included'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 14, 'Visit the iconic **Big Lagoon** (family kayaking through crystal turquoise waters), **Small Lagoon**, and the hidden passage of **Secret Lagoon**'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 15, 'Stop at **Shimizu Island** for world-class snorkeling among colorful fish and sea turtles'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 16, 'Relax along the white coconut palm shores of **Seven Commandos Beach**'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 17, 'Return to El Nido town center for an evening stroll'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 18, 'Overnight stay at **El Nido Garden Resort** (or similar) in El Nido'),
