  ('bohol', 4768, 20, 'Embark on El Nido Island Hopping Tour C, famous for dramatic limestone formations and secluded beaches, with local lunch included'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 21, 'Crawl through a natural rock opening to discover **Secret Beach** and explore the secluded shores of **Hidden Beach**'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 22, 'Admire the distinct shape of **Helicopter Island** (Dilumacad Island) and swim along **Talisay Beach**'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 23, 'Snorkel in pristine marine protection areas teeming with vibrant coral reefs'),
