  ('bohol', 4768, 39, 'Morning completely free for leisure—enjoy the resort pool, build sandcastles, or try gentle family water sports'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 40, 'Around 3:00 PM, meet for a breathtaking **Boracay Sunset Paraw Cruise**, sailing into the golden hour aboard a traditional outrigger sailboat'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 41, 'Return to the resort for an evening of beachside dining and live acoustic entertainment'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 42, 'Overnight stay at **Boracay Mandarin Bay Resort and Spa** (or similar) in Boracay'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 43, 'Breakfast at the hotel'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 44, 'Check out of the resort and transfer to Caticlan Airport (MPH)'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 45, 'Domestic flight to Cebu (Mactan-Cebu International Airport)'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 46, 'Meet-and-greet upon arrival in Cebu and private transfer to hotel'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 47, 'Check in and spend the evening relaxing or exploring nearby dining hubs'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 48, 'Overnight stay at **BAI Hotel** (or similar) in Cebu'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 49, 'Breakfast at the hotel'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 50, 'Embark on a comprehensive family Cebu City & Highland Tour covering major cultural and modern highlights:'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 51, 'Visit the grand Roman-inspired **Temple of Leah** overlooking the city skyline'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 52, 'Stop at the charming French bakery hub **La Vie Parisienne**'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 53, 'Explore historic sites: **Heritage Park**, **Yap-San Diego Ancestral House**, and **Fort San Pedro**'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 54, 'Visit **Magellan''s Cross** and the revered **Santo Niño Church**'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 55, 'Drive up to **Tops Lookout** for stunning nighttime views of Metropolitan Cebu'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 56, 'Cross the impressive **CCLEX Bridge** (Cebu–Cordova Link Expressway)'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 57, 'Visit the romantic illuminated garden of **10,000 Roses** in Cordova'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 58, 'Return to hotel late evening'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 59, 'Overnight stay at **BAI Hotel** (or similar) in Cebu'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 60, 'Early morning departure (approx. 3:00 AM) heading south to Tan-awan, Oslob *(packed breakfast provided by the hotel)*'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 61, '**Oslob Whale Shark Watching**: An unforgettable experience swimming and snorkeling near gentle whale shark giants under strict eco-guides'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 62, 'Proceed to Badian for the famous **Kawasan Waterfalls**, marveling at its legendary turquoise river waters'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 63, 'Enjoy family-friendly river trekking and the **Kawasan Canyoneering** activity (tailored for safety and fun with certified local guides)'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 64, 'Scenic drive back to Cebu City in the afternoon'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 65, 'Overnight stay at **BAI Hotel** (or similar) in Cebu'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 66, 'Breakfast at the hotel'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 67, 'Morning pick-up around 7:00 AM and transfer to Mactan wharf for an island-hopping marine sanctuary adventure:'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 68, '**Gilutongan Island**: Snorkeling paradise filled with rich marine life and colorful coral gardens'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 69, '**Caohagan Island**: Peaceful island village offering authentic local charm and relaxing sandy shorelines'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 70, '**Nalusuan Island**: Famous for its scenic wooden boardwalk and protected marine sanctuary, ideal for fish feeding and swimming'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 71, 'Enjoy a fresh seafood and island lunch before cruising back to Mactan'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 72, 'Return transfer to hotel and evening at leisure'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 73, 'Overnight stay at **BAI Hotel** (or similar) in Cebu'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 74, 'Breakfast at the hotel'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 75, 'Early morning ferry transfer across the Cebu Strait to Tagbilaran, Bohol, for a full-day countryside excursion:'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 76, '**Blood Compact Shrine**: Historical monument commemorating the first treaty of friendship between Spain and the Philippines'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 77, '**Baclayon Church**: One of the oldest stone churches in the country with a rich heritage museum'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 78, '**Bohol Man-Made Forest**: Ride through a dense, picturesque green canopy stretch of mahogany trees'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 79, '**Exotic Wildlife Encounter**: Visit a local sanctuary featuring native pythons and butterflies'),
  ('bohol', 4768, 80, '**Tarsier Conservation Area**: Get up close with the world’s smallest primates in their natural forested habitat'),
