  ('kanyakumari', 4964, 0, 'Stay near the main beach and temple area in Kanyakumari town for easy access to sunrise/sunset points, boat jetties, and key sights; avoid paying extra for distant “sea-view” labels if they add daily transfer time to core activities.'),
