  ('kanyakumari', 4964, 2, 'Use local eateries and Tamil meals instead of only hotel dining; simple South Indian breakfasts, thalis, and coastal seafood at small restaurants cost a fraction of resort prices while still offering good quality.'),
  ('kanyakumari', 4964, 3, 'Keep the itinerary compact to reduce taxi and private-transfer costs; cluster activities around one or two zones (e.g., main beach + Rock Memorial boat ride, or temple circuit + lighthouse + coastal walk).'),
