  ('trivandrum', 5058, 4, 'Controls transit friction by recommending pre-booked private vehicles for inter-zone movements, day trips, and seamless airport connections.'),
  ('trivandrum', 5058, 5, 'Uses high-value experiences at optimal times—such as early morning visits for temple/palace perimeter tours and late afternoons for Lighthouse Beach sunsets or Poovar mangrove cruises.'),
