  ('ooty', 5160, 2, 'Underestimate the travel time caused by winding mountain roads, traffic, weather, and peak-season congestion.'),
  ('ooty', 5160, 3, 'Stay far outside Ooty merely to save on hotel cost, without calculating the additional daily taxi cost and travel time.'),
  ('ooty', 5160, 4, 'Mix Pykara, Avalanche, Coonoor and other distant attractions into the same day without considering geography.'),
  ('ooty', 5160, 5, 'Schedule too many outdoor activities during periods of heavy rain, fog, or poor visibility.'),
