  ('kodaikanal', 5223, 8, 'Allow extra time for queues, parking, walking, and sudden weather changes at popular attractions.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5223, 9, 'Prefer private cars/taxis for Berijam Lake, Mannavanur, Dolphin''s Nose, and other longer sightseeing routes.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5223, 10, 'Avoid changing hotels frequently during a short Kodaikanal holiday.'),
