  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 0, 'Prefer hotels in or near central Kodaikanal, especially around Kodaikanal Lake and the main town area, to reduce daily travel and provide easier access to restaurants, pharmacies, shops, and transport.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 1, 'Use private cars, taxis, or reliable local transport for longer sightseeing journeys because Kodaikanal''s attractions are spread across hilly terrain.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 2, 'Avoid stacking multiple long-distance attractions or walking-heavy activities in one day.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 3, 'Include regular seating, rest, meals, hydration, and warm-up breaks, particularly during longer sightseeing days.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 4, 'Check hotel accessibility, lifts, ground-floor rooms, heating, hot-water availability, bathroom facilities, and ease of vehicle access before booking.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 5, 'Avoid unnecessary steep walks, uneven paths, prolonged outdoor exposure during rain or fog, and difficult viewpoints with limited accessibility.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 6, 'Prefer senior-friendly attractions such as Kodaikanal Lake, Bryant Park, Coaker''s Walk, selected viewpoints, and scenic attractions with convenient vehicle access.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 7, 'Plan Berijam Lake, Mannavanur, Dolphin''s Nose, and other remote attractions as separate comfortable excursions rather than combining too many distant locations in one day.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 8, 'Schedule major sightseeing during comfortable daytime hours and avoid very early-morning or late-evening mountain travel when temperatures can be particularly low and visibility may be reduced.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 9, 'Allow longer transition times between attractions because winding Palani Hills roads can make journeys slower than their distance suggests.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 10, 'Avoid unnecessarily long public-transport journeys when comfort, accessibility, or weather conditions are a concern.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 11, 'Keep the itinerary flexible around rainfall, fog, temperature, road conditions, forest access restrictions, and the senior traveler''s mobility.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5227, 12, 'Give extra consideration to Coaker''s Walk, Pillar Rocks, Dolphin''s Nose, and waterfall areas because some viewpoints and trails involve slopes, stairs, uneven surfaces, or additional walking.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5228, 0, 'Central Kodaikanal and major hotels may offer some accessible facilities, but availability of ramps, lifts, accessible bathrooms, parking, and step-free access varies considerably.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5228, 1, 'Kodaikanal Lake and surrounding central attractions may offer comparatively easier access in selected areas, but paths, slopes, steps, kerbs, and uneven surfaces can still affect wheelchair movement.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5228, 2, 'Bryant Park and other garden attractions contain substantial outdoor areas where paths, slopes, steps, and uneven surfaces may affect wheelchair access.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5228, 3, 'Coaker''s Walk and major viewpoints can present accessibility challenges because of slopes, steps, narrow sections, and uneven terrain; wheelchair users should verify current access conditions before visiting.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5228, 4, 'Pillar Rocks, Guna Caves, Dolphin''s Nose, Pine Forest, waterfalls, trekking areas, and other nature attractions may have uneven terrain, steps, limited accessible infrastructure, or difficult access for wheelchair users.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5228, 5, 'Berijam Lake and other remote forest attractions may have additional access restrictions and should be verified with the relevant local or forest authorities before planning a visit.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5228, 6, 'Kodaikanal''s winding mountain roads and steep sections can make private vehicle transfers more practical than public transport for travelers with mobility requirements.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5228, 7, 'Public buses and other local transport may not provide consistent step-free boarding or wheelchair-friendly facilities, so travelers requiring accessibility should confirm arrangements before relying on them.'),
