  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 0, 'Try to cover every Kodaikanal attraction, Pillar Rocks, Guna Caves, Poombarai, Mannavanur, Berijam Lake, and surrounding Palani Hills destinations in a very short trip.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 1, 'Schedule Kodaikanal Lake, Coaker''s Walk, Bryant Park, Pillar Rocks, Guna Caves, and multiple distant attractions without allowing enough time for each.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 2, 'Underestimate travel time caused by winding hill roads, traffic, weather, fog, and peak-season congestion.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 3, 'Stay far outside central Kodaikanal merely to save on hotel cost, without calculating the additional daily taxi cost and travel time.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 4, 'Mix Poombarai, Mannavanur, Berijam Lake, Dolphin''s Nose, and other distant attractions into the same day without considering geography and road conditions.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 5, 'Schedule too many outdoor activities during periods of heavy rain, fog, or poor visibility.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 6, 'Plan every day as a full sightseeing day without sufficient hotel rest, café time, boating, or relaxed mountain experiences.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 7, 'Forget queues, parking, attraction timings, boating availability, forest permissions, road conditions, and local transport buffers.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 8, 'Schedule too much sightseeing on departure day, especially when traveling back down the mountain to Madurai or another departure point.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5254, 9, 'Ignore the traveler''s actual purpose, especially when the trip is primarily for honeymoon, relaxation, nature, photography, adventure, or family travel.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 0, 'Builds the trip around the traveler''s purpose.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 1, 'Groups attractions geographically around Central Kodaikanal, Pillar Rocks / Guna Caves, Poombarai / Mannavanur, Berijam, and the wider Palani Hills.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 2, 'Uses hotel location strategically, especially for short trips and travelers relying on local transport.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 3, 'Protects free time for rest, meals, cafés, boating, photography, and relaxed mountain exploration.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 4, 'Controls daily walking, driving time, road intensity, and sightseeing density.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 5, 'Uses private cars or taxis selectively, especially for Poombarai, Mannavanur, Berijam, Dolphin''s Nose, longer countryside excursions, and full-day sightseeing.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 6, 'Places outdoor experiences during comfortable daytime periods and adjusts plans around rain, fog, visibility, and road conditions.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 7, 'Leaves flexibility for weather, forest access restrictions, attraction timings, boating, and local traffic conditions.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 8, 'Avoids unnecessary hotel changes on short trips.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 9, 'Uses a smaller number of meaningful Kodaikanal experiences rather than trying to visit every attraction and remote hill destination in the region.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 10, 'Keeps at least one relaxed period in the itinerary for enjoying the hotel''s surroundings, cafés, Kodaikanal Lake, viewpoints, or mountain scenery.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 11, 'Treats Berijam Lake and other regulated forest-area excursions separately when access permissions or local conditions need to be confirmed.'),
  ('kodaikanal', 5255, 12, 'Avoids combining multiple remote destinations with central Kodaikanal sightseeing on the same day when doing so creates excessive road travel.'),
