  ('madurai', 5275, 0, 'Meenakshi Amman Temple is a large historic temple complex, so accessibility can vary across different areas, corridors, entrances, and visitor routes. Confirm wheelchair access and assistance arrangements with the temple before visiting.'),
  ('madurai', 5275, 1, 'Madurai Junction falls under Indian Railways'' accessibility framework, which provides for facilities such as wheelchair assistance, accessible infrastructure, lifts, toilets and other services depending on station category and implementation. Actual facilities should be verified before travel.'),
  ('madurai', 5275, 2, 'Madurai Junction has had accessibility-related infrastructure issues identified in official railway audit material, including concerns regarding tactile pathways, so accessibility should not be assumed to be perfect.'),
  ('madurai', 5275, 3, 'Historic attractions such as Thirumalai Nayak Palace, older temples, heritage streets, and traditional market areas may have uneven surfaces, steps, narrow passages, or other access limitations.'),
  ('madurai', 5275, 4, 'Samanar Hills and other outdoor or hill-based attractions may be difficult for wheelchair users because of natural terrain, slopes, steps, and limited accessible infrastructure.'),
  ('madurai', 5275, 5, 'Auto-rickshaws may not be suitable for all wheelchair users; private cars or appropriately accessible vehicles should be preferred when available.'),
  ('madurai', 5275, 6, 'Hotel accessibility must be checked for step-free entrances, lift dimensions, accessible bathrooms, room layout, parking/drop-off access, and wheelchair circulation.'),
  ('madurai', 5275, 7, 'Do not assume that an attraction being classified as "family-friendly" or "senior-friendly" means it is wheelchair accessible.'),
