  ('shimla', 5455, 0, '**Day 7: Shimla to Chandigarh Departure**'),
  ('shimla', 5456, 0, 'Try to cover Jakhoo Temple, The Ridge, Christ Church, Mall Road, Lakkar Bazaar, Kufri, Fagu, Chail, Naldehra, and Mashobra in only two or three days.'),
  ('shimla', 5456, 1, 'Treat Shimla as a checklist destination instead of allowing time for slow walks, cafés, mountain views, photography, shopping, and hotel relaxation.'),
  ('shimla', 5456, 2, 'Book a hotel only because it is advertised as being “near Mall Road” without checking the exact vehicle drop point, number of stairs, luggage access, lift availability, parking, and walking distance.'),
  ('shimla', 5456, 3, 'Plan long downhill or uphill walks without considering Shimla’s steep roads, stairs, uneven pavements, altitude, cold weather, rain, or snowfall.'),
  ('shimla', 5456, 4, 'Schedule the Kalka–Shimla Toy Train without checking the departure and arrival timings, seat availability, road-transfer requirements, or whether it fits comfortably with the hotel itinerary.'),
  ('shimla', 5456, 5, 'Ignore peak-season traffic during weekends, school holidays, Christmas, New Year, and snowfall periods, then expect every attraction and transfer to run on a tight timetable.'),
  ('shimla', 5456, 6, 'Leave no weather buffer for monsoon rain, winter snowfall, fog, road congestion, landslides, or temporary changes to attraction access.'),
  ('shimla', 5457, 0, 'Builds the trip around the traveller’s main purpose: first-time sightseeing, honeymoon, family relaxation, snowfall, photography, heritage, luxury, shopping, or light adventure.'),
  ('shimla', 5457, 1, 'Uses a geographically logical structure: central Shimla walking experiences on one day, Jakhoo or heritage attractions on another, and Kufri, Mashobra, Naldehra, or Chail as separate excursions.'),
  ('shimla', 5457, 2, 'Keeps the main sightseeing base close to The Ridge, Mall Road, Christ Church, Gaiety Heritage Cultural Complex, and Lakkar Bazaar when convenience is more important than seclusion.'),
  ('shimla', 5457, 3, 'Chooses Mashobra, Naldehra, Summer Hill, or a quiet valley-view property when the priority is privacy, resort relaxation, forest scenery, spa time, or a romantic mountain stay.'),
  ('shimla', 5457, 4, 'Builds a flexible alternative for poor weather, such as museums, heritage buildings, cafés, shopping, hotel dining, spa treatments, indoor activities, or a shorter central walk.'),
  ('shimla', 5457, 5, 'Schedules outdoor sightseeing during the clearest and warmest part of the day, especially for senior travellers, families, and winter visitors.'),
  ('shimla', 5457, 6, 'Plans family trips around short walks, easy vehicle access, toy-train experiences, Kufri, open spaces, warm meals, and daily downtime.'),
  ('shimla', 5457, 7, 'Advises travellers to carry layered clothing, comfortable shoes, rain protection, warm socks, medicines, and suitable footwear for changing hill weather and uneven paths.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 0, '**First-time visitors:** The Ridge, Mall Road, or Lakkar Bazaar.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 1, '**Families:** Chhota Shimla, Brockhurst, or a property with direct road access.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 2, '**Honeymooners:** Mashobra, Summer Hill, Naldehra, or a quiet valley-view hotel.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 3, '**Luxury travelers:** Premium heritage hotels or high-service resorts in Shimla, Mashobra, Naldehra, or Summer Hill.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 4, '**Budget travelers:** Sanjauli, Chhota Shimla, or accommodation slightly outside the central pedestrian zone.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 5, 'Honeymoon travelers.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 6, 'Luxury travelers.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 7, 'Families with children or heavy luggage.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 8, 'Senior travelers.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 9, 'Visitors arriving from Chandigarh Airport.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 10, 'Travelers visiting multiple nearby excursions.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 11, 'One relaxed walking circuit covering The Ridge, Christ Church, Mall Road, Scandal Point, and Gaiety Heritage Cultural Complex.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 12, 'One mountain or nature experience at Kufri, Green Valley, Naldehra, Mashobra, or Jakhoo Hill.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 13, 'One heritage experience at Viceregal Lodge, the Himachal State Museum, or the Gaiety Heritage Cultural Complex.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 14, 'One local Himachali or Tibetan food experience, such as siddu, chana madra, dhaam-style food, rajma-chawal, momos, or thukpa.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 15, 'Do not combine Kufri, Naldehra, Mashobra, Chail, Jakhoo, and multiple museums in one day.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 16, 'Do not plan long uphill walks for young children, seniors, or travelers with limited mobility.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 17, 'Do not change hotels unnecessarily on a short trip.'),
  ('shimla', 5523, 18, 'Do not book a central hotel without checking road access, stairs, lift availability, and luggage handling.'),
  ('shimla', 5524, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
  ('manali', 5529, 0, 'Stay in Old Manali, Vashisht, or near Mall Road for a good balance of cafés, local restaurants, markets, temples, riverside walks, and easy access to central sightseeing. Choose accommodation with road access, because some properties in Old Manali and hillside areas may require walking uphill or using narrow lanes.'),
  ('manali', 5529, 1, 'Select guesthouses, hostels, homestays, or simple hotels slightly away from the busiest tourist streets. Booking early and travelling in March, September, October, or November can provide better rates than visiting during summer holidays, Christmas, New Year, or active snowfall periods.'),
  ('manali', 5529, 2, 'Combine free or low-cost experiences—Hadimba Temple, Manu Temple, Vashisht village, Beas River walks, Van Vihar, Old Manali lanes, local markets, forest walks, and café time—with one or two paid excursions such as Solang Valley, Atal Tunnel, Naggar, or Rohtang-area sightseeing.'),
  ('manali', 5529, 3, 'Eat at local Himachali and North Indian restaurants, dhabas, Tibetan cafés, bakeries, and simple eateries instead of relying only on hotel dining. Budget meals such as thalis, rajma-chawal, siddu, parathas, momos, thukpa, tea, and bakery snacks can help control daily food costs.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 0, '4+'),
  ('manali', 5534, 1, '7+'),
  ('manali', 5534, 2, 'TEENAGERS'),
  ('manali', 5534, 3, 'Maximum 2 major attractions/day.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 4, 'Avoid excessive walking because Manali has uneven paths, slopes, stairs and crowded market areas.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 5, 'Avoid changing hotels on short trips.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 6, 'Choose accommodation with easy vehicle access, heating, family rooms and an in-house restaurant.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 7, 'Keep sightseeing flexible during snowfall, rain, traffic or road restrictions.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 8, 'Allow downtime every day for rest, snacks, indoor games or hotel relaxation.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 9, 'Plan only one long mountain excursion per day because winding roads can be tiring for children.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 10, 'Carry warm clothing, comfortable shoes, sunscreen, water and basic medicines.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 11, 'Allow children time to adjust to Manali’s altitude and cold weather after arrival.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 12, 'Hadimba Devi Temple and Dhungri Forest for a short cultural visit and gentle deodar-forest walk.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 13, 'Van Vihar and the Beas River for relaxed outdoor time, shaded paths and family photography.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 14, 'Solang Valley for seasonal snow play, cable-car rides, zorbing and other supervised activities.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 15, 'Old Manali for short walks, cafés, bakeries, small shops and a relaxed village atmosphere.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 16, 'Mall Road and Manali Market for easy shopping, snacks, woollens and souvenirs.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 17, 'Vashisht Temple and hot springs, using a taxi and avoiding long uphill walks with toddlers.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 18, 'Atal Tunnel–Sissu only when roads and weather are suitable, with regular breaks during the drive.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 19, 'Hotel or resort time with a valley-view room, heating, indoor games, family dining and nearby vehicle access.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 20, 'Short roadside viewpoints such as Kothi or Nehru Kund instead of lengthy mountain hikes.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 21, 'Mild meals such as rice, dal, parathas, noodles, momos, sandwiches, soup and bakery items.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 22, 'Full-day sightseeing circuits with too many temples, viewpoints, markets and forest walks.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 23, 'Multiple long mountain transfers in one day, especially with tired or motion-sensitive children.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 24, 'Long uphill walks to Manu Temple, Vashisht or other hillside attractions with toddlers.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 25, 'Combining Solang Valley, Atal Tunnel, Sissu, Rohtang-area viewpoints and local sightseeing on the same day.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 26, 'Hampta Pass, Bhrigu Lake, Beas Kund and other demanding treks with young children.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 27, 'Adventure activities without checking age limits, safety equipment, weather and operator standards.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 28, 'Snow activities without warm clothing, waterproof shoes, gloves, sunglasses and weather flexibility.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 29, 'Visiting Rohtang Pass or high-altitude areas without checking permits, road conditions and local restrictions.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 30, 'Crowded market areas during peak holidays if travelling with a stroller or very young children.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 31, 'Long outdoor walks during heavy rain, snowfall, strong winds or very cold evenings.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 32, 'Hotels that require steep walking, long stairways or narrow lanes from the vehicle drop-off point.'),
  ('manali', 5534, 33, 'Relying only on cafés and restaurants with limited child-friendly food options.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 0, 'Stay in a premium valley-view resort, boutique hotel or luxury property in Old Manali, Aleo, Prini, Naggar or a peaceful area near the Beas River.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 1, 'Choose a quiet room or suite with a private balcony, mountain views, fireplace-style ambience, heating, bathtub or in-room dining.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 2, 'Arrange a private chauffeur-driven excursion to Solang Valley, Atal Tunnel and Sissu, with flexible scenic stops.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 3, 'Enjoy a relaxed couple walk through Old Manali, Dhungri Forest, apple orchards or along the Beas River.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 4, 'Visit Hadimba Devi Temple and Dhungri Forest for culture, photography and a peaceful mountain atmosphere.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 5, 'Plan a romantic café date with hot chocolate, Tibetan food, Himachali snacks, pastries or warm bakery items.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 6, 'Arrange one private mountain-view dinner at a boutique resort, riverside restaurant or hotel balcony.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 7, 'Visit Vashisht Temple and hot springs for a calm cultural and wellness experience.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 8, 'Enjoy sunrise or sunset photography at Solang Valley, Kothi Village, Sissu or another scenic Himalayan viewpoint.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 9, 'Keep enough free time for snowfall, room relaxation, spa treatments, slow mornings and private couple moments.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 10, 'Book a private transfer from Chandigarh Airport in a comfortable sedan, SUV or premium MPV for a more relaxed journey.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 11, '2 major activities/day.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 12, 'One memorable mountain experience + one romantic local experience + free time.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 13, 'Three or four attractions packed into one day.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 14, '**Solang Valley** – enjoy mountain scenery, snow activities, cable-car rides, paragliding or a private photography session, depending on the season and weather.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 15, '**Atal Tunnel–Sissu route** – take a scenic private drive through high-altitude landscapes, waterfalls and Lahaul Valley scenery.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 16, '**Old Manali** – explore relaxed lanes, cafés, boutique shops, forest surroundings and peaceful couple-walk locations.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 17, '**Hadimba Devi Temple and Dhungri Forest** – combine traditional architecture, deodar trees, photography and a calm cultural atmosphere.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 18, '**Vashisht** – visit the temple, enjoy village views and experience the natural hot springs.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 19, '**Naggar** – choose a slower cultural day with Naggar Castle, village scenery, cafés, orchards and the Roerich Art Gallery.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 20, '**Beas River** – enjoy a quiet riverside walk, scenic photographs or private relaxation near the water.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 21, '**Winter snowfall** – plan snow play, warm café time, cosy room relaxation and mountain-view photography when conditions permit.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 22, '**Old Manali** – best for couples who want cafés, boutique shops, forest lanes, Manu Temple and a lively but relaxed atmosphere.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 23, '**Aleo** – suitable for peaceful riverside stays, valley views, better road access and convenient access to central Manali.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 24, '**Prini** – quieter and less crowded, with mountain scenery, apple orchards and a relaxed atmosphere for couples.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 25, '**Vashisht** – suitable for couples seeking hot springs, spiritual experiences, village views, cafés and budget-to-premium stays.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 26, '**Naggar** – ideal for privacy, traditional Himachali surroundings, art, heritage, orchards and a slower romantic holiday.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 27, '**Solang Valley surroundings** – suitable for couples prioritising snow, mountain views and adventure activities, although access and weather should be checked before booking.'),
  ('manali', 5535, 28, '**Premium valley-view properties** – ideal for private balconies, mountain sunsets, in-room dining, fireplace-style rooms, spa services and unhurried mornings.'),
  ('manali', 5536, 0, 'Premium valley-view resort, boutique mountain hotel or high-service luxury property in Old Manali, Aleo, Prini, Naggar or near the Beas River.'),
  ('manali', 5536, 1, 'Suite or premium room with panoramic Himalayan views, private balcony, heating, fireplace-style ambience, bathtub, in-room dining and personalised service.'),
  ('manali', 5536, 2, 'Private chauffeur-driven sightseeing with a dedicated guide for curated experiences such as Solang Valley, Atal Tunnel, Sissu, Naggar Castle, Hadimba Devi Temple and Vashisht.'),
  ('manali', 5536, 3, 'Premium SUV excursion to Solang Valley, Atal Tunnel–Sissu, Naggar, Kothi Village or Rohtang-area viewpoints, subject to weather and road access.'),
  ('manali', 5536, 4, 'Flexible itinerary with sufficient time for spa treatments, scenic drives, slow forest walks, café stops and quiet relaxation at the hotel.'),
  ('manali', 5536, 5, 'Private Chandigarh Airport transfer in a premium sedan, Innova Crysta, SUV or luxury MPV, with luggage assistance and optional scenic rest stops.'),
