  ('dharamshala', 5638, 3, 'Travel in the shoulder season or monsoon period if you want better hotel pricing and lower crowd pressure.'),
  ('dharamshala', 5638, 4, 'Keep the itinerary compact to reduce taxi and transfer costs on hilly roads.'),
  ('dharamshala', 5638, 5, 'For a first-time visit, spend more on comfort and location than on chasing the cheapest room.'),
