  ('jispa', 6020, 3, 'No acclimatisation to save time - Jispa 3200m is acclimatisation for Baralacha La 4850m + Sarchu 4290m + Leh 3500m + need 1N rest + water 3-4L + Diamox + need rest + need slow pace + need 1N Jispa + need 1N Sarchu.'),
  ('jispa', 6020, 4, 'No jacket + woolens + night cold -5°C to 5°C + need jacket + woolens + cap + gloves + sunscreen + hat + water + Diamox + AMS risk + high altitude 3200m + Baralacha La 4850m + Sarchu 4290m + Leh 3500m + cold + wind + snow + need jacket.'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 0, 'RIVERSIDE PREMIUM CAMPS $60-$90 - Bhaga River view + green meadows view + bonfire + Milky Way + Star Gazing - Best location - 1 night #1 overnight + acclimatization + river side'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 1, 'HOTEL IBEX JISPA $50-$70 - Bhaga River view + green meadows + best hotel + safe + family + near river + near village - 1 night family + safe + acclimatization'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 2, 'BASIC CAMPS $35-$50 - Bhaga River view + green meadows + bonfire + Milky Way - Budget - 1 night budget + biker + backpacker'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 3, 'Jispa village last green Lahaul + green meadows + Bhaga Riverside + riverside premium + basic camps + bonfire + Milky Way + Star Gazing + zero light pollution + offbeat + quiet + silence'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 4, 'Bhaga Riverside + green meadows + valley view + photography + river sound + nature + must + last green + green meadows + Bhaga River + valley + offbeat + quiet + silence'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 5, 'Padmasambhava statue 10km giant + Tibetan + must + 15min drive + must + photography + must'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 6, 'Keylong 20km district HQ + market + petrol + ATM + hospital + last big market Lahaul + Darcha 22km last check post + police check + bridge + Bhaga River + Baralacha La gate'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 7, 'Baralacha La day trip 90km 4850m + Suraj Tal 60km + Deepak Tal 50km lakes + Zingzing Bar + Patseo + high pass + photography + acclimatization + biking + must'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 8, 'Don''t do Manali 100km -> Sarchu 140km / Leh 335km direct 8-12hr in 1 day - Impossible + tiring + long + high altitude 2050m-4850m + AMS risk + need Jispa 3200m 1N acclimatization + rest + break + need 1N Jispa + need 1N Sarchu + need rest + need water + need Diamox'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 9, 'Don''t do Jispa afternoon only - Bhaga River morning 8-11AM best light + green meadows morning best + Padmasambhava morning best + Milky Way night 10PM-3AM best + stars night + bonfire night + village morning'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 10, 'Don''t expect luxury 5★ in Jispa - Only premium camps $60-$90 + Hotel Ibex $50-$70 + basic camps $35-$50 + basic + offbeat + small + overnight only + last green + riverside + camping + bonfire + stars + Milky Way'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 11, 'Don''t do Nov-May - Closed snow 5-15ft + frozen Bhaga + road closed + Manali-Leh closed + Baralacha La closed + Sarchu closed + no camps + no hotels + road closed + not recommended'),
  ('jispa', 6024, 12, 'Don''t forget jacket + woolens + cap + gloves + sunscreen SPF50 + hat + water 3-4L + Diamox + AMS medicine + torch + trek shoes + snow boots + night -5°C to 5°C + high altitude 3200m + AMS risk + need acclimatization + need rest + need water + need Diamox + need jacket + need woolens + need cap + need gloves + need sunscreen + need hat + need torch + need trek shoes + need snow boots'),
  ('jispa', 6025, 0, 'Himachal Tourism + Lahaul Tourism + Jispa village + Bhaga River + Hotel Ibex Jispa + Jispa riverside camps management + Padmasambhava statue + Keylong market + Darcha check post + Baralacha La + Sarchu + Leh + Suraj Tal + Deepak Tal'),
  ('jispa', 6025, 1, 'KUU Bhuntar Airport + JUB Shimla Airport + IXC Chandigarh + DEL Delhi + JDN Joginder Nagar Railway + CDG Chandigarh Railway + HRTC bus + private car + shared jeep + bike + guide - transport data - Manali 100km 4hr via Atal Tunnel + Sissu 40km + Gondla + Keylong 20km + Jispa + Darcha 22km + Baralacha La 90km 4850m + Sarchu 140km 4290m + Leh 335km 11-12hr + Tanglang La 5328m'),
  ('jispa', 6025, 2, 'Hotel supplier data - Jispa camps $35-$90, premium $60-$90, basic $35-$50, Hotel Ibex $50-$70, Keylong hotels $30-$60, Sarchu tents $50-$80, Leh hotels $40-$250, Manali hotels $40-$200'),
  ('jispa', 6025, 3, 'Food + shopping + biking data - Camps food + Hotel Ibex restaurant + dhaba + momos + thukpa + maggi + tea + Keylong market + woolens + prayer flags + biking Manali-Leh + Baralacha La + Sarchu + Leh + fuel + mechanic + repair'),
  ('jispa', 6025, 4, 'Jispa village + Bhaga River + green meadows + last green Lahaul + Padmasambhava statue 10km + Keylong 20km + Darcha 22km + Baralacha La 90km 4850m + Suraj Tal 60km + Deepak Tal 50km + Sarchu 140km 4290m + Leh 335km + Tanglang La 5328m + Bhaga River + green meadows + last green + cold desert + high altitude 3200m-5328m + AMS + acclimatization + Milky Way + Star Gazing + camping + bonfire + biking + jeep + guide'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 0, 'Stay around **Ramnagar, Dhikuli, Dhangari, or Dhela** for a wider range of budget accommodation and easier safari access.'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 1, 'Use local restaurants and dhabas around Ramnagar instead of relying entirely on premium jungle-resort dining.'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 2, 'Compare safari zones before booking; **Jhirna and Dhela operate year-round**, while several other zones have seasonal opening periods.'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 3, 'Share private transfers with a group where practical, particularly for railway-station, airport, and sightseeing transfers.'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 4, 'Book safaris directly through the **official Corbett Tiger Reserve portal** to avoid unauthorized booking websites and inflated intermediary charges.'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 5, 'Do not use unauthorized safari vehicles or guides; only authorized vehicles and guides are permitted inside the reserve.'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 6, 'Do not choose accommodation solely by lowest price if it creates long daily transfers to your safari gate.'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 7, 'Do not reduce the number of safari drives excessively if wildlife photography or tiger sightings are the primary purpose.'),
  ('corbett', 6030, 8, 'Do not ignore vehicle condition and driver experience on forest and rural roads.'),
