  ('ranikhet', 6111, 0, 'Treat Ranikhet as only a **hill-station sightseeing destination**, resulting in an itinerary focused entirely on viewpoints and temples.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6111, 1, 'Pack too many nearby attractions into a single day, creating **unnecessary driving and rushed sightseeing**.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6111, 2, 'Ignore the **monsoon season and landslide/road disruption risk** while planning July–September travel.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6111, 3, 'Assume Ranikhet will have the same **snow conditions every winter**, creating unrealistic expectations for snowfall.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6111, 4, 'Plan long outdoor sightseeing sessions during **cold winter mornings or peak summer afternoons** without allowing flexibility.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6111, 5, 'Underestimate the value of **slow travel, forest walks, cafés, resort time and Himalayan views**.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6112, 0, 'Uses Ranikhet as a **slow-paced Himalayan retreat**, combining sightseeing with nature, relaxation and scenic drives.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6112, 1, 'Groups attractions geographically to reduce **backtracking and unnecessary road travel**.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6112, 2, 'Prioritizes **Chaubatia, Jhula Devi Temple, Mankameshwar Temple, Binsar Mahadev and scenic viewpoints** according to the traveller''s interests and available time.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6112, 3, 'Keeps **monsoon itineraries flexible**, especially for road travel and outdoor sightseeing.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6112, 4, 'Treats winter snowfall as a **seasonal bonus rather than a guarantee**, while still selling the charm of a peaceful winter mountain stay.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6112, 5, 'Builds in **resort leisure, forest walks, photography time and café/market exploration** instead of filling every hour with sightseeing.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6113, 0, '**Nature Strategy:** Sell Ranikhet as a **peaceful Himalayan escape**, not as a destination where travellers need to tick off every attraction.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6113, 1, '**Road Logistics:** Cluster sightseeing by location and keep **buffer time for mountain-road delays**, especially during monsoon and winter.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6113, 2, '**Season Strategy:** Prioritize **March–June and October–November** for comfortable sightseeing; use July–September cautiously because of heavy rainfall and road disruption risk.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6113, 3, '**Snow Strategy:** **Never guarantee snowfall**—position December–February as a cold, scenic winter experience with snowfall dependent on weather conditions.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6113, 4, '**Itinerary Balance:** **4–6 key attractions + nature/forest time + leisure + scenic drives** works better than an overloaded sightseeing schedule.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6113, 5, '**Experience Strategy:** For couples and families, combine **scenic sightseeing + relaxed resort time + nature experiences** rather than treating Ranikhet like a checklist destination.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 0, 'Visit **Chaubatia Garden** and experience its scenic orchards and mountain surroundings.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 1, 'Seek blessings at **Jhula Devi Temple** and explore **Mankameshwar Temple**.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 2, 'Visit the **Kumaon Regimental Centre Museum** for Ranikhet''s military and local heritage.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 3, 'Drive to **Majhkhali** for panoramic Himalayan views and photography.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 4, 'Spend time on **forest walks, viewpoints and relaxed nature experiences** rather than rushing between attractions.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 5, 'If staying longer, add a suitable **nearby Kumaon destination** such as Dwarahat or Binsar Mahadev.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 6, 'Overloading the itinerary with too many distant mountain destinations.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 7, 'Planning rigid outdoor schedules during **July–September monsoon**.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 8, 'Assuming **snowfall is guaranteed** during winter.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 9, 'Spending the entire trip only at viewpoints without allowing time for **nature, relaxation and local exploration**.'),
  ('ranikhet', 6116, 10, 'Underestimating mountain-road travel time.'),
