  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 0, 'Treat Bhalukpong only as a **gateway/transit stop for Tawang**, missing its **Kameng River, historical fort, orchids and surrounding forests**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 1, 'Pack **Bhalukpong + Tipi + Sessa + Bomdila** into a rushed half-day, leaving little time for nature experiences.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 2, 'Assume Bhalukpong is primarily a **luxury hill-station destination**, despite its stronger positioning as a **nature, adventure and gateway destination**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 3, 'Ignore the **Kameng River**, even though river rafting, angling and riverside leisure are among Bhalukpong''s principal experiences.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 4, 'Visit Tipi only as a quick photo stop instead of allowing time for its **orchid museum and botanical surroundings**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 5, 'Skip **Sessa Orchid Sanctuary** because it lies along the onward route, missing one of the region''s major orchid and trekking experiences.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 6, 'Try to cover **Pakke Tiger Reserve, Eaglenest, Sessa and Bhalukpong** as casual day trips without accounting for forest-road conditions, permissions and travel time.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 7, 'Underestimate **mountain-road travel**, especially when continuing toward Bomdila, Dirang and Tawang.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 8, 'Plan Bhalukpong without considering the **Arunachal Pradesh Inner Line Permit (ILP)** requirements for eligible domestic visitors.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 9, 'Choose accommodation only by price without considering **highway access, river proximity, onward-route convenience and private-vehicle availability**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6735, 10, 'Treat Bhalukpong as a destination requiring several nights when, for most travellers, **1–2 nights is sufficient unless wildlife/adventure activities are added**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 0, 'Positions Bhalukpong as a **nature + adventure + heritage + gateway destination**, rather than merely a transit point for Tawang.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 1, 'Prioritizes **Kameng River, Bhalukpong Fort, Tipi Orchid Centre and Sessa Orchid Sanctuary** for first-time visitors.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 2, 'Uses Bhalukpong as the **gateway into the Bhalukpong–Bomdila–Dirang–Tawang circuit**, rather than treating it as an isolated destination. The official circuit from Tezpur to Tawang covers about 350 km.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 3, 'Combines **Fort + Kameng River + Tipi** into the core Bhalukpong experience and adds Sessa when continuing toward Bomdila.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 4, 'Allocates **1 full day** for Bhalukpong when the traveller wants nature, photography and relaxation instead of merely an overnight halt.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 5, 'Uses **early morning and late afternoon** for photography, riverside activities and forest experiences while keeping the middle of the day flexible for transfers and rest.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 6, 'Builds **rafting, angling, trekking, birdwatching and wildlife experiences** according to the traveller''s interest rather than adding every activity to every itinerary.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 7, 'Connects Bhalukpong with **Bomdila and Dirang** for travellers seeking culture, monasteries, mountain scenery, orchards and a deeper Arunachal experience.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 8, 'Uses **private SUVs/cabs** for families, honeymooners and premium travellers because the broader circuit is road-oriented and involves mountainous terrain.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6736, 9, 'Keeps **weather and road buffers** when planning the onward journey to Tawang, particularly because the route rises substantially from low-altitude Bhalukpong to high-altitude Tawang.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 0, '**Gateway Strategy:** Sell Bhalukpong as the **gateway to Western Arunachal + a genuine nature/adventure stop**, not simply a night halt.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 1, '**Core Experience Strategy:** For first-time visitors, prioritize **Bhalukpong Fort + Kameng River + Tipi Orchid Centre**, with **Sessa Orchid Sanctuary** added when continuing toward Bomdila.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 2, '**Adventure Strategy:** Add **river rafting, angling, trekking, birdwatching or wildlife experiences** according to interest and operating conditions.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 3, '**Nature Strategy:** Combine **Kameng River + Tipi + Sessa + surrounding forest landscapes** for the strongest nature-focused experience.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 4, '**Circuit Strategy:** Use **Bhalukpong → Bomdila → Dirang → Tawang** as the principal onward route for travellers exploring Western Arunachal.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 5, '**Wildlife Strategy:** Treat **Pakke Tiger Reserve and Eaglenest** as dedicated wildlife/nature extensions rather than trying to squeeze them into a short Bhalukpong sightseeing schedule.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 6, '**Itinerary Balance:** **1 day Bhalukpong sightseeing + 1 onward travel day** works better than continuously adding short stops.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 7, '**Photography Strategy:** Prioritize **Kameng River + orchids + forest landscapes + Bomdila mountain views** for photographers. Bomdila itself is officially promoted for Himalayan views and photography.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 8, '**Family Strategy:** Combine **river picnic + Tipi + Fort + scenic drive**, while avoiding overly strenuous trekking and excessive road travel in a single day.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 9, '**Honeymoon Strategy:** Emphasize **private SUV + riverside/mountain stay + orchid visit + scenic photography + relaxed evenings**, then continue toward Dirang/Tawang.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 10, '**Luxury Strategy:** For premium travellers, sell **high-quality accommodation + private chauffeur SUV + dedicated guide + curated nature experiences + premium dining**, while being transparent that Bhalukpong itself has a **limited luxury-resort inventory**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 11, '**Permit Strategy:** Confirm **ILP/PAP requirements before departure** and complete the necessary formalities rather than leaving permits until arrival.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6737, 12, '**Route Buffer Strategy:** Never schedule a critical flight/train connection immediately after a long **Bhalukpong–Bomdila–Dirang–Tawang mountain drive**; maintain a practical buffer for road and weather disruptions.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 0, 'Experience the **Kameng River**, including riverside scenery and suitable adventure activities such as rafting or angling when operating.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 1, 'Visit **Bhalukpong Fort** for a glimpse of the area''s historical heritage.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 2, 'Explore the **Tipi Orchid Research Centre**, one of the signature attractions near Bhalukpong.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 3, 'Visit **Sessa Orchid Sanctuary** for orchids, forests, valleys, trekking and biodiversity.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 4, 'Add **Pakke Tiger Reserve** for serious wildlife and forest experiences when sufficient time is available.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 5, 'Explore **Eaglenest Wildlife Sanctuary** for birdwatching, biodiversity and forest landscapes.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 6, 'Continue toward **Bomdila** for monasteries, Himalayan views, local culture and traditional crafts.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 7, 'Experience **Dirang** for its valley landscapes, hot springs, orchards, Sangti Valley and mountain atmosphere.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 8, 'Include **Thembang** for traditional village culture and a deeper understanding of the region''s heritage.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 9, 'Visit **Chillipam Monastery** when following a culture-focused Western Arunachal route.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 10, 'Capture **Kameng River, orchids, forests, mountain roads and Himalayan landscapes** through dedicated photography time.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 11, 'Taste **local Arunachali food, rice-based meals, momos, thukpa, regional vegetables and local fish**, complemented by simple Indian options.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 12, 'Include opportunities to experience **Aka/Hrusso and other regional cultural traditions, handicrafts and local village life**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 13, 'Treat Bhalukpong as the gateway to the **Bhalukpong–Bomdila–Dirang–Tawang** journey rather than simply an overnight transit halt.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 14, 'Treating Bhalukpong only as a **transit stop for Tawang** and skipping its river, fort and orchid attractions.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 15, 'Trying to cover **Bhalukpong + Sessa + Pakke + Eaglenest + Bomdila** in one rushed day.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 16, 'Underestimating the **mountain-road travel time** between Bhalukpong and the higher Arunachal destinations.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 17, 'Planning a tightly timed itinerary during **heavy monsoon periods**, when road and weather conditions can change quickly.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 18, 'Assuming wildlife sightings at **Pakke or Eaglenest are guaranteed**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 19, 'Adding strenuous trekking or remote forest excursions to family and senior itineraries without checking physical suitability.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 20, 'Expecting Bhalukpong to offer the same **luxury, nightlife or shopping infrastructure as major Indian tourist cities**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 21, 'Choosing accommodation only by price without considering **road access, onward-route convenience and vehicle availability**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 22, 'Leaving **Arunachal Pradesh permit requirements** until the last moment.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 23, 'Scheduling an important flight immediately after a long mountain-road journey without a sufficient **weather and road buffer**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6740, 24, 'Overloading the itinerary with distant attractions instead of allowing time for **Kameng River, orchids, forests and relaxed nature experiences**.'),
  ('bhalukpong', 6741, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
