  ('tawang', 6833, 0, 'Treat Tawang as only a **quick monastery-and-scenery destination**, missing its **Monastery, Bum La Pass, Shonga-Tser Lake, P.T. Tso and rich Monpa culture**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 1, 'Try to cover **Bomdila + Dirang + Sela Pass + Tawang** in overly compressed schedules, leaving insufficient time for **high-altitude acclimatisation, sightseeing and photography**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 2, 'Underestimate the **long mountain-road journey** from Dirang to Tawang, especially the altitude gain through **Sela Pass**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 3, 'Plan **Bum La Pass and nearby lakes** without accounting for **permit requirements, weather, road conditions and vehicle restrictions**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 4, 'Treat **Tawang Monastery** as a short photo stop instead of allowing time to appreciate its **architecture, Buddhist heritage, prayer halls and surrounding mountain landscape**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 5, 'Ignore **Urgelling Monastery**, associated with **6th Dalai Lama Tsangyang Gyatso**, missing an important historical and spiritual site.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 6, 'Attempt **Bum La Pass, Sangetsar Lake and P.T. Tso** without allowing for the effects of **high altitude, cold weather and rapidly changing mountain conditions**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 7, 'Assume every attraction around Tawang can be visited year-round, overlooking **snow, road closures, landslides and seasonal accessibility**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 8, 'Ignore the importance of **acclimatisation**, particularly after travelling from the lower-altitude areas of Assam and Western Arunachal into Tawang''s high-altitude environment.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 9, 'Plan the entire Tawang circuit around sightseeing without keeping **weather and road buffers**, which can make the itinerary stressful when mountain conditions change.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 10, 'Choose accommodation only by price without considering **location, heating, views, parking, road accessibility and proximity to the main market/monastery area**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 11, 'Try to include every lake, pass, monastery and village in a single day instead of creating a **balanced high-altitude itinerary**.'),
  ('tawang', 6833, 12, 'Forget to verify **Arunachal Pradesh Inner Line Permit (ILP)** requirements for eligible domestic visitors and the applicable **Protected Area Permit (PAP)** requirements for foreign nationals.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 0, 'Positions Tawang as a **high-Himalayan Buddhist heritage + dramatic landscape + culture + adventure destination**, rather than simply a monastery sightseeing stop.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 1, 'Prioritizes **Tawang Monastery, Bum La Pass, Sangetsar Lake, P.T. Tso and Urgelling Monastery** for first-time visitors.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 2, 'Uses **Tawang as the principal destination anchor** after Dirang and Sela Pass, allowing sufficient time for acclimatisation and local exploration.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 3, 'Separates **Tawang town sightseeing** from the **Bum La–Sangetsar–P.T. Tso excursion**, instead of attempting everything together.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 4, 'Allocates **3 nights minimum** for a comfortable first-time Tawang experience, with **4 nights** preferable when including multiple high-altitude excursions and relaxed cultural exploration.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 5, 'Keeps **arrival and acclimatisation days relatively light**, particularly after the Dirang–Sela–Tawang drive.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 6, 'Plans **Bum La Pass and surrounding lakes as a dedicated excursion**, checking permits, road conditions, weather and local operating restrictions before departure.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 7, 'Uses **private SUVs/cabs** for families, honeymooners and premium travellers because the Tawang circuit is heavily road-dependent and involves difficult mountain terrain.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 8, 'Builds **weather and road buffers** into the itinerary rather than treating driving times as fixed.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 9, 'Combines **Buddhist heritage + lakes + high-altitude landscapes + Monpa culture** to create a more complete Tawang experience.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 10, 'Uses **early morning and late afternoon** for photography around the monastery, valleys and mountain viewpoints while avoiding unnecessary rushing during high-altitude excursions.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 11, 'Recommends **comfortable accommodation with heating and reliable vehicle access**, especially during colder months.'),
  ('tawang', 6834, 12, 'Treats **Sela Pass and the Dirang–Tawang journey as experiences in themselves**, rather than merely transportation between destinations.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 0, '**Heritage Strategy:** Position Tawang around **Tawang Monastery + Urgelling Monastery + Monpa Buddhist culture**, giving sufficient time for genuine cultural exploration.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 1, '**High-Altitude Strategy:** Keep the first day in Tawang comparatively relaxed and allow the body to adjust before attempting **Bum La Pass and other high-altitude excursions**.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 2, '**Core Experience Strategy:** For first-time visitors, prioritize **Tawang Monastery + Bum La Pass + Sangetsar Lake + P.T. Tso**, with **Urgelling Monastery** added as a cultural extension.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 3, '**Nature Strategy:** Combine **Sangetsar Lake + P.T. Tso + Sela Pass + surrounding Himalayan landscapes** for the strongest scenery-focused itinerary.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 4, '**Adventure Strategy:** Add **Bum La Pass and high-altitude excursions** according to **weather, road conditions, permits and traveller fitness**, rather than treating them as guaranteed daily activities.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 5, '**Circuit Strategy:** Use **Bhalukpong → Bomdila → Dirang → Sela Pass → Tawang** as the principal road circuit, with adequate buffers for mountain travel.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 6, '**Photography Strategy:** Prioritize **Tawang Monastery + Sela Pass + Sangetsar Lake + P.T. Tso + mountain roads + Monpa villages** for photographers.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 7, '**Family Strategy:** Combine **Tawang Monastery + lakes + scenic drives + light cultural sightseeing**, while avoiding excessive high-altitude activity on the same day.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 8, '**Honeymoon Strategy:** Emphasize **private SUV + scenic accommodation + monastery visit + lake excursions + mountain photography + relaxed evenings**, rather than an overpacked sightseeing schedule.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 9, '**Luxury Strategy:** Sell **private chauffeur-driven SUV + premium available accommodation + dedicated local assistance + curated monastery/lake experiences**, while being transparent that Tawang has a **limited luxury-hospitality inventory compared with major Himalayan resort destinations**.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 10, '**Permit Strategy:** Confirm **ILP/PAP requirements and Bum La excursion permissions well before departure**, and verify current local requirements with the relevant authorities/operator.'),
  ('tawang', 6835, 11, '**Weather & Route Buffer Strategy:** Never schedule a critical flight, train or onward connection immediately after the **Tawang–Sela–Dirang mountain journey**; maintain a practical buffer for **snow, landslides, traffic, road restrictions and weather delays**.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 0, 'Visit **Tawang Monastery**, one of the defining cultural and spiritual attractions of the region.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 1, 'Explore **Urgelling Monastery**, traditionally associated with the birthplace of the **6th Dalai Lama, Tsangyang Gyatso**.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 2, 'Experience **Sangetsar Lake (Madhuri Lake)** for its dramatic high-altitude landscape and surrounding mountains.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 3, 'Visit **P.T. Tso** for a quieter alpine-lake experience and spectacular Himalayan scenery.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 4, 'Take the **Bum La Pass** excursion when permits, weather and road conditions allow.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 5, 'Experience **Sela Pass** as part of the journey between **Dirang and Tawang**, rather than treating it merely as a roadside stop.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 6, 'Spend time experiencing **Monpa culture, Buddhist traditions, local villages and regional architecture**.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 7, 'Explore **Tawang War Memorial** for an important connection to the region''s modern military history.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 8, 'Capture **Tawang Monastery, Sangetsar Lake, P.T. Tso, Bum La, Sela Pass, mountain roads and Monpa settlements** through dedicated photography time.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 9, 'Taste **Monpa and Himalayan food such as thukpa, momos, thenthuk, churpi, zan and butter tea**, alongside local and Indian dishes.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 10, 'Allow sufficient time for **quiet monastery visits, scenic drives and Himalayan viewpoints**, rather than continuously moving between attractions.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 11, 'Treat Tawang as the **high-Himalayan cultural and scenic anchor** of the **Bhalukpong–Bomdila–Dirang–Sela–Tawang** circuit.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 12, 'Treating Tawang only as a **one-night monastery stop** and missing its lakes, high-altitude landscapes and cultural attractions.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 13, 'Trying to cover **Tawang Monastery + Bum La + Sangetsar Lake + P.T. Tso** in one rushed day.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 14, 'Underestimating the **long mountain-road journey and altitude gain** from Dirang through Sela Pass to Tawang.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 15, 'Attempting **Bum La or other high-altitude excursions** without checking permits, weather, road conditions and local operating restrictions.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 16, 'Planning tightly timed itineraries during the **monsoon or periods of heavy snowfall**, when mountain roads can become unpredictable.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 17, 'Ignoring **acclimatisation** after arriving in Tawang''s high-altitude environment.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 18, 'Adding strenuous activities to family and senior itineraries without considering **altitude, weather and physical suitability**.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 19, 'Expecting Tawang to provide the **luxury resorts, nightlife and extensive shopping infrastructure of major Indian tourist destinations**.'),
  ('tawang', 6838, 20, 'Choosing accommodation only by price without checking **heating, location, road access, views and vehicle accessibility**.');
