  ('lucknow', 6903, 6, 'Verify elevators and accessible bathrooms at hotels.'),
  ('lucknow', 6903, 7, 'Avoid unnecessary stairs in heritage monuments.'),
  ('lucknow', 6903, 8, 'Use wheelchair assistance at airport and railway station when needed.'),
  ('lucknow', 6904, 0, 'Metro-based travel can substantially reduce road-transfer difficulty on the operational corridor.'),
  ('lucknow', 6904, 1, 'Modern airport facilities, major malls and newer hotels generally provide stronger accessibility than older heritage areas.'),
  ('lucknow', 6904, 2, 'Bhul Bhulaiya involves stairs and is not suitable for every traveler with limited mobility.'),
  ('lucknow', 6904, 3, 'Chowk and older market lanes can be congested and difficult for wheelchairs.'),
  ('lucknow', 6904, 4, 'Residency grounds involve outdoor walking over a large heritage landscape.'),
  ('lucknow', 6904, 5, 'Large parks may offer easier broad pathways but walking distance remains significant.'),
  ('lucknow', 6904, 6, 'Private vehicles are often the most practical solution for travelers with serious mobility restrictions.'),
  ('lucknow', 6904, 7, 'Current lift, escalator and station accessibility should be reverified for actual travel dates.'),
