  ('lucknow', 6930, 0, 'Treat Lucknow as only Bara Imambara + Rumi Darwaza + kebabs and miss the British Residency, Husainabad, Qaiserbagh, Chowk craft culture, La Martiniere, Dilkusha, Sikandar Bagh, Hazratganj and modern Gomti Nagar.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 1, 'Overload Day 1 with BARA_IMAMBARA + BHUL_BHULAIYA + RUMI_DARWAZA + CHOTA_IMAMBARA + RESIDENCY + CHOWK + HAZRATGANJ within one continuous sightseeing day.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 2, 'Try to combine OLD_LUCKNOW_HERITAGE + RESIDENCY + LA_MARTINIERE + GOMTI_NAGAR + KUKRAIL in a short itinerary simply because all lie within the same metropolitan area.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 3, 'Treat Lucknow like a compact walking-only heritage city instead of understanding that sightseeing works best through CLUSTER_BASED_WALKING + METRO + AUTO_E_RICKSHAW + CAB_TRANSFERS.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 4, 'Underestimate road traffic, Old Lucknow congestion, summer heat, large monument grounds and cross-city travel time.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 5, 'Choose a hotel only according to price without considering access to Hazratganj, Old Lucknow, Metro stations, airport, Charbagh and Gomti Nagar.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 6, 'Stay only around Gomti Nagar and modern commercial areas and fail to allocate enough time to Nawabi Old Lucknow.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 7, 'Treat Bara Imambara only as a Bhul Bhulaiya photo stop rather than understanding its monumental hall, Asafi Mosque, Shahi Baoli, architectural importance and famine-relief history.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 8, 'Photograph Rumi Darwaza quickly from the roadside without recognizing its eighteenth-century Nawabi architectural importance and its direct historical connection with the Asafi Imambara complex.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 9, 'Treat Chota Imambara only as another similar monument and miss its highly decorative interiors, royal tombs, chandeliers, religious function and Husainabad setting.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 10, 'Rush the Residency as a generic colonial ruin without understanding its large historic complex, surviving structures, cemetery, museum context and central role in the events of 1857.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 11, 'Treat Chowk only as a kebab destination and ignore Chikankari, Zardozi, ittar, traditional markets, old-city streets and its importance to Lucknow''s living cultural identity.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 12, 'Assume all Chikankari sold in tourist-oriented markets is equivalent in craftsmanship, production method and quality.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 13, 'Treat Lucknow cuisine as only Galouti kebab and biryani instead of including Kakori kebab, nihari-kulcha, korma, sheermal, chaat, traditional sweets and seasonal makhan malai.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 14, 'Schedule all major food experiences immediately after one another rather than spreading them across breakfast, lunch, snacks and dinner.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 15, 'Visit Chowk or Aminabad with a large vehicle and expect convenient door-to-door movement through congested market streets.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 16, 'Ignore Qaiserbagh because individual surviving structures appear less immediately iconic than Bara Imambara, despite its importance to Nawabi royal urban history.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 17, 'Ignore La Martiniere and Dilkusha because they do not fit the conventional Indo-Islamic image of Lucknow and consequently miss an important European and hybrid architectural layer.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 18, 'Treat Sikandar Bagh only as a garden rather than recognizing its Wajid Ali Shah-era history and major connection with the fighting of 1857.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 19, 'Schedule large exposed monuments and market walking during the hottest April–June afternoon hours.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 20, 'Ignore monsoon rainfall and humidity when creating tightly packed July–September outdoor itineraries.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 21, 'Ignore winter fog when scheduling early-morning airport, railway or inter-city departures in December and January.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 22, 'Assume every historical monument, market lane, staircase and old building is automatically wheelchair-accessible.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 23, 'Use Metro for every sightseeing movement despite many important heritage sites requiring road or last-mile connections.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 24, 'Use private cars for every short Old Lucknow movement despite narrow streets, parking difficulty and pedestrian congestion.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 25, 'Add unnecessary hotel changes between Hazratganj, Gomti Nagar and Old Lucknow during a short city stay.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 26, 'Treat Lucknow solely as an old-city heritage destination and ignore its large parks, modern commercial districts, contemporary urban landscape and family-oriented recreational spaces.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('lucknow', 6930, 27, 'Treat Lucknow as a major adventure destination instead of positioning it primarily around CULTURE + HISTORY + FOOD + SHOPPING + ARCHITECTURE.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 28, 'Rush shopping at the end of the trip without allocating dedicated time for Chikankari quality comparison, fittings and craft selection.'),
  ('lucknow', 6930, 29, 'Design itineraries around maximum monument count rather than geographically grouped heritage, food and shopping experiences.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around BARA_IMAMBARA_RUMI_DARWAZA + HUSAINABAD_CHOTA_IMAMBARA + RESIDENCY + CHOWK_FOOD_AND_CRAFT + HAZRATGANJ.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 1, 'Gives Bara Imambara enough time for the monumental hall, Bhul Bhulaiya, Asafi Mosque, Shahi Baoli and architectural interpretation rather than treating the complex as a quick labyrinth visit.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 2, 'Combines RUMI_DARWAZA + BARA_IMAMBARA + HUSAINABAD geographically rather than moving repeatedly across the city.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 3, 'Gives Chota Imambara enough time for its decorative interiors, courtyard, tombs, chandeliers and Shia religious heritage.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 4, 'Treats the RESIDENCY as a dedicated 1857_HISTORY_AND_ARCHAEOLOGY block and allows time for the ruins, landscape and museum context.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 5, 'Uses QAISERBAGH_AND_CHATTAR_MANZIL_AREA for deeper Nawabi royal architecture, urban history and repeat-visitor itineraries.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 6, 'Uses CHOWK_AND_AKBARI_GATE for AWADHI_CUISINE + CHIKANKARI + ZARDOZI + ITTAR + OLD_CITY_ATMOSPHERE rather than only one famous food outlet.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 7, 'Uses AMINABAD selectively for value shopping, textiles, Chikankari and street-food atmosphere.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 8, 'Uses HAZRATGANJ for central accommodation, Metro convenience, evening walking, shopping, cafés and selected heritage.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 9, 'Uses LA_MARTINIERE + DILKUSHA for European-influenced architecture, nineteenth-century history, photography and 1857 context.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 10, 'Uses SIKANDAR_BAGH as part of a broader 1857 or Wajid Ali Shah-era historical itinerary rather than treating it as an isolated stop.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 11, 'Uses GOMTI_NAGAR for premium accommodation, modern restaurants, shopping and contemporary-city experiences rather than replacing Old Lucknow sightseeing with it.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 12, 'Uses AMBEDKAR_MEMORIAL + JANESHWAR_MISHRA_PARK to balance monument-heavy family itineraries with open landscaped spaces.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 13, 'Uses KUKRAIL selectively for family, green-space and nature-oriented travelers rather than positioning it as a first-time essential.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 14, 'Uses METRO for the airport–Charbagh–Hazratganj corridor and other suitable station-based movements.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 15, 'Uses APP_CABS_OR_PRIVATE_CARS for cross-city heritage clusters, families, seniors, luxury travelers and hot-weather sightseeing.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 16, 'Uses AUTO_RICKSHAWS_AND_E_RICKSHAWS selectively for short local connections where road conditions and luggage permit.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 17, 'Walks inside individual heritage and market clusters rather than attempting long cross-city pedestrian routes.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 18, 'Schedules OLD_LUCKNOW early morning or later afternoon during hot periods and reserves midday for lunch, hotel rest, shopping or indoor attractions.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 19, 'Matches Residency, parks and exposed monuments to cooler daylight periods.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 20, 'Uses winter morning flexibility because fog can affect visibility and road, rail and air operations.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 21, 'Uses monsoon flexibility because June–September accounts for the majority of Lucknow''s annual rainfall.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 22, 'Builds gastronomy across multiple meal periods rather than converting one evening into an excessive food checklist.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 23, 'Includes at least one proper AWADHI_MEAL alongside street-food sampling.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 24, 'Distinguishes authentic Chikankari craftsmanship from mass-produced embroidered retail and allows time to compare work quality.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 25, 'Keeps substantial free time for cafés, shopping, sweets, photography and spontaneous exploration.'),
  ('lucknow', 6931, 26, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 0, 'WALKING for Bara Imambara–Rumi Darwaza–Husainabad circuits, Residency grounds, Hazratganj, Chowk inner lanes and selected Qaiserbagh heritage areas'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 1, 'LUCKNOW_METRO for airport, Alambagh, Charbagh, Hazratganj and other movements aligned with the operational corridor'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 2, 'AUTO_RICKSHAWS_AND_E_RICKSHAWS for short local connections where luggage, traffic and road access permit'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 3, 'APP_BASED_CABS for cross-city transfers, hot-weather travel, evening journeys and travelers carrying luggage'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 4, 'PRIVATE_AC_CAR selectively for families, seniors, luxury travel and multi-cluster sightseeing'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 5, 'RAIL for arrival/departure through Lucknow Charbagh and Lucknow Junction'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 6, 'INTERCITY_ROAD_OR_RAIL for onward Uttar Pradesh / Awadh extensions'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 7, 'Bara Imambara + Bhul Bhulaiya + Shahi Baoli'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 8, 'Rumi Darwaza + Husainabad heritage corridor'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 9, 'Chota Imambara'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 10, 'British Residency and 1857 history'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 11, 'Chowk food + Chikankari experience'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 12, 'Authentic Awadhi meal including kebab / biryani / korma traditions'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 13, 'Hazratganj evening walk'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 14, 'Qaiserbagh or related Nawabi royal heritage'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 15, 'La Martiniere + Dilkusha for Lucknow''s Indo-European architectural layer'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 16, 'Dedicated Chikankari shopping with quality comparison'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 17, 'Do not treat Lucknow as only Bara Imambara + Rumi Darwaza + kebab tasting while skipping Residency, Husainabad, Qaiserbagh, Chowk and its wider cultural heritage.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 18, 'Do not force Bara Imambara + Chota Imambara + Residency + La Martiniere + Chowk + Gomti Nagar into a single rushed day.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 19, 'Do not underestimate road traffic and cross-city transfer time between Old Lucknow, central districts and Gomti Nagar.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 20, 'Do not schedule Bara Imambara, Residency, Dilkusha, markets and large parks during the hottest April–June afternoon hours when early-morning and evening alternatives are available.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 21, 'Do not treat Galouti kebab as Lucknow''s complete culinary identity and miss Kakori kebab, biryani, nihari, korma, breads, chaat and seasonal specialties.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 22, 'Do not treat Chikankari as generic machine embroidery without considering handwork, stitch quality, fabric, finishing and provenance.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 23, 'Do not attempt to use Metro as the only transport solution because many major heritage attractions still require road or last-mile connections.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 24, 'Do not rely exclusively on private cars inside congested Chowk and Aminabad lanes where walking or short local transport can be more practical.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 25, 'Do not choose distant accommodation solely for a slightly lower nightly rate without calculating cross-city travel time.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 26, 'Do not assume every imambara, historic staircase, market lane, ruin or monument is fully wheelchair-accessible.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 27, 'Do not underestimate Bhul Bhulaiya stairs and internal navigation for young children, seniors or travelers with mobility limitations.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 28, 'Do not ignore winter fog when scheduling tightly timed early-morning flights, trains or road transfers.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 29, 'Do not ignore monsoon rainfall when creating tightly scheduled July–September outdoor sightseeing.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 30, 'Do not treat Lucknow solely as an Islamic or Nawabi monument destination and overlook its composite cultural traditions, colonial history, modern cityscape and broader religious diversity.'),
  ('lucknow', 6934, 31, 'Do not add Ayodhya, Varanasi, Prayagraj or other regional excursions to very short Lucknow stays before allocating enough time to Lucknow itself.'),
  ('lucknow', 6935, 0, 'District Lucknow / Government of Uttar Pradesh — Official destination history, Nawabi-era architectural development, cultural heritage, visitor attractions and tourism information.'),
  ('lucknow', 6935, 1, 'District Lucknow Tourist Places — Official listings covering Bara Imambara-related heritage, Chota Imambara, La Martiniere, Dilkusha Palace, Sikandar Bagh, Sibtainabad, Saadat Ali Khan heritage and other Lucknow attractions.'),
  ('lucknow', 6935, 2, 'District Lucknow Culture & Heritage — Official information on Lucknowi Tehzeeb, Urdu, Nawabi cultural patronage, Kathak, music, poetry, festivals, Chowk and associated cultural traditions.'),
  ('lucknow', 6935, 3, 'District Lucknow How to Reach — Official information for Chaudhary Charan Singh International Airport, Lucknow Charbagh Railway Station, Lucknow Junction and road connectivity.'),
  ('lucknow', 6935, 4, 'Lucknow Metro / relevant urban-transport authorities — Operational Metro routes, station facilities, fares, accessibility and service information where applicable.'),
  ('lucknow', 6935, 5, 'Archaeological Survey of India / relevant monument authorities — Heritage conservation and monument-specific operational information where applicable.'),
  ('lucknow', 6935, 6, 'Relevant airport, railway, park and attraction authorities — Current schedules, visitor access, operational restrictions and facility information where applicable.'),
