  ('ayodhya', 7071, 0, 'Treat Ayodhya as a 2-hour stopover only for Ram Janmabhoomi darshan, completely missing the sunset Saryu Aarti at Naya Ghat, illuminated Ram Ki Paidi, and historic Faizabad Nawabi heritage.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 1, 'Overload Day 1 with Hanuman Garhi, Ram Janmabhoomi, Kanak Bhawan, Dashrath Mahal, Treta Ke Thakur, and Guptar Ghat all within a single morning window.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 2, 'Try to combine Ayodhya + Varanasi + Prayagraj + Naimisharanya in a 3-day itinerary simply because regional highways look short on a map.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 3, 'Rely entirely on private cars inside inner-city pilgrim zones, ignoring heavy traffic diversions, pedestrianized corridors (Ram Path, Bhakti Path, Janmabhoomi Path), and budget e-rickshaws.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 4, 'Underestimate advance VIP pass booking rules and strict phone/electronic security bans inside the Ram Janmabhoomi Mandir complex during festival seasons.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 5, 'Treat Ayodhya''s climate as uniform and ignore seasonal extremes between scorching summer heat (exceeding 42°C in May–June), monsoon river surges, and dense winter fog.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 6, 'Plan outdoor ghat walks, open-air Ram Ki Paidi light shows, or Suraj Kund visits without checking seasonal weather forecasts, heavy rainfall days, or extreme festival crowd surges (Deepotsav, Ram Navami).'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 7, 'Ignore authentic Awadhi satvik gastronomy by treating meals only as basic hotel buffets instead of scheduling authentic Bedmi Puri, Aloo Kachori, Makhan Malai, Dahi Jalebi, Tehri, and Ayodhya Peda.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 8, 'Schedule excessive hotel moves between Ayodhya Dham and Faizabad town even when a single base near Ram Path or Saryu Riverfront serves the entire twin-city zone efficiently.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7071, 9, 'Assume every ancient temple staircase (like Hanuman Garhi''s 76 steps), river ghat, and historic haveli entrance is automatically step-free or fully wheelchair accessible.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around RAM_JANMABHOOMI_MANDIR + HANUMAN_GARHI + KANAK_BHAWAN + SARYU_RIVER_AARTI_AND_RAM_KI_PAIDI.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 1, 'Gives Shri Ram Janmabhoomi Mandir and Janmabhoomi Path enough time for security clearance, locker storage, and peaceful darshan without rushing.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 2, 'Gives Guptar Ghat or Surya Kund trips enough time for HISTORIC_PROMENADE_STROLL + SUNSET_BOAT_RIDE + HERITAGE_GARDEN_VISITS rather than treating them as rushed side trips.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 3, 'Adds GULAB_BARI & BAHU_BEGUM_KA_MAQBARA in Faizabad for 18th-century Awadhi Nawabi history and Mughal garden architecture.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 4, 'Uses RAM_KATHA_MUSEUM / TULSI_SMARAK_BHAWAN selectively when Ramayana manuscripts, excavated artifacts, and live Ramlila performances are the focus.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 5, 'Uses MANI_PARVAT / JAIN_TIRTHANKARA_SHRINES / SARYU_ECO_PARK when elevated city views, ancient Jain birthplaces, and nature trails are preferred.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 6, 'Uses ELECTRIC_GOLF_CARTS and E_RICSKSHAWS for inner-city transit, and private chauffeured AC SUVs for airport transfers (AYJ) and intercity connections.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 7, 'Keeps time for Lata Mangeshkar Chowk cafes, traditional sweet shops, riverfront plazas, and relaxed ghat strolling.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 8, 'Matches outdoor temple walking, boat cruises, and evening laser shows to seasonal weather, crowd surges, and daylight conditions.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7072, 9, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 0, 'WALKING + E_RICKS'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 1, 'UPSRTC_ELECTRIC_BUSES for budget eco-friendly transit between Ayodhya Dham station, Airport, and major ghat hubs'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 2, 'PRIVATE_TAXIS / AUTO_RICKS'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 3, 'SARAYU_RIVER_BOATS_AND_CRUISES for scenic water transit between Ram ki Paidi, Naya Ghat, and Guptar Ghat'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 4, 'INDIAN_RAILWAYS_EXPRESS_SERVICES for high-speed train connections via redeveloped Ayodhya Dham Junction (AY) and Ayodhya Cantt (AYC)'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 5, 'DOMESTIC_FLIGHTS via Maharishi Valmiki International Airport (AYJ) connecting Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Ahmedabad, and major Indian metros'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 6, 'Shri Ram Janmabhoomi Mandir grand darshan & Nagara architectural view'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 7, 'Hanuman Garhi hill-temple blessing & panoramic town overview'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 8, 'Evening Sarayu River Maha Aarti & lighted Ram ki Paidi promenade walk'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 9, 'Kanak Bhawan ornate gold-carved shrine & divine art viewing'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 10, 'Guptar Ghat historical sunset stroll & eco-park heritage tour'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 11, 'Takamaka-style traditional Sattvik Awadhi Thali & local Ayodhya Pedha tasting'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 12, 'Surya Kund ancient stepwell heritage site & light show experience'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 13, 'Ram Katha Park cultural pavilion & live Ramayana theatrical performance'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 14, 'Saryu River boating or electric cruise boat experience'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 15, 'Mani Parvat historic mound & ancient Buddhist-Hindu heritage exploration'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 16, 'Do not treat Ayodhya as just a 2-hour stopover while skipping evening Sarayu Aarti and heritage ghat circuits.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 17, 'Do not force Ram Janmabhoomi + Hanuman Garhi + Guptar Ghat + Surya Kund + Chhoti Devkali all into a single rushed morning.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 18, 'Do not attempt carrying smartphones, leather items, or large bags into strict security zones around Shri Ram Janmabhoomi (use free locker facilities).'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 19, 'Do not rely solely on heavy motor vehicles inside pedestrianized heritage corridors during peak festive days.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 20, 'Do not visit open river ghats during scorching summer afternoons without sun protection and hydration.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 21, 'Do not plan major temple visits during peak festival days without checking official slot guidelines and crowd control alerts.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 22, 'Do not miss local Awadhi sweet delicacies and Sattvik street snacks by eating only fast food chain offerings.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 23, 'Do not assume ancient temple staircases, high ghat steps, and historic stepwells are fully step-free without checking accessibility ramps.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7075, 24, 'Do not ignore physical scale; pedestrian paths and multi-kilometer sacred corridors require comfortable walking shoes.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7076, 0, 'UP Tourism (uptourism.gov.in) — Official government tourism board details covering sacred ghats, Ramayan circuit sites, cultural festivals, and heritage itineraries.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7076, 1, 'Sri Ram Janmabhoomi Teerth Kshetra & Hanuman Garhi Trust — Official darshan guidelines, opening schedules, locker policies, and security updates for major temples.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7076, 2, 'Ayodhya Development Authority (ADA) & UPSRTC — Urban bus transit networks, battery rickshaw corridors, and Master Plan 2031 infrastructure updates.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7076, 3, 'India Meteorological Department (IMD) — Seasonal climate data, summer heat protocols, and winter fog advisories.'),
  ('ayodhya', 7076, 4, 'Official transportation operators — Maharishi Valmiki International Airport (AYJ), Indian Railways (Ayodhya Dham Junction), and Sarayu River Cruise Authority.'),
