  ('jodhpur', 7234, 0, 'Treat Jaipur as only a **fort-and-palace destination**, creating repetitive sightseeing and missing food, shopping, culture and leisure experiences.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7234, 1, 'Pack **Amber Fort, Jaigarh, Nahargarh, City Palace and multiple bazaars** into one day, creating excessive driving, walking and rushed visits.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7234, 2, 'Ignore **extreme summer heat** while planning long outdoor sightseeing days during April–June.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7234, 3, 'Visit **Amber Fort, City Palace and Jantar Mantar** during peak afternoon hours, reducing comfort and photography opportunities.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7234, 4, 'Treat **Hawa Mahal, City Palace and Jantar Mantar** as quick photo stops instead of allowing enough time for their heritage value.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7234, 5, 'Underestimate **winter crowds, wedding demand and hotel price increases**, especially during December–February.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7234, 6, 'Focus entirely on sightseeing and underestimate the value of **heritage hotels, rooftop dining, spa time and cultural evenings**.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7234, 7, 'Plan extensive shopping without allocating sufficient **time and separate shopping budget**, particularly for jewellery and handicrafts.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7235, 0, 'Positions Jaipur as a **royal heritage destination** combining architecture, culture, food, shopping, photography and luxury experiences.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7235, 1, 'Groups attractions geographically to minimize **backtracking and unnecessary city travel**.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7235, 2, 'Prioritizes **Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal and Jantar Mantar** for first-time visitors, then adds Nahargarh, Jaigarh, Jal Mahal and Albert Hall according to interests.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7235, 3, 'Plans major forts and outdoor attractions during **early morning or late afternoon**, especially during warmer months.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7235, 4, 'Keeps **summer itineraries shorter and flexible**, with midday hotel breaks, indoor attractions and evening sightseeing.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7235, 5, 'Uses **October–March** as the primary sightseeing window while recognizing that peak winter demand can increase prices and crowds.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7235, 6, 'Builds in **local food, bazaar walks, rooftop dining and Rajasthani cultural experiences** instead of filling every hour with monuments.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7235, 7, 'Uses **private vehicles for fort circuits** and combines walking, autos and taxis within the historic city to improve efficiency.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7236, 0, '**Heritage Strategy:** Sell Jaipur as a **royal cultural experience** rather than a checklist of forts and palaces.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7236, 1, '**Route Logistics:** Cluster **Amber–Jaigarh–Nahargarh** separately from the **City Palace–Jantar Mantar–Hawa Mahal** circuit to reduce backtracking.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7236, 2, '**Heat Strategy:** Prioritize **October–March** for comfortable sightseeing; keep April–June outdoor schedules short and avoid intense midday exposure.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7236, 3, '**Crowd Strategy:** Visit major monuments **early morning or later afternoon** and pre-plan high-demand attractions during peak winter periods.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7236, 4, '**Itinerary Balance:** **4–6 key attractions + food + shopping + leisure + cultural experience** works better than continuous sightseeing.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7236, 5, '**Experience Strategy:** For couples and families, combine **royal heritage + Rajasthani cuisine + shopping + photography + relaxed hotel time** rather than maximizing attraction count.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7236, 6, '**Luxury Strategy:** For premium travellers, emphasize **heritage-palace accommodation + private chauffeur + guided sightseeing + spa + fine dining + curated cultural experiences**.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 0, 'Explore **Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal and Jantar Mantar** in Jaipur.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 1, 'Experience the magnificent **Mehrangarh Fort and Blue City** of Jodhpur.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 2, 'Enjoy the lakes, palaces and romantic atmosphere of **Udaipur**, particularly around Lake Pichola.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 3, 'Experience a **Thar Desert sunset, camel safari and desert camp** around Jaisalmer.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 4, 'Explore **Jaisalmer Fort**, one of Rajasthan''s most distinctive living forts.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 5, 'Visit **Bikaner''s Junagarh Fort** and experience its traditional food and desert culture.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 6, 'Combine the spiritual atmosphere of **Ajmer Sharif and Pushkar** with Pushkar Lake and its historic temples.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 7, 'Go on a **wildlife safari in Ranthambore** for the possibility of seeing Bengal tigers and other wildlife.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 8, 'Explore **Chittorgarh Fort** for one of Rajasthan''s most important Rajput historical experiences.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 9, 'Visit **Keoladeo National Park in Bharatpur** for birdwatching and wetland wildlife.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 10, 'Experience the hill-station character and forests of **Mount Abu**, including Nakki Lake and the Dilwara Temples.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 11, 'Taste regional specialties including **dal baati churma, laal maas, gatte ki sabzi, ker sangri, pyaaz kachori, mirchi bada and ghevar**.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 12, 'Allocate dedicated time for **textiles, jewellery, handicrafts, blue pottery, block prints, leather goods and traditional Rajasthani products**.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 13, 'Include at least one **Rajasthani cultural performance, folk-music evening or traditional dining experience**.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 14, 'Trying to cover **all 11 destinations** in one short trip.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 15, 'Treating Rajasthan as a single homogeneous destination—**Jaipur, Jodhpur, Udaipur, Jaisalmer, Ranthambore and Mount Abu offer very different experiences**.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 16, 'Planning long outdoor sightseeing schedules during **April–June**, when daytime temperatures can become extremely uncomfortable.'),
  ('jodhpur', 7239, 17, 'Underestimating the **distance and travel time between cities**, particularly on road-based itineraries.');
