  ('jaisalmer', 7280, 0, 'Treat Jaisalmer as only a **desert safari destination**, missing its exceptional **living fort, havelis, Jain heritage and old-city culture**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7280, 1, 'Pack **Jaisalmer Fort, multiple havelis, Bada Bagh, Kuldhara and Sam Sand Dunes** into one day, creating excessive walking and rushed sightseeing.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7280, 2, 'Ignore **Thar Desert heat**, especially during April–June, when Rajasthan temperatures can become extremely high.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7280, 3, 'Visit **Sam Sand Dunes** in the harsh afternoon instead of timing the desert experience around **late afternoon, sunset and evening**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7280, 4, 'Treat **Jaisalmer Fort and Patwon Ki Haveli** as quick photo stops instead of allowing enough time for their architecture and heritage.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7280, 5, 'Underestimate **winter demand and seasonal desert-camp pricing**, particularly around December–February and festival periods.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7280, 6, 'Focus only on monuments and safaris while missing **rooftop dining, Rajasthani food, folk performances and evening cultural experiences**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7280, 7, 'Book a desert camp without checking **location, inclusions, camel/jeep activities, transfers and cultural-program timings**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7281, 0, 'Positions Jaisalmer as a **golden-city heritage + Thar Desert experience**, combining architecture, culture, photography, adventure and relaxation.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7281, 1, 'Groups the **Fort, Jain Temples, Patwon Ki Haveli, Nathmal Ki Haveli and Salim Singh Ki Haveli** into a logical Old City heritage circuit.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7281, 2, 'Prioritizes **Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon Ki Haveli, Gadisar Lake, Bada Bagh and Sam Sand Dunes** for first-time visitors.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7281, 3, 'Plans **city sightseeing in the morning** and **desert activities from late afternoon toward sunset**, especially during warmer periods.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7281, 4, 'Keeps **April–June itineraries shorter**, with early starts, midday rest and limited outdoor exposure.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7281, 5, 'Uses **October–March** as the preferred period for desert camping and comfortable sightseeing; Rajasthan Tourism specifically identifies this as the ideal camping season.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7281, 6, 'Builds in **Rajasthani food, rooftop evenings, folk performances, shopping and photography** instead of filling every hour with monuments.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7281, 7, 'Uses **walking/auto-rickshaws for the Old City** and **private taxi/SUV for Bada Bagh, Kuldhara, Lodurva and the Sam desert circuit**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7282, 0, '**Heritage Strategy:** Sell Jaisalmer as a **Golden City + Thar Desert cultural experience**, not simply a fort-and-camel destination.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7282, 1, '**Route Logistics:** Cluster **Fort–Jain Temples–Havelis–Gadisar Lake** separately from the **Bada Bagh–Kuldhara–Sam Desert** circuit to reduce unnecessary driving.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7282, 2, '**Heat Strategy:** Prioritize **October–March** for comfortable sightseeing and desert camping; keep summer outdoor schedules short.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7282, 3, '**Desert Strategy:** Schedule **Sam Sand Dunes around sunset**, with camel safari, jeep/dune activities and an optional overnight camp. RTDC itineraries similarly place the Sam excursion in the afternoon for sunset.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7282, 4, '**Itinerary Balance:** **4–6 key heritage attractions + desert experience + food + shopping + leisure** works better than continuous sightseeing.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7282, 5, '**Experience Strategy:** For couples and families, combine **heritage + desert sunset + Rajasthani cuisine + photography + cultural evening**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7282, 6, '**Luxury Strategy:** For premium travellers, emphasize **heritage accommodation + luxury desert camp + private chauffeur + private guide + curated dining + exclusive desert experiences**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 0, 'Explore **Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal and Jantar Mantar** in Jaipur.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 1, 'Experience the magnificent **Mehrangarh Fort and Blue City** of Jodhpur.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 2, 'Enjoy the lakes, palaces and romantic atmosphere of **Udaipur**, particularly around Lake Pichola.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 3, 'Experience a **Thar Desert sunset, camel safari and desert camp** around Jaisalmer.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 4, 'Explore **Jaisalmer Fort**, one of Rajasthan''s most distinctive living forts.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 5, 'Visit **Bikaner''s Junagarh Fort** and experience its traditional food and desert culture.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 6, 'Combine the spiritual atmosphere of **Ajmer Sharif and Pushkar** with Pushkar Lake and its historic temples.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 7, 'Go on a **wildlife safari in Ranthambore** for the possibility of seeing Bengal tigers and other wildlife.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 8, 'Explore **Chittorgarh Fort** for one of Rajasthan''s most important Rajput historical experiences.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 9, 'Visit **Keoladeo National Park in Bharatpur** for birdwatching and wetland wildlife.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 10, 'Experience the hill-station character and forests of **Mount Abu**, including Nakki Lake and the Dilwara Temples.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 11, 'Taste regional specialties including **dal baati churma, laal maas, gatte ki sabzi, ker sangri, pyaaz kachori, mirchi bada and ghevar**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 12, 'Allocate dedicated time for **textiles, jewellery, handicrafts, blue pottery, block prints, leather goods and traditional Rajasthani products**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 13, 'Include at least one **Rajasthani cultural performance, folk-music evening or traditional dining experience**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 14, 'Trying to cover **all 11 destinations** in one short trip.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 15, 'Treating Rajasthan as a single homogeneous destination—**Jaipur, Jodhpur, Udaipur, Jaisalmer, Ranthambore and Mount Abu offer very different experiences**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 16, 'Planning long outdoor sightseeing schedules during **April–June**, when daytime temperatures can become extremely uncomfortable.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 17, 'Underestimating the **distance and travel time between cities**, particularly on road-based itineraries.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 18, 'Spending only a few hours in Jaisalmer while trying to include the desert experience.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 19, 'Visiting multiple forts and palaces consecutively without balancing the itinerary with **food, markets, cultural experiences and leisure**.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 20, 'Assuming every desert or wildlife activity is available year-round or under identical weather conditions.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 21, 'Booking winter accommodation and desert camps too late during **November–February**, when demand is strongest.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 22, 'Overpacking the itinerary with distant destinations instead of allowing sufficient time to experience each city.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7285, 23, 'Ignoring **early-morning starts** for major forts, wildlife safaris and desert activities.'),
  ('jaisalmer', 7286, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 0, 'Stay around **Ranthambore Road / Sawai Madhopur / Sherpur** for convenient safari access.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 1, 'Choose **Canter safari** instead of Gypsy when budget is the priority.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 2, 'Book safari permits through the **Rajasthan Forest Department''s official system**.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 3, 'Combine **Ranthambore Fort + Trinetra Ganesh Temple**.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 4, 'Group nearby sightseeing rather than taking separate taxis.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 5, 'Use local restaurants for economical meals.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 6, 'Travel outside peak winter weekends for better hotel value.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 7, 'Book safari and accommodation early because Ranthambore is highly popular.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 8, 'Choosing an unreliable safari operator.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 9, 'Booking the cheapest accommodation far from safari gates.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 10, 'Skipping advance safari reservations.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 11, 'Taking multiple unnecessary private transfers.'),
  ('ranthambore', 7291, 12, 'Choosing a safari without checking vehicle type and inclusions.'),
