  ('amritsar', 7374, 0, 'Treat Amritsar as only GOLDEN_TEMPLE + ATTARI_WAGAH and miss Jallianwala Bagh, Partition Museum, Gobindgarh Fort, Durgiana Temple, Ram Bagh, old-city bazaars, Punjabi food and Sikh Empire heritage.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 1, 'Overload Day 1 with GOLDEN_TEMPLE + JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM + GOBINDGARH_FORT + ATTARI_WAGAH.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 2, 'Try to combine CENTRAL_HERITAGE_CORE + ATTARI_WAGAH + PUL_KANJARI + RURAL_PUNJAB in one sightseeing day simply because all belong to the Amritsar region.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 3, 'Treat Amritsar as a fully car-based destination instead of using WALKING + E_RICKSHAW_AUTO + PRIVATE_CAR_BY_CLUSTER.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 4, 'Underestimate Golden Temple pilgrimage crowds, old-city congestion, security procedures, market traffic and Attari–Wagah waiting time.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 5, 'Choose a hotel only by proximity to the Golden Temple without checking vehicle access, luggage handling, lane width, parking and final walking distance.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 6, 'Stay deep inside the heritage core with heavy luggage, young children or mobility limitations without planning last-mile access.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 7, 'Visit the Golden Temple only during busy midday hours and miss early-morning or illuminated evening atmosphere.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 8, 'Treat Golden Temple langar as a tourist attraction rather than a functioning Sikh institution based on equality, community service and religious tradition.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 9, 'Rush Jallianwala Bagh as a quick photo stop instead of allowing time to understand the April 1919 massacre and its importance to India''s freedom struggle.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 10, 'Skip the Partition Museum even though it provides essential context for Punjab and the human consequences of the 1947 Partition.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 11, 'Treat the Attari–Wagah ceremony as a quick roadside stop and underestimate road travel, security screening, seating and waiting requirements.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 12, 'Assume every phulkari, Punjabi jutti or textile sold near the tourist core has equivalent craftsmanship and authenticity.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 13, 'Treat Amritsari cuisine only as kulcha and lassi and miss dhaba traditions, Amritsari fish, tandoori food, Punjabi vegetarian dishes, sweets and seasonal cuisine.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 14, 'Schedule long old-city walks, border excursions and exposed heritage sightseeing during the hottest May–June afternoons.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 15, 'Ignore monsoon humidity and rainfall when planning July–September outdoor sightseeing.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 16, 'Ignore winter fog when tightly scheduling flights, trains, early road transfers or long-distance onward journeys during December and January.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 17, 'Assume every temple, fort, bazaar lane and historic site is automatically wheelchair-accessible.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 18, 'Use private cars for every short central movement even where walking or e-rickshaws are more efficient.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 19, 'Schedule too many heavy Punjabi meals consecutively rather than spreading culinary experiences across breakfast, lunch, snacks and dinner.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 20, 'Add Dharamshala, Dalhousie, Chandigarh or other regional destinations before allocating enough time to Amritsar itself.'),
  ('amritsar', 7374, 21, 'Design itineraries around maximum attraction count instead of combining SPIRITUAL_HERITAGE + HISTORY + FOOD + BORDER_EXPERIENCE + FREE_TIME.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around GOLDEN_TEMPLE_AKAL_TAKHT + JALLIANWALA_PARTITION + ATTARI_WAGAH.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 1, 'Gives the Golden Temple enough time for entry procedures, head covering, shoe deposit, Amrit Sarovar, Akal Takht, langar and quiet observation rather than treating it as a quick landmark stop.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 2, 'Combines GOLDEN_TEMPLE + HERITAGE_STREET + JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM geographically.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 3, 'Uses EARLY_MORNING_OR_EVENING_GOLDEN_TEMPLE for atmosphere, photography and reduced heat.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 4, 'Treats JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM as complementary historical experiences rather than interchangeable attractions.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 5, 'Gives ATTARI_WAGAH a dedicated half day because the border is roughly 30+ km from central Amritsar and ceremony visits involve security and waiting time.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 6, 'Uses GOBINDGARH_FORT + RAM_BAGH for Sikh Empire context and longer first-time stays.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 7, 'Uses DURGIANA_TEMPLE selectively for religious diversity and Hindu pilgrimage interest.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 8, 'Uses HALL_BAZAAR + KATRA_JAIMAL_SINGH for SHOPPING + FOOD + TRADITIONAL_CITY_LIFE rather than one isolated souvenir outlet.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 9, 'Includes a reputable PHULKARI_OR_TRADITIONAL_TEXTILE experience rather than only tourist-front retail.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 10, 'Uses PUL_KANJARI and rural Punjab selectively for repeat visitors, photographers and Sikh Empire interests.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 11, 'Uses WALKING inside the Golden Temple heritage cluster, E_RICKSHAW_AUTO for short city links and PRIVATE_CAR for airport, Attari and outer-city sightseeing.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 12, 'Uses knowledgeable local guides for Sikh heritage, Jallianwala Bagh, Partition history and specialized cultural interpretation.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 13, 'Schedules old-city and religious sightseeing early morning or evening during hot periods and keeps midday for food, museums, hotel rest or indoor experiences.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 14, 'Keeps additional time buffers during Gurpurabs, Baisakhi and other major pilgrimage or festival periods.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 15, 'Spreads Amritsari gastronomy across kulcha breakfast, traditional lunch, snacks, sweets and dinner.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 16, 'Distinguishes genuine handcrafted phulkari, textile quality and Punjabi juttis from mass-produced tourist merchandise.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 17, 'Keeps free time for Golden Temple atmosphere, food, bazaars, photography and spontaneous exploration.'),
  ('amritsar', 7375, 18, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 0, 'WALKING for Golden Temple, Akal Takht, Heritage Street, Jallianwala Bagh, Partition Museum and compact old-city circuits');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('amritsar', 7378, 1, 'E_RICKSHAWS_AND_AUTO_RICKSHAWS for short urban connections and heritage-core last-mile movement'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 2, 'APP_BASED_CABS_AND_TAXIS for airport, railway, hotel and cross-city transfers where available'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 3, 'PRIVATE_AC_CAR selectively for families, seniors, luxury travelers, Attari–Wagah, Pul Kanjari and outer-city touring'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 4, 'ORGANIZED_OR_SHARED_BORDER_TRANSFERS selectively for budget Attari–Wagah visits'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 5, 'LOCAL_BUSES selectively for suitable urban and suburban routes'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 6, 'RAIL for arrival / departure through Amritsar Junction and wider Punjab / North India connectivity'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 7, 'INTERCITY_ROAD_OR_RAIL for Chandigarh, Dharamshala, Jammu and broader North India extensions'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 8, 'Sri Harmandir Sahib / Golden Temple + Amrit Sarovar'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 9, 'Akal Takht + Sikh religious context'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 10, 'Golden Temple during early morning or evening illumination'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 11, 'Guru Ka Langar experience approached respectfully'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 12, 'Jallianwala Bagh'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 13, 'Partition Museum'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 14, 'Attari–Wagah evening retreat ceremony'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 15, 'Heritage Street + Old Amritsar walking'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 16, 'Amritsari kulcha + lassi + wider Punjabi food experience'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 17, 'Gobindgarh Fort, Ram Bagh or Maharaja Ranjit Singh heritage according to available time'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 18, 'Do not treat Amritsar as only GOLDEN_TEMPLE + ATTARI_WAGAH while skipping Jallianwala Bagh, Partition Museum, Sikh Empire heritage, food and old-city culture.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 19, 'Do not force Golden Temple + Jallianwala Bagh + Partition Museum + Gobindgarh Fort + Attari–Wagah into one rushed sightseeing day.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 20, 'Do not underestimate religious crowds, security procedures and pedestrian congestion around Sri Harmandir Sahib.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 21, 'Do not treat Golden Temple langar as an entertainment attraction; it is an active Sikh religious and community institution.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 22, 'Do not ignore head covering, shoe-removal, washing and other current religious etiquette requirements at Sri Harmandir Sahib.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 23, 'Do not schedule extensive old-city walking, exposed heritage sites or prolonged Attari waiting during the hottest May–June afternoon hours.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 24, 'Do not assume the Attari–Wagah retreat starts at one permanently fixed time throughout the year; ceremony and entry arrangements should be checked for the actual date.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 25, 'Do not underestimate transfer and waiting time for Attari–Wagah; the district administration places the border roughly 32 km by road from Amritsar''s bus stand.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 26, 'Do not rush Jallianwala Bagh purely as a photography stop; it is a memorial connected with one of the defining events of India''s freedom struggle.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 27, 'Do not skip the Partition Museum when twentieth-century Indian or Punjab history is a major traveler interest.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 28, 'Do not treat Amritsari cuisine as only kulcha and lassi while missing Punjabi dhabas, tandoori traditions, sweets and regional non-vegetarian specialties where relevant.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 29, 'Do not assume every phulkari, Punjabi jutti or textile marketed to tourists represents equivalent handmade quality.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 30, 'Do not rely exclusively on cars inside the Golden Temple heritage core where walking or e-rickshaws can be more practical.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 31, 'Do not choose accommodation purely by Golden Temple distance without checking luggage handling and final vehicle access.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 32, 'Do not assume every religious site, fort, old-city market or heritage structure is wheelchair-accessible.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 33, 'Do not underestimate crowd density, standing time and security queues for seniors or young children at Attari–Wagah.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 34, 'Do not ignore winter fog when scheduling tightly timed flights, trains, road transfers or early-morning photography.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 35, 'Do not ignore monsoon rainfall and humidity when planning July–September outdoor itineraries.'),
  ('amritsar', 7378, 36, 'Do not add Dharamshala, Dalhousie, Chandigarh or other regional extensions to very short stays before allocating enough time to Amritsar itself.'),
