  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 0, 'Treat Ahmedabad as only SABARMATI_ASHRAM + RIVERFRONT and miss the UNESCO Historic City, pol neighborhoods, Jama Masjid, Sidi Saiyyed Mosque, Bhadra–Teen Darwaza, Calico Museum, Sarkhej Roza, stepwells, textile heritage and the city''s internationally significant architectural identity.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 1, 'Overload one day with OLD_CITY_HERITAGE + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + KANKARIA + SCIENCE_CITY + RIVERFRONT + SHOPPING.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 2, 'Treat Ahmedabad as a fully walkable compact city instead of using METRO_BRTS_OR_ROAD_TRANSPORT_BETWEEN_DISTRICTS + WALKING_WITHIN_HERITAGE_CLUSTERS.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 3, 'Enter the UNESCO old city without planning a structured heritage route and consequently miss the pols, wooden houses, religious architecture and neighborhood-scale urban heritage that make Ahmedabad distinctive.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 4, 'Treat Manek Chowk only as a late-night food stop and ignore its importance within the historic commercial and religious fabric of the old city.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 5, 'Visit Sabarmati Ashram only as a quick photo stop and miss its relationship with Gandhi''s life, the freedom movement and Ahmedabad''s textile / khadi history.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 6, 'Ignore Ahmedabad''s major Sultanate architectural legacy represented by Jama Masjid, Bhadra, Teen Darwaza, Sidi Saiyyed Mosque and Sarkhej Roza.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 7, 'Ignore the city''s globally important twentieth-century architecture associated with Le Corbusier, B. V. Doshi and other major modern architects.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 8, 'Assume Calico Museum can be visited casually without checking current pre-registration, guided-tour timings, weekly closure and visitor procedures.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 9, 'Schedule prolonged Old City, Sarkhej, stepwell or Riverfront sightseeing during extremely hot April–June afternoons.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 10, 'Ignore monsoon rain, humidity, road disruption and waterlogging risk during the wetter part of the year.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 11, 'Assume every pol lane, mosque, temple, haveli, stepwell and historic building is automatically wheelchair-accessible.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 12, 'Attempt to use Metro alone for every sightseeing movement even though many heritage attractions still require walking, auto-rickshaw or cab last-mile connections.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 13, 'Treat Ahmedabad food as generic Gujarati cuisine and miss farsan, breakfast traditions, Gujarati thali, seasonal dishes, sweets, Manek Chowk and the city''s strong vegetarian food identity.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 14, 'Treat Ahmedabad shopping as only modern malls and miss Law Garden, Dhalgarwad, Old City markets, traditional textiles, bandhani, embroidery and handicrafts.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 15, 'Expect alcohol-centric nightlife without accounting for Gujarat''s prohibition framework and Ahmedabad''s stronger DINING + CAFES + STREET_FOOD + SHOPPING evening culture.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7468, 16, 'Spend too many nights only on central Ahmedabad sightseeing without considering Adalaj, Gandhinagar, Modhera, Patan or wider Gujarat circuits.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around UNESCO_OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SIDI_SAIYYED_AND_BHADRA_HERITAGE.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 1, 'Combines OLD_CITY_POLS + MANEK_CHOWK + JAMA_MASJID + BHADRA + TEEN_DARWAZA geographically because they belong to Ahmedabad''s principal historic sightseeing zone.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 2, 'Gives the UNESCO Historic City dedicated walking time rather than treating individual monuments as disconnected photo stops.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 3, 'Uses SABARMATI_ASHRAM for Gandhi and independence history rather than only architectural sightseeing.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 4, 'Uses CALICO_MUSEUM + TEXTILE_SHOPPING + TRADITIONAL_MARKETS for deeper understanding of Ahmedabad''s textile identity.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 5, 'Uses SARKHEJ_ROZA + DADA_HARIR_STEPWELL + HUTHEESING_JAIN_TEMPLE + ADALAJ selectively for architecture-focused travelers.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 6, 'Uses GUJARAT_SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA_LAKE for families, children and weather-protected sightseeing.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 7, 'Uses SABARMATI_RIVERFRONT_LATE_AFTERNOON_OR_EVENING for walking, photography, recreation and cooler temperatures.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 8, 'Uses MODERN_ARCHITECTURE selectively for architecture, design and specialist educational travelers.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 9, 'Uses LAW_GARDEN + CG_ROAD + SELECTED_OLD_CITY_MARKETS for shopping, textiles, food and evening activity.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 10, 'Uses METRO_OR_BRTS where routing is genuinely efficient and CAB_OR_AUTO for attractions with weak last-mile connectivity.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 11, 'Keeps Science City, museums, premium shopping or hotel breaks for extreme summer heat and monsoon periods.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 12, 'Uses knowledgeable heritage or architecture guides for the pols, Sultanate history, Gandhi heritage, textiles and twentieth-century architecture.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 13, 'Keeps free time for Gujarati food, cafés, Riverfront, shopping and relaxed city exploration.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7469, 14, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 0, 'WALKING within Old City pols, Manek Chowk, Bhadra, selected heritage clusters and Riverfront promenades'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 1, 'AHMEDABAD_METRO for suitable cross-city corridors and connections'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 2, 'BRTS_JANMARG selectively for practical road-based public transport'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 3, 'AMTS_CITY_BUSES selectively for budget-oriented local travel'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 4, 'APP_BASED_CABS_AND_TAXIS for airport, cross-city and attraction-to-attraction transfers'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 5, 'AUTO_RICKSHAWS for short and last-mile urban movements'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 6, 'PRIVATE_AC_CAR for families, seniors, luxury travelers, architecture touring and regional excursions'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 7, 'INTERCITY_ROAD_OR_RAIL for Gandhinagar, Patan, Modhera and wider Gujarat extensions'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 8, 'UNESCO Historic City / Old City Heritage Walk'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 9, 'Pol neighborhoods and traditional urban fabric'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 10, 'Jama Masjid'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 11, 'Sidi Saiyyed Mosque'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 12, 'Bhadra Fort + Teen Darwaza'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 13, 'Manek Chowk'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 14, 'Sabarmati Ashram'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 15, 'Sabarmati Riverfront'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 16, 'Gujarati food / thali / farsan experience'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 17, 'Kankaria Lake, Gujarat Science City, Calico Museum, Sarkhej Roza or Dada Harir Stepwell according to available time'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 18, 'Do not treat Ahmedabad as only SABARMATI_ASHRAM + RIVERFRONT.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 19, 'Do not force OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + KANKARIA + SCIENCE_CITY + CALICO_MUSEUM + SARKHEJ into one rushed day.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 20, 'Do not treat the UNESCO Historic City as only a collection of monuments; its living pol neighborhoods and traditional houses are central to its significance.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 21, 'Do not visit Calico Museum assuming unrestricted walk-in access; current visitor arrangements use pre-registration and structured guided gallery tours.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 22, 'Do not assume every modernist building is freely accessible; individual institutional and privately managed buildings may require advance permission.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 23, 'Do not schedule long Old City, Sarkhej, stepwell or Riverfront sightseeing during extreme April–June afternoon heat.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 24, 'Do not ignore monsoon rainfall, humidity and traffic disruption when planning July–September outdoor touring.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 25, 'Do not assume every pol, temple, mosque, haveli or stepwell is wheelchair-accessible.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 26, 'Do not rely exclusively on Metro for every attraction; last-mile road transport and walking remain important.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 27, 'Do not treat Manek Chowk as Ahmedabad''s entire food identity; include Gujarati thalis, farsan, breakfast traditions, sweets and neighborhood dining.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 28, 'Do not treat Ahmedabad shopping as only malls; textiles, handicrafts, Law Garden, Dhalgarwad and traditional markets are major parts of the destination.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 29, 'Do not position Ahmedabad as an alcohol-focused nightlife destination without accounting for Gujarat''s prohibition framework.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 30, 'Do not allocate excessive nights to central-city sightseeing without considering Adalaj, Gandhinagar, Patan, Modhera or wider Gujarat extensions.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7472, 31, 'Do not assume attraction prices, opening hours, guided walks, museum admissions, gallery access or maintenance schedules remain permanently fixed.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7473, 0, 'UNESCO World Heritage Centre — Official Historic City of Ahmadabad inscription, Outstanding Universal Value, Sultanate architecture, pol urban fabric, traditional timber architecture, religious diversity, protection and management information.'),
  ('ahmedabad', 7473, 1, 'UNESCO World Heritage Centre — Current 2026 World Heritage documentation and monitoring material relating to the Historic City of Ahmadabad.'),
