  ('jabalpur', 7519, 8, 'Taste local Madhya Pradesh delicacies including **poha jalebi, bhutte ka kees, sabudana khichdi, and local chaat**.'),
  ('jabalpur', 7519, 9, 'Use Jabalpur as the **principal gateway to Kanha and Bandhavgarh National Parks** rather than treating it merely as a transit city.'),
  ('jabalpur', 7519, 10, 'Expecting to take a **boat ride through the Marble Rocks during the peak monsoon (July–September)**, as operations are completely suspended for safety.'),
  ('jabalpur', 7519, 11, 'Trying to cover **Bhedaghat + Bargi Dam + Madan Mahal + Dumna Nature Reserve** in one overloaded day.'),
  ('jabalpur', 7519, 12, 'Underestimating the **extreme summer heat (April–June)** when daytime temperatures can easily exceed 40°C (104°F).'),
  ('jabalpur', 7519, 13, 'Visiting Dhuandhar Falls or Gwarighat during major festivals or holidays without considering **large crowds and limited parking**.'),
