  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7586, 6, 'Stargazing under clear skies'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7586, 7, 'Wildlife documentary screenings'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7586, 8, 'Quiet forest dinners'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 0, 'Treat Bandhavgarh & Kanha as **quick 1-night stopovers or standard weekend getaways**, underestimating safari gate logistics, travel distances, and park regulations.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 1, 'Attempt to drive private non-registered vehicles into core zones, ignoring the **mandatory registered open 4x4 Gypsies, licensed park drivers, and certified forest department guides**.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 2, 'Forget that core zone safaris across Madhya Pradesh tiger reserves are **closed on Wednesday afternoons**, accidentally scheduling core safaris on the weekly afternoon off.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 3, 'Book safari permits at gates far from the client’s resort (e.g., booking Mukki/Sarhi permits while staying near Khatia in Kanha, or Tala permits while staying near Panpatha), causing **1 to 2-hour pre-dawn transit delays**.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 4, 'Plan tight land transfers between Bandhavgarh and Kanha (240+ km / 5–6 hours driving) on safari days, leaving clients **exhausted for afternoon game drives**.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 5, 'Overlook the **strict 120-day advance booking window** for high-demand core zones (Tala in Bandhavgarh; Kanha/Kisli in Kanha), leaving clients stuck with last-minute single-seat or outer buffer permits.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 6, 'Underestimate **extreme winter morning temperatures** (dropping to 2–5°C in open Gypsies), failing to advise clients on heavy thermal layering, windcheaters, gloves, and caps.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 7, 'Fail to match exact guest names and ID numbers submitted during booking with **physical government IDs presented at checkpost entry**, resulting in denied gate entry.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7608, 8, 'Ignore seasonal park closures during the **monsoon season (July 1 to September 30)** when core zones remain completely closed for animal breeding and road regeneration.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7609, 0, 'Positions the circuit as the **ultimate Central Indian Tiger & Wilderness Odyssey — combining Bandhavgarh''s high tiger density with Kanha''s legendary Kipling landscapes and Barasingha conservation**.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7609, 1, 'Pre-books **zone-specific core safari permits 120 days ahead** via the MP Forest portal, securing high-probability tiger sighting tracks like Tala/Magadhi (Bandhavgarh) and Kanha/Mukki (Kanha).'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7609, 2, 'Coordinates **resort selection directly with allocated entry gates** (e.g., Mukki resort for Mukki gate permits, Tala resort for Tala gate permits) to minimize transfer time.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7609, 3, 'Schedules a **dedicated non-safari transit day or buffer-only safari** for the 5-hour drive between Bandhavgarh and Kanha, keeping travel comfortable.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7609, 4, 'Strategically utilizes **Wednesday afternoons for resort relaxation, local Baiga tribal village walks, or nature trail excursions** outside core boundaries.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7609, 5, 'Advises clients on appropriate safari attire (earth tones like olive and khaki), camera dust protection, optical equipment (10x42 binoculars), and carrying physical ID cards.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7609, 6, 'Combines **Core Zone drives with Night Buffer Safaris** (where available) to expose clients to nocturnal wildlife like leopards, sloth bears, and Indian civets.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7609, 7, 'Allocates **3 nights in Bandhavgarh (4–5 safaris) and 3–4 nights in Kanha (5–6 safaris)** to build a realistic, multi-zone wildlife itinerary.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 0, '**High Sighting Probability Strategy:** Prioritize **Tala & Magadhi Zones (Bandhavgarh)** paired with **Mukki & Kanha Core Zones (Kanha)**.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 1, '**Biodiversity & Flora Strategy:** Route clients through **Kanha''s expansive Sal forests and open meadows** to track the endemic Hard Ground Barasingha.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 2, '**Landscape & Heritage Strategy:** Focus on **Bandhavgarh''s rugged sandstone cliffs, ancient Bandhavgarh Fort, and Shesh Shaiya statue** views.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 3, '**Birding & Photography Strategy:** Schedule winter mornings (Nov–Feb) around **Kanha’s wetlands and Bandhavgarh’s stream systems** for migratory species and soft golden lighting.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 4, '**Family & Eco-Luxe Strategy:** Combine **relaxed morning safaris with Baiga culture interactions, resort nature walks, and swimming pool downtime** at top eco-lodges.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 5, '**Adventure Strategy:** Add **Night Safaris in buffer zones (e.g., Dhamokhar/Panpatha/Khitoli buffers)** for tracking nocturnal predators.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 6, '**Honeymoon Strategy:** Book **private open Gypsies, jungle canvas glamping, private bush dinners, and uninterrupted quiet hours** between safaris.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 7, '**Logistics & Transit Strategy:** Route flights/trains via **Jabalpur (JBP), Raipur (RPR), or Nagpur (NAG)** for efficient ground handling.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7610, 8, '**Planning Strategy:** Do not sell this circuit as a **rushed tiger-hunting sprint**; sell it as an **immersive, multi-ecosystem Central Indian jungle safari experience**.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 0, 'Secure core safari permits **120 days in advance** for high-probability zones like **Tala & Magadhi (Bandhavgarh)** and **Kanha & Mukki (Kanha)**.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 1, 'Track the Bengal Tiger in **Bandhavgarh''s rugged sandstone terrain**, famous for having one of the highest tiger densities in the world.');
INSERT INTO destination_guidance_bullet (place_id, position, bullet_index, text) VALUES
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 2, 'Explore **Kanha''s sprawling Sal forests and open grasslands**, the inspiration for Rudyard Kipling''s *The Jungle Book* and the last refuge of the endemic Hard Ground Barasingha (Swamp Deer).'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 3, 'Marvel at ancient history within Bandhavgarh core, including the massive Shesh Shaiya (reclining Vishnu statue), 2,000-year-old rock-cut caves, and views of Bandhavgarh Fort.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 4, 'Experience a **Night Buffer Safari** in surrounding buffer zones (e.g., Dhamokhar or Khatia) to track nocturnal wildlife like leopards, sloth bears, civets, and owls.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 5, 'Take a guided **Baiga or Gond tribal village walk** near Kanha to experience local culture, traditional architecture, and authentic indigenous art.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 6, 'Schedule winter early-morning safaris equipped with **heavy thermal layers, windcheaters, gloves, and caps** to handle plunging jungle temperatures in open Gypsies.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 7, 'Use **10x42 binoculars and telephoto lenses with dust covers** to capture wildlife portraits and diverse avian species.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 8, 'Enjoy quiet afternoon downtime at eco-lodges, taking advantage of **naturalist-led nature walks, birdwatching trails, and bush dinners**.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 9, 'Pair resort locations strictly with **permitted safari entry gates** to avoid pre-dawn 1–2 hour road transfers.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 10, 'Attempting to split a **2-day weekend trip between both parks**, which leads to 5–6 hours of wasted highway transit and missed safari gates.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 11, 'Booking safari permits for gates **far from your resort location**, causing exhausting pre-dawn drives on unpaved roads.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 12, 'Scheduling core safaris on **Wednesday afternoons**, as all core zones in MP tiger reserves are closed for the weekly off.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 13, 'Traveling during the **Monsoon season (July 1 to September 30)** expecting core zone safaris, as all core gates are strictly closed.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 14, 'Packing light clothing for **winter morning drives (Nov–Feb)**; open Gypsies create extreme windchill in 2°C temperatures.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 15, 'Expecting to drive **private personal vehicles or self-drive rentals** into core forest zones without registered park Gypsies.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7613, 16, 'Mismatching **guest names or government ID details** on safari permit documents with physical IDs presented at checkposts, which leads to immediate entry rejection.'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 7614, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
