  ('raipur', 7702, 0, 'Treat Raipur as a **mere quick transit stop** on the way to Jagdalpur or Bastar, missing its rich urban cultural attractions, ancient museums, and modern planned infrastructure.'),
  ('raipur', 7702, 1, 'Fail to realize that major attractions like **Purkhauti Muktangan, Nandan Van Jungle Safari, and Central Park are located in Naya Raipur (Nava Raipur Atal Nagar)**, approximately 25–30 km away from central Raipur, leading to poor transit scheduling.'),
  ('raipur', 7702, 2, 'Schedule outdoor visits to sprawling open-air sites like **Purkhauti Muktangan or Sirpur during peak summer afternoons (May–June)** when temperatures exceed 40°C.'),
  ('raipur', 7702, 3, 'Overlook booking **online advance tickets or morning safari slots** for Nandan Van Jungle Safari, causing clients to face long entry queues or sold-out gypsy rides.'),
  ('raipur', 7702, 4, 'Forget to advise clients that **monsoons (July–August) cause closure of core jungle safari tracks** at nearby Barnawapara Wildlife Sanctuary.'),
  ('raipur', 7702, 5, 'Miss incorporating local culinary hubs like **Gadh Kaleva**, depriving travelers of authentic Chhattisgarhi delicacies like *Cheela*, *Farra*, and *Muthia*.'),
  ('raipur', 7702, 6, 'Fail to inform clients about shop operating hours in artisan markets, leading to missed opportunities for purchasing authentic **Bell Metal (Dhokra) crafts and Kosa silk**.'),
  ('raipur', 7703, 0, 'Positions Raipur as a **vibrant cultural, heritage, and eco-tourism gateway to Central India**, ideally paired with Sirpur and Barnawapara for a balanced multi-day circuit.'),
  ('raipur', 7703, 1, 'Clusters attractions strategically by geography—grouping **Naya Raipur sites (Purkhauti Muktangan, Jungle Safari, Central Park)** on one day and central city attractions on another.'),
  ('raipur', 7703, 2, 'Pre-arranges **early morning safari slots at Nandan Van Jungle Safari** and books private AC vehicles for day excursions to Sirpur (84 km) and Barnawapara (95 km).'),
  ('raipur', 7703, 3, 'Integrates a visit to **Gadh Kaleva in Katora Talab** for a curated Chhattisgarhi breakfast or high-tea culinary experience in a traditional rustic setting.'),
  ('raipur', 7703, 4, 'Recommends quality accommodations based on client profile—5-star luxury resorts in **Naya Raipur for tranquil retreats** or business hotels in **central Raipur for easy market access**.'),
  ('raipur', 7703, 5, 'Schedules heritage walks around **Mahant Ghasidas Memorial Museum and Dudhadhari Math** during pleasant morning hours to avoid heat and traffic.'),
  ('raipur', 7703, 6, 'Combines **ancient archaeology at Sirpur with nature escapes at Ghatarani and Jatmai waterfalls** to give clients a diverse, well-rounded regional itinerary.'),
  ('raipur', 7704, 0, '**Core Heritage Strategy:** Pair **Mahant Ghasidas Memorial Museum** with the 17th-century **Dudhadhari Math** for a complete dive into Raipur''s historical origins.'),
  ('raipur', 7704, 1, '**Tribal Art & Culture Strategy:** Dedicate a half-day to **Purkhauti Muktangan** in Naya Raipur to experience life-sized open-air tribal art installations and rural architecture.'),
  ('raipur', 7704, 2, '**Archaeology Excursion Strategy:** Include a full-day trip to **Sirpur (84 km)** to showcase 7th-century brick architecture at Laxman Temple and ancient Buddhist Viharas.'),
  ('raipur', 7704, 3, '**Wildlife & Nature Strategy:** Book an early morning **gypsy safari at Nandan Van Jungle Safari** or a full-day nature drive to **Barnawapara Wildlife Sanctuary**.'),
  ('raipur', 7704, 4, '**Culinary Experience Strategy:** Include a dedicated meal or snack stop at **Gadh Kaleva** to introduce clients to authentic Chhattisgarhi food culture.'),
  ('raipur', 7704, 5, '**Logistics & Transit Strategy:** Utilize **Swami Vivekananda Airport (RPR)** or **Raipur Junction (R&R)** with pre-booked private AC vehicles for seamless day trips.'),
  ('raipur', 7704, 6, '**Planning Strategy:** Do not sell Raipur as an **uninspiring industrial transit town**; position it as a **rich, multi-layered cultural hub and central Indian gateway**.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 0, 'Walk through **Purkhauti Muktangan** in Naya Raipur to admire life-sized open-air tribal architecture, folk art installations, and Chhattisgarhi rural life representations.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 1, 'Take an early morning open-top gypsy drive at **Nandan Van Jungle Safari** in Naya Raipur to view tigers, lions, and bears in semi-natural enclosures.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 2, 'Experience an authentic Chhattisgarhi meal or high-tea at **Gadh Kaleva** (Katora Talab), savoring regional delicacies like *Cheela*, *Farra*, and *Muthia* in a rustic setting.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 3, 'Tour the historic **Mahant Ghasidas Memorial Museum** to see ancient Kalachuri stone sculptures, tribal artifacts, and regional archaeological finds.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 4, 'Plan a day excursion to **Sirpur (84 km)** to examine the 7th-century red-brick **Laxman Temple**, Surang Tila, and ancient excavated Buddhist Viharas.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 5, 'Visit the 17th-century **Dudhadhari Math and Temple**, known for its intricate ancient murals depicting scenes from the Ramayana.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 6, 'Take a sunset stroll along the illuminated promenade at **Telibandha Lake (Marine Drive)** or **Swami Vivekananda Sarovar (Budha Talab)**.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 7, 'Shop for authentic **Bell Metal (Dhokra) crafts**, iron art, terracotta items, and handwoven **Kosa silk** at state emporiums (*Shabari*) or Sadar Bazaar.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 8, 'Take a nature drive to **Jatmai and Ghatarani Waterfalls** during or immediately after the monsoon season.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 9, 'Schedule wildlife safaris at **Barnawapara Wildlife Sanctuary** early in the morning to maximize chances of spotting Indian bison (Gaur), leopards, and deer species.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 10, 'Treating Raipur merely as a rapid transit hub for Bastar, overlooking its rich museums, modern infrastructure, and regional gastronomy.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 11, 'Scheduling open-air walking tours at Purkhauti Muktangan or Sirpur ruins during peak summer afternoons without sun protection and hydration.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 12, 'Heading to Nandan Van Jungle Safari without checking ticket availability or pre-booking safari slots on weekends.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 13, 'Confusing central Raipur attractions with Naya Raipur sites; Naya Raipur is located 25–30 km away, requiring planned transit times.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 14, 'Expecting deep-forest core jungle safaris at Barnawapara during peak heavy monsoon months when tracks are waterlogged.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 15, 'Missing out on local Chhattisgarhi cuisine by sticking strictly to standard hotel buffets or global fast-food chains.'),
  ('raipur', 7707, 16, 'Purchasing unverified or mass-produced "metalcrafts" from unauthorized street hawkers instead of certified artisan handloom/handicraft centers.'),
  ('raipur', 7708, 0, 'To be populated with authoritative tourism/transport/attraction sources before production use.'),
