  ('daringbadi', 7797, 0, 'Treat Daringbadi as only PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN and miss Nature Park, Hill View Point, Doluri River, Lovers Point, waterfalls and wider Kandhamal landscapes.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 1, 'Attempt DARINGBADI_LOCAL + MANDASARU + PUTUDI + BELGHAR in one rushed sightseeing day.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 2, 'Treat Daringbadi as a conventional compact hill town when most attractions are spread along road corridors and require vehicle planning.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 3, 'Underestimate the road journey from Brahmapur or Bhubaneswar and schedule major sightseeing immediately after arrival.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 4, 'Use Bhubaneswar as the only practical gateway when Brahmapur Railway Station is substantially closer for many rail-based itineraries.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 5, 'Assume public transport will efficiently connect every waterfall, plantation, forest and viewpoint.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 6, 'Depend on last-minute local vehicles during busy weekends or holiday periods.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 7, 'Treat every waterfall approach as family-, senior- or wheelchair-friendly.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 8, 'Ignore slippery rocks, steps and uneven terrain around waterfalls and rivers.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 9, 'Visit Lovers Point or waterfall areas without considering current water level, rainfall and road conditions.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 10, 'Schedule all viewpoints around midday instead of using sunrise, morning or sunset light.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 11, 'Treat Pine Jungle, Coffee Garden and plantation landscapes as quick roadside photo stops instead of relaxed nature experiences.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 12, 'Expect coffee plantation experiences comparable with major commercial plantation destinations such as Coorg or Chikmagalur.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 13, 'Market “snowfall” as a guaranteed winter experience rather than treating very cold mornings and possible frost as the dependable winter attraction.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 14, 'Assume winter temperatures remain mild simply because the destination is in Odisha.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 15, 'Ignore rain and reduced visibility during monsoon sightseeing.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 16, 'Attempt remote nature routes during severe rainfall without checking road conditions.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 17, 'Treat Mandasaru as another small local Daringbadi stop instead of a substantial gorge and eco-tourism excursion.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 18, 'Add Putudi Waterfall casually to a short local Daringbadi day even though it belongs to a wider Kandhamal circuit.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 19, 'Treat Belghar as a central Daringbadi attraction rather than a more remote nature and tribal-region extension.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 20, 'Overload family trips with continuous driving and waterfalls without park, resort and meal breaks.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 21, 'Give young children unrestricted access near slippery rocks, streams or waterfall edges.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 22, 'Assume senior travelers can comfortably complete every forest trail and waterfall descent.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 23, 'Expect luxury infrastructure comparable with established Himalayan or Western Ghats resort destinations.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 24, 'Choose accommodation only by lowest rate without considering road access, parking, heating / hot-water needs and sightseeing location.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 25, 'Expect destination-scale shopping, nightlife or sophisticated café culture.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 26, 'Treat local culture as a staged “tribal attraction” rather than approaching communities respectfully and avoiding intrusive photography.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 27, 'Photograph local residents without permission.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7797, 28, 'Spend too many nights repeating central Daringbadi sightseeing without adding Mandasaru, Belghar, Phulbani, Putudi, Jirang / Chandragiri or another regional circuit.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 0, 'Builds first-time itineraries around NATURE_PARK + HILL_VIEW_POINT + PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + LOVERS_POINT + DARINGBADI_WATERFALL.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 1, 'Uses 2_NIGHTS_3_DAYS as the strongest standard first-time pattern.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 2, 'Keeps arrival and departure days relatively light because road transfers are substantial.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 3, 'Uses BRAHMAPUR as the preferred rail gateway where routing is suitable.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 4, 'Uses BHUBANESWAR for air arrivals and longer Odisha road circuits.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 5, 'Pre-arranges PRIVATE_CAR_OR_SUV when multiple natural attractions are included.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 6, 'Groups Pine Forest + Coffee Garden + Doluri River + Lovers Point geographically wherever routing permits.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 7, 'Uses SUNSET_POINT_OR_HILL_VIEW_POINT during good-light periods rather than treating viewpoints as midday checklist stops.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 8, 'Treats waterfalls as WEATHER_AND_TERRAIN_DEPENDENT experiences.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 9, 'Uses sturdy footwear and conservative water-edge planning during monsoon.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 10, 'Keeps children closely supervised around rocks and flowing water.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 11, 'Gives Pine Forest and Coffee Garden enough relaxed walking and photography time.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 12, 'Uses MANDASARU as a separate half-day or full excursion on longer stays.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 13, 'Uses PUTUDI primarily within a wider Kandhamal / Phulbani route rather than forcing it into every first-time Daringbadi itinerary.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 14, 'Adds BELGHAR mainly for offbeat nature, eco-tourism and deeper regional travel.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 15, 'Uses nature camps or stronger resorts for travelers prioritizing atmosphere over town-centre convenience.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 16, 'Keeps resort leisure and café / meal breaks between road-based sightseeing blocks.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 17, 'Plans WINTER for cold hill-station atmosphere without guaranteeing snowfall.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 18, 'Uses MONSOON primarily for greenery and waterfalls while retaining weather flexibility.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 19, 'Uses SUMMER as a hill escape from hotter Odisha plains but still avoids unnecessary afternoon exposure.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 20, 'Treats local community encounters respectfully and obtains permission before close-up photography.'),
  ('daringbadi', 7798, 21, 'For first-time visits, prioritize:'),
