  ('ranchi', 8157, 6, 'Don''t do Hundru Falls + Jonha Falls + Dassam Falls + Patratu Valley + Rock Garden + Kanke Dam + Tagore Hill + Jagannath Temple + Deoghar Baidyanath + Basukinath + Trikut Pahar + Tapovan + Satsang + Hazaribagh Wildlife + Hazaribagh Lake + Canary Hill + Rajrappa + Netarhat + Magnolia Point + Upper Ghaghri + Lower Ghaghri + Betla National Park + Parasnath Hill + McCluskieganj + Jamshedpur + Dalma Wildlife + Kolkata + Patna + Gaya + Varanasi + Puri in 1 day without overnight - Impossible + region spread 100-250km + need auto + need bus + need train + need private car + need safari + need IXR Airport 8km + need DGH Airport 12km + need Kolkata 340km + need Patna 400km + need Deoghar 250km + need Hazaribagh 100km + need Netarhat 156km + need Betla 156km + need Parasnath 120km + need McCluskieganj 50km + need Jamshedpur 130km + Max 3-4 attractions/day + Ranchi city Hundru Jonha Dassam Patratu Rock Garden Kanke Tagore Jagannath separate + Deoghar Baidyanath Basukinath Trikut Pahar Tapovan Satsang separate + Hazaribagh Wildlife Lake Canary Hill Rajrappa separate + Netarhat Magnolia Point Upper Ghaghri Lower Ghaghri separate + Betla safari separate + Parasnath Hill separate + McCluskieganj separate + Jamshedpur Dalma separate + need 3-4N minimum + auto + bus + train + private car + safari'),
  ('ranchi', 8157, 7, 'Don''t stay far from Ranchi city Deoghar Baidyanath Hazaribagh Lake to save $10 - Waste time + taxi cost $5-$15 each + must near Ranchi city + near Hundru + near Jonha + near Patratu + near Baidyanath + near Hazaribagh Lake + near Canary Hill + near Rajrappa + central + flat + nature + pilgrimage + city + best must Ranchi city + Deoghar Baidyanath + Hazaribagh Lake'),
  ('ranchi', 8157, 8, 'Don''t skip Hundru + no Jonha + no Dassam + no Patratu - Must Hundru Falls + Jonha Falls + Dassam Falls + Patratu Valley + must'),
  ('ranchi', 8157, 9, 'Don''t skip Deoghar Baidyanath - Must Deoghar Baidyanath Jyotirlinga + Basukinath + must'),
  ('ranchi', 8157, 10, 'Don''t skip Hazaribagh Wildlife + no Rajrappa - Must Hazaribagh Wildlife Sanctuary + Hazaribagh Lake + Canary Hill + Rajrappa Chinnamastika Temple + must'),
  ('ranchi', 8157, 11, 'Don''t skip Netarhat - Must Netarhat + Magnolia Point sunset + Upper Ghaghri + Lower Ghaghri + must'),
  ('ranchi', 8157, 12, 'Don''t plan Ranchi as day trip from Kolkata/Patna/Jamshedpur without overnight - Possible from Jamshedpur 130km 3hrs but better 3-4N + Kolkata 340km 7hrs too far + Patna 400km 8hrs too far + need overnight + better 3-4N + auto + bus + train + private car + need overnight + better 3-4N + auto + bus + train + private car + need overnight + better 3-4N');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('cairo:rule:0', 'cairo', 'do not recommend Saqqara, Dahshur, Alexandria, or other distant day trips by default.', 'Short Cairo stays work best when time is concentrated around the Pyramids of Giza, the Great Sphinx, one major museum, Islamic Cairo, and one Nile experience rather than being spread across long transfers.'),
  ('cairo:rule:1', 'cairo', 'prioritize: Pyramids of Giza and the Great Sphinx. One major museum. One Nile-side evening experience.', 'A two-night stay allows only the essential Cairo highlights without creating an exhausting schedule.'),
  ('cairo:rule:2', 'cairo', 'add: Islamic Cairo or Khan el-Khalili. Saladin Citadel and Muhammad Ali Mosque. One flexible or relaxed evening.', 'Three nights allow a strong first impression of Cairo while keeping the itinerary manageable.'),
  ('cairo:rule:3', 'cairo', 'consider: Saqqara and Dahshur. Coptic Cairo. National Museum of Egyptian Civilization. Additional shopping, food, photography, or leisure time.', 'Longer stays make Cairo’s outlying archaeological areas and deeper cultural experiences more practical.'),
  ('cairo:rule:4', 'cairo', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Changing hotels consumes valuable time and creates additional packing, check-in, transfer, and traffic risks.'),
  ('cairo:rule:5', 'cairo', 'consider: Saqqara. Dahshur. Memphis. Additional museum time.', 'These areas reward travelers with enough time for longer transfers and outdoor exploration.'),
  ('cairo:rule:6', 'cairo', 'add_one_flexible_half_day', 'Cairo is an intense urban destination, so longer stays should include hotel leisure, spa time, pool time, cafés, or a relaxed Nile experience. ## Honeymoon Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:7', 'cairo', 'increase romance_weight by 30% increase privacy_weight by 25% increase free_time_weight by 25% decrease activity_density by 20%', 'Cairo honeymoon value comes from private cultural experiences, Nile views, premium dining, luxury hotels, and memorable evenings rather than maximum sightseeing.'),
  ('cairo:rule:8', 'cairo', 'prefer: Zamalek. Garden City. Nile Corniche. A luxury Nile-view hotel. Giza only when pyramid views are a priority.', 'These areas offer better access to romantic dining, Nile views, hotel lounges, cruises, and relaxed evening experiences.'),
  ('cairo:rule:9', 'cairo', 'limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include_one_memorable_experience_per_day', 'A private felucca ride, premium dinner, or pyramid-view experience usually creates more honeymoon value than adding several additional attractions.'),
  ('cairo:rule:10', 'cairo', 'schedule: Private sunset felucca ride. Nile-view dinner. Rooftop dining. Private Nile dinner cruise. Luxury hotel or spa time.', 'Cairo’s most romantic experiences are strongest during sunset and evening hours along the Nile, in rooftop restaurants, and in carefully selected luxury venues.'),
  ('cairo:rule:11', 'cairo', 'prefer romantic_evening OVER: late_night_club_itinerary', 'A relaxed evening generally fits the atmosphere of a cultural honeymoon better than a late-night, high-energy schedule. ## Family Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:12', 'cairo', 'limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include_one_leisure_block_daily', 'Cairo’s heat, traffic, crowds, uneven surfaces, and walking distances can be tiring for families, so shorter sightseeing blocks work better.'),
  ('cairo:rule:13', 'cairo', 'reduce walking_intensity_target by 25% increase downtime by 25% prefer: Short transfers. Air-conditioned vehicles. Predictable meal breaks. Hotel pools. Early dinners. Child-friendly attractions.', 'Young children handle Cairo better when outdoor visits are short, comfortable, and followed by rest.'),
  ('cairo:rule:14', 'cairo', 'visit_outdoor_attractions early', 'The Pyramids, Saqqara, Dahshur, and other archaeological sites are exposed to heat and offer limited shade.'),
  ('cairo:rule:15', 'cairo', 'keep pyramids_and_sphinx_duration between 90 minutes and 2 hours', 'The Pyramids are essential, but a focused visit is easier for children than an extended, walking-heavy archaeological day.'),
  ('cairo:rule:16', 'cairo', 'prefer: Al-Azhar Park. Short Nile felucca ride. Short Grand Egyptian Museum visit. Pharaonic Village. Cairo Tower views. Hotel pool time. AND: avoid: Full-day museum schedules. Long walking tours. Extended Khan el-Khalili visits. Long exposed visits to Saqqara or Dahshur. Late-night activities.', 'Younger children benefit from variety, short activity periods, shade, easy transport, and regular breaks. ## Hotel Location Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:17', 'cairo', 'prefer_central_or_strategic_hotel', 'A cheaper hotel can provide worse overall value when daily traffic, taxi costs, and lost sightseeing time are added.'),
  ('cairo:rule:18', 'cairo', 'prefer Giza', 'Giza provides the most convenient access to the Pyramids, the Great Sphinx, pyramid-view accommodation, and nearby pyramid-view restaurants.'),
  ('cairo:rule:19', 'cairo', 'prefer Downtown Cairo / Tahrir', 'Downtown offers practical access to the Egyptian Museum, restaurants, cafés, transport, and central sightseeing areas.'),
  ('cairo:rule:20', 'cairo', 'prefer Zamalek OR Garden City / Nile Corniche', 'These areas are better suited to Nile views, premium hotels, restaurants, cafés, lounges, and romantic evening experiences.'),
  ('cairo:rule:21', 'cairo', 'consider Heliopolis or New Cairo', 'These areas can be more convenient for Cairo International Airport and modern business facilities, although they are less suitable for a short cultural visit.'),
  ('cairo:rule:22', 'cairo', 'avoid_airport_area_as_default_hotel_base', 'Staying close to the airport may simplify departure but can create long daily journeys to Cairo’s principal historical attractions. ## Luxury Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:23', 'cairo', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_private_egyptologist_guide AND: prefer_premium_or_exclusive_experiences', 'Luxury value in Cairo is created through comfort, privacy, reliable service, time efficiency, and flexible arrangements rather than simply adding more attractions.'),
  ('cairo:rule:24', 'cairo', 'increase: Comfort. Privacy. Service. Convenience. Exclusivity. Time efficiency. Flexibility. AND: do_not_increase_activity_density_by_default', 'A luxury itinerary should feel effortless and well paced, not crowded with sightseeing stops.'),
  ('cairo:rule:25', 'cairo', 'prefer: Five-star Nile-view accommodation. Private airport assistance. Chauffeured luxury sedan or premium MPV. Private Egyptologist-led touring. Premium Nile cruise. Pyramid-view dining. Private felucca ride. Spa and pool time. Concierge support. Personal shopping assistance.', 'These services improve the quality, privacy, and convenience of the Cairo experience. ## Budget Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:26', 'cairo', 'prefer: Downtown Cairo, Dokki, or another walkable, well-connected base. Local Egyptian restaurants. Cairo Metro for suitable routes. Reputable ride-hailing services. Free or low-cost historic areas. A mix of paid highlights and low-cost activities.', 'Cairo offers strong value when travelers combine local food, compact sightseeing areas, public transport, and carefully selected paid attractions.'),
  ('cairo:rule:27', 'cairo', 'do_not_save_on: Safe and reliable airport transfers. Clean accommodation with working air-conditioning. A licensed guide for the Pyramids or Saqqara when needed. A well-located hotel.', 'The cheapest option can become more expensive through traffic delays, unreliable transport, poor sleep, and lost sightseeing time.'),
  ('cairo:rule:28', 'cairo', 'prefer_local_food AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions', 'Koshari, ful medames, ta’ameya, local bakeries, cafés, mosques, markets, Nile walks, and selected museums can keep costs manageable while preserving a strong Cairo experience. ## First-Time Visitor Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:29', 'cairo', 'anchor_the_trip_around: Pyramids of Giza. Great Sphinx. Grand Egyptian Museum or Egyptian Museum. Islamic Cairo. Khan el-Khalili. One Nile-based evening experience.', 'These attractions provide the clearest introduction to Cairo’s ancient history, museums, heritage, markets, and Nile atmosphere.'),
  ('cairo:rule:30', 'cairo', 'add: Saladin Citadel. Muhammad Ali Mosque. Coptic Cairo. One additional museum or cultural area.', 'Four or more nights allow a more complete introduction without forcing every district into the same day.'),
  ('cairo:rule:31', 'cairo', 'combine: Islamic Cairo. Al-Muizz Street. Khan el-Khalili. Al-Azhar Mosque.', 'These attractions form a coherent historic area with high cultural experience density, although the district requires controlled walking and realistic timing.'),
  ('cairo:rule:32', 'cairo', 'combine: Coptic Cairo. Hanging Church. Saint Sergius and Bacchus Church. Coptic Museum. Amr Ibn Al-Aas Mosque where appropriate.', 'Coptic Cairo works best as a compact half-day heritage visit, sometimes combined with the National Museum of Egyptian Civilization. ## Transport Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:33', 'cairo', 'increase_transfer_buffer AND: avoid_tightly_connected_flights_or_reservations', 'Cairo traffic can make road journeys unpredictable, especially between the airport, Giza, Downtown, Zamalek, and historic districts.'),
  ('cairo:rule:34', 'cairo', 'keep_activity_density low AND: prefer_hotel_check_in + light_evening_experience', 'Arrival day should protect travelers from flight fatigue, airport delays, traffic, and late check-in.'),
  ('cairo:rule:35', 'cairo', 'allow_only_short_nearby_sightseeing', 'The final day must preserve sufficient time for traffic, luggage collection, airport procedures, and international departure requirements.'),
  ('cairo:rule:36', 'cairo', 'do_not_schedule_major_sightseeing', 'An early airport transfer is safer and less stressful than attempting a final museum or heritage visit. ## Weather Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:37', 'cairo', 'schedule outdoor_sites before 10:00 AND: move museums, cafés, shopping, and hotel leisure to the afternoon', 'Cairo’s outdoor archaeological areas can become intensely hot, while indoor attractions and evening activities are more comfortable later in the day.'),
  ('cairo:rule:38', 'cairo', 'increase: Air-conditioned transport. Water breaks. Hotel downtime. Indoor cultural activities. Evening experiences. AND: decrease: Midday walking. Long desert excursions. Multiple outdoor archaeological sites in one day.', 'Summer offers lower crowd and price levels but requires heat-conscious planning.'),
  ('cairo:rule:39', 'cairo', 'increase_outdoor_sightseeing_capacity AND: expect_higher_crowds_and_prices', 'Winter is generally the most comfortable period for pyramids, museums, heritage walks, and full-day sightseeing, but demand and prices are often higher.'),
  ('cairo:rule:40', 'cairo', 'reduce_photography_priority AND: prefer_museums_or_indoor_attractions', 'Dust and reduced visibility can weaken pyramid, skyline, and desert photography conditions. ## Senior Traveler Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:41', 'cairo', 'prefer_central_hotel AND: use_private_transfer_when_helpful AND: avoid_multiple_walking_heavy_stops', 'Cairo’s heat, stairs, uneven surfaces, crowds, and long transfers require careful movement management.'),
  ('cairo:rule:42', 'cairo', 'include: Seating. Shade. Water breaks. Air-conditioned rest periods. Hotel downtime. Shorter sightseeing blocks. Reliable toilets and meal stops.', 'Comfort and controlled movement are more important than maximizing the number of sites visited.'),
  ('cairo:rule:43', 'cairo', 'avoid_or_limit: Long visits to Saqqara and Dahshur during hot periods. Pyramid interiors where mobility is limited. Narrow historic lanes. Uneven pavements. Extended Khan el-Khalili walks. Late-night activities.', 'These experiences can involve heat, stairs, crowds, uneven ground, and limited accessibility. ## Accessibility Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:44', 'cairo', 'verify_each_hotel_and_attraction_individually AND: verify_vehicle_access AND: verify_toilets_and_drop_off_points', 'Accessibility varies significantly between hotels, museums, archaeological sites, historic districts, pavements, and transport facilities.'),
  ('cairo:rule:45', 'cairo', 'prefer: Modern luxury hotels. Private vehicles. Short, accessible museum visits where confirmed. Carefully selected viewing points. One major attraction area per day. AND: avoid_assuming_full_accessibility_at: Pyramids. Historic mosques. Khan el-Khalili. Coptic churches. Uneven archaeological areas.', 'Destination-level accessibility cannot reliably predict the conditions at individual sites. ## Nile Experience Rules'),
  ('cairo:rule:46', 'cairo', 'prefer_private_felucca_at_sunset OR: prefer_private_Nile_dinner_cruise', 'A Nile-based evening adds romance, privacy, and a slower contrast to Cairo’s busy historical attractions.'),
  ('cairo:rule:47', 'cairo', 'prefer_short_felucca_ride AND: avoid_late_return_times', 'A short boat experience offers a memorable Nile activity without adding a demanding late-night schedule.'),
  ('cairo:rule:48', 'cairo', 'include_one_Nile_experience_only', 'One well-timed felucca ride, dinner cruise, or Nile-view dinner is usually sufficient on a short stay.'),
  ('cairo:rule:49', 'cairo', 'consider_two_distinct_Nile_experiences', 'A sunset felucca ride and a separate Nile-view dinner provide different experiences without repeating the same sightseeing pattern. ## Final Decision Rule'),
  ('cairo:rule:50', 'cairo', 'prioritize: Pyramids and Sphinx. Museums. Islamic Cairo. Coptic Cairo. Khan el-Khalili. Saladin Citadel. One Nile experience.', NULL),
  ('cairo:rule:51', 'cairo', 'prioritize: Nile-view hotel. Private guide. Private transfers. Pyramids at a comfortable time. One premium dining experience. One private Nile experience. Generous hotel leisure time.', NULL),
  ('cairo:rule:52', 'cairo', 'prioritize: Early outdoor sightseeing. Short museum visits. Private transport. Predictable meals. Daily leisure time. No more than two major activities per day.', NULL),
  ('cairo:rule:53', 'cairo', 'Cairo_should_not_be_the_only_destination AND: consider_combining_Cairo_with: A Nile cruise. A Red Sea resort. A quieter Egyptian destination.', 'Cairo is exceptionally strong for history and culture but is less naturally suited to a purely quiet or resort-focused holiday because of traffic, noise, crowds, heat, and urban intensity. ---'),
  ('luxor:rule:0', 'luxor', 'do not recommend distant day trips (Dendera, Abydos) or extensive West Bank tomb-hopping by default.', 'Short Luxor stays work best when time is concentrated around Karnak, Luxor Temple, one West Bank highlight (Valley of the Kings or Hatshepsut), and one Nile experience rather than being spread across long transfers and multiple ticketed sites.'),
  ('luxor:rule:1', 'luxor', 'prioritize: Karnak Temple and Luxor Temple (East Bank). One West Bank highlight (Valley of the Kings or Hatshepsut’s Temple). One Nile-side evening experience (felucca or dinner cruise).', 'A two-night stay allows only the essential Luxor highlights without creating an exhausting schedule in the heat.'),
  ('luxor:rule:2', 'luxor', 'add: Second West Bank site (Hatshepsut or Valley of the Kings, whichever was missed). Colossi of Memnon photo stop. One flexible or relaxed evening (Corniche walk, rooftop dining, or Sound & Light Show).', 'Three nights allow a strong first impression of Luxor’s East and West Banks while keeping the itinerary manageable.'),
  ('luxor:rule:3', 'luxor', 'consider: Additional tombs (Valley of the Queens, Tomb of Nefertari, Tutankhamun). Medinet Habu and Ramesseum. Luxor Museum or Mummification Museum. Additional shopping, food, photography, or leisure time.', 'Longer stays make Luxor’s outlying archaeological areas and deeper cultural experiences more practical.'),
  ('luxor:rule:4', 'luxor', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Changing hotels consumes valuable time and creates additional packing, check-in, transfer, and ferry/road traffic risks between East and West Banks.'),
  ('luxor:rule:5', 'luxor', 'consider: Valley of the Queens. Medinet Habu. Deir el-Medina (Workmen’s Village). Tombs of the Nobles. Additional museum time.', 'These areas reward travelers with enough time for longer transfers and outdoor exploration across the West Bank.'),
  ('luxor:rule:6', 'luxor', 'add_one_flexible_half_day', 'Luxor is an intense open-air museum destination, so longer stays should include hotel leisure, spa time, pool time, cafés, or a relaxed Nile experience. ## Honeymoon Rules'),
  ('luxor:rule:7', 'luxor', 'increase romance_weight by 30% increase privacy_weight by 25% increase free_time_weight by 25% decrease activity_density by 20%', 'Luxor honeymoon value comes from private temple experiences, Nile views, premium dining, luxury hotels, and memorable evenings rather than maximum sightseeing.'),
  ('luxor:rule:8', 'luxor', 'prefer: East Bank Corniche. West Bank village area near ferries. Nile Corniche. A luxury Nile-view hotel. West Bank boutique stays when privacy is a priority.', 'These areas offer better access to romantic dining, Nile views, hotel lounges, cruises, and relaxed evening experiences.'),
  ('luxor:rule:9', 'luxor', 'limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include_one_memorable_experience_per_day', 'A private felucca ride, premium dinner, or temple-view experience usually creates more honeymoon value than adding several additional attractions.'),
  ('luxor:rule:10', 'luxor', 'schedule: Private sunset felucca ride. Nile-view dinner. Rooftop dining. Private Nile dinner cruise. Luxury hotel or spa time.', 'Luxor’s most romantic experiences are strongest during sunset and evening hours along the Nile, in rooftop restaurants, and in carefully selected luxury venues.'),
  ('luxor:rule:11', 'luxor', 'prefer romantic_evening OVER: late_night_club_itinerary', 'A relaxed evening generally fits the atmosphere of a cultural honeymoon better than a late-night, high-energy schedule. ## Family Rules'),
  ('luxor:rule:12', 'luxor', 'limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include_one_leisure_block_daily', 'Luxor’s heat, sun exposure, crowds, uneven surfaces, and walking distances at temples and tombs can be tiring for families, so shorter sightseeing blocks work better.'),
  ('luxor:rule:13', 'luxor', 'reduce walking_intensity_target by 25% increase downtime by 25% prefer: Short transfers. Air-conditioned vehicles. Predictable meal breaks. Hotel pools. Early dinners. Child-friendly attractions.', 'Young children handle Luxor better when outdoor visits are short, comfortable, and followed by rest.'),
  ('luxor:rule:14', 'luxor', 'visit_outdoor_attractions early', 'Karnak, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut, and other archaeological sites are exposed to heat and offer limited shade.'),
  ('luxor:rule:15', 'luxor', 'keep karnak_and_luxor_temple_duration between 60 minutes and 90 minutes each', 'The temples are essential, but a focused visit is easier for children than an extended, walking-heavy archaeological day.'),
  ('luxor:rule:16', 'luxor', 'prefer: Short Nile felucca ride. Short Luxor Museum visit. Colossi of Memnon photo stop. Hotel pool time. West Bank sightseeing with private transport and early starts. AND: avoid: Full-day temple or tomb marathons. Long walking tours in the heat. Extended Luxor Souq visits during peak hours. Late-night activities.', 'Younger children benefit from variety, short activity periods, shade, easy transport, and regular breaks. ## Hotel Location Rules'),
  ('luxor:rule:17', 'luxor', 'prefer_central_or_strategic_hotel', 'A cheaper hotel can provide worse overall value when daily taxi costs, ferry crossings, and lost sightseeing time are added.'),
  ('luxor:rule:18', 'luxor', 'prefer East Bank (Karnak/Luxor Temple side)', 'East Bank provides the most convenient access to Karnak, Luxor Temple, Luxor Museum, and many restaurants and cafés.'),
  ('luxor:rule:19', 'luxor', 'prefer West Bank (near ferries or Valley of the Kings side)', 'West Bank offers direct access to the Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut, Colossi of Memnon, and a quieter, more rural atmosphere.'),
  ('luxor:rule:20', 'luxor', 'prefer East Bank Corniche OR West Bank boutique near ferries', 'These areas are better suited to Nile views, premium hotels, restaurants, cafés, lounges, and romantic evening experiences.'),
  ('luxor:rule:21', 'luxor', 'consider Luxor Airport area / South East Bank', 'These areas can be more convenient for Luxor International Airport and modern business facilities, although they are less suitable for a short cultural visit.'),
  ('luxor:rule:22', 'luxor', 'avoid_airport_area_as_default_hotel_base', 'Staying close to the airport may simplify departure but can create long daily journeys to Luxor’s principal historical attractions. ## Luxury Rules'),
  ('luxor:rule:23', 'luxor', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_private_egyptologist_guide AND: prefer_premium_or_exclusive_experiences', 'Luxury value in Luxor is created through comfort, privacy, reliable service, time efficiency, and flexible arrangements rather than simply adding more attractions.'),
  ('luxor:rule:24', 'luxor', 'increase: Comfort. Privacy. Service. Convenience. Exclusivity. Time efficiency. Flexibility. AND: do_not_increase_activity_density_by_default', 'A luxury itinerary should feel effortless and well paced, not crowded with sightseeing stops.'),
  ('luxor:rule:25', 'luxor', 'prefer: Five-star Nile-view accommodation. Private airport assistance. Chauffeured luxury sedan or premium MPV. Private Egyptologist-led touring. Premium Nile cruise. Temple-view or Nile-view dining. Private felucca ride. Spa and pool time. Concierge support. Personal shopping assistance.', 'These services improve the quality, privacy, and convenience of the Luxor experience. ## Budget Rules'),
  ('luxor:rule:26', 'luxor', 'prefer: East Bank Corniche, Luxor Town Center, or West Bank village near ferries. Local Egyptian restaurants. Taxis, minibuses, or ride-hailing for suitable routes. Free or low-cost historic areas. A mix of paid highlights and low-cost activities.', 'Luxor offers strong value when travelers combine local food, compact sightseeing areas, public transport, and carefully selected paid attractions.'),
  ('luxor:rule:27', 'luxor', 'do_not_save_on: Safe and reliable airport transfers. Clean accommodation with working air-conditioning. A licensed guide for Karnak, Valley of the Kings, or Hatshepsut when needed. A well-located hotel.', 'The cheapest option can become more expensive through traffic delays, unreliable transport, poor sleep, and lost sightseeing time.'),
  ('luxor:rule:28', 'luxor', 'prefer_local_food AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions', 'Koshari, ful medames, ta’ameya, local bakeries, cafés, mosques, markets, Nile walks, and selected museums can keep costs manageable while preserving a strong Luxor experience. ## First-Time Visitor Rules'),
  ('luxor:rule:29', 'luxor', 'anchor_the_trip_around: Karnak Temple. Luxor Temple. Valley of the Kings. Temple of Hatshepsut. Colossi of Memnon. One Nile-based evening experience.', 'These attractions provide the clearest introduction to Luxor’s ancient history, temples, tombs, markets, and Nile atmosphere.'),
  ('luxor:rule:30', 'luxor', 'add: Luxor Museum or Mummification Museum. Valley of the Queens or Medinet Habu. Luxor Souq. One additional cultural or leisure experience.', 'Four or more nights allow a more complete introduction without forcing every district into the same day.'),
  ('luxor:rule:31', 'luxor', 'combine: Karnak Temple. Luxor Temple. Avenue of Sphinxes. Luxor Museum.', 'These attractions form a coherent historic area with high cultural experience density on the East Bank.'),
  ('luxor:rule:32', 'luxor', 'combine: Valley of the Kings. Temple of Hatshepsut. Colossi of Memnon. Medinet Habu. Valley of the Queens where appropriate.', 'West Bank archaeological sites work best as a compact full-day heritage visit with private transport. ---'),
  ('alexandria:rule:0', 'alexandria', 'do not recommend a full archaeological program, distant excursions, or changing hotels.', 'A one-night Alexandria stop is best treated as a focused coastal-city visit. Prioritise the Bibliotheca Alexandrina, Qaitbay Citadel, a short Corniche walk, and one seafood or waterfront dinner rather than attempting every museum and archaeological site.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:1', 'alexandria', 'prioritize: Bibliotheca Alexandrina. Qaitbay Citadel and Eastern Harbour. Short Alexandria Corniche sunset walk. One seafood dinner beside the Mediterranean.', 'One night allows only a compact introduction, especially when arriving from Cairo. The itinerary should stay geographically concentrated and avoid long cross-city transfers.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:2', 'alexandria', 'prioritize: Bibliotheca Alexandrina. Qaitbay Citadel and Eastern Harbour. Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa. Pompey’s Pillar and Serapeum. One relaxed waterfront evening.', 'Two nights provide enough time for Alexandria’s main coastal, archaeological, and cultural highlights without making the visit excessively rushed. Alexandria is generally strongest as a short cultural and Mediterranean city break rather than a pure beach-resort destination.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:3', 'alexandria', 'add: Alexandria National Museum or Graeco-Roman Museum. Montaza Palace Gardens. Stanley Bridge and the Eastern Corniche. One local market, café, or food experience. Additional photography or relaxed waterfront time.', 'Three nights allow visitors to combine Alexandria’s principal heritage sites with gardens, museums, food, and coastal scenery while keeping the schedule manageable.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:4', 'alexandria', 'consider: Kom El-Dikka Archaeological Site. Royal Jewellery Museum. Cavafy Museum or literary-themed city walk. Abu al-Abbas al-Mursi Mosque and Anfushi. Additional seafood, shopping, photography, or café time. A separate eastern-coast or beach half-day.', 'Four nights are suitable for a balanced first visit covering archaeology, museums, waterfront areas, local neighbourhoods, food, and leisure without excessive backtracking.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:5', 'alexandria', 'consider: Deeper museum and architecture exploration. Repeat visits to favourite Corniche or harbour areas. Montaza or eastern beach time. A food, photography, or literary itinerary. A day trip toward Rosetta or El Alamein, subject to transport and timing. One flexible half-day.', 'Five nights are generally the upper limit recommended for a first visit focused mainly on Alexandria itself. Longer stays work best when travellers add a specific interest, nearby destination, or slower coastal programme.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:6', 'alexandria', 'recommend only when: traveler_type == REPEAT_VISITOR traveler_interest == FOOD traveler_interest == PHOTOGRAPHY traveler_interest == ARCHITECTURE traveler_interest == BEACH trip_includes_nearby_destinations == TRUE', 'Six or more nights can feel excessive for a standard first-time sightseeing itinerary unless the traveller wants deeper local exploration, extended beach time, specialised photography, food discovery, or nearby excursions.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:7', 'alexandria', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Changing hotels wastes valuable time and creates additional packing, check-in, transfer, and traffic risks. A single well-located base is usually more efficient for Alexandria’s spread-out attractions.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:8', 'alexandria', 'consider: Stanley. San Stefano. Montaza. Eastern beach districts. A hotel with a pool, sea view, garden, or spa facilities.', 'Longer stays make it practical to trade some sightseeing convenience for a more relaxed coastal setting. These areas are farther from the main western archaeological sites, so they are less suitable for short heritage-focused visits. ## Honeymoon Rules'),
  ('alexandria:rule:9', 'alexandria', 'increase romance_weight by 30% increase privacy_weight by 25% increase free_time_weight by 25% decrease activity_density by 20%', 'Alexandria’s honeymoon value comes from Mediterranean views, sunset walks, private boat rides, seafood dining, boutique or luxury hotels, and atmospheric cultural experiences rather than maximum sightseeing. Its urban character makes it more active and less secluded than a dedicated beach-resort destination.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:10', 'alexandria', 'prefer: Central Corniche or Bibliotheca area. Qaitbay and Western Harbour. Stanley or Eastern Corniche. San Stefano. Montaza for a slower coastal atmosphere. A high-quality sea-view hotel.', 'These areas offer the best combination of waterfront scenery, restaurants, cafés, sunset opportunities, hotel comfort, and access to romantic experiences.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:11', 'alexandria', 'limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include_one_memorable_experience_per_day', 'A private harbour cruise, premium seafood dinner, or sunset walk usually creates more honeymoon value than adding several additional attractions.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:12', 'alexandria', 'schedule: Private sunset harbour or coastal boat ride. Mediterranean seafood dinner. Sunset Corniche walk. Montaza Palace Gardens visit. Private guided visit to the Bibliotheca Alexandrina. Private guided visit to Qaitbay Citadel. Hotel lounge, spa, pool, or balcony time. Historic architecture or photography walk.', 'Alexandria’s most romantic experiences are concentrated around the waterfront, harbour, gardens, sea-view hotels, and carefully paced cultural visits.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:13', 'alexandria', 'prefer romantic_evening OVER: late_night_club_itinerary', 'Alexandria’s evening character is primarily dining-focused and social, with waterfront cafés, seafood restaurants, hotel lounges, live music, and illuminated city walks rather than a major clubbing scene. ## Family Rules'),
  ('alexandria:rule:14', 'alexandria', 'limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include_one_leisure_block_daily', 'Traffic, crowded pavements, heat, busy attractions, uneven historic areas, and long cross-city transfers can make Alexandria tiring for families. Short sightseeing blocks with predictable breaks are more practical.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:15', 'alexandria', 'reduce walking_intensity_target by 25% increase downtime by 25% prefer: Air-conditioned transport. Short transfers. Bibliotheca Alexandrina museums or planetarium. Alexandria Aquarium. Montaza Palace Gardens. Short harbour or coastal boat ride. Short Corniche walks. Hotel pool time. Early dinners. Restaurants with clean facilities and familiar food.', 'Young children manage Alexandria better when sightseeing is short, varied, comfortable, and followed by rest.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:16', 'alexandria', 'visit_outdoor_attractions early', 'Qaitbay Citadel, Montaza Gardens, Stanley Bridge, and waterfront areas are more comfortable in the morning or late afternoon than during the hottest and busiest part of the day.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:17', 'alexandria', 'keep major_attraction_duration between 60 minutes and 90 minutes each', 'A focused visit is usually more manageable for children than a long walking-heavy tour through multiple museums, archaeological sites, or crowded historic areas.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:18', 'alexandria', 'prefer: Alexandria Aquarium near Qaitbay Citadel. Bibliotheca Alexandrina planetarium or selected museums. Montaza Palace Gardens. Short Corniche walk with ice cream or fresh juice. Brief Qaitbay Citadel visit. Stanley Bridge viewpoint. Hotel pool and downtime. Private vehicle for distant attractions. AND: avoid: Full-day archaeological sightseeing. Long visits to the Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa. Multiple museums on one day. Long market walks during peak hours. Unplanned street-food stops. Late-night activities. Very crowded summer beaches. Long cross-city journeys during peak traffic.', 'Younger children benefit from variety, shade, short activity periods, easy transport, predictable meals, and regular breaks.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:19', 'alexandria', 'include_one_child_oriented_activity', 'The Alexandria Aquarium, Bibliotheca planetarium, Montaza Gardens, and short boat rides provide variety alongside the city’s history and museums. ## Hotel Location Rules'),
  ('alexandria:rule:20', 'alexandria', 'prefer_central_or_strategic_hotel', 'A cheaper hotel can offer worse overall value when daily taxi costs, traffic delays, and lost sightseeing time are included.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:21', 'alexandria', 'prefer Central Corniche / Bibliotheca area', 'This area offers strong access to the Bibliotheca Alexandrina, central waterfront attractions, cafés, restaurants, museums, and Qaitbay Citadel. It is particularly suitable for short sightseeing-focused stays.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:22', 'alexandria', 'consider Kom El-Dikka, central Alexandria, or the Kom El-Shoqafa / Pompey’s Pillar area', 'These locations provide better access to archaeological and historic sites, although they are generally busier, noisier, and less scenic than waterfront districts.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:23', 'alexandria', 'prefer Central Corniche, Qaitbay, or Western Harbour', 'These areas provide easy access to sea views, harbour scenery, Qaitbay Citadel, sunset photography, seafood restaurants, and waterfront walks.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:24', 'alexandria', 'prefer Central Corniche OR Stanley OR Qaitbay / Western Harbour', 'These areas offer the strongest combination of Mediterranean views, sunset settings, waterfront dining, cafés, photography, and romantic walks.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:25', 'alexandria', 'prefer Central Corniche, Stanley, San Stefano, or Montaza', 'Luxury accommodation, sea-view rooms, modern facilities, premium dining, hotel pools, and concierge services are strongest in these areas, although eastern districts are farther from western archaeological attractions.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:26', 'alexandria', 'prefer Central Alexandria / Raml Station OR Kom El-Dikka', 'These areas generally provide more affordable accommodation, local restaurants, markets, cafés, tram access, and practical connections to central attractions.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:27', 'alexandria', 'consider Stanley, San Stefano, Montaza, or Miami', 'Eastern districts provide better access to coastal scenery, gardens, beach areas, modern hotels, and a livelier local summer atmosphere, but they create longer journeys to central and western historic sites.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:28', 'alexandria', 'consider Alexandria Train Station / Mahatta Misr area', 'The station area is convenient for early departures, train connections, short practical stays, and budget accommodation, but it is busy and lacks the waterfront atmosphere of the Corniche.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:29', 'alexandria', 'avoid_distant_eastern_beach_area_as_default_hotel_base', 'Staying in Miami or another distant beach district can create repeated traffic delays and long daily journeys when the main purpose is sightseeing.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:30', 'alexandria', 'consider Central Alexandria, San Stefano, or a hotel with reliable business facilities', 'Central districts provide better city access, while San Stefano offers more modern hotels, shopping, dining, and contemporary facilities. ## Luxury Rules'),
  ('alexandria:rule:31', 'alexandria', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_private_cultural_guide AND: prefer_premium_or_exclusive_experiences', 'Luxury value in Alexandria is created through comfort, privacy, reliable service, time efficiency, curated access, and flexible arrangements rather than simply adding more attractions.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:32', 'alexandria', 'increase: Comfort. Privacy. Service. Convenience. Exclusivity. Time efficiency. Flexibility. Sea-view quality. Dining quality. AND: do_not_increase_activity_density_by_default', 'A luxury Alexandria itinerary should feel effortless and well paced, with time for waterfront views, hotel facilities, premium meals, and private cultural experiences.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:33', 'alexandria', 'prefer: Five-star sea-view accommodation. Private airport transfer from Cairo International Airport. Chauffeured sedan or premium MPV. Private Egyptologist or specialist cultural guide. Private visits to Qaitbay Citadel and major archaeological sites. Curated Bibliotheca Alexandrina visit. Premium seafood dining. Private harbour or sunset boat ride. Montaza Gardens with private transport. Spa, pool, balcony, or hotel lounge time. Concierge support. Curated architecture, literary, or photography tour.', 'These services improve comfort, privacy, cultural depth, and time efficiency across Alexandria’s spread-out attractions. ## Budget Rules'),
  ('alexandria:rule:34', 'alexandria', 'prefer: Central Alexandria / Raml Station. Kom El-Dikka. Central Corniche when a modest sea view is important. Local Egyptian restaurants. Tram, buses, shared taxis, or reputable ride-hailing. Free Corniche walks and harbour viewpoints. Local markets and historic streets. A mix of paid archaeological sites and low-cost activities.', 'Alexandria offers good budget value through local food, affordable accommodation, public transport, markets, waterfront walks, and selected paid attractions.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:35', 'alexandria', 'do_not_save_on: Clean accommodation with functioning air-conditioning. Safe and predictable airport transfers. A well-located hotel. Reliable transport after dark. Secure luggage storage. A licensed guide when visiting complex archaeological sites. Lift access and manageable stairs when required.', 'The cheapest option can become more expensive through poor sleep, unreliable transport, long traffic delays, vendor pressure, or lost sightseeing time.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:36', 'alexandria', 'prefer_local_food AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions', 'Koshari, ful, ta’ameya, grilled fish, bakeries, fresh juices, cafés, Corniche walks, markets, harbour views, and exterior photography can keep costs manageable while preserving a strong Alexandria experience.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:37', 'alexandria', 'avoid: Paying a large premium for an unused sea-view room. Staying in a distant beach district solely because the nightly rate is lower. Hiring a private driver for every city journey. Booking poorly reviewed accommodation without checking air-conditioning, hot water, cleanliness, lift access, and transport. Using unlicensed or unmetered taxis without agreeing on the fare. Overloading a short trip with Rosetta, El Alamein, or North Coast excursions. Spending the entire trip in hotel or Western-style restaurants.', 'Budget performance depends more on location, comfort, local food, and efficient routing than on choosing the lowest room rate. ## First-Time Visitor Rules'),
  ('alexandria:rule:38', 'alexandria', 'anchor_the_trip_around: Bibliotheca Alexandrina. Qaitbay Citadel and Eastern Harbour. Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa. Pompey’s Pillar and Serapeum. Alexandria Corniche sunset walk. One Mediterranean seafood dinner. Montaza Palace Gardens when time allows.', 'These experiences provide the clearest introduction to Alexandria’s ancient heritage, Mediterranean setting, museums, gardens, food, and urban atmosphere.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:39', 'alexandria', 'combine: Bibliotheca Alexandrina. Corniche walk. Qaitbay Citadel. Seafood dinner.', 'These attractions form the most practical compact coastal route for a very short visit.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:40', 'alexandria', 'combine: Bibliotheca Alexandrina + Corniche + Qaitbay Citadel on one coastal day. Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa + Pompey’s Pillar on another archaeological route. One relaxed evening near the waterfront.', 'Grouping attractions geographically reduces time lost in Alexandria’s traffic.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:41', 'alexandria', 'add: Alexandria National Museum or Graeco-Roman Museum. Montaza Palace Gardens. Stanley Bridge and Eastern Corniche. One historic neighbourhood or market walk. One local seafood or Egyptian food experience.', 'Three or more nights allow visitors to expand beyond the core landmarks without forcing every district into the same day.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:42', 'alexandria', 'consider: Royal Jewellery Museum. Kom El-Dikka Archaeological Site. Abu al-Abbas al-Mursi Mosque. Anfushi historic district. Cavafy Museum. Additional photography, shopping, café, or beach time.', 'Four nights allow a more complete introduction to Alexandria’s archaeology, architecture, food, local life, and Mediterranean atmosphere.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:43', 'alexandria', 'combine: Bibliotheca Alexandrina. Alexandria National Museum. Graeco-Roman Museum. Kom El-Dikka. Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa. Pompey’s Pillar. Qaitbay Citadel.', 'Together these sites present Alexandria’s Hellenistic, Roman, Egyptian, Islamic, modern, and literary dimensions.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:44', 'alexandria', 'combine: Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa. Pompey’s Pillar and Serapeum. Kom El-Dikka Archaeological Site. Qaitbay Citadel. Alexandria National Museum. Graeco-Roman Museum where open and appropriate.', 'Alexandria’s archaeological attractions are distributed across busy urban districts, so they work best as carefully grouped routes with reliable transport or a private guide.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:45', 'alexandria', 'prioritize: Local seafood or grilled-fish restaurant. Egyptian breakfast featuring ful and ta’ameya. Koshari or local street-food experience in a clean setting. Traditional café. Fresh juice, bakery, or Egyptian dessert tasting. Anfushi or harbour-area food exploration.', 'Alexandria’s coastal setting gives it a particularly strong seafood identity, while local bakeries, cafés, Egyptian staples, and traditional neighbourhoods add cultural depth.'),
  ('alexandria:rule:46', 'alexandria', 'prioritize: Qaitbay Citadel and Eastern Harbour. Alexandria Corniche. Stanley Bridge. Bibliotheca Alexandrina architecture. Historic central streets. Anfushi harbour district. Montaza Palace Gardens. Sunset photography beside the Mediterranean.', 'Alexandria offers unusually broad photographic variety through Mediterranean light, harbour scenery, historic architecture, archaeological sites, gardens, markets, and waterfront life. ---'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:0', 'amboseli-national-park', 'do not add Naivasha, Elementeita, or Mara by default.', 'Short Amboseli stays work best when time is concentrated on elephants, swamps, and Kilimanjaro views rather than spread across multiple parks.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:1', 'amboseli-national-park', 'increase romance_weight by 30% increase privacy_weight by 20% increase free_time_weight by 20% decrease activity_density by 20%', 'Amboseli honeymoon value comes from private game drives, Kilimanjaro-backed scenery, and relaxed lodge time rather than maximum wildlife coverage.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:2', 'amboseli-national-park', 'reduce walking_intensity_target by 20% increase downtime by 20% prefer short transfers and predictable meal breaks', 'Young children handle Amboseli better with short, well-timed game drives, pool time, and fewer long vehicle days.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:3', 'amboseli-national-park', 'prefer_central_lodge', 'A cheaper lodge far from Kimana/Meshanani gates often creates worse overall trip value in Amboseli.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:4', 'amboseli-national-park', 'prefer_one_lodge', 'Lodge changes consume valuable game-drive time on a short Amboseli trip.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:5', 'amboseli-national-park', 'consider_Chyulu_Hills_or_Tsavo_add_on', 'Longer stays make a slower scenic or multi-park extension more practical and more rewarding.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:6', 'amboseli-national-park', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_lodge AND: prefer_exclusive_or_private_experiences', 'Luxury value in Amboseli is created through comfort, privacy, and service (fly-in, private 4×4, bush dinners) rather than more game drives.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:7', 'amboseli-national-park', 'prefer_shared_transfer_or_group_safari AND: prefer_high_value_lodge_location AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions', 'Amboseli offers strong value when the itinerary uses core swamp/plains circuits, simple lodge meals, and fewer paid extras.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:8', 'amboseli-national-park', 'anchor the trip around Amboseli swamps and Observation Hill AND: add one Maasai cultural visit (park boundary) AND: include one sunrise/sunset photography session', 'These three elements give the clearest first impression of Amboseli’s wildlife, landscapes, and Kilimanjaro backdrop.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:9', 'amboseli-national-park', 'limit_major_activities_per_day to 2 AND: include one leisure block daily', 'Amboseli family trips work best when the pace stays relaxed with predictable rest and meal times.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:10', 'amboseli-national-park', 'schedule premium bush dinner or sundowner in the evening', 'Amboseli is strongest at sunset, on the plains, and during quiet, private wildlife and landscape experiences.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:11', 'amboseli-national-park', 'reduce_outdoor_walking AND: increase_lodge_and_photography_time', 'Heavy rain and muddy roads make a slower, more flexible Amboseli plan perform better.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:12', 'amboseli-national-park', 'combine morning and late-afternoon game drives on the same day', 'These time blocks cluster well around animal activity and light, creating a more coherent safari experience.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:13', 'amboseli-national-park', 'prefer_lodge_near_main_gates AND: use_private_4x4_when_helpful AND: avoid_multiple_long_game_drives_in_one_day', 'Amboseli’s wildlife and views are rewarding, but easier when movement, heat, and rough roads are controlled.'),
  ('amboseli-national-park:rule:14', 'amboseli-national-park', 'add one flexible half-day', 'Amboseli benefits from breathing room for extra photography, lodge relaxation, or weather adjustments. ---'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:0', 'lake-naivasha', 'Do not add Naivasha, Elementeita, or Mara by default.', 'Short Rift Valley trips work best when time is concentrated on core lake experiences (boat rides, Crescent Island, Hell’s Gate) rather than spread across multiple parks.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:1', 'lake-naivasha', 'romance_weight += 30%, privacy_weight += 20%, free_time_weight += 20%, activity_density -= 20%', 'Naivasha honeymoon value comes from private boat rides, lakeside scenery, and relaxed lodge time rather than maximum activity coverage.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:2', 'lake-naivasha', 'walking_intensity_target -= 20%, downtime += 20%, prefer short transfers and predictable meal breaks.', 'Young children handle Naivasha better with short boat rides, pool time, and fewer long vehicle days.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:3', 'lake-naivasha', 'Prefer one lodge.', 'Lodge changes consume valuable activity time on a short Naivasha trip.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:4', 'lake-naivasha', 'Consider Lake Nakuru/Elementaita add-on.', 'Longer stays make a slower scenic or multi-lake extension more practical and rewarding.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:5', 'lake-naivasha', 'Prefer private transfer AND high-service lodge AND exclusive/private experiences.', 'Luxury value in Naivasha is created through comfort, privacy, and service (private boats, lakeside dining) rather than more activities.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:6', 'lake-naivasha', 'Prefer shared transfer/group activities AND high-value lodge location AND mix free/paid attractions.', 'Naivasha offers strong value when the itinerary uses core lake circuits, simple lodge meals, and fewer paid extras.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:7', 'lake-naivasha', 'Anchor trip around: boat safari, Crescent Island walk, Hell’s Gate excursion AND include one sunrise/sunset photography session.', 'These elements give the clearest first impression of Naivasha’s wildlife, landscapes, and Rift Valley scenery.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:8', 'lake-naivasha', 'Limit major activities/day to 2 AND include one leisure block daily.', 'Naivasha family trips work best when the pace stays relaxed with predictable rest and meal times.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:9', 'lake-naivasha', 'Schedule premium lakeside dinner or sundowner.', 'Naivasha is strongest at sunset, on the water, and during quiet, private wildlife and landscape experiences.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:10', 'lake-naivasha', 'Reduce outdoor walking AND increase lodge/photography time.', 'Heavy rain and muddy roads make a slower, more flexible Naivasha plan perform better.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:11', 'lake-naivasha', 'Combine morning and late-afternoon boat rides/excursions on the same day.', 'These time blocks cluster well around animal activity and light, creating a more coherent nature experience.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:12', 'lake-naivasha', 'Prefer lodge near main jetties/town AND use private 4×4 when helpful AND avoid multiple long activities in one day.', 'Naivasha’s wildlife and views are rewarding, but easier when movement, heat, and rough roads are controlled.'),
  ('lake-naivasha:rule:13', 'lake-naivasha', 'Add one flexible half-day.', 'Naivasha benefits from breathing room for extra photography, lodge relaxation, or weather adjustments. ---'),
  ('masaimara:rule:0', 'masaimara', 'Focus only on Masai Mara; avoid adding extra destinations.', 'Short stays need concentrated game-viewing time.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:1', 'masaimara', 'Prioritize the National Reserve, Big Five drives, and one sunrise/sunset safari.', 'These provide the classic Mara experience.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:2', 'masaimara', 'Increase privacy and free time; choose a conservancy, private vehicle, sundowner, or bush dinner.', 'The Mara is best enjoyed through exclusive, romantic experiences.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:3', 'masaimara', 'Limit to 1–2 game drives daily, add midday rest, and choose a family-friendly camp.', 'Shorter drives and downtime keep children comfortable.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:4', 'masaimara', 'Prefer a private 4×4, luxury camp, fly-in transfer, and conservancy safari.', 'Luxury value comes from comfort, privacy, and exclusivity.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:5', 'masaimara', 'Choose shared safaris, camps near a convenient gate, and low-season travel.', 'Location and timing offer better savings than cutting guide or vehicle quality.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:6', 'masaimara', 'Schedule early and late game drives with a private vehicle where possible.', 'Wildlife activity and light are strongest during these periods.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:7', 'masaimara', 'Travel around July–October and stay near suitable migration areas.', 'River crossings are seasonal and unpredictable; never guarantee sightings.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:8', 'masaimara', 'Prefer scenic flights, private transfers, accessible camps, and relaxed game drives.', 'This reduces rough-road travel and physical strain.'),
  ('masaimara:rule:9', 'masaimara', 'Add a conservancy, cultural visit, or flexible rest half-day.', 'Longer stays allow deeper experiences without rushing. ---'),
  ('nairobi:rule:0', 'nairobi', 'Use Nairobi as a transit stop; focus on one nearby activity or hotel-based rest.', 'Limited time and airport transfers make a packed itinerary impractical.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:1', 'nairobi', 'Combine Nairobi National Park, Karen, and one dining or cultural experience.', 'Two nights allow the city’s main highlights without excessive travel.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:2', 'nairobi', 'Add museums, shopping, Karura Forest, or a second food and cultural experience.', 'Longer stays allow deeper exploration at a relaxed pace.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:3', 'nairobi', 'Prioritize Nairobi National Park, Giraffe Centre, Karen Blixen Museum, and local cuisine.', 'These provide a balanced introduction to Nairobi’s wildlife, culture, and food.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:4', 'nairobi', 'Choose Karen, Gigiri, or Riverside, with private transfers, premium dining, and relaxed activities.', 'Nairobi is best used as a comfortable luxury stop before or after a safari.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:5', 'nairobi', 'Plan 1–2 activities daily, include rest time, and choose family-friendly hotels and transport.', 'Short activities and minimal traffic exposure improve comfort.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:6', 'nairobi', 'Prefer a five-star hotel, chauffeur, private guide, fine dining, and a private park experience.', 'Luxury value comes from comfort, privacy, service, and convenience.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:7', 'nairobi', 'Choose a well-located guesthouse, local restaurants, ride-hailing, and shared tours.', 'Location and safe transport matter more than small accommodation savings.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:8', 'nairobi', 'Focus on museums, Karen Blixen Museum, Bomas of Kenya, markets, and local crafts.', 'Nairobi offers strong cultural and historical experiences.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:9', 'nairobi', 'Add Kenyan cuisine, nyama choma, cafés, and one recommended restaurant.', 'Nairobi has a wide range of local and international dining.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:10', 'nairobi', 'Visit Maasai Market, Village Market, Karen boutiques, or Westlands malls.', 'Nairobi provides greater shopping variety than safari areas.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:11', 'nairobi', 'Choose Nairobi National Park, Karura Forest, or Ngong Hills according to walking ability.', 'Each offers a different level of wildlife and outdoor activity.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:12', 'nairobi', 'Use private transfers, accessible hotels, short activities, and a relaxed schedule.', 'This reduces traffic stress, walking demands, and physical strain.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:13', 'nairobi', 'Stay near JKIA and avoid distant city attractions unless sufficient transfer time is available.', 'Airport proximity reduces the risk of delays.'),
  ('nairobi:rule:14', 'nairobi', 'Consider adding a safari or nearby destination rather than repeating city activities.', 'Nairobi is generally strongest as a 1–3 night city stop. ---'),
  ('port-louis:rule:0', 'port-louis', 'Use Port Louis as a transit stop; focus on one nearby activity or hotel-based rest.', 'Limited time and airport transfers make a packed itinerary impractical.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:1', 'port-louis', 'Combine Caudan Waterfront, Central Market, Aapravasi Ghat, and one dining or cultural experience.', 'Two nights allow the city’s main highlights without excessive travel.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:2', 'port-louis', 'Add museums, shopping, Citadel Fort, or a second food and cultural experience.', 'Longer stays allow deeper exploration at a relaxed pace.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:3', 'port-louis', 'Prioritize Caudan Waterfront, Central Market, Aapravasi Ghat, Blue Penny Museum, and local Mauritian cuisine.', 'These provide a balanced introduction to Port Louis’s culture, history, and food.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:4', 'port-louis', 'Choose Caudan, Grand Bay, or Le Morne, with private transfers, premium dining, and relaxed activities.', 'Port Louis is best used as a comfortable luxury stop before or after a beach honeymoon.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:5', 'port-louis', 'Plan 1–2 activities daily, include rest time, and choose family-friendly hotels and transport.', 'Short activities and minimal traffic exposure improve comfort.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:6', 'port-louis', 'Prefer a five-star hotel, chauffeur, private guide, fine dining, and a private island or sea experience.', 'Luxury value comes from comfort, privacy, service, and convenience.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:7', 'port-louis', 'Choose a well-located guesthouse, local restaurants, ride-hailing, and shared tours.', 'Location and safe transport matter more than small accommodation savings.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:8', 'port-louis', 'Focus on Aapravasi Ghat, Blue Penny Museum, Central Market, Chinatown, and Jummah Mosque.', 'Port Louis offers strong multicultural and historical experiences.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:9', 'port-louis', 'Add Mauritian Creole, Indian, Chinese, and French-inspired cuisine, plus local markets and cafés.', 'Port Louis has a wide range of local and international dining.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:10', 'port-louis', 'Visit Central Market, Caudan Waterfront, Bagatelle Mall, or Cascavelle Shopping Mall.', 'Port Louis provides greater shopping variety than Mauritius’s resort beaches.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:11', 'port-louis', 'Choose Pamplemousses Botanical Garden, Vallée des Couleurs, or nearby coastal excursions according to walking ability.', 'Each offers a different level of wildlife and outdoor activity.');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('port-louis:rule:12', 'port-louis', 'Use private transfers, accessible hotels, short activities, and a relaxed schedule.', 'This reduces traffic stress, walking demands, and physical strain.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:13', 'port-louis', 'Stay near MRU airport or Caudan and avoid distant island attractions unless sufficient transfer time is available.', 'Airport or waterfront proximity reduces the risk of delays.'),
  ('port-louis:rule:14', 'port-louis', 'Consider adding a beach or nature destination (e.g., Grand Bay, Flic-en-Flac, Le Morne) rather than repeating city activities.', 'Port Louis is generally strongest as a 1–3 night city stop within a wider Mauritius holiday. ---'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:0', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Use Île aux Cerfs as a quick day trip or transit-style add-on.', 'The island is best for short beach time, not a packed multi-day base.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:1', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Pair Île aux Cerfs with Belle Mare or another east-coast beach stay.', 'Two nights are enough for one island day plus relaxed coastal downtime.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:2', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Add another Mauritius region instead of repeating island activities.', 'Île aux Cerfs works best as part of a broader Mauritius itinerary.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:3', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Prioritize Île aux Cerfs lagoon time, boat transfer, snorkeling, and beach relaxation.', 'These give the clearest classic Mauritius experience.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:4', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Choose private transfer, premium boat access, and quiet beach time.', 'The island is very strong for romantic lagoon experiences.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:5', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Plan 1–2 activities daily, include rest time, and keep the schedule easy.', 'Short, calm outings work best for children and parents.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:6', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Prefer a private cruise, high-end resort base, and curated island lunch.', 'Luxury value comes from comfort and exclusivity.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:7', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Use shared boat transfers, simple meals, and a short day-trip format.', 'The island is still affordable if you avoid private upgrades.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:8', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Focus on lagoon scenery, swimming, and coastal relaxation.', 'Nature is one of the island’s strongest selling points.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:9', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Keep food expectations simple and plan one mainland meal stop if needed.', 'Île aux Cerfs is not a major food destination.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:10', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Do shopping on the mainland, especially in Flacq or other east-coast stops.', 'Shopping on the island itself is very limited.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:11', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Use private transfers, short activities, and an east-coast base.', 'This reduces walking and transfer stress.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:12', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Stay near MRU or the east coast and avoid unnecessary extra movement.', 'Convenience matters more than trying to fit in too much.'),
  ('ile-aux-cerfs:rule:13', 'ile-aux-cerfs', 'Combine Île aux Cerfs with a beach or city segment elsewhere in Mauritius.', 'The island is strongest as one highlight within a larger holiday. ---'),
  ('south-islands:rule:0', 'south-islands', 'Focus on Pointe d’Esny, Mahébourg waterfront, or Blue Bay Marine Park near MRU airport.', 'Southern highlights near the airport maximize scenic downtime and minimize transfer delays.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:1', 'south-islands', 'Base in Le Morne, Bel Ombre, or Pointe d’Esny and cover Chamarel and Gris Gris.', 'Two nights allow for one dedicated coastal drive day and one relaxed beach day.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:2', 'south-islands', 'Explore the full South Coast Corridor before moving to northern or western Mauritius.', 'Three or more nights allow you to combine mountain hikes, nature reserves, and lagoon relaxation without rushing.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:3', 'south-islands', 'Prioritize Le Morne Brabant, Chamarel Seven Colored Earth, Gris Gris sea cliffs, and Blue Bay snorkeling.', 'These iconic southern landmarks provide the most dramatic introduction to Mauritius''s natural diversity.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:4', 'south-islands', 'Choose a private villa in Bel Ombre or Le Morne, paired with a helicopter tour or private catamaran cruise.', 'The dramatic mountain backdrop and secluded luxury sanctuaries create an ideal romantic setting.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:5', 'south-islands', 'Include La Vanille Nature Park, Blue Bay glass-bottom boat tours, and Rochester Falls.', 'Gentle wildlife encounters and calm lagoon swimming are safe and engaging for all ages.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:6', 'south-islands', 'Base in Bel Ombre or Le Morne Peninsula with private helicopter transfers and fine dining at estate venues.', 'Five-star integrated resort sanctuaries offer world-class golf, spas, and butler service.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:7', 'south-islands', 'Base in Mahébourg or Souillac, use public buses or a rental car, and enjoy free public beaches.', 'Southeast guesthouses and local street food deliver high value without resort markups.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:8', 'south-islands', 'Trek in Black River Gorges National Park, explore Chamarel, and tour Île aux Aigrettes sanctuary.', 'South Mauritius contains the island''s highest concentration of native flora, fauna, and national parks.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:9', 'south-islands', 'Pair Mahébourg street food markets with rum tasting at Rhumerie de Chamarel and heritage estate dining.', 'The South offers an authentic blend of local Creole street food, colonial estate cuisine, and artisanal spirits.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:10', 'south-islands', 'Focus on Mahébourg Market, Bois Chéri Tea Estate, and local rum distilleries.', 'Shopping in the South centers around authentic local spices, artisanal crafts, tea, and rum rather than modern malls.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:11', 'south-islands', 'Use private chauffeured transfers, focus on panoramic drive-up lookouts, and stay in accessible coastal resorts.', 'Viewing Chamarel and Gris Gris via vehicle-accessible points avoids strenuous walking or steep trails.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:12', 'south-islands', 'Stay in Mahébourg or Pointe d’Esny for a 10–15 minute airport transfer.', 'Close proximity to MRU airport avoids long cross-island drives before or after flights.'),
  ('south-islands:rule:13', 'south-islands', 'Split the stay between a South nature/resort base and a North/West beach and nightlife hub. ---', NULL),
  ('mahe-island:rule:0', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_VICTORIA_CLOCK_TOWER_AND_MARKET + BEAU_VALLON_BEACH + ANSE_INTENDANCE_AND_SOUTH_MAHE', 'Very short stays gain more value from properly experiencing core island culture, world-famous granite beaches, and charm-filled southern coastal bays than losing time to distant island-hopping island ferries. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:1', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_VICTORIA_HERITAGE_CENTRE + BEAU_VALLON_RESORT_ATTRACTIONS + SOUTH_MAHE_COAST + PRASLIN_AND_LA_DIGUE_DAY_TRIP', 'This gives a balanced introduction to Creole heritage, world-class beach entertainment, preserved island coves, and seamless Inner Island day excursions. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:2', 'mahe-island', 'prefer_CENTRAL_MAHE_CORE + COSTA_SOUTH_COASTAL_RETREAT + DAY_TRIPS_TO_PRASLIN_AND_LA_DIGUE_VIA_CAT_COCOS AND: use_RENTAL_CARS_SPTC_BUSES_AND_INTER_ISLAND_FERRIES', 'Luxury beachfront resorts, mountain national parks, secluded coastal trails, and ferry connections to Praslin offer distinct regional insights into the Seychelles archipelago. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:3', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_SOUTH_MAHE_LUXURY_VILLA_RESORTS + NORTH_COAST_HERITAGE_STAYS + PRIVATE_SUNSET_CATAMARAN_CRUISE AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + HILLSIDE_DINING + LUXURY_SPA + RUM_TASTING + COUPLE_EXPERIENCES', 'Mahé''s romantic routes mix ultra-luxury cliffside villas, Michelin-caliber seafood dining, rooftop cocktails overlooking granite bays, and quiet walks along secluded white-sand beaches. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:4', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_BOTANICAL_GARDENS_TORTOISES + SAINTE_ANNE_GLASS_BOTTOM_BOAT + CAP_TERNAY_SNORKELING AND: include_BEAU_VALLON_WATER_SPORTS + ZIPLINING_AT_CONSTANCE_EPHHELIA + CREOLE_COOKING_WORKSHOP AND: reduce_STEEP_MOUNTAIN_HIKE_WALKS + LONG_CONTINUOUS_TRANSFERS', 'Mahé has exceptional family sights, including giant tortoise feedings, glass-bottom boat tours, protected calm snorkeling bays, mountain ziplining, and interactive cooking workshops. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:5', 'mahe-island', 'prefer_FOUR_SEASONS_RESORT_SEYCHELLES + MAIA_LUXURY_RESORT + ANANTARA_MAIA_SEYCHELLES AND: increase_PRIVATE_GUIDES + FINE_SEAFOOD_DINING + PRIVATE_MPV_TRANSFERS + VIP_CHARTER_BOATS + SPA', 'Mahé high-end travel relies on world-record numbers of private pool villa sanctuaries, multi-course Creole fusion dining, luxury MPV airport transfers, and private beach-view estate stays. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:6', 'mahe-island', 'prefer_SPTC_PUBLIC_BUSES + SELF_DRIVE_RENTALS + WALKING + LOCAL_TAKEAWAY_FOOD_STALLS AND: book_FREE_BEACH_DAYS_EARLY AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_BEAU_VALLON_STROLLS + VICTORIA_MARKET_WALKS + MOUNTAIN_LOOKOUT_VIEWS', 'Mahé can be accessed affordably using local public buses, Creole takeaway boxes, free public beach parks, and free national park scenic lookouts. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:7', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_VICTORIA_MARKET + MISSION_LODGE + DOMAINE_DE_VAL_DES_PRES + LA_PLAINE_ST_ANDRE AND: include_COLONIAL_FRENCH_BRITISH_ARCHITECTURE + SEYCHELLES_CREOLE_HERITAGE + LOCAL_FESTIVALS', 'These sights showcase Mahé''s unique East-meets-West heritage, mixing African, European, and Asian traditions with 250 years of Seychellois history. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:8', 'mahe-island', 'prefer_KAZ_ZABOKA_ART_STUDIO + NATIONAL_MUSEUM_OF_HISTORY + DOMAINE_DE_VAL_DES_PRES + ARUL_MIHU_NAVINATAN_VINAYAGAR_TEMPLE AND: include_CONTEMPORARY_ISLAND_GALLERIES + HISTORIC_COLONIAL_RENEWAL + ECO_RESORT_DESIGN', 'This route contrasts colourful Dravidian temple architecture with historic wooden plantation estates and eco-conscious contemporary resort design. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:9', 'mahe-island', 'prefer_SEYCHELLES_CREOLE_OCTOPUS_CURRY + LADOB_DESSERT + GRILLED_RED_SNAPPER + TAKAMAKA_RUM_DISTILLERY AND: include_FISH_TAKEOUT_STALLS + ANSE_ROYALE_BISTROS + SEAFOOD_FINE_DINING', 'Mahé dining spans iconic fresh coconut drinks, crispy fried breadfruit, unique UNESCO-recognized Seychellois Creole fusion cuisine, and elite beachfront fine dining. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:10', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_MORNE_SEYCHELLOIS_NATIONAL_PARK + SAINTE_ANNE_MARINE_NATIONAL_PARK + VICTORIA_BOTANICAL_GARDENS + CAP_TERNAY_MARINE_PARK AND: do_not_treat_MANICURED_RESORT_GARDENS_AND_NATIONAL_PARK_JUNGLE_TRAILS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Resort gardens offer manicured tropical flora and pools, while Mahé''s national parks and marine reserves feature endemic species, primary rainforests, and marine wildlife. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:11', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_VICTORIA_SIR_SELWYN_SELWYN_CLARKE_MARKET + EDEN_PLAZA_SHOPPING_CENTRE + CRAFT_VILLAGE_VAL_DES_PRES + ANSE_ROYALE_STALLS AND: include_LOCAL_RUM_STORES + SPICE_SHOPS + CREOLE_HANDICRAFTS', 'Victoria Market offers local spices and crafts, Eden Plaza supplies imported luxury goods, and Val des Prés craft village features authentic Seychellois artisan souvenirs. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:12', 'mahe-island', 'choose_LUXURY_RESORT_SPAS + TRADITIONAL_COCONUT_SCRUB_MASSAGE + HYDROTHERAPY_SANCTUARIES AND: do_not_treat_LOCAL_HOLISTIC_MASSAGE_AND_MODERN_RESORT_HOTEL_SPAS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Mahé wellness ranges from beachside holistic massages to Forbes-rated luxury spa retreats overlooking island granite bay skylines. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:13', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_ANSE_INTENDANCE + MORNE_BLANC_VIEWPOINT + MISSION_LODGE_LOOKOUT + ROCKPOOL_MACHABEE AND: prioritize_GOLDEN_HOUR + BLUE_HOUR + CLEAR_AIR_DAYS', 'These sites produce stunning visual contrasts between glowing turquoise waters, pristine granite boulders, and emerald mountain jungle peaks. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:14', 'mahe-island', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_ONE_OR_TWO_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Island transfers, coastal road navigation, and airport/ferry transfers consume valuable sightseeing hours. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:15', 'mahe-island', 'prefer_DIRECT_CAR_RENTALS_PRIVATE_TRANSFERS_OR_CAT_COCOS_FERRIES_OVER_MULTIPLE_LOCAL_BUS_TRANSFERS', 'Direct transfers eliminate transit confusion and save energy for exploring coastal beaches and mountain trails. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:16', 'mahe-island', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_RESORT_HOTELS + FLAT_BEACH_PROMENADES + PRIVATE_MPV + BOTANICAL_GARDENS_ACCESSIBLE_PATHWAYS AND: reduce_EXCESSIVE_JUNGLE_STEPS + MORNE_BLANC_INCLINES + EXTREME_HUMIDITY_WALKS', 'High jungle mountain steps and steep granite hills cause fatigue; elevators, private MPVs, and flat coastal promenades ease travel. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:17', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_EARLY_MORNING_HERITAGE_VISITS + AIR_CONDITIONED_MUSEUMS_AND_STORES + EVENING_BEACH_DINING AND: reduce_MIDDAY_UNSHADED_BEACH_EXPOSURE', 'Mahé summer temps routinely exceed high tropical heat with intense humidity; early starts and indoor/shaded breaks maintain comfort. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:18', 'mahe-island', 'increase_NATIONAL_MUSEUM_OF_HISTORY + TAKAMAKA_RUM_DISTILLERY + INDOOR_RESORT_ENTERTAINMENT + CRAFT_VILLAGE AND: reduce_MORNE_BLANC_OUTDOOR_DECKS + OUTDOOR_BEACH_PROMENADES', 'Indoor history museums, rum distillery tours, covered craft markets, and tea houses remain excellent regardless of outdoor tropical rain. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:19', 'mahe-island', 'prioritize_VICTORIA_TOWN + BEAU_VALLON_BEACH + MORNE_SEYCHELLOIS + ANSE_INTENDANCE AND: add_ONE_OF_SAINTE_ANNE_MARINE_PARK_MISSION_LODGE_OR_TAKAMAKA_DISTILLERY AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_CREOLE_OCTOPUS_CURRY_OR_TAKEOUT_FISH_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a comprehensive introduction to Mahé''s premier natural heritage and coastal sights alongside authentic local island food culture. ---'),
  ('mahe-island:rule:20', 'mahe-island', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_TEA_TAVERNS + BEACH_CAFES + SPAS + SUNSET_LOUNGES + SHOPPING + FREE_TIME ---', NULL),
  ('johannesburg:rule:0', 'johannesburg', 'Choose a focused, high-impact loop near the city center by taking the Gautrain or a private transfer to Rosebank, exploring contemporary African art at Everard Read Gallery or CIRCUS GALLERY, and enjoying a relaxed lunch or coffee at Rosebank Zone or Rosebank Mall before departing back toward O.R. Tambo International Airport (JNB).', 'Half-day layovers require maximum transit efficiency near major transport arteries; focusing on Rosebank leverages the direct, high-speed Gautrain connection from JNB, offering world-class art, safe walkability, and top-tier dining without risking missed flight connections due to highway traffic.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:1', 'johannesburg', 'Visit the Apartheid Museum and Constitution Hill in the morning to understand South Africa''s struggle for democracy, take a guided afternoon tour of Soweto (including Vilakazi Street and Orlando Towers), and head to Rosebank or Sandton in the evening for open-fire fine dining at places like Marble.', 'A single full day allows energetic travelers to experience Johannesburg''s profound political and cultural history alongside its contemporary, cosmopolitan fine-dining scene.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:2', 'johannesburg', 'Spend day one exploring key historical sites (Apartheid Museum, Constitution Hill, Soweto tour), followed by evening dining in Sandton or Rosebank; spend day two taking a scenic day trip out to the UNESCO-listed Cradle of Humankind (Maropeng & Sterkfontein Caves) or a safari game drive at Pilanesberg National Park before returning for dinner.', 'Multi-day stays allow travelers to balance Johannesburg''s deep human and political heritage with surrounding natural biospheres, ancient fossil caves, and Big Five wildlife reserves.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:3', 'johannesburg', 'Focus on quintessential city highlights—learning history at the Apartheid Museum and Constitution Hill, exploring township heritage on Vilakazi Street in Soweto, viewing contemporary African art in Rosebank, shopping at Sandton City, and experiencing open-fire dining at celebrated local steakhouses.', 'Combining Joburg''s iconic anti-apartheid monuments, vibrant township culture, renowned African art galleries, and modern commercial centers delivers a complete first-time overview of South Africa''s economic powerhouse.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:4', 'johannesburg', 'Book a luxury estate suite or cliffside retreat at premier properties like The Saxon Hotel, Villa & Spa or Four Seasons Hotel The Westcliff, indulge in private fine-dining tasting menus, arrange a sunrise hot-air balloon flight over the Magaliesberg, and enjoy spa treatments surrounded by manicured gardens.', 'Pairing secluded estate luxury and cliffside sunset views with private balloon flights, fine-dining gastronomy, and award-winning wellness sanctuaries creates an unforgettable romantic getaway.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:5', 'johannesburg', 'Visit the interactive exhibits at Sci-Bono Discovery Centre, take a surface heritage tour and gold-pour demonstration at Gold Reef City, spot wildlife at the Johannesburg Zoo, explore open-air food and craft stalls at Prison Break Market, and take a sunrise balloon flight or visit gentle nature reserves in the Magaliesberg.', 'Accessible science centers, historical theme parks, sprawling zoo grounds, and safe open-air food markets keep children engaged and entertained across diverse age groups.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:6', 'johannesburg', 'Book 5-star suites at iconic luxury properties like The Saxon Hotel, Villa & Spa, Four Seasons Hotel The Westcliff, or The Michelangelo Hotel, shop international luxury brands at Diamond Walk in Sandton City, hire private chauffeured luxury SUVs, and enjoy multi-course open-fire tasting menus at premier tables in Rosebank and Sandton.', 'World-class estate hotels, private luxury transport, exclusive high-end shopping precincts, and internationally acclaimed culinary venues provide peak comfort and personalized service.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:7', 'johannesburg', 'Stay in central hostels or boutique guesthouses around Melville, Maboneng, or Braamfontein, navigate key nodes using the Gautrain and Uber, take self-guided or budget walking tours through Maboneng Precinct, visit affordable cultural venues like the Wits Art Museum, and savor local street food and shisa nyama braais in Soweto.', 'Johannesburg provides a dynamic network of affordable urban art precincts, budget-friendly hostels, vibrant street food markets, and rapid rail links suitable for price-conscious travelers.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:8', 'johannesburg', 'Take day trips out of the main urban grid to explore the dramatic caves and ancient landscapes at the Cradle of Humankind, hike the nature trails of Walter Sisulu National Botanical Garden, go mountain biking or birdwatching in the Magaliesberg Biosphere Reserve, or embark on a Big Five day-safari at Pilanesberg National Park.', 'While Greater Johannesburg is a sprawling metropolis, its surrounding region offers fast access to UNESCO biosphere reserves, ancient limestone caves, manicured botanical gardens, and pristine wildlife parks.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:9', 'johannesburg', 'Embark on a diverse culinary journey—sampling township shisa nyama braai meats and chakalaka along Vilakazi Street in Soweto, tasting iconic South African staples like Bobotie and Bunny Chow, exploring Pan-African Ethiopian platters in Jeppestown, and experiencing high-end open-fire gastronomy and craft cocktail lounges in Rosebank and Parkhurst.', 'Johannesburg is the ultimate melting pot of southern and central African gastronomy, offering authentic township braais alongside Pan-African delicacies and world-class fine-dining steakhouses.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:10', 'johannesburg', 'Head on thrill-seeking excursions—bungee jumping or SCAD free-falling between the Orlando Towers in Soweto, canopy zip-lining through forest ravines in the Magaliesberg, white-water rafting down the Vaal River near Parys, or off-road quad biking through bushveld trails.', 'Adrenaline junkies can easily use Johannesburg as a launching pad for iconic urban bungee jumps, white-water river navigation, cliffside zip-lines, and rugged off-road trail riding.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:11', 'johannesburg', 'Stay at full-service luxury hotels in Sandton, Rosebank, or Melrose Arch, take private air-conditioned chauffeured tours to Constitution Hill and the Apartheid Museum with step-free access, explore flat gallery halls at the Everard Read Gallery, and enjoy relaxed high-tea or garden dining at The Saxon or Mount Grace.', 'Accessible cultural museums, private vehicular transport, flat master-planned shopping precincts, and gentle countryside garden dining allow senior travelers to experience Johannesburg in total comfort.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:12', 'johannesburg', 'Take the 15-minute high-speed Gautrain directly from O.R. Tambo International Airport (JNB) to Sandton or Rosebank, browse high-end shops at Sandton City or Rosebank Mall, enjoy a relaxed lunch of traditional South African braai or steak, and return directly to the airport terminal.', 'Immediate connection via the Gautrain between JNB airport and secure commercial hubs allows layover passengers to sample local food, shopping, and urban atmosphere safely without highway traffic delays.'),
  ('johannesburg:rule:13', 'johannesburg', 'Divide your stay between 1 full day of anti-apartheid history and township culture (Apartheid Museum, Constitution Hill, Soweto), 1 full day exploring modern art, luxury shopping, and open-fire dining (Rosebank, Sandton, Parkhurst), and 1-2 days taking surrounding day-trip excursions to the Cradle of Humankind, Magaliesberg, or a Big Five game reserve at Pilanesberg National Park.', 'A comprehensive multi-day itinerary seamlessly bridges Johannesburg''s urban historical roots and high-energy modern districts with ancient biospheres and iconic African wildlife reserves nearby. ---'),
  ('cape-town:rule:0', 'cape-town', 'Choose a focused excursion taking the Table Mountain Aerial Cableway to the summit for 360-degree views of the Mother City, followed by a quick stroll through the colorful historic streets of Bo-Kaap and a traditional Cape Malay snack before returning to Cape Town International Airport (CPT).', 'Half-day layovers require efficient, high-impact scheduling near the city center; prioritizing Table Mountain and Bo-Kaap delivers Cape Town''s most iconic natural landmark and vibrant cultural heritage without risking missed flight connections.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:1', 'cape-town', 'Ascend Table Mountain early via cableway in the morning, explore the colorful streets of Bo-Kaap and historic Greenmarket Square for lunch, take an afternoon trip to the V&A Waterfront and Zeitz MOCAA, and enjoy an oceanfront seafood dinner along the Camps Bay Strip at sunset.', 'A single full day allows energetic travelers to experience Cape Town''s striking contrast between dramatic mountain landscapes, historic Cape Malay culture, world-class modern art, and vibrant Atlantic coastal dining.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:2', 'cape-town', 'Spend day one exploring central highlights including Table Mountain, Bo-Kaap, the V&A Waterfront, and Zeitz MOCAA; spend day two taking a full-day coastal road trip down the Cape Peninsula, traveling via Chapman’s Peak Drive to Cape Point, Cape of Good Hope, and the Boulders Beach Penguin Colony.', 'Multi-day stays allow travelers to balance Cape Town''s central urban landmarks and cultural museums with a world-famous coastal drive through marine reserves and wild penguin habitats.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:3', 'cape-town', 'Focus on quintessential city highlights—ascending Table Mountain, taking a full-day Cape Peninsula trip (Chapman’s Peak Drive, Cape Point, Boulders Beach Penguins), visiting the historic Robben Island prison museum, exploring Bo-Kaap, and dining at the V&A Waterfront.', 'Combining iconic natural wonder peaks, wild African penguin colonies, historic apartheid heritage sites, and harbor dining delivers a complete, unforgettable first-time overview of Cape Town.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:4', 'cape-town', 'Book a luxury ocean-facing suite in Camps Bay or a historic wine estate room in Constantia, schedule a private sunset catamaran cruise from the V&A Waterfront, charter a private vintage sidecar along Chapman’s Peak Drive, and indulge in fine-dining wine-pairing tasting menus in the Cape Winelands.', 'Pairing dramatic Atlantic oceanfront views and boutique vineyard luxury with private sunset cruises, scenic cliffside drives, and acclaimed culinary estates creates a romantic getaway.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:5', 'cape-town', 'Visit the Two Oceans Aquarium at the V&A Waterfront, ride the Table Mountain Aerial Cableway, walk among wild penguins on wooden boardwalks at Boulders Beach, cross the elevated "Boomslang" Tree Canopy Walkway at Kirstenbosch Botanical Garden, and ride the Cape Wheel.', 'Interactive marine touch pools, revolving cable cars, accessible penguin boardwalks, and wide botanical garden lawns keep children entertained without physical strain.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:6', 'cape-town', 'Book 5-star suites at iconic properties like The Silo Hotel, One&Only Cape Town, Mount Nelson, or The Twelve Apostles Hotel & Spa, hire private chauffeured vehicles, take a scenic helicopter flight over the Cape Peninsula, and enjoy private cellar tastings and tasting menus in Constantia and Franschhoek.', 'World-class waterfront luxury hotels, private aerial transport, exclusive estate wine tastings, and internationally acclaimed culinary tables provide high-end comfort and service.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:7', 'cape-town', 'Stay in central hostels or guesthouses around Long Street or Green Point, hike up Lion''s Head or Table Mountain via Platteklip Gorge for free, photograph Bo-Kaap on foot, browse local craft markets at Greenmarket Square and The Watershed, and spend low-cost days on Clifton and Camps Bay public beaches.', 'Cape Town offers extensive zero-cost outdoor mountain hikes, vibrant craft markets, free public beaches, and low-cost self-guided cultural walks for price-conscious travelers.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:8', 'cape-town', 'Explore the native fynbos flora and canopy walkway at Kirstenbosch National Botanical Garden, trek the wilderness trails inside Table Mountain National Park, spot marine life and Cape fur seals in Hout Bay, view wild African penguins at Boulders Beach, and visit the dramatic cliffside landscapes of Cape Point.', 'Cape Town is situated within the unique Cape Floral Kingdom, offering unparalleled access to biodiverse botanical gardens, endemic marine life, and coastal nature reserves.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:9', 'cape-town', 'Embark on a rich culinary journey—sampling traditional Cape Malay curries in Bo-Kaap, exploring third-wave coffee shops and trendy bistros along Bree Street, savoring fresh seafood at the V&A Waterfront, eating gourmet street food at the weekend Bay Harbour Market, and experiencing fine-dining open-fire gastronomy and wine pairings in Constantia.', 'Cape Town is Africa''s premier culinary destination, blending indigenous South African braai traditions, historic Cape Malay spices, fresh Atlantic seafood, and modern fine-dining techniques.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:10', 'cape-town', 'Paraglide tandem off Signal Hill landing in Sea Point, abseil 112 meters down the cliff face of Table Mountain, snorkel with wild Cape fur seals off Hout Bay, surf the swells at Muizenberg Beach, and hike the steep knife-edge ridges of Lion''s Head or India Venster.', 'Adrenaline seekers can turn Cape Town''s dramatic topography into a playground for ocean water sports, high-altitude cliff rappelling, mountain ridge treks, and tandem aerial paragliding.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:11', 'cape-town', 'Stay at step-free luxury properties along the flat V&A Waterfront or Sea Point Promenade, utilize private chauffeured transfers, take the Table Mountain Aerial Cableway, stroll accessible wooden boardwalks at Boulders Beach, take a golf-cart tour of Kirstenbosch Botanical Garden, and enjoy scenic drives along Chapman''s Peak Drive.', 'Revolving cable cars, flat harbor promenades, wheelchair-accessible wooden boardwalks, and scenic vehicle drives allow mature travelers to experience Cape Town''s beauty comfortably.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:12', 'cape-town', 'Take a 20-to-30 minute taxi or ride-share from Cape Town International Airport (CPT) directly to the V&A Waterfront, enjoy a relaxed meal of fresh seafood or South African cuisine, browse artisanal crafts at The Watershed, take in Table Mountain views across the harbor, and return directly to the terminal.', 'High accessibility between CPT Airport and the self-contained V&A Waterfront allows layover passengers to sample local food, shop for authentic crafts, and enjoy mountain views without transit complications.'),
  ('cape-town:rule:13', 'cape-town', 'Divide your stay between 1 full day of city core highlights (Table Mountain, Bo-Kaap, V&A Waterfront, Robben Island), 1 full day along the coastal Cape Peninsula (Chapman''s Peak Drive, Cape Point, Boulders Beach Penguins), and 1 full day exploring the historic wine estates and fine dining of Constantia, Stellenbosch, or Franschhoek.', 'A comprehensive multi-day itinerary bridges Cape Town''s iconic urban mountain landmarks and marine wildlife reserves with world-renowned wine valleys and heritage estates nearby. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:0', 'tbilisi', 'do not recommend Gori + Uplistsikhe, Ananuri + Gudauri, or Kakheti day trips as default additions.', 'The additional road travel can make a short Tbilisi stay unnecessarily rushed. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:1', 'tbilisi', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 15% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective is a relaxed and romantic city experience with scenic views, Georgian dining, cafés, and quality couple time rather than maximum sightseeing. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:2', 'tbilisi', 'reduce_travel_intensity_target by 20% increase_downtime by 20% prefer_short_sightseeing + parks + cable_car + family_friendly_experiences', 'Young children can find long walking routes, crowded historic areas, mountain-road transfers, and excessive sightseeing tiring. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:3', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_hotel_near_CENTRAL_TBILISI', 'A cheaper hotel may not provide better total value once daily taxi costs, traffic, travel time, and sightseeing convenience are considered. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:4', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Hotel changes consume valuable short-trip time and reduce time available for sightseeing, dining, shopping, and relaxation. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:5', 'tbilisi', 'consider_TBILISI + NEARBY_GEORGIAN_DESTINATIONS', 'A longer stay makes it practical to explore Tbilisi''s core attractions along with Mtskheta, Gori, Uplistsikhe, Ananuri, Gudauri, or Kakheti. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:6', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_private_or_personalized_experiences', 'Luxury value in Tbilisi is primarily created through premium accommodation, private transfers, personalized tours, fine dining, spa experiences, wine experiences, and convenient sightseeing. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:7', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_central_hotel_location AND: use_metro_or_local_bus_where_practical AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions', 'Maintain sightseeing quality while reducing unnecessary transportation and accommodation costs. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:8', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_OLD_TBILISI AND: group_OLD_TBILISI + FREEDOM_SQUARE + RUSTAVELI_AVENUE + RIVERSIDE_EXPERIENCES', 'Central Tbilisi provides convenient access to historic streets, churches, restaurants, cafés, cultural attractions, shopping, and relaxed city experiences. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:9', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_MTATSMINDA_AND_NARIKALA AND: group_panorama_views + OLD_TBILISI + RIVER_VIEWS + CITYSCAPES', 'Mtatsminda, Narikala Fortress, the Tbilisi Cable Car, and Old Tbilisi provide some of the city''s strongest panoramic and photographic experiences. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:10', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_TBILISI_SURROUNDINGS AND: group_hiking + MOUNTAIN_VIEWS + SCENIC_ROADS + NATURE_EXPERIENCES', 'The areas surrounding Tbilisi provide opportunities for hiking, scenic drives, mountain viewpoints, and nature-focused excursions. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:11', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_OLD_TBILISI AND: group_NARIKALA + ABANOTUBANI + SIONI_CATHEDRAL + GEORGIAN_HERITAGE_EXPERIENCES', 'These experiences showcase Tbilisi''s historic architecture, religious heritage, traditional neighborhoods, baths, and Georgian cultural character. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:12', 'tbilisi', 'consider_MTSKHETA_AND_GORI_UPLISTSIKHE AND: group_ancient_sites + churches + museums + archaeological_landscapes', 'Mtskheta, Gori, and Uplistsikhe provide strong opportunities to experience Georgia''s religious, historical, archaeological, and cultural heritage beyond Tbilisi. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:13', 'tbilisi', 'consider_split_itinerary BETWEEN: CENTRAL_TBILISI + ANANURI/GUDAURI', 'Separating central Tbilisi sightseeing from longer mountain excursions reduces unnecessary backtracking and keeps the itinerary comfortable. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:14', 'tbilisi', 'consider_KAKHETI AND: group_winery_visits + WINE_TASTING + GEORGIAN_FOOD + COUNTRYSIDE_EXPERIENCES', 'Kakheti is Georgia''s principal wine region and provides a strong combination of wine, food, countryside, and cultural experiences. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:15', 'tbilisi', 'reduce_mountain_and_remote_outdoor_activities AND: prefer_CENTRAL_TBILISI AND: increase_flexible_indoor_or_hotel_time', 'Rain, fog, snow, and poor visibility can reduce the value and safety of viewpoints, mountain excursions, and longer road journeys. ---'),
  ('tbilisi:rule:16', 'tbilisi', 'prefer_OLD_TBILISI + MTATSMINDA + RIVERSIDE_EXPERIENCES AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Couples generally benefit more from scenic walks, panoramic views, Georgian dining, cafés, spa experiences, and free time than from packing multiple distant destinations into one day. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:0', 'batumi', 'do not recommend Mtirala National Park + waterfalls, Batumi Botanical Garden + mountain excursions, or multiple Adjara day trips as default additions.', 'Additional road travel can make a short Batumi stay unnecessarily rushed. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:1', 'batumi', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 15% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective is a relaxed coastal experience with beach time, scenic walks, sunsets, Georgian dining, cafés, and quality couple time rather than maximum sightseeing. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:2', 'batumi', 'reduce_travel_intensity_target by 20% increase_downtime by 20% prefer_short_sightseeing + BEACH + PARKS + BOULEVARD + FAMILY_FRIENDLY_EXPERIENCES', 'Young children can find long walking routes, crowded areas, extended road journeys, and excessive sightseeing tiring. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:3', 'batumi', 'prefer_hotel_near_CENTRAL_BATUMI', 'A cheaper hotel may not provide better total value once daily taxi costs, traffic, travel time, and sightseeing convenience are considered. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:4', 'batumi', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Hotel changes consume valuable short-trip time and reduce time available for sightseeing, beach relaxation, dining, shopping, and leisure. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:5', 'batumi', 'consider_BATUMI + ADJARA_DESTINATIONS', 'A longer stay makes it practical to combine Batumi''s core attractions with the Botanical Garden, Gonio, Mtirala National Park, waterfalls, and other Adjara experiences. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:6', 'batumi', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel AND: prefer_private_or_personalized_experiences', 'Luxury value in Batumi is primarily created through premium accommodation, private transfers, personalized tours, fine dining, spa experiences, seaside experiences, and convenient sightseeing. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:7', 'batumi', 'prefer_central_hotel_location AND: use_city_bus_or_local_transport_where_practical AND: mix_free_and_paid_attractions', 'Maintain sightseeing quality while reducing unnecessary transportation and accommodation costs. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:8', 'batumi', 'prefer_OLD_BATUMI AND: group_OLD_BATUMI + EUROPE_SQUARE + BATUMI_BOULEVARD + SEASIDE_EXPERIENCES', 'Central Batumi provides convenient access to historic streets, architecture, restaurants, cafés, parks, the waterfront, and relaxed city experiences. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:9', 'batumi', 'prefer_BATUMI_BOULEVARD_AND_ALI_NINO AND: group_SEA_VIEWS + OLD_BATUMI + MIRACLE_PARK + PANORAMIC_CITYSCAPES', 'Batumi Boulevard, the Black Sea waterfront, Ali & Nino, Miracle Park, and the surrounding cityscape provide strong sunset and photography opportunities. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:10', 'batumi', 'prefer_BATUMI_SURROUNDINGS AND: group_HIKING + WATERFALLS + MOUNTAIN_VIEWS + NATURE_EXPERIENCES', 'The wider Adjara region provides opportunities for hiking, waterfalls, forest experiences, scenic mountain roads, and outdoor activities. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:11', 'batumi', 'prefer_OLD_BATUMI AND: group_EUROPE_SQUARE + GONIO_FORTRESS + BATUMI_ARCHITECTURE + ADJARAN_CULTURAL_EXPERIENCES', 'These experiences showcase Batumi''s historic architecture, ancient heritage, multicultural character, and Adjara''s cultural identity. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:12', 'batumi', 'consider_GONIO_FORTRESS + ADJARA_HISTORIC_SITES AND: group_ANCIENT_SITES + FORTRESS + CULTURAL_EXPERIENCES + REGIONAL_LANDSCAPES', 'Gonio and other historic sites around Adjara provide opportunities to experience the region''s ancient, Georgian, and multicultural heritage beyond central Batumi. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:13', 'batumi', 'consider_split_itinerary BETWEEN: CENTRAL_BATUMI + MTIRALA_OR_ADJARA_MOUNTAIN_EXCURSIONS', 'Separating central Batumi sightseeing from longer mountain excursions reduces unnecessary backtracking and keeps the itinerary comfortable. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:14', 'batumi', 'consider_ADJARAN_CUISINE AND: group_ADJARULI_KHACHAPURI + GEORGIAN_FOOD + LOCAL_MARKETS + WINE_EXPERIENCES', 'Batumi provides strong access to Georgian and Adjara cuisine, seafood, cafés, restaurants, wine experiences, and regional culinary traditions. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:15', 'batumi', 'reduce_MOUNTAIN_AND_REMOTE_OUTDOOR_ACTIVITIES AND: prefer_CENTRAL_BATUMI AND: increase_FLEXIBLE_INDOOR_OR_HOTEL_TIME', 'Heavy rain, fog, and poor visibility can reduce the value and practicality of beaches, viewpoints, mountain excursions, hiking, and longer road journeys. ---'),
  ('batumi:rule:16', 'batumi', 'prefer_BATUMI_BOULEVARD + OLD_BATUMI + SEASIDE_SUNSETS AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Couples generally benefit more from seaside walks, sunsets, cafés, Georgian dining, spa experiences, beach time, and free time than from packing multiple distant destinations into one day. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:0', 'gori', 'prefer_GORI_CITY_CORE + ONE_MAJOR_EXCURSION AND: do not recommend UPLISTSIKHE + ATENI_VALLEY + WATERFALLS + MULTIPLE_RURAL_EXCURSIONS as default additions.', 'Gori''s central attractions can be covered efficiently, but adding several surrounding excursions can make a short stay unnecessarily rushed. Uplistsikhe alone is around a 25-minute drive from central Gori, while Ateni Valley begins around 10 km from the city. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:1', 'gori', 'increase_romance_weight by 15% increase_privacy_weight by 15% increase_free_time_weight by 20% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective is a relaxed cultural and countryside experience with scenic drives, Georgian dining, wine experiences, quiet rural landscapes, sunset viewpoints, and quality couple time rather than maximum sightseeing. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:2', 'gori', 'reduce_travel_intensity_target by 20% increase_downtime by 20% prefer_SHORT_CITY_SIGHTSEEING + PARKS + EASY_VIEWPOINTS + FAMILY_FRIENDLY_EXPERIENCES', 'Young children can find long archaeological walks, uneven rocky terrain, extended road journeys, and excessive sightseeing tiring. Uplistsikhe in particular is an open-air archaeological site with rock-cut structures and uneven terrain. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:3', 'gori', 'prefer_hotel_near_CENTRAL_GORI', 'Gori''s main attractions are concentrated around the city centre, including Gori Fortress and the Stalin Museum. Staying centrally can reduce unnecessary daily transport and make short sightseeing periods more efficient. Gori Fortress is located in the heart of the city. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:4', 'gori', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Hotel changes consume valuable short-trip time and reduce time available for Gori sightseeing, archaeological excursions, dining, wine experiences, and relaxation. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:5', 'gori', 'consider_GORI + ATENI_VALLEY + REGIONAL_NATURE_EXPERIENCES', 'A longer stay makes it practical to combine Gori''s historic core with the Ateni Valley, where travelers can experience the Tana River, mountain scenery, Biisi Waterfall, hiking trails, and historic monuments. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:6', 'gori', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_high_service_hotel_or_BOUTIQUE_STAY AND: prefer_private_or_personALIZED_EXPERIENCES', 'Luxury value around Gori is better created through private transfers, boutique accommodation, curated wine experiences, private countryside excursions, Georgian culinary experiences, and personalized sightseeing rather than a large luxury-shopping or nightlife scene. Ateni wineries can offer wine tasting, Georgian cuisine, lunch/dinner and culinary experiences. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:7', 'gori', 'prefer_CENTRAL_HOTEL_LOCATION AND: use_WALKING + LOCAL_TRANSPORT_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: mix_FREE_AND_PAID_ATTRACTIONS', 'Gori''s central attractions can be combined efficiently on foot, while paid transport can be reserved for Uplistsikhe, Ateni Valley and more distant rural sites. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:8', 'gori', 'prefer_CENTRAL_GORI AND: group_GORI_FORTRESS + OLD_GORI + STALIN_MUSEUM + CENTRAL_CAFES + GEORGIAN_DINING', 'Central Gori provides convenient access to the fortress, museums, historic streets, restaurants and relaxed city experiences. Gori Fortress is centrally located on a rocky hill and also provides views over the city and surrounding mountains. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:9', 'gori', 'prefer_GORI_FORTRESS + ATENI_VALLEY AND: group_CITY_VIEWS + MOUNTAIN_LANDSCAPES + VINEYARDS + HISTORIC_ARCHITECTURE', 'Gori Fortress provides elevated views over Gori and the surrounding Caucasus Mountains, while Ateni Valley combines mountain scenery, terraced vineyards, waterways and historic monuments. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:10', 'gori', 'prefer_ATENI_VALLEY AND: group_HIKING + WATERFALLS + FOREST + MOUNTAIN_VIEWS + RURAL_EXPERIENCES', 'Ateni Valley is the strongest nearby option for outdoor experiences, with the Tana River, mountain scenery and the Biisi Waterfall accessible by a 2.5 km hiking trail. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:11', 'gori', 'prefer_GORI_CITY_CORE + UPLISTSIKHE AND: group_GORI_FORTRESS + STALIN_MUSEUM + ETHNOGRAPHIC_EXPERIENCES + ANCIENT_SITES', 'Gori combines medieval and regional history with Soviet-era heritage, while nearby Uplistsikhe adds an ancient rock-hewn settlement dating back to the 6th–5th century BC. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:12', 'gori', 'consider_UPLISTSIKHE + ATENI_SIONI + ATENI_FORTRESS AND: group_ANCIENT_SITES + MEDIEVAL_ARCHITECTURE + FORTRESS + RELIGIOUS_HERITAGE + REGIONAL_LANDSCAPES', 'The area around Gori contains major archaeological and historical sites. Uplistsikhe is an ancient rock-hewn settlement, while Ateni Valley contains Ateni Sioni, Ateni Fortress and other historic monuments. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:13', 'gori', 'consider_split_itinerary BETWEEN: CENTRAL_GORI + ATENI_VALLEY_OR_OTHER_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS', 'Separating central Gori sightseeing from rural and mountain excursions reduces unnecessary backtracking and keeps the itinerary comfortable. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:14', 'gori', 'consider_SHIDA_KARTLI_CUISINE_AND_WINE AND: group_GEORGIAN_FOOD + LOCAL_PRODUCE + WINE_TASTING + FAMILY_WINE_CELLARS', 'Gori and the surrounding Shida Kartli region provide access to local wine cellars, Georgian cuisine and agricultural products. Ateni is a notable wine area, and local wineries offer tastings and culinary experiences. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:15', 'gori', 'prefer_ATENI_VALLEY AND: consider_WINE_CELLAR + VINEYARDS + GEORGIAN_MEAL', 'Ateni is a distinctive winemaking area with historic vineyard terraces and local wine cellars offering tastings, food and cultural experiences. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:16', 'gori', 'reduce_UPLISTSIKHE + WATERFALL + HIKING + REMOTE_OUTDOOR_ACTIVITIES AND: prefer_CENTRAL_GORI AND: increase_FLEXIBLE_INDOOR_OR_HOTEL_TIME', 'Rain, poor visibility and slippery outdoor terrain can reduce the comfort and value of archaeological, hiking and mountain excursions. Uplistsikhe and the Ateni Valley contain substantial outdoor walking components. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:17', 'gori', 'prefer_ATENI_VALLEY + WINE_EXPERIENCE + SCENIC_GORI AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Couples generally benefit more from scenic countryside, vineyard experiences, Georgian dining, wine tasting and relaxed time together than from packing multiple archaeological and historical sites into one day. Ateni wineries can combine wine, food, cultural experiences and countryside settings. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:18', 'gori', 'prioritize_GORI_FORTRESS + STALIN_MUSEUM + UPLISTSIKHE', 'These provide the strongest combination of Gori''s central historical identity and its most important nearby archaeological attraction. Uplistsikhe is approximately a 25-minute drive from central Gori. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:19', 'gori', 'prioritize_GORI_CITY_CORE + UPLISTSIKHE + ATENI_VALLEY', 'This combination provides a balanced experience of Gori''s urban history, ancient archaeology, religious heritage, vineyards, mountains, rivers and outdoor landscapes without requiring excessively long regional travel. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:20', 'gori', 'reduce_UPLISTSIKHE_HIKING_INTENSITY AND: prefer_CENTRAL_GORI + EASY_ACCESS_ATTRACTIONS AND: verify_SITE_ACCESS_BEFORE_BOOKING', 'Gori Fortress involves an elevated hilltop setting, while Uplistsikhe and some Ateni Valley experiences involve uneven outdoor terrain. Site-specific accessibility should therefore be checked before confirming the itinerary. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:21', 'gori', 'prefer_GORI_FORTRESS + CENTRAL_GORI OR: prefer_STALIN_MUSEUM AND: avoid_multiple_OUTSKIRT_EXCURSIONS', 'Gori is strategically positioned between Tbilisi and western Georgia, making it useful as a short cultural stop. The city is approximately 1 hour 10 minutes by road from Tbilisi. ---'),
  ('gori:rule:22', 'gori', 'prefer_ATENI_WINE_CELLARS + LOCAL_GEORGIAN_DINING + RURAL_SHIDA_KARTLI AND: decrease_GENERIC_TOURIST_ACTIVITY_WEIGHT', 'The wider Gori area offers family-run wine cellars, local cuisine, vineyards and rural experiences that can provide a more regionally focused experience beyond the city''s major museums. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:0', 'uplistsikhe', 'prioritize_UPLISTSIKHE_INNER_CITY + MAJOR_ROCK_CUT_STRUCTURES + PANORAMIC_VIEWPOINTS AND: avoid_DETAILED_FULL_SITE_EXPLORATION', 'Uplistsikhe is a substantial archaeological complex rather than a single monument. A very short visit should concentrate on its strongest surviving structures and overall landscape. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:1', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_FULL_CORE_UPLISTSIKHE_EXPERIENCE AND: group_INNER_CITY + ROCK_CUT_STREETS + HALLS + RELIGIOUS_STRUCTURES + WINE_FACILITIES + SECRET_TUNNEL + VIEWPOINTS', 'The archaeological reserve contains streets, squares, public spaces, temples, theatre, wine presses, wine cellars, and a tunnel connecting toward the Mtkvari River. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:2', 'uplistsikhe', 'increase_scenic_weight by 20% increase_photography_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 10% decrease_activity_density by 20% AND: prefer_PRIVATE_TRANSFER + RELAXED_UPLISTSIKHE_EXPLORATION + SCENIC_VIEWS + GEORGIAN_DINING', 'Uplistsikhe works best for honeymoon travelers as a scenic cultural excursion rather than a dense archaeological checklist. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:3', 'uplistsikhe', 'reduce_UPLISTSIKHE_ROUTE_LENGTH by 30% increase_rest_time by 20% prefer_MUSEUM + MAIN_STRUCTURES + SHORT_VIEWPOINT_ROUTE AND: avoid_DIFFICULT_ROCK_SECTIONS', 'The archaeological complex involves natural rock surfaces, slopes, steps, footways, and exposed sections that require close supervision with young children. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:4', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_INTERACTIVE_ARCHAEOLOGICAL_EXPLORATION AND: group_SECRET_TUNNEL + ANCIENT_STREETS + CAVE_CHAMBERS + WINE_PRESSES + VIEWPOINTS', 'Older children can engage more effectively with Uplistsikhe as an exploratory and educational archaeological experience. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:5', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_PRIVATE_TRANSFER AND: prefer_PRIVATE_EXPERT_GUIDE AND: prefer_FLEXIBLE_VISIT_TIMING + PREMIUM_REGIONAL_DINING', 'Uplistsikhe has limited standalone luxury infrastructure. Luxury value is created through high-quality transportation, private guiding, flexibility, personalized interpretation, and premium complementary experiences. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:6', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT_TO_GORI AND: use_SHARED_OR_LOCAL_TRANSPORT_TO_UPLISTSIKHE_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: prefer_INDEPENDENT_EXPLORATION_OR_AUDIO_GUIDE', 'The attraction itself can be visited economically. Transportation from Tbilisi or Gori is generally the main variable affecting the total day-trip cost. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:7', 'uplistsikhe', 'reduce_ROUTE_LENGTH AND: prefer_MUSEUM + LOWER_OR_EASIER_SECTIONS + SELECTED_MAIN_STRUCTURES AND: verify_CURRENT_SITE_ACCESS', 'The Uplistsikhe Museum has a ramp, but this should not be interpreted as full accessibility throughout the wider archaeological complex. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:8', 'uplistsikhe', 'increase_UPLISTSIKHE_VISIT_TIME AND: prioritize_INNER_CITY + CENTRAL_ARCHITECTURAL_ENSEMBLE + BASILICAS + RELIGIOUS_STRUCTURES + RESIDENTIAL_AREAS + MUSEUM', 'Uplistsikhe was an important religious, political, and cultural centre, with archaeological remains spanning multiple historical periods. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:9', 'uplistsikhe', 'prioritize_CENTRAL_ENSEMBLE + ROCK_CUT_HALLS + PILLARED_STRUCTURES + BASILICAS + DECORATIVE_ROCK_CUT_DETAILS', 'UNESCO identifies the central ensemble, large rock-cut hall, palace complex, and basilicas as particularly important architectural elements of Uplistsikhe. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:10', 'uplistsikhe', 'prioritize_PAGAN_HERITAGE + ROCK_CUT_BASILICAS + UPLISTSULI_CHURCH + CHRISTIAN_TRANSITION', 'Uplistsikhe provides important evidence of different religious periods, including its major pre-Christian role and later Christian development. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:11', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING_OR_LATE_AFTERNOON_WHERE_OPERATING_HOURS_ALLOW AND: group_ROCK_CUT_ARCHITECTURE + UPPER_VIEWPOINTS + MTKVARI_VALLEY + ARCHAEOLOGICAL_LANDSCAPE', 'The combination of carved rock architecture, elevated terrain, and Mtkvari River landscapes makes photography one of Uplistsikhe''s strongest secondary experiences. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:12', 'uplistsikhe', 'position_UPLISTSIKHE_AS_LIGHT_TO_MODERATE_ARCHAEOLOGICAL_EXPLORATION AND: do_not_position_AS_EXTREME_ADVENTURE', 'Uplistsikhe provides active walking over rocky archaeological terrain, but it is not a technical hiking, climbing, mountaineering, or extreme-adventure destination. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:13', 'uplistsikhe', 'combine_UPLISTSIKHE_WITH_GORI_OR_SHIDA_KARTLI_FOOD_AND_WINE AND: do_not_treat_UPLISTSIKHE_AS_PRIMARY_CULINARY_DESTINATION', 'Food and wine strengthen an Uplistsikhe excursion, but the archaeological site itself is primarily a historical and cultural attraction. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:14', 'uplistsikhe', 'allow_SMALL_UPLISTSIKHE_SOUVENIR_PURCHASE AND: prefer_GORI_OR_TBILISI_FOR_MAJOR_SHOPPING', 'Uplistsikhe offers limited souvenir-oriented shopping and should not be positioned as a significant retail destination. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:15', 'uplistsikhe', 'do_not_base_EVENING_AT_UPLISTSIKHE AND: prefer_GORI_FOR_RELAXED_EVENING OR: prefer_TBILISI_FOR_MAJOR_NIGHTLIFE', 'Uplistsikhe is primarily a daytime archaeological attraction and does not have a meaningful dedicated nightlife scene. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:16', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_EARLY_VISIT_OR_LATE_AFTERNOON_VISIT AND: reduce_MIDDAY_EXPOSURE AND: increase_WATER + REST + SUN_PROTECTION_PRIORITY', 'Much of Uplistsikhe is an exposed outdoor archaeological landscape, making prolonged exploration less comfortable during strong summer heat. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:17', 'uplistsikhe', 'reduce_UPPER_ROCK + STEEP_SECTIONS + SECRET_TUNNEL_ROUTE AND: consider_SHORTER_VISIT_OR_RESCHEDULING', 'Natural and worn rock surfaces, slopes, and steps can become more difficult to negotiate when wet. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:18', 'uplistsikhe', 'strongly_reduce_FULL_ARCHAEOLOGICAL_ROUTE AND: verify_SITE_CONDITIONS_BEFORE_VISIT', 'Ice or snow can significantly increase difficulty on Uplistsikhe''s exposed rocky surfaces and historic footways. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:19', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_DIRECT_TAXI_OR_PRIVATE_TRANSFER_TO_UPLISTSIKHE OR: use_LOCAL_TRANSPORT_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Uplistsikhe is approximately 10 km from Gori and around a 25-minute drive from the city centre. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:20', 'uplistsikhe', 'consider_UPLISTSIKHE + GORI_COMBINATION', 'Combining Uplistsikhe with Gori creates an efficient full-day historical excursion and provides contrasting ancient, medieval, and modern historical experiences. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:21', 'uplistsikhe', 'consider_MTSKHETA + GORI + UPLISTSIKHE', 'This combination covers several major periods of Georgian history but should be treated as an intensive full-day itinerary rather than the default relaxed option. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:22', 'uplistsikhe', 'consider_UPLISTSIKHE_ONLY_IF_TRANSPORT_TIMING_IS_PRACTICAL AND: prioritize_INNER_CITY + MAJOR_STRUCTURES + VIEWPOINT', 'Uplistsikhe should not be inserted into a tight transit schedule if road transfers leave insufficient time for meaningful archaeological exploration. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:23', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_GUIDED_UPLISTSIKHE_HISTORY + REGIONAL_GEORGIAN_MEAL + SHIDA_KARTLI_EXPERIENCE AND: decrease_GENERIC_TOURIST_ACTIVITY_WEIGHT', 'The strongest authentic experience comes from understanding Uplistsikhe''s archaeological and cultural significance and connecting it with the wider traditions of Shida Kartli. ---'),
  ('uplistsikhe:rule:24', 'uplistsikhe', 'prefer_UPLISTSIKHE + GORI AND: group_ANCIENT_ARCHAEOLOGY + MEDIEVAL_HERITAGE + MODERN_HISTORY', 'Uplistsikhe and Gori are geographically close and provide one of the most practical history-focused combinations in Shida Kartli. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:0', 'gudauri', 'prioritize_GUDAURI_CORE + SKI_OR_MOUNTAIN_EXPERIENCES AND: do not recommend KAZBEGI + MULTIPLE_GEORGIAN_MILITARY_ROAD_STOPS + MULTIPLE_ADVENTURE_ACTIVITIES as default additions.', 'A short Gudauri stay is best focused on skiing, snowboarding, mountain scenery, cable-car experiences, relaxation, and one selected scenic activity. Additional road excursions can significantly reduce useful time at the resort. Gudauri is approximately 120 km from Tbilisi, with the road journey generally taking around 2–2.5 hours. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:1', 'gudauri', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 20% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective should be a relaxed alpine experience combining mountain views, snow, scenic cable-car rides, private dining, spa or hotel relaxation, photography, and quality couple time rather than maximum skiing and sightseeing. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:2', 'gudauri', 'reduce_ski_intensity_target by 25% increase_downtime by 25% prefer_BEGINNER_SNOW_EXPERIENCES + EASY_SLOPES + SKI_SCHOOL + SCENIC_CABLE_CAR + HOTEL_RELAXATION', 'Young children can become tired quickly from cold weather, ski equipment, altitude, snow activities, and extended outdoor exposure. Gudauri provides beginner terrain and professional ski instruction, making controlled introductory experiences preferable to intensive ski days. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:3', 'gudauri', 'prefer_hotel_near_PREFERRED_SKI_ACCESS', 'In a ski resort, proximity to the appropriate lift, equipment rental, ski school, restaurants, and desired slopes can be more valuable than a small accommodation saving, particularly for families, beginners, and short stays. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:4', 'gudauri', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Hotel changes consume valuable mountain-holiday time and complicate luggage, ski equipment, transfers, skiing, dining, and relaxation. Gudauri generally works best as a single mountain base for a short stay. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:5', 'gudauri', 'prioritize_MULTIPLE_SKI_DAYS AND: consider_ONE_SCENIC_OR_KAZBEGI_EXCURSION', 'Gudauri''s ski season normally runs from December to around mid-April, with extensive lift-served terrain reaching approximately 3,276 m. A longer stay provides time for skiing at different ability levels without sacrificing relaxation or scenic experiences. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:6', 'gudauri', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_HIGH_SERVICE_SKI_IN_SKI_OUT_OR_PREMIUM_HOTEL AND: prefer_PRIVATE_INSTRUCTOR_OR_GUIDE AND: prefer_private_or_personalized_experiences', 'Luxury value in Gudauri is primarily created through premium accommodation, convenient slope access, private transportation, personalized ski instruction, mountain dining, wellness, private guiding, and carefully managed adventure experiences rather than luxury shopping or extensive urban entertainment. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:7', 'gudauri', 'prefer_CONVENIENT_GUESTHOUSE_OR_APARTMENT AND: use_SHARED_OR_PUBLIC_TRANSFER_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: compare_EQUIPMENT_RENTAL + SKI_PASS + ACCOMMODATION_PACKAGES', 'Gudauri can provide comparatively accessible mountain-sport experiences, but accommodation, equipment rental, lessons, lift access, meals, and transfers together determine the real trip cost. Peak winter periods require earlier booking because demand and prices increase. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:8', 'gudauri', 'prefer_WINTER_GUDAURI AND: group_SKI_LIFTS + PISTES + SKI_SCHOOL + EQUIPMENT_RENTAL + MOUNTAIN_DINING', 'Skiing and snowboarding are Gudauri''s core winter products. The official ski season generally operates from December until approximately mid-April, with January and February particularly strong for stable snow conditions. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:9', 'gudauri', 'prefer_GUDAURI_PANORAMA + HIGH_MOUNTAIN_LIFTS + JVARI_PASS_AREA AND: group_CAUCASUS_VIEWS + SNOW_LANDSCAPES + MOUNTAIN_PANORAMAS + SUNSET_PHOTOGRAPHY', 'Gudauri''s high-altitude setting, open Caucasus landscapes, ski lifts, mountain passes, and panoramic viewpoints provide excellent landscape and winter-photography opportunities. Lift access reaches approximately 3,276 m. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:10', 'gudauri', 'prefer_GUDAURI_MOUNTAIN_ACTIVITIES AND: group_SKIING + SNOWBOARDING + FREERIDING + PARAGLIDING + MOUNTAIN_EXPLORATION', 'Gudauri is one of Georgia''s principal adventure destinations, offering skiing, snowboarding, freestyle terrain, freeriding, heli-skiing, paragliding, and seasonal mountain activities. Specialist off-piste activities require appropriate skills, professional guidance, equipment, and avalanche-risk assessment. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:11', 'gudauri', 'prefer_QUALIFIED_MOUNTAIN_GUIDE AND: verify_AVALANCHE_CONDITIONS AND: require_APPROPRIATE_SAFETY_EQUIPMENT', 'Gudauri is particularly well known for freeride and off-piste terrain, but these activities involve substantially greater mountain risk than groomed-piste skiing. Weather and avalanche warnings should always be respected. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:12', 'gudauri', 'consider_GUDAURI_PARAGLIDING ONLY_IF: weather_conditions == SUITABLE AND: use_CERTIFIED_TANDEM_PILOT', 'Gudauri has established paragliding locations around Panorama, Kudebi and Bidara. Suitability varies by location and season, and flights depend on safe weather conditions. Official tourism guidance specifies certified tandem pilots for these experiences. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:13', 'gudauri', 'consider_GUDAURI + KOBI + STEPANTSMINDA_KAZBEGI', 'Gudauri is approximately 32 km from Stepantsminda and can be combined with the northern Georgian Military Road corridor. The Gudauri–Kobi lift connection also provides important scenic access when operating. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:14', 'gudauri', 'verify_GUDAURI_KOBI_ROAD_STATUS AND: verify_WEATHER + AVALANCHE_CONDITIONS BEFORE: departure', 'The Gudauri–Kobi road section can be temporarily restricted or closed because of snow and avalanche danger. Such closures occurred during the 2025–26 winter season, demonstrating why Kazbegi excursions should remain operationally flexible. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:15', 'gudauri', 'reduce_HIGH_MOUNTAIN + PARAGLIDING + REMOTE_EXCURSIONS AND: verify_LIFT_OPERATIONS AND: increase_HOTEL + SPA + INDOOR_RELAXATION_TIME', 'Mountain weather directly affects visibility, lift operations, road conditions, outdoor comfort, and adventure safety. Gudauri travelers should maintain flexible itineraries rather than treating every outdoor activity as guaranteed. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:16', 'gudauri', 'avoid_OFF_PISTE + FREERIDE + BACKCOUNTRY_ACTIVITIES AND: follow_OFFICIAL_SAFETY_RESTRICTIONS AND: verify_GUDAURI_KOBI_ROAD_STATUS', 'Avalanche conditions can affect both mountain recreation and the Gudauri–Kobi road corridor. Official Georgian road authorities can temporarily prohibit traffic when avalanche danger becomes high. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:17', 'gudauri', 'prefer_MOUNTAIN_VIEW_HOTEL + SCENIC_CABLE_CAR + SPA + MOUNTAIN_DINING AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Couples generally benefit more from mountain views, snow experiences, scenic rides, relaxed dining, wellness, photography, and free time than from filling every day with intensive skiing or distant road excursions. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:18', 'gudauri', 'book_ACCOMMODATION + TRANSFERS + SKI_SERVICES_EARLY AND: increase_EXPECTED_BUDGET', 'Winter is Gudauri''s main demand period. Official Georgia Travel guidance identifies the New Year period as the annual visitor peak and notes that accommodation prices can rise significantly, while January and February generally provide some of the strongest skiing conditions. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:19', 'gudauri', 'replace_SKI_FOCUS WITH: HIKING + MOUNTAIN_BIKING + PARAGLIDING + SCENIC_LIFTS + CAUCASUS_LANDSCAPES', 'Gudauri is not exclusively a winter destination. During warmer months, mountain biking, hiking, scenic exploration, and paragliding become more important, with designated bike routes accessible through selected lifts. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:20', 'gudauri', 'reduce_SKI_AND_WALKING_INTENSITY AND: prefer_SCENIC_LIFT + MOUNTAIN_VIEW_HOTEL + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT + RELAXED_EXPERIENCES AND: verify_HOTEL_AND_LIFT_ACCESSIBILITY', 'Gudauri''s altitude, snow, ice, slopes, ski equipment, and mountainous terrain can increase physical demands. Comfort-focused transport, convenient accommodation, carefully selected lift experiences, and site-specific accessibility verification are therefore important. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:21', 'gudauri', 'prioritize_BEGINNER_SKI_LESSON + EASY_SNOW_ACTIVITY + SCENIC_CABLE_CAR + FREE_TIME', 'Gudauri provides beginner pistes, ski schools, rental services, scenic lifts, and non-ski winter activities, making it suitable for travelers experiencing a ski resort or substantial snow environment for the first time. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:22', 'gudauri', 'prefer_NEW_GUDAURI + APRÈS_SKI + BARS + MOUNTAIN_RESTAURANTS BUT: do not position_GUDAURI_as_MAJOR_NIGHTLIFE_DESTINATION', 'Gudauri offers mountain cafés, bars, restaurants, and après-ski opportunities, but its primary tourism identity remains skiing, adventure, mountains, and winter recreation rather than large-scale nightlife. ---'),
  ('gudauri:rule:23', 'gudauri', 'prefer_MOUNTAIN_VIEW_ACCOMMODATION + SPA + SCENIC_LIFTS + CAFES + FREE_TIME AND: reduce_ADVENTURE_ACTIVITY_DENSITY', 'Gudauri can work well as an alpine relaxation destination when mountain scenery, comfortable accommodation, wellness, cafés, snow landscapes, and low-intensity scenic experiences are prioritized over continuous adventure activities. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:0', 'baku', 'prioritize_ICHERISHEHER + CENTRAL_BAKU + BAKU_BOULEVARD + ONE_PANORAMIC_EXPERIENCE AND: do not recommend GOBUSTAN + MUD_VOLCANOES + ATESHGAH + YANAR_DAG + MULTIPLE_REMOTE_EXCURSIONS as default additions.', 'A short Baku stay is best focused on the UNESCO-listed Old City, central urban attractions, Caspian waterfront, food, and one selected modern or scenic experience. Regional excursions can consume a substantial portion of a limited itinerary. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:1', 'baku', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 15% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective should be a relaxed urban-romantic experience combining Icherisheher, Caspian waterfront walks, Highland Park views, Flame Towers, fine dining, cafés, spa / hammam experiences, shopping, and quality couple time rather than maximum sightseeing. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:2', 'baku', 'reduce_walking_intensity_target by 20% increase_downtime by 20% prefer_BAKU_BOULEVARD + PARKS + SHORT_OLD_CITY_VISIT + FAMILY_ATTRACTIONS + HOTEL_RELAXATION', 'Young children can become tired from long Old City walks, cobblestones, summer heat, traffic, museum-heavy itineraries, and lengthy regional excursions. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:3', 'baku', 'consider_ICHERISHEHER + HEYDAR_ALIYEV_CENTER + GOBUSTAN AND: include_INTERACTIVE_OR_EDUCATIONAL_EXPERIENCES', 'Older children can engage more effectively with Baku''s history, architecture, museums, UNESCO heritage, and Gobustan''s prehistoric rock-art landscape. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:4', 'baku', 'prefer_hotel_near_ICHERISHEHER_OR_CENTRAL_TRANSPORT', 'For short stays, convenient access to Icherisheher, Fountain Square, Nizami Street, Baku Boulevard, restaurants, metro stations, and evening activity often provides better overall value than a slightly cheaper remote hotel. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:5', 'baku', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Baku works efficiently as a single accommodation base. Hotel changes consume useful sightseeing, dining, shopping, and excursion time without normally improving a short city itinerary. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:6', 'baku', 'prioritize_ICHERISHEHER + GOBUSTAN + SELECTED_ABSHERON_HERITAGE', 'Baku''s UNESCO-listed Walled City preserves the Maiden Tower and Palace of the Shirvanshahs, while Gobustan adds a major prehistoric archaeological experience outside the capital. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:7', 'baku', 'prefer_private_airport_transfer AND: prefer_HIGH_SERVICE_CENTRAL_OR_CASPIAN_VIEW_HOTEL AND: prefer_PRIVATE_GUIDE + CHAUFFEURED_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS AND: increase_FINE_DINING + SPA + PREMIUM_SHOPPING_WEIGHT', 'Luxury value in Baku is created through premium central accommodation, private transportation, personalized cultural guiding, quality dining, wellness, shopping, and comfortable Gobustan / Absheron excursions rather than simply increasing the number of attractions. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:8', 'baku', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_METRO_CONNECTED_ACCOMMODATION AND: use_WALKING + METRO + CITY_BUS_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: mix_FREE_PUBLIC_SPACES + SELECTED_PAID_ATTRACTIONS', 'Central Baku can be explored efficiently through walking and public transport, while taxis or shared excursions can be reserved for Gobustan and Absheron attractions. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:9', 'baku', 'prefer_ICHERISHEHER AND: group_MAIDEN_TOWER + SHIRVANSHAHS_PALACE + HISTORIC_STREETS + CARAVANSERAIS + MUSEUMS', 'Icherisheher is Baku''s historic core and UNESCO World Heritage Site, preserving medieval walls, mosques, hammams, caravanserais, residential buildings, Maiden Tower, and the Palace of the Shirvanshahs. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:10', 'baku', 'prefer_ICHERISHEHER + OIL_BOOM_ARCHITECTURE + HEYDAR_ALIYEV_CENTER + FLAME_TOWERS AND: group_MEDIEVAL + EARLY_MODERN + CONTEMPORARY_ARCHITECTURE', 'Baku''s architectural appeal comes from the contrast between its medieval historic core, oil-boom cityscape, Soviet-era layers, and highly visible contemporary architecture. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:11', 'baku', 'prefer_HIGHLAND_PARK + FLAME_TOWERS + ICHERISHEHER + BAKU_BOULEVARD + HEYDAR_ALIYEV_CENTER AND: group_CASPIAN_VIEWS + HISTORIC_STREETS + MODERN_SKYLINE + SUNSET_AND_NIGHT_PHOTOGRAPHY', 'Baku provides unusually strong visual contrast between the historic Old City, Caspian waterfront, elevated city panoramas, and modern architecture. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:12', 'baku', 'prioritize_AZERBAIJANI_CUISINE AND: group_PLOV + QUTAB + DOLMA + KEBAB + TEA_CULTURE + SWEETS + LOCAL_MARKET_EXPERIENCE', 'Baku is one of Azerbaijan''s strongest culinary destinations and should include dedicated food experiences rather than treating meals purely as itinerary breaks. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:13', 'baku', 'choose_SHOPPING_AREA_BY_PURPOSE AND: use_NIZAMI_STREET_FOR_CENTRAL_RETAIL AND: use_PORT_BAKU_FOR_LUXURY AND: use_ICHERISHEHER_OR_BAZAARS_FOR_CRAFTS_AND_LOCAL_PRODUCTS', 'Baku offers very different shopping environments, from international luxury retail to central pedestrian shopping, carpets, crafts, food products, and traditional souvenirs. ---');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('baku:rule:14', 'baku', 'prefer_FOUNTAIN_SQUARE + NIZAMI_STREET + CENTRAL_BAKU + SELECTED_ROOFTOP_OR_WATERFRONT_VENUES AND: retain_LATE_MORNING_START_NEXT_DAY_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Baku''s nightlife is strongest in the central city through restaurants, bars, lounges, live music, clubs, rooftops, cafés, and late-evening pedestrian areas. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:15', 'baku', 'prefer_ICHERISHEHER_EVENING + BAKU_BOULEVARD + HIGHLAND_PARK + SPA + FINE_DINING AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Couples generally benefit more from sunset views, waterfront walks, Old City atmosphere, dining, wellness, cafés, and free time than from packing multiple regional excursions into every day. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:16', 'baku', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_TO_FULL_DAY AND: consider_MUD_VOLCANOES_WHEN_ACCESS_IS_PRACTICAL AND: use_SUITABLE_TRANSPORT', 'Gobustan is a significant archaeological and landscape excursion rather than a short city attraction. It should receive sufficient time for the museum, rock-art landscape, walking, photography, and regional transport. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:17', 'baku', 'verify_CURRENT_ACCESS + ROAD_CONDITIONS + VEHICLE_SUITABILITY AND: do_not_assume_STANDARD_CITY_CAR_IS_ALWAYS_APPROPRIATE', 'Mud-volcano locations can involve rough or unpaved access depending on the selected site and current conditions, so transport should be matched to the actual route. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:18', 'baku', 'prefer_ATESHGAH + YANAR_DAG AND: group_AS_SINGLE_ABSHERON_EXCURSION', 'Ateshgah and Yanar Dag are geographically logical to combine and provide the strongest introduction to the Absheron Peninsula''s historic and natural fire-related heritage. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:19', 'baku', 'prioritize_ICHERISHEHER + GOBUSTAN + ATESHGAH + YANAR_DAG + MUSEUMS AND: retain_AT_LEAST_ONE_RELAXED_CITY_PERIOD', 'Four or more nights allow Baku''s urban heritage and major regional cultural excursions to be combined without turning every day into a full road-and-walking itinerary. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:20', 'baku', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON_OUTDOOR_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_MIDDAY_ICHERISHEHER + GOBUSTAN + ABSHERON_OUTDOOR_EXPOSURE AND: increase_MUSEUM + MALL + RESTAURANT + HOTEL_TIME', 'Many of Baku''s historical and regional attractions are exposed outdoor environments, making prolonged midday sightseeing less comfortable during hot summer conditions. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:21', 'baku', 'reduce_CASPIAN_BOAT + LONG_BOULEVARD_WALKS + EXPOSED_VIEWPOINT_TIME AND: increase_OLD_CITY + MUSEUM + DINING + SHOPPING_TIME', 'Baku is known for strong winds, which can materially affect waterfront comfort, elevated viewpoints, coastal experiences, and boat operations. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:22', 'baku', 'reduce_GOBUSTAN + MUD_VOLCANOES + EXPOSED_ABSHERON_EXCURSIONS AND: prefer_MUSEUMS + HEYDAR_ALIYEV_CENTER + SHOPPING + FOOD + SPA', 'Poor weather reduces the value of exposed archaeological landscapes, photography, viewpoints, and semi-desert excursions while Baku still offers substantial indoor cultural and leisure options. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:23', 'baku', 'book_CENTRAL_ACCOMMODATION_EARLY AND: increase_EXPECTED_BUDGET AND: verify_ROAD_CLOSURES + TRANSFER_ROUTES + ACCESS_TO_CENTRAL_ATTRACTIONS', 'Major events can substantially affect central Baku''s traffic, hotel demand, road access, and pricing. The 2026 Azerbaijan Grand Prix is scheduled for September 24–26. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:24', 'baku', 'reduce_OLD_CITY_WALKING_INTENSITY AND: prefer_BOULEVARD + MODERN_MUSEUMS + SCENIC_DRIVES + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT AND: verify_HOTEL + METRO + ATTRACTION_ACCESSIBILITY', 'Modern Baku can be relatively manageable, but Icherisheher contains historic surfaces and slopes while regional attractions such as Gobustan involve uneven outdoor terrain. Baku Metro provides mobility assistance, but independent elevator access is currently available only at selected stations. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:25', 'baku', 'prefer_SUMMER_ABSHERON_COAST AND: treat_BEACH_AS_COMPLEMENTARY_TO_BAKU_CITY_BREAK', 'The Caspian coastline adds seasonal leisure value, but Baku''s primary destination strengths remain culture, architecture, food, shopping, nightlife, and urban sightseeing. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:26', 'baku', 'prioritize_ICHERISHEHER + BAKU_BOULEVARD + HIGHLAND_PARK + HEYDAR_ALIYEV_CENTER AND: add_ONE_OF_GOBUSTAN_OR_ATESHGAH_YANAR_DAG', 'This combination provides the strongest introduction to Azerbaijan''s medieval heritage, modern capital identity, Caspian setting, architecture, and wider regional history. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:27', 'baku', 'prefer_CASPIAN_VIEW_HOTEL + BAKU_BOULEVARD + SPA_OR_HAMMAM + CAFES + FINE_DINING AND: reduce_REGIONAL_EXCURSION_DENSITY', 'Baku works well as an urban relaxation destination when waterfront leisure, quality accommodation, dining, wellness, cafés, and unstructured city time are prioritized over continuous sightseeing. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:28', 'baku', 'prefer_ICHERISHEHER + BAKU_BOULEVARD + HIGHLAND_PARK AND: avoid_GOBUSTAN + ABSHERON_FULL_DAY_EXCURSIONS', 'Baku''s strongest central experiences can be combined efficiently, while regional excursions require substantially more travel time. ---'),
  ('baku:rule:29', 'baku', 'prefer_ICHERISHEHER + LOCAL_AZERBAIJANI_DINING + TEA_CULTURE + YASHIL_BAZAAR + LOCAL_CRAFTS AND: decrease_GENERIC_MALL_AND_CHAIN_EXPERIENCE_WEIGHT', 'Historic neighborhoods, traditional cuisine, tea culture, bazaars, crafts, carpets, and local food products provide a stronger connection with Azerbaijani cultural identity than relying only on modern shopping centres. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:0', 'shamakhi', 'prioritize_CENTRAL_SHAMAKHI + JUMA_MOSQUE + YEDDI_GUMBAZ + ONE_SIGNATURE_EXPERIENCE AND: do not recommend OBSERVATORY + SAFARI_PARK + MEYSARI + ALPACA_FARM + MULTIPLE_REMOTE_FORTRESSES as default additions.', 'A short Shamakhi stay is best focused on its strongest heritage attractions plus one selected nature, astronomy, family, or wine experience. The region''s attractions are dispersed, so excessive road travel can quickly make a short itinerary rushed. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:1', 'shamakhi', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 20% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective should be a relaxed countryside experience combining Pirgulu mountain scenery, stargazing, vineyards, wine, scenic drives, photography, spa or resort time, and quality couple time rather than maximum sightseeing. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:2', 'shamakhi', 'reduce_walking_intensity_target by 20% increase_downtime by 25% prefer_ALPACA_FARM + EASY_SAFARI_EXPERIENCE + SHORT_HERITAGE_VISITS + RESORT_RELAXATION', 'Young children generally benefit more from interactive animal experiences, short sightseeing periods, regular breaks, and countryside leisure than long fortress hikes or dense historical itineraries. The Alpaca Farm specifically offers animal interaction and a children''s playground. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:3', 'shamakhi', 'consider_JUMA_MOSQUE + OBSERVATORY + SAFARI_PARK + ALPACA_FARM AND: include_EDUCATIONAL + NATURE_BASED_EXPERIENCES', 'Older children can combine history, astronomy, wildlife, mountain scenery, and interactive rural experiences particularly well in Shamakhi. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:4', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_hotel_with_CONVENIENT_ROAD_ACCESS', 'Shamakhi is not a compact walking destination. Accommodation should be evaluated according to planned access to central heritage, Pirgulu, Meysari, Safari Park, and wider countryside rather than room price alone. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:5', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'A single Shamakhi base normally works better for short stays because hotel changes add luggage handling and road time without materially improving access to the main regional attractions. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:6', 'shamakhi', 'prioritize_JUMA_MOSQUE + YEDDI_GUMBAZ + SHIRVANSHAH_HERITAGE AND: consider_GULUSTAN_OR_BUGHURT_FOR_ACTIVE_TRAVELERS', 'Shamakhi was an important Silk Road city and medieval capital of the Shirvanshahs. Yeddi Gumbaz, Gulustan, Bughurt, Kelekhana, Shahkhandan, and Sabir heritage form the destination''s strongest historic layer. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:7', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_PREMIUM_RESORT_OR_COUNTRYSIDE_PROPERTY AND: prefer_PRIVATE_DRIVER + PERSONALIZED_GUIDE AND: increase_WINE + SPA + PRIVATE_NATURE_EXPERIENCE_WEIGHT', 'Luxury in Shamakhi is better created through privacy, high-quality resort accommodation, chauffeured transport, vineyards, premium dining, astronomy, nature, and personalized regional excursions rather than shopping or urban entertainment. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:8', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_WELL_REVIEWED_GUESTHOUSE_OR_MID_RANGE_HOTEL AND: use_INTERCITY_TRANSPORT_FOR_BAKU_SHAMAKHI_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: use_TAXIS_SELECTIVELY_FOR_REMOTE_ATTRACTIONS', 'Shamakhi''s basic accommodation, food, and heritage sightseeing can be economical, but transport between dispersed attractions is the main budget consideration. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:9', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_JUMA_MOSQUE + YEDDI_GUMBAZ + KELEKHANA + SHAHKHANDAN AND: group_SHIRVAN_ARCHITECTURE + RELIGIOUS_HERITAGE + HISTORICAL_SITES', 'Shamakhi''s strongest cultural identity comes from its Shirvan architectural school, Islamic heritage, former-capital history, historic cemeteries, mausoleums, and fortress remains. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:10', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_YEDDI_GUMBAZ + PIRGULU + OBSERVATORY + MOUNTAIN_VIEWPOINTS + MEYSARI AND: group_MOUNTAIN_LANDSCAPES + VINEYARDS + SUNSET + NIGHT_SKY_PHOTOGRAPHY', 'Shamakhi combines grassy heritage hills, Caucasus mountain scenery, vineyards, rural landscapes, and clear-sky astronomy experiences particularly well. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:11', 'shamakhi', 'prioritize_SHAMAKHI_ASTROPHYSICAL_OBSERVATORY AND: verify_VISITOR_SCHEDULE + WEATHER + CLOUD_COVER AND: arrange_NIGHT_TRANSPORT_IF_REQUIRED', 'The Observatory is located approximately 22 km north of Shamakhi in Pirgulu and offers a museum, major telescope facilities, and possible stargazing after dark. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:12', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_SHAMAKHI_SAFARI_PARK AND: allocate_HALF_DAY AND: verify_OPENING_HOURS + WEATHER', 'Safari Park covers more than 1,000 hectares in the Pirgulu mountain region, contains more than 1,000 animals, and offers group and individual off-road safari experiences. Its opening conditions vary by season and weather. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:13', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_ALPACA_FARM + SAFARI_PARK AND: reduce_MONUMENT_DENSITY', 'The Alpaca Farm provides animal feeding, interaction, picnics, yoga, a children''s playground, and souvenirs, making it one of Shamakhi''s strongest interactive family experiences. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:14', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_MEYSARI AND: group_VINEYARD + WINE_TASTING + LOCAL_FOOD + COUNTRYSIDE_RELAXATION', 'Meysari is one of Shamakhi''s key winemaking areas and combines naturally with countryside and culinary experiences. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:15', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_GULUSTAN_FORTRESS + BUGHURT_FORTRESS + PIRGULU AND: verify_WEATHER + TRAIL_CONDITIONS + TRAVELER_FITNESS', 'Official tourism guidance identifies Gulustan and Bughurt as remote mountain fortresses whose hiking routes combine historical exploration with Caucasus landscapes. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:16', 'shamakhi', 'reduce_FORTRESS_HIKING + REMOTE_WALKING AND: prefer_JUMA_MOSQUE + SCENIC_DRIVES + OBSERVATORY + WINERY + RESORT_RELAXATION AND: use_PRIVATE_TRANSPORT', 'Central heritage and road-based experiences can be much easier to manage than remote fortresses, uneven cemeteries, and mountain hiking routes. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:17', 'shamakhi', 'reduce_FORTRESS_HIKING + SAFARI + MOUNTAIN_VIEWPOINTS AND: prefer_JUMA_MOSQUE + MUSEUM + HOTEL + SPA + DINING', 'Poor weather can materially reduce road comfort, mountain visibility, hiking safety, photography value, and wildlife-excursion practicality. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:18', 'shamakhi', 'do_not_build_evening_around_STARGAZING AND: replace_with_RESORT_RELAXATION + DINING + SPA', 'Astronomy experiences depend on atmospheric conditions, so stargazing should remain flexible rather than guaranteed. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:19', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_PIRGULU + MEYSARI + STARGAZING + MOUNTAIN_VIEW_ACCOMMODATION AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Shamakhi''s romantic strength comes from quiet countryside, mountain views, vineyards, astronomy, privacy, wine, and relaxed resort time rather than dense sightseeing. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:20', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_COUNTRYSIDE_RESORT + SPA + SCENIC_DRIVES + LOCAL_DINING + FREE_TIME AND: reduce_REMOTE_EXCURSION_DENSITY', 'Shamakhi works especially well as a slower regional escape from Baku when nature, views, resort facilities, food, and unstructured time are prioritized. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:21', 'shamakhi', 'prioritize_JUMA_MOSQUE + YEDDI_GUMBAZ AND: add_ONE_OF_OBSERVATORY_OR_SAFARI_PARK_OR_MEYSARI', 'Juma Mosque and Yeddi Gumbaz provide the strongest introduction to Shamakhi''s historical identity, while one signature regional experience introduces its mountain, astronomy, wildlife, or wine character. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:22', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_JUMA_MOSQUE + YEDDI_GUMBAZ AND: avoid_PIRGULU + SAFARI + REMOTE_FORTRESSES', 'The central heritage pair provides the highest historical value with the lowest travel friction for a short stop. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:23', 'shamakhi', 'consider_SHAMAKHI + BASGAL_OR_LAHIJ + ISMAYILLI_OR_GABALA', 'Shamakhi sits naturally on Azerbaijan''s north-western tourism corridor and works well as part of a broader Silk Road, mountain, village, and cultural itinerary rather than being treated as an isolated destination. ---'),
  ('shamakhi:rule:24', 'shamakhi', 'prefer_LOCAL_AZERBAIJANI_DINING + MEYSARI + RURAL_SHAMAKHI + HERITAGE_SITES AND: decrease_GENERIC_RESORT_ONLY_ACTIVITY_WEIGHT', 'Traditional food, vineyards, rural landscapes, historic monuments, local villages, and Shirvan heritage provide a stronger regional identity than relying only on resort facilities. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:0', 'gabala', 'prioritize_TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE + YEDDI_GOZEL + ONE_SIGNATURE_EXPERIENCE AND: do not recommend OLD_GABALA + NIJ + SAVALAN + RAFTING + MULTIPLE_REMOTE_ACTIVITIES as default additions.', 'A short Gabala stay is best focused on its strongest mountain and nature experiences. Tufandag, Nohur Lake, and Yeddi Gozel provide the clearest first-time introduction, while additional cultural and adventure excursions increase road travel and activity density. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:1', 'gabala', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 20% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective should be a relaxed mountain-resort experience combining Tufandag panoramas, Nohur Lake, mountain-view accommodation, Savalan wine, spa, scenic photography, private drives, and quality couple time rather than maximum sightseeing. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:2', 'gabala', 'reduce_adventure_intensity_target by 25% increase_downtime by 25% prefer_TUFANDAG_CABLE_CAR + NOHUR_LAKE + GABALAND + EASY_SNOW_OR_NATURE_EXPERIENCES + RESORT_RELAXATION', 'Young children generally benefit more from cable-car rides, lake scenery, amusement activities, easy snow experiences, and regular rest than long hikes, difficult waterfall access, or intensive adventure activities. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:3', 'gabala', 'consider_TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE + YEDDI_GOZEL + OLD_GABALA + FAMILY_ADVENTURE AND: include_EDUCATIONAL + RECREATIONAL + NATURE_BASED_EXPERIENCES', 'Older children can combine mountain activities, waterfalls, archaeology, Caucasian Albanian heritage, snow experiences, and family recreation more effectively. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:4', 'gabala', 'prefer_hotel_near_TUFANDAG_OR_CONVENIENT_RESORT_ACCESS', 'Tufandag is only about 4 km from Gabala city centre, but daily movement with ski equipment, children, or winter clothing can make convenient resort access particularly valuable. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:5', 'gabala', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Gabala generally works best from one convenient base. Hotel changes add luggage handling, road travel, and lost resort time without usually improving a short mountain itinerary. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:6', 'gabala', 'prioritize_TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE + YEDDI_GOZEL AND: consider_ONE_OF_HIKING_OR_JEEP_SAFARI_OR_PARAGLIDING', 'Gabala is officially positioned as Azerbaijan''s prime outdoor-activities hub, with mountain scenery and activities centred strongly around Tufandag and the wider Caucasus foothills. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:7', 'gabala', 'prefer_private_transfer AND: prefer_PREMIUM_MOUNTAIN_OR_WELLNESS_RESORT AND: prefer_PRIVATE_DRIVER + PERSONALIZED_GUIDE_OR_INSTRUCTOR AND: increase_SPA + PRIVATE_MOUNTAIN + WINE + PREMIUM_DINING_WEIGHT', 'Luxury in Gabala is created primarily through premium resort accommodation, mountain views, private transport, spa and wellness, personalized adventure, quality guiding, and wine or countryside experiences rather than urban luxury shopping. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:8', 'gabala', 'prefer_WELL_REVIEWED_GUESTHOUSE_OR_MID_RANGE_HOTEL AND: use_TRAIN_OR_INTERCITY_TRANSPORT_FOR_BAKU_GABALA_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: use_TAXIS_SELECTIVELY_FOR_OUTLYING_ATTRACTIONS', 'Accommodation and food can be managed economically, while cable cars, adventure activities, skiing, resort services, and transport between dispersed attractions are the main additional cost factors. Official tourism information confirms passenger rail access on the Baku–Gabala route. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:9', 'gabala', 'prefer_TUFANDAG_IN_WINTER AND: group_SKIING + SNOWBOARDING + CABLE_CARS + SKI_SCHOOL + MOUNTAIN_DINING', 'Tufandag is Gabala''s principal winter-sports product, with about 12 km of slopes, beginner and advanced terrain, cable-car access, snowmaking, ski-school services, and nearby accommodation. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:10', 'gabala', 'replace_PRIMARY_SKI_FOCUS WITH: HIKING + CYCLING + PARAGLIDING + JEEP_SAFARI + RAFTING + SCENIC_CABLE_CAR', 'In warmer months, Tufandag shifts toward hiking, cycling, paragliding, and jeep tours, while rafting on the Turyanchay near Savalan is offered seasonally from approximately May to September. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:11', 'gabala', 'consider_TUFANDAG_PARAGLIDING ONLY_IF: weather_conditions == SUITABLE AND: operator_availability == CONFIRMED', 'Paragliding is an established Tufandag activity, but mountain flying depends on wind, visibility, operator decisions, and traveler suitability. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:12', 'gabala', 'prefer_SAVALAN_TURYANCHAY AND: verify_SEASON + WATER_CONDITIONS + OPERATOR_AVAILABILITY', 'Official tourism information identifies rafting near Savalan on an approximately 11 km section of the Turyanchay River, with local operations generally running from May to September. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:13', 'gabala', 'prefer_OLD_GABALA + NIJ_VILLAGE AND: group_CAUCASIAN_ALBANIAN_HISTORY + UDI_HERITAGE + RURAL_CULTURE', 'Old Gabala was once the capital of Caucasian Albania, while Nij preserves one of the region''s strongest living Udi cultural traditions. These experiences provide Gabala''s main cultural depth beyond its resort identity. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:14', 'gabala', 'prefer_TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE + YEDDI_GOZEL + MOUNTAIN_VIEWPOINTS AND: group_CAUCASUS_VIEWS + LAKE_REFLECTIONS + WATERFALLS + SUNSET + SEASONAL_LANDSCAPES', 'Gabala''s strongest visual identity comes from the Caucasus Mountains, forests, lakes, waterfalls, snow landscapes, and elevated Tufandag viewpoints. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:15', 'gabala', 'prefer_SAVALAN_WINERY AND: group_VINEYARD + WINE_TASTING + LOCAL_FOOD + COUNTRYSIDE_RELAXATION', 'Savalan provides Gabala''s strongest dedicated wine-tourism experience and combines naturally with countryside scenery, premium dining, and romantic or luxury itineraries. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:16', 'gabala', 'prefer_GABALAND + TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE AND: reduce_ARCHAEOLOGY_AND_LONG_DRIVE_DENSITY', 'Families generally gain more from a balance of recreation, cable cars, snow or nature, lakes, and resort leisure than from filling every day with archaeological and rural sightseeing. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:17', 'gabala', 'prefer_YEDDI_GOZEL AND: verify_CURRENT_ACCESS + WEATHER + WALKING_CONDITIONS', 'Yeddi Gozel is one of Gabala''s signature nature experiences, but the approach can involve steps and natural surfaces, so weather and traveler mobility should be considered. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:18', 'gabala', 'prefer_TUFANDAG + SEASONAL_OUTDOOR_ACTIVITIES AND: group_PARAGLIDING + JEEP_SAFARI + HIKING + CYCLING + RAFTING_WHERE_SEASONALLY_AVAILABLE', 'Gabala is officially described as Azerbaijan''s prime outdoor-sports hub, supporting winter skiing and warmer-season adventure activities. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:19', 'gabala', 'prefer_TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE + SAVALAN + SPA + MOUNTAIN_VIEW_ACCOMMODATION AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Gabala''s romantic strength comes from mountain views, lakes, vineyards, spa resorts, cable cars, scenic dining, snow experiences, and private countryside time rather than dense sightseeing. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:20', 'gabala', 'prefer_MOUNTAIN_RESORT + SPA + NOHUR_LAKE + SCENIC_DRIVES + FREE_TIME AND: reduce_ADVENTURE_ACTIVITY_DENSITY', 'Gabala works particularly well as a resort escape when mountain scenery, spa, lakeside leisure, quality accommodation, and unstructured time are prioritized. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:21', 'gabala', 'reduce_WATERFALL_WALKING + HIKING + SKIING + ADVENTURE_INTENSITY AND: prefer_TUFANDAG_CABLE_CAR + NOHUR_LAKE + SCENIC_DRIVES + SPA + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT AND: verify_HOTEL + CABLE_CAR + ATTRACTION_ACCESSIBILITY', 'Gabala''s mountain terrain, winter snow, waterfall approaches, rural surfaces, and adventure activities can increase physical demands, while cable cars, scenic drives, lakes, and resort wellness can provide lower-intensity alternatives. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:22', 'gabala', 'reduce_TUFANDAG_VIEWPOINTS + WATERFALL_EXCURSIONS + PARAGLIDING + JEEP_SAFARI AND: verify_CABLE_CAR_OPERATIONS AND: increase_SPA + HOTEL + DINING + CULTURAL_TIME', 'Poor weather can reduce mountain visibility, cable-car value, hiking comfort, paragliding suitability, road conditions, and photography quality. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:23', 'gabala', 'verify_TUFANDAG_OPERATIONS + REGIONAL_ROADS AND: reduce_REMOTE_RURAL_EXCURSIONS AND: prefer_RESORT_BASED_WINTER_ACTIVITIES', 'Snow can improve the ski experience while simultaneously making road-based rural sightseeing more difficult, so winter itineraries should distinguish between good slope conditions and difficult road conditions. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:24', 'gabala', 'prioritize_TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE + YEDDI_GOZEL AND: add_ONE_OF_OLD_GABALA_OR_NIJ_OR_SIGNATURE_ACTIVITY', 'This combination introduces Gabala''s dominant mountain and nature identity while adding either cultural depth or a personalized family, adventure, wine, or wellness experience. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:25', 'gabala', 'prefer_TUFANDAG + NOHUR_LAKE AND: avoid_NIJ + SAVALAN + RAFTING + MULTIPLE_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS', 'Tufandag and Nohur Lake provide strong visual and destination value with relatively manageable sightseeing friction for a short visit. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:26', 'gabala', 'consider_GABALA + OGUZ + SHEKI OR: consider_SHAMAKHI + ISMAYILLI_OR_LAHIJ + GABALA', 'Gabala sits naturally within Azerbaijan''s north-western tourism corridor and works particularly well as part of a broader mountain, culture, village, and road-trip itinerary. ---'),
  ('gabala:rule:27', 'gabala', 'prefer_NIJ + OLD_GABALA + LOCAL_AZERBAIJANI_DINING + RURAL_EXPERIENCES AND: decrease_GENERIC_RESORT_ONLY_ACTIVITY_WEIGHT', 'Udi heritage, Caucasian Albanian history, local cuisine, villages, and rural landscapes provide a stronger connection with Gabala''s regional identity than relying exclusively on Tufandag and modern resort facilities. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:0', 'almaty', 'prioritize_CENTRAL_ALMATY + KOK_TOBE + MEDEU_SHYMBULAK + ONE_SIGNATURE_FOOD_OR_CULTURAL_EXPERIENCE AND: do not recommend CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY + MULTIPLE_REMOTE_MOUNTAIN_EXCURSIONS as default additions.', 'A short Almaty stay is best focused on the city''s strongest urban and nearby mountain experiences. Panfilov Park, Green Bazaar, Kok Tobe, Medeu, and Shymbulak provide a strong introduction without sacrificing excessive time to long regional road journeys. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:1', 'almaty', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 15% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective should be a relaxed city-and-mountain experience combining Kok Tobe sunsets, Shymbulak panoramas, premium dining, cafés, spa, private mountain excursions, photography, and quality couple time rather than maximum sightseeing. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:2', 'almaty', 'reduce_adventure_intensity_target by 25% increase_downtime by 25% prefer_KOK_TOBE + PARKS + EASY_MEDEU_SHYMBULAK + SNOW_PLAY + FAMILY_RECREATION', 'Young children generally benefit more from cable-car rides, parks, short snow experiences, recreational attractions, cafés, and regular breaks than long mountain hikes or extensive regional road trips. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:3', 'almaty', 'consider_PANFILOV_PARK + KOK_TOBE + MEDEU + SHYMBULAK + SELECTED_NATURE_EXCURSION AND: include_EDUCATIONAL + RECREATIONAL + MOUNTAIN_EXPERIENCES', 'Older children can combine city culture, mountain scenery, skiing, hiking, museums, markets, and nature-based experiences more effectively. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:4', 'almaty', 'do_not_default_to_SNOWBOARD_LESSON AND: consider_CHILD_SKI_LESSON', 'Shymbulak''s current ski-school booking system provides ski instruction for young children, while snowboard instruction is currently listed from age 8. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:5', 'almaty', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_WELL_CONNECTED_HOTEL', 'For city-focused stays, access to restaurants, metro / bus routes, Panfilov Park, Green Bazaar, pedestrian areas, shopping, nightlife, and mountain-transfer routes generally provides better overall value than a small room-rate saving in an inconvenient outer location. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:6', 'almaty', 'consider_SOUTH_ALMATY_OR_CONVENIENT_MOUNTAIN_ACCESS_HOTEL', 'Daily travel with ski equipment and winter clothing increases transport friction. Convenient access toward Medeu and Shymbulak can materially improve a short ski-oriented stay. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:7', 'almaty', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Almaty generally works effectively as a single urban base for central sightseeing, Kok Tobe, Medeu, Shymbulak, restaurants, shopping, and selected nearby mountain experiences. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:8', 'almaty', 'consider_SPLIT_STAY_ALMATY + OI_QARAGAI_OR_MOUNTAIN_RESORT', 'Longer itineraries can justify combining city accommodation with a dedicated mountain-resort stay when privacy, wellness, skiing, forest scenery, or slower resort leisure is a primary objective. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:9', 'almaty', 'prefer_PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER AND: prefer_PREMIUM_CENTRAL_OR_SOUTH_ALMATY_HOTEL AND: prefer_PRIVATE_DRIVER + PERSONALIZED_GUIDE AND: increase_FINE_DINING + SPA + PREMIUM_SHOPPING + PRIVATE_MOUNTAIN_EXPERIENCE_WEIGHT', 'Luxury value in Almaty comes from premium accommodation, chauffeured transport, fine dining, wellness, shopping, private cultural interpretation, mountain access, high-quality guiding, and flexible regional excursions rather than simply adding more attractions. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:10', 'almaty', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT_CONNECTED_ACCOMMODATION AND: use_WALKING + METRO + CITY_BUS_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: use_GROUP_EXCURSIONS_FOR_REMOTE_NATURE_SITES', 'Almaty''s urban sightseeing can be relatively economical through walking and public transport, while mountain lifts, skiing, equipment rental, nightlife, and distant regional excursions represent the main additional cost categories. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:11', 'almaty', 'prefer_PANFILOV_PARK + ASCENSION_CATHEDRAL + MUSEUM_OF_FOLK_MUSICAL_INSTRUMENTS + CENTRAL_STATE_MUSEUM + GREEN_BAZAAR AND: group_KAZAKH_CULTURE + VERN Y_HERITAGE + SOVIET_HISTORY + LOCAL_MARKET_EXPERIENCE', 'Almaty''s cultural strength comes from historic religious architecture, museums, Soviet and pre-Soviet urban layers, Kazakh musical traditions, markets, food culture, galleries, and its long role as Kazakhstan''s cultural centre. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:12', 'almaty', 'prioritize_KAZAKH_CUISINE + CENTRAL_ASIAN_CUISINE + GREEN_BAZAAR + MODERN_ALMATY_DINING AND: group_BESHBARMAK + KAZY + MANTY + LAGMAN + PLOV + BAURSAK + TEA + CAFÉ_CULTURE', 'Almaty is one of Kazakhstan''s strongest gastronomy destinations, combining traditional Kazakh cuisine, Central Asian food, markets, specialty coffee, contemporary restaurants, and international dining. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:13', 'almaty', 'choose_SHOPPING_AREA_BY_PURPOSE AND: use_GREEN_BAZAAR_FOR_LOCAL_FOOD_PRODUCTS AND: use_ARBAT_ZHIBEK_ZHOLY_FOR_CENTRAL_RETAIL_AND_SOUVENIRS AND: use_ESENTAI_OR_DOSTYK_FOR_PREMIUM_SHOPPING', 'Almaty provides very different retail environments ranging from traditional markets and local crafts to major shopping centres, international brands, and premium boutiques. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:14', 'almaty', 'prefer_CENTRAL_ALMATY + DOSTYK + SELECTED_ROOFTOP_BAR_LOUNGE_OR_LIVE_MUSIC AND: retain_LATER_START_NEXT_MORNING_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Almaty has a substantial evening economy involving restaurants, cocktail bars, lounges, clubs, cafés, live music, rooftops, and late-night social activity. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:15', 'almaty', 'prefer_KOK_TOBE + MEDEU + SHYMBULAK + PANFILOV_AREA AND: group_CITYSCAPES + TIAN_SHAN_BACKDROPS + SUNSET + SNOW + HISTORIC_ARCHITECTURE', 'Almaty''s strongest visual identity comes from the contrast between urban architecture, tree-lined streets, historic landmarks, and the dramatic Trans-Ili Alatau immediately behind the city. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:16', 'almaty', 'prioritize_MEDEU + SHYMBULAK AND: consider_ILE_ALATAU_OR_BIG_ALMATY_LAKE_AREA', 'Medeu and Shymbulak offer the easiest high-value mountain experience close to the city, while Ile-Alatau and Big Almaty Lake provide deeper nature exploration with greater access and weather considerations. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:17', 'almaty', 'prefer_SHYMBULAK_IN_WINTER AND: group_MEDEU + GONDOLA + SKIING + SNOWBOARDING + SKI_SCHOOL + MOUNTAIN_DINING', 'Shymbulak is Almaty''s principal winter-sports product. The resort operates between approximately 2,200 and 3,180 metres and currently provides roughly 17–20 km of ski slopes, equipment rental, ski school, hotels, restaurants, and ten lifts. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:18', 'almaty', 'replace_PRIMARY_SKI_FOCUS WITH: SHYMBULAK_GONDOLA + HIKING + HORSE_RIDING + MOUNTAIN_WALKING + OUTDOOR_RECREATION', 'Shymbulak operates as an all-season mountain resort. During warmer months, its official tourism product shifts toward hiking, walking, horse riding, mountain scenery, festivals, dining, and other outdoor experiences. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:19', 'almaty', 'prefer_ILE_ALATAU + KIM_ASAR + KOK_ZHAILAU + FURMANOV_OR_OTHER_SUITABLE_ROUTE AND: verify_ROUTE_DIFFICULTY + WEATHER + ALTITUDE + DAYLIGHT', 'Almaty has extensive mountain-trail access immediately south of the city, but route difficulty varies considerably and should be matched to traveler fitness, experience, season, and current mountain conditions. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:20', 'almaty', 'verify_CURRENT_ACCESS_RULES + ROAD_STATUS + PROTECTED_AREA_REQUIREMENTS BEFORE: confirming_itinerary', 'Big Almaty Lake is one of the region''s most recognizable mountain landscapes, but access arrangements have changed at different times and should never be assumed from older travel information. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:21', 'almaty', 'allocate_FULL_DAY AND: consider_VALLEY_OF_CASTLES_AS_PRIORITY AND: avoid_combining_with_HEAVY_CITY_SIGHTSEEING', 'Charyn lies well outside central Almaty and requires substantial road travel. The canyon is best treated as a major nature and landscape excursion rather than an additional city attraction. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:22', 'almaty', 'allocate_FULL_DAY_TO_OVERNIGHT AND: consider_SATY_AS_REGIONAL_BASE', 'Kolsay and Kaindy require long road travel from Almaty and are better treated as dedicated regional experiences rather than casual additions to a city day. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:23', 'almaty', 'prefer_2_DAY_OR_3_DAY_REGIONAL_CIRCUIT OVER: RUSHED_SINGLE_DAY_COMBINATION', 'Combining all three in one day creates excessive road travel and reduces useful time for hiking, photography, lakeside exploration, meals, rest, and seasonal delays. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:24', 'almaty', 'do_not_recommend_CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY_AS_DEFAULT', 'A short first visit generally provides better value when focused on Almaty city, Kok Tobe, Medeu, Shymbulak, food, culture, and nightlife rather than spending most of the stay on long regional transfers. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:25', 'almaty', 'consider_ONE_MAJOR_REGIONAL_EXCURSION SUCH_AS: CHARYN_OR_ILE_ALATAU_OR_BIG_ALMATY_LAKE_AREA', 'Four or more nights provide enough time to preserve Almaty''s city-and-mountain identity while adding one significant regional nature experience. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:26', 'almaty', 'consider_CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY AND: retain_AT_LEAST_3_DAYS_FOR_ALMATY_CITY_AND_NEARBY_MOUNTAINS', 'Almaty itself remains a substantial destination. Longer nature circuits should enhance rather than replace Panfilov Park, Kok Tobe, Medeu, Shymbulak, food, shopping, and urban cultural experiences. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:27', 'almaty', 'prefer_SHYMBULAK + ILE_ALATAU + SEASONAL_MOUNTAIN_ACTIVITIES AND: consider_CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY_FOR_EXTENDED_TRIPS', 'Almaty''s principal adventure identity comes from its unusually close relationship with the Trans-Ili Alatau and its access to skiing, snowboarding, hiking, trekking, mountain recreation, canyon exploration, and alpine lakes. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:28', 'almaty', 'prefer_KOK_TOBE + SHYMBULAK + SPA + PREMIUM_DINING + MOUNTAIN_VIEW_ACCOMMODATION AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Almaty''s romantic appeal comes from mountain panoramas, cable-car rides, snow experiences, stylish restaurants, cafés, spas, sunset views, and flexible city-and-nature time. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:29', 'almaty', 'prefer_PREMIUM_HOTEL + SPA + BOTANICAL_GARDEN + CAFÉS + KOK_TOBE + EASY_MOUNTAIN_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_REMOTE_EXCURSION_DENSITY', 'Almaty works well as a relaxed urban-and-mountain destination when quality accommodation, parks, cafés, dining, wellness, scenic cable cars, and free time are prioritized over continuous long-distance excursions. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:30', 'almaty', 'reduce_HIKING + CANYON_WALKING + SKIING + HIGH_ALTITUDE_ACTIVITY_INTENSITY AND: prefer_PANFILOV_PARK + MUSEUMS + KOK_TOBE + EASY_MEDEU_SHYMBULAK + SCENIC_DRIVES + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT AND: verify_HOTEL + PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + GONDOLA_ACCESSIBILITY', 'Almaty''s city sightseeing can be relatively manageable, but mountain snow, slopes, high altitude, canyon terrain, and hiking routes can significantly increase physical demands. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:31', 'almaty', 'reduce_KOK_TOBE_PANORAMA + SHYMBULAK_VIEWPOINTS + MOUNTAIN_HIKING + CANYON_EXCURSIONS AND: increase_MUSEUMS + FOOD + SHOPPING + SPA + CAFÉ_TIME', 'Poor visibility reduces mountain and panoramic value, while Almaty''s strong indoor culture, dining, shopping, cafés, museums, and wellness provide practical alternatives. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:32', 'almaty', 'prioritize_RESORT_BASED_WINTER_ACTIVITIES BUT: verify_CITY_ROADS + MOUNTAIN_ACCESS + AVALANCHE_INFORMATION', 'Snow can improve skiing while simultaneously increasing road, walking, and mountain-safety complexity. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:33', 'almaty', 'avoid_UNCONTROLLED_BACKCOUNTRY + REMOTE_WINTER_HIKING AND: follow_OFFICIAL_SHYMBULAK_AND_MOUNTAIN_SAFETY_RESTRICTIONS', 'Shymbulak issues avalanche-season safety guidance, and high-mountain winter conditions should always take priority over planned adventure activities. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:34', 'almaty', 'prioritize_PANFILOV_PARK + ASCENSION_CATHEDRAL + GREEN_BAZAAR + KOK_TOBE + MEDEU + SHYMBULAK AND: add_ONE_KAZAKH_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'This combination provides the strongest introduction to Almaty''s cultural, culinary, urban, scenic, and mountain identities without excessive travel friction. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:35', 'almaty', 'prioritize_ALMATY_CITY_CULTURE + KAZAKH_CUISINE + TIAN_SHAN_MOUNTAINS AND: consider_ONE_MAJOR_REGIONAL_NATURE_EXPERIENCE_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Almaty provides an unusually broad first introduction to Kazakhstan through urban culture, markets, food, Soviet and historic architecture, mountain landscapes, skiing, and south-eastern Kazakhstan nature. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:36', 'almaty', 'prefer_PANFILOV_PARK + GREEN_BAZAAR + KOK_TOBE OR: prefer_MEDEU_SHYMBULAK_IF_MOUNTAINS_ARE_PRIORITY AND: avoid_CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY', 'Central Almaty and the nearby mountain corridor provide substantially greater value for a short stop than long road-based regional excursions. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:37', 'almaty', 'book_SHYMBULAK + ACCOMMODATION + SKI_SERVICES_EARLY AND: increase_EXPECTED_BUDGET', 'New Year and strong winter weekends increase visitor demand at Shymbulak. The resort operates extended schedules and special holiday arrangements during peak periods, and discounted tariffs may be restricted. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:38', 'almaty', 'verify_ECO_BUS + TAXI + ROAD_ACCESS_OPTIONS AND: restructure_MOUNTAIN_DAY_IF_REQUIRED', 'Shymbulak periodically closes cable cars for scheduled maintenance. During such periods, alternative road access can also operate under time restrictions, so old schedules should never be assumed. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:39', 'almaty', 'prefer_GREEN_BAZAAR + LOCAL_KAZAKH_DINING + PANFILOV_AREA + LOCAL_CAFÉS + CULTURAL_MUSEUMS AND: decrease_GENERIC_MALL_ONLY_AND_INTERNATIONAL_CHAIN_WEIGHT', 'Markets, traditional dishes, historic districts, museums, neighbourhood cafés, Kazakh music, and local food experiences provide a stronger connection with Almaty''s identity than relying primarily on international shopping centres. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:40', 'almaty', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_ESENTAI_AL_FARABI_HOTEL AND: add_ONE_OF_KOK_TOBE_OR_MEDEU_SHYMBULAK', 'Almaty''s business districts, premium hotels, dining, shopping, and relatively close mountain access make it particularly suitable for combining business travel with a short scenic extension. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:41', 'almaty', 'consider_OVERNIGHT_MOUNTAIN_RESORT_STAY WHEN: trip_length >= 5 nights OR: traveler_priority == RESORT_RELAXATION', 'Oi-Qaragai works best as a dedicated forest-and-mountain resort experience rather than a mandatory addition to every Almaty itinerary, particularly when the traveler already plans Medeu and Shymbulak. ---'),
  ('almaty:rule:42', 'almaty', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_50_TO_65_PERCENT_TO_ALMATY_CITY_AND_NEARBY_MOUNTAINS AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS', 'Almaty''s key advantage is the ability to combine a major urban destination with high-quality mountain experiences nearby. Excessive regional road trips can unintentionally remove the city component that makes Almaty distinctive. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:0', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_CENTRAL_ALMATY + KOK_TOBE_CABLE_CAR + PANORAMIC_VIEWPOINTS + ONE_FOOD_OR_CULTURAL_EXPERIENCE AND: do_not_recommend_MEDEU + SHYMBULAK + CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY_AS_DEFAULT_ADDITIONS', 'Kok Tobe is most effective as a compact scenic Almaty experience rather than a standalone multi-day destination. A short stay should focus on the cable-car journey, city panoramas, sunset or evening atmosphere, central-Almaty dining, and one nearby cultural or market experience. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:1', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_CENTRAL_ALMATY + KOK_TOBE + PANFILOV_PARK + GREEN_BAZAAR + ONE_SIGNATURE_FOOD_OR_CULTURAL_EXPERIENCE AND: consider_MEDEU_OR_SHYMBULAK_ONLY_IF_MOUNTAINS_ARE_THE_PRIMARY_PRIORITY', 'A two-night stay can provide a strong city-and-hilltop experience without excessive transport. Kok Tobe combines well with central Almaty, while Medeu and Shymbulak should be treated as a separate mountain day rather than rushed additions. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:2', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_CENTRAL_ALMATY + KOK_TOBE_SUNSET_OR_EVENING + ONE_MOUNTAIN_OR_CULTURAL_DAY AND: do_not_recommend_CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY_AS_DEFAULT', 'Kok Tobe, central Almaty, and one additional mountain or cultural experience give better value on a short first visit than long road-based regional excursions. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:3', 'kok-tobe', 'include_CENTRAL_ALMATY + KOK_TOBE + MEDEU_SHYMBULAK_ON_SEPARATE_DAY AND: consider_ONE_MAJOR_NATURE_OR_REGIONAL_EXCURSION_ACCORDING_TO_SEASON_AND_INTEREST', 'Four or more nights allow travelers to enjoy Kok Tobe as an unhurried city-view and evening experience while preserving time for Almaty’s mountain corridor and one larger nature product. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:4', 'kok-tobe', 'consider_CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY_REGIONAL_CIRCUIT AND: retain_AT_LEAST_2_TO_3_DAYS_FOR_CENTRAL_ALMATY + KOK_TOBE + MEDEU_SHYMBULAK', 'Kok Tobe and the city remain important parts of an Almaty itinerary. Longer regional nature circuits should complement rather than replace Almaty’s urban, scenic, food, and hilltop-leisure strengths. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:5', 'kok-tobe', 'increase_ROMANCE_WEIGHT_BY_20_PERCENT AND: increase_PRIVACY_WEIGHT_BY_15_PERCENT AND: increase_FREE_TIME_WEIGHT_BY_25_PERCENT AND: decrease_ACTIVITY_DENSITY_BY_20_PERCENT AND: prioritize_KOK_TOBE_SUNSET + SCENIC_DINING + PRIVATE_TRANSFER + EVENING_CITY_VIEWS', 'Kok Tobe is especially suitable for couples because it combines a cable-car experience, panoramic Almaty views, sunset, city lights, restaurants, cafés, and photography. It should be planned as a relaxed late-afternoon or evening experience rather than inserted into an overloaded sightseeing day. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:6', 'kok-tobe', 'reduce_ADVENTURE_INTENSITY_TARGET_BY_25_PERCENT AND: increase_DOWNTIME_BY_25_PERCENT AND: prefer_KOK_TOBE_CABLE_CAR + VIEWPOINTS + AGE_APPROPRIATE_FAMILY_RECREATION + CASUAL_DINING AND: avoid_ASSUMING_ALL_RIDES_OR_ATTRACTIONS_ARE_SUITABLE', 'Young children generally benefit more from a short cable-car ride, panoramic viewpoints, food breaks, simple recreation, and a flexible pace than from long mountain transfers, strenuous walking, or tightly scheduled outdoor activities. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:7', 'kok-tobe', 'consider_CENTRAL_ALMATY + KOK_TOBE + FAMILY_RECREATION + MEDEU_OR_SHYMBULAK_ON_SEPARATE_DAY AND: include_EDUCATIONAL + RECREATIONAL + SCENIC_EXPERIENCES', 'Older children can combine Kok Tobe’s cable car, city views, family attractions, markets, museums, and a separate Medeu or Shymbulak excursion more comfortably when the itinerary retains meal breaks and realistic travel time. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:8', 'kok-tobe', 'avoid_LATE_NIGHT_KOK_TOBE_RETURN_AS_DEFAULT AND: prefer_DAYLIGHT_OR_EARLY_SUNSET_VISIT', 'Kok Tobe can be highly suitable for families, but late finishes, cold evening conditions, queues, tired children, and transport arrangements can reduce comfort. Choose a return time that matches the family’s routine. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:9', 'kok-tobe', 'prefer_PRIVATE_TRANSPORT + KOK_TOBE_CABLE_CAR + SHORT_VIEWPOINT_VISIT + SEATED_DINING AND: reduce_STEEP_WALKING + LONG_HILLTOP_EXPLORATION + PEAK_HOUR_QUEUING AND: verify_CURRENT_CABLE_CAR_AND_SITE_ACCESSIBILITY', 'The cable car can reduce the effort of reaching Kok Tobe, but the hilltop includes slopes, steps, uneven surfaces, weather exposure, and walking distances that may affect comfort. A slower pace, private transfer, and flexible timing improve the experience. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:10', 'kok-tobe', 'prefer_PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER AND: prefer_PREMIUM_CENTRAL_OR_SOUTH_ALMATY_HOTEL AND: prefer_PRIVATE_DRIVER + FLEXIBLE_SUNSET_TIMING + PERSONALIZED_GUIDE_OR_PHOTOGRAPHER AND: increase_FINE_DINING + SPA + PREMIUM_SHOPPING + SCENIC_EVENING_EXPERIENCE_WEIGHT', 'For luxury travelers, Kok Tobe performs best as a premium scenic addition to an Almaty stay. Value comes from private transfers, timed sunset access, quality dining, photography, flexible scheduling, and central-Almaty luxury hotels rather than from treating Kok Tobe as a luxury resort. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:11', 'kok-tobe', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT_CONNECTED_ACCOMMODATION AND: use_WALKING + METRO + BUS_OR_TROLLEYBUS_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: treat_KOK_TOBE_CABLE_CAR_AS_THE_MAIN_PAID_ELEMENT AND: limit_PREMIUM_DINING + MULTIPLE_PAID_RIDES + SOUVENIR_SPENDING', 'Kok Tobe can be manageable on a moderate budget when visited as a focused scenic activity. The cable car, restaurants, family attractions, and convenience transport can raise spending if multiple optional activities are added. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:12', 'kok-tobe', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_WELL_CONNECTED_HOTEL', 'For visitors planning Kok Tobe with central sightseeing, restaurants, markets, museums, and evening activity, a central or well-connected hotel typically provides better overall value than a small room-rate saving in an inconvenient outer district. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:13', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_PANFILOV_PARK + ASCENSION_CATHEDRAL + MUSEUM_OF_FOLK_MUSICAL_INSTRUMENTS + CENTRAL_STATE_MUSEUM + GREEN_BAZAAR AND: use_KOK_TOBE_AS_A_SCENIC_EVENING_COMPLEMENT', 'Kok Tobe is a leisure, viewpoint, and cityscape experience rather than a primary heritage attraction. It works best after a cultural programme focused on central Almaty’s historic architecture, museums, markets, food, and urban history. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:14', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_KAZAKH_CUISINE + CENTRAL_ASIAN_CUISINE + GREEN_BAZAAR + MODERN_ALMATY_DINING AND: use_KOK_TOBE_FOR_SCENIC_CAFÉ_OR_DINNER_EXPERIENCE', 'Kok Tobe can add atmosphere, views, and scenic dining, but Almaty’s deeper gastronomy experience is found through local restaurants, markets, cafés, Kazakh dishes, Central Asian food, and contemporary city dining. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:15', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_GREEN_BAZAAR + ZHIBEK_ZHOLY_ARBAT + CENTRAL_MALLS + PREMIUM_RETAIL_AREAS AND: treat_KOK_TOBE_SOUVENIR_SHOPS_AS_SECONDARY', 'Kok Tobe may provide small souvenir opportunities, but it is not a major shopping destination. Central Almaty and premium districts provide broader retail choice, local products, crafts, international brands, and luxury shopping. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:16', 'kok-tobe', 'schedule_KOK_TOBE_FOR_SUNSET_OR_EARLY_EVENING AND: continue_TO_CENTRAL_ALMATY_OR_DOSTYK_FOR_BARS + LOUNGES + LIVE_MUSIC + LATE_DINING AND: retain_LATER_START_NEXT_MORNING_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Kok Tobe contributes panoramic dusk and city-light views but should not be positioned as Almaty’s primary nightlife district. The stronger late-night restaurant, bar, lounge, and social scene is in central Almaty. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:17', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_KOK_TOBE_CABLE_CAR + PANORAMIC_VIEWPOINTS + SUNSET + NIGHT_CITY_VIEWS AND: check_WEATHER + HAZE + CLOUD + WIND + SUNSET_TIME AND: allow_FLEXIBILITY_BEFORE_AND_AFTER_GOLDEN_HOUR', 'Kok Tobe is one of Almaty’s strongest locations for cityscape, sunset, night, and mountain-backdrop photography. View quality depends heavily on weather and visibility, so rigid timing should be avoided. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:18', 'kok-tobe', 'arrive_BEFORE_GOLDEN_HOUR AND: allow_TIME_FOR_CABLE_CAR_QUEUE + HILLTOP_WALKING + VIEWPOINT_SELECTION AND: verify_RETURN_TRANSPORT_AFTER_DARK', 'A sunset visit requires more than the short cable-car travel time. Ticketing, queues, restaurant demand, hilltop walking, weather changes, and post-sunset city-light photography can extend the visit substantially. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:19', 'kok-tobe', 'prefer_KOK_TOBE_SUNSET + SCENIC_DINING + CITY_LIGHTS + SPA + CENTRAL_ALMATY_CAFÉS AND: decrease_ACTIVITY_DENSITY_BY_20_PERCENT', 'Kok Tobe is strongest for romantic travelers when used as an unhurried scenic evening with cable-car views, dinner or drinks, photography, and free time rather than as one of many rushed attractions. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:20', 'kok-tobe', 'prefer_KOK_TOBE + BOTANICAL_GARDEN + CAFÉS + SPA + EASY_CITY_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_REMOTE_EXCURSION_DENSITY', 'Kok Tobe offers a low-intensity change of perspective over Almaty, especially when combined with a quiet café, scenic meal, parks, hotel relaxation, and light sightseeing instead of long-distance day trips. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:21', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_PANFILOV_PARK + ASCENSION_CATHEDRAL + GREEN_BAZAAR + KOK_TOBE + ONE_KAZAKH_FOOD_EXPERIENCE AND: add_MEDEU_OR_SHYMBULAK_ON_A_SEPARATE_DAY_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'This itinerary introduces Almaty’s cultural, food, market, architectural, scenic, and mountain-adjacent identity. Kok Tobe provides the clearest panoramic overview of the city without requiring a full mountain-resort day. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:22', 'kok-tobe', 'prefer_GREEN_BAZAAR_OR_PANFILOV_PARK + KOK_TOBE OR: choose_CENTRAL_ALMATY_FOOD_EXPERIENCE + KOK_TOBE_SUNSET_IF_TIME_ALLOWS AND: avoid_CHARYN + KOLSAY + KAINDY + FULL_DAY_MOUNTAIN_EXCURSIONS', 'For a short stop, Kok Tobe offers high visual impact with relatively limited travel time from central Almaty. It is more realistic than distant road-based regional attractions. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:23', 'kok-tobe', 'reduce_KOK_TOBE_PANORAMA_PRIORITY AND: increase_MUSEUMS + FOOD + SHOPPING + SPA + CAFÉ_TIME AND: consider_RESCHEDULING_KOK_TOBE_FOR_CLEARER_WEATHER', 'Kok Tobe’s principal value is its cable-car experience, open-air leisure, and panoramic views. Fog, haze, rain, cloud, or poor visibility can significantly reduce its sightseeing and photography value. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:24', 'kok-tobe', 'verify_KOK_TOBE_CABLE_CAR_STATUS + OUTDOOR_ATTRACTION_STATUS BEFORE: traveling_to_the_lower_station', 'Cableway and open-air attraction operations may be affected by weather, maintenance, or safety requirements. Visitors should confirm current conditions rather than relying on standard schedules. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:25', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_WARM_CLOTHING + SHORTER_OUTDOOR_DURATION + INDOOR_DINING_OR_CAFÉ_BREAKS AND: allow_EXTRA_TIME_FOR_TRANSPORT + WALKING + RETURN_JOURNEY', 'Winter can create attractive snowy panoramas and night views, but cold, ice, wind, fog, reduced daylight, and transport delays can reduce comfort. Kok Tobe works best as a short, well-timed visit in these conditions. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:26', 'kok-tobe', 'arrive_EARLIER AND: expect_HIGHER_DEMAND_FOR_CABLE_CAR + RESTAURANTS + FAMILY_ATTRACTIONS AND: verify_BOOKING_OR_RESERVATION_REQUIREMENTS', 'Clear-weather evenings, weekends, school holidays, and festive periods can increase demand at Kok Tobe. Early arrival and flexible plans reduce the effect of queues and limited restaurant availability. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:27', 'kok-tobe', 'verify_ALTERNATIVE_ROAD_ACCESS + TAXI_OR_PRIVATE_TRANSFER_OPTIONS AND: restructure_THE_VISIT_IF_THE_CABLE_CAR_IS_A_CORE_EXPERIENCE', 'The cable-car ride is a defining part of the Kok Tobe visit, not merely transport. If it is unavailable, the hilltop may still be reachable by road, but the experience and itinerary value change substantially. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:28', 'kok-tobe', 'verify_CURRENT_OPERATION + PRICING + LAST_ASCENT + LAST_DESCENT + WEATHER_STATUS BEFORE: confirming_the_itinerary', 'The official Kok Tobe cableway is approximately 1,620 metres long and the journey takes about six minutes, but maintenance, weather, operating hours, and special-event arrangements can change practical access. [page:1] ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:29', 'kok-tobe', 'prioritize_KOK_TOBE_CABLE_CAR + VIEWPOINTS + SELECTED_AGE_APPROPRIATE_ATTRACTIONS + CASUAL_DINING AND: verify_HEIGHT + AGE + WEATHER + OPERATING_REQUIREMENTS_FOR_EACH_ACTIVITY', 'Kok Tobe offers family-oriented leisure facilities in addition to viewpoints and dining, but individual attractions can have different operating conditions and may not be suitable for every child. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:30', 'kok-tobe', 'do_not_position_KOK_TOBE_AS_PRIMARY_ADVENTURE_PRODUCT AND: use_KOK_TOBE_AS_LIGHT_SCENIC_LEISURE AND: prefer_MEDEU + SHYMBULAK + ILE_ALATAU + SUITABLE_HIKING_OR_MOUNTAIN_ACTIVITIES_FOR_ADVENTURE', 'Kok Tobe provides light outdoor recreation and elevated views, but it is not a wilderness, trekking, ski, or serious mountain-adventure destination. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:31', 'kok-tobe', 'use_KOK_TOBE_FOR_CITY_AND_MOUNTAIN_BACKDROP_VIEWS AND: use_MEDEU_OR_SHYMBULAK_FOR_DEEPER_MOUNTAIN_EXPERIENCE', 'Kok Tobe is an accessible urban hilltop panorama. Medeu and Shymbulak are more suitable when the visitor’s goal is high-altitude mountain scenery, skiing, hiking, snow, or alpine recreation. ---'),
  ('kok-tobe:rule:32', 'kok-tobe', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_ESENTAI_AL_FARABI_HOTEL AND: add_KOK_TOBE_AS_A_2_TO_3_HOUR_LATE_AFTERNOON_OR_EVENING_EXPERIENCE', 'Kok Tobe is particularly effective for business travelers with limited leisure time because it can provide an iconic Almaty panorama, cable-car experience, food, and a relaxed evening without committing to a full ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:0', 'samarkand', 'prioritize_REGISTAN + GUR_E_AMIR + BIBI_KHANUM_SIAB + SHAH_I_ZINDA AND: do not recommend KONIGIL + IMAM_AL_BUKHARI + URGUT + SHAKHRISABZ + MULTIPLE_OUTLYING_EXCURSIONS as default additions.', 'A short Samarkand stay should focus on its highest-value UNESCO and Timurid heritage. The central monuments provide substantially more value than spending limited time on regional road transfers. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:1', 'samarkand', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20% prefer_REGISTAN_EVENING + GUR_E_AMIR + PREMIUM_DINING + SILK_ROAD_SAMARKAND', 'Samarkand works best for honeymoon travelers through illuminated architecture, heritage photography, boutique or premium accommodation, relaxed dining, cultural experiences, and quality couple time. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:2', 'samarkand', 'reduce_MONUMENT_DENSITY by 25% increase_downtime by 25% prefer_REGISTAN + SIAB_BAZAAR + SHORT_GUR_E_AMIR + KONIGIL_OR_FAMILY_LEISURE', 'Young children generally benefit more from shorter monument visits, markets, crafts, food, open spaces, and regular breaks than multiple long historical tours. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:3', 'samarkand', 'consider_REGISTAN + SHAH_I_ZINDA + ULUGH_BEG_OBSERVATORY + AFRASIAB AND: include_EDUCATIONAL + CULTURAL_EXPERIENCES', 'Older children can engage more effectively with Timurid history, archaeology, medieval astronomy, architecture, and Silk Road culture. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:4', 'samarkand', 'prefer_CENTRAL_HERITAGE_AREA_HOTEL', 'For short stays, proximity to Registan, Gur-e-Amir, restaurants, Siab Bazaar, and evening sightseeing usually provides better total value than a cheaper outer-area hotel. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:5', 'samarkand', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Samarkand works efficiently from one well-positioned base. Hotel changes usually add luggage handling and transport without improving a short heritage itinerary. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:6', 'samarkand', 'prefer_PRIVATE_TRANSFER AND: prefer_PREMIUM_HERITAGE_OR_SILK_ROAD_SAMARKAND_HOTEL AND: prefer_PRIVATE_GUIDE + CHAUFFEURED_VEHICLE AND: increase_FINE_DINING + SPA + PRIVATE_CULTURAL_EXPERIENCE_WEIGHT', 'Luxury in Samarkand should improve comfort, interpretation, privacy, dining, accommodation, and flexibility rather than simply increasing attraction count. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:7', 'samarkand', 'prefer_CENTRAL_GUESTHOUSE_OR_MID_RANGE_HOTEL AND: use_WALKING + CITY_BUS + SELECTIVE_TAXI AND: prioritize_CORE_HERITAGE + LOCAL_FOOD + BAZAARS', 'Samarkand can be explored economically because many core attractions are concentrated and local food, guesthouses, buses, and taxis remain relatively accessible. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:8', 'samarkand', 'prioritize_REGISTAN + SHAH_I_ZINDA + GUR_E_AMIR + BIBI_KHANUM + AFRASIAB AND: group_TIMURID + ISLAMIC + SOGDIAN + SILK_ROAD_HISTORY', 'UNESCO identifies ancient Afrasiab, the Timurid city, Registan, Bibi-Khanum, Shah-i-Zinda, Gur-e-Amir, and Ulugh Beg Observatory as Samarkand''s defining cultural layers. :[oaicite:2]{index=2} ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:9', 'samarkand', 'prefer_REGISTAN + SHAH_I_ZINDA + BIBI_KHANUM + GUR_E_AMIR AND: group_ISLAMIC_TILEWORK + MADRASA + MOSQUE + MAUSOLEUM_ARCHITECTURE', 'Samarkand''s strongest visual and architectural identity comes from monumental Timurid and Islamic design, glazed tilework, domes, portals, and madrasa ensembles. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:10', 'samarkand', 'prefer_AFRASIAB + AFRASIAB_MUSEUM + ULUGH_BEG_OBSERVATORY AND: retain_CORE_TIMURID_MONUMENTS', 'Afrasiab provides the ancient pre-Timurid layer, while Ulugh Beg Observatory adds one of Samarkand''s strongest science-history experiences. UNESCO specifically distinguishes ancient Afrasiab from the later Timurid city. :[oaicite:3]{index=3} ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:11', 'samarkand', 'prefer_REGISTAN + SHAH_I_ZINDA + GUR_E_AMIR + BIBI_KHANUM AND: prioritize_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + BLUE_HOUR', 'Samarkand''s strongest photography comes from monumental façades, tilework, courtyards, domes, markets, and illuminated evening architecture. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:12', 'samarkand', 'prefer_SIAB_BAZAAR + SAMARKAND_PLOV + SAMSA + NON + TEA + LOCAL_SWEETS AND: include_ONE_TRADITIONAL_FAMILY_STYLE_MEAL', 'Food should be treated as part of the Silk Road experience rather than only as a break between monuments. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:13', 'samarkand', 'prefer_SIAB_BAZAAR + KONIGIL + REGISTAN_AREA_CRAFTS AND: prioritize_SAMARKAND_PAPER + CERAMICS + SUZANI + TEXTILES + LOCAL_FOOD_PRODUCTS', 'Samarkand is stronger for traditional crafts and regional products than for international luxury shopping. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:14', 'samarkand', 'prioritize_SHAH_I_ZINDA + HAZRAT_KHIZR + IMAM_AL_BUKHARI_COMPLEX AND: allow_ADDITIONAL_ROAD_TIME_FOR_PAYARIK', 'Religious travel should distinguish central Islamic heritage from the outlying Imam Al-Bukhari pilgrimage complex. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:15', 'samarkand', 'prefer_ULUGH_BEG_OBSERVATORY + AFRASIAB', 'Ulugh Beg''s Observatory is one of Samarkand''s defining medieval scientific monuments and is specifically included in the UNESCO property. :[oaicite:4]{index=4} ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:16', 'samarkand', 'prefer_KONIGIL AND: allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS', 'Konigil works best as a secondary hands-on craft experience rather than replacing Samarkand''s essential monuments on a short first visit. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:17', 'samarkand', 'consider_SILK_ROAD_SAMARKAND + ETERNAL_CITY AND: combine_PREMIUM_HOTEL + DINING + WELLNESS + CULTURAL_ENTERTAINMENT', 'This area provides Samarkand''s strongest modern resort-style and premium leisure product. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:18', 'samarkand', 'consider_OHALIK + OK_BUYRO + MIRANKUL AND: reduce_MONUMENT_DENSITY', 'These recreational areas provide a countryside break from Samarkand''s monument-heavy sightseeing, but they should remain secondary to the city''s cultural core. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:19', 'samarkand', 'prefer_URGUT AND: allocate_HALF_DAY', 'Urgut is better suited to travelers specifically interested in regional markets, crafts, textiles, local food, and photography than to short first-time sightseeing. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:20', 'samarkand', 'allocate_FULL_DAY AND: use_PRIVATE_DRIVER_OR_ORGANIZED_EXCURSION AND: avoid_combining_with_HEAVY_SAMARKAND_SIGHTSEEING', 'Shakhrisabz is a substantial regional Timurid excursion and should not be treated as a quick extension to a full central-Samarkand day. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:21', 'samarkand', 'do_not_recommend_SHAKHRISABZ + URGUT + IMAM_AL_BUKHARI + MULTIPLE_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS_AS_DEFAULT', 'Short trips provide greater value when concentrated on Samarkand''s UNESCO core, food, markets, and photography. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:22', 'samarkand', 'add_AFRASIAB + ULUGH_BEG + KONIGIL AND: consider_ONE_OF_IMAM_AL_BUKHARI_OR_SHAKHRISABZ', 'Four or more nights allow deeper historical layers and one regional excursion without sacrificing the central heritage experience. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:23', 'samarkand', 'consider_SHAKHRISABZ + URGUT + IMAM_AL_BUKHARI + COUNTRYSIDE AND: retain_AT_LEAST_3_DAYS_FOR_CORE_SAMARKAND', 'Regional extensions should enhance rather than replace the UNESCO city itself. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:24', 'samarkand', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON_HERITAGE_SIGHTSEEING AND: increase_MUSEUM + BAZAAR + RESTAURANT + HOTEL_BREAK_TIME', 'Samarkand''s major monuments are exposed outdoor environments, so prolonged midday sightseeing can become uncomfortable during peak summer heat. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:25', 'samarkand', 'reduce_LONG_WALKING + OUTLYING_EXCURSIONS AND: prefer_MUSEUMS + FOOD + CRAFTS + SHORTER_HERITAGE_VISITS', 'Poor weather reduces walking comfort and photography value but Samarkand retains strong museum, dining, craft, and indoor cultural alternatives. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:26', 'samarkand', 'reduce_SHAH_I_ZINDA_STAIRS + LONG_HERITAGE_WALKS AND: prefer_REGISTAN + GUR_E_AMIR + ULUGH_BEG + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT AND: verify_ACCESSIBILITY_PER_SITE', 'Historic paving, stairs, thresholds, large monument complexes, and summer heat can materially increase walking difficulty. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:27', 'samarkand', 'prioritize_REGISTAN + GUR_E_AMIR + BIBI_KHANUM + SIAB_BAZAAR + SHAH_I_ZINDA AND: add_ONE_OF_ULUGH_BEG_OR_AFRASIAB_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'This combination provides the clearest introduction to Samarkand''s Timurid architecture, Islamic heritage, Silk Road culture, local food, and deeper historical layers. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:28', 'samarkand', 'prioritize_SAMARKAND_CORE_HERITAGE + UZBEK_CUISINE + LOCAL_CRAFTS AND: combine_WITH_TASHKENT_OR_BUKHARA_IF_TRIP_LENGTH_ALLOWS', 'Samarkand is one of Uzbekistan''s essential Silk Road destinations, but a broader first Uzbekistan itinerary benefits from combining it with other major cultural centres. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:29', 'samarkand', 'prefer_REGISTAN + GUR_E_AMIR OR: prefer_REGISTAN + BIBI_KHANUM + SIAB_BAZAAR AND: avoid_REMOTE_EXCURSIONS', 'These combinations provide the highest visual and cultural value with the lowest travel friction. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:30', 'samarkand', 'prefer_SIAB_BAZAAR + LOCAL_UZBEK_DINING + KONIGIL + TRADITIONAL_NEIGHBOURHOODS AND: decrease_GENERIC_RESORT_ONLY_ACTIVITY_WEIGHT', 'Markets, cuisine, crafts, traditional neighbourhoods, and local workshops provide a deeper connection with Samarkand than relying only on monumental sightseeing. ---'),
  ('samarkand:rule:31', 'samarkand', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_65_TO_75_PERCENT_TO_CORE_HERITAGE AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_FOOD + CRAFTS + SILK_ROAD_SAMARKAND + COUNTRYSIDE + FREE_TIME', 'Samarkand''s primary strength is concentrated cultural heritage, but excessive monument density can reduce enjoyment. A balanced itinerary should protect food, crafts, photography, and relaxed exploration. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:0', 'tashkent', 'prioritize_CENTRAL_TASHKENT + KHAST_IMAM + CHORSU_BAZAAR + AMIR_TIMUR_SQUARE + TV_TOWER + ONE_SIGNATURE_UZBEK_FOOD_OR_CULTURAL_EXPERIENCE AND: do not recommend_CHIMGAN + BELDERSAY + AMIRSOY + CHARVAK + FERGANA_VALLEY + MULTIPLE_REMOTE_MOUNTAIN_EXCURSIONS as default additions.', 'A short Tashkent stay is best focused on the city''s strongest urban, cultural, and culinary experiences. Khast Imam Square, Chorsu Bazaar, Amir Timur Square, Tashkent TV Tower, Independence Square, Minor Mosque, museums, metro architecture, and local food provide a strong introduction without sacrificing excessive time to long regional road journeys. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:1', 'tashkent', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_privacy_weight by 15% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20%', 'The objective should be a relaxed city-and-mountain experience combining TV Tower views, Minor Mosque, premium dining, cafés, spa, private city tours, scenic mountain excursions to Chimgan or Charvak, photography, and quality couple time rather than maximum sightseeing. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:2', 'tashkent', 'reduce_adventure_intensity_target by 25% increase_downtime by 25% prefer_TV_TOWER + PARKS + ZOO + BOTANICAL_GARDEN + EASY_CHIMGAN_AMIRSOY + FAMILY_RECREATION', 'Young children generally benefit more from cable-car rides, parks, zoo, botanical garden, TV Tower, cafés, malls, and short scenic experiences than long mountain hikes or extensive regional road trips. Mountain day trips, summer heat, and extended excursions require age-appropriate planning. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:3', 'tashkent', 'consider_KHAST_IMAM + CHORSU_BAZAAR + TV_TOWER + AMIRSOY + SELECTED_NATURE_EXCURSION AND: include_EDUCATIONAL + RECREATIONAL + MOUNTAIN_EXPERIENCES', 'Older children can combine city culture, mountain scenery, cable cars, skiing, hiking, museums, bazaars, and nature-based experiences more effectively. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:4', 'tashkent', 'do_not_default_to_SNOWBOARD_LESSON AND: consider_CHILD_SKI_LESSON', 'Amirsoy and Chimgan ski schools typically provide ski instruction for young children, while snowboard instruction is often listed from age 8. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:5', 'tashkent', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_WELL_CONNECTED_HOTEL', 'For city-focused stays, access to restaurants, metro / bus routes, Khast Imam, Chorsu Bazaar, pedestrian areas, shopping, nightlife, and mountain-transfer routes generally provides better overall value than a small room-rate saving in an inconvenient outer location. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:6', 'tashkent', 'prefer_CENTRAL_TASHKENT_OR_CONVENIENT_MOUNTAIN_ACCESS_HOTEL', 'Daily travel with ski equipment and winter clothing increases transport friction. Convenient access toward Amirsoy, Chimgan, and Beldersay can materially improve a short ski-oriented stay. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:7', 'tashkent', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Tashkent generally works effectively as a single urban base for central sightseeing, TV Tower, Khast Imam, Chorsu, museums, shopping, and selected nearby mountain experiences. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:8', 'tashkent', 'consider_SPLIT_STAY_TASHKENT + AMIRSOY_OR_CHIMGAN_MOUNTAIN_RESORT', 'Longer itineraries can justify combining city accommodation with a dedicated mountain-resort stay when privacy, wellness, skiing, forest scenery, or slower resort leisure is a primary objective. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:9', 'tashkent', 'prefer_PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER AND: prefer_PREMIUM_CENTRAL_OR_SOUTH_TASHKENT_HOTEL AND: prefer_PRIVATE_DRIVER + PERSONALIZED_GUIDE AND: increase_FINE_DINING + SPA + PREMIUM_SHOPPING + PRIVATE_MOUNTAIN_EXPERIENCE_WEIGHT', 'Luxury value in Tashkent comes from premium accommodation, chauffeured transport, fine dining, wellness, shopping, private cultural interpretation, mountain access, high-quality guiding, and flexible regional excursions rather than simply adding more attractions. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:10', 'tashkent', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT_CONNECTED_ACCOMMODATION AND: use_WALKING + METRO + CITY_BUS_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: use_GROUP_EXCURSIONS_FOR_REMOTE_NATURE_SITES', 'Tashkent''s urban sightseeing can be relatively economical through walking and public transport, while mountain lifts, skiing, equipment rental, nightlife, and distant regional excursions represent the main additional cost categories. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:11', 'tashkent', 'prefer_KHAST_IMAM_SQUARE + KUKELDASH_MADRASAH + JUMA_MOSQUE + STATE_MUSEUM_OF_HISTORY + MINOR_MOSQUE + CHORSU_BAZAAR AND: group_ISLAMIC_ARCHITECTURE + SOVIET_HERITAGE + UZBEK_TRADITIONS + LOCAL_MARKET_EXPERIENCE', 'Tashkent''s cultural strength comes from historic Islamic architecture, museums, Soviet and pre-Soviet urban layers, Uzbek musical traditions, bazaars, food culture, galleries, and its role as Uzbekistan''s cultural capital. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:12', 'tashkent', 'prioritize_UZBEK_CUISINE + CENTRAL_ASIAN_CUISINE + CHORSU_BAZAAR + MODERN_TASHKENT_DINING AND: group_PLOV + SHASHLIK + SAMSA + MANTY + LAGMAN + NON + TEA + CAFÉ_CULTURE', 'Tashkent is one of Central Asia''s strongest gastronomy destinations, combining traditional Uzbek cuisine, Central Asian food, bazaars, specialty coffee, contemporary restaurants, and international dining. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:13', 'tashkent', 'choose_SHOPPING_AREA_BY_PURPOSE AND: use_CHORSU_BAZAAR_FOR_LOCAL_FOOD_PRODUCTS_AND_CRAFTS AND: use_CENTRAL_RETAIL_STREETS_FOR_CENTRAL_RETAIL_AND_SOUVENIRS AND: use_PREMIUM_MALLS_FOR_INTERNATIONAL_BRANDS_AND_LUXURY', 'Tashkent provides very different retail environments ranging from traditional bazaars and local crafts to major shopping centres, international brands, and premium boutiques. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:14', 'tashkent', 'prefer_CENTRAL_TASHKENT + SELECTED_ROOFTOP_BAR_LOUNGE_OR_LIVE_MUSIC AND: retain_LATER_START_NEXT_MORNING_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Tashkent has a substantial evening economy involving restaurants, cocktail bars, lounges, clubs, cafés, live music, rooftops, and late-night social activity. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:15', 'tashkent', 'prefer_TV_TOWER + KHAST_IMAM + CHORSU_BAZAAR + AMIRSOY + CHIMGAN AND: group_CITYSCAPES + TIAN_SHAN_BACKDROPS + SUNSET + ISLAMIC_ARCHITECTURE + SOVIET_GRANDEUR', 'Tashkent''s strongest visual identity comes from the contrast between urban architecture, tree-lined streets, Islamic landmarks, Soviet monuments, and the dramatic Chatkal Range and Tian Shan immediately behind the city. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:16', 'tashkent', 'prioritize_AMIRSOY + CHIMGAN + BELDERSAY AND: consider_CHARVAK_RESERVOIR_OR_UGAM_CHATKAL_AREA', 'Amirsoy, Chimgan, and Beldersay offer the easiest high-value mountain experience close to the city, while Charvak Reservoir and Ugam-Chatkal provide deeper nature exploration with greater access and weather considerations. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:17', 'tashkent', 'prefer_AMIRSOY_OR_CHIMGAN_IN_WINTER AND: group_AMIRSOY + GONDOLA + SKIING + SNOWBOARDING + SKI_SCHOOL + MOUNTAIN_DINING', 'Amirsoy and Chimgan are Tashkent''s principal winter-sports products. The resorts operate with modern cable cars, ski slopes, equipment rental, ski school, restaurants, and seasonal mountain facilities. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:18', 'tashkent', 'replace_PRIMARY_SKI_FOCUS WITH: AMIRSOY_GONDOLA + HIKING + HORSE_RIDING + MOUNTAIN_WALKING + OUTDOOR_RECREATION', 'Amirsoy and Chimgan operate as all-season mountain resorts. During warmer months, their official tourism product shifts toward hiking, walking, horse riding, mountain scenery, festivals, dining, and other outdoor experiences. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:19', 'tashkent', 'prefer_UGAM_CHATKAL + CHIMGAN + BELDERSAY + SELECTED_CHATKAL_ROUTE AND: verify_ROUTE_DIFFICULTY + WEATHER + ALTITUDE + DAYLIGHT', 'Tashkent has extensive mountain-trail access immediately north and east of the city, but route difficulty varies considerably and should be matched to traveler fitness, experience, season, and current mountain conditions. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:20', 'tashkent', 'verify_CURRENT_ACCESS_RULES + ROAD_STATUS + PROTECTED_AREA_REQUIREMENTS BEFORE: confirming_itinerary', 'Charvak Reservoir is one of the region''s most recognizable mountain landscapes, but access arrangements have changed at different times and should never be assumed from older travel information. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:21', 'tashkent', 'allocate_FULL_DAY AND: consider_BELDERSAY_AS_PRIORITY AND: avoid_combining_with_HEAVY_CITY_SIGHTSEEING', 'Chimgan lies well outside central Tashkent and requires substantial road travel. The mountain area is best treated as a major nature and landscape excursion rather than an additional city attraction. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:22', 'tashkent', 'allocate_FULL_DAY AND: consider_PRIVATE_DRIVER_OR_ORGANIZED_EXCURSION', 'Amirsoy and Beldersay require long road travel from Tashkent and are better treated as dedicated regional experiences rather than casual additions to a city day. ---');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('tashkent:rule:23', 'tashkent', 'prefer_2_DAY_OR_3_DAY_REGIONAL_CIRCUIT OVER: RUSHED_SINGLE_DAY_COMBINATION', 'Combining all three in one day creates excessive road travel and reduces useful time for hiking, photography, lakeside exploration, meals, rest, and seasonal delays. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:24', 'tashkent', 'do_not_recommend_CHIMGAN + CHARVAK + FERGANA_VALLEY_AS_DEFAULT', 'A short first visit generally provides better value when focused on Tashkent city, Khast Imam, Chorsu, TV Tower, food, culture, and nightlife rather than spending most of the stay on long regional transfers. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:25', 'tashkent', 'consider_ONE_MAJOR_REGIONAL_EXCURSION SUCH_AS: CHIMGAN_OR_AMIRSOY_OR_CHARVAK_RESERVOIR', 'Four or more nights provide enough time to preserve Tashkent''s city-and-mountain identity while adding one significant regional nature experience. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:26', 'tashkent', 'consider_CHIMGAN + CHARVAK + FERGANA_VALLEY AND: retain_AT_LEAST_3_DAYS_FOR_TASHKENT_CITY_AND_NEARBY_MOUNTAINS', 'Tashkent itself remains a substantial destination. Longer nature circuits should enhance rather replace Khast Imam, Chorsu, TV Tower, museums, food, shopping, and urban cultural experiences. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:27', 'tashkent', 'prefer_AMIRSOY + CHIMGAN + SEASONAL_MOUNTAIN_ACTIVITIES AND: consider_CHARVAK + FERGANA_VALLEY_FOR_EXTENDED_TRIPS', 'Tashkent''s principal adventure identity comes from its unusually close relationship with the Chatkal Range and Tian Shan and its access to skiing, snowboarding, hiking, trekking, mountain recreation, canyon exploration, and alpine reservoirs. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:28', 'tashkent', 'prefer_TV_TOWER + AMIRSOY + SPA + PREMIUM_DINING + MOUNTAIN_VIEW_ACCOMMODATION AND: decrease_activity_density_by_20_percent', 'Tashkent''s romantic appeal comes from mountain panoramas, cable-car rides, snow experiences, stylish restaurants, cafés, spas, sunset views, and flexible city-and-nature time. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:29', 'tashkent', 'prefer_PREMIUM_HOTEL + SPA + BOTANICAL_GARDEN + CAFÉS + TV_TOWER + EASY_MOUNTAIN_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_REMOTE_EXCURSION_DENSITY', 'Tashkent works well as a relaxed urban-and-mountain destination when quality accommodation, parks, cafés, dining, wellness, scenic towers, and free time are prioritized over continuous long-distance excursions. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:30', 'tashkent', 'reduce_HIKING + CANYON_WALKING + SKIING + HIGH_ALTITUDE_ACTIVITY_INTENSITY AND: prefer_KHAST_IMAM + MUSEUMS + TV_TOWER + EASY_CHIMGAN_AMIRSOY + SCENIC_DRIVES + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT AND: verify_HOTEL + PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + GONDOLA_ACCESSIBILITY', 'Tashkent''s city sightseeing can be relatively manageable, but mountain snow, slopes, high altitude, canyon terrain, and hiking routes can significantly increase physical demands. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:31', 'tashkent', 'reduce_TV_TOWER_PANORAMA + AMIRSOY_VIEWPOINTS + MOUNTAIN_HIKING + CANYON_EXCURSIONS AND: increase_MUSEUMS + FOOD + SHOPPING + SPA + CAFÉ_TIME', 'Poor visibility reduces mountain and panoramic value, while Tashkent''s strong indoor culture, dining, shopping, cafés, museums, and wellness provide practical alternatives. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:32', 'tashkent', 'prioritize_RESORT_BASED_WINTER_ACTIVITIES BUT: verify_CITY_ROADS + MOUNTAIN_ACCESS + AVALANCHE_INFORMATION', 'Snow can improve skiing while simultaneously increasing road, walking, and mountain-safety complexity. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:33', 'tashkent', 'avoid_UNCONTROLLED_BACKCOUNTRY + REMOTE_WINTER_HIKING AND: follow_OFFICIAL_AMIRSOY_AND_MOUNTAIN_SAFETY_RESTRICTIONS', 'Amirsoy and Chimgan issue avalanche-season safety guidance, and high-mountain winter conditions should always take priority over planned adventure activities. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:34', 'tashkent', 'prioritize_KHAST_IMAM + CHORSU_BAZAAR + AMIR_TIMUR_SQUARE + TV_TOWER + INDEPENDENCE_SQUARE + MINOR_MOSQUE AND: add_ONE_UZBEK_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'This combination provides the strongest introduction to Tashkent''s cultural, culinary, urban, scenic, and mountain identities without excessive travel friction. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:35', 'tashkent', 'prioritize_TASHKENT_CITY_CULTURE + UZBEK_CUISINE + TIAN_SHAN_MOUNTAINS AND: consider_ONE_MAJOR_REGIONAL_NATURE_EXPERIENCE_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Tashkent provides an unusually broad first introduction to Uzbekistan through urban culture, bazaars, food, Islamic and Soviet architecture, mountain landscapes, skiing, and north-eastern Uzbekistan nature. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:36', 'tashkent', 'prefer_KHAST_IMAM + CHORSU_BAZAAR + TV_TOWER OR: prefer_AMIRSOY_CHIMGAN_IF_MOUNTAINS_ARE_PRIORITY AND: avoid_CHIMGAN + CHARVAK + FERGANA_VALLEY', 'Central Tashkent and the nearby mountain corridor provide substantially greater value for a short stop than long road-based regional excursions. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:37', 'tashkent', 'book_AMIRSOY + ACCOMMODATION + SKI_SERVICES_EARLY AND: increase_EXPECTED_BUDGET', 'New Year and strong winter weekends increase visitor demand at Amirsoy and Chimgan. The resorts operate extended schedules and special holiday arrangements during peak periods, and discounted tariffs may be restricted. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:38', 'tashkent', 'verify_TAXI + ROAD_ACCESS_OPTIONS AND: restructure_MOUNTAIN_DAY_IF_REQUIRED', 'Amirsoy and Chimgan periodically close cable cars for scheduled maintenance. During such periods, alternative road access can also operate under time restrictions, so old schedules should never be assumed. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:39', 'tashkent', 'prefer_CHORSU_BAZAAR + LOCAL_UZBEK_DINING + KHAST_IMAM_AREA + LOCAL_CAFÉS + CULTURAL_MUSEUMS AND: decrease_GENERIC_MALL_ONLY_AND_INTERNATIONAL_CHAIN_WEIGHT', 'Bazaars, traditional dishes, historic districts, museums, neighbourhood cafés, Uzbek music, and local food experiences provide a stronger connection with Tashkent''s identity than relying primarily on international shopping centres. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:40', 'tashkent', 'prefer_CENTRAL_OR_PREMIUM_SOUTH_TASHKENT_HOTEL AND: add_ONE_OF_TV_TOWER_OR_AMIRSOY_CHIMGAN', 'Tashkent''s business districts, premium hotels, dining, shopping, and relatively close mountain access make it particularly suitable for combining business travel with a short scenic extension. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:41', 'tashkent', 'consider_OVERNIGHT_MOUNTAIN_RESORT_STAY WHEN: trip_length >= 5 nights OR: traveler_priority == RESORT_RELAXATION', 'Amirsoy works best as a dedicated forest-and-mountain resort experience rather than a mandatory addition to every Tashkent itinerary, particularly when the traveler already plans Chimgan and Beldersay. ---'),
  ('tashkent:rule:42', 'tashkent', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_50_TO_65_PERCENT_TO_TASHKENT_CITY_AND_NEARBY_MOUNTAINS AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS', 'Tashkent''s key advantage is the ability to combine a major urban destination with high-quality mountain experiences nearby. Excessive regional road trips can unintentionally remove the city component that makes Tashkent distinctive. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:0', 'bishkek', 'prioritize_ALA_TOO_SQUARE + OSH_BAZAAR + PANFILOV_PARK + VICTORY_SQUARE + STATE_HISTORY_MUSEUM AND: do not recommend ALA_ARCHA + BURANA + CHON_KEMIN + KASHKA_SUU + MULTIPLE_OUTLYING_EXCURSIONS as default additions.', 'A short Bishkek stay should focus on the city''s main urban sights, food, and easy cultural stops. The central areas give much more value than spending limited time on road transfers. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:1', 'bishkek', 'increase_romance_weight by 20% increase_free_time_weight by 25% decrease_activity_density by 20% prefer_ALA_TOO_SQUARE_EVENING + MOUNTAIN_VIEW_DINING + SPA + BOUTIQUE_HOTEL + ALA_ARCHA', 'Bishkek works best for honeymoon travelers through relaxed city time, good dining, spa experiences, mountain scenery, and private short excursions. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:2', 'bishkek', 'reduce_MONUMENT_DENSITY by 25% increase_downtime by 25% prefer_PANFILOV_PARK + DUBOVY_PARK + SHORT_OSH_BAZAAR + ALA_TOO_SQUARE + FAMILY_CAFES', 'Young children usually do better with parks, open space, short market visits, food stops, and regular breaks than with too many museum or transport-heavy activities. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:3', 'bishkek', 'consider_AlaTooSquare + OshBazaar + StateHistoryMuseum + AlaArcha AND: include_EDUCATIONAL + CULTURAL_EXPERIENCES', 'Older children can handle more history, urban culture, and one easy mountain outing. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:4', 'bishkek', 'prefer_CENTRAL_BISHKEK_HOTEL', 'For short stays, access to central sights, restaurants, cafés, and evening movement usually matters more than a small room-rate saving. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:5', 'bishkek', 'prefer_one_hotel', 'Bishkek works efficiently from one well-located base. Hotel changes usually add time and cost without improving a short city itinerary. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:6', 'bishkek', 'prefer_PRIVATE_TRANSFER AND: prefer_PREMIUM_CITY_HOTEL AND: prefer_PRIVATE_GUIDE + CHAUFFEURED_VEHICLE AND: increase_FINE_DINING + SPA + PRIVATE_EXCURSION_WEIGHT', 'Luxury in Bishkek should improve comfort, privacy, food, and flexibility rather than simply adding more sights. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:7', 'bishkek', 'prefer_CENTRAL_GUESTHOUSE_OR_MID_RANGE_HOTEL AND: use_WALKING + CITY_BUS + SELECTIVE_TAXI AND: prioritize_CORE_CITY_SIGHTS + LOCAL_FOOD + BAZAARS', 'Bishkek is well suited to budget travel because the central city is manageable and local food and transport remain accessible. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:8', 'bishkek', 'prioritize_ALA_TOO_SQUARE + STATE_HISTORY_MUSEUM + VICTORY_SQUARE + SOVIET_BISHKEK_AREA + PANFILOV_PARK', 'Bishkek is strongest for Soviet-era urban culture, national history, parks, and easy city walking rather than dense monument sightseeing. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:9', 'bishkek', 'prefer_AlaTooSquare + SovietBishkekCore + VictorySquare + CentralBoulevards AND: group_SOVIET_URBAN_LAYOUT + MONUMENTAL_PUBLIC_SPACE + MODERN_CITY_PHOTOGRAPHY', 'Bishkek''s architectural identity comes mainly from Soviet planning, open squares, and broad city avenues. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:10', 'bishkek', 'prefer_STATE_HISTORY_MUSEUM + VICTORY_SQUARE + MANAS_COMPLEX + SOVIET_BISHKEK_CORE', 'Bishkek''s history is best experienced through museums, memorial spaces, and the city''s Soviet-era fabric. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:11', 'bishkek', 'prefer_ALA_TOO_SQUARE + PANFILOV_PARK + DUBOVY_PARK + SOVIET_BISHKEK_CORE + MOUNTAIN_BACKDROPS AND: prioritize_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + BLUE_HOUR', 'Bishkek''s best photography comes from city squares, parks, bazaars, and the mountain backdrop around the capital. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:12', 'bishkek', 'prefer_OSH_BAZAAR + KYRGYZ_CUISINE + PLOV + LAGMAN + SHASHLIK + MANTY + SAMSA + CAFES AND: include_ONE_TRADITIONAL_MEAL', 'Food should be treated as a major Bishkek experience, not just a stop between sightseeing points. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:13', 'bishkek', 'prefer_OSH_BAZAAR + DORDOI_MARKET + MALLS + LOCAL_CRAFTS + FELT + TEXTILES', 'Bishkek is strong for bazaars, everyday shopping, souvenirs, and Kyrgyz products. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:14', 'bishkek', 'prefer_ALA_ARCHA + MOUNTAIN_VIEWPOINTS + CHON_KEMIN + BURANA AND: reduce_CENTRAL_CITY_DENSITY', 'Bishkek works well as a gateway to the Tien Shan rather than as a pure urban-only destination. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:15', 'bishkek', 'consider_PANFILOV_PARK + DUBOVY_PARK + CAFES + SPA + HOTEL_TIME AND: reduce_ACTIVITY_DENSITY', 'Bishkek is a good fit for slow urban travel, café time, and easy pauses between short sightseeing blocks. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:16', 'bishkek', 'prefer_OSH_BAZAAR + DORDOI_MARKET AND: allocate_HALF_DAY', 'These markets are best for travelers interested in everyday commerce, food, and local atmosphere rather than polished sightseeing. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:17', 'bishkek', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_OR_FULL_DAY AND: use_PRIVATE_DRIVER_OR_ORGANIZED_EXCURSION AND: avoid_combining_with_HEAVY_CITY_SIGHTSEEING', 'Ala-Archa is the key mountain escape from Bishkek and deserves its own time window. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:18', 'bishkek', 'do_not_recommend_BURANA + CHON_KEMIN + KASHKA_SUU + MULTIPLE_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS_AS_DEFAULT', 'Short trips are better spent on Bishkek''s central sights, food, parks, and one easy nature option if time allows. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:19', 'bishkek', 'add_ALA_ARCHA + DUBOVY_PARK + CAFE_DINING_TIME AND: consider_ONE_OF_BURANA_OR_CHON_KEMIN', 'Four or more nights allow a deeper Bishkek stay without sacrificing the core city experience. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:20', 'bishkek', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON_SIGHTSEEING AND: increase_MUSEUM + CAFE + HOTEL_BREAK_TIME', 'Bishkek''s outdoor areas are easier to enjoy when the day is split around the hottest hours. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:21', 'bishkek', 'reduce_LONG_WALKS + OUTLYING_EXCURSIONS AND: prefer_MUSEUMS + FOOD + CAFES + SHORTER_CITY_VISITS', 'Poor weather reduces comfort, but Bishkek still has strong indoor and low-walking options. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:22', 'bishkek', 'reduce_LONG_WALKS + MARKET_CROWDING + MOUNTAIN_STRESS AND: prefer_ALA_TOO_SQUARE + PANFILOV_PARK + VICTORY_SQUARE + STATE_HISTORY_MUSEUM + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT', 'A calm central route with shorter transfers usually works best for seniors and mobility-limited travelers. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:23', 'bishkek', 'prioritize_ALA_TOO_SQUARE + OSH_BAZAAR + PANFILOV_PARK + VICTORY_SQUARE + STATE_HISTORY_MUSEUM AND: add_ONE_OF_DUBOVY_PARK_OR_AlaArcha_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'This gives the clearest introduction to Bishkek''s city life, culture, food, and mountain access. ---'),
  ('bishkek:rule:24', 'bishkek', 'prioritize_BISHKEK_CORE_CITY + KYRGYZ_CUISINE + LOCAL_MARKETS AND: combine_WITH_ISSYK_KUL_OR_OTHER_REGIONS_IF_TRIP_LENGTH_ALLOWS', 'Bishkek is a strong first entry point to Kyrgyzstan, but a broader itinerary benefits from adding the mountains and lake regions too. ---'),
