  ('busan:rule:3', 'busan', 'Haeundae Beach sunset + Gwangalli Bridge night + Gamcheon + Haedong Yonggungsa + seafood dinner + boutique + beach romantic + best beach honeymoon Korea + 4★ $80-$150 + 5★ $120-$300 + boutique $80-$200 + Haeundae $120-$300 + Gwangalli $100-$250 + Park Hyatt $200-$400 + Paradise $200-$400 + Haeundae Beach sunset + Gwangalli Bridge night + Gamcheon + Haedong Yonggungsa + seafood dinner + boutique + beach romantic + best beach honeymoon Korea + must + 2-3N + private car + guide', NULL),
  ('busan:rule:4', 'busan', 'Jagalchi Fish Market biggest seafood market Korea + Dwaeji Gukbap + Milmyeon + street food + seafood + best seafood Korea + best street food beach Korea + Jagalchi + Seomyeon + Nampodong + Haeundae + Gwangalli + Haeundae Beach #1 beach Korea + Gwangalli Beach + Songdo Beach + Dadaepo Beach + best beaches Korea + best beach city Korea + beach + spa + Jjimjilbang + quiet + best relaxation beach Korea + must + 2-3N + Metro + private car + seafood + beach ---', NULL),
  ('beijing:rule:0', 'beijing', 'prioritize_FORBIDDEN_CITY_AND_JINGSHAN + MUTIANYU_GREAT_WALL + TEMPLE_OF_HEAVEN_AND_HUTONGS', 'Very short stays gain more value from properly experiencing core imperial sights and one Great Wall section than losing time to distant suburban moves. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:1', 'beijing', 'prioritize_FORBIDDEN_CITY + MUTIANYU_GREAT_WALL + SUMMER_PALACE + TEMPLE_OF_HEAVEN + 798_ART_ZONE', 'This gives a balanced introduction to imperial palaces, Great Wall landscapes, royal gardens, historic alleys, and contemporary art. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:2', 'beijing', 'prefer_CENTRAL_IMPERIAL_CORE + GREAT_WALL_AND_GUBEI_WATER_TOWN + DAY_TRIP_TO_TIANJIN_OR_XI_AN AND: use_SUBWAY_AND_HIGH_SPEED_RAIL_OR_PRIVATE_CAR', 'Palaces, suburban water towns, alpine wall ridges, and high-speed rail connections offer distinct regional insights. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:3', 'beijing', 'prioritize_COURTYARD_SIHEYUAN_HOTELS + AMAN_SUMMER_PALACE + SIMATAI_GREAT_WALL_NIGHT_VIEW AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + ROOFTOP_DINING + COURTYARD_SPA + TEA_CEREMONY + COUPLE_EXPERIENCES', 'Beijing''s romantic routes mix luxury courtyard stays, private Great Wall sunset picnics, lakeside cocktails, and fine dining. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:4', 'beijing', 'prioritize_MUTIANYU_GREAT_WALL_TOBOGGAN + SUMMER_PALACE_DRAGON_BOATS + BEIJING_ZOO_PANDAS AND: include_UNIVERSAL_STUDIOS_BEIJING + SHICHAHAI_PEDAL_BOATS + DUMPLING_MAKING_WORKSHOP AND: reduce_MUSEUM_DENSITY + LONG_CONTINUOUS_TRANSFERS', 'Beijing has exceptional family sights, including toboggan runs, giant pandas, lake pedal boats, and interactive food workshops. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:5', 'beijing', 'prefer_AMAN_SUMMER_PALACE + ROSEWOOD_BEIJING + PENINSULA_BEIJING AND: increase_PRIVATE_GUIDES + AFTER_HOURS_ACCESS + FINE_DINING + PRIVATE_TRANSFERS + HELICOPTER_TOURS + SPA', 'Beijing high-end travel relies on private after-hours palace tours, masterchef duck carving, luxury MPV transfers, and heritage resort spas. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:6', 'beijing', 'prefer_BEIJING_SUBWAY + PUBLIC_EXPRESS_BUSES + WALKING + BUDGET_HUTONGS AND: book_FREE_MONUMENT_TICKETS_EARLY AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_PARKS + HUTONG_WALKS + PUBLIC_GALLERIES', 'Beijing can be accessed affordably using cheap subway fares, budget dumpling houses, free public parks, and advance online tickets. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:7', 'beijing', 'prioritize_FORBIDDEN_CITY + TEMPLE_OF_HEAVEN + LAMA_TEMPLE + CONFUCIUS_ACADEMY AND: include_NATIONAL_MUSEUM + PEKING_OPERA + HUTONG_COURTYARD_ARCHITECTURE', 'These sites showcase Beijing''s concentrated dynastic history, imperial ritual architecture, and traditional theater arts. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:8', 'beijing', 'prefer_798_ART_ZONE + NATIONAL_CENTRE_FOR_PERFORMING_ARTS + CBD_SKYSCRAPERS + FORBIDDEN_CITY AND: include_CONTEMPORARY_GALLERIES + IMPERIAL_TIMBER_DESIGN + MODERN_SKYLINES', 'This route contrasts ancient timber joinery with cutting-edge contemporary art and modern international architecture. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:9', 'beijing', 'prefer_PEKING_DUCK_DINING + COPPER_POT_HOT_POT + HUTONG_SNACK_TRAILS + IMPERIAL_COURT_CUISINE AND: include_DAJIAOZI_DUMPLING_HOUSES + ZHAJIANGMIAN_NOODLES + CRAFT_MICROBREWERIES', 'Beijing dining spans crisp roast duck, alleyway noodle houses, imperial pastry art, and modern craft breweries. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:10', 'beijing', 'prioritize_SUMMER_PALACE + BEIJING_BOTANICAL_GARDEN + WILD_GREAT_WALL_CORRIDORS AND: do_not_treat_MANICURED_IMPERIAL_GARDENS_AND_SUBURBAN_MOUNTAIN_RIDGES_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Imperial parks offer manicured lakes and pavilions, while Huairou and Miyun feature rugged alpine ridges. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:11', 'beijing', 'prioritize_PANJIAYUAN_FLEA_MARKET + LIULICHANG_ANTIQUES + WANGFUJING_AND_SKP AND: include_TEAS_MALIANDAO + SILK_MARKET + LOCAL_HANDICRAFTS', 'Panjiayuan offers antiques and crafts, Maliandao concentrates wholesale tea, and SKP/Wangfujing serve luxury fashion. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:12', 'beijing', 'choose_COURTYARD_TCM_SPA + LUXURY_HOTEL_WELLNESS + THERMAL_HOT_SPRINGS_XIAOTANGSHAN AND: do_not_treat_TRADITIONAL_TCM_MASSAGE_AND_MODERN_HOTEL_SPAS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Beijing wellness ranges from imperial herbal foot baths and TCM reflexology to suburban hot spring resorts. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:13', 'beijing', 'prioritize_JINGSHAN_PARK_OVERLOOK + FORBIDDEN_CITY_MOAT + MUTIANYU_GREAT_WALL + 798_ART_ZONE AND: prioritize_GOLDEN_HOUR + BLUE_HOUR + CLEAR_AIR_DAYS', 'These sites produce stunning visual contrasts between golden palace roofs, mountain wall ridges, and modern art installations. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:14', 'beijing', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_ONE_OR_TWO_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Urban traffic, massive venue walking distances, and airport/station transit consume valuable sight hours. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:15', 'beijing', 'prefer_PRIVATE_TRANSFER_OR_DIRECT_EXPRESS_BUS_OVER_MULTIPLE_SUBWAY_TRANSFERS', 'Direct transfers eliminate transit confusion and save energy for climbing Great Wall stairs. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:16', 'beijing', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_HOTELS + SUBWAY_WITH_ELEVATORS + PRIVATE_CAR + CABLE_CAR_GREAT_WALL AND: reduce_EXCESSIVE_STEPS + HIGH_DOOR_THRESHOLDS + EXTREME_SUMMER_HEAT_WALKS', 'High ancient thresholds and long walking paths cause fatigue; cable cars, elevators, and private cars ease travel. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:17', 'beijing', 'prioritize_EARLY_MORNING_PALACE_VISITS + AIR_CONDITIONED_MUSEUMS + EVENING_LAKESIDE_WALKS AND: reduce_MIDDAY_UNSHADED_PLAZA_EXPOSURE', 'Beijing summer temps exceed 35°C (95°F); early starts and museum breaks maintain comfort. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:18', 'beijing', 'increase_NATIONAL_MUSEUM + LAMA_TEMPLE + ACROBATICS_SHOW + MALL_DINING AND: reduce_GREAT_WALL_VISIBILITY_DEPENDENT_TRIPS + OUTDOOR_PARKS', 'Indoor museums, theater shows, covered markets, and tea houses remain excellent regardless of outdoor air or weather. ---'),
  ('beijing:rule:19', 'beijing', 'prioritize_FORBIDDEN_CITY + MUTIANYU_GREAT_WALL + TEMPLE_OF_HEAVEN AND: add_ONE_OF_SUMMER_PALACE_LAMA_TEMPLE_OR_798_ART_ZONE AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_PEKING_DUCK_OR_TEA_CEREMONY_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a comprehensive introduction to Beijing''s premier heritage sights alongside authentic local culture. ---'),
