  ('santorini:rule:4', 'santorini', 'Canaves Oia + Katikies + Andronis + Mystique + Vedema + 5★ + boutique + infinity pools + private pools + Caldera view + Oia luxury + luxury #1 Greece + best luxury Greece #1 + Oia blue domes + Caldera + Oia sunset #1 world + Fira + Imerovigli + Red Beach + Black Beach + White Beach + Akrotiri + wine + sunset cruise + best photography world #1 + Oia blue domes + Caldera + Oia sunset #1 world + best photography world #1 + best sunset world #1 + must + 2-3N + private car + guide + private pool + infinity pool + photography ---', NULL),
  ('venice:rule:0', 'venice', 'prioritize_SAN_MARCO_AND_DOGES_PALACE + GRAND_CANAL_AND_RIALTO + DORSODURO_AND_CANNAREGIO AND: include_ONE_VENETIAN_CICCHETTI_OR_EVENING_CANAL_EXPERIENCE', 'Very short stays gain more value from properly experiencing Venice''s monumental centre, Grand Canal architecture, major art heritage and one authentic neighborhood atmosphere than losing several hours to rushed multi-island hopping. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:1', 'venice', 'prioritize_SAN_MARCO + RIALTO_SAN_POLO + DORSODURO + CANNAREGIO AND: add_ONE_OF_MURANO_OR_BURANO_TORCELLO', 'This structure provides a balanced introduction to monumental Venice, Grand Canal commerce, Venetian art, neighborhood life, food culture and the wider lagoon. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:2', 'venice', 'prefer_SAN_MARCO + RIALTO_SAN_POLO + DORSODURO + CANNAREGIO + CASTELLO + GIUDECCA_SAN_GIORGIO AND: add_MURANO + BURANO_TORCELLO_OR_LIDO', 'Longer stays should move beyond the crowded San Marco–Rialto axis and reveal Venice as a network of distinct sestieri and lagoon islands rather than a compact collection of postcard landmarks. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:3', 'venice', 'prioritize_DORSODURO_BOUTIQUE_STAY_OR_GRAND_CANAL_PALAZZO + PRIVATE_WATER_TAXI_ARRIVAL + GIUDECCA_OR_SAN_GIORGIO_SUNSET AND: increase_PRIVATE_GONDOLA + ROMANTIC_DINING + QUIET_CANAL_WALKS + LUXURY_HOTEL_SPA + PRIVATE_ART_OR_MURANO_EXPERIENCES + FREE_TIME', 'Venice''s strongest honeymoon experiences combine water-based arrivals, historic palace accommodation, quiet canals, lagoon sunsets, intimate dining and slow evening exploration after daytime visitor pressure falls. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:4', 'venice', 'prioritize_GRAND_CANAL_VAPORETTO + MURANO_GLASS + BURANO_COLOR + OPEN_CAMPI_AND_SHORT_WALKS AND: include_NATURAL_HISTORY_OR_FAMILY_SUITABLE_MUSEUMS + GELATO_BREAKS + LIDO_BEACH_TIME_IF_SUMMER AND: reduce_LONG_BRIDGE_HEAVY_WALKS + MULTIPLE_ISLANDS_IN_ONE_SHORT_DAY + PEAK_SAN_MARCO_CONGESTION', 'Venice works best for families when water transport, colorful islands, artisan traditions and frequent rest periods break up long pedestrian sightseeing days. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:5', 'venice', 'prefer_GRAND_CANAL_PALACE_HOTELS + SAN_MARCO_LUXURY_PROPERTIES + GIUDECCA_WATERFRONT_RESORTS AND: increase_PRIVATE_WATER_TAXIS + PRIVATE_ART_HISTORIAN_GUIDES + EXCLUSIVE_MURANO_ATELIER_VISITS + FINE_DINING + SPA + PRIVATE_LAGOON_CRUISING', 'Venice high-end travel is distinguished by historic palace accommodation, direct water arrivals, private cultural access, artisan craftsmanship and bespoke lagoon experiences. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:6', 'venice', 'prefer_CANNAREGIO_SANTA_CROCE_OR_MESTRE_ACCOMMODATION + WALKING + ACTV_TIME_LIMITED_PASSES_WHEN_JUSTIFIED AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_CAMPI + CHURCH_EXTERIORS + WATERFRONT_WALKS + NEIGHBORHOOD_PHOTOGRAPHY AND: use_BACARI + CICCHETTI + BAKERIES + TRAMEZZINI + SIMPLE_TRATTORIAS', 'Venice is expensive but remains manageable when accommodation location, walking, public water transport and neighborhood food are carefully coordinated. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:7', 'venice', 'prioritize_DOGES_PALACE + ST_MARKS_BASILICA + FRARI + SCUOLA_GRANDE_DI_SAN_ROCCO AND: include_CANNAREGIO_JEWISH_GHETTO + CASTELLO_ARSENALE + TORCELLO + MURANO_GLASS_HERITAGE', 'These areas connect Venice''s Byzantine, Gothic, Renaissance, maritime-republic, Jewish, religious and artisan history across both the historic centre and lagoon. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:8', 'venice', 'prioritize_GALLERIE_DELL_ACCADEMIA + DOGES_PALACE + ST_MARKS_BASILICA + PEGGY_GUGGENHEIM_COLLECTION AND: include_FRARI + SCUOLA_GRANDE_DI_SAN_ROCCO + PUNTA_DELLA_DOGANA + GRAND_CANAL_PALAZZI + SAN_GIORGIO_MAGGIORE', 'Venice provides an exceptional continuum from Byzantine mosaics and Venetian Gothic palaces through Renaissance painting to modern and contemporary art. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:9', 'venice', 'prefer_CANNAREGIO + RIALTO_SAN_POLO + CASTELLO + DORSODURO AND: include_CICCHETTI + BACARI + BACCALA_MANTECATO + SARDE_IN_SAOR + BIGOLI_IN_SALSA + LAGOON_SEAFOOD + VENETO_WINES', 'Venetian gastronomy is deeply connected to lagoon seafood, maritime trade, small bàcari, Rialto market culture and Veneto wine rather than generic Italian dining alone. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:10', 'venice', 'prioritize_LIDO_DI_VENEZIA + TORCELLO + SANT_ERASMO + PELLESTRINA + OUTER_LAGOON AND: do_not_treat_SAN_MARCO_CANALS_AND_NATURAL_LAGOON_ECOSYSTEMS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Historic Venice provides an intensely built urban-water environment, while the outer lagoon introduces beaches, marshes, agricultural islands, open water and slower ecological landscapes. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:11', 'venice', 'prioritize_MURANO + BURANO + SAN_MARCO + DORSODURO_AND_CASTELLO_ARTISAN_AREAS AND: include_GLASS + LACE + MASKS + PAPER + JEWELRY + ART + ITALIAN_FASHION', 'Venice shopping is strongest when authentic local craft traditions are separated from generic souvenir retail, especially for Murano glass and Burano lace. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:12', 'venice', 'choose_LUXURY_HOTEL_SPAS + GIUDECCA_RESORTS + LIDO_WELLNESS_AND_BEACH_TIME AND: combine_WITH_SLOW_DORSODURO_WALKS + LAGOON_VIEWS + FINE_DINING + FREE_TIME', 'Venice is not primarily a thermal-wellness destination, but luxury hotels, Giudecca resorts and Lido properties can support high-end spa and relaxation itineraries. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:13', 'venice', 'prioritize_SAN_MARCO_EARLY_MORNING + RIALTO_SUNRISE + ACCADEMIA_BRIDGE_BLUE_HOUR + SAN_GIORGIO_MAGGIORE_SUNSET AND: include_BURANO_COLOR + CANNAREGIO_CANALS + GIUDECCA_SKYLINE + GRAND_CANAL_PALAZZI AND: prioritize_EARLY_MORNING + GOLDEN_HOUR + BLUE_HOUR', 'Lower-angle light, reflections and reduced pedestrian congestion dramatically improve Venice photography compared with peak midday conditions. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:14', 'venice', 'prefer_ONE_HISTORIC_CENTER_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES_BETWEEN_VENICE_MESTRE_LIDO_AND_ISLANDS', 'Hotel relocation in Venice can involve bridges, water transport and luggage handling, consuming disproportionate amounts of limited sightseeing time. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:15', 'venice', 'choose_BETWEEN_AIRPORT_BUS_TO_PIAZZALE_ROMA + ALILAGUNA_WATER_SERVICE + PRIVATE_WATER_TAXI ACCORDING_TO: HOTEL_LOCATION + BUDGET + LUGGAGE + MOBILITY + DESIRED_ARRIVAL_EXPERIENCE', 'Marco Polo Airport officially connects to Venice through ACTV/ATVO road services toward Piazzale Roma as well as Alilaguna and private water transport, so no single transfer method is optimal for every hotel. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:16', 'venice', 'prefer_ACTV_VAPORETTI_OR_WELL_PLANNED_PRIVATE_LAGOON_BOAT AND: allocate_SUBSTANTIAL_HALF_TO_FULL_DAY', 'Water transport, transfers and waiting time mean the northern lagoon islands should not be treated as instantaneous extensions of central Venice. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:17', 'venice', 'prefer_HOTELS_CLOSE_TO_VAPORETTO_STOPS + VERIFIED_LOW_BRIDGE_ROUTES + PRIVATE_WATER_TRANSFER_WHEN_USEFUL AND: reduce_REPEATED_BRIDGE_CROSSINGS + LONG_CONTINUOUS_WALKS + PEAK_SUMMER_HEAT + HEAVY_LUGGAGE_HANDLING', 'Venice can work well for seniors when water transport and carefully chosen accommodation reduce physical strain, but historic stepped bridges remain a significant mobility challenge. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:18', 'venice', 'prioritize_EARLY_SAN_MARCO + AIR_CONDITIONED_MUSEUMS + HOTEL_OR_LONG_LUNCH_BREAKS + EVENING_CANAL_WALKS AND: reduce_MIDDAY_BRIDGE_HEAVY_WALKING + LONG_UNSHADED_QUEUES', 'Venice''s dense pedestrian environment, humidity, stone surfaces and limited shade can make prolonged summer midday sightseeing physically demanding. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:19', 'venice', 'increase_DOGES_PALACE + GALLERIE_DELL_ACCADEMIA + PEGGY_GUGGENHEIM + CIVIC_MUSEUMS + CHURCH_INTERIORS AND: reduce_LONG_OUTDOOR_WALKS + LAGOON_ISLAND_HOPPING + WEATHER_DEPENDENT_GONDOLA_PLANS AND: check_OFFICIAL_LOCAL_CONDITIONS_AND_TRANSPORT_UPDATES', 'Heavy rain and high-water conditions can affect pedestrian routes, squares, lagoon activity and water transport planning, so flexible indoor alternatives should be built into the itinerary. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:20', 'venice', 'prioritize_SAN_MARCO_AND_DOGES_PALACE + GRAND_CANAL_AND_RIALTO + DORSODURO AND: add_ONE_OF_CANNAREGIO_CASTELLO_OR_MURANO AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_CICCHETTI_BACARI_OR_GONDOLA_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a balanced first introduction to monumental Venice, Grand Canal architecture, major art, local neighborhood atmosphere and Venetian food or water culture. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:21', 'venice', 'prioritize_MURANO + BURANO AND: add_TORCELLO_WHEN_TIME_ALLOWS AND: use_LIDO_SANT_ERASMO_OR_PELLESTRINA_FOR_REPEAT_VISITS_OR_SPECIAL_INTERESTS', 'Murano and Burano provide the strongest first-time artisan and visual contrasts, Torcello adds early Venetian history, while the remaining lagoon islands are particularly rewarding for slow travel and repeat visitors. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:22', 'venice', 'prioritize_CASTELLO_ARSENALE + GIARDINI + DORSODURO_CONTEMPORARY_COLLECTIONS AND: include_PEGGY_GUGGENHEIM + PUNTA_DELLA_DOGANA + PALAZZO_GRASSI_AS_RELEVANT', 'Castello contains the principal Biennale-oriented geography, while Dorsoduro and Grand Canal institutions extend Venice''s modern and contemporary art offering beyond the exhibition grounds. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:23', 'venice', 'prioritize_DORSODURO_ZATTERE + CANNAREGIO_CANALS + GIUDECCA + SAN_GIORGIO_VIEWS AND: schedule_SAN_MARCO_AFTER_DAY_TRIP_CROWDS_DECLINE', 'Venice''s romantic quality increases dramatically away from concentrated daytime visitor corridors and after the busiest excursion traffic has departed. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:24', 'venice', 'prioritize_CANNAREGIO + CASTELLO + SANTA_CROCE + SAN_POLO_SIDE_STREETS AND: reduce_TOTAL_TIME_SPENT_ONLY_ON_SAN_MARCO_RIALTO_CORRIDOR', 'Official Venice tourism identifies Cannaregio for secluded lagoon-facing corners and bacari, Castello for everyday Venetian atmosphere, and Santa Croce for quieter historic corners, making these districts critical for understanding Venice beyond its principal monuments. ---'),
  ('venice:rule:25', 'venice', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_QUIET_CAMPI + BACARI + GIUDECCA + ZATTERE + LAGOON_RIDES + SPA + SHOPPING + FREE_TIME', 'Venice is best experienced when formal monuments and museums are balanced with slower canal-side walking, lagoon views, neighborhood food and unstructured exploration. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:0', 'rome', 'prioritize_COLOSSEUM_FORUM_PALATINE + VATICAN_CITY + PANTHEON_NAVONA_TREVI AND: include_ONE_TRASTEVERE_EVENING', 'Very short stays gain more value from Rome''s essential ancient, Vatican, Baroque, and neighborhood experiences than from adding distant day trips. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:1', 'rome', 'prioritize_ANCIENT_ROME + VATICAN_CITY + HISTORIC_CENTER + TRASTEVERE AND: add_VILLA_BORGHESE_OR_CAPITOLINE_GHETTO', 'This creates a balanced first introduction to Roman archaeology, Renaissance art, Baroque landmarks, neighborhood culture, food, and relaxation. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:2', 'rome', 'prefer_CENTRAL_ROME_CORE + VILLA_BORGHESE + APPIAN_WAY + TESTACCIO_AVENTINE AND: add_ONE_OF_OSTIA_ANTICA_OR_TIVOLI', 'Longer stays allow Rome''s outer archaeological landscapes and local districts to complement the essential historic centre without rushing. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:3', 'rome', 'prioritize_PIAZZA_NAVONA_OR_SPANISH_STEPS_STAY + TRASTEVERE_EVENINGS + GIANICOLO_OR_AVENTINE_SUNSET AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_HOTELS + ROOFTOP_DINING + PRIVATE_GUIDES + SPA + FREE_TIME', 'Rome''s romance comes from historic palazzi, illuminated piazzas, rooftop views, intimate trattorias, quiet lanes, and sunset viewpoints. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:4', 'rome', 'prioritize_COLOSSEUM_FAMILY_TOUR + VILLA_BORGHESE + PIAZZA_NAVONA_AND_FOUNTAINS AND: include_EXPLORA_CHILDRENS_MUSEUM + GELATO_BREAKS + SHORT_METRO_OR_TAXI_TRANSFERS AND: reduce_LONG_ARCHAEOLOGICAL_WALKS + MIDDAY_SUMMER_EXPOSURE', 'Rome works well for families when history is balanced with parks, interactive experiences, shorter walking blocks, and regular rest periods. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:5', 'rome', 'prefer_SPANISH_STEPS + VIA_VENETO + PIAZZA_NAVONA_LUXURY_HOTELS AND: increase_PRIVATE_GUIDES + CHAUFFEURED_TRANSFERS + PREMIUM_VATICAN_TOURS + FINE_DINING + SPA', 'Rome''s luxury market combines historic five-star hotels, private cultural touring, designer shopping, exceptional gastronomy, and personalized transport. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:6', 'rome', 'prefer_METRO_CONNECTED_STAY + ATAC_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + SELF_GUIDED_WALKS AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_CHURCHES + PIAZZAS + FOUNTAINS + PARKS_AND_VIEWPOINTS AND: use_PIZZA_AL_TAGLIO + BAKERIES + LOCAL_TRATTORIAS', 'Rome offers substantial low-cost sightseeing through historic streets, churches, piazzas, parks, fountains, and affordable neighborhood food. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:7', 'rome', 'prioritize_COLOSSEUM_ROMAN_FORUM + VATICAN_MUSEUMS + PANTHEON + CAPITOLINE_MUSEUMS AND: include_MAJOR_BASILICAS + JEWISH_GHETTO + APPIAN_WAY', 'Rome layers Ancient Roman, early Christian, Renaissance, Baroque, Jewish-Roman, and modern Italian heritage within one destination. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:8', 'rome', 'prioritize_VATICAN_MUSEUMS + GALLERIA_BORGHESE + PANTHEON + ST_PETERS_BASILICA AND: include_BAROQUE_CHURCHES + PIAZZA_NAVONA + CAPITOLINE_HILL', 'Rome offers an exceptional progression from ancient engineering through Renaissance masterpieces and Baroque urban design. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:9', 'rome', 'prefer_TESTACCIO + TRASTEVERE + JEWISH_GHETTO + CAMPO_DE_FIORI AND: include_CARBONARA + CACIO_E_PEPE + AMATRICIANA + SUPPLI + CARCIOFI', 'Rome''s food identity is strongly regional, with traditional pasta dishes, fried street food, Jewish-Roman specialties, markets, and neighborhood trattorias. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:10', 'rome', 'prioritize_VILLA_BORGHESE + APPIAN_WAY + AQUEDUCT_PARK + VILLA_DORIA_PAMPHILJ AND: do_not_treat_ROME_AS_PRIMARY_WILDERNESS_DESTINATION', 'Rome provides excellent parks, archaeological landscapes, gardens, and cycling routes but remains fundamentally an urban cultural destination. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:11', 'rome', 'prioritize_VIA_CONDOTTI + VIA_DEL_CORSO + VIA_DEL_BABUINO + MONTI AND: include_LUXURY_FASHION + ITALIAN_LEATHER + ARTISAN_BOUTIQUES + GOURMET_GIFTS', 'The Trident concentrates international and Italian luxury fashion, while Monti adds independent boutiques, vintage stores, and artisan shopping. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:12', 'rome', 'choose_LUXURY_HOTEL_SPAS + URBAN_WELLNESS_CENTERS + THERMAL_DAY_EXCURSIONS AND: combine_WITH_VILLA_BORGHESE + SLOW_DINING + FREE_TIME', 'Rome''s wellness offer works best as a complement to cultural sightseeing rather than as the city''s primary travel purpose. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:13', 'rome', 'prioritize_COLOSSEUM_GOLDEN_HOUR + TREVI_EARLY_MORNING + PINCIAN_TERRACE_SUNSET + GIANICOLO_VIEWPOINT AND: include_PANTHEON_NAVONA + TRASTEVERE_STREETS + ST_PETERS_DOME_VIEWS', 'Rome offers exceptional contrasts between ancient ruins, Baroque fountains, church domes, ochre façades, cobbled streets, and panoramic skylines. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:14', 'rome', 'prefer_ONE_CENTRAL_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Most major Rome attractions are better explored from one well-located base using walking, metro, buses, and occasional taxis. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:15', 'rome', 'prefer_DIRECT_BUS_TAXI_EBIKE_OR_PRIVATE_TRANSFER AND: avoid_COMPLEX_MULTI_TRANSFER_ROUTING', 'The Appian Way lies outside the densest historic core, and direct access preserves more time for walking, cycling, catacombs, and archaeological exploration. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:16', 'rome', 'prefer_URBAN_RAIL_CONNECTION AND: allocate_HALF_TO_FULL_DAY', 'Ostia Antica is extensive enough to deserve a dedicated excursion rather than being combined with multiple central Rome attractions. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:17', 'rome', 'prefer_CENTRAL_ACCESSIBLE_HOTELS + TAXI_OR_PRIVATE_TRANSFER + SHORT_WALKING_CIRCUITS AND: reduce_PALATINE_HILL_CLIMBS + LONG_COBBLESTONE_ROUTES + APPIAN_WAY_WALKING', 'Ancient paving, hills, archaeological terrain, heat, and prolonged walking can significantly increase fatigue. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:18', 'rome', 'prioritize_EARLY_COLOSSEUM_VISITS + AIR_CONDITIONED_MUSEUMS + HOTEL_BREAKS + EVENING_PIAZZA_WALKS AND: reduce_MIDDAY_ROMAN_FORUM + PALATINE + APPIAN_WAY_EXPOSURE', 'Rome''s exposed archaeological areas provide limited shade, making early starts and indoor midday breaks particularly important during hot periods. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:19', 'rome', 'increase_VATICAN_MUSEUMS + CAPITOLINE_MUSEUMS + CHURCH_INTERIORS + SHOPPING AND: reduce_APPIAN_WAY + VILLA_BORGHESE + LONG_OPEN_AIR_ARCHAEOLOGICAL_WALKS', 'Rome''s museums, basilicas, galleries, cafés, and indoor heritage attractions provide strong alternatives when outdoor sightseeing becomes uncomfortable. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:20', 'rome', 'prioritize_COLOSSEUM_ROMAN_FORUM + VATICAN_CITY + PANTHEON_NAVONA + TREVI_SPANISH_STEPS AND: add_ONE_OF_TRASTEVERE_VILLA_BORGHESE_OR_CAPITOLINE_GHETTO AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_ROMAN_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure gives first-time visitors the clearest introduction to Ancient Rome, Vatican art, Baroque Rome, neighborhood atmosphere, and traditional cuisine. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:21', 'rome', 'prioritize_ST_PETERS_BASILICA + ST_JOHN_LATERAN + SANTA_MARIA_MAGGIORE + ST_PAUL_OUTSIDE_THE_WALLS AND: include_VATICAN_MUSEUMS + EARLY_CHRISTIAN_SITES', 'Rome is one of the world''s foremost Christian pilgrimage destinations, centered on the four major papal basilicas and Vatican City. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:22', 'rome', 'prioritize_COLOSSEUM_FORUM_PALATINE + CAPITOLINE_AREA + APPIAN_WAY + OSTIA_ANTICA AND: include_TRAJANS_MARKETS + THEATRE_OF_MARCELLUS', 'This combination moves beyond individual monuments and reveals imperial civic life, infrastructure, burial roads, commercial districts, and ancient urban planning. ---'),
  ('rome:rule:23', 'rome', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_VILLA_BORGHESE + PIAZZA_CAFES + APERITIVO + SPA + SHOPPING + FREE_TIME', 'Rome is best experienced with deliberate breaks between major monuments rather than continuous checklist sightseeing. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:0', 'denmark', 'prioritize_ONE_MAJOR_CITY + ONE_NEARBY_EXCURSION', 'Very short stays gain significantly more value from properly experiencing one major Danish hub (like Copenhagen) and an adjacent landmark (like Roskilde or North Zealand Castles) than losing precious hours to long inter-island transfers. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:1', 'denmark', 'prioritize_COPENHAGEN + ODENSE + AARHUS_OR_NORTH_ZEALAND', 'This gives a perfectly balanced introduction to royal Renaissance history, fairytale Viking heritage, world-class modern art, scenic bridge crossings, and contemporary Scandinavian design and gastronomy. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:2', 'denmark', 'prefer_GOLDEN_TRIANGLE_COPENHAGEN_ODENSE_AARHUS + SKAGEN_OR_BORNHOLM AND: use_HIGH_SPEED_DSB_INTERCITY_RAIL_FOR_CITIES_AND_REGIONAL_TRANSFERS_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Copenhagen, Odense, Aarhus, and the dramatic coastal extremities of Skagen or Bornholm offer four completely distinct, world-class Danish travel experiences connected seamlessly by rail, bridge, and ferry. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:3', 'denmark', 'prefer_COPENHAGEN + NORTH_ZEALAND_SEASIDE_SPA_OR_BORNHOLM_SUNSHINE_ISLAND AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + SCENIC_DINING + HARBOR_SAUNA_EXPERIENCES + FREE_TIME + COUPLE_EXPERIENCES', 'Denmark''s strongest romantic routes mix canal-front boutique hotels, Michelin New Nordic dining, Baltic granite coastal retreats, historic inn stays (Kro), and private electric boat cruises. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:4', 'denmark', 'prioritize_COPENHAGEN + BILLUND + ODENSE_AND_LEGOLAND_OR_EXPERIMENTARIUM AND: include_LEGOLAND_BILLUND + LEGO_HOUSE + TIVOLI_GARDENS + HANS_CHRISTIAN_ANDERSEN_HOUSE + VIKING_SHIP_MUSEUM AND: reduce_HEAVY_MUSEUM_DENSITY + LONG_CONTINUOUS_TRANSFERS', 'Denmark is the ultimate family destination, boasting world-class theme parks (LEGOLAND, Tivoli), the interactive LEGO House, fairytale interactive museums, and hands-on Viking boat building. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:5', 'denmark', 'prefer_COPENHAGEN + NORTH_ZEALAND_RIVIERA + SKAGEN_LUXURY_BEACH_HOTEL AND: increase_5_STAR_FLAGSHIP_HOTELS + PRIVATE_GUIDES + FINE_DINING + PRIVATE_TRANSFERS + PRIVATE_CANAL_CHARTERS + EXCLUSIVE_PALACE_ACCESS', 'Danish high-end travel relies on historic luxury flagships (Hotel d''Angleterre, Villa Copenhagen), Michelin-starred New Nordic gastronomy (Alchemist, Geranium), private electric harbor boat charters, and coastal manor estates. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:6', 'denmark', 'prefer_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + REJSEKORT_OR_COPENHAGEN_CARD + WALKING + BAKERY_SMØRREBRØD_AND_STREET_FOOD AND: book_DSB_ORANGE_TRAIN_TICKETS_IN_ADVANCE AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_MUSEUM_DAYS + PARKS + HARBOR_BATHS + HISTORIC_CANALS', 'Denmark offers clear savings for budget travelers who utilize advance DSB Orange rail fares, street food halls (Reffen, Broens Gadekøkken), public harbor bath swimming, and pedestrian-friendly city paths. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:7', 'denmark', 'prioritize_COPENHAGEN + ROSKILDE + ODENSE + KRONBORG_CASTLE + RIBE AND: include_ROSENBORG_CASTLE + VIKING_SHIP_MUSEUM + HANS_CHRISTIAN_ANDERSEN_HOUSE + JELLING_RUNIC_STONES + RIBE_MEDIEVAL_TOWN', 'These destinations feature Denmark''s dense concentration of UNESCO World Heritage sites, Viking maritime heritage, royal Renaissance palaces, and fairytale literary history. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:8', 'denmark', 'prefer_COPENHAGEN + AARHUS + HUMLEBÆK_LOUISIANA + DESIGN_MUSEUM_DENMARK AND: include_LOUISIANA_MUSEUM_OF_MODERN_ART + AROS_RAINBOW_PANORAMA + MOESGAARD_MUSEUM + COPENHAGEN_DOCKLANDS_ARCHITECTURE', 'This route contrasts iconic mid-century Scandinavian furniture design with cutting-edge harbor architecture, ancient archaeological masterworks, and world-renowned modern art museums. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:9', 'denmark', 'prefer_COPENHAGEN + AARHUS + BORNHOLM + LIMFJORD AND: include_HISTORIC_SMØRREBRØD_LUNCH + NEW_NORDIC_FINE_DINING + TORVEHALLERNE_FOOD_HALL + BORNHOLM_SMOKEHOUSES + OYSTER_SAFARIS', 'Danish food culture spans traditional open-faced rye bread sandwiches (smørrebrød), world-leading Michelin-starred foraging, coastal fish smokehouses, Limfjord oyster safaris, and pioneer craft breweries. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:10', 'denmark', 'prefer_BORNHOLM_ISLAND + SKAGEN + SOUTH_FUNEN_ARCHIPELAGO + DANISH_RIVIERA AND: match_REGION_TO_SEASON + WATERSPORT_STYLE + RELAXATION_REQUIREMENT', 'Bornholm provides dramatic granite sea cliffs, Skagen offers dual colliding seas at Grenen, the South Funen Archipelago provides tranquil island hopping, and North Zealand delivers sandy beach retreats. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:11', 'denmark', 'prioritize_WADDEN_SEA_NATIONAL_PARK + MØNS_KLINT + RÅBJERG_MILE + SILKEBORG_LAKES AND: do_not_treat_CHALK_CLIFFS_AND_TIDAL_WADDEN_FLATS_AS_INTERCHANGEABLE', 'Wadden Sea focuses on UNESCO tidal oyster safaris and migratory starling murmurations ("Black Sun"), Møns Klint centers on dramatic turquoise chalk cliffs, Råbjerg Mile features shifting sand dunes, and Silkeborg provides lake canoeing. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:12', 'denmark', 'prefer_COPENHAGEN + AARHUS + AALBORG AND: match_AREA_TO_PARTY_STYLE + SEASON', 'Copenhagen''s Meatpacking District (Kødbyen) and Vesterbro offer vibrant warehouse clubs, craft brewpubs, and natural wine bars; Aarhus features lively canal side terraces; and Aalborg hosts the famous Jomfru Ane Gade bar street. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:13', 'denmark', 'prioritize_COPENHAGEN + BILLUND + BORNHOLM + ODENSE AND: include_DANISH_DESIGN_STORES + ILLUM + ROYAL_COPENHAGEN + LEGO_STORE_EXCLUSIVES + BORNHOLM_CERAMICS', 'Denmark concentrates flagship Scandinavian interior design and high fashion along Strøget and Illum in Copenhagen, exclusive LEGO sets in Billund, and famous hand-crafted ceramics on Bornholm. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:14', 'denmark', 'prefer_COPENHAGEN + AARHUS + ODENSE + BORNHOLM AND: include_MIKKELLER_BREWPUBS + TO_ØL_CITY_BREWERY + AKVAVIT_PAIRING_LUNCHES + CRAFT_GIN_DISTILLERIES AND: use_PUBLIC_TRANSIT_METRO_OR_WALKING_WHEN_TASTING', 'Copenhagen is a global epicenter for the craft beer movement led by Mikkeller and To Øl, complemented by traditional caraway Akvavit pairings and artisanal island spirit distilleries. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:15', 'denmark', 'prefer_BORNHOLM_COASTAL_PATH + MØNS_KLINT_TRAILS + GENDARMSTIEN_COASTAL_TRAIL + HÆRVEJEN_JUTLAND AND: match_ROUTE_TO_FITNESS + WIND_EXPOSURE + WEATHER + SEASON', 'Danish hiking ranges from dramatic granite cliff coastal paths on Bornholm and beech forest chalk trails at Møns Klint to historical border walks like Gendarmstien along the German frontier. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:16', 'denmark', 'prefer_KRONBORG_CASTLE + FREDERIKSBORG_CASTLE + ROSENBORG_CASTLE + EGESKOV_CASTLE + CHRISTIANSBORG_PALACE AND: choose_HIGH_DENSITY_CASTLE_REGIONS + DSB_RAIL_OR_RENTAL_CAR_FOR_RURAL_ESTATES', 'North Zealand features Shakespeare''s Hamlet Castle (Kronborg) and the magnificent Frederiksborg Palace, Copenhagen hosts active royal residences and Crown Jewels, while Funen features the Renaissance moat castle Egeskov. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:17', 'denmark', 'prefer_NYHAVN_HARBOR + AROS_RAINBOW_PANORAMA + MØNS_KLINT_TURQUOISE_WATER + FREDERIKSBORG_CASTLE_GARDENS + GRENEN_SKAGEN AND: prioritize_EARLY_MORNING + GOLDEN_HOUR + BLUE_HOUR', 'These sites yield iconic visual contrast between brightly painted 17th-century harbor townhouses, Olafur Eliasson''s chromatic glass walkway, towering chalk cliffs, baroque castle gardens, and colliding ocean tides. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:18', 'denmark', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_TWO_OR_THREE_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Though train transit across Danish bridges is fast and efficient, frequent hotel check-ins and inter-island luggage transfers diminish precious sightseeing time in primary hubs. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:19', 'denmark', 'prefer_DSB_INTERCITY_EXPRESS_RAIL_OVER_RENTAL_CAR_FOR_STANDARD_CITY_TRAVEL', 'Denmark''s high-speed passenger rail network connects major island cities in 1 to 3 hours via the Great Belt Bridge, bypassing highway congestion, bridge toll fees, and urban parking limitations. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:20', 'denmark', 'prioritize_CENTRAL_HOTELS + HIGH_SPEED_RAIL_1ST_CLASS + STEP_FREE_METRO_AND_BUSES + MODERATE_DAILY_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_STEEP_COASTAL_STAIRWAYS + HEAVY_COBBLESTONE_WALKS + RAPID_MULTI_ISLAND_MOVEMENT', 'Historic medieval cobblestones and steep cliff stairways (such as Møns Klint''s 497 steps) cause fatigue; step-free Copenhagen Metro lines, smooth harbor walks, and central accommodation ensure seamless travel. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:21', 'denmark', 'prioritize_EARLY_MORNING_OUTDOOR_SIGHTSEEING + AIR_CONDITIONED_MUSEUMS_MIDDAY + EVENING_HARBOR_SWIMMING_AND_WATERFRONT_DINING AND: reduce_MIDDAY_OUTDOOR_WALKING_ON_EXPOSED_SQUARES', 'Scandinavian peak summer days can reach high temperatures; visiting air-conditioned flagship museums (Nationalmuseet, ARoS) or enjoying harbor baths (Islands Brygge) and seaside terraces offers maximum comfort. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:22', 'denmark', 'increase_MUSEUMS + ROYAL_CASTLES + FOOD_HALLS + GASTRONOMY + INDOOR_THERMAL_SPAS AND: reduce_LONG_OUTDOOR_WALKING_TOURS + WINDY_COASTAL_DUNE_ACTIVITIES', 'Attractions like ARoS Art Museum, Rosenborg Castle Crown Jewels, Torvehallerne Food Hall, Louisiana Museum, and indoor thermal spas remain completely unaffected by rain. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:23', 'denmark', 'prioritize_COPENHAGEN + ODENSE AND: add_ONE_OF_AARHUS_NORTH_ZEALAND_ROSKILDE_OR_SKAGEN AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_DANISH_FOOD_OR_HISTORICAL_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a comprehensive, highly rewarding introduction to Denmark''s essential historic hubs alongside a distinct regional contrast. ---'),
  ('denmark:rule:24', 'denmark', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_SMØRREBRØD_BISTROS_AND_CAFES + HARBOR_BATHS + HYGGE_LOUNGES + BREWPUB_GARDENS + EVENING_CANAL_STROLLS + FREE_TIME ---', NULL),
  ('norway:rule:0', 'norway', 'prioritize_TROMSØ + ONE_NEARBY_FJORD_SAFARI', 'Very short winter stays gain more value from properly experiencing one major Arctic hub (like Tromsø or Alta) and adjacent fjord safaris than losing daylight to long Arctic road transfers. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:1', 'norway', 'prioritize_TROMSØ + ALTA_OR_LYNGEN_ALPS + ONE_GLASS_DOME_OR_ICE_HOTEL_STAY', 'This gives a balanced introduction to vibrant city culture, dramatic mountain fjords, animal safaris, glass-dome stays, Sorrisniva ice architecture, and Aurora hunting. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:2', 'norway', 'prefer_TROMSØ + ALTA_AND_LYNGEN_ALPS + KARASJOK_FINNMARK_SÁMI_HUB AND: use_COASTAL_EXPRESS_SHIP_AND_PRIVATE_TRANSFER_OR_4X4_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Urban coastal Tromsø, dramatic alpine ski/fjord areas, and far-northern Indigenous Sámi plateau wilderness offer three completely distinct Arctic experiences. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:3', 'norway', 'prioritize_TROMSØ_GLASS_DOMES + LYNGEN_LODGE + SORRISNIVA_SUITE AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + SCENIC_DINING + SAUNA_SPA_EXPERIENCES + FREE_TIME + COUPLE_EXPERIENCES', 'Northern Norway''s strongest romantic routes mix glass domes, private floating saunas under the Aurora, snowbound fjord views, high-end Arctic seafood dining, and secluded coastal rorbuer. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:4', 'norway', 'prioritize_TROMSØ + ALTA_OR_SENJA + ANIMAL_SAFARIS_AND_POLARIA AND: include_POLARIA_AQUARIUM + HUSKY_SLEIGH + REINDEER_FARM + FJELLHEISEN_CABLE_CAR + SORRISNIVA_SNOWHOTEL AND: reduce_MUSEUM_DENSITY + LONG_CONTINUOUS_TRANSFERS', 'Northern Norway has exceptional family activities, including seal feeding at Polaria, husky sled driving, reindeer feeding, cable car panoramas, and ice sculpture visits. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:5', 'norway', 'prefer_TROMSØ_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + LYNGEN_ALPS_PRIVATE_LODGE + SORRISNIVA_VIP_SUITE AND: increase_5_STAR_GLASS_DOMES + PRIVATE_GUIDES + FINE_DINING + PRIVATE_4X4_TRANSFERS + CHARTERED_HELICOPTER + SPA', 'Arctic high-end travel relies on private wilderness lodges, exclusive glass suites, private Arctic chefs, chauffeured 4x4 transfers, and private Aurora safaris. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:6', 'norway', 'prefer_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + SVIPPER_AND_SNELANDIA_BUSES + WALKING + SELF_CATERING_RORBUER AND: book_EXPRESS_BOATS_AND_BUSES_EARLY AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_AURORA_SPOTS + SCENIC_FJORD_WALKS + HISTORIC_HARBOR_PROMENADES', 'Northern Norway can be accessed on a budget by using regional public transit buses, booking self-catering fishing cabins, eating daily lunch specials (Dagens lunsj), and exploring free wilderness trails. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:7', 'norway', 'prioritize_TROMSØ + ALTA + KARASJOK + KAUTOKEINO AND: include_SÁMI_PARLIAMENT + ALTA_ROCK_ART_MUSEUM + POLAR_MUSEUM + JUHLS_SILVER_GALLERY + REINDEER_HERDING_FARMS', 'These destinations feature Northern Norway''s concentration of Indigenous Sámi culture, Arctic exploration history, prehistoric UNESCO rock art, and traditional craft galleries. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:8', 'norway', 'prefer_TROMSØ + ALTA + SORRISNIVA + KARASJOK AND: include_ARCTIC_CATHEDRAL + SORRISNIVA_ICE_HOTEL + NORDNORSK_KUNSTMUSEUM + SÁMI_PARLIAMENT_BUILDING', 'This route contrasts iconic modern Northern architecture and seasonal ice structures with Indigenous Sámi timber designs and coastal art galleries. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:9', 'norway', 'prefer_TROMSØ + ALTA + LYNGEN + KIRKENES AND: include_KING_CRAB_FEAST + SKREI_COD_DINING + REINDEER_BIDUS_STEW + CLOUDBERRY_TASTINGS + ARCTIC_FINE_DINING', 'Northern Norwegian food culture spans coastal seafood feasts, freshly caught King Crab, wild reindeer meat, Arctic char, and contemporary fine dining using local ingredients. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:10', 'norway', 'prefer_KIRKENES + VARANGER + NORTH_CAPE_NORDKAPP AND: match_REGION_TO_SEASON + COASTAL_EXPRESS_CRUISE_STYLE + RELAXATION_REQUIREMENT', 'Kirkenes and the Barents coast provide King Crab diving, sea-ice floating, coastal express voyages, and dramatic frozen ocean landscapes. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:11', 'norway', 'prioritize_KVALØYA_WHALE_SAFARI + LYNGEN_ALPS + VARANGER_BIRD_RESERVE + SENJA_ISLAND AND: do_not_treat_ARCTIC_COASTAL_FJORDS_AND_PLATEAU_TUNDRA_AS_INTERCHANGEABLE', 'Kvaløya focuses on humpback whales, sea eagles, and fjords; Varanger offers rare Arctic sea-bird species, while the Finnmark plateau centers on open tundra landscapes. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:12', 'norway', 'prefer_TROMSØ + ALTA AND: match_AREA_TO_PARTY_STYLE + SEASON', 'Tromsø is Northern Norway''s premier university pub and nightlife hub ("Paris of the North"), Alta provides cozy hotel lounges, and coastal villages offer quiet fireside bars. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:13', 'norway', 'prioritize_TROMSØ + KAUTOKEINO + ALTA AND: include_SÁMI_SILVER_JEWELRY + NORWEGIAN_SWEATER_STORES + DUODJI_CRAFTS + HIGH_END_OUTDOOR_APPAREL', 'Tromsø and Kautokeino concentrate Northern Norway''s leading Scandinavian outdoor boutiques (Norrøna), traditional Sámi silver studios (Juhls), and authentic craft outlets. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:14', 'norway', 'prefer_LYNGEN_ALPS + NARVIK + TROMSO_OUTDOORS + ALTA AND: include_SKI_TOURING + ALPINE_SKIING + SNOWSHOEING + FAT_BIKING AND: use_RENTAL_EQUIPMENT_AND_RESORT_PASSES', 'Northern Norway''s alpine regions offer world-renowned sea-to-summit ski touring, downhill slopes, and expansive groomed cross-country trails. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:15', 'norway', 'prefer_LYNGEN_ALPS + SENJA_ISLAND + STORSLETT_REISA_NATIONAL_PARK + FINNMARK_PLATEAU AND: match_ROUTE_TO_FITNESS + SNOW_DEPTH + WEATHER + DAYLIGHT_HOURS', 'Northern Norwegian terrain ranges from sheer coastal summits on Senja and Lyngen to expansive Finnmark high-plateaus and deep river canyons. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:16', 'norway', 'choose_RESORT_REGION + SAUNA_TYPE + ARCTIC_OCEAN_PLUNGE_OPTION AND: do_not_treat_FLOATING_FJORD_SAUNAS_AND_HOTEL_ELECTRIC_SAUNAS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Northern Norwegian sauna culture ranges from modern harbor floating saunas (Pust Sauna in Tromsø) and fjord-side wood-fired hot tubs to luxury hotel spa suites. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:17', 'norway', 'prefer_FJELLHEISEN_VIEWPOINT + SENJA_SEGLA_SUMMIT + LYNGEN_FJORDS + ALTA_SORRISNIVA + GLASS_DOMES AND: prioritize_AURORA_HOURS + BLUE_HOUR + POLAR_TWILIGHT', 'These sites yield dramatic visual contrast between jagged coastal mountains dropping into fjords, illuminated glass domes, ice structures, and glowing Northern Lights. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:18', 'norway', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_TWO_OR_THREE_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Though coastal roads are scenic, winter icy conditions, dark mountain driving, and limited daylight can consume valuable excursion and safari hours. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:19', 'norway', 'prefer_REGIONAL_EXPRESS_BUSES_OR_COASTAL_SHIPS_OVER_RENTAL_CAR_FOR_STANDARD_TRANSFERS', 'Svipper and Snelandia regional buses alongside Hurtigruten/Havila coastal ships link Tromsø, Alta, and Kirkenes comfortably, eliminating difficult winter mountain pass driving. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:20', 'norway', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_GLASS_DOMES + COASTAL_EXPRESS_CRUISES + PRIVATE_4X4_TRANSFERS + MODERATE_DAILY_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_DEEP_SNOW_WALKS + EXCESSIVE_ICE_STEPS + RAPID_MULTI_RESORT_MOVEMENT', 'Icy walkways and deep snow can cause fatigue and slips; heated glass accommodations, coastal express ships, and private transfers ease movement. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:21', 'norway', 'prioritize_THERMAL_GEAR_RENTAL + INDOOR_MIDDAY_WARM_UPS + SHORT_OUTDOOR_SAFARIS AND: reduce_EXTENDED_UNSHELTERED_OUTDOOR_EXPOSURE', 'Northern Norwegian winter temperatures in inland Finnmark can drop below -30°C (-22°F); using high-grade thermal suits, taking frequent hot berry juice breaks, and staying near fires provides safety. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:22', 'norway', 'increase_MUSEUMS + FLOATING_SAUNA + FIRESIDE_DINING + POLARIA_AQUARIUM AND: reduce_LONG_ROAD_DRIVES + AURORA_HUNTING_DEPENDENT_ACTIVITY', 'Attractions like Polaria Aquarium, the Polar Museum, Alta Museum, hotel spa complexes, and traditional coastal saunas remain unaffected by bad Arctic weather. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:23', 'norway', 'prioritize_TROMSØ + ALTA_OR_LYNGEN_ALPS AND: add_ONE_OF_KARASJOK_SÁMI_CULTURE_KIRKENES_KING_CRAB_OR_GLASS_DOME AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_HUSKY_SAFARI_OR_HARBOR_SAUNA_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a comprehensive introduction to Northern Norway''s primary festive hubs alongside an authentic fjord wilderness escape. ---'),
  ('norway:rule:24', 'norway', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_SAUNAS + HOT_TUBS + SPA_WELLNESS + FIRESIDE_LOUNGES + SHOPPING + AURORA_SPOTTING + FREE_TIME ---', NULL),
  ('sweden:rule:0', 'sweden', 'prioritize_KIRUNA_AND_JUKKASJÄRVI + ONE_NEARBY_EXCURSION', 'Very short winter stays gain more value from properly experiencing one major Arctic hub (like Kiruna/Jukkasjärvi or Abisko) and adjacent safaris than losing daylight to long Arctic transport transfers. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:1', 'sweden', 'prioritize_KIRUNA_AND_JUKKASJÄRVI + ABISKO_NATIONAL_PARK + ONE_DESIGN_STAY', 'This gives a balanced introduction to iconic ice architecture, world-class Aurora viewing, Arctic fell scenery, animal safaris, and luxury wilderness design. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:2', 'sweden', 'prefer_KIRUNA_AND_JUKKASJÄRVI + ABISKO_AND_RIKSGRÄNSEN + JOKKMOKK_AND_HARADS_HUB AND: use_VY_TRAIN_AND_PRIVATE_TRANSFER_OR_RENTAL_CAR_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Arctic mining hubs, high alpine mountain passes, Indigenous Sámi cultural centers, and secluded forest design lodges offer completely distinct Arctic experiences. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:3', 'sweden', 'prioritize_ICEHOTEL_ART_SUITES + TREEHOTEL_HARADS + ARCTIC_BATH_FLOATING_SPA AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + SCENIC_DINING + SAUNA_SPA_EXPERIENCES + FREE_TIME + COUPLE_EXPERIENCES', 'Swedish Lapland''s strongest romantic routes mix architectural treehouses, private floating river spas under the Aurora, snowbound forest views, high-end Arctic dining, and iconic ice suites. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:4', 'sweden', 'prioritize_KIRUNA_AND_JUKKASJÄRVI + LULEÅ_SEA_ICE + ANIMAL_SAFARIS_AND_ICE_PARKS AND: include_ICEHOTEL_EXPLORATION + HUSKY_SLEIGH + REINDEER_FARM + CAPE_WILD_MOOSE + GAMMELSTAD_CHURCH_TOWN AND: reduce_MUSEUM_DENSITY + LONG_CONTINUOUS_TRANSFERS', 'Swedish Lapland has exceptional family attractions, including Icehotel snow carving walks, interactive moose feeding, husky driving, kicksleighing on frozen sea ice, and UNESCO heritage sites. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:5', 'sweden', 'prefer_TREEHOTEL_HARADS + ARCTIC_BATH + ICEHOTEL_365_SUITES + NIEHKU_MOUNTAIN_VILLA AND: increase_DESIGN_SUITES + PRIVATE_GUIDES + FINE_DINING + PRIVATE_TRANSFERS + HELICOPTER_TOURS + SPA', 'Swedish Lapland high-end travel relies on world-famous architectural lodges, exclusive ice art suites, private wilderness chefs, chartered helicopter tours, and heli-skiing villas. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:6', 'sweden', 'prefer_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + VY_NIGHT_TRAINS + WALKING + STF_MOUNTAIN_CABINS AND: book_INTERCITY_TRANSPORT_EARLY AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_AURORA_SPOTS + NATIONAL_PARK_WALKS + VILLAGE_GROUNDS', 'Swedish Lapland can be accessed on a budget by using night train sleeper seats/buses, staying in Swedish Tourist Association (STF) cabins (stugor), eating daily dagens rätt lunches, and exploring national park trails. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:7', 'sweden', 'prioritize_JOKKMOKK + KIRUNA + GAMMELSTAD_LULEÅ AND: include_ÁJTTE_SÁMI_MUSEUM + KIRUNA_CHURCH + GAMMELSTAD_UNESCO_TOWN + NUTTI_SÁMI_SIIDA + LKAB_MINE_TOUR', 'These destinations feature Swedish Lapland''s concentration of Indigenous Sámi culture, coastal church town history, Arctic mining heritage, and timber architecture. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:8', 'sweden', 'prefer_JUKKASJÄRVI + HARADS + LULEÅ + KIRUNA AND: include_ICEHOTEL_ART_SUITES + TREEHOTEL_DESIGNS + ARCTIC_BATH + KIRUNA_WOODEN_CHURCH', 'This route contrasts cutting-edge Scandinavian modern architecture and hand-carved ice structures with historic Arctic timber design. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:9', 'sweden', 'prefer_KIRUNA + HARADS + LULEÅ + JUKKASJÄRVI AND: include_OPEN_FIRE_LÁVVU_DINING + SOKKER_AND_SOUVAS + KALIX_LÖJROM_TASTING + CLOUDBERRY_PAIRINGS + ICE_RESTAURANT_FINE_DINING', 'Swedish Lapland food culture spans traditional Sámi open-fire cooking, wild game, Bothnian Bay bleak roe (Kalix Löjrom), Arctic berries, and high-end Nordic dining. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:10', 'sweden', 'prefer_LULEÅ + PITEÅ + BOTHNIAN_BAY_ARCHIPELAGO AND: match_REGION_TO_SEASON + ICEBREAKER_CRUISE_STYLE + RELAXATION_REQUIREMENT', 'Luleå and the Bothnian Bay provide frozen sea ice roads, kicksleighing, archipelago icebreaker cruises, ice floating, and coastal Arctic breaks. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:11', 'sweden', 'prioritize_ABISKO_NATIONAL_PARK + SAREK_WILDERNESS + CAPE_WILD_LULEÅ AND: do_not_treat_ARCTIC_TAIGA_AND_HIGH_ALPINE_TUNDRA_AS_INTERCHANGEABLE', 'Cape Wild offers intimate moose and reindeer encounters, Abisko provides high-altitude microclimate valleys, and Sarek represents Europe''s ultimate untamed alpine wilderness. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:12', 'sweden', 'prefer_RIKSGRÄNSEN + KIRUNA + LULEÅ AND: match_AREA_TO_PARTY_STYLE + SEASON', 'Riksgränsen is famous for spring ski & snowboard après-ski, Kiruna offers local industrial town pubs, and Luleå provides coastal city bars and microbreweries. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:13', 'sweden', 'prioritize_JOKKMOKK + JUKKASJÄRVI + LULEÅ AND: include_ÁJTTE_MUSEUM_SHOP + SÁMI_DUODJI_CRAFTS + SWEDISH_DESIGN_STORES + FJÄLLRÄVEN_OUTDOOR_GEAR', 'Jokkmokk and Jukkasjärvi concentrate authentic Sámi handicraft artisans (knives, wooden kåsa cups, silver), while Luleå offers modern Swedish design boutiques. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:14', 'sweden', 'prefer_RIKSGRÄNSEN + BJÖRKLIDEN + DUNDRET_GÄLLIVARE + KUNGSLEDEN AND: include_ALPINE_SKIING + HELI_SKIING + CROSS_COUNTRY_SKIING + BACKCOUNTRY_TOURING AND: use_RENTAL_EQUIPMENT_AND_RESORT_PASSES', 'Swedish Lapland offers legendary spring ski touring at Riksgränsen, extensive cross-country trail networks, and remote alpine heli-skiing. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:15', 'sweden', 'prefer_KUNGSLEDEN_TRAIL + ABISKO_NATIONAL_PARK + STORA_SJÖFALLET + SAREK AND: match_ROUTE_TO_FITNESS + SNOW_DEPTH + WEATHER + DAYLIGHT_HOURS', 'Swedish Arctic outdoors ranges from the famous King''s Trail (Kungsleden) to Mount Nuolja hikes and the untouched mountain gorges of Sarek. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:16', 'sweden', 'choose_RESORT_REGION + SAUNA_TYPE + ICE_SWIMMING_OPTION AND: do_not_treat_WOOD_FIRED_RIVER_SAUNAS_AND_HOTEL_ELECTRIC_SAUNAS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Swedish sauna culture ranges from floating open-air river saunas (Arctic Bath) and Torne River ice-dip log saunas to private lodge hot tubs. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:17', 'sweden', 'prioritize_ABISKO_AURORA_SKY_STATION + ICEHOTEL_SUITES + TREEHOTEL_HARADS + LAPPORTEN_VALLEY + FROZEN_SEA_ICE AND: prioritize_AURORA_HOURS + BLUE_HOUR + POLAR_TWILIGHT', 'These sites produce iconic visual contrasts between heavy snowy pine forests, frozen sea-ice expanses, architectural treehouses, illuminated ice sculptures, and glowing Northern Lights. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:18', 'sweden', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_TWO_OR_THREE_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Though Arctic railway routes and highways are direct, winter weather, ice, dark driving conditions, and limited daylight can consume valuable safari hours. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:19', 'sweden', 'prefer_VY_NIGHT_TRAINS_AND_MALMBANAN_RAIL_OVER_RENTAL_CAR_FOR_STANDARD_TRANSFERS', 'Sweden''s Vy trains and Iron Ore Line (Malmbanan) link Stockholm, Luleå, Kiruna, and Abisko comfortably, eliminating winter road fatigue. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:20', 'sweden', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_LODGES + DIRECT_RAIL + PRIVATE_TRANSFER_WHEN_USEFUL + MODERATE_DAILY_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_DEEP_SNOW_WALKS + EXCESSIVE_ICE_STEPS + RAPID_MULTI_RESORT_MOVEMENT', 'Icy walkways and deep snow cause fatigue; step-free train coaches, private transfers, and ground-level heated accommodation ease travel. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:21', 'sweden', 'prioritize_THERMAL_GEAR_RENTAL + INDOOR_MIDDAY_WARM_UPS + SHORT_OUTDOOR_SAFARIS AND: reduce_EXTENDED_UNSHELTERED_OUTDOOR_EXPOSURE', 'Swedish Lapland winter temperatures can drop below -30°C (-22°F); using full thermal overalls, taking frequent hot lingonberry juice breaks, and staying near open fires provides safety. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:22', 'sweden', 'increase_MUSEUMS + SPA_AND_SAUNA + FIRESIDE_DINING + ICEHOTEL_MAIN_HALL AND: reduce_LONG_ROAD_DRIVES + AURORA_HUNTING_DEPENDENT_ACTIVITY', 'Attractions like Ájtte Sámi Museum, Icehotel exhibition halls, hotel spa complexes, and traditional saunas remain unaffected by severe Arctic weather. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:23', 'sweden', 'prioritize_KIRUNA_AND_JUKKASJÄRVI + ABISKO_NATIONAL_PARK AND: add_ONE_OF_JOKKMOKK_SÁMI_CULTURE_LULEÅ_ICE_ROADS_OR_TREEHOTEL AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_HUSKY_SAFARI_OR_THERMAL_SAUNA_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a comprehensive introduction to Swedish Lapland''s premier destinations alongside an authentic Arctic wilderness escape. ---'),
  ('sweden:rule:24', 'sweden', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_SAUNAS + HOT_TUBS + SPA_WELLNESS + FIRESIDE_LOUNGES + SHOPPING + AURORA_SPOTTING + FREE_TIME ---', NULL),
  ('finland:rule:0', 'finland', 'prioritize_ROVANIEMI + ONE_NEARBY_EXCURSION', 'Very short winter stays gain more value from properly experiencing one major hub (like Rovaniemi or Levi) and adjacent safaris than losing daylight to long Arctic road transfers. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:1', 'finland', 'prioritize_ROVANIEMI + LEVI_OR_SAARISELKÄ + ONE_GLASS_IGLOO_STAY', 'This gives a balanced introduction to festive Santa activities, fell skiing, animal safaris, glass igloo stays, and Aurora hunting. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:2', 'finland', 'prefer_ROVANIEMI + LEVI_AND_SAARISELKÄ + LAKE_INARI_SÁMI_HUB AND: use_VR_TRAIN_AND_PRIVATE_TRANSFER_OR_RENTAL_CAR_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Urban Lapland, central fell ski resorts, and far-northern Indigenous Sámi wilderness offer three completely distinct Arctic experiences. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:3', 'finland', 'prioritize_ROVANIEMI_IGLOOS + LEVI_UTSUVAARA + PRIVATE_WILDERNESS_LODGE AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + SCENIC_DINING + SAUNA_SPA_EXPERIENCES + FREE_TIME + COUPLE_EXPERIENCES', 'Lapland''s strongest romantic routes mix glass igloos, private hot tubs under the Aurora, snowbound fell views, high-end Arctic dining, and secluded log chalets. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:4', 'finland', 'prioritize_ROVANIEMI + LEVI_OR_SAARISELKÄ + ANIMAL_SAFARIS_AND_SNOWPARKS AND: include_SANTA_CLAUS_VILLAGE + HUSKY_SLEIGH + REINDEER_FARM + ARTIKUM_OR_RANUA_ZOO + SNOWMAN_WORLD AND: reduce_MUSEUM_DENSITY + LONG_CONTINUOUS_TRANSFERS', 'Lapland has exceptional family attractions, including Santa Claus Village, husky sled driving, snow tubing, polar bears at Ranua, and elf parks. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:5', 'finland', 'prefer_ROVANIEMI_DESIGN_HOTELS + LEVI_LUXURY_CHALETS + INARI_PRIVATE_LODGE AND: increase_5_STAR_IGLOOS + PRIVATE_GUIDES + FINE_DINING + PRIVATE_TRANSFERS + HELICOPTER_TOURS + SPA', 'Lappish high-end travel relies on private wilderness chalets, exclusive glass suites, private Arctic chefs, chauffeured transfers, and private Aurora safaris. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:6', 'finland', 'prefer_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + VR_TRAINS + WALKING + WELL_CONNECTED_CABINS AND: book_INTERCITY_TRANSPORT_EARLY AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_AURORA_SPOTS + NATIONAL_PARK_WALKS + SANTA_VILLAGE_GROUNDS', 'Lapland can be accessed on a budget by using sleeper train seats/buses, booking self-catering cabins, eating daily lounas lunches, and exploring free nature trails. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:7', 'finland', 'prioritize_ROVANIEMI + INARI + SODANKYLÄ + KEMI AND: include_SIIDA_SÁMI_MUSEUM + ARKTIKUM + SAJOS_CULTURAL_CENTRE + OLD_CHURCHES + REINDEER_HERDING_FARMS', 'These destinations feature Lapland''s concentration of Indigenous Sámi culture, Arctic science, architectural history, and traditional herding lifeways. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:8', 'finland', 'prefer_ROVANIEMI + KEMI + LEVI + INARI AND: include_ARKTIKUM_GLASS_TUNNEL + KEMI_SNOWCASTLE + DESIGN_HOTELS + SÁMI_HANDICRAFT_GALLERIES', 'This route contrasts modern Nordic Arctic architecture and ice structures with traditional Sámi timber designs and regional craft galleries. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:9', 'finland', 'prefer_ROVANIEMI + LEVI + SAARISELKÄ + INARI AND: include_KOTA_FIRESIDE_DINING + SALMON_SOUP_HUTS + REINDEER_SAUTÉ + CLOUDBERRY_TASTINGS + FINE_LAPPISH_DINING', 'Lappish food culture spans traditional open-fire cooking, wild game, freshwater fish, Arctic berries, and contemporary fine dining using local ingredients. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:10', 'finland', 'prefer_KEMI + TORNIO + BOTHNIAN_BAY_NATIONAL_PARK AND: match_REGION_TO_SEASON + ICEBREAKER_CRUISE_STYLE + RELAXATION_REQUIREMENT', 'Kemi and the Bothnian Bay provide sea icebreaker cruises, ice floating, snow castles, and frozen sea coastal breaks. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:11', 'finland', 'prioritize_RANUA_WILDLIFE_PARK + PALLAS_YLLÄSTUNTURI + UKK_NATIONAL_PARK AND: do_not_treat_ARCTIC_TAIGA_AND_FELL_TUNDRA_AS_INTERCHANGEABLE', 'Ranua focuses on polar bears and boreal fauna, Pallas-Yllästunturi offers vast fell landscapes and clean air, while Urho Kekkonen National Park centers on deep wilderness and taiga trails. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:12', 'finland', 'prefer_LEVI + ROVANIEMI + SAARISELKÄ AND: match_AREA_TO_PARTY_STYLE + SEASON', 'Levi is Lapland''s premier après-ski and nightlife hub, Rovaniemi provides urban pubs, and smaller resorts offer fireside lounge bars. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:13', 'finland', 'prioritize_ROVANIEMI + LEVI AND: include_SANTA_VILLAGE_SHOPS + FINNISH_DESIGN_STORES + PUUKKO_KNIFE_SHOPS + SÁMI_DUODJI_CRAFTS + OUTDOOR_GEAR', 'Rovaniemi and Levi concentrate Lapland''s leading Finnish design boutiques (Marimekko, Iittala), traditional knife shops, Sámi craft outlets, and souvenir halls. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:14', 'finland', 'prefer_LEVI + YLLÄS + PYHÄ + SAARISELKÄ AND: include_ALPINE_SKIING + CROSS_COUNTRY_SKIING + FAT_BIKING + SNOWBOARDING AND: use_RENTAL_EQUIPMENT_AND_RESORT_PASSES', 'Lapland''s major fell resorts offer extensive downhill slopes, hundreds of kilometers of lit cross-country tracks, and modern ski facilities. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:15', 'finland', 'prefer_PALLAS_YLLÄSTUNTURI + RIISITUNTURI + UKK_NATIONAL_PARK + PYHÄ_LUOSTO AND: match_ROUTE_TO_FITNESS + SNOW_DEPTH + WEATHER + DAYLIGHT_HOURS', 'Lappish outdoors offers terrain ranging from crown-snow trees (tykky) in Riisitunturi to expansive fell high-plateaus and deep river gorges. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:16', 'finland', 'choose_RESORT_REGION + SAUNA_TYPE + ICE_SWIMMING_OPTION AND: do_not_treat_WOOD_FIRED_SAUNAS_AND_HOTEL_ELECTRIC_SAUNAS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Lapland''s sauna culture ranges from traditional riverside wood-fired log saunas and smoke saunas (savusauna) to ice saunas and luxury outdoor jacuzzi suites. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:17', 'finland', 'prefer_RIISITUNTURI_SNOW_TREES + LEVI_FELL_TOP + ROVANIEMI_ARCTIC_TREEHOUSE + LAKE_INARI + GLASS_IGLOOS AND: prioritize_AURORA_HOURS + BLUE_HOUR + POLAR_TWILIGHT', 'These sites yield dramatic visual contrast between heavy snow-laden trees, frozen Arctic lakes, illuminated glass igloos, and glowing Northern Lights. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:18', 'finland', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_TWO_OR_THREE_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Though highway roads are direct, winter weather, ice, dark driving conditions, and limited daylight can consume valuable safari and excursion hours. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:19', 'finland', 'prefer_VR_RAIL_AND_EXPRESS_BUSES_OVER_RENTAL_CAR_FOR_STANDARD_TRANSFERS', 'Finland''s VR train lines and Matkahuolto express buses link Rovaniemi to Kemi, Santa Claus Village, and main ski resorts comfortably, eliminating winter driving stress. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:20', 'finland', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_IGLOOS + DIRECT_RAIL + PRIVATE_TRANSFER_WHEN_USEFUL + MODERATE_DAILY_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_DEEP_SNOW_WALKS + EXCESSIVE_ICE_STEPS + RAPID_MULTI_RESORT_MOVEMENT', 'Icy walkways and deep snow can cause fatigue and slips; heated glass accommodations, private transfers, and accessible train coaches ease movement. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:21', 'finland', 'prioritize_THERMAL_GEAR_RENTAL + INDOOR_MIDDAY_WARM_UPS + SHORT_OUTDOOR_SAFARIS AND: reduce_EXTENDED_UNSHELTERED_OUTDOOR_EXPOSURE', 'Lapland winter temperatures can drop below -30°C (-22°F); using thermal suits, taking frequent hot berry juice breaks, and staying near fires provides safety. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:22', 'finland', 'increase_MUSEUMS + SPA_AND_SAUNA + FIRESIDE_DINING + INDOOR_SANTA_PARK AND: reduce_LONG_ROAD_DRIVES + AURORA_HUNTING_DEPENDENT_ACTIVITY', 'Attractions like Arktikum Museum, SantaPark, hotel spa complexes, and traditional saunas remain unaffected by bad Arctic weather. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:23', 'finland', 'prioritize_ROVANIEMI + LEVI_OR_SAARISELKÄ AND: add_ONE_OF_INARI_SÁMI_CULTURE_KEMI_ICEBREAKER_OR_GLASS_IGLOO AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_HUSKY_SAFARI_OR_THERMAL_SAUNA_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a comprehensive introduction to Lapland''s primary festive hubs alongside an authentic wilderness escape. ---'),
  ('finland:rule:24', 'finland', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_SAUNAS + HOT_TUBS + SPA_WELLNESS + FIRESIDE_LOUNGES + SHOPPING + AURORA_SPOTTING + FREE_TIME ---', NULL),
  ('iceland:rule:0', 'iceland', 'prioritize_REYKJAVIK_AND_GOLDEN_CIRCLE + SOUTH_COAST_TO_VIK', 'Short stays maximize value by pairing the capital hub and Golden Circle highlights with South Coast waterfalls, avoiding long cross-country drives. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:1', 'iceland', 'prioritize_REYKJAVIK + GOLDEN_CIRCLE + SOUTH_COAST_TO_JÖKULSÁRLÓN + SNAEFELLSNES', 'Provides a comprehensive balance of geothermal wonders, glacier lagoons, black sand beaches, volcanic peaks, and urban culture. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:2', 'iceland', 'prefer_FULL_RING_ROAD_CIRCUIT + SNAEFELLSNES_PENINSULA AND: use_RENTAL_4X4_OR_PRIVATE_SUPER_JEEP_DRIVE', 'Allows a complete loop around Route 1 to experience South Coast glaciers, East Fjords, Lake Mývatn volcanic fields, and Northern coastal towns without rushing. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:3', 'iceland', 'prioritize_RETREAT_AT_BLUE_LAGOON + SKY_LAGOON_PRIVATE + GLASS_IGLOO_STAYS AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_LODGES + SCENIC_DINING + GEOTHERMAL_SPA_EXPERIENCES + PRIVATE_AURORA_TOURS', 'Iceland''s romantic luxury routes blend secluded geothermal spas, glass-roofed northern lights suites, private ice cave tours, and New Nordic fine dining. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:4', 'iceland', 'prioritize_REYKJAVIK + GOLDEN_CIRCLE + SOUTH_COAST_SHORT_STOPS AND: include_PERLAN_MUSEUM + WHALE_WATCHING + FRIÐHEIMAR_TOMATO_FARM + ICELANDIC_HORSE_RIDING AND: reduce_LONG_GLACIER_TREKS + EXCESSIVE_DAILY_DRIVING', 'Iceland offers engaging family activities including interactive volcanic museums, gentle horse rides, tomato farm lunches, and whale spotting. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:5', 'iceland', 'prefer_RETREAT_HOTEL + DEPLAR_FARM + ELEVENTH_EXPERIENCE + SUPER_JEEP_TRANSFERS AND: increase_PRIVATE_HELICOPTER_TOURS + EXCLUSIVE_ICE_CAVES + PRIVATE_CHEFS + LUXURY_LODGES', 'High-end Iceland travel focuses on private fly-in heli-skiing/hiking, exclusive geothermal spa access, chartered helicopter crater landings, and private wilderness chefs. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:6', 'iceland', 'prefer_SELF_DRIVE_COMPACT_CAR + PUBLIC_GEOTHERMAL_POOLS + GUESTHOUSES + SUPERMARKET_MEALS AND: book_RENTAL_VEHICLES_AND_STAYS_EARLY AND: balance_PAID_TOURS_WITH_FREE_NATURAL_WATERFALLS + NATIONAL_PARKS + VOLCANIC_TRAILS', 'Iceland can be explored affordably by utilizing self-drive options, eating from local markets (Bonus), swimming in municipal heated pools, and focusing on free natural sites. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:7', 'iceland', 'prioritize_REYKJAVIK + WEST_ICELAND + HISTORIC_SITES AND: include_NATIONAL_MUSEUM + SETTLEMENT_EXHIBITION + THINGVELLIR_UNESCO + EGILS_SAGA_SITES', 'These routes highlight Viking settlement history, Commonwealth parliament origins at Þingvellir, and rich Icelandic saga heritage. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:8', 'iceland', 'prefer_REYKJAVIK + AKUREYRI AND: include_HARPA_CONCERT_HALL + HALLGRÍMSKIRKJA + DESIGNMARCH_STORES + AKUREYRI_ART_STREET', 'Combines iconic modern Nordic architecture, glass-facade oceanfront landmarks, geometric concrete churches, and contemporary art galleries. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:9', 'iceland', 'prefer_REYKJAVIK + SOUTH_COAST + NORTH_ICELAND AND: include_LANGOUSTINE_IN_HÖFN + FRIÐHEIMAR_GREENHOUSE + GEOTHERMAL_RYE_BREAD + NEW_NORDIC_TASTING_MENUS', 'Iceland''s food scene features fresh North Atlantic seafood, mountain lamb, geothermally baked rye bread (Rúgbrauð), and innovative regional cuisine. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:10', 'iceland', 'prioritize_JÖKULSÁRLÓN_GLACIER_LAGOON + DIAMOND_BEACH + REYNISFJARA + KATLA_ICE_CAVES AND: match_REGION_TO_SEASON + BOAT_TOUR_STYLE + ICE_CAVE_SAFETY', 'The South Coast offers iceberg-filled lagoons, black crystal beaches, dramatic ocean basalt columns, and natural blue glacier ice caves. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:11', 'iceland', 'prioritize_MÝVATN_BIRD_RESERVE + HÚSAVÍK + LÁTRABJARG_CLIFFS + WESTMAN_ISLANDS AND: match_EXCURSION_TO_PUFFIN_AND_WHALE_SEASONS', 'Húsavík provides world-class whale watching, Látrabjarg offers dramatic puffin nesting cliffs, and Lake Mývatn hosts rich wetland birdlife. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:12', 'iceland', 'prefer_REYKJAVIK_CITY_CENTER AND: match_AREA_TO_BAR_CRAWL_STYLE + SEASON', 'Downtown Reykjavík concentrates lively craft beer bars, late-night music venues, pub crawls, and vibrant weekend nightlife within walking distance. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:13', 'iceland', 'prioritize_REYKJAVIK_LAUGAVEGUR + HANDKNITTING_ASSOCIATION AND: include_AUTHENTIC_LOPAPEYSA_SWEATERS + LAVA_JEWELRY + BIOEFFECT_SKINCARE + ICELANDIC_DESIGN', 'Laugavegur street features authentic hand-knit wool sweaters (Lopapeysa), local volcanic rock jewelry, high-tech skincare, and Icelandic artisan crafts. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:14', 'iceland', 'prefer_TÁLKNAFJÖRÐUR + AKUREYRI_HÍÐARFJALL + TRÖLLASKAGI_PENINSULA AND: include_RESORT_SKIING + HELI_SKIING + BACKCOUNTRY_TOURING AND: use_RENTAL_EQUIPMENT_AND_LOCAL_GUIDES', 'Northern Iceland''s Troll Peninsula delivers premier arctic heli-skiing down to ocean fjords and reliable winter resort slopes. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:15', 'iceland', 'prefer_LAUGAVEGUR_TRAIL + LANDMANNALAUGAR + SKÓGAR_TO_THÓRSMÖRK + KERLINGARFJÖLL AND: match_ROUTE_TO_FITNESS + HIGHLAND_BUS_SCHEDULES + WEATHER_SAFETY', 'Iceland''s interior highlands present world-class multi-day treks through rhyolite mountains, geothermal valleys, and glacial river canyons. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:16', 'iceland', 'choose_BATHS_REGION + HOT_SPRING_TYPE + OCEAN_DIP_OPTION AND: do_not_treat_LUXURY_GEOTHERMAL_SPAS_AND_LOCAL_MUNICIPAL_POOLS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Icelandic bathing culture spans luxury geothermal lagoons (Blue Lagoon, Sky Lagoon, Vök Baths) and authentic heated municipal outdoor pools (Laugardalslaug). ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:17', 'iceland', 'prioritize_KIRKJUFELL + DIAMOND_BEACH + STOKKSNES + STROKKUR_GEYSER + AURORA_SPOTS AND: prioritize_GOLDEN_HOUR + MIDNIGHT_SUN + POLAR_TWILIGHT', 'Iconic shooting locations pair dramatic coastal sea stacks, mirror-like black sand lagoons, spouting geysers, and midnight sun glow. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:18', 'iceland', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_TWO_OR_THREE_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Winter road ice, sudden weather shifts, strong gale warnings, and short daylight hours make frequent hotel transfers inefficient. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:19', 'iceland', 'prefer_RENTAL_4X4_WITH_STUDDED_TIRES_OR_GUIDED_SUPER_JEEP_TRANSFERS', 'Navigating Iceland''s Ring Road and mountain passes in changing weather demands high-clearance 4x4 capability and winter tire grip. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:20', 'iceland', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_LAGOONS + DIRECT_SUPER_JEEP_TOURS + MODERATE_DAILY_DRIVING AND: reduce_UNPAVED_LAVA_TRAILS + EXCESSIVE_GLACIER_STEPS + HEAVY_HIGHLAND_TREKS', 'Uneven lava rocks, icy footpaths, and steep waterfall steps cause fatigue; accessible boardwalks, geothermal spas, and private vehicular tours ease travel. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:21', 'iceland', 'prioritize_VEHICLE_SAFETY + INDOOR_MUSEUMS + GEOTHERMAL_POOLS AND: hold_CAR_DOORS_WITH_BOTH_HANDS + AVOID_OPEN_COASTAL_CLIFF_EDGES', 'Icelandic wind gusts can exceed 40 m/s (90 mph), easily stripping car doors past hinges and making gravel-paved driving hazardous. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:22', 'iceland', 'increase_MUSEUMS + GEOTHERMAL_SPAS + CITY_EXPLORATION + CULINARY_TOURS AND: reduce_LONG_RING_ROAD_DRIVES + ISOLATED_HIGHLAND_TRIPS', 'Attractions like Perlan, National Museum, FlyOver Iceland, covered food halls, and city thermal baths remain operational during whiteouts. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:23', 'iceland', 'prioritize_REYKJAVIK + GOLDEN_CIRCLE + SOUTH_COAST AND: add_ONE_OF_SNAEFELLSNES_PENINSULA_OR_MÝVATN_NORTH_ICELAND AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_ICE_CAVE_OR_GEOTHERMAL_SPA_EXPERIENCE', 'Delivers an ideal primer on Iceland''s quintessential volcanic, glacial, and geothermal wonders alongside unforgettable wilderness activities. ---'),
  ('iceland:rule:24', 'iceland', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_GEOTHERMAL_BATHS + FIRESIDE_LOUNGES + LOCAL_CAFES + AURORA_SPOTTING + FREE_TIME ---', NULL),
  ('manchester:rule:0', 'manchester', 'Choose a focused city center loop in central Manchester, visiting Piccadilly Gardens, taking exterior photos of the Neo-Gothic Manchester Town Hall at Albert Square, admiring the architecture of John Rylands Library, and enjoying a traditional cup of tea alongside a fresh Eccles cake or full English breakfast at an iconic Northern Quarter café before departing from Manchester Piccadilly Station.', 'Half-day layovers require maximum transit efficiency around Piccadilly Station; focusing on the compact civic core delivers historic architecture, classic northern food, and vibrant city culture without risking delayed train connections.'),
  ('manchester:rule:1', 'manchester', 'Spend the morning exploring the Science and Industry Museum in Castlefield and browsing John Rylands Library, take a midday lunch break in Spinningfields, and spend the afternoon visiting the National Football Museum and Manchester Cathedral, concluding with a evening dinner and craft beer crawl through the vibrant Northern Quarter.', 'A single full day allows travelers to efficiently experience Manchester''s industrial heritage, stunning Victorian architecture, football culture, and independent food scene in a compact central geographic zone.'),
  ('manchester:rule:2', 'manchester', 'Spend day one focusing on Manchester''s civic history, fine art, and vibrant city center neighborhoods at John Rylands Library, Manchester Art Gallery, the National Football Museum, and the Northern Quarter; spend day two exploring industrial revolution history at the Science and Industry Museum, taking a stadium tour at Old Trafford or the Etihad Stadium, and dining along the canals of Salford Quays.', 'Multi-day stays allow travelers to balance Manchester''s rich industrial and architectural heritage with world-class sporting culture and modern waterfront developments.'),
  ('manchester:rule:3', 'manchester', 'Focus on the core city highlights—visiting John Rylands Library, Manchester Art Gallery, the Science and Industry Museum, taking a guided stadium tour of Old Trafford, exploring the iconic Northern Quarter, and enjoying an evening out at Spinningfields or Gay Village.', 'Combining Manchester''s world-famous football grounds, groundbreaking industrial museums, Gothic architecture, and famous nightlife corridors delivers a comprehensive first-time overview of the capital of the North.'),
  ('manchester:rule:4', 'manchester', 'Book an executive suite at a 5-star luxury property like Stock Exchange Hotel or The Kimpton Clocktower, featuring private chauffeured city tours, couples massages, skyline cocktails at 20 Stories, and fine dining at Michelin-starred Mana in historic Ancoats.', 'Pairing classic Victorian industrial luxury with panoramic skyline views and elevated modern British gastronomy creates a sophisticated, stylish urban getaway.'),
  ('manchester:rule:5', 'manchester', 'Stay at family-friendly hotels near Castlefield or St Peter''s Square, ride the contactless Metrolink tram between attraction hubs, explore interactive hands-on exhibits at the Science and Industry Museum and the Manchester Museum, tour the National Football Museum, and take a scenic river cruise along the Manchester Ship Canal.', 'Interactive science galleries, dinosaur exhibits, immersive football challenges, and easy tram travel keep children engaged while avoiding urban friction.'),
  ('manchester:rule:6', 'manchester', 'Book premier suites at 5-star luxury hotels, reserve VIP stadium hospitality match packages or after-hours private tours at Old Trafford, hire executive chauffeured vehicles for transfers, enjoy VIP seating at West End-caliber shows at The Lowry or Palace Theatre, and dine at high-end establishments across Spinningfields.', 'Private chauffeured transport, exclusive stadium access, and premier fine dining eliminate urban hassle while delivering world-class service in dynamic settings.'),
  ('manchester:rule:7', 'manchester', 'Stay in boutique hostels or budget hotels around the Northern Quarter or Ancoats, travel using free city-center buses (Free Bus routes 1 & 2) or walking, visit free-entry world-class venues like John Rylands Library, Manchester Art Gallery, and Manchester Central Library, and dine at affordable street-food hubs in Mackie Mayor or curry houses along the famous Curry Mile.', 'Manchester features exceptional free public museums, complimentary city-center shuttle buses, and legendary cheap eats, making rich cultural sightseeing accessible on a modest budget.'),
  ('manchester:rule:8', 'manchester', 'Take a short regional train ride or private excursion out of the urban center to the dramatic gritstone edges and rolling hills of the Peak District National Park (such as Edale or Castleton), stroll through the peaceful estate of Tatton Park, or walk along the canals of Hebden Bridge.', 'The immediate countryside surrounding Manchester offers rapid access to breathtaking national parks, historic stately country estates, and picturesque canal valleys.'),
  ('manchester:rule:9', 'manchester', 'Map out a dynamic culinary exploration of the city, sampling traditional Manchester tarts and full English breakfasts in the Northern Quarter, global street food inside converted glasshouses at Mackie Mayor, authentic South Asian dishes along the Curry Mile in Rusholme, and Michelin-starred fine dining in Ancoats.', 'Manchester boasts a world-class food scene, seamlessly blending traditional Northern comfort classics, vibrant ethnic culinary enclaves, modern market halls, and cutting-edge gastronomy.'),
  ('manchester:rule:10', 'manchester', 'Combine indoor skydiving and skiing at Chill Factore, rock climbing or bouldering in the Northern Quarter, cycling at the HSBC UK National Cycling Centre (Manchester Velodrome), and day excursions for hiking along the rugged trails of Kinder Scout in the nearby Peak District.', 'Manchester and its surrounding region offer world-class indoor action sports facilities alongside immediate access to challenging national park hiking terrain.');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('manchester:rule:11', 'manchester', 'Stay at full-service central luxury hotels near St Peter''s Square, utilize smooth Metrolink trams and private air-conditioned cars for transfers, explore the flat, accessible gallery spaces of Manchester Art Gallery and Manchester Museum at a relaxed pace, and enjoy afternoon tea inside historic Victorian tea rooms.', 'Accessible city-center infrastructure, flat museum walkways, easy tram connections, and refined tea traditions allow senior travelers to experience the city comfortably without physical strain.'),
  ('manchester:rule:12', 'manchester', 'Take a direct 20-minute train from Manchester Airport (MAN) to Manchester Piccadilly Station, spend 2 to 3 hours visiting John Rylands Library and Manchester Art Gallery, enjoy a relaxed pub lunch or coffee in the Northern Quarter, and return directly to the airport.', 'Rapid high-frequency rail links connecting Manchester Airport directly to the city core allow layover travelers to comfortably take in iconic monuments, shopping, and dining within a short timeframe.'),
  ('manchester:rule:13', 'manchester', 'Divide your stay between 2 days exploring Manchester''s civic, football, museum, and neighborhood highlights, paired with a full-day excursion to the scenic Peak District National Park or the historic walled city of Chester.', 'A three-day itinerary bridges Manchester''s vibrant urban sports and cultural hubs with surrounding natural countryside landscapes and ancient regional history. ---'),
  ('london:rule:0', 'london', 'Choose a focused city center loop in central London, taking exterior photos of Big Ben and the Houses of Parliament, strolling past Westminster Abbey, walking through St. James''s Park to view Buckingham Palace, and enjoying a classic British cream tea or pint at a traditional pub along Whitehall before departing.', 'Half-day layovers require maximum transit efficiency using direct airport rail links; focusing on the iconic Westminster corridor provides world-famous landmarks within a compact, easily walkable area.'),
  ('london:rule:1', 'london', 'Spend the morning exploring the historic Tower of London and walking across Tower Bridge, take a scenic Thames river bus down to Westminster to view Big Ben and Westminster Abbey, spend the afternoon browsing global treasures at the British Museum, and conclude with an evening West End theatre show in Covent Garden.', 'A single full day allows travelers to efficiently experience London''s premier royal fortress, historic riverways, world-class museum collections, and iconic West End entertainment using fast transit links.'),
  ('london:rule:2', 'london', 'Spend day one focusing on royal heritage and iconic landmarks across Westminster and the South Bank, including Big Ben, Westminster Abbey, Buckingham Palace, and the London Eye; spend day two exploring historic maritime and financial hubs at the Tower of London, St. Paul''s Cathedral, Borough Market, and the British Museum.', 'Multi-day stays allow travelers to balance London''s majestic royal history and modern riverside attractions with world-leading art galleries, historic markets, and culinary exploration.'),
  ('london:rule:3', 'london', 'Focus on the core capital highlights—visiting the Tower of London, Westminster Abbey, Big Ben, Buckingham Palace for the Changing of the Guard, the British Museum, taking a ride on the London Eye, and sampling international street food at Borough Market.', 'Combining London''s iconic royal palaces, thousand-year-old fortresses, world-class free museums, and panoramic skyline vistas delivers a comprehensive first-time overview of the UK capital.'),
  ('london:rule:4', 'london', 'Book a luxury suite at a 5-star heritage property like Claridge''s, The Connaught, or The Ritz London, featuring private Thames riverboat charters, couples spa treatments, afternoon tea in historic salons, and romantic multi-course fine dining at Michelin-starred restaurants or rooftop spots like 20 Stories.', 'Pairing classic British elegance and luxury hospitality with scenic Thames cruises and refined gastronomy creates a deeply romantic and sophisticated urban escape.'),
  ('london:rule:5', 'london', 'Stay at family-friendly hotels near South Kensington or the South Bank, take advantage of interactive free museums like the Natural History Museum and Science Museum, ride the London Eye and double-decker red buses, explore the underwater tunnels at SEA LIFE London, and enjoy open play areas in Hyde Park or Kensington Gardens.', 'Hands-on science and dinosaur exhibits, expansive royal park playgrounds, red double-decker bus rides, and kid-friendly attractions keep children engaged while utilizing step-free transport options.'),
  ('london:rule:6', 'london', 'Book premier suites in Mayfair, Knightsbridge, or Belgravia, reserve private curator-led after-hours museum tours, hire VIP chauffeured executive vehicles (such as Range Rovers or Rolls-Royces), charter private yachts along the Thames, and enjoy multi-course Michelin-starred dining and private box seating at West End theatres.', 'Chauffeured luxury transport, exclusive after-hours gallery viewings, and bespoke dining eliminate city friction while delivering world-class service in historic settings.'),
  ('london:rule:7', 'london', 'Stay in well-connected hostels or budget hotels near King''s Cross, Paddington, or Shoreditch, utilize contactless pay-as-you-go public transit caps on buses and the Tube, explore London''s world-class free museums (British Museum, V&A, National Gallery), and dine at affordable food markets like Borough Market, Seven Dials Market, or Camden Market.', 'London offers an incredible array of top-tier free entry national museums, capped public transport fares, and vibrant street food halls, making rich cultural sightseeing accessible on a modest budget.'),
  ('london:rule:8', 'london', 'Take day excursions out of the concrete city center to the sprawling royal green spaces of Richmond Park to spot wild deer, stroll through the UNESCO-listed Royal Botanic Gardens at Kew, explore the historic formal grounds of Hampton Court Palace, and walk along the serene Regent''s Canal through Little Venice.', 'Greater London features vast, protected royal parks, botanical glasshouses, peaceful canal networks, and ancient woodland retreats within easy train or Tube access.'),
  ('london:rule:9', 'london', 'Map out an authentic culinary exploration of the capital, sampling traditional corned beef hash and regional desserts, exploring artisan food stalls at Borough Market and Mackie Mayor, savoring world-class Neapolitan pizzas in Ancoats, indulging in an authentic curry along Rusholme''s Curry Mile, and dining at Michelin-starred establishments.', 'London and its regional hubs feature a dynamic culinary landscape, seamlessly blending historic British pub fare, famous international food markets, cutting-edge craft bakery cultures, and diverse global dining.'),
  ('london:rule:10', 'london', 'Combine urban adventure sports like real-snow indoor skiing at Chill Factore or indoor skydiving, rock climbing at premier urban bouldering hubs, kayak or stand-up paddleboard tours along urban canals, and scenic day-trip ridge hikes in the Peak District National Park.', 'The UK capital and connected northern hubs offer high-energy indoor extreme sports, canal waterways, and rapid rail access to rugged national park hiking trails.'),
  ('london:rule:11', 'london', 'Stay at central luxury or boutique hotels featuring elevator access, utilize iconic accessible Black Cabs or pre-booked chauffeured cars for site transfers, explore flat, paved paths in St. James''s Park and the accessible halls of the British Museum at a relaxed pace, and enjoy a sit-down Thames river cruise or high afternoon tea.', 'Highly accessible public infrastructure, step-free museum routing, iconic door-to-door Black Cabs, and gentle riverboat tours allow senior travelers to experience the capital comfortably without physical strain.'),
  ('london:rule:12', 'london', 'Take the express rail link into central London (such as the Elizabeth line or airport express), spend 2 to 3 hours touring the exterior of Big Ben, Westminster Abbey, and Buckingham Palace, enjoy a relaxed pub lunch or afternoon tea, and return directly to the airport.', 'Fast, direct rail connections between London''s major airports and central hubs allow layover travelers to comfortably take in iconic royal landmarks and traditional dining within a tight window.'),
  ('london:rule:13', 'london', 'Divide your stay between 2 days exploring London''s royal, historical, and museum highlights in Westminster, South Bank, and Kensington, paired with a full-day excursion to Windsor Castle, Oxford, or Greenwich''s maritime heritage sites.', 'A three-day itinerary bridges London''s essential urban cultural core with iconic royal castles, historic university towns, and maritime UNESCO World Heritage sites." ---'),
  ('liverpool:rule:0', 'liverpool', 'Choose a focused city center loop around Liverpool''s maritime core, visiting Pier Head to take exterior photos of the iconic Three Graces (including the Royal Liver Building), walking through the historic cobbled colonnades of the Royal Albert Dock, and enjoying a traditional bowl of Scouse or afternoon tea at a waterfront cafe before departing from Liverpool Lime Street Station.', 'Half-day layovers require maximum transit efficiency around Lime Street Station; focusing on the compact waterfront core delivers historic maritime architecture, classic local comfort food, and iconic views of the River Mersey without risking delayed train connections.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:1', 'liverpool', 'Spend the morning exploring the world-class collections at the Museum of Liverpool and the Royal Albert Dock, take a midday lunch break along Castle Street, spend the afternoon discovering musical history at The Beatles Story or visiting The Cavern Club on Mathew Street, and conclude with an evening dinner and drinks in the vibrant Ropewalks district.', 'A single full day allows travelers to efficiently experience Liverpool''s UNESCO-recognized maritime heritage, world-famous Beatles legacy, fine architecture, and independent food scene within a compact central geographic zone.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:2', 'liverpool', 'Spend day one focusing on Liverpool''s maritime history, Beatles legacy, and vibrant city center neighborhoods at Pier Head, Royal Albert Dock, Mathew Street, and Bold Street; spend day two taking a stadium tour at Anfield (Liverpool FC) or Goodison Park (Everton FC), exploring the grand architecture of St George''s Hall and the Walker Art Gallery, and dining in the creative warehouse district of the Baltic Triangle.', 'Multi-day stays allow travelers to balance Liverpool''s rich maritime and musical heritage with world-class sporting culture, grand Neoclassical art institutions, and modern creative food halls.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:3', 'liverpool', 'Focus on core city highlights—visiting the Royal Albert Dock, Pier Head, The Beatles Story, taking a guided stadium tour of Anfield, exploring the vibrant indie shops along Bold Street, paying homage to music legends at The Cavern Club, and enjoying an evening out along Castle Street or the Baltic Triangle.', 'Combining Liverpool''s world-famous football grounds, legendary pop culture history, historic docklands, and vibrant nightlife corridors delivers a comprehensive first-time overview of the cultural capital of Merseyside.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:4', 'liverpool', 'Book an executive suite at a 5-star luxury property like The Municipal Hotel & Spa Liverpool - MGallery or Titanic Hotel Liverpool, featuring private chauffeured city tours, couples'' spa retreats, waterfront sunset strolls along Pier Head, and fine dining at The Art School or "8" by Andrew Sheridan.', 'Pairing classic Victorian and maritime heritage luxury with waterfront views and elevated fine dining creates a romantic, stylish urban getaway.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:5', 'liverpool', 'Stay at family-friendly hotels near the Royal Albert Dock or Liverpool ONE, ride the Merseyrail network between attraction hubs, explore interactive hands-on exhibits at the Museum of Liverpool and the World Museum, tour Anfield Stadium, and take a scenic river cruise on the iconic Mersey Ferry.', 'Interactive natural history galleries, planetarium shows, immersive football challenges, and easy ferry and train travel keep children engaged while avoiding urban friction.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:6', 'liverpool', 'Book premier suites at 5-star heritage properties, reserve VIP stadium matchday hospitality boxes at Anfield, hire executive chauffeured vehicles for transfers, enjoy private behind-the-scenes tours of top maritime and Beatles institutions, and dine at high-end establishments across Castle Street and the waterfront.', 'Private chauffeured transport, exclusive stadium access, and premier fine dining eliminate urban hassle while delivering world-class service in dynamic settings.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:7', 'liverpool', 'Stay in boutique hostels or budget hotels around Ropewalks or the city center, travel on foot or via affordable Merseyrail links, visit free-entry world-class venues like the Museum of Liverpool, Walker Art Gallery, World Museum, and Tate Liverpool, and dine at affordable street-food hubs inside Baltic Market or independent cafes along Bold Street.', 'Liverpool features exceptional free public museums, compact walkable central corridors, and legendary cheap eats, making rich cultural sightseeing accessible on a modest budget.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:8', 'liverpool', 'Take a short Merseyrail train ride out of the urban center to the dramatic pine forests and sand dunes of Formby Beach to spot native red squirrels, walk along the coastal promenade at Crosby Beach to view Antony Gley''s Another Place installation, or stroll through the historic botanical gardens at Sefton Park.', 'The immediate coastline and green spaces surrounding Liverpool offer rapid access to pristine coastal nature, rare wildlife habitats, and sprawling Victorian parks.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:9', 'liverpool', 'Map out a dynamic culinary exploration of the city, sampling traditional Scouse stew along the docks, international street food inside converted warehouses at Baltic Market, fine dining at Castle Street bistros, and innovative multi-course tasting menus at The Art School.', 'Liverpool boasts a vibrant food scene, seamlessly blending traditional maritime comfort classics, dynamic street-food markets, modern independent bistros, and high-end gastronomy.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:10', 'liverpool', 'Combine urban bouldering, watersports at Liverpool Water Sports Centre (Queen''s Dock), paddleboarding along the historic dock system, windsurfing or coastal trail biking along the Wirral Peninsula, and day excursions for coastal hiking along the sand dunes of Formby.', 'Liverpool and its surrounding maritime region offer exciting urban dockland watersports alongside immediate access to coastal trail exploration.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:11', 'liverpool', 'Stay at full-service central luxury hotels near Castle Street or the Royal Albert Dock, utilize smooth Merseyrail trains and private air-conditioned taxis for transfers, explore the flat, accessible gallery spaces of the Museum of Liverpool and Walker Art Gallery at a relaxed pace, and enjoy afternoon tea inside historic dockside tearooms or grand hotel lounges.', 'Accessible city-center infrastructure, flat dockland boardwalks, step-free station access, and refined tea traditions allow senior travelers to experience the city comfortably without physical strain.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:12', 'liverpool', 'Take a direct 20-minute train or bus link from Liverpool John Lennon Airport (LPL) or step out directly from Liverpool Lime Street Station, spend 2 to 3 hours visiting St George''s Hall, strolling along Mathew Street, and exploring the Royal Albert Dock, enjoy a relaxed pub lunch, and return directly to your connection point.', 'Rapid high-frequency transit links connecting major hubs to the city core allow layover travelers to comfortably take in iconic monuments, music history, and waterfront dining within a short timeframe.'),
  ('liverpool:rule:13', 'liverpool', 'Divide your stay between 2 days exploring Liverpool''s maritime, Beatles, football, and museum highlights, paired with a full-day excursion to the historic walled Roman city of Chester or the coastal nature reserves of Formby and Crosby Beach.', 'A three-day itinerary bridges Liverpool''s vibrant urban sports and cultural hubs with surrounding natural coastal landscapes and ancient regional history. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:0', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_EDINBURGH_CASTLE + ROYAL_MILE + NEW_TOWN_OR_CALTON_HILL AND: choose_ONE_OF_NATIONAL_MUSEUM_OR_HOLYROODHOUSE', 'Very short Edinburgh trips gain more value from a concentrated Old Town + New Town itinerary than from attempting multiple outer neighborhoods. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:1', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_EDINBURGH_CASTLE + ROYAL_MILE + NATIONAL_MUSEUM + HOLYROOD + NEW_TOWN AND: retain_ONE_BLOCK_FOR_CALTON_HILL_OR_ARTHURS_SEAT', 'Three to four nights provide Edinburgh''s strongest first-time balance of medieval history, royal heritage, museums, Georgian architecture, landscapes and evening culture. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:2', 'edinburg', 'add_DEAN_VILLAGE + STOCKBRIDGE_BOTANICS + LEITH_BRITANNIA', 'Longer stays allow Edinburgh''s residential neighborhoods, waterfront, gardens and wider cultural experiences to be explored without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:3', 'edinburg', 'consider_ONE_OF_ROSSLYN_CHAPEL + SOUTH_QUEENSFERRY + EAST_LOTHIAN + STIRLING', 'Edinburgh becomes a stronger extended base when central-city sightseeing is combined with one or more contrasting heritage, coastal or countryside excursions. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:4', 'edinburg', 'prefer_BOUTIQUE_OR_LUXURY_HOTEL + DEAN_VILLAGE + CALTON_HILL + FINE_DINING + RELAXED_NEW_TOWN_EVENING AND: reduce_DAILY_MUSEUM_COUNT', 'Edinburgh''s romantic strength comes from historic architecture, scenic viewpoints, atmospheric neighborhoods, premium hotels and dining rather than nonstop attraction scheduling. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:5', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_NATIONAL_MUSEUM + CAMERA_OBSCURA + DYNAMIC_EARTH + ZOO_OR_BRITANNIA AND: include_GARDEN_OR_PARK_BREAKS', 'Families benefit from combining interactive museums and heritage with outdoor recreation rather than continuous history-heavy sightseeing. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:6', 'edinburg', 'prefer_FIVE_STAR_OR_HERITAGE_HOTEL + PRIVATE_GUIDE + PREMIUM_DINING + CHAUFFEUR_SELECTIVELY AND: add_PRIVATE_COUNTRYSIDE_OR_STIRLING_EXCURSION_IF_RELEVANT', 'Edinburgh''s strongest luxury positioning combines prestigious accommodation, private heritage interpretation, Scottish gastronomy and premium regional touring. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:7', 'edinburg', 'prefer_CENTRAL_VALUE_HOTEL_OR_HOSTEL + WALKING + BUS_OR_TRAM + FREE_MUSEUMS_AND_GALLERIES AND: limit_TAXIS + FESTIVAL_PEAK_DATES + EXCESSIVE_PAID_ATTRACTIONS', 'Edinburgh accommodation can be expensive, but extensive walking, public transport, free museums, galleries, parks and viewpoints significantly improve value. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:8', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_EDINBURGH_CASTLE + ROYAL_MILE + NATIONAL_MUSEUM + HOLYROODHOUSE + SCOTTISH_PARLIAMENT', 'Edinburgh concentrates royal, military, religious, political and national history within a comparatively compact urban area. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:9', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_OLD_TOWN + WRITERS_MUSEUM + SCOTTISH_LITERARY_HERITAGE + BOOKSHOPS + STORYTELLING_OR_LITERARY_WALK', 'Edinburgh has an internationally significant literary identity associated with historic and contemporary Scottish writing and was the world''s first UNESCO City of Literature. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:10', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_CASTLE_INTERIORS + CROWN_AND_ROYAL_HISTORY + MILITARY_HERITAGE + CASTLE_VIEWPOINTS AND: reserve_TIMED_ENTRY_IN_ADVANCE', 'Edinburgh Castle is the city''s defining paid heritage attraction and high-demand entry periods can sell out, particularly in summer and during festivals. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:11', 'edinburg', 'combine_CASTLE_ESPLANADE + ST_GILES + HISTORIC_CLOSES + VICTORIA_STREET_OR_GRASSMARKET', 'The Royal Mile is most valuable when treated as a complete medieval urban landscape rather than simply a walking route between Edinburgh Castle and Holyrood. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:12', 'edinburg', 'verify_CURRENT_PUBLIC_OPENING_STATUS AND: combine_WITH_SCOTTISH_PARLIAMENT + HOLYROOD_PARK_IF_RELEVANT', 'As a working royal residence, visitor access can be affected by royal use, ceremonial activity and seasonal operating arrangements. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:13', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_EDINBURGH_CASTLE + PALACE_OF_HOLYROODHOUSE + ROYAL_MILE + ROYAL_YACHT_BRITANNIA_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Edinburgh provides an unusually strong sequence of medieval, early-modern and modern royal heritage across the Castle, Holyrood and Britannia. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:14', 'edinburg', 'check_WEATHER + WIND + VISIBILITY + FOOTWEAR + MOBILITY AND: allocate_APPROXIMATELY_2_TO_3_HOURS_BASED_ON_ROUTE', 'Arthur''s Seat is a volcanic hill rather than a conventional paved viewpoint and requires appropriate conditions and physical capability. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:15', 'edinburg', 'replace_WITH_CALTON_HILL_OR_INDOOR_CULTURAL_SIGHTSEEING', 'Exposed slopes and uneven terrain make Arthur''s Seat considerably less suitable during poor weather. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:16', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_CALTON_HILL OVER: ARTHURS_SEAT', 'Calton Hill provides one of Edinburgh''s strongest city panoramas with substantially lower walking intensity than the ascent of Arthur''s Seat. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:17', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_NEW_TOWN + CHARLOTTE_SQUARE + GEORGE_STREET + ST_ANDREW_SQUARE + PRINCES_STREET_GARDENS', 'Edinburgh''s planned Georgian New Town forms a defining part of the UNESCO World Heritage property and provides a major architectural contrast with the medieval Old Town. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:18', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_NATIONAL_MUSEUM_OF_SCOTLAND + NATIONAL_GALLERY + MODERN_ART_BASED_ON_INTEREST', 'Edinburgh combines major national collections covering Scottish history, natural sciences, world cultures, fine art and modern art, with several institutions offering free general admission. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:19', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_CAMERA_OBSCURA + DYNAMIC_EARTH + NATIONAL_MUSEUM AND: combine_WITH_PRINCES_STREET_GARDENS_OR_ZOO', 'Interactive interpretation works particularly well for families when balanced with parks, wildlife or shorter outdoor experiences. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:20', 'edinburg', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_OR_LONGER AND: prepare_FOR_HILLY_WALKING', 'Edinburgh Zoo is a substantial attraction on sloping terrain and works best as a dedicated family or wildlife experience rather than a short city-centre add-on. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:21', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_LEITH + BRITANNIA AND: combine_WITH_THE_SHORE_OR_WATERFRONT_DINING', 'Britannia becomes a stronger half-day experience when combined with Leith''s historic waterfront and dining scene. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:22', 'edinburg', 'use_TRAM_OR_BUS_WHERE_SUITABLE AND: combine_BRITANNIA + THE_SHORE + FOOD_OR_DRINK', 'Leith is well connected to central Edinburgh and provides a strong contrast between royal maritime history and contemporary waterfront culture. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:23', 'edinburg', 'include_MODERN_SCOTTISH_CUISINE + SEAFOOD + PUB_FOOD + LOCAL_SCOTTISH_PRODUCT AND: retain_ONE_HIGH_QUALITY_RESTAURANT_EXPERIENCE', 'Edinburgh''s food scene extends well beyond traditional haggis through Scottish seafood, beef, game, bakeries, international cuisine and contemporary fine dining. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:24', 'edinburg', 'combine_ONE_QUALITY_TASTING_OR_WHISKY_EXPERIENCE + SCOTTISH_DINING AND: avoid_DRINKING_AND_DRIVING', 'Whisky is an important element of Edinburgh''s visitor experience but is best incorporated selectively alongside wider Scottish gastronomy and culture. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:25', 'edinburg', 'combine_HISTORIC_PUB + LIVE_MUSIC_OR_THEATRE + ONE_NON_ROYAL_MILE_AREA AND: consider_GRASSMARKET + COWGATE + NEW_TOWN + LEITH_BASED_ON_STYLE', 'Edinburgh nightlife extends beyond Royal Mile tourist pubs through live music, whisky bars, cocktail venues, theatres, comedy and neighborhood nightlife. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:26', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_EVENT_SCHEDULE + ADVANCE_TICKETS + CENTRAL_TRANSPORTABLE_HOTEL AND: reduce_NORMAL_DAILY_SIGHTSEEING_COUNT', 'Major Edinburgh festivals can substantially change street conditions, attraction demand, restaurant availability and realistic sightseeing pace. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:27', 'edinburg', 'expect_EXTREME_VISITOR_PRESSURE + VERY_HIGH_ACCOMMODATION_DEMAND + FESTIVAL_CONGESTION AND: book_HOTEL + MAJOR_ATTRACTIONS + FESTIVAL_TICKETS + IMPORTANT_RESTAURANTS_EARLY', 'The Edinburgh Festival Fringe, Edinburgh International Festival, Royal Edinburgh Military Tattoo and other major cultural events overlap during August, creating the city''s strongest annual demand period. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:28', 'edinburg', 'reserve_TICKET_WELL_IN_ADVANCE AND: allow_EXTRA_ACCESS_TIME_AROUND_CASTLE_ESPLANADE', 'The Royal Edinburgh Military Tattoo is one of Edinburgh''s highest-demand seasonal events and operates directly in the Castle precinct during the busy August festival period. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:29', 'edinburg', 'combine_DEAN_VILLAGE + WATER_OF_LEITH + WEST_END_OR_STOCKBRIDGE', 'Dean Village provides greater itinerary value when integrated into the surrounding riverside walking network instead of being treated as a brief isolated photography stop. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:30', 'edinburg', 'combine_STOCKBRIDGE + ROYAL_BOTANIC_GARDEN + INVERLEITH_OR_WATER_OF_LEITH', 'Stockbridge works particularly well as a relaxed half-day neighborhood experience combining cafés, independent shopping, gardens and local atmosphere. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:31', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_ROYAL_BOTANIC_GARDEN + STOCKBRIDGE AND: check_INDIVIDUAL_GLASSHOUSE_OR_SPECIAL_EXHIBITION_STATUS_SEPARATELY', 'The Royal Botanic Garden provides one of Edinburgh''s strongest free green-space experiences, while individual facilities or exhibitions can operate under separate access arrangements. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:32', 'edinburg', 'combine_BEACH + PROMENADE + CAFE_OR_LOCAL_DINING AND: use_BUS_OR_OTHER_SUITABLE_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT', 'Portobello provides Edinburgh''s strongest urban seaside contrast but works best as a relaxed neighborhood excursion rather than a rapid sightseeing stop. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:33', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_ARTHURS_SEAT_OR_HOLYROOD_PARK + BOTANIC_GARDEN + WATER_OF_LEITH AND: consider_PORTOBELLO_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Edinburgh combines volcanic hills, major gardens, riverside corridors and coastline within the wider urban destination. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:34', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_CASTLE_AREA_EARLY + VICTORIA_STREET_EARLY + CALTON_HILL_GOLDEN_HOUR + DEAN_VILLAGE + ARTHURS_SEAT_WHEN_SUITABLE', 'Early and late hours improve atmosphere and reduce crowd pressure at Edinburgh''s most photographed historic streets and viewpoints. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:35', 'edinburg', 'prefer_CENTRAL_ACCESSIBLE_HOTEL + SHORT_WALKING_CLUSTERS + BUS_TRAM_OR_TAXI_FOR_LONGER_TRANSFERS AND: reduce_STEEP_OLD_TOWN_CLIMBS + ARTHURS_SEAT + LONG_COBBLED_WALKING', 'Edinburgh is highly rewarding for seniors but its gradients, cobbles, castle terrain and elevation changes require considerably more mobility planning than flatter European city destinations. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:36', 'edinburg', 'increase_WALKING + BOTANIC_GARDEN + DEAN_VILLAGE + ARTHURS_SEAT_WHEN_WEATHER_ALLOWS AND: retain_RAIN_AND_WIND_PROTECTION', 'Increasing daylight and improving temperatures make spring one of Edinburgh''s strongest periods for mixed heritage, gardens and outdoor sightseeing. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:37', 'edinburg', 'expect_LONG_DAYLIGHT + STRONG_OUTDOOR_SIGHTSEEING + HIGHER_VISITOR_PRESSURE AND: book_MAJOR_ATTRACTIONS_AND_HOTELS_EARLY', 'Early and mid-summer provide Edinburgh''s longest daylight and generally strongest outdoor conditions, but tourism demand and accommodation pressure rise substantially. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:38', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_FESTIVALS + PREBOOKED_CASTLE + EVENING_EVENTS + FLEXIBLE_WALKING_BLOCKS AND: reduce_NORMAL_ATTRACTION_DENSITY', 'August should be treated as a festival destination period rather than a normal sightseeing month because city-centre congestion and event schedules materially affect itinerary pace. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:39', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_WALKING + ARTHURS_SEAT + DEAN_VILLAGE + STOCKBRIDGE + CULTURE + FOOD', 'September commonly provides a strong post-festival balance between relatively mild conditions, cultural activity and more manageable visitor pressure. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:40', 'edinburg', 'increase_MUSEUMS + GALLERIES + FOOD + WHISKY + HISTORIC_INTERIORS AND: retain_SHORTER_OUTDOOR_BLOCKS', 'Cooling temperatures, increasing rainfall and shorter daylight progressively increase the value of Edinburgh''s strong indoor cultural and gastronomic inventory. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:41', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_CHRISTMAS_ATMOSPHERE + MUSEUMS + FOOD + PUBS + NEW_TOWN_EVENINGS AND: expect_SHORT_DAYLIGHT + SEASONAL_DEMAND', 'December combines strong festive atmosphere with limited daylight, cold weather and periods of increased accommodation and entertainment demand. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:42', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_MUSEUMS + GALLERIES + CASTLE + FOOD + WHISKY + THEATRE AND: reduce_LONG_OUTDOOR_PROGRAMS_DURING_POOR_WEATHER', 'Winter''s short daylight, cold temperatures and changeable weather favor Edinburgh''s substantial indoor cultural inventory while often providing lower visitor pressure outside special events. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:43', 'edinburg', 'replace_EXTENDED_WALKING_WITH_NATIONAL_MUSEUM + NATIONAL_GALLERY + CAMERA_OBSCURA + DYNAMIC_EARTH_OR_OTHER_INDOOR_ATTRACTION AND: retain_FLEXIBLE_BUS_TRAM_OR_TAXI_PLAN', 'Edinburgh weather remains changeable throughout the year, making its extensive museum, gallery and indoor attraction inventory essential for resilient itinerary design. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:44', 'edinburg', 'reduce_OR_REPLACE_HILL_WALK AND: use_CALTON_HILL_IF_SAFE_OR_INDOOR_CULTURAL_ALTERNATIVE', 'Arthur''s Seat and Salisbury Crags are exposed landscapes where wind, rain and poor visibility can materially reduce comfort and suitability. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:45', 'edinburg', 'reduce_ARTHURS_SEAT + STEEP_CLOSES + UNEVEN_HISTORIC_WALKING AND: increase_MUSEUMS + GALLERIES + PUBLIC_TRANSPORT_USAGE', 'Ice and snow can significantly increase difficulty on Edinburgh''s slopes, steps, cobbled streets and natural hill routes. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:46', 'edinburg', 'prefer_TRAM_OR_AIRPORT_BUS_FOR_STANDARD_TRAVEL AND: use_TAXI_OR_PRIVATE_TRANSFER_FOR_HEAVY_LUGGAGE + MOBILITY_LIMITATIONS + PREMIUM_TRAVEL', 'Edinburgh Airport has direct public-transport connections to the city centre, making a rental car unnecessary for most arriving city-break travelers. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:47', 'edinburg', 'prefer_TRAM_OR_BUS_WHERE_SUITABLE', 'Leith and the Royal Yacht Britannia area are directly connected with central Edinburgh by frequent urban public transport. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:48', 'edinburg', 'prefer_BUS_OR_TAXI_BASED_ON_TRAVELER_NEEDS', 'Edinburgh Zoo lies west of the principal historic centre and is more efficiently reached by road-based public transport than by incorporating it into a central walking itinerary. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:49', 'edinburg', 'prefer_BUS_OR_OTHER_SUITABLE_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT', 'Portobello is easily incorporated as a separate coastal excursion without requiring a private vehicle or hotel change. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:50', 'edinburg', 'prefer_WALKING AND: use_LOTHIAN_BUSES + EDINBURGH_TRAMS + SELECTIVE_TAXI_AS_REQUIRED', 'Edinburgh''s principal visitor districts are geographically compact, while public transport is most valuable for longer movements and reducing repeated elevation changes. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:51', 'edinburg', 'consider_BUS_OR_TAXI_FOR_DIFFICULT_ELEVATION_CHANGES', 'Map distance alone understates the physical difficulty created by Edinburgh''s steep gradients, bridges, closes and elevation differences. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:52', 'edinburg', 'avoid_RENTAL_CAR_FOR_PRIMARY_EDINBURGH_CITY_ITINERARY AND: use_WALKING + PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + SELECTIVE_TAXIS', 'A car is generally unnecessary for Edinburgh''s principal visitor areas and can add parking, restricted-access and traffic friction to an otherwise walkable and transit-connected itinerary. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:53', 'edinburg', 'retain_ONE_EDINBURGH_HOTEL_BASE AND: use_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT_FOR_PORTOBELLO_OR_LOCAL_COASTAL_MOVEMENTS', 'Edinburgh''s coastal districts can generally be explored without unnecessary hotel changes. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:54', 'edinburg', 'consider_STIRLING_AS_DAY_TRIP_OR_SECONDARY_STOP', 'Stirling provides a strong extension of Edinburgh''s royal and national-history narrative through its castle, Old Town and central role in Scottish history. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:55', 'edinburg', 'consider_EDINBURGH_BASE + ONE_SECONDARY_SCOTTISH_REGION AND: avoid_USING_EDINBURGH_AS_BASE_FOR_EVERY_DISTANT_HIGHLAND_EXCURSION', 'Edinburgh is an excellent Scottish gateway, but Highlands, Inverness, Aberdeen, Glasgow and other distant regions become more enjoyable when unnecessary repeated long-distance day travel is reduced. ---'),
  ('edinburg:rule:56', 'edinburg', 'prioritize_EDINBURGH_CASTLE + ROYAL_MILE + NATIONAL_MUSEUM_OR_HOLYROOD + GEORGIAN_NEW_TOWN AND: add_ARTHURS_SEAT + DEAN_VILLAGE + LEITH_ONLY_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'These experiences provide Edinburgh''s strongest first introduction to Scottish history, medieval heritage, royal culture, architecture, museums and the city''s dramatic urban landscape. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:0', 'dublin', 'prioritize_TRINITY_COLLEGE + MEDIEVAL_DUBLIN + GEORGIAN_OR_TEMPLE_BAR AND: choose_ONE_OF_GUINNESS_OR_KILMAINHAM', 'Very short Dublin trips gain more value from a concentrated historic-core itinerary than from attempting both city and coastal sightseeing. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:1', 'dublin', 'prioritize_TRINITY + MEDIEVAL_DUBLIN + GEORGIAN_DUBLIN + GUINNESS + KILMAINHAM AND: retain_ONE_EVENING_FOR_PUB_OR_LIVE_MUSIC', 'Three to four nights provide Dublin''s strongest first-time balance of literature, history, architecture, gastronomy and nightlife. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:2', 'dublin', 'add_PHOENIX_PARK + DOCKLANDS_EPIC + HOWTH_OR_DUBLIN_BAY', 'Longer stays allow Dublin''s coastal, family, emigrant-history and urban-nature experiences to be explored without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:3', 'dublin', 'consider_ONE_OF_MALAHIDE + DUN_LAOGHAIRE + WICKLOW + BRU_NA_BOINNE', 'Dublin becomes a stronger extended base when the central-city itinerary is combined with one or more contrasting coastal, archaeological or countryside excursions. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:4', 'dublin', 'prefer_GEORGIAN_OR_LUXURY_HOTEL + HOWTH_OR_DUBLIN_BAY + FINE_DINING + LIVE_MUSIC AND: reduce_DAILY_MUSEUM_COUNT', 'Dublin''s romantic strength comes from atmospheric streets, coastline, restaurants, historic pubs and relaxed evening experiences rather than nonstop sightseeing. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:5', 'dublin', 'prioritize_DUBLINIA + EPIC + PHOENIX_PARK_OR_DUBLIN_ZOO + TRINITY AND: include_PARK_OR_COASTAL_BREAKS', 'Families benefit from combining interactive history with outdoor experiences rather than continuous cathedral and museum scheduling. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:6', 'dublin', 'prefer_FIVE_STAR_OR_BOUTIQUE_HOTEL + PRIVATE_GUIDE + PREMIUM_DINING + CHAUFFEUR_SELECTIVELY AND: add_PRIVATE_WICKLOW_OR_COASTAL_EXCURSION_IF_RELEVANT', 'Dublin''s strongest luxury positioning combines heritage accommodation, private cultural interpretation, modern Irish gastronomy and premium regional touring. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:7', 'dublin', 'prefer_CENTRAL_VALUE_HOTEL_OR_HOSTEL + WALKING + TFI_LEAP_CARD + FREE_MUSEUMS AND: limit_TAXIS + PREMIUM_NIGHTLIFE + EXCESSIVE_PAID_ATTRACTIONS', 'Dublin accommodation can be expensive, but walking, integrated public transport, parks and free national cultural institutions significantly improve value. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:8', 'dublin', 'prioritize_MEDIEVAL_DUBLIN + KILMAINHAM_GAOL + GPO_AREA + NATIONAL_MUSEUM + DUBLIN_CASTLE_WHEN_OPEN', 'Dublin contains Viking, medieval, British-administration, revolutionary and independence-era heritage within a comparatively compact urban area. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:9', 'dublin', 'prioritize_TRINITY_COLLEGE + MOLI + NATIONAL_LIBRARY + JAMES_JOYCE_HERITAGE + LITERARY_WALK_OR_PUB', 'Dublin is internationally recognized as a UNESCO City of Literature and has an unusually dense literary heritage associated with globally influential writers. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:10', 'dublin', 'prioritize_BOOK_OF_KELLS + OLD_LIBRARY + COLLEGE_GROUNDS AND: reserve_TIMED_ENTRY_IN_ADVANCE', 'Trinity College is one of Dublin''s defining cultural landmarks and should be treated as a complete university-and-literature experience rather than only a manuscript viewing stop. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:11', 'dublin', 'combine_CHRIST_CHURCH + DUBLINIA + ST_PATRICKS + MARSHS_LIBRARY_IF_RELEVANT', 'This compact district provides the capital''s strongest concentration of medieval, Viking and ecclesiastical heritage. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:12', 'dublin', 'do_NOT_PLAN_NORMAL_PUBLIC_CASTLE_VISIT AND: substitute_CHESTER_BEATTY + MEDIEVAL_DUBLIN + GEORGIAN_OR_NATIONAL_MUSEUM_SIGHTSEEING', 'Heritage Ireland confirms Dublin Castle is closed to the public from 5 May through 31 December 2026 to accommodate Ireland''s EU Presidency. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:13', 'dublin', 'prioritize_KILMAINHAM_GAOL + GPO_AREA + NATIONAL_MUSEUM + CITY_CENTER_HISTORY AND: book_KILMAINHAM_IN_ADVANCE', 'Kilmainham Gaol and the central revolutionary-history sites are essential for understanding the Easter Rising, independence struggle and formation of modern Ireland. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:14', 'dublin', 'prioritize_GUINNESS_STOREHOUSE + LIBERTIES AND: combine_WITH_LOCAL_HISTORY_OR_FOOD', 'The Guinness experience works best when placed within the wider industrial and neighborhood history of the Liberties rather than treated as an isolated drink stop. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:15', 'dublin', 'combine_ONE_DISTILLERY_OR_GUIDED_TASTING + QUALITY_IRISH_DINING AND: avoid_DRINKING_AND_DRIVING', 'Dublin''s whiskey heritage is best experienced through dedicated tasting or distillery experiences without unnecessary road transport. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:16', 'dublin', 'include_MODERN_IRISH_CUISINE + SEAFOOD + PUB_FOOD + LOCAL_ARTISAN_PRODUCT AND: retain_ONE_HIGH_QUALITY_RESTAURANT_EXPERIENCE', 'Official Dublin tourism positioning reflects a food scene extending from traditional pubs and seafood to markets, contemporary restaurants and Michelin-level dining. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:17', 'dublin', 'combine_TRADITIONAL_PUB + LIVE_MUSIC + ONE_NON_TEMPLE_BAR_AREA AND: avoid_TEMPLE_BAR_ONLY_PLANNING', 'Dublin''s nightlife extends well beyond Temple Bar through traditional music pubs, live venues, cocktail bars, theatres and multiple evening districts. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:18', 'dublin', 'prioritize_AUTHENTIC_TRAD_SESSION_OR_MUSIC_VENUE AND: consider_MERRION_ROW + SMITHFIELD_OR_OTHER_SPECIALIST_PUBS', 'Traditional music remains a living part of Dublin''s cultural identity and can be experienced throughout the city rather than only in tourist-focused Temple Bar venues. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:19', 'dublin', 'prioritize_MERRION_SQUARE + FITZWILLIAM_SQUARE_AREA + GEORGIAN_STREETS + NATIONAL_CULTURAL_INSTITUTIONS', 'Georgian Dublin provides one of the city''s defining architectural landscapes and combines naturally with literature, parks, museums and photography. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:20', 'dublin', 'prioritize_NATIONAL_MUSEUM + NATIONAL_GALLERY + EPIC + CHESTER_BEATTY_BASED_ON_INTEREST', 'Dublin combines major free national collections with specialist museums covering art, archaeology, manuscripts, emigration and Irish social history. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:21', 'dublin', 'prioritize_DUBLINIA + EPIC AND: combine_WITH_PHOENIX_PARK_OR_DUBLIN_ZOO', 'Interactive interpretation works particularly well for families when balanced with outdoor recreation. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:22', 'dublin', 'prioritize_PHOENIX_PARK + HOWTH + DUBLIN_BAY AND: consider_WICKLOW_IF_FULL_DAY_AVAILABLE', 'Dublin combines major urban parkland with unusually convenient access to coastline and nearby mountain landscapes. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:23', 'dublin', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_IF_COMBINING_ZOO + WALKING_OR_CYCLING', 'Phoenix Park covers approximately 1,750 acres and includes Dublin Zoo, cycling and walking routes, historic monuments, gardens and wild fallow deer. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:24', 'dublin', 'use_DART_WHERE_SUITABLE AND: combine_HARBOUR + SEAFOOD + COASTAL_WALK_OR_VIEWPOINT', 'Howth provides one of Dublin''s strongest city-to-coast contrasts and is particularly effective as a half-day or relaxed full-day excursion. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:25', 'dublin', 'consider_HOWTH + DUN_LAOGHAIRE_OR_OTHER_DART_CONNECTED_COASTAL_STOPS AND: avoid_OVERLOADING_MULTIPLE_COASTAL_TOWNS_IN_ONE_SHORT_DAY', 'Dublin''s rail-connected coastline is best appreciated through one or two focused coastal districts rather than rapid station-hopping. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:26', 'dublin', 'prioritize_TRINITY_EARLY + TEMPLE_BAR_EARLY_MORNING + GEORGIAN_DUBLIN + LIFFEY_BLUE_HOUR + HOWTH', 'Early and late hours improve light and atmosphere while reducing crowd pressure at Dublin''s most photographed central locations. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:27', 'dublin', 'prefer_CENTRAL_HOTEL + SHORT_WALKING_CLUSTERS + BUS_OR_TAXI_FOR_LONGER_TRANSFERS AND: reduce_COBBLED_WALKING + LONG_COASTAL_TRAILS + MULTIPLE_STANDING_TOURS', 'Dublin is relatively manageable for seniors, but historic surfaces, long walking days and older buildings create localized mobility challenges. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:28', 'dublin', 'increase_WALKING + PARKS + GEORGIAN_DUBLIN + COASTAL_SIGHTSEEING AND: retain_RAIN_PROTECTION', 'Increasing daylight and generally improving temperatures make spring one of Dublin''s strongest periods for mixed indoor and outdoor touring. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:29', 'dublin', 'expect_LONG_DAYLIGHT + HIGHER_VISITOR_PRESSURE + HIGHER_ACCOMMODATION_COST AND: book_MAJOR_ATTRACTIONS_AND_HOTELS_EARLY', 'Summer provides Dublin''s longest daylight and strongest outdoor conditions, but tourism demand and accommodation pressure reduce value and crowd comfort. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:30', 'dublin', 'prioritize_WALKING + HOWTH + PHOENIX_PARK + CULTURE + FOOD', 'September commonly provides a strong balance between relatively mild conditions and reduced pressure compared with the busiest summer period. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:31', 'dublin', 'increase_MUSEUMS + LITERATURE + FOOD + PUB_CULTURE AND: retain_SHORTER_OUTDOOR_BLOCKS', 'Cooling weather and shorter daylight progressively increase the value of Dublin''s strong indoor cultural and gastronomic inventory. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:32', 'dublin', 'prioritize_MUSEUMS + PUBS + LIVE_MUSIC + LITERATURE + FOOD AND: reduce_LONG_COASTAL_OR_PARK_PROGRAMS', 'Short daylight and cool, damp conditions favour Dublin''s museums, historic interiors, food scene and evening culture. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:33', 'dublin', 'replace_EXTENDED_WALKING_WITH_NATIONAL_MUSEUM + NATIONAL_GALLERY + EPIC + CHESTER_BEATTY_OR_OTHER_INDOOR_ATTRACTION AND: retain_FLEXIBLE_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT_PLAN', 'Irish weather remains changeable throughout the year, making Dublin''s extensive indoor cultural inventory particularly valuable. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:34', 'dublin', 'reduce_OR_REPLACE_COASTAL_WALK AND: retain_HOWTH_HARBOUR + SEAFOOD_OR_CITY_MUSEUM_ALTERNATIVE', 'Exposed coastal routes can become considerably less comfortable or appropriate during poor weather. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:35', 'dublin', 'prefer_DART_WHERE_SUITABLE', 'Rail provides a straightforward connection between central Dublin and one of the capital''s strongest coastal sightseeing areas. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:36', 'dublin', 'prefer_DART_WHERE_SUITABLE', 'The coastal rail corridor makes Dún Laoghaire a practical public-transport excursion from the city centre. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:37', 'dublin', 'prefer_WALKING + TFI_LEAP_CARD AND: use_DUBLIN_BUS + LUAS + DART_AS_REQUIRED', 'Dublin''s central visitor districts are highly walkable, while the TFI network allows integrated travel across bus, Luas, DART and eligible commuter rail services. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:38', 'dublin', 'avoid_RENTAL_CAR_FOR_PRIMARY_DUBLIN_CITY_ITINERARY AND: use_WALKING + PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + SELECTIVE_TAXIS', 'A car is generally unnecessary for Dublin''s principal visitor areas and can add parking and traffic friction to an otherwise walkable and transit-connected itinerary. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:39', 'dublin', 'retain_ONE_DUBLIN_HOTEL_BASE AND: use_DART_FOR_COASTAL_DAY_TRIPS', 'Howth, Dún Laoghaire and other Dublin Bay locations can generally be explored without unnecessary hotel changes. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:40', 'dublin', 'consider_DUBLIN_BASE + ONE_SECONDARY_REGION AND: avoid_USING_DUBLIN_AS_BASE_FOR_EVERY_DISTANT_IRELAND_EXCURSION', 'Dublin is an excellent national gateway, but longer-distance regions become more enjoyable when overnight bases reduce repeated travel. ---'),
  ('dublin:rule:41', 'dublin', 'prioritize_TRINITY_COLLEGE + MEDIEVAL_DUBLIN + GEORGIAN_DUBLIN + GUINNESS_OR_KILMAINHAM AND: add_PHOENIX_PARK_OR_HOWTH_ONLY_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'These experiences provide Dublin''s strongest first introduction to literature, Irish history, architecture, gastronomy and contemporary city culture. ---'),
