  ('cappadocia:rule:3', 'cappadocia', 'Cave hotel luxury + Hot Air Balloon #1 world + Fairy Chimneys + Rose Valley sunset + Love Valley + Pigeon Valley + Uchisar Castle sunset + pottery + best honeymoon adventure Turkey + best balloon world + 5★ cave $200-$600 + Museum Hotel $400-$800 + Argos $300-$600 + Sacred House $300-$600 + boutique cave $100-$300 + cave hotels + Hot Air Balloon #1 world + Fairy Chimneys + Rose Valley sunset + Love Valley + Pigeon Valley + Uchisar Castle sunset + pottery + best honeymoon adventure Turkey + best balloon world + must + 2-3N + private car + guide + private balloon + private cave hotel', NULL),
  ('cappadocia:rule:4', 'cappadocia', 'Hot Air Balloon #1 world + Fairy Chimneys + Love Valley + Rose Valley + Pigeon Valley + Ihlara Valley + Underground Cities + Uchisar Castle + horse riding + ATV + hiking + best adventure Turkey + best balloon world + Fairy Chimneys + Love Valley + Rose Valley + Pigeon Valley + Ihlara Valley + Uchisar Castle + Goreme + Avanos + best nature Turkey + best valleys world + best fairy chimneys world + must + 2-3N + dolmus + private car + balloon + ATV + horse + hiking ---', NULL),
  ('amman:rule:0', 'amman', 'Focus exclusively on the hilltop Amman Citadel, descend to the ancient Roman Theater, explore the bustling markets of Downtown Al-Balad, and finish with authentic local cuisine at Hashem Restaurant and Habibah Sweets.', 'A single day requires concentrating on central historic landmarks and core street-food culture to maximize sight-seeing efficiency within Amman''s urban core.'),
  ('amman:rule:1', 'amman', 'Dedicate Day 1 to the Amman Citadel, Roman Theater, and Rainbow Street; take a Day 2 trip north to the Greco-Roman ruins of Jerash and Ajloun Castle; and reserve Day 3 for The Jordan Museum, art galleries in Jabal Weibdeh, and modern shopping in Abdali.', 'A 3-day window provides a balanced mix of Amman''s ancient heritage, a premier northern excursion, and contemporary local culture.'),
  ('amman:rule:2', 'amman', 'Cover all major Amman urban districts, launch full day trips north to Jerash and Ajloun, head south to the mosaic city of Madaba and Mount Nebo, and spend multi-day leisure time floating at the Dead Sea and visiting the Baptism Site.', 'Extended stays allow travelers to use Amman as a complete regional hub, venturing to surrounding holy sites, ancient cities, and therapeutic natural wonders.'),
  ('amman:rule:3', 'amman', 'Book a structured itinerary covering Amman Citadel, Roman Theater, a walking food tour in Downtown Al-Balad, sunset views from Rainbow Street, and a day excursion to Jerash.', 'First-time visitors experience Jordan''s core historic narrative—spanning Roman, Umayyad, and modern Levantine eras—without logistical complexity.'),
  ('amman:rule:4', 'amman', 'Stay at a boutique hotel in Jabal Amman, reserve private rooftop dinners overlooking the lit-up city skyline, stroll through art galleries in Jabal Weibdeh, and combine city exploring with a luxury wellness stay on the Dead Sea.', 'Combining hilltop boutique views, fine Levantine dining, and Dead Sea spa luxury delivers an intimate, scenic, and romantic itinerary.'),
  ('amman:rule:5', 'amman', 'Plan a comfortable itinerary visiting the Roman Theater, the interactive Children''s Museum Jordan, the Royal Automobile Museum, pedestrian walks along Abdali Boulevard, and an easy day trip to Jerash.', 'Wide pedestrian spaces, engaging vehicle exhibits, and accessible ancient ruins offer a safe and entertaining environment for travelers of all ages.'),
  ('amman:rule:6', 'amman', 'Reserve 5-star accommodations in central Amman, utilize private chauffeured luxury transfers, hire expert private historians for Amman Citadel and Jerash, and arrange private VIP spa packages at the Dead Sea.', 'Amman offers world-class 5-star hospitality, private VIP airport handling, and high-end fine dining that elevate classical archaeological touring.'),
  ('amman:rule:7', 'amman', 'Stay in hostels or budget hotels in Downtown Al-Balad, utilize ride-hailing apps or local buses, leverage the Jordan Pass for free site entries, and dine on street food like falafel, shawarma, and fresh flatbreads.', 'Bundled entrance passes, affordable public sights, and cheap local food make Amman one of the most accessible historic capitals for budget travelers.'),
  ('amman:rule:8', 'amman', 'Combine urban hill walks with day trips into the pine forests of Ajloun, explore the Dana Bioreserve trails south of the city, and experience the unique marine geology of the Dead Sea.', 'Amman sits within short driving distance of northern forest reserves and the lowest land elevation on Earth, making nature day trips effortless.'),
  ('amman:rule:9', 'amman', 'Embark on street-food walks for falafel and knafeh in Downtown, take cooking classes at Beit Sitti in Jabal Weibdeh, sample festive dinners of Mansaf, and enjoy contemporary Levantine fusion dining on Rainbow Street.', 'Amman is a culinary capital offering everything from centuries-old street stalls to high-end Levantine gastronomy.'),
  ('amman:rule:10', 'amman', 'Use Amman as a launchpad for hiking sections of the Jordan Trail, canyoneering in nearby wadis like Wadi Mujib, or taking offbeat desert castle circuits into the eastern badia.', 'Rugged wadis and historic desert trails begin just outside the capital, perfect for thrill-seekers seeking physical challenges.'),
  ('amman:rule:11', 'amman', 'Utilize private chauffeured door-to-door transport, focus on flat or elevator-accessible sites like The Jordan Museum, take golf-cart or gentle walking routes at Jerash, and avoid steep, unpaved stair climbs between hills.', 'Navigating Amman''s steep geography via private transport avoids strenuous hill walking while ensuring full access to major archaeological highlights.'),
  ('amman:rule:12', 'amman', 'If stopping over for a 4 to 6-hour layover from Queen Alia Airport, hire a private airport taxi directly to the Amman Citadel for panoramic views, grab a quick lunch on Rainbow Street, and return for your flight.', 'The Citadel is easily reachable from the airport highway, allowing transit travelers to capture sweeping capital views efficiently.'),
  ('amman:rule:13', 'amman', 'Visit the iconic King Abdullah I Mosque, explore early Christian heritage at Madaba and Mount Nebo, and make a sacred pilgrimage to the Baptism Site of Jesus Christ (Bethany Beyond the Jordan).', 'The region surrounding Amman hosts pivotal Holy Land sites spanning early Islamic architecture, Byzantine mosaic art, and sacred biblical rivers. ---'),
  ('petra:rule:0', 'petra', 'Walk through the shaded canyon of The Siq, emerge at Al-Khazneh (The Treasury), explore the monumental Royal Tombs, walk the ancient Colonnaded Street, and visit the air-conditioned Petra Museum.', 'A single day requires focusing strictly on Petra''s core archaeological axis and iconic rock-cut monuments without undertaking exhausting multi-hour mountain stair climbs.'),
  ('petra:rule:1', 'petra', 'Dedicate Day 1 to the Main Trail featuring The Siq, Al-Khazneh, Royal Tombs, and Colonnaded Street; reserve Day 2 for ascending the 800 steps to Ad Deir (The Monastery) and exploring Little Petra (Siq al-Barid); and spend Day 3 hiking to the High Place of Sacrifice or the Al-Khubtha Treasury Viewpoint before experiencing Petra by Night.', 'A 3-day window allows travelers to thoroughly explore both the main valley floor and the dramatic high-elevation mountain viewpoints without physical burnout.'),
  ('petra:rule:2', 'petra', 'Cover the entire main Petra park and backcountry trails, undertake the full Jordan Trail Backdoor Route from Little Petra to the Monastery, trek remote summit peaks like Umm al-Biyara, and take regional day trips to the desert wilderness of Wadi Rum and the coastal waters of Aqaba.', 'Extended stays enable a comprehensive southern Jordan exploration, combining deep archaeological discovery with desert wilderness trekking and Red Sea relaxation.'),
  ('petra:rule:3', 'petra', 'Purchase a Jordan Pass prior to arrival, enter the site gate at 6:00 AM opening to walk through The Siq before crowds arrive, admire Al-Khazneh, explore the Royal Tombs, ascend to Ad Deir (The Monastery), and visit the Petra Museum.', 'First-time visitors experience Petra''s quintessential bucket-list monuments, world-famous sandstone views, and core historical narrative efficiently.'),
  ('petra:rule:4', 'petra', 'Stay at a luxury resort or desert bubble glamping dome, experience a candlelit evening walk during Petra by Night, take a private guided Backdoor Trail trek from Little Petra to Ad Deir, and enjoy a sunset Bedouin zarb dinner under the stars.', 'Combining dramatic desert canyon landscapes, luxury glamping amenities, candlelit walks, and intimate sunset vistas creates an unforgettable romantic escape.'),
  ('petra:rule:5', 'petra', 'Take a relaxed walk through The Siq, utilize authorized electric golf carts for younger children or grandparents, engage with interactive exhibits at the Petra Museum, enjoy short camel encounters along the Colonnaded Street, and relax with Bedouin storytelling in Wadi Musa.', 'Utilizing mobility support through the canyon and balancing outdoor ruin walks with interactive, climate-controlled museum visits keeps the experience safe and manageable for all ages.'),
  ('petra:rule:6', 'petra', 'Reserve 5-star accommodations adjacent to the main park gate, utilize private VIP transfers, hire a dedicated licensed expert archaeologist guide, arrange golf cart transport through The Siq, and enjoy private luxury Bedouin dining in a secluded desert canyon.', 'Top-tier resort stays right at the gate eliminate travel hassle, while private guides and VIP transport ensure exclusive, comfortable access to ancient history.'),
  ('petra:rule:7', 'petra', 'Purchase a multi-day Jordan Pass online to waive visa fees and cover entry, stay in budget guesthouses in upper Wadi Musa Town Center, pack water and snacks, eat local falafel and shawarma, and trek all main trails and Ad Deir steps on foot.', 'Pre-bundled digital passes, affordable local town dining, and self-guided trail networks make Petra exceptionally accessible for budget travelers.'),
  ('petra:rule:8', 'petra', 'Hike through the soaring sandstone walls of The Siq, explore the desert canyons of Little Petra (Siq al-Barid), trek the high cliff paths of the Al-Khubtha Trail, and take scenic backcountry mountain routes overlooking the vast Wadi Araba basin.', 'Petra is set within spectacular rose-red sandstone geology, providing a world-class sanctuary of desert canyons, mountain summits, and wild valley vistas.'),
  ('petra:rule:9', 'petra', 'Feast on traditional underground Bedouin Zarb barbecue, taste Jordan''s national lamb dish Mansaf, take a local cooking class at Petra Kitchen in Wadi Musa, and enjoy sweet Knafeh and cardamom-infused tea at mountain tea stalls inside the site.', 'Petra and Wadi Musa offer deep culinary traditions, highlighting ancient Bedouin earth-oven cooking methods and classic Levantine flavors.'),
  ('petra:rule:10', 'petra', 'Scramble up the ancient stone staircases to the High Place of Sacrifice, complete the backcountry Jordan Trail trek from Little Petra to the Monastery, climb the Al-Khubtha cliff trail to the high Treasury lookout, and tackle the remote summit trek of Umm al-Biyara.', 'Petra boasts miles of challenging rock stairways, steep cliff paths, and wild backcountry desert routes perfect for high-stamina adventurers.'),
  ('petra:rule:11', 'petra', 'Ride an authorized electric golf cart through The Siq to Al-Khazneh, stroll along flat sections of the Colonnaded Street, rest frequently at shaded canyon cafes, explore the accessible Petra Museum, and avoid unrailed mountain climbs.', 'Leveraging golf cart assistance through the long canyon and sticking to flat central valley paths allows senior travelers to appreciate iconic monuments without physical strain.'),
  ('petra:rule:12', 'petra', 'If taking a dedicated 12 to 14-hour express trip from Queen Alia International Airport or Aqaba, hire a direct private driver to Wadi Musa, walk through The Siq to view Al-Khazneh (The Treasury), have lunch along Tourism Street, and return immediately to your departure gateway.', 'Petra''s distance from major airports requires dedicated high-speed highway transfers, allowing express travelers to see the iconic Treasury facade before departing.'),
  ('petra:rule:13', 'petra', 'Visit the sacred peak of the High Place of Sacrifice, explore early Christian heritage and intricate 5th-century floor mosaics at the Byzantine Church, and take a day excursion to nearby Jabal Haroun (Aaron''s Mountain), the sacred burial site of the Prophet Aaron.', 'Petra holds rich spiritual history spanning ancient Nabataean sacrificial altars, early Christian mosaic sanctuaries, and revered Islamic-Judeo mountain pilgrimage sites. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:0', 'auckland', 'prioritize_CBD_WATERFRONT + SKY_TOWER_OR_CITY_VIEW AND: choose_ONE_OF_AUCKLAND_MUSEUM_OR_MAUNGAWHAU', 'A very short Auckland stay gains more value from concentrated city, harbour, cultural and volcanic sightseeing than from attempting a full offshore-island excursion. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:1', 'auckland', 'prioritize_CBD_WATERFRONT + AUCKLAND_MUSEUM + MAUNGAWHAU AND: retain_ONE_DAY_OR_HALF_DAY_FOR_WAIHEKE_OR_RANGITOTO_OR_DEVONPORT', 'Two to three nights provide Auckland''s essential first-time combination of harbour city, Māori and Pacific culture, volcanic heritage and one major Gulf experience. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:2', 'auckland', 'add_WAIHEKE + RANGITOTO_OR_DEVONPORT + NEIGHBORHOOD_OR_BEACH_TIME', 'Four to five nights provide the strongest balanced introduction to Auckland without forcing city, island and volcanic experiences into rushed combinations. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:3', 'auckland', 'add_WAITAKERE_WEST_COAST + MAUNGAKIEKIE + MISSION_BAY + PONSONBY_OR_K_ROAD', 'Longer stays allow Auckland''s regional nature, neighbourhood culture, beaches and additional volcanic landscapes to complement the core city and island program. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:4', 'auckland', 'consider_AUCKLAND_BASE + ONE_SECONDARY_NORTH_ISLAND_REGION AND: avoid_REPEATED_EXTREME_DISTANCE_DAY_TRIPS_FROM_AUCKLAND', 'Auckland is an excellent national gateway, but repeatedly returning to the city after long-distance North Island excursions creates unnecessary road fatigue. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:5', 'auckland', 'prefer_PREMIUM_WATERFRONT_HOTEL + WAIHEKE + HARBOUR_EXPERIENCE + FINE_DINING + FREE_TIME AND: add_PRIVATE_YACHT_OR_SCENIC_FLIGHT_IF_BUDGET_ALLOWS', 'Auckland''s strongest honeymoon positioning combines harbour scenery, Waiheke''s vineyards and beaches, premium dining and private experiences rather than continuous urban sightseeing. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:6', 'auckland', 'prioritize_AUCKLAND_MUSEUM + ZOO_MOTAT + WATERFRONT + BEACH_OR_SHORT_FERRY AND: include_PARK_AND_FOOD_BREAKS', 'Families benefit most from balancing interactive education, wildlife, transport experiences, parks and manageable outdoor sightseeing. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:7', 'auckland', 'reduce_RANGITOTO_LONG_WALKS + MULTIPLE_VOLCANIC_SUMMITS + LONG_WAITAKERE_HIKES AND: increase_ZOO + MOTAT + WESTERN_SPRINGS + MISSION_BAY + DEVONPORT', 'Rough lava, steep slopes, ferry timing and long regional walks can reduce comfort for younger children despite Auckland''s overall family friendliness. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:8', 'auckland', 'prefer_FIVE_STAR_WATERFRONT_HOTEL + CHAUFFEURED_TRANSFER + PRIVATE_WAIHEKE + PREMIUM_DINING AND: consider_YACHT_CHARTER + HELICOPTER + PRIVATE_WEST_COAST_TOUR', 'Auckland''s luxury strength lies in waterfront accommodation, private island touring, scenic aviation, yachting, gastronomy and wine. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:9', 'auckland', 'prefer_TRANSIT_CONNECTED_VALUE_HOTEL + WALKING + BUS_TRAIN + FREE_VOLCANIC_SITES AND: limit_PRIVATE_TRANSFERS + PREMIUM_WAIHEKE_TOURS + EXCESSIVE_CAR_HIRE', 'Free parks, maunga, public spaces and urban walking can reduce costs significantly, while ferry excursions and accommodation require selective budgeting. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:10', 'auckland', 'prioritize_AUCKLAND_MUSEUM + MAUNGAWHAU + MAUNGAKIEKIE + APPROPRIATE_CULTURAL_INTERPRETATION AND: use_TAMAKI_MAKAURAU_CONTEXT_NOT_GENERIC_NEW_ZEALAND_ONLY', 'Auckland''s Māori identity is embedded in its ancestral maunga, settlement history, place names, museum collections and contemporary cultural life. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:11', 'auckland', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_2_TO_4_HOURS_BASED_ON_INTEREST AND: combine_WITH_AUCKLAND_DOMAIN + PARNELL', 'Auckland Museum contains major Māori and Pacific collections as well as natural-history, military and social-history material, making it one of the city''s highest-value cultural attractions. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:12', 'auckland', 'verify_CURRENT_OPENING_HOURS + EXHIBITIONS + CULTURAL_PROGRAM_TIMES + ADMISSION', 'Museum programming, paid experiences, temporary exhibitions and operating hours can change and should be reconfirmed before travel. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:13', 'auckland', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_1_5_TO_3_HOURS AND: include_VOLCANIC_INTERPRETATION + MAORI_HERITAGE + SUMMIT_VIEW', 'Maungawhau is both a major volcanic viewpoint and a highly significant ancestral Māori pā landscape rather than merely a scenic hill. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:14', 'auckland', 'respect_DESIGNATED_PATHS + WAHI_TAPU + CURRENT_MAUNGA_RULES', 'Tūpuna maunga are culturally significant ancestral landscapes and should be visited according to current protection and access requirements. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:15', 'auckland', 'combine_MAUNGAKIEKIE + CORNWALL_PARK AND: allow_TIME_FOR_WALKING + HERITAGE + VOLCANIC_VIEWS', 'Maungakiekie / One Tree Hill and Cornwall Park combine an important Māori settlement landscape with major urban parkland and panoramic viewpoints. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:16', 'auckland', 'allocate_FULL_DAY_FOR_STANDARD_FIRST_VISIT AND: combine_ONE_OR_MORE_OF_VINEYARDS + ONEROA + BEACH + FOOD + ART', 'Waiheke lies approximately 40 minutes from downtown Auckland by passenger ferry but its principal attractions are spread across the island, making a full-day structure substantially stronger than a rushed turnaround. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:17', 'auckland', 'plan_ISLAND_TRANSPORT_BEFORE_ARRIVAL AND: choose_BUS + TAXI + TOUR + PRIVATE_DRIVER_BASED_ON_ITINERARY', 'Matiatia Wharf is the principal arrival point but vineyards, Onetangi, beaches and other attractions are distributed across the island. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:18', 'auckland', 'prebook_VINEYARDS_AND_TRANSPORT_DURING_BUSY_PERIODS AND: avoid_SELF_DRIVING_AFTER_MULTIPLE_TASTINGS', 'Waiheke''s wine experiences can experience high demand and responsible transport planning is essential when alcohol tasting forms part of the itinerary. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:19', 'auckland', 'book_FERRY_AND_KEY_EXPERIENCES_EARLY_WHERE_AVAILABLE AND: allow_EXTRA_CAPACITY_AND_QUEUE_BUFFER', 'Auckland Transport specifically notes limited Waiheke ferry capacity and recommends advance planning during busy periods. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:20', 'auckland', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_TO_FULL_DAY AND: prioritize_SUMMIT_TRACK + VOLCANIC_LANDSCAPE + OPTIONAL_LAVA_CAVES', 'Rangitoto is Auckland''s iconic volcanic island and the Summit Track alone requires meaningful walking time before optional extensions are added. ---');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('auckland:rule:21', 'auckland', 'carry_FOOD + 1_TO_2_LITRES_WATER_PER_PERSON + SUN_PROTECTION + WATERPROOF_LAYER + STURDY_SHOES', 'DOC advises visitors that food and drinking water are unavailable on Rangitoto and that rugged lava surfaces, exposed conditions and changeable weather require appropriate preparation. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:22', 'auckland', 'carry_TORCH AND: use_STURDY_FOOTWEAR', 'The lava-cave extension involves dark volcanic terrain and official visitor advice recommends carrying appropriate lighting and footwear. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:23', 'auckland', 'verify_FERRY_TIMES_BEFORE_DEPARTURE AND: build_RETURN_FERRY_BUFFER_INTO_WALKING_PLAN', 'The island depends primarily on scheduled ferry access for ordinary visitors, so missing the intended return sailing can materially disrupt the itinerary. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:24', 'auckland', 'follow_PEST_FREE_ISLAND_BIOSECURITY_RULES AND: check_clean_seal_FOOTWEAR_AND_GEAR', 'Rangitoto and Motutapu require strict biosecurity care to reduce the risk of introducing pests, soil, seeds and other threats to protected island ecosystems. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:25', 'auckland', 'assess_WALKING_ABILITY + LAVA_SURFACES + FERRY_ACCESS + WEATHER AND: consider_DEVONPORT_OR_WAIHEKE_SCENIC_PROGRAM_IF_UNSUITABLE', 'Rangitoto''s rough volcanic surfaces and sustained walking make it substantially more physically demanding than Auckland''s lower-intensity ferry excursions. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:26', 'auckland', 'combine_DEVONPORT_VILLAGE + MAUNGAUIKA_NORTH_HEAD + TAKARUNGA_MOUNT_VICTORIA_BASED_ON_MOBILITY', 'Devonport offers a compact mix of ferry travel, coastal heritage, Māori pā landscapes, military history and skyline viewpoints. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:27', 'auckland', 'prioritize_DEVONPORT OVER: RANGITOTO_SUMMIT', 'Devonport provides ferry scenery, shops, cafés and flexible walking without requiring the same level of outdoor preparation as Rangitoto. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:28', 'auckland', 'choose_MISSION_BAY_OR_EASTERN_BAYS_FOR_EASY_URBAN_BEACH AND: choose_PIHA_OR_WEST_COAST_FOR_DRAMATIC_SURF_COAST', 'Auckland''s east-coast urban beaches and rugged Tasman west coast deliver substantially different beach experiences and should not be positioned interchangeably. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:29', 'auckland', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_OR_FULL_DAY_WITH_WAITAKERE_CONTEXT AND: prefer_PRIVATE_CAR + RENTAL_CAR + GUIDED_TOUR_BASED_ON_TRAVELER_STYLE', 'Piha lies roughly an hour from central Auckland and works best as part of a dedicated west-coast excursion rather than a quick urban stop. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:30', 'auckland', 'check_CURRENT_SURF + PATROL + BEACH_SAFETY_CONDITIONS AND: swim_ONLY_WHERE_CURRENT_LOCAL_GUIDANCE_INDICATES_SAFE', 'Piha is a powerful surf beach where conditions differ significantly from Auckland''s more sheltered urban beaches. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:31', 'auckland', 'do_NOT_SCHEDULE_SUMMIT_ACCESS AND: use_PIHA_BEACH + OPEN_VIEWPOINTS + CURRENTLY_OPEN_TRACKS', 'As of the latest 2026 Auckland Council regional-parks update, the Lion Rock summit track remains closed because of instability and major storm damage. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:32', 'auckland', 'verify_CURRENT_TRACK_STATUS_BEFORE_DEPARTURE AND: use_ONLY_OPEN_AUTHORISED_TRACKS', 'Although many tracks have reopened, Auckland Council continues to maintain closures and rehabilitation work across parts of the western regional-park network. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:33', 'auckland', 'clean_FOOTWEAR_AND_EQUIPMENT + USE_CLEANING_STATIONS + STAY_ON_TRACK', 'Kauri dieback remains an important environmental threat, and official guidance requires visitors to minimise the movement of contaminated soil and respect protected-track systems. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:34', 'auckland', 'recheck_TRACKS + ROAD_ACCESS + LANDSLIP_RISK AND: replace_WITH_CITY_CULTURE_IF_NEEDED', 'Auckland''s western regional parks contain steep forest and coastal terrain that can be affected by slips, erosion and storm damage. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:35', 'auckland', 'prioritize_ONE_OF_RANGITOTO + WAITAKERE_WEST_COAST + MAUNGAKIEKIE + MAUNGAWHAU AND: choose_BASED_ON_PHYSICAL_INTENSITY + WEATHER + AVAILABLE_TIME', 'Auckland offers multiple levels of nature experience ranging from accessible urban maunga and parks to volcanic-island hiking and rugged west-coast forest. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:36', 'auckland', 'prioritize_CORNWALL_PARK + MISSION_BAY + AUCKLAND_DOMAIN + WATERFRONT OVER: RANGITOTO_LONG_WALKS + RUGGED_WAITAKERE_TRACKS', 'These city-based options provide landscape and recreation with substantially lower transport and physical demands. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:37', 'auckland', 'consider_RANGITOTO_HIKING + WAIHEKE_ZIPLINING + KAYAKING + SAILING + WEST_COAST_SURFING + SKY_ACTIVITIES', 'Auckland''s adventure strength comes from combining a major city with volcanoes, islands, harbour activities and surf-oriented coastal environments. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:38', 'auckland', 'prioritize_MAUNGAWHAU_GOLDEN_HOUR + WATERFRONT_BLUE_HOUR + DEVONPORT_SKYLINE + WAIHEKE + WEST_COAST', 'Auckland''s photographic strength comes from combining skyline, harbour, volcanoes, vineyards, islands and dramatic coastal landscapes. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:39', 'auckland', 'combine_SKY_TOWER + VIADUCT_WYNYARD + BRITOMART + DEVONPORT_VIEWPOINT', 'These locations provide contrasting elevated, waterfront, architectural and across-harbour perspectives of central Auckland. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:40', 'auckland', 'include_CONTEMPORARY_NEW_ZEALAND + MAORI_INFLUENCE + PACIFIC_CUISINE + ASIAN_DINING + SEAFOOD AND: retain_ONE_QUALITY_WAIHEKE_OR_CITY_RESTAURANT_EXPERIENCE', 'Auckland''s multicultural population and access to New Zealand produce give it one of the country''s broadest restaurant and culinary inventories. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:41', 'auckland', 'prioritize_WAIHEKE AND: consider_KUMEU_OR_MATAKANA_ONLY_WITH_ADDITIONAL_TIME_AND_REGIONAL_TRANSPORT', 'Waiheke offers the most convenient major wine experience directly associated with a standard central-Auckland itinerary. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:42', 'auckland', 'combine_COMMERCIAL_BAY_QUEEN_STREET + NEWMARKET + PONSONBY_BASED_ON_STYLE', 'Auckland''s shopping inventory ranges from central-city retail and luxury brands to independent boutiques and local design districts. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:43', 'auckland', 'prioritize_PONSONBY + K_ROAD + DEVONPORT + LOCAL_CAFES + NEIGHBORHOOD_DINING', 'Auckland becomes substantially more interesting for repeat visitors when the itinerary moves beyond landmark sightseeing into neighbourhood culture and everyday urban life. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:44', 'auckland', 'combine_VIADUCT_OR_BRITOMART_DINNER + PONSONBY_OR_K_ROAD_BARS + SAFE_LATE_TRANSPORT', 'Auckland''s nightlife is strongest through restaurants, cocktail bars, live venues and urban social districts rather than a single concentrated resort-style entertainment zone. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:45', 'auckland', 'prioritize_VIADUCT + WYNYARD + BRITOMART_QUAY_STREET AND: consider_HARBOUR_CRUISE_OR_DEVONPORT_FERRY', 'Auckland''s identity is fundamentally linked to its harbours, marinas, ferry network and sailing culture. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:46', 'auckland', 'verify_CURRENT_DEPARTURE_TIME + WEATHER + OPERATOR_STATUS AND: do_NOT_GUARANTEE_WILDLIFE_SIGHTINGS_UNLESS_PRODUCT_SPECIFIC_TERMS_SUPPORT_IT', 'Marine and wildlife experiences remain dependent on weather, operating conditions and natural animal movement. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:47', 'auckland', 'prioritize_AUCKLAND_MUSEUM + MOTAT + AUCKLAND_ZOO AND: combine_WITH_WESTERN_SPRINGS_OR_WATERFRONT_BREAKS', 'These attractions provide Auckland''s strongest combination of culture, technology, aviation, wildlife and interactive family learning. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:48', 'auckland', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_OR_COMBINE_WITH_AUCKLAND_ZOO_BASED_ON_ENERGY AND: verify_CURRENT_EXHIBITION_AND_SITE_ACCESS', 'MOTAT occupies a significant family sightseeing block and should not be treated as a quick stop between distant Auckland attractions. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:49', 'auckland', 'verify_CURRENT_EVENT_DATES + VENUE + TRANSPORT_CHANGES + HOTEL_DEMAND AND: reduce_NORMAL_SIGHTSEEING_DENSITY', 'Major Auckland cultural and sporting events can significantly alter accommodation availability, road conditions and central-city visitor pressure. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:50', 'auckland', 'prefer_CENTRAL_HOTEL + SHORT_CLUSTER_WALKS + TAXI_OR_RIDESHARE_SUPPORT AND: reduce_RANGITOTO_SUMMIT + MULTIPLE_MAUNGA_CLIMBS + RUGGED_WAITAKERE_TRAILS', 'Auckland is senior-friendly at city level, but its volcanic and natural attractions can significantly increase physical intensity. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:51', 'auckland', 'increase_BEACHES + WAIHEKE + SAILING + RANGITOTO + OUTDOOR_DINING AND: book_PEAK_DEMAND_PRODUCTS_EARLIER', 'Auckland summer provides the strongest warm-weather island and beach conditions, but Christmas, New Year and school-holiday periods increase demand. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:52', 'auckland', 'increase_WAIHEKE + WALKING + FOOD_AND_WINE + VOLCANIC_SIGHTSEEING AND: retain_LIGHT_RAIN_LAYER', 'Autumn generally combines mild conditions with excellent food, vineyard and outdoor sightseeing opportunities. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:53', 'auckland', 'increase_AUCKLAND_MUSEUM + ART_GALLERY + MOTAT + FOOD + CULTURAL_EVENTS AND: retain_CLEAR_WEATHER_BLOCKS_FOR_MAUNGA_AND_WATERFRONT', 'Winter is cooler, wetter and sometimes windy, but Auckland remains a strong cultural and gastronomy destination year-round. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:54', 'auckland', 'increase_ISLAND_TRIPS + COASTAL_WALKS + GARDENS + CYCLING + VOLCANIC_SIGHTSEEING AND: retain_WEATHER_FLEXIBILITY', 'Spring brings longer daylight and increasingly mild conditions while remaining changeable enough to justify adaptable scheduling. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:55', 'auckland', 'retain_FLEXIBLE_AUCKLAND_PROGRAM AND: move_BETWEEN_INDOOR_AND_OUTDOOR_ATTRACTIONS_AS_CONDITIONS_CHANGE', 'Auckland''s maritime climate can produce sunshine, cloud and showers within the same day, so ordinary rainfall does not automatically require cancelling sightseeing. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:56', 'auckland', 'replace_LONG_VOLCANIC_WALKS + WAITAKERE_HIKING_WITH_AUCKLAND_MUSEUM + ART_GALLERY + MOTAT + SHOPPING + FOOD AND: use_ROAD_TRANSPORT_MORE_SELECTIVELY', 'Auckland has sufficient museum, cultural, retail and culinary inventory to build a strong poor-weather itinerary. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:57', 'auckland', 'recheck_FERRY_OPERATIONS + HARBOUR_CRUISES + SKY_TOWER + EXPOSED_VIEWPOINTS', 'Wind can materially affect marine services, exposed volcanic sites and elevated attractions even when rainfall is limited. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:58', 'auckland', 'suspend_NONESSENTIAL_ISLAND_TRIPS + EXPOSED_COASTAL_HIKES + REMOTE_REGIONAL_PARK_PROGRAMS AND: follow_METservice + AUCKLAND_EMERGENCY_AND_OPERATOR_GUIDANCE', 'Severe rain and wind can affect ferries, roads, flooding, slips and coastal safety, so official emergency guidance should override normal tourism scheduling. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:59', 'auckland', 'consider_AIRPORTLINK_TO_PUHINUI + TRAIN_TO_CENTRAL_AUCKLAND', 'AirportLink connects both airport terminals with Puhinui Station, providing an integrated public-transport route into Auckland''s wider rail network. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:60', 'auckland', 'prefer_DIRECT_COACH + TAXI + RIDESHARE + PREBOOKED_TRANSFER_BASED_ON_COMFORT', 'Direct road transport avoids luggage transfers and can provide substantially simpler arrival logistics for families, premium travelers and mobility-limited visitors. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:61', 'auckland', 'allow_TRAFFIC_BUFFER AND: avoid_FIXED_MAJOR_ATTRACTION_IMMEDIATELY_AFTER_INTERNATIONAL_ARRIVAL', 'Central Auckland is approximately 30_TO_35_MINUTES from the airport under favorable road conditions, but traffic and international-arrival processing can materially extend the total journey. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:62', 'auckland', 'prefer_WALKING + BUS + TRAIN AND: use_TAXI_OR_RIDESHARE_FOR_STEEP_OR_INCONVENIENT_CONNECTIONS', 'Central Auckland''s waterfront and CBD are highly walkable in clusters, while public transport reduces unnecessary parking and traffic friction. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:63', 'auckland', 'prefer_FERRY_FROM_DOWNTOWN', 'The ferry provides both practical transport and one of Auckland''s simplest scenic harbour experiences. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:64', 'auckland', 'verify_FERRY_OPERATOR + DEPARTURE_TIME + TICKET_TYPE + PAYMENT_METHOD', 'Multiple Waiheke services operate and ticketing / contactless rules differ between operators. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:65', 'auckland', 'do_NOT_ASSUME_STANDARD_CONTACTLESS_BANK_CARD_TAGGING AND: use_VALID_FULLERS_TICKET_OR_SUPPORTED_AT_HOP_ARRANGEMENT', 'Auckland Transport explicitly excludes Fullers360 Waiheke services from its general contactless-payment system. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:66', 'auckland', 'AT_HOP_OR_SUPPORTED_CONTACTLESS_PAYMENT_CAN_BE_USED AND: consider_ADVANCE_BOOKING_DURING_BUSY_PERIODS', 'Island Direct participates in supported AT HOP and contactless payment arrangements, but capacity remains limited. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:67', 'auckland', 'purchase_OPERATOR_APPROPRIATE_TICKET AND: do_NOT_ASSUME_AT_HOP_VALIDITY', 'AT HOP is not valid on the standard Rangitoto tourist ferry service, which requires operator-specific ticketing. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:68', 'auckland', 'use_AT_HOP_OR_SUPPORTED_CONTACTLESS_PAYMENT AND: tag_ON_AND_OFF_CORRECTLY', 'Cash is not accepted for ordinary Auckland bus boarding and travelers should use one of the supported electronic payment methods. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:69', 'auckland', 'use_ONE_PAYMENT_METHOD_PER_TRAVELER AND: use_THE_SAME_CARD_OR_DEVICE_FOR_TAG_ON_AND_TAG_OFF', 'Auckland Transport requires correct individual tagging to calculate fares and does not allow one contactless bank card to function as a shared payment method for multiple passengers. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:70', 'auckland', 'avoid_RENTAL_CAR_FOR_CBD + DEVONPORT + STANDARD_FERRY_ITINERARY AND: use_WALKING + PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + SELECTIVE_RIDESHARE', 'Parking, traffic and vehicle logistics generally provide limited value when a short Auckland itinerary is concentrated around central and ferry-accessible attractions. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:71', 'auckland', 'consider_RENTAL_CAR_OR_PRIVATE_TOUR_FOR_SELECTED_DAYS AND: avoid_PAYING_FOR_UNUSED_CITY_CAR_DAYS_IF_NOT_REQUIRED', 'A vehicle becomes more useful when the itinerary moves into dispersed west-coast and regional destinations rather than central Auckland. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:72', 'auckland', 'use_AUCKLAND_FOR_MAORI_CULTURE + HARBOUR + VOLCANIC_LANDSCAPE + FOOD + ISLAND_EXPERIENCE AND: continue_TO_OTHER_NEW_ZEALAND_REGIONS_IF_ALPINE_OR_GEOTHERMAL_OR_EXTENDED_WILDERNESS_TRAVEL_IS_REQUIRED', 'Auckland provides an unusually broad introduction to contemporary New Zealand, but it should not be treated as a substitute for every landscape and experience elsewhere in the country. ---'),
  ('auckland:rule:73', 'auckland', 'prioritize_AUCKLAND_WATERFRONT + AUCKLAND_MUSEUM + MAUNGAWHAU AND: add_WAIHEKE_OR_RANGITOTO_BASED_ON_TRAVEL_STYLE', 'These experiences provide Auckland''s strongest first introduction to harbour identity, Māori and Pacific culture, volcanic heritage and the Hauraki Gulf. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:0', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_QUEENSTOWN_BAY + SKYLINE_BOBS_PEAK AND: choose_ONE_OF_SHOTOVER_JET_OR_CENTRAL_LAKE_CRUISE', 'A very short Queenstown stay gains more value from concentrated lake, alpine-view and one signature experience than from attempting distant regional excursions. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:1', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_QUEENSTOWN_BAY + SKYLINE + ONE_SIGNATURE_ADVENTURE AND: retain_ONE_HALF_DAY_OR_DAY_FOR_ARROWTOWN_OR_GIBBSTON_OR_GLENORCHY', 'Two to three nights provide Queenstown''s essential combination of alpine scenery, Lake Whakatipu and one regional or adventure experience without excessive road time. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:2', 'queenstown', 'add_ARROWTOWN + GIBBSTON_OR_WALTER_PEAK + GLENORCHY AND: retain_ONE_BLOCK_FOR_HIKING_OR_CYCLING_OR_SECOND_ADVENTURE', 'Four to five nights create a strong balanced introduction combining the resort core with wine, heritage, wilderness and outdoor activity. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:3', 'queenstown', 'add_MOKE_LAKE + DEEPER_GLENORCHY + QUEENSTOWN_TRAIL + MULTIPLE_ACTIVITY_OPTIONS AND: consider_SECOND_SKI_DAY_OR_LONGER_HIKE_BASED_ON_SEASON', 'Longer stays allow Queenstown''s surrounding valleys, trails, mountain environments and quieter scenic experiences to complement headline attractions. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:4', 'queenstown', 'consider_QUEENSTOWN_BASE + ONE_SECONDARY_SOUTH_ISLAND_BASE AND: avoid_REPEATED_EXTREME_DISTANCE_DAY_TRIPS_FROM_QUEENSTOWN', 'Queenstown is an excellent Southern Lakes gateway, but repeatedly returning after very long regional road journeys can create unnecessary travel fatigue. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:5', 'queenstown', 'prefer_PREMIUM_LAKE_VIEW_HOTEL + GIBBSTON_WINE + SCENIC_EXPERIENCE + FINE_DINING + FREE_TIME AND: add_PRIVATE_HELICOPTER_OR_HOT_POOL_OR_PRIVATE_CRUISE_IF_BUDGET_ALLOWS', 'Queenstown''s strongest honeymoon positioning combines alpine scenery, lake views, wine, privacy and premium experiential travel rather than continuous adrenaline activities. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:6', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_SKYLINE + QUEENSTOWN_GARDENS + ARROWTOWN + WALTER_PEAK_OR_LAKE_CRUISE AND: include_ONE_OR_TWO_AGE_APPROPRIATE_ADVENTURE_ACTIVITIES', 'Families benefit most from balancing scenery, interactive activities, heritage, lake experiences and manageable adventure rather than overloading extreme products. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:7', 'queenstown', 'reduce_BEN_LOMOND + MULTIPLE_EXTREME_ADVENTURES + LONG_REGIONAL_DRIVES AND: increase_SKYLINE + SNOWPLAY_IF_SEASONAL + QUEENSTOWN_GARDENS + ARROWTOWN + WALTER_PEAK', 'Long hikes, high-adrenaline products and repeated road journeys can reduce comfort for younger children despite Queenstown''s strong family appeal. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:8', 'queenstown', 'prefer_PREMIUM_LAKEFRONT_OR_LODGE + CHAUFFEURED_TRANSFER + PRIVATE_GLENORCHY_OR_WINE_TOUR + PREMIUM_DINING AND: consider_HELICOPTER + PRIVATE_BOAT + BESPOKE_SKI_OR_ALPINE_EXPERIENCE', 'Queenstown''s luxury strength lies in dramatic scenery, remote lodges, scenic aviation, wine, private transport and personalized alpine experiences. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:9', 'queenstown', 'prefer_BUS_CONNECTED_VALUE_HOTEL + WALKING + ORBUS + FREE_LAKEFRONT_AND_TRAILS AND: limit_PRIVATE_TRANSFERS + MULTIPLE_PREMIUM_ADVENTURES + UNUSED_RENTAL_CAR_DAYS', 'Queenstown can be expensive, but walking, public buses, free scenery and carefully selecting one or two signature paid experiences can control costs. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:10', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_ONE_OR_MORE_OF_SHOTOVER_JET + KAWARAU_BUNGY + NEVIS + SKYDIVING + RAFTING + PARAGLIDING AND: select_BASED_ON_RISK_TOLERANCE + AGE + WEIGHT + HEALTH + WEATHER', 'Queenstown offers an unusually broad adventure inventory, but each activity has different participant and operating requirements. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:11', 'queenstown', 'choose_KAWARAU_FOR_HISTORIC_FIRST_COMMERCIAL_BUNGY_CONTEXT OR: choose_NEVIS_FOR_MORE_EXTREME_REMOTE_VALLEY_EXPERIENCE', 'Kawarau and Nevis deliver substantially different settings, heights, logistics and psychological intensity. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:12', 'queenstown', 'verify_CURRENT_OPENING_HOURS + WEIGHT_RULES + MEDICAL_REQUIREMENTS + CHECK_IN AND: consider_COMBINING_WITH_GIBBSTON', 'Kawarau lies within the Gibbston / Kawarau corridor, making bungy and wine-region sightseeing geographically compatible when alcohol and driving are managed responsibly. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:13', 'queenstown', 'use_OPERATOR_TRANSPORT_TO_REMOTE_ACTIVITY_SITE AND: do_NOT_INSTRUCT_STANDARD_VISITORS_TO_SELF_DRIVE_DIRECTLY_TO_PLATFORM', 'The Nevis operation uses controlled access and dedicated transport into its remote valley environment. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:14', 'queenstown', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_1_TO_2_HOURS_TOTAL_BASED_ON_TRANSPORT AND: verify_WEATHER + RIVER_CONDITIONS + CURRENT_DEPARTURE_TIME', 'The boat ride itself is approximately 25 minutes, but check-in, briefing, transport and operational conditions require a larger itinerary block. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:15', 'queenstown', 'check_IN_APPROXIMATELY_30_MINUTES_BEFORE_BOOKED_TRIP AND: use_OPERATOR_SHUTTLE_OR_DIRECT_TRANSPORT_AS_APPROPRIATE', 'Shotover Jet operates from Arthurs Point rather than directly from Queenstown Bay and requires pre-ride preparation. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:16', 'queenstown', 'reconfirm_OPERATOR_STATUS AND: replace_WITH_INDOOR_OR_LOW_WEATHER_DEPENDENCE_ACTIVITY_IF_CANCELLED', 'Shotover Jet operates subject to weather and river conditions and can be suspended when conditions are unsafe. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:17', 'queenstown', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_2_TO_4_HOURS_BASED_ON_LUGE_DINING_AND_VIEWING AND: verify_SEPARATE_GONDOLA + LUGE + DINING + MTB_TIMES', 'Skyline Queenstown combines multiple products with different operating windows rather than one universal attraction schedule. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:18', 'queenstown', 'verify_CURRENT_UPLIFT_SEASON + TRAIL_STATUS + BIKE_PARK_OPERATION', 'Mountain-bike uplift is seasonal and should not be assumed to operate continuously throughout winter. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:19', 'queenstown', 'allocate_FULL_DAY_FOR_SUMMIT_FROM_QUEENSTOWN AND: allow_APPROXIMATELY_6_TO_8_HOURS + 14_KM_RETURN + 1438_M_ELEVATION_GAIN', 'DOC classifies the Ben Lomond summit route as a demanding climb requiring high fitness and substantial elevation gain. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:20', 'queenstown', 'check_WEATHER + SNOW_ICE + DAYLIGHT + FITNESS AND: carry_FOOD + WATER + WARM_LAYER + WATERPROOF_LAYER + APPROPRIATE_FOOTWEAR', 'Ben Lomond is an exposed alpine environment where conditions can change rapidly and snow or ice can occur outside mid-winter. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:21', 'queenstown', 'assess_CARDIO_FITNESS + JOINT_MOBILITY + WEATHER + ELEVATION_GAIN AND: replace_WITH_QUEENSTOWN_HILL_OR_SKYLINE_OR_LAKEFRONT_IF_UNSUITABLE', 'Ben Lomond is materially more physically demanding than Queenstown''s easier scenic walking options. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:22', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_QUEENSTOWN_GARDENS + LAKEFRONT + SELECTED_QUEENSTOWN_TRAIL_SECTIONS OVER: BEN_LOMOND_SUMMIT + REMOTE_BACKCOUNTRY_TRACKS', 'These central options provide strong lake and mountain scenery with substantially lower physical and transport demands. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:23', 'queenstown', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_OR_RELAXED_SCENIC_BLOCK AND: use_APPROPRIATE_VEHICLE + ALLOW_FOR_UNSEALED_ROAD + WEATHER', 'Moke Lake provides excellent mountain scenery close to Queenstown but its final road approach is unsealed and should not be treated as urban-road access. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:24', 'queenstown', 'follow_CURRENT_DOC_SIGNAGE AND: avoid_PENINSULA_AND_RESTRICTED_EROSION_AFFECTED_SECTIONS', 'DOC currently restricts mountain biking on parts of the Moke Lake Loop because of erosion. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:25', 'queenstown', 'allocate_MINIMUM_HALF_DAY AND: prefer_FULL_DAY_IF_ADDING_PARADISE + DART_RIVER + HIKING + FILM_LOCATIONS', 'Glenorchy is approximately 45 km from Queenstown and its scenery, road viewpoints and wilderness activities justify substantially more time than pure driving duration suggests. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:26', 'queenstown', 'allow_PHOTOGRAPHY_AND_VIEWPOINT_BUFFER_ON_QUEENSTOWN_GLENORCHY_ROAD AND: stop_ONLY_IN_SAFE_DESIGNATED_LOCATIONS', 'The road is a major scenic attraction in its own right, but narrow sections make unsafe roadside stopping inappropriate. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:27', 'queenstown', 'recheck_ROAD_CONDITIONS + OPERATOR_STATUS AND: allow_DELAY_OR_REPLACEMENT_PROGRAM', 'Alpine weather, slips, ice and road conditions can materially affect regional road travel. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:28', 'queenstown', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_2_TO_4_HOURS AND: include_BUCKINGHAM_STREET + CHINESE_SETTLEMENT + ARROW_RIVER + HERITAGE_CONTEXT', 'Arrowtown offers meaningful gold-rush and Chinese-settlement heritage in addition to scenic streets, cafés and shopping. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:29', 'queenstown', 'increase_PHOTOGRAPHY_TIME + WALKING_TIME AND: allow_FOR_HIGHER_VISITOR_DEMAND_AROUND_AUTUMN_FESTIVAL', 'Arrowtown''s autumn colours are among the region''s signature seasonal experiences and festival periods can increase demand. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:30', 'queenstown', 'combine_ARROWTOWN + GIBBSTON', 'Arrowtown and Gibbston form a geographically efficient heritage-and-wine regional itinerary from Queenstown. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:31', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_GIBBSTON AND: include_PINOT_NOIR + CELLAR_DOORS + WINERY_LUNCH_OR_CYCLING_BASED_ON_STYLE', 'Gibbston is Queenstown''s nearest major wine sub-region and a principal gateway to Central Otago Pinot Noir. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:32', 'queenstown', 'prebook_HIGH_DEMAND_CELLAR_DOORS_AND_RESTAURANTS AND: arrange_TOUR + TAXI + PRIVATE_DRIVER_OR_DESIGNATED_NON_DRINKING_DRIVER', 'Wine tastings and winery meals require both reservation and responsible transport planning during busy periods. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:33', 'queenstown', 'limit_ALCOHOL_TASTING_OR_USE_DESIGNATED_DRIVER', 'Driving after multiple tastings creates unnecessary road-safety risk and should not form part of responsible itinerary planning. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:34', 'queenstown', 'select_QUEENSTOWN_TRAIL_SECTION_BASED_ON_DISTANCE + ELEVATION + SURFACE + FITNESS AND: consider_E_BIKE_FOR_LONGER_REGIONAL_ROUTES', 'Queenstown''s trail network connects major regional destinations but different sections create materially different physical demands. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:35', 'queenstown', 'consider_SELECTED_QUEENSTOWN_TRAIL + GIBBSTON_RIVER_WINE_TRAIL + QUEENSTOWN_GARDENS_SECTIONS AND: verify_CURRENT_SURFACE_AND_ASSISTANCE_REQUIREMENTS', 'Official Queenstown accessibility guidance identifies several relatively accessible trail environments, although individual sections still require verification. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:36', 'queenstown', 'verify_CURRENT_VESSEL_OPERATION + DEPARTURE_TIME + ANNUAL_MAINTENANCE AND: do_NOT_GUARANTEE_VINTAGE_STEAMSHIP_DURING_MAINTENANCE_PERIOD', 'TSS Earnslaw normally operates extensively through the year but undergoes annual survey and maintenance. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:37', 'queenstown', 'allocate_APPROXIMATELY_HALF_DAY_BASED_ON_SELECTED_PRODUCT AND: combine_LAKE_CRUISE + FARM_OR_DINING_EXPERIENCE', 'Walter Peak experiences combine lake transport with dining, farm or heritage components and require more time than a simple boat crossing. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:38', 'queenstown', 'increase_SKIING + SNOWBOARDING + SNOWPLAY + APRES_SKI + HOT_POOLS + WINTER_SCENERY AND: book_ACCOMMODATION + SKI_PRODUCTS + TRANSPORT_EARLIER', 'Winter is one of Queenstown''s major peak seasons and snow-sport demand materially increases accommodation and mountain-service pressure. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:39', 'queenstown', 'compare_CORONET_PEAK + THE_REMARKABLES_BASED_ON_SKILL + ROAD + TERRAIN + DATES AND: check_DAILY_SNOW_REPORT + LIFT_STATUS + SKIBUS + ROAD_CONDITIONS', 'Queenstown''s principal ski fields have different terrain, access and operating dates, and daily mountain conditions matter more than fixed itinerary assumptions. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:40', 'queenstown', 'treat_AS_EARLY_WINTER_LIMITED_OPERATION AND: prioritize_BEGINNER_TERRAIN + SNOWPLAY + PEAK_GONDOLA_SIGHTSEEING', 'Coronet Peak''s special 2026 early-winter period operates from approximately 10:00–15:00 with focused beginner and snowplay terrain before full-mountain opening. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:41', 'queenstown', 'use_FULL_SEASON_OPERATION_BASELINE AND: verify_DAILY_OPEN_TERRAIN + WEATHER + LIFTS', 'Coronet Peak''s published 2026 full season runs from 13 June to 4 October with standard operations approximately 09:00–16:00 subject to conditions. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:42', 'queenstown', 'do_NOT_ASSUME_2026_SKI_OPERATION AND: consider_CORONET_PEAK_EARLY_SEASON_IF_APPROPRIATE', 'The Remarkables'' published 2026 season begins on 27 June, later than Coronet Peak''s 2026 early and full-season opening. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:43', 'queenstown', 'use_2026_SEASON_BASELINE AND: verify_DAILY_TERRAIN + ROAD + LIFT_STATUS', 'The Remarkables'' official 2026 season is scheduled from 27 June through 11 October, with daily operations approximately 09:00–16:00 subject to conditions. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:44', 'queenstown', 'check_CORONET_PEAK_CURRENT_NIGHT_SKI_CALENDAR AND: do_NOT_ASSUME_NIGHT_SKI_DAILY', 'Night skiing operates only on selected dates rather than throughout every winter evening. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:45', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_SNOWPLAY + GONDOLA_SIGHTSEEING + SPA + ARROWTOWN + WINE + LAKE_CRUISE + DINING', 'Queenstown remains a strong winter destination for non-skiers because alpine sightseeing, snowplay, food, wine and wellness continue alongside skiing. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:46', 'queenstown', 'increase_HIKING + CYCLING + LAKE_ACTIVITIES + GLENORCHY + JET_BOATING + OUTDOOR_DINING AND: book_PEAK_SUMMER_PRODUCTS_EARLIER', 'Queenstown summer offers long daylight and strong outdoor conditions, but Christmas, New Year and summer holidays create higher accommodation and activity demand. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:47', 'queenstown', 'increase_ARROWTOWN + PHOTOGRAPHY + WINE + HIKING + CYCLING AND: retain_WARM_LAYERS_FOR_COOLER_MORNINGS_AND_EVENINGS', 'Autumn combines distinctive colour, generally strong outdoor sightseeing and wine experiences with cooler temperatures and comparatively balanced visitor pressure. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:48', 'queenstown', 'combine_LATE_SKIIING_IF_OPEN + HIKING + CYCLING + WINE + GOLF + SCENIC_TOURING AND: retain_HIGH_WEATHER_FLEXIBILITY', 'Queenstown spring can offer snow-covered peaks alongside increasingly green valleys and multiple seasonal activities, but weather remains changeable. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:49', 'queenstown', 'retain_FLEXIBLE_QUEENSTOWN_PROGRAM AND: move_BETWEEN_OUTDOOR + WINE + FOOD + SPA + INDOOR_ACTIVITIES_AS_CONDITIONS_CHANGE', 'Ordinary alpine weather changes do not automatically require cancelling an entire Queenstown sightseeing day. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:50', 'queenstown', 'recheck_RIVER_ACTIVITIES + HIKING + GLENORCHY_ROADS + SCENIC_AVIATION AND: replace_WITH_WINE + SPA + DINING + SHOPPING + INDOOR_ADVENTURE_WHERE_NEEDED', 'Heavy rain can affect river levels, trail surfaces, road conditions and aviation while Queenstown still retains strong indoor and culinary alternatives. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:51', 'queenstown', 'recheck_SKYLINE + SCENIC_FLIGHTS + HELICOPTERS + PARAGLIDING + LAKE_CRUISES + SKI_LIFTS', 'Wind can materially affect elevated, airborne, marine and mountain experiences even when rainfall is limited. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:52', 'queenstown', 'recheck_HELICOPTER + FIXED_WING + ALPINE_SIGHTSEEING_PRODUCTS AND: do_NOT_GUARANTEE_SCENIC_FLIGHT_OPERATION', 'Scenic aviation requires suitable visibility and safe flying conditions and can be delayed or cancelled by weather. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:53', 'queenstown', 'recheck_AIRPORT_TRANSFER + SKI_ROADS + GLENORCHY_ROAD + REGIONAL_DRIVING AND: allow_ADDITIONAL_TRANSPORT_BUFFER', 'Snow and ice can affect mountain roads, regional routes, airport journeys and activity transfers. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:54', 'queenstown', 'suspend_NONESSENTIAL_ALPINE_HIKES + REMOTE_DRIVES + SCENIC_AVIATION + UNSAFE_WATER_ACTIVITIES AND: follow_METservice + DOC + NZSKI + ROAD_AND_OPERATOR_GUIDANCE', 'Official weather and operator safety information should override fixed tourism schedules during severe alpine conditions. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:55', 'queenstown', 'consider_ORBUS_PUBLIC_BUS AND: use_BEE_CARD_FOR_LOWEST_STANDARD_CURRENT_FARE_WHEN_PRACTICAL', 'Queenstown Airport is served by the local Orbus network, providing the lowest-cost standard transfer option for suitable travelers. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:56', 'queenstown', 'prefer_TAXI + UBER + SHUTTLE + PREBOOKED_PRIVATE_TRANSFER_BASED_ON_COMFORT', 'Door-to-door transport reduces luggage handling and provides simpler arrival logistics for families, premium travelers and mobility-limited visitors. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:57', 'queenstown', 'allow_FRANKTON_TRAFFIC_BUFFER AND: avoid_FIXED_MAJOR_ACTIVITY_IMMEDIATELY_AFTER_INTERNATIONAL_ARRIVAL', 'The airport is close to Queenstown, but traffic, immigration, baggage, weather and peak visitor periods can materially extend total arrival time. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:58', 'queenstown', 'prefer_WALKING AND: use_ORBUS_OR_TAXI_OR_RIDESHARE_FOR_STEEP_OR_LONGER_CONNECTIONS', 'Queenstown Bay, The Mall, Steamer Wharf, restaurants, Gardens and Skyline base form a compact central sightseeing cluster. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:59', 'queenstown', 'use_BEE_CARD_OR_CASH AND: do_NOT_ASSUME_STANDARD_BANK_CARD_PAYMENT_ON_BUS', 'Current Orbus guidance states that Queenstown buses accept Bee Card or cash and not standard bank or credit-card payment onboard. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:60', 'queenstown', 'prefer_BEE_CARD_FOR_REPEATED_OR_VALUE_FOCUSED_TRAVEL', 'The current adult Bee Card airport fare is substantially lower than the adult airport cash fare. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:61', 'queenstown', 'verify_CURRENT_FERRY_ROUTE + TIMETABLE + FARE + PAYMENT_METHOD', 'Queenstown ferry services have different fare and payment arrangements from standard buses and should be checked independently. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:62', 'queenstown', 'avoid_FULL_STAY_RENTAL_CAR_IF_ITINERARY_IS_CENTRAL + SKYLINE + SHOTOVER + CRUISE AND: use_WALKING + ORBUS + OPERATOR_SHUTTLES + SELECTIVE_TAXI', 'Parking and rental costs often provide limited additional value when a short itinerary is concentrated around central Queenstown and transport-supported activities. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:63', 'queenstown', 'consider_RENTAL_CAR_OR_PRIVATE_TOUR_FOR_SELECTED_DAYS AND: avoid_PAYING_FOR_UNUSED_CENTRAL_CAR_DAYS_IF_NOT_REQUIRED', 'A private vehicle becomes more valuable when the itinerary expands to dispersed regional scenery rather than central sightseeing. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:64', 'queenstown', 'increase_ROAD_CONDITION_CHECKS + CHAIN_PREPARATION + EXTRA_TRAVEL_TIME', 'Queenstown''s winter environment can introduce snow, ice and mountain-road restrictions not encountered during ordinary urban driving. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:65', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_BOBS_PEAK + GLENORCHY_ROAD + MOKE_LAKE + ARROWTOWN + LAKE_WHAKATIPU AND: schedule_BASED_ON_LIGHT + SEASON + WEATHER', 'Queenstown''s photographic strength comes from combining alpine peaks, reflective lakes, autumn colours, snow, historic streets and dramatic road landscapes. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:66', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_ARROWTOWN + LAKE_HAYES + QUEENSTOWN_GARDENS + GIBBSTON', 'Autumn transforms parts of the Whakatipu Basin into strong red, orange and gold landscapes particularly suited to photography. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:67', 'queenstown', 'include_MODERN_NEW_ZEALAND + CENTRAL_OTAGO_WINE + LOCAL_PRODUCE + CASUAL_LOCAL_FAVOURITES AND: retain_ONE_PREMIUM_RESTAURANT_EXPERIENCE_IF_BUDGET_ALLOWS', 'Queenstown combines a major resort restaurant scene with Central Otago wine and diverse dining beyond stereotypical pub food. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:68', 'queenstown', 'combine_CENTRAL_DINNER + BARS_OR_APRES + SAFE_LATE_TRANSPORT AND: reduce_LATE_NIGHT_ALCOHOL_IF_EARLY_SKI_HIKE_OR_DRIVE_NEXT_DAY', 'Queenstown has strong resort nightlife, but fatigue and alcohol can materially affect the safety and enjoyment of early outdoor programs. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:69', 'queenstown', 'combine_QUEENSTOWN_CBD + ARROWTOWN_BOUTIQUES AND: use_FRANKTON_FOR_PRACTICAL_LARGER_RETAIL_REQUIREMENTS', 'Queenstown offers visitor-oriented boutiques and outdoor retail in town while Frankton provides broader practical shopping. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:70', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_ARROWTOWN + CHINESE_SETTLEMENT + LAKES_DISTRICT_MUSEUM + TSS_EARNSLAW', 'Queenstown''s strongest heritage experiences combine gold-rush settlement history, Chinese mining heritage and Lake Whakatipu transport history. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:71', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_LAKEFRONT + SPA_OR_HOT_POOL + WINE + SCENIC_CRUISE + EASY_WALKS AND: reduce_MULTIPLE_ADRENALINE_PRODUCTS', 'Queenstown can function as a highly effective scenic relaxation destination despite its adventure-capital reputation. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:72', 'queenstown', 'prioritize_QUEENSTOWN_BAY + SKYLINE_BOBS_PEAK + ONE_SIGNATURE_ADVENTURE AND: add_ARROWTOWN_OR_GIBBSTON_OR_GLENORCHY_BASED_ON_TRAVEL_STYLE', 'These experiences provide Queenstown''s strongest first introduction to lake scenery, alpine geography, adventure identity and surrounding regional diversity. ---'),
  ('queenstown:rule:73', 'queenstown', 'use_QUEENSTOWN_FOR_ALPINE_SCENERY + ADVENTURE + CENTRAL_OTAGO_WINE + SOUTH_ISLAND_OUTDOOR_EXPERIENCE AND: continue_TO_OTHER_NEW_ZEALAND_REGIONS_IF_GEOTHERMAL + MAJOR_MAORI_CULTURAL + TROPICAL_COASTAL_OR_LARGE_CITY_EXPERIENCE_IS_REQUIRED', 'Queenstown provides an exceptional introduction to New Zealand''s alpine South Island identity but should not be treated as a substitute for every landscape and cultural experience elsewhere in the country. ---'),
