  ('dharamshala:rule:0', 'dharamshala', 'do not recommend Triund trek or a Kangra Valley day trip by default.', 'Short Dharamshala stays work best when time is concentrated around McLeod Ganj, Bhagsu, and Naddi rather than spread across distant or time-heavy add-ons.'),
