  ('sarahan:rule:1', 'sarahan', 'Too much for Sarahan alone unless adding Shrikhand Mahadev trek base 5-6 days + Buran Ghati trek base 3-4 days + birding + village walk + apple orchards stay + rest + acclimatisation.', '1N enough for temple + gateway + Shrikhand view + bird park + apple orchards + village walk + offbeat + quiet + silence + temple town.'),
