  ('hanle:rule:9', 'hanle', 'Arrange guided trekking, camping, or mountaineering-oriented excursions around Parkachik, the Nun-Kun region, and Suru Valley; reserve extra acclimatization and weather-buffer days.', 'Suru Valley is a gateway to high-altitude trekking and mountain terrain, where professional local guidance and flexible logistics are essential.'),
  ('hanle:rule:10', 'hanle', 'Stay in Kargil town, use a private vehicle for the War Memorial, Mulbekh, and short Suru Valley drives, and avoid strenuous walks, long unbroken journeys, and high-pass excursions.', 'Road-accessible heritage and landscape stops offer Kargil’s highlights with lower physical strain than remote trekking and high-altitude routes.'),
  ('hanle:rule:11', 'hanle', 'On the Srinagar–Leh road journey, schedule a Kargil overnight rather than forcing a same-day crossing; use the stop for local rest, meals, and a short town visit.', 'Kargil is a natural break on the trans-Himalayan route, while extended detours into Suru Valley require additional nights.'),
  ('hanle:rule:12', 'hanle', 'Prioritize the Kargil War Memorial at Drass, including its memorial galleries and the names of soldiers commemorated for the 1999 conflict; add Mulbekh Monastery for Buddhist heritage.', 'The Drass memorial is Kargil’s principal site of national remembrance, while Mulbekh contributes a distinct historical and religious layer through its rock-cut Maitreya imageDESTINATION DECISION RULES'),
  ('hanle:rule:13', 'hanle', 'Treat Hanle as a very limited stop only after reaching Leh first; focus on Hanle village, Hanle Monastery, and a short dark-sky experience, then return or overnight only if the schedule is already well acclimatized.', 'Hanle sits at extreme altitude and is not suitable for fast, same-day rush travel without prior acclimatization in Leh.'),
  ('hanle:rule:14', 'hanle', 'Use Hanle as the main destination: spend one day on arrival and village exploration, one night for stargazing, and one day for the Indian Astronomical Observatory and nearby Changthang viewpoints.', 'Hanle’s best experiences need at least 2 nights to balance acclimatization, astronomy, and slow exploration.'),
  ('hanle:rule:15', 'hanle', 'Build a wider eastern Ladakh circuit: Hanle, Umling La sector, Tso Moriri, Pangong, and possibly Nyoma, with buffer time for road and weather changes.', 'Hanle works best as part of a longer, flexible high-altitude itinerary rather than a tightly packed standalone stop.'),
  ('hanle:rule:16', 'hanle', 'Prioritize Hanle Dark Sky Reserve, Hanle Village & Monastery, a daytime Indian Astronomical Observatory visit, and a slow local cultural experience.', 'These are Hanle’s defining first-visit essentials and introduce its astronomy, culture, and landscape identity clearly.'),
  ('hanle:rule:17', 'hanle', 'Choose quiet homestays, private SUV transfers, sunset photography, and an Astro-Ambassador-led night-sky session.', 'Hanle is strongest for solitude, stargazing, and privacy rather than conventional luxury romance.'),
  ('hanle:rule:18', 'hanle', 'Base the family in Leh first, then go to Hanle only after 48 hours of acclimatization, keeping the first day in Hanle easy and short.', 'Extreme altitude and limited medical infrastructure make Hanle challenging for families, especially with young children.'),
  ('hanle:rule:19', 'hanle', 'Book the best available homestay, private rooms, heating, and a premium SUV with an experienced driver; combine Hanle with better comfort in Leh.', 'Hanle has limited luxury infrastructure, so premium travel here is mostly about private logistics and customized experiences.'),
  ('hanle:rule:20', 'hanle', 'Use community homestays, shared transport from Leh, homestay meals, and group astro-tours.', 'Hanle can be managed affordably, but transport and altitude-related essentials should never be compromised.'),
  ('hanle:rule:21', 'hanle', 'Focus on Changthang landscapes, village belts like Khaldo/Naga/Punguk/Gang, and wildlife-friendly scenic drives.', 'Hanle is one of Ladakh’s strongest nature destinations, with vast high-altitude plains, protected habitats, and open horizons.'),
  ('hanle:rule:22', 'hanle', 'Add Umling La, remote Changthang roads, and high-altitude driving with flexible timing and weather buffers.', 'Hanle is an excellent adventure base, but access depends heavily on road, weather, and local conditions.'),
  ('hanle:rule:23', 'hanle', 'Keep Hanle short, use private transport, avoid night driving, and limit walking and high-pass exertion.', 'Hanle’s altitude, cold, and remoteness make it unsuitable for many senior travelers unless the plan is very conservative. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:0', 'bhalukpong', 'Treat Bhalukpong as a nature + heritage gateway express: prioritise Kameng River, Bhalukpong Fort and Tipi Orchid Centre; add Sessa Orchid Sanctuary only if it fits naturally into the onward Bomdila route.', 'Bhalukpong''s strongest short-visit combination is Kameng River + historical Fort + orchid landscape, while Tipi is only about 5 km away. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:1', 'bhalukpong', 'Build a classic Bhalukpong nature + adventure + cultural circuit with Kameng River, Bhalukpong Fort, Tipi Orchid Centre, Sessa Orchid Sanctuary and selected Pakke/Eaglenest experiences, while keeping time for relaxation.', 'Three days allow travellers to experience Bhalukpong itself while adding one dedicated wildlife/forest or orchid experience without making the itinerary excessively rushed. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:2', 'bhalukpong', 'Expand Bhalukpong into a Western Arunachal nature + culture circuit, combining Bhalukpong, Sessa, Bomdila, Dirang and Tawang, with additional time for Thembang, Eaglenest, Pakke or photography experiences.', 'Bhalukpong functions as the southern gateway to a much larger Western Arunachal circuit, with the official Tezpur–Bhalukpong–Bomdila–Tawang circuit covering about 350 km. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:3', 'bhalukpong', 'Build the itinerary around Kameng River, Bhalukpong Fort, Tipi Orchid Centre and Sessa Orchid Sanctuary, followed by Bomdila if continuing deeper into Arunachal.', 'These provide the strongest introduction to Bhalukpong''s river landscape, history, orchids, forests and gateway character. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:4', 'bhalukpong', 'Choose a comfortable private stay, arrange a private SUV, and prioritise Kameng riverside scenery, Tipi orchids, forest drives, scenic photography, private meals and relaxed evenings, using Bhalukpong as the opening stage before continuing toward Dirang/Tawang.', 'Bhalukpong''s romantic appeal comes from privacy, forests, rivers, mountain-road scenery and slow nature experiences, rather than nightlife or conventional luxury attractions. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:5', 'bhalukpong', 'Base the family in a comfortable hotel/resort or homestay, use a private SUV, and prioritise Kameng River, Tipi Orchid Centre, Bhalukpong Fort and easy scenic stops; add Sessa only if the children can manage the additional travel.', 'Bhalukpong offers a good combination of nature, education, light adventure and sightseeing, while private transport simplifies family logistics. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:6', 'bhalukpong', 'Select the best available premium accommodation, arrange a chauffeur-driven SUV and private guide, and emphasise privacy, curated nature experiences, premium meals, photography and seamless onward transfers.', 'Bhalukpong has limited conventional luxury infrastructure, so premium travel should focus on comfort, exclusivity, personalised transport and high-quality experiences rather than expecting a major luxury-resort destination. Arunachal Tourism lists accommodation ranging from budget hotels and guesthouses to homestays and hotels across its circuits. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:7', 'bhalukpong', 'Stay near Bhalukpong town/highway, use shared taxis or economical local transport, and prioritise Kameng River, Bhalukpong Fort and Tipi Orchid Centre, adding only one major paid/remote excursion.', 'Bhalukpong''s core attractions are relatively straightforward to combine, while the biggest budget pressure comes from private mountain transport and longer wildlife/forest excursions. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:8', 'bhalukpong', 'Prioritise Kameng River, Tipi Orchid Centre, Sessa Orchid Sanctuary, Pakke Tiger Reserve and Eaglenest Wildlife Sanctuary, with additional forest landscapes around the Bhalukpong–Bomdila road.', 'The region combines river ecosystems, dense forests, orchids, wildlife habitats, gorges and mountain landscapes. Sessa alone contains more than 200 orchid species and lies within the wider Kameng Protected Area Complex. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:9', 'bhalukpong', 'Add river rafting, angling, trekking, birdwatching, wildlife excursions, forest exploration and mountain-road experiences, depending on season and operating conditions.', 'River rafting and angling are specifically identified by Arunachal Tourism as principal tourist activities in Bhalukpong, while Sessa provides trekking opportunities through rugged forest terrain. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:10', 'bhalukpong', 'Choose a comfortable stay, use a private vehicle, prioritise Kameng River viewpoints, Tipi and Bhalukpong Fort, and limit strenuous trekking and long mountain drives.', 'Bhalukpong itself is at only about 213 m, but onward travel rapidly enters mountainous terrain; Sessa and the wider West Kameng landscape include steep, rugged terrain. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:11', 'bhalukpong', 'Use Bhalukpong as a 1-night gateway stop, prioritising Kameng River + Bhalukpong Fort + Tipi Orchid Centre, then continue toward Bomdila/Dirang/Tawang.', 'Bhalukpong is officially described as an entry point/gateway to Arunachal Pradesh and destinations such as Bomdila and Tawang, making it naturally suited to route-based travel. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:12', 'bhalukpong', 'Prioritise Bhalukpong Fort and its archaeological remains, then add Bomdila Monastery, Thembang and Chillipam Monastery when extending the itinerary.', 'Bhalukpong''s historic fort remains date to approximately the 10th–12th century, while the wider West Kameng circuit adds Buddhist monasteries and traditional settlements. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:13', 'bhalukpong', 'Choose a peaceful stay and reduce daily transfers, incorporating riverside relaxation, nature walks, scenic drives, leisurely meals, photography and quiet evenings; use Dirang for a stronger wellness component.', 'Bhalukpong works well for slow nature-based relaxation, while Dirang adds its well-known hot-water springs and valley environment. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:14', 'bhalukpong', 'Schedule outdoor activities in the morning and late afternoon, keep midday flexible for rest, and prioritise river, forest and orchid experiences rather than exhausting long-distance sightseeing.', 'Bhalukpong''s low elevation makes it considerably warmer than the higher settlements farther north, so itinerary pacing should become more conservative during hotter periods. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:15', 'bhalukpong', 'Treat Bhalukpong primarily as a nature + gateway + flexible itinerary destination, keeping road buffers, avoiding overly tight mountain schedules and confirming the operating status of rafting, trekking and forest excursions.', 'The region receives substantial monsoon rainfall, while Sessa''s southern slopes receive more than 3,000 mm annually; mountainous routes can therefore become more challenging during heavy rain. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:16', 'bhalukpong', 'Build a local Arunachali food experience around rice-based meals, momos, thukpa, local vegetables, fish and regional tribal-style dishes, complemented by a quality hotel/resort dinner.', 'Food is a supporting experience in Bhalukpong; the destination''s primary strengths remain nature, adventure, orchids and gateway travel. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:17', 'bhalukpong', 'Allocate limited time to local markets and craft outlets, focusing on bamboo/cane products, tribal textiles, handmade souvenirs and regional products, with additional craft shopping in Bomdila.', 'Bhalukpong is not a major shopping destination, while Bomdila has established craft centres and cultural outlets. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:18', 'bhalukpong', 'Prioritise Kameng River, Bhalukpong Fort, Tipi orchids, Sessa forests, mountain roads, Bomdila viewpoints and Thembang, with wildlife photography added through suitable forest excursions.', 'The area provides exceptional variety through rivers, orchids, dense forests, historic ruins, tribal culture and Himalayan landscapes; Bomdila is specifically described by Arunachal Tourism as a photographer''s delight. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:19', 'bhalukpong', 'Combine Bhalukpong Fort + Tipi + Aka/Hrusso cultural exposure with Bomdila monasteries, craft centres and Thembang traditional village experiences.', 'The wider West Kameng region combines tribal communities, Buddhist culture, traditional villages, crafts and archaeological heritage. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:20', 'bhalukpong', 'Use Bhalukpong as the gateway to Pakke Tiger Reserve, Eaglenest Wildlife Sanctuary and Sessa, allocating dedicated time rather than treating wildlife as a quick sightseeing stop.', 'Pakke is a major wildlife destination with tiger, elephant, gaur, sambar, leopard and hornbill habitats, while Sessa and Eaglenest form part of the broader biodiversity-rich Kameng landscape. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:21', 'bhalukpong', 'Allocate 1–2 days around Bhalukpong before continuing through Sessa → Bomdila → Dirang → Tawang, with additional nights added for Thembang, wildlife or slower travel.', 'Bhalukpong is the natural southern gateway to the official Tezpur–Bhalukpong–Bomdila–Tawang tourism circuit. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:22', 'bhalukpong', 'Complete the required Arunachal Pradesh ILP/PAP formalities before travel and verify current requirements for every traveller.', 'Arunachal Tourism states that eILP applies to Indian citizens, while foreign nationals may require PAP/RAP; tourist eILP is currently applicable for stays up to 14 days. ---'),
  ('bhalukpong:rule:23', 'bhalukpong', 'Treat Bhalukpong as the first gateway stage, then plan Bomdila → Dirang → high-altitude Tawang with early starts, private transport and adequate weather/road buffers.', 'The route changes dramatically from low-altitude Bhalukpong to the much higher Himalayan terrain around Tawang, making road conditions, pacing and buffer time critical. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:0', 'dirang', 'Treat Dirang as a Himalayan nature + culture express: prioritise Dirang Dzong, Thupsung Dhargye Ling Monastery, Dirang Hot Water Spring and nearby orchards; add Sangti Valley only if road time permits.', 'Dirang''s strongest short-visit combination is heritage + monastery + hot spring + mountain scenery, with several attractions close to town. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:1', 'dirang', 'Build a classic Dirang nature + culture + relaxation circuit with Dirang Dzong, Sangti Valley, Hot Water Spring, Thupsung Dhargye Ling, Kalachakra Gompa and Yak Research Centre, keeping one flexible scenic day.', 'Three days allow travellers to experience Dirang''s Monpa culture, valleys, orchards, monasteries and natural attractions without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:2', 'dirang', 'Expand Dirang into a Western Arunachal mountain circuit, combining Dirang, Sangti, Thembang, Sela Pass, Bomdila and Tawang, with additional time for photography, villages and nature experiences.', 'Dirang is strategically positioned on the Bomdila–Tawang route, making it ideal as a multi-day base within Western Arunachal. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:3', 'dirang', 'Build the itinerary around Sangti Valley, Dirang Dzong, Hot Water Spring and Thupsung Dhargye Ling, followed by Mandala Top or Thembang if time allows.', 'These provide the strongest introduction to Dirang''s valleys, Monpa heritage, spirituality, relaxation and Himalayan scenery. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:4', 'dirang', 'Choose a comfortable private stay, arrange a private SUV, and prioritise Sangti Valley, orchard walks, hot springs, mountain photography, private meals and quiet evenings.', 'Dirang''s romantic strength comes from privacy, peaceful valleys, orchards, mountain scenery and slow travel, rather than nightlife. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:5', 'dirang', 'Base the family in a comfortable hotel/homestay, use a private SUV, and prioritise Sangti Valley, Yak Research Centre, orchards, Hot Water Spring and easy monastery visits.', 'Dirang combines nature, education, culture and light outdoor experiences, while private transport makes mountain travel easier for families. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:6', 'dirang', 'Select the best available premium accommodation, arrange a chauffeur-driven SUV and private guide, and emphasise privacy, curated valley experiences, premium meals and seamless transfers.', 'Dirang has limited conventional luxury infrastructure, so premium travel should focus on comfort, privacy and personalised service rather than resort-style luxury. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:7', 'dirang', 'Stay around Dirang town or Sangti, choose homestays/budget hotels, use shared transport where practical, and prioritise Dirang Dzong, Hot Water Spring, monasteries and Sangti Valley.', 'Dirang''s core sightseeing is relatively affordable; the main budget pressure comes from private mountain transport and longer excursions. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:8', 'dirang', 'Prioritise Sangti Valley, Mandala Top, orchards, Sela Pass and surrounding forest landscapes, adding wildlife/birdwatching experiences where suitable.', 'Dirang offers a strong combination of valleys, rivers, orchards, forests, high mountains and winter birdlife, particularly around Sangti. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:9', 'dirang', 'Add trekking, hiking, birdwatching, mountain drives, high-altitude excursions, snow experiences and valley exploration, depending on season and road conditions.', 'The surrounding terrain provides substantial mountain, trekking and high-altitude adventure opportunities, especially toward Mandala, Thembang and Sela. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:10', 'dirang', 'Choose a comfortable stay, use a private vehicle, prioritise Sangti Valley, orchards, monasteries and easy scenic drives, and limit strenuous trekking and rapid altitude gains.', 'Dirang itself is relatively manageable, but excursions toward Mandala and Sela involve considerably higher and more demanding mountain terrain. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:11', 'dirang', 'Use Dirang as a 1-night gateway stop, prioritising Dirang Dzong + Hot Water Spring + Thupsung Dhargye Ling, then continue toward Sela/Tawang.', 'Dirang is an important overnight halt on the Bomdila–Tawang route, making it naturally suited to route-based travel. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:12', 'dirang', 'Prioritise Dirang Dzong and Nyukmadung War Memorial, then add Thembang Zong, Kalachakra Gompa and regional monasteries.', 'Dirang combines Monpa heritage, fortified settlements, Buddhist traditions and modern military history within its wider regional circuit. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:13', 'dirang', 'Choose a peaceful stay and reduce daily transfers, focusing on Dirang Hot Water Spring, Sangti Valley, orchard walks, nature, scenic drives and quiet evenings.', 'Dirang''s hot springs, peaceful valleys and slower mountain environment make wellness and relaxation particularly strong. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:14', 'dirang', 'Prioritise Sangti Valley, orchards, monasteries and outdoor sightseeing, keeping midday flexible and carrying light rain protection.', 'March–June is among Dirang''s recommended travel periods, although late-season rainfall can affect mountain roads. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:15', 'dirang', 'Treat Dirang as a flexible mountain destination, keep generous road buffers, avoid overly tight schedules and confirm conditions before long excursions.', 'Heavy monsoon rainfall can make mountain roads and remote excursions less predictable, so flexibility is essential. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:16', 'dirang', 'Build a Monpa food experience around thukpa, momos, churpi, zan, butter tea, rice dishes and local vegetables, preferably through homestays and local eateries.', 'Dirang''s food experience is closely connected to Monpa culture and traditional Himalayan cuisine. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:17', 'dirang', 'Allocate limited time to local handicrafts, woollens, bamboo/cane products, Monpa textiles and regional produce, with larger craft shopping in Bomdila.', 'Shopping is a secondary strength in Dirang; the destination is more notable for nature, culture and mountain experiences. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:18', 'dirang', 'Prioritise Sangti Valley, Dirang Dzong, Mandala Top, Thembang Zong, orchards, monasteries, Sela Pass and mountain roads.', 'Dirang offers exceptional photographic variety through Monpa architecture, valleys, orchards, monasteries, forests and high Himalayan landscapes. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:19', 'dirang', 'Combine Dirang Dzong + Thupsung Dhargye Ling + Kalachakra Gompa with Thembang Zong and Monpa village experiences.', 'The Dirang region provides strong exposure to Monpa traditions, Buddhist culture, fortified settlements and traditional architecture. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:20', 'dirang', 'Use Dirang as a nature-and-birding base, prioritising Sangti Valley, Mandala Top and surrounding forests, while adding dedicated wildlife areas through the wider West Kameng circuit.', 'Sangti is particularly notable for winter black-necked cranes, while the wider West Kameng region provides richer dedicated wildlife experiences. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:21', 'dirang', 'Allocate 2–3 days around Dirang before continuing through Sela Pass → Tawang, with optional extensions to Thembang, Mandala and Bomdila.', 'Dirang sits naturally within the Bomdila–Dirang–Tawang mountain corridor, making it one of the key stops for Western Arunachal itineraries. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:22', 'dirang', 'Complete the required Arunachal Pradesh ILP/PAP formalities before travel and verify the current requirements for every traveller.', 'Arunachal Pradesh requires appropriate entry permits; eILP is available for Indian tourist visitors, while foreign travellers follow separate permit requirements. ---'),
  ('dirang:rule:23', 'dirang', 'Treat Dirang as the major pre-Tawang mountain stage, then plan Dirang → Sela Pass → Tawang with early starts, private transport and adequate weather/road buffers.', 'The route rises rapidly into high-altitude Himalayan terrain, making road conditions, acclimatisation, pacing and contingency time critical. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:0', 'tawang', 'Treat Tawang as a Himalayan Buddhist heritage + mountain express: prioritise Tawang Monastery, Urgelling Monastery and the main town viewpoints; add Sela Pass only if Tawang is part of a transit itinerary.', 'A one-day visit is best focused on Tawang''s strongest combination of Buddhist heritage, Monpa culture and dramatic Himalayan scenery rather than attempting distant high-altitude excursions. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:1', 'tawang', 'Build a classic Tawang culture + nature + high-altitude circuit with Tawang Monastery, Urgelling Monastery, Sangetsar Lake, P.T. Tso and Bum La Pass, keeping sufficient time for acclimatisation.', 'Three days allow travellers to experience Tawang''s monasteries, lakes, mountain landscapes and high-altitude attractions without making every day excessively rushed. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:2', 'tawang', 'Expand Tawang into a complete high-Himalayan Arunachal circuit, combining Tawang, Bum La, Sangetsar Lake, P.T. Tso, Sela Pass, Dirang and Bomdila, with additional time for villages, photography and cultural experiences.', 'Five or more days make it easier to balance long mountain drives, acclimatisation, sightseeing and weather-related flexibility. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:3', 'tawang', 'Build the itinerary around Tawang Monastery, Bum La Pass, Sangetsar Lake, P.T. Tso and Urgelling Monastery, with Sela Pass integrated into the wider route.', 'These provide the strongest first introduction to Tawang''s Buddhist heritage, lakes, high-altitude landscapes and Monpa culture. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:4', 'tawang', 'Choose a comfortable scenic stay, arrange a private SUV, and prioritise Tawang Monastery, Sangetsar Lake, P.T. Tso, mountain viewpoints, photography and relaxed evenings.', 'Tawang''s honeymoon appeal comes from dramatic landscapes, peaceful surroundings, privacy and scenic road journeys, rather than nightlife. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:5', 'tawang', 'Base the family in a comfortable heated hotel/homestay, use a private SUV, and prioritise Tawang Monastery, Urgelling Monastery, scenic viewpoints and accessible lake excursions.', 'Tawang offers a strong combination of culture, nature and sightseeing, while private transport makes the demanding mountain circuit easier for families. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:6', 'tawang', 'Select the best available premium accommodation, arrange a chauffeur-driven SUV and private local assistance, and emphasise privacy, comfort, curated monastery/lake experiences and seamless transfers.', 'Tawang has limited conventional luxury infrastructure, so premium travel should focus on service, privacy, vehicle comfort and personalised experiences rather than resort-style luxury. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:7', 'tawang', 'Stay around Tawang town, choose budget hotels/homestays, share transport where practical, and prioritise Tawang Monastery, Urgelling Monastery, local viewpoints and selected lake excursions.', 'Tawang''s core sightseeing can be relatively economical; the major budget pressure comes from private mountain transport, permits and longer high-altitude excursions. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:8', 'tawang', 'Prioritise Sangetsar Lake, P.T. Tso, Bum La surroundings, Sela Pass and Himalayan viewpoints, adding valley and village landscapes where accessible.', 'Tawang''s major nature strength is its combination of glacial lakes, snow-covered mountains, alpine terrain and dramatic high-altitude landscapes. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:9', 'tawang', 'Add Bum La excursion, high-altitude drives, snow experiences, hiking and mountain exploration, depending on season, fitness, permits and road conditions.', 'The Tawang region provides substantial high-altitude adventure opportunities, but altitude and weather make responsible pacing essential. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:10', 'tawang', 'Choose a comfortable heated stay, use a private vehicle, prioritise Tawang Monastery, Urgelling Monastery and easier scenic sightseeing, and avoid excessive same-day altitude changes.', 'Tawang''s high elevation can make travel physically demanding; gradual acclimatisation, rest and reduced exertion are more important than covering every attraction. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:11', 'tawang', 'Use Tawang as a 2-night minimum destination stop where possible, prioritising Tawang Monastery + one local sightseeing circuit, then continue toward Sela Pass/Dirang or return toward Bomdila.', 'Tawang is a substantial mountain destination rather than an ideal quick transit stop, with long road journeys and high altitude requiring adequate time. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:12', 'tawang', 'Prioritise Tawang Monastery, Urgelling Monastery and regional war/military heritage, with Sela Pass and nearby memorial sites added according to the route.', 'Tawang combines Tibetan Buddhist history, Monpa heritage and important modern military history. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:13', 'tawang', 'Choose a slow-paced itinerary with a comfortable stay, focusing on monastery visits, scenic viewpoints, peaceful lakes, photography and quiet evenings, while avoiding excessive high-altitude excursions.', 'Tawang''s wellness appeal comes primarily from its peaceful mountain environment, spirituality, solitude and slow travel, rather than conventional spa infrastructure. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:14', 'tawang', 'Prioritise Tawang Monastery, lakes, monasteries, viewpoints and outdoor sightseeing, while keeping rain protection and road buffers in the itinerary.', 'Warmer months generally provide better opportunities for sightseeing, but rain and mountain-road disruptions can still affect travel. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:15', 'tawang', 'Treat Tawang as a flexible mountain destination, maintain generous road buffers, confirm conditions before departure and avoid tightly scheduled long-distance transfers.', 'Monsoon conditions can increase the risk of landslides, road disruptions, poor visibility and travel delays across the Arunachal mountain corridor. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:16', 'tawang', 'Build a Monpa and Himalayan food experience around momos, thukpa, thenthuk, zan, churpi, butter tea and local Tibetan-style dishes, preferably through local eateries and homestays.', 'Tawang''s food culture reflects its Monpa Buddhist heritage and broader Himalayan/Tibetan culinary influences. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:17', 'tawang', 'Allocate limited time to Tibetan/Monpa handicrafts, woollens, traditional textiles, prayer items, bamboo/cane products and local souvenirs, with additional shopping opportunities in Tawang market.', 'Shopping is a secondary strength of Tawang; the destination is more strongly positioned around culture, monasteries and Himalayan scenery. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:18', 'tawang', 'Prioritise Tawang Monastery, Sangetsar Lake, P.T. Tso, Bum La, Sela Pass, mountain roads, monasteries and Monpa settlements.', 'Tawang provides exceptional photographic variety through Buddhist architecture, alpine lakes, snow peaks, high-altitude roads and dramatic Himalayan landscapes. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:19', 'tawang', 'Combine Tawang Monastery + Urgelling Monastery + Monpa village experiences with local Buddhist traditions, architecture and regional food.', 'Tawang is one of Arunachal Pradesh''s strongest destinations for experiencing Monpa culture and Himalayan Buddhist heritage. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:20', 'tawang', 'Treat Tawang primarily as a high-altitude nature destination, focusing on alpine landscapes, mountain ecosystems and birdlife, while using dedicated wildlife destinations elsewhere in Arunachal for deeper wildlife experiences.', 'Tawang''s major natural attraction is its high-altitude Himalayan environment, rather than conventional safari-style wildlife tourism. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:21', 'tawang', 'Allocate 3–4 days around the Tawang section after travelling through Bomdila → Dirang → Sela Pass, with optional additional time for Thembang and other regional experiences.', 'Tawang forms the dramatic high-altitude culmination of the Western Arunachal mountain corridor, requiring more time than a conventional city sightseeing destination. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:22', 'tawang', 'Complete the required Arunachal Pradesh ILP/PAP formalities before travel and separately verify the current requirements for Bum La and other restricted/high-altitude areas.', 'Entry into Arunachal Pradesh and access to restricted border areas involve specific permit and permission requirements that should be confirmed before departure. ---'),
  ('tawang:rule:23', 'tawang', 'Treat Dirang → Sela Pass → Tawang as a major mountain journey, using early departures, private transport, acclimatisation time and generous weather/road buffers.', 'The route involves a substantial transition into high-altitude Himalayan terrain, making altitude, weather, road conditions and travel time critical itinerary factors. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:0', 'guwahati', 'Treat Guwahati as a gateway city + culture + riverfront express: prioritise Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Temple, Assam State Museum and Brahmaputra River cruise; add Navagraha Temple if time permits.', 'Guwahati''s strongest short-visit combination is spiritual heritage + Assamese culture + Brahmaputra scenery, with several major attractions accessible from the city. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:1', 'guwahati', 'Build a classic Guwahati culture + spirituality + nature circuit with Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Temple, Assam State Museum, Assam State Zoo, Navagraha Temple and Brahmaputra River cruise, keeping one flexible period for local exploration.', 'Three days allow travellers to experience Guwahati''s temples, museums, river landscape, wildlife and Assamese urban culture without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:2', 'guwahati', 'Expand Guwahati into an Assam gateway circuit, combining Guwahati, Sualkuchi, Hajo, Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary and selected destinations toward Kaziranga or Shillong, rather than keeping the entire stay inside the city.', 'Guwahati works best as a regional gateway and base for exploring Lower Assam, the Brahmaputra Valley and nearby Northeast destinations. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:3', 'guwahati', 'Build the itinerary around Kamakhya Temple, Brahmaputra River cruise, Umananda Temple, Assam State Museum and Navagraha Temple, adding Assam State Zoo if time allows.', 'These provide the strongest introduction to Guwahati''s spiritual identity, Assamese heritage, river landscape and urban culture. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:4', 'guwahati', 'Choose a comfortable riverside or premium city stay, arrange private transport, and prioritise Brahmaputra sunset cruise, Umananda Island, Kamakhya Temple, scenic dining and relaxed evenings.', 'Guwahati''s romantic appeal comes from river views, sunsets, private experiences and convenient premium hospitality, rather than traditional hill-station scenery. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:5', 'guwahati', 'Base the family in a comfortable city hotel, use private transport, and prioritise Assam State Zoo, Brahmaputra cruise, Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Temple and regional museums.', 'Guwahati offers a useful combination of education, wildlife, spirituality, sightseeing and easy urban access for families. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:6', 'guwahati', 'Select the best available premium hotel, arrange a chauffeur-driven vehicle and curated guide, and emphasise private river experiences, premium Assamese dining, heritage sightseeing and seamless airport/rail transfers.', 'Guwahati has the Northeast''s stronger urban hospitality infrastructure, making it more suitable for business-class and premium travel than many smaller regional destinations. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:7', 'guwahati', 'Stay around Paltan Bazaar, Pan Bazaar or central Guwahati, choose budget hotels/guesthouses, use public transport or app-based taxis where practical, and prioritise Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Temple, museums and riverfront experiences.', 'Guwahati''s core attractions can be explored relatively economically; the main budget pressure comes from private vehicles and longer excursions outside the city. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:8', 'guwahati', 'Prioritise Brahmaputra riverfront, Deepor Beel, Assam State Zoo and nearby nature destinations, adding Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary for a dedicated wildlife excursion.', 'Guwahati combines riverine landscapes, wetlands, forested surroundings and accessible wildlife areas within and around the city. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:9', 'guwahati', 'Add river cruises, nearby trekking/hiking, cycling, wildlife safaris and day excursions to surrounding natural areas, depending on season and operating conditions.', 'Guwahati itself is primarily a gateway and cultural city, while its surrounding region provides stronger opportunities for outdoor adventure. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:10', 'guwahati', 'Choose a centrally located comfortable hotel, use private transport, prioritise Kamakhya Temple, museums, Umananda Temple, river views and easy sightseeing, and avoid unnecessarily long day excursions.', 'Guwahati is relatively accessible, but temple steps, heat, traffic and long regional drives should be considered when pacing the itinerary. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:11', 'guwahati', 'Use Guwahati as a 1-night gateway stop, prioritising Kamakhya Temple + Brahmaputra riverfront/cruise or Umananda Temple, then continue toward the next Northeast destination.', 'Guwahati is one of the Northeast''s principal air, rail and road gateways, making short stays particularly practical. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:12', 'guwahati', 'Prioritise Assam State Museum, Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Temple, Navagraha Temple and regional heritage sites, adding Sualkuchi or Hajo for a wider historical-cultural excursion.', 'Guwahati combines ancient temple traditions, Ahom-era heritage, Assamese culture and the historical importance of the Brahmaputra Valley. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:13', 'guwahati', 'Choose a quiet premium or riverside stay, reduce daily transfers and focus on river views, temple visits, wellness facilities, Assamese cuisine and relaxed evenings.', 'Guwahati''s wellness strength is primarily based on comfortable hospitality, river ambience and slower cultural experiences, rather than mountain-style wellness retreats. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:14', 'guwahati', 'Prioritise early-morning temples, museums, indoor cultural attractions and evening Brahmaputra experiences, keeping the hottest afternoon hours flexible.', 'Guwahati can become hot and humid during the warmer months, so sightseeing is more comfortable in the morning and late afternoon. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:15', 'guwahati', 'Treat Guwahati as a flexible city-and-culture destination, keep rain and traffic buffers, and confirm conditions before planning excursions to wetlands or wildlife areas.', 'Heavy rainfall can affect road travel, river activities and surrounding low-lying areas, making flexible scheduling important. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:16', 'guwahati', 'Build an Assamese food experience around khar, tenga, pitha, duck preparations, freshwater fish, pork dishes, Assamese thali and local tea, using established local restaurants and traditional eateries.', 'Guwahati is one of the best places to experience Assamese cuisine alongside broader Northeast Indian food traditions. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:17', 'guwahati', 'Prioritise Assamese silk, especially Muga and Paat silk, traditional textiles, bamboo/cane crafts, tea and local handicrafts, with Sualkuchi added for a dedicated silk experience.', 'Shopping is a strong supporting attraction in Guwahati, particularly for Assamese textiles, tea and handicrafts. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:18', 'guwahati', 'Prioritise Brahmaputra River, Umananda Island, Kamakhya Temple, Deepor Beel, sunset river cruises, Assamese markets and traditional architecture.', 'Guwahati provides strong photographic variety through river landscapes, temples, wetlands, culture, markets and dramatic evening light. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:19', 'guwahati', 'Combine Kamakhya Temple + Umananda Temple + Assam State Museum + Navagraha Temple with Sualkuchi, Hajo or local Assamese cultural experiences.', 'Guwahati provides a strong introduction to Assamese religious traditions, textiles, crafts, history and Brahmaputra Valley culture. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:20', 'guwahati', 'Use Guwahati as a wildlife gateway, prioritising Deepor Beel and Assam State Zoo, then add Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary or continue toward Kaziranga National Park for a dedicated safari itinerary.', 'Guwahati offers accessible nature experiences, while Pobitora and Kaziranga provide substantially stronger dedicated wildlife and safari experiences. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:21', 'guwahati', 'Allocate 2–3 days around Guwahati before continuing toward Sualkuchi → Hajo → Pobitora → Kaziranga, depending on the overall trip length.', 'Guwahati functions naturally as the principal gateway for an Assam itinerary, allowing travellers to combine urban culture with wildlife, heritage and rural experiences. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:22', 'guwahati', 'Confirm the applicable entry, wildlife-sanctuary and protected-area requirements before travelling, particularly when adding destinations outside Guwahati.', 'Requirements can vary by destination and activity, especially for protected wildlife areas, so advance verification prevents disruptions. ---'),
  ('guwahati:rule:23', 'guwahati', 'Treat Guwahati as the major Northeast gateway, allowing sufficient time for airport/rail transfers, traffic, weather and regional road conditions before onward travel to Assam, Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh or other Northeast destinations.', 'Guwahati is strategically positioned as a transport hub, but onward mountain and regional journeys can take substantially longer than expected. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:0', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA_RUMI_DARWAZA + CHOTA_IMAMBARA_HUSAINABAD + RESIDENCY AND: include_ONE_CHOWK_AWADHI_FOOD_AND_CHIKANKARI_EXPERIENCE + HAZRATGANJ_EVENING', 'Very short stays gain more value from Lucknow''s strongest Nawabi monuments, 1857 heritage and one living food-and-craft experience than from attempting geographically scattered secondary attractions. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:1', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA_RUMI_DARWAZA + HUSAINABAD + RESIDENCY + CHOWK + HAZRATGANJ AND: add_ONE_OF_QAISERBAGH_OR_LA_MARTINIERE_DILKUSHA', 'This structure provides a balanced first introduction to Nawabi architecture, Shia heritage, 1857 history, Awadhi cuisine, Chikankari, shopping and Lucknow''s central urban atmosphere. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:2', 'lucknow', 'prefer_BARA_IMAMBARA + HUSAINABAD + RESIDENCY + QAISERBAGH + CHOWK + HAZRATGANJ + LA_MARTINIERE_DILKUSHA AND: add_AMBEDKAR_MEMORIAL_JANESHWAR_PARK + GOMTI_NAGAR_OR_KUKRAIL', 'Longer stays should move beyond Lucknow''s headline monuments and reveal the city through Nawabi palatial history, colonial and 1857 heritage, craft districts, modern urban spaces and recreational areas. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:3', 'lucknow', 'prefer_PREMIUM_HAZRATGANJ_OR_GOMTI_NAGAR_HOTEL + PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER + CURATED_HERITAGE_SIGHTSEEING AND: increase_AWADHI_FINE_DINING + EVENING_CITY_DRIVES + HAZRATGANJ_WALK + SPA + PREMIUM_CHIKANKARI_SHOPPING + FREE_TIME', 'Lucknow''s honeymoon appeal comes primarily from refined hospitality, Awadhi cuisine, heritage architecture, premium accommodation and relaxed evening experiences rather than isolated resort-style romance. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:4', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA + HUSAINABAD + RESIDENCY + JANESHWAR_MISHRA_PARK AND: include_GOMTI_NAGAR + FAMILY_FOOD_EXPERIENCES + KUKRAIL_IF_TIME_ALLOWS AND: reduce_LONG_MARKET_WALKS + HOT_AFTERNOON_HERITAGE_SIGHTSEEING + EXCESSIVE_MONUMENT_COUNT', 'Lucknow works best for families when heritage is balanced with parks, food, shorter walking blocks and comfortable road transport. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:5', 'lucknow', 'prefer_SHORT_HERITAGE_VISITS + PRIVATE_AC_CAB + PARK_BREAKS + EARLY_OR_EVENING_SIGHTSEEING AND: include_JANESHWAR_MISHRA_PARK + GOMTI_NAGAR + SHORT_METRO_RIDE + FAMILY_FRIENDLY_FOOD AND: reduce_BHUL_BHULAIYA_COMPLEXITY + CONGESTED_MARKET_DURATION + LONG_EXPOSED_WALKS', 'Young children generally respond better to variety, transport breaks and open recreational spaces than continuous architectural sightseeing. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:6', 'lucknow', 'prefer_PREMIUM_HAZRATGANJ_OR_GOMTI_NAGAR_HOTELS AND: increase_CHAUFFEURED_CAR + PRIVATE_HERITAGE_GUIDE + CURATED_AWADHI_DINING + PREMIUM_CHIKANKARI_SHOPPING + SPA + PRIVATE_PHOTOGRAPHY', 'Lucknow luxury travel is distinguished more by personalized guiding, refined Awadhi cuisine, premium hotels, private transport and bespoke craft shopping than by resort infrastructure. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:7', 'lucknow', 'prefer_CHARBAGH_OR_CENTRALLY_CONNECTED_BUDGET_HOTELS + METRO + AUTO_E_RICKSHAW + WALKING_WITHIN_CLUSTERS AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_MARKETS + HERITAGE_STREETS + PARKS + LOCAL_FOOD AND: use_LOCAL_KEBAB_BIRYANI_CHAAT_AND_VEGETARIAN_EATERIES_WITH_GOOD_HYGIENE', 'Lucknow is highly suitable for budget travel because public transport, local food, markets and most cultural sightseeing remain comparatively affordable. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:8', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA + RUMI_DARWAZA + CHOTA_IMAMBARA + QAISERBAGH AND: include_RESIDENCY + CHOWK + SIBTAINABAD + LA_MARTINIERE + DILKUSHA', 'These sites connect Nawabi patronage, Shia religious culture, Awadhi architecture, European influence, colonial history and Lucknow''s living urban traditions. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:9', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA + RUMI_DARWAZA + CHOTA_IMAMBARA + QAISERBAGH AND: include_DILKUSHA + SIKANDAR_BAGH + SAADAT_ALI_KHAN_HERITAGE + SIBTAINABAD', 'Lucknow''s identity as the courtly capital of Awadh developed through successive Nawabi and royal building programs that created monumental, palatial, religious and garden architecture across the city. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:10', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_RESIDENCY AND: include_SIKANDAR_BAGH + DILKUSHA + LA_MARTINIERE + OTHER_RELEVANT_1857_SITES', 'The Residency provides the strongest interpretive anchor, while Sikandar Bagh, Dilkusha and La Martiniere extend the geography and historical understanding of the fighting in Lucknow during 1857. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:11', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA + RUMI_DARWAZA + CHOTA_IMAMBARA + LA_MARTINIERE AND: include_QAISERBAGH + DILKUSHA + SIBTAINABAD + CHARBAGH_ARCHITECTURE', 'Lucknow provides an unusual architectural continuum combining Nawabi Lakhauri-brick construction, Islamic and Shia religious architecture, Indo-European experimentation, French Baroque influence and later monumental urban architecture. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:12', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA_ASAFI_MOSQUE + CHOTA_IMAMBARA AND: include_SIBTAINABAD + OTHER_RELEVANT_IMAMBARAS_AND_RELIGIOUS_SITES', 'Lucknow developed as a major centre of Shia intellectual and religious culture under the Nawabs of Awadh, and its imambaras remain important both architecturally and religiously. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:13', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_CHOWK + OLD_LUCKNOW + HERITAGE_INTERPRETATION AND: include_URDU_LITERARY_CONTEXT + KATHAK + GHAZAL_THUMRI_TRADITIONS + LOCAL_CULTURAL_EVENTS_WHEN_AVAILABLE', 'Official Lucknow cultural documentation describes the city''s identity through Urdu, poetry, Kathak, music, refined etiquette, hospitality and the cultural life that developed under Nawabi patronage. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:14', 'lucknow', 'prefer_CHOWK + AMINABAD + SELECTED_CENTRAL_LUCKNOW_AND_PREMIUM_AWADHI_RESTAURANTS AND: include_GALOUTI_KEBAB + KAKORI_KEBAB + AWADHI_BIRYANI + NIHARI_KULCHA + KORMA + SHEERMAL + CHAAT AND: add_MAKHHAN_MALAI_WHEN_SEASONALLY_AVAILABLE', 'Lucknow''s cuisine is one of the destination''s defining cultural assets and should be planned around Awadhi slow-cooking traditions, kebabs, rice dishes, rich gravies, breads, street snacks and seasonal sweets rather than one signature dish. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:15', 'lucknow', 'include_CHAAT + KACHORI + LOCAL_VEGETARIAN_THALIS + SWEETS + BAKERY_AND_DAIRY_SPECIALTIES AND: do_not_assume_LUCKNOW_FOOD_EXPERIENCE_REQUIRES_MEAT_BASED_AWADHI_DISHES', 'Although Lucknow is internationally associated with kebabs and meat-based Awadhi cuisine, the city also supports extensive vegetarian street-food, snack and sweet traditions. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:16', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_CHOWK + AMINABAD + HAZRATGANJ AND: include_CHIKANKARI + ZARDOZI + TEXTILES + ITTAR + TRADITIONAL_CRAFTS AND: use_GOMTI_NAGAR_FOR_MODERN_PREMIUM_RETAIL_AS_REQUIRED', 'Lucknow shopping is strongest when its internationally recognized Chikankari and Zari-Zardozi craft traditions are combined with traditional bazaars and organized contemporary retail. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:17', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_REPUTABLE_CHOWK_AND_SPECIALIST_CHIKANKARI_SELLERS AND: compare_HANDWORK_QUALITY + FABRIC + STITCH_DENSITY + FINISHING + PRICE AND: do_not_assume_EVERY_EMBROIDERED_PRODUCT_IS_IDENTICAL_OR_FULLY_HANDMADE', 'Chikankari is one of Lucknow''s defining craft industries and purchasing quality varies substantially according to fabric, embroidery complexity, production method and finishing. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:18', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_RUMI_DARWAZA + BARA_IMAMBARA + CHOTA_IMAMBARA + RESIDENCY + LA_MARTINIERE AND: include_QAISERBAGH + CHOWK_STREET_SCENES + DILKUSHA + MODERN_LUCKNOW AND: prioritize_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + GOLDEN_HOUR', 'Lower-angle light and reduced heat improve Lucknow''s monument photography, while its architectural diversity allows Nawabi, colonial, ruin, market and modern-city compositions. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:19', 'lucknow', 'prefer_CHOWK + AMINABAD + HAZRATGANJ + OLD_LUCKNOW AND: respect_LOCAL_PRIVACY + RELIGIOUS_SENSITIVITY + MARKET_ACTIVITY', 'Old Lucknow offers strong market, craft, food and street-life photography, but travelers should avoid intrusive photography of individuals and sensitive religious activity. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:20', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_GOMTI_NAGAR + AMBEDKAR_MEMORIAL + JANESHWAR_MISHRA_PARK AND: include_CONTEMPORARY_DINING + SHOPPING + EVENING_CITY_EXPERIENCES', 'Lucknow should not be presented exclusively as a historic Nawabi city; eastern Lucknow demonstrates its contemporary metropolitan development and provides important family, dining and premium-travel infrastructure. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:21', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_KUKRAIL + JANESHWAR_MISHRA_PARK AND: include_SELECTED_GOMTI_SIDE_AND_URBAN_GREEN_SPACES AND: do_not_position_LUCKNOW_AS_A_PRIMARY_WILDERNESS_DESTINATION', 'Lucknow provides substantial urban green spaces and selected nature-oriented areas, but heritage, culture and gastronomy remain much stronger destination pillars than wilderness tourism. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:22', 'lucknow', 'choose_PREMIUM_HOTEL + JANESHWAR_MISHRA_PARK + GOMTI_NAGAR + SELECTED_SPA AND: combine_WITH_LIGHT_HERITAGE_SIGHTSEEING + AWADHI_DINING + SHOPPING + FREE_TIME', 'Relaxation-oriented Lucknow itineraries work best when monument sightseeing is deliberately reduced and balanced with parks, dining, spa time and contemporary urban comforts. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:23', 'lucknow', 'choose_PREMIUM_HOTEL_SPAS + MODERN_WELLNESS_FACILITIES AND: combine_WITH_LIGHT_HERITAGE_SIGHTSEEING + AWADHI_FINE_DINING + PARK_WALKS + FREE_TIME', 'Lucknow is not primarily a thermal or destination-wellness centre, but premium urban hotels can support spa-focused city breaks. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:24', 'lucknow', 'prefer_GOMTI_NAGAR + HAZRATGANJ + SELECTED_PREMIUM_HOTELS_AND_COMMERCIAL_DISTRICTS AND: focus_ON_DINING + CAFES + LOUNGES + EVENING_SHOPPING AND: do_not_position_LUCKNOW_AS_A_MAJOR_LARGE_SCALE_CLUBBING_DESTINATION', 'Lucknow''s evening appeal is stronger for dining, cafés, lounges and social nightlife than for major nightclub-focused tourism. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:25', 'lucknow', 'prefer_ONE_CENTRAL_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES_BETWEEN_OLD_LUCKNOW_HAZRATGANJ_AND_GOMTI_NAGAR', 'Lucknow''s major districts are connected by road and Metro sufficiently well that changing hotels during a short stay usually wastes more time than it saves. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:26', 'lucknow', 'prefer_HAZRATGANJ_OR_WELL_CONNECTED_CENTRAL_LUCKNOW', 'A central base provides stronger balance between Old Lucknow monuments, Residency, commercial areas, Metro access and cross-city sightseeing than an isolated outer hotel. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:27', 'lucknow', 'consider_GOMTI_NAGAR_OR_PREMIUM_CENTRAL_HOTELS AND: retain_PRIVATE_CAR_ACCESS_FOR_OLD_LUCKNOW', 'Gomti Nagar provides strong modern hotel and dining infrastructure but is separated from many of Lucknow''s principal heritage attractions. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:28', 'lucknow', 'consider_CHARBAGH_AND_OTHER_METRO_CONNECTED_AREAS AND: verify_HOTEL_QUALITY + STREET_ACCESS + NIGHT_ARRIVAL_PRACTICALITY', 'Charbagh provides exceptional rail and Metro convenience and broad budget inventory but transport congestion and immediate surroundings should be considered carefully. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:29', 'lucknow', 'choose_BETWEEN_LUCKNOW_METRO + APP_BASED_CAB + PRIVATE_CAR ACCORDING_TO: HOTEL_LOCATION + LUGGAGE + TRAVELER_COUNT + MOBILITY + ARRIVAL_TIME', 'Chaudhary Charan Singh International Airport lies approximately 14 km from central Lucknow and is connected with the city through road transport and Lucknow Metro, so no single transfer mode is optimal for every traveler. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:30', 'lucknow', 'prefer_METRO_OR_SHORT_ROAD_TRANSFER ACCORDING_TO: LUGGAGE + TRAFFIC + FINAL_HOTEL_DISTANCE_FROM_STATION', 'Charbagh and Hazratganj are connected through Lucknow''s Metro corridor, making rail-to-central-city movement comparatively straightforward. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:31', 'lucknow', 'prefer_CAB_OR_AUTO_E_RICKSHAW_TO_CLUSTER_EDGE AND: continue_WITH_WALKING_INSIDE_HERITAGE_ZONE', 'Old Lucknow''s monuments and market streets are better experienced through short road connections followed by cluster-based walking than continuous private-car movement through congested lanes. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:32', 'lucknow', 'prefer_DIRECT_APP_CAB_OR_PRIVATE_CAR', 'These areas represent different sides of the city and cross-city road transport is generally more efficient than attempting multiple local transfers during limited sightseeing time. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:33', 'lucknow', 'prefer_CENTRAL_HOTEL + PRIVATE_AC_CAR + SHORT_WALKING_BLOCKS + VERIFIED_ACCESSIBLE_ATTRACTIONS AND: reduce_BHUL_BHULAIYA_STAIRS + CHOWK_MARKET_WALKING + LARGE_EXPOSED_GROUNDS + EXTREME_SUMMER_HEAT', 'Lucknow can work well for seniors when road transport minimizes walking, but historic staircases, extensive grounds, uneven surfaces and congested old-market areas still require itinerary modification. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:34', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_EARLY_BARA_IMAMBARA_HUSAINABAD + AIR_CONDITIONED_LUNCH_OR_HOTEL_BREAK + EVENING_HAZRATGANJ_OR_GOMTI_NAGAR AND: reduce_MIDDAY_RESIDENCY + PARKS + LONG_CHOWK_WALKING + EXPOSED_MONUMENT_GROUNDS', 'IMD climatology describes Lucknow''s pre-monsoon summer as very hot, with average maximum temperatures around the upper 30s °C and occasional temperatures approaching the mid-40s °C, making prolonged midday sightseeing physically demanding. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:35', 'lucknow', 'increase_INDOOR_DINING + SHOPPING + SELECTED_MUSEUMS + COVERED_HERITAGE_INTERIORS AND: reduce_TIGHTLY_TIMED_OUTDOOR_PHOTOGRAPHY + LARGE_PARKS + LONG_MARKET_WALKS AND: allow_BUFFER_FOR_TRAFFIC_AND_WATERLOGGING_RISK', 'Lucknow receives most of its annual rainfall during the June–September monsoon period, with increased humidity, cloud cover and rain requiring flexible sightseeing schedules. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:36', 'lucknow', 'delay_NONESSENTIAL_EARLY_MORNING_ROAD_SIGHTSEEING_WHEN_VISIBILITY_IS_POOR AND: allow_BUFFER_FOR_AIRPORT + RAILWAY + INTERCITY_TRANSFERS AND: move_PHOTOGRAPHY_TO_LATER_MORNING_OR_AFTERNOON_WHEN_NEEDED', 'IMD climatology identifies winter mist and fog as a characteristic feature of Lucknow, particularly in December and January, which can affect visibility and transportation. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:37', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_RESIDENCY + BARA_IMAMBARA + HUSAINABAD + WALKING_AND_OUTDOOR_PHOTOGRAPHY AND: include_SEASONAL_FOOD + MAKHHAN_MALAI_WHEN_AVAILABLE', 'Cooler winter conditions substantially improve long outdoor heritage days compared with Lucknow''s hot pre-monsoon season. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:38', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA_AND_RUMI_DARWAZA + CHOTA_IMAMBARA_HUSAINABAD + RESIDENCY AND: add_CHOWK_FOOD_AND_CHIKANKARI + HAZRATGANJ AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_AWADHI_MEAL', 'This structure provides the strongest balanced first introduction to Lucknow through Nawabi architecture, Shia heritage, 1857 history, living craft traditions, cuisine and contemporary central-city atmosphere. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:39', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_CHOWK + OLD_LUCKNOW + SELECTED_QAISERBAGH_AND_AMINABAD_AREAS AND: reduce_TOTAL_TIME_SPENT_ONLY_IN_GOMTI_NAGAR_AND_MODERN_MALLS', 'Lucknow''s historic cultural identity is particularly visible in its old bazaars, traditional crafts, food, Urdu-influenced social culture and neighborhoods shaped by the Nawabi period. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:40', 'lucknow', 'allocate_CHOWK_AS_A_DEDICATED_HALF_DAY_OR_EVENING_BLOCK AND: combine_KEBABS_AND_TRADITIONAL_FOOD + CHIKANKARI + ZARDOZI + ITTAR + OLD_MARKET_WALKING', 'Chowk historically functioned as a major centre for traders, artisans and cultural activity and remains one of the strongest places to combine Lucknow''s living craft and culinary traditions. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:41', 'lucknow', 'prioritize_BARA_IMAMBARA + RESIDENCY + LA_MARTINIERE + SIKANDAR_BAGH AND: use_GUIDED_OR_INTERPRETIVE_CONTEXT', 'These sites allow students and specialist travelers to connect Nawabi state formation, architecture, European interaction and the events of 1857 within one city. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:42', 'lucknow', 'allocate_50_TO_60_PERCENT_TO_HERITAGE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_PARKS + FOOD + SHOPPING + GOMTI_NAGAR + HOTEL_REST + FREE_TIME', 'Lucknow is more enjoyable for families when formal heritage sightseeing is balanced with open spaces, dining and less structured city experiences. ---'),
  ('lucknow:rule:43', 'lucknow', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_HERITAGE_AND_FOOD AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_HAZRATGANJ + GOMTI_NAGAR + PARKS + SPA + SHOPPING + FREE_TIME', 'Lucknow''s strongest itineraries combine monuments and cultural interpretation with leisurely meals, shopping, cafés, parks and unstructured exploration rather than continuous sightseeing. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:0', 'agra', 'prioritize_TAJ_MAHAL_SUNRISE + AGRA_FORT_HERITAGE + FATEHPUR_SIKRI_AND_WEST_AGRA', 'Very short stays gain more value from properly experiencing core Mughal heritage, world-famous marble monuments, and charm-filled sandstone imperial palaces than losing time to exhausting multi-city transit schedules. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:1', 'agra', 'prioritize_TAJ_HERITAGE_CENTRE + FATEHABAD_ROAD_RESORT_ATTRACTIONS + FATEHPUR_SIKRI_AND_SANCTUARY + MATHURA_AND_VRINDAVAN_DAY_TRIP', 'This gives a balanced introduction to Mughal heritage, world-class monument entertainment, preserved wildlife sanctuaries, and seamless Braj region spiritual day excursions. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:2', 'agra', 'prefer_CENTRAL_AGRA_CORE + SIKANDRA_AND_KEETHAM_RETREAT + DAY_TRIPS_TO_BHARATPUR_AND_JAIPUR_VIA_YAMUNA_EXPRESSWAY AND: use_PRIVATE_AC_CARS_GATIMAAN_EXPRESS_AND_INTER_CITY_TAXIS', 'Luxury heritage resorts, riverfront Mughal monuments, protected wetland sanctuaries, and express rail connections to Delhi and Jaipur offer distinct regional insights into North India''s Golden Triangle. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:3', 'agra', 'prioritize_OBEROI_AMARVILAS_LUXURY_VILLA_RESORTS + TAJ_EAST_GATE_HERITAGE_STAYS + PRIVATE_MEHTAB_BAGH_SUNSET_TOUR AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + ROOFTOP_TAJ_VIEW_DINING + LUXURY_AYURVEDIC_SPA + MUGHLAI_TASTING + COUPLE_EXPERIENCES', 'Agra''s romantic routes mix ultra-luxury Taj-view balcony sanctuaries, royal Mughlai multi-course dining, rooftop lounges overlooking glowing marble domes, and quiet walks along Yamuna garden estates. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:4', 'agra', 'prioritize_WILDLIFE_SOS_ELEPHANTS + TAJ_EAST_GATE_BATTERY_BUSES + KALAKRITI_MOHABBAT_THE_TAJ_SHOW AND: include_MEHTAB_BAGH_GARDEN_RUNS + MARBLE_INLAY_WORKSHOPS_AT_GOKULPURA + AGRA_CHAUPATI_FOOD_PARK AND: reduce_STEEP_MONUMENT_HIGH_STAIRS + LONG_CONTINUOUS_TRANSFERS', 'Agra has exceptional family sights, including rescued elephant sanctuary visits, battery-operated cart rides through eco-zones, interactive marble craft workshops, and colorful theatrical evening shows. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:5', 'agra', 'prefer_OBEROI_AMARVILAS_AGRA + ITC_MUGHAL_LUXURY_COLLECTION + TAJ_HOTEL_AGRA AND: increase_PRIVATE_GUIDES + ROYAL_MUGHLAI_FINE_DINING + PRIVATE_MPV_TRANSFERS + VIP_MONUMENT_ENTRY + SPA', 'Agra high-end travel relies on world-famous Taj-view luxury suites, multi-course Mughlai imperial dining, private MPV transfers via expressways, and high-end heritage hotel estates. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:6', 'agra', 'prefer_ELECTRIC_AUTO_RICKS_AND_E_BUSES + SELF_GUIDED_WALKS + LOCAL_TAKEAWAY_BEDAI_STALLS AND: book_FREE_GARDEN_VIEW_POINTS_EARLY AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_TAJ_EAST_GATE_PROMENADE_STROLLS + KINARI_BAZAAR_MARKET_WALKS + MOUNTAIN_RIVER_LOOKOUT_VIEWS', 'Agra can be accessed affordably using local electric buses, authentic street side dhabas, free Taj East Gate promenade walkways, and scenic riverbank garden viewpoints across the Yamuna. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:7', 'agra', 'prioritize_TAJ_MAHAL + AGRA_FORT + FATEHPUR_SIKRI + ITIMAD_UD_DAULAH AND: include_MUGHAL_ARCHITECTURE + SEYCHELLES_CREOLE_HERITAGE + LOCAL_FESTIVALS', 'These sights showcase Agra''s unique imperial history, mixing Persian, Timurid, and Indian architectural traditions with 300 years of Mughal empire heritage. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:8', 'agra', 'prioritize_PIETRA_DURA_MARBLE_WORKSHOPS + TAJ_MUSEUM + FATEHPUR_SIKRI_PALACES + JAMA_MASJID_AGRA AND: include_CONTEMPORARY_ISLAND_GALLERIES + HISTORIC_COLONIAL_RENEWAL + ECO_RESORT_DESIGN', 'This route contrasts intricate Pietra Dura marble inlay craftsmanship with grand red sandstone arches, geometric Mughal gardens, and historic Islamic calligraphy. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:9', 'agra', 'prefer_AGRA_BEDAI_KACHORI + MUGHLAI_MUTTON_RANA + GRILLED_TANDOORI_KEBABS + AGRA_PETHA_SWEETS AND: include_FISH_TAKEOUT_STALLS + ANSE_ROYALE_BISTROS + SEAFOOD_FINE_DINING', 'Agra dining spans iconic crispy breakfast Bedai-Jalebi, fragrant Biryani, unique world-famous pumpkin Petha sweets, and royal Mughlai tandoori dining. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:10', 'agra', 'prioritize_KEOLADEO_NATIONAL_PARK + WILDLIFE_SOS_ELEPHANT_CENTER + SUR_SAROVAR_BIRD_SANCTUARY + MEHTAB_BAGH_YAMUNA_PARK AND: do_not_treat_MANICURED_RESORT_GARDENS_AND_NATIONAL_PARK_JUNGLE_TRAILS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Resort lawns offer manicured lawns and pools, while Agra''s surrounding wetlands and wildlife rescue centers feature native migratory birds, Asian elephants, and protected river ecosystems. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:11', 'agra', 'prioritize_SADAR_BAZAAR + KINARI_BAZAAR_OLD_CITY + SUBHASH_EMPORIUM_MARBLE + SHAHGANJ_LEATHER_MARKET AND: include_LOCAL_RUM_STORES + SPICE_SHOPS + CREOLE_HANDICRAFTS', 'Sadar Bazaar offers high-end leather goods and handicrafts, Kinari Bazaar supplies traditional bridal embroidery and spices, and Subhash Emporium features authentic Pietra Dura marble souvenirs. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:12', 'agra', 'choose_LUXURY_RESORT_SPAS + TRADITIONAL_AYURVEDIC_ABHYANGA_MASSAGE + HYDROTHERAPY_SANCTUARIES AND: do_not_treat_LOCAL_HOLISTIC_MASSAGE_AND_MODERN_RESORT_HOTEL_SPAS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Agra wellness ranges from heritage hotel holistic Ayurvedic massages to Forbes-rated luxury spa retreats overlooking the Taj Mahal horizon. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:13', 'agra', 'prioritize_TAJ_MAHAL_SUNRISE + MEHTAB_BAGH_SUNSET + AGRA_FORT_MUSAMMAM_BURJ + HUMAYUN_MOSQUE_VIEWPOINT AND: prioritize_GOLDEN_HOUR + BLUE_HOUR + CLEAR_AIR_DAYS', 'These sites produce stunning visual contrasts between glowing white marble domes, red sandstone ramparts, and emerald Yamuna riverbank gardens. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:14', 'agra', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_ONE_OR_TWO_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Monument transit, city traffic navigation, and railway/expressway transfers consume valuable sightseeing hours. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:15', 'agra', 'prefer_DIRECT_CAR_RENTALS_PRIVATE_TRANSFERS_OR_GATIMAAN_EXPRESS_TRAINS_OVER_MULTIPLE_LOCAL_BUS_TRANSFERS', 'Direct express trains and private car transfers eliminate transit confusion and save energy for exploring heritage monuments and palace complexes. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:16', 'agra', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_RESORT_HOTELS + FLAT_TAJ_EAST_GATE_PROMENADE + PRIVATE_MPV + MEHTAB_BAGH_ACCESSIBLE_PATHWAYS AND: reduce_EXCESSIVE_JUNGLE_STEPS + MORNE_BLANC_INCLINES + EXTREME_HUMIDITY_WALKS', 'High monument stairs and steep sandstone ramparts cause fatigue; battery carts, private MPVs, and flat garden pathways ease travel. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:17', 'agra', 'prioritize_EARLY_MORNING_HERITAGE_VISITS + AIR_CONDITIONED_MUSEUMS_AND_STORES + EVENING_BEACH_DINING AND: reduce_MIDDAY_UNSHADED_BEACH_EXPOSURE', 'Agra summer temps routinely exceed high tropical heat (over 40°C); early starts and air-conditioned indoor breaks maintain comfort. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:18', 'agra', 'increase_TAJ_MUSEUM + KALAKRITI_CULTURAL_CENTER + INDOOR_RESORT_ENTERTAINMENT + MARBLE_CRAFT_EMPORIUMS AND: reduce_MORNE_BLANC_OUTDOOR_DECKS + OUTDOOR_BEACH_PROMENADES', 'Indoor history museums, cultural dance shows, covered marble emporiums, and heritage lounges remain excellent regardless of outdoor rain or dense winter fog. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:19', 'agra', 'prioritize_TAJ_MAHAL + AGRA_FORT + FATEHPUR_SIKRI + MEHTAB_BAGH AND: add_ONE_OF_SAINTE_ANNE_MARINE_PARK_MISSION_LODGE_OR_TAKAMAKA_DISTILLERY AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_CREOLE_OCTOPUS_CURRY_OR_TAKEOUT_FISH_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a comprehensive introduction to Agra''s premier Mughal architectural heritage alongside authentic local food culture. ---'),
  ('agra:rule:20', 'agra', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_TEA_TAVERNS + BEACH_CAFES + SPAS + SUNSET_LOUNGES + SHOPPING + FREE_TIME ---', NULL),
  ('varanasi:rule:0', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_KASHI_VISHWANATH_DASHASHWAMEDH + SUNRISE_GANGA_BOAT + ASSI AND: include_SARNATH_IF_SCHEDULE_ALLOWS + ONE_BANARASI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'Very short stays gain more value from Varanasi''s strongest sacred riverfront experiences and one cultural extension than from attempting many scattered secondary sites. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:1', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_KASHI_VISHWANATH + DASHASHWAMEDH_AARTI + SUNRISE_BOAT + ASSI + SARNATH AND: add_ONE_OF_BHU_SOUTHERN_TEMPLES_OR_BANARASI_WEAVING', 'This gives a balanced first introduction to sacred Kashi, Ganga river culture, Buddhist heritage, food and living artisan traditions. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:2', 'varanasi', 'prefer_KASHI_VISHWANATH + CENTRAL_GHATS + ASSI + SARNATH + BHU + SOUTHERN_TEMPLES AND: add_RAMNAGAR + NORTHERN_GHATS + BANARASI_WEAVING + KABIR_CHAURA_OR_SPECIALIST_CULTURE', 'Longer stays should move beyond the headline pilgrimage corridor and reveal Varanasi through multiple religious, educational, artisan and neighborhood traditions. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:3', 'varanasi', 'prefer_PREMIUM_ASSI_SHIVALA_OR_RIVERFRONT_HOTEL + PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER + PRIVATE_SUNRISE_BOAT AND: increase_QUIET_GHAT_WALKS + HERITAGE_DINING + SARNATH + CURATED_CULTURE + FREE_TIME', 'Varanasi''s romantic appeal comes primarily from river atmosphere, sunrise experiences, heritage stays and private cultural experiences rather than resort-style honeymoon infrastructure. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:4', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_ASSI + SUNRISE_BOAT + SARNATH + BHU AND: include_SELECTED_TEMPLES + FOOD + CRAFT_EXPERIENCES AND: reduce_LONG_OLD_CITY_WALKS + PEAK_CROWD_EXPOSURE + EXCESSIVE_GHAT_STAIRS', 'Varanasi works best for families when intense old-city sightseeing is balanced with boats, open spaces, Sarnath and shorter cultural blocks. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:5', 'varanasi', 'prefer_SHORT_GHAT_VISITS + PRIVATE_CAR + E_RICKSHAW + EARLY_OR_EVENING_SIGHTSEEING AND: include_ASSI + SARNATH + BHU + SIMPLE_FOOD_EXPERIENCES AND: reduce_LONG_TEMPLE_QUEUES + CREMATION_GHAT_DURATION + EXTREME_HEAT', 'Young children generally benefit from variety and transport breaks rather than continuous temple queues and stair-heavy walking. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:6', 'varanasi', 'prefer_PREMIUM_RIVERFRONT_OR_HIGH_END_CITY_HOTEL AND: increase_CHAUFFEURED_CAR + PRIVATE_GUIDE + PRIVATE_BOAT + CURATED_TEMPLE_ASSISTANCE + PREMIUM_CRAFT_SHOPPING + FINE_DINING', 'Varanasi luxury travel is strongest through personalized access, premium accommodation, expert interpretation, river experiences and bespoke cultural services. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:7', 'varanasi', 'prefer_ASSI_LANKA_BHELUPUR_OR_CENTRALLY_CONNECTED_BUDGET_STAY + WALKING + E_RICKSHAW_AUTO AND: balance_PAID_EXPERIENCES_WITH_GHATS + LOCAL_FOOD + MARKETS + SHARED_BOATS', 'Varanasi is highly suitable for budget travel because many major cultural experiences remain inexpensive or free. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:8', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_KASHI_VISHWANATH + DASHASHWAMEDH + GANGA_GHATS AND: include_ANNAPURNA + SANKAT_MOCHAN + DURGA_KUND + SELECTED_SACRED_CIRCUITS', 'Varanasi''s primary destination identity is inseparable from Hindu sacred geography, the Ganga and its long-established pilgrimage traditions. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:9', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_SARNATH AND: include_DHAMEKH_STUPA + CHAUKHANDI_STUPA + ARCHAEOLOGICAL_REMAINS + MUSEUM + MULAGANDHA_KUTI_VIHAR', 'Sarnath is where the Buddha delivered his first sermon after enlightenment and should receive dedicated interpretive time rather than a short monument stop. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:10', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_OLD_KASHI + MAJOR_GHATS + SARNATH + BHU AND: include_RAMNAGAR + BANARASI_CRAFT + KABIR_TULSI_AND_MUSIC_CONTEXT', 'Varanasi''s cultural importance extends beyond monuments into learning, literature, music, religion, crafts, festivals and living neighborhood traditions. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:11', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_KASHI_VISHWANATH + GANGA_GHATS + SOUTHERN_TEMPLE_CIRCUIT AND: include_SARNATH_AND_OTHER_MULTI_FAITH_HERITAGE_IF_RELEVANT', 'Varanasi is primarily Hindu sacred geography but also possesses major Buddhist, Jain and Sant traditions. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:12', 'varanasi', 'prefer_GODOWLIA + CHOWK + ASSI + SELECTED_TRADITIONAL_FOOD_STOPS AND: include_KACHORI_SABZI + CHAAT + LASSI + BANARASI_PAAN + MITHAI AND: add_MALAIYO_WHEN_SEASONALLY_AVAILABLE', 'Varanasi''s culinary identity is strongest through breakfast traditions, street food, dairy sweets, chaat and paan rather than one signature dish. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:13', 'varanasi', 'include_KACHORI_SABZI + CHAAT + SATTVIC_MEALS + LASSI + SWEETS + SEASONAL_MALAIYO AND: do_not_assume_VARANASI_REQUIRES_NON_VEGETARIAN_FOOD_FOR_A_COMPLETE_CULINARY_EXPERIENCE', 'Varanasi is particularly strong for vegetarian, temple-associated and traditional North Indian food experiences. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:14', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_BANARASI_SILK_AND_BROCADE + GODOWLIA_CHOWK + REPUTABLE_CRAFT_SELLERS AND: include_GULABI_MEENAKARI + WOODEN_LACQUERWARE + METAL_AND_STONE_CRAFTS', 'Varanasi''s official cultural profile strongly identifies silk, brocades, textiles, toys, ornaments, metalwork, clay and wood crafts among its traditional industries. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:15', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_REPUTABLE_HANDLOOM_AND_SPECIALIST_SELLERS AND: compare_WEAVING_METHOD + SILK_QUALITY + ZARI + DESIGN_COMPLEXITY + FINISHING + PRICE AND: do_not_assume_EVERY_BANARASI_LABEL_MEANS_IDENTICAL_HANDWOVEN_QUALITY', 'Banarasi textile value varies substantially according to production method, materials and craftsmanship. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:16', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_SUNRISE_GANGA + ASSI + DASHASHWAMEDH + NORTHERN_GHATS + SARNATH AND: include_BOATS + OLD_CITY_LANES + FESTIVAL_SCENES_WHEN_APPROPRIATE AND: prioritize_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + BLUE_HOUR', 'Varanasi provides exceptional river light, architecture, boats, rituals and street scenes throughout the day. ---');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('varanasi:rule:17', 'varanasi', 'prefer_OLD_CITY + GODOWLIA_CHOWK + ASSI + SELECTED_MARKETS AND: respect_LOCAL_PRIVACY + RELIGIOUS_SENSITIVITY + CREMATION_RITUALS', 'Varanasi offers exceptional human-interest photography, but sacred and private situations require strict cultural sensitivity. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:18', 'varanasi', 'include_KABIR_CHAURA + TULSI_HERITAGE + BANARAS_MUSIC_TRADITIONS + CULTURAL_PERFORMANCES_WHEN_AVAILABLE', 'Official district tourism identifies Varanasi as a major centre of literature, vocal and instrumental music, folk traditions and Ramlila. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:19', 'varanasi', 'choose_ASSI_OR_QUIETER_RIVERFRONT_BASE + PREMIUM_HOTEL + PRIVATE_BOAT + SARNATH AND: combine_WITH_LIGHT_GHAT_WALKING + FOOD + CULTURE + FREE_TIME', 'Relaxation-oriented Varanasi itineraries work best when central pilgrimage congestion is deliberately reduced. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:20', 'varanasi', 'prefer_ASSI + BHELUPUR + LANKA + SELECTED_HOTELS_AND_CAFES AND: focus_ON_GANGA_AARTI + FOOD + CAFES + CULTURAL_PERFORMANCES + EVENING_WALKS AND: do_not_position_VARANASI_AS_A_MAJOR_CLUBBING_DESTINATION', 'Varanasi''s evening appeal comes primarily from spiritual activity, riverfront atmosphere, dining and culture rather than conventional nightlife. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:21', 'varanasi', 'prefer_ONE_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES_BETWEEN_OLD_CITY_ASSI_AND_CANTONMENT', 'Changing hotels usually creates more luggage and access friction than sightseeing benefit during a short Varanasi stay. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:22', 'varanasi', 'prefer_ASSI_BHELUPUR_OR_ACCESSIBLE_CENTRAL_LOCATION', 'These areas generally provide a better balance between riverfront access, central sightseeing and road connectivity than the deepest old-city lanes. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:23', 'varanasi', 'consider_KASHI_VISHWANATH_DASHASHWAMEDH_PROXIMITY AND: verify_FINAL_VEHICLE_ACCESS + STAIRS + LUGGAGE_TRANSFER + CROWD_CONDITIONS', 'Very close temple accommodation can reduce pilgrimage travel time but may significantly increase last-mile movement complexity. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:24', 'varanasi', 'consider_PREMIUM_RIVERFRONT_OR_HERITAGE_PROPERTIES AND: retain_PRIVATE_CAR_AND_LUGGAGE_ASSISTANCE', 'Riverfront luxury provides stronger atmosphere but property access varies substantially according to road and ghat position. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:25', 'varanasi', 'consider_ASSI_LANKA_BHELUPUR_AND_WELL_CONNECTED_GUESTHOUSES AND: verify_CLEANLINESS + ACCESS + AIR_CONDITIONING + NIGHT_ARRIVAL_PRACTICALITY', 'These areas provide broad budget inventory and strong access to food and local transport. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:26', 'varanasi', 'choose_BETWEEN_APP_CAB + TAXI + PRIVATE_CAR ACCORDING_TO: HOTEL_LOCATION + LUGGAGE + TRAVELER_COUNT + ARRIVAL_TIME + FINAL_OLD_CITY_ACCESS', 'Airport transfer planning should consider the final hotel approach because central historic lanes may not permit door-to-door car access. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:27', 'varanasi', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR_OR_CAB', 'Sarnath is an outer-city archaeological and pilgrimage cluster and is more efficiently handled through a dedicated road excursion. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:28', 'varanasi', 'prefer_E_RICKSHAW_OR_AUTO_TO_ACCESSIBLE_POINT AND: continue_WITH_WALKING', 'Narrow historic lanes and traffic controls make last-mile local transport and walking more practical than continuous car movement. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:29', 'varanasi', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_HOTEL + PRIVATE_CAR + SHORT_WALKING_BLOCKS + VERIFIED_BOAT_BOARDING AND: reduce_STEEP_GHAT_STAIRS + DENSE_OLD_CITY_WALKS + PEAK_HEAT + PEAK_PILGRIMAGE_CROWDS', 'Varanasi can remain highly rewarding for seniors, but its historic riverfront requires significant itinerary adaptation. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:30', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_PRE_DAWN_OR_EARLY_GHATS + TEMPLE_VISITS + AIR_CONDITIONED_MIDDAY_BREAK + EVENING_ACTIVITY AND: reduce_MIDDAY_SARNATH + LONG_GHAT_WALKS + EXPOSED_OUTDOOR_TOURING', 'April–June heat can make prolonged outdoor sightseeing physically demanding and requires strong day-part planning. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:31', 'varanasi', 'increase_TEMPLES + FOOD + CRAFT + SELECTED_INDOOR_CULTURE AND: reduce_TIGHTLY_TIMED_BOAT_PLANS + LONG_RIVERFRONT_WALKS AND: allow_BUFFER_FOR_RIVER_LEVEL + TRAFFIC + LOCAL_RESTRICTIONS', 'Monsoon rainfall and changing Ganga conditions can affect boat services, river access and outdoor itineraries. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:32', 'varanasi', 'allow_FLEXIBILITY_FOR_SUNRISE_BOATS AND: allow_BUFFER_FOR_AIRPORT + RAILWAY + INTERCITY_TRANSFERS AND: shift_PHOTOGRAPHY_TO_LATER_MORNING_IF_VISIBILITY_IS_POOR', 'Dense winter fog can reduce river visibility and disrupt transport even during otherwise excellent sightseeing weather. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:33', 'varanasi', 'increase_WALKING_AND_E_RICKSHAW_DEPENDENCE + HOTEL_LOCATION_PRIORITY + TIME_BUFFERS AND: reduce_CROSS_CITY_MOVEMENTS + TIGHT_CONNECTIONS', 'Major pilgrimage and festival periods can generate road diversions, long queues, concentrated ghat crowds and exceptional demand. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:34', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_KASHI_VISHWANATH + DASHASHWAMEDH_AARTI + SUNRISE_GANGA_BOAT AND: add_ASSI + SARNATH + ONE_BANARASI_FOOD_AND_CRAFT_EXPERIENCE', 'This provides the strongest balanced introduction to Varanasi through sacred geography, the Ganga, Buddhist heritage and living Banarasi culture. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:35', 'varanasi', 'prioritize_ASSI + OLD_CITY_LANES + GODOWLIA_CHOWK + SELECTED_NORTHERN_GHATS AND: reduce_TOTAL_TIME_SPENT_ONLY_IN_MODERN_HOTELS_AND_ROAD_BASED_SIGHTSEEING', 'Varanasi''s strongest sense of place comes from its ghats, lanes, food, rituals, markets, crafts and everyday riverfront life. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:36', 'varanasi', 'allocate_50_TO_60_PERCENT_TO_CORE_GHATS_TEMPLES_AND_SARNATH AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_BHU + FOOD + CRAFT + HOTEL_REST + FREE_TIME', 'Families generally enjoy Varanasi more when intensive spiritual sightseeing is balanced with educational and less crowded experiences. ---'),
  ('varanasi:rule:37', 'varanasi', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_GHATS_SARNATH_AND_CULTURE AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_ASSI + PRIVATE_BOAT + FOOD + HOTEL_REST + FREE_TIME', 'Varanasi becomes significantly more rewarding when the itinerary allows time to observe and absorb the city rather than continuously moving between attractions. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:0', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_RAM_JANMABHOOMI_MANDIR + HANUMAN_GARHI_MANDIR + SARYU_RIVER_AARTI_AND_RAM_KI_PAIDI', 'Very short stays gain more value from properly experiencing core temple darshan, spiritual riverfront lighting, and authentic satvik culinary heritage than losing time to distant regional day excursions. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:1', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_RAM_JANMABHOOMI_CORE + HANUMAN_GARHI_AND_KANAK_BHAWAN + GUPTAR_GHAT_PROMENADE + FAIZABAD_NAWABI_HERITAGE_DAY_TRIP', 'This gives a balanced introduction to Vedic spiritual heritage, grand temple architecture, peaceful riverfront promenades, and 18th-century Nawabi garden history. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:2', 'ayodhya', 'prefer_AYODHYA_DHAM_CENTRAL_CORE + SARYU_RIVERFRONT_RETREAT + DAY_TRIPS_TO_NAIMISHARANYA_OR_VARANASI_VIA_RAIL_OR_HIGHWAY AND: use_E_RICSKSHAWS_ELECTRIC_BUSES_AND_PRIVATE_AC_TAXIS', 'Central heritage havelis, riverside eco-parks, historical monuments, and regional pilgrimage connections via expressways offer distinct insights into northern India''s spiritual belt. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:3', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_SARYU_RIVERFRONT_LUXURY_HOTELS + CENTRAL_HERITAGE_HAVELI_STAYS + PRIVATE_SUNSET_SARYU_BOAT_CRUISE AND: increase_BOUTIQUE_STAYS + ROOFTOP_SARYU_VIEW_DINING + LUXURY_SPA + SATVIK_FINE_DINING + COUPLE_EXPERIENCES', 'Ayodhya''s romantic routes mix luxury river-view suites, fine satvik Awadhi thali dining, rooftop tea sessions overlooking illuminated temple spires, and quiet evening walks along Guptar Ghat. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:4', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_RAM_KI_PAIDI_LASER_SHOW + SARYU_BOAT_RIDE_FISH_FEEDING + LATA_MANGESHKAR_CHOWK_VEENA AND: include_TULSI_SMARAK_BHAWAN_RAMLILA + GOLF_CART_RIDES_JANMABHOOMI_PATH + LOCAL_SWEET_TASTING AND: reduce_STEEP_TEMPLE_STAIR_CLIMBS + LONG_CONTINUOUS_PEDESTRIAN_QUEUES', 'Ayodhya has exceptional family sights, including 3D light and sound shows, river boat rides, electric golf cart transport, puppet shows, and interactive Ramayana museums. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:5', 'ayodhya', 'prefer_SARYU_RIVERFRONT_LUXURY_HOTELS + HERITAGE_HAVELI_SUITES + VIP_TENTED_CITIES_DEEPOTSAV AND: increase_PRIVATE_VIP_DARSHAN_GUIDES + SATVIK_FINE_DINING + PRIVATE_SUV_TRANSFERS + PRIVATE_BOAT_CHARTERS + AYURVEDIC_SPA', 'Ayodhya high-end travel relies on boutique heritage suites, multi-course chef-curated Satvik thalis, private chauffeured SUV transfers, fast-track temple assistance, and private riverfront cruises. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:6', 'ayodhya', 'prefer_ELECTRIC_BUSES + E_RICSKSHAWS + WALKING + TEMPLE_ANNAKSHETRA_COMMUNITY_KITCHENS AND: book_FREE_TEMPLE_DARSHAN_SLOTS_EARLY AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_FREE_RAM_KI_PAIDI_STROLLS + SARYU_AARTI_VIEWS + GUPTAR_GHAT_PROMENADE', 'Ayodhya can be accessed affordably using local e-rickshaws, temple community feast halls (annakshetras), free public ghat parks, and free open-air laser light shows. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:7', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_RAM_JANMABHOOMI_MANDIR + GULAB_BARI + BAHU_BEGUM_KA_MAQBARA + TULSI_SMARAK_BHAWAN AND: include_VAGHELA_AWADHI_ARCHITECTURE + RAMAYANA_LITERARY_HERITAGE + LOCAL_FESTIVALS_DEEPOTSAV', 'These sights showcase Ayodhya''s unique multi-layered history, mixing ancient Suryavanshi heritage, Ramayana literary traditions, and 18th-century Awadhi Nawabi architecture. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:8', 'ayodhya', 'prefer_RAM_JANMABHOOMI_NAGARA_STYLE + KANAK_BHAWAN_ORLI_WORK + BAHU_BEGUM_MAQBARA_NAWABI_DOMES + LATA_MANGESHKAR_CHOWK_VEENA AND: include_ANCIENT_STONE_CARVINGS + HERITAGE_HAVELI_COURTYARDS + MODERN_PLAZA_DESIGN', 'This route contrasts ancient and modern Nagara temple architecture with grand Nawabi Mughal domes and contemporary civic bronze installations. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:9', 'ayodhya', 'prefer_AWADHI_SATVIK_THALI + BEDMI_PURI_ALOO_KACHORI + DAHI_JALEBI_AND_RABRI + AYODHYA_PEDA AND: include_HANUMAN_GARHI_SWEET_LANE + KULHAD_CHAI_STALLS + MAKHAN_MALAI_WINTER_SPECIAL', 'Ayodhya dining spans pure-vegetarian satvik feasts prepared without onion or garlic, crispy morning kachoris, winter milk foam desserts, and historical peda sweet traditions. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:10', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_SARYU_RIVER_WETLANDS + GUPTAR_GHAT_TREE_PROMENADE + SARYU_ECO_PARK + SURAJ_KUND_GARDENS AND: do_not_treat_MANICURED_TEMPLE_GARDENS_AND_RIVERFRONT_CONSERVATION_TRAILS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Temple gardens offer manicured lawns and fountains, while Saryu riverfront conservation zones feature migratory water birds, natural wetlands, and riverine flora. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:11', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_HANUMAN_GARHI_MARKET_LANE + RAM_PATH_HERITAGE_STORES + GITA_PRESS_BOOK_DEPOT + FAIZABAD_TEXTILE_BAZAARS AND: include_BRASS_IDOLS + WOODEN_RAM_MANDIR_REPLICAS + CHIKANKARI_TEXTILES + TULSI_MALAS', 'Hanuman Garhi lane supplies brass idols and devotional souvenirs, Ram Path houses book depots and handicraft stores, and Faizabad markets supply traditional textiles and embroidery. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:12', 'ayodhya', 'choose_RIVERSIDE_AYURVEDIC_RETREATS + TRADITIONAL_VEDIC_HERBAL_MASSAGE + RIVERSIDE_YOGA_PAVILIONS AND: do_not_treat_LOCAL_HOLISTIC_MASSAGES_AND_LUXURY_RESORT_SPAS_AS_IDENTICAL', 'Ayodhya wellness ranges from quiet riverfront yoga sessions and Vedic Ayurvedic centers to luxury resort spa treatments overlooking the Saryu. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:13', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_RAM_KI_PAIDI_ILLUMINATIONS + BAHU_BEGUM_MAQBARA_LOOKOUT + SARYU_RIVER_SUNSET_BOATS + GUPTAR_GHAT_PROMENADE AND: prioritize_GOLDEN_HOUR + BLUE_HOUR + EVENING_AARTI_LIGHTING', 'These sites produce stunning visual contrasts between glowing temple spires, reflective river waters, historic Nawabi domes, and vibrant evening aarti flames. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:14', 'ayodhya', 'prefer_MAXIMUM_ONE_OR_TWO_BASES AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Inner-city traffic, pedestrian security zones, and airport/rail transfers consume valuable sightseeing hours. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:15', 'ayodhya', 'prefer_DIRECT_E_BUSES_PRIVATE_TRANSFERS_OR_EXPRESS_TRAINS_OVER_MULTIPLE_LOCAL_TRANSITS', 'Direct transfers eliminate transit confusion and save energy for exploring temple complexes and historical monuments. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:16', 'ayodhya', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_HOTELS + FLAT_GHAT_PROMENADES + ELECTRIC_GOLF_CARTS + JANMABHOOMI_PATH_RAMPS AND: reduce_HANUMAN_GARHI_STEEP_STEPS + LONG_UNSHADED_WALKS + EXTREME_SUMMER_HEAT_EXPOSURE', 'Steep temple staircases and long pedestrian walking corridors cause fatigue; ramps, battery golf carts, and flat promenades ease travel. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:17', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_EARLY_MORNING_DARSHAN + AIR_CONDITIONED_MUSEUMS_AND_HOTELS + EVENING_RIVER_AARTI AND: reduce_MIDDAY_UNSHADED_TEMPLE_QUEUE_EXPOSURE', 'Ayodhya summer temps routinely exceed 40°C with intense solar radiation; early morning starts and shaded/indoor breaks maintain comfort. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:18', 'ayodhya', 'increase_RAM_KATHA_MUSEUM + TULSI_SMARAK_BHAWAN + INDOOR_BHOJANALAYAS + COVERED_BAZAARS AND: reduce_SARYU_BOAT_CRUISES + OUTDOOR_GHAT_PROMENADES', 'Indoor history museums, cultural centers, covered sweet bazaars, and traditional bhojanalayas remain excellent regardless of outdoor rain or smog. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:19', 'ayodhya', 'prioritize_RAM_JANMABHOOMI_MANDIR + HANUMAN_GARHI + KANAK_BHAWAN + SARYU_RIVER_AARTI AND: add_ONE_OF_RAM_KI_PAIDI_LASER_SHOW_GUPTAR_GHAT_OR_GULAB_BARI AND: include_ONE_SIGNATURE_AWADHI_SATVIK_THALI_OR_BEDMI_PURI_EXPERIENCE', 'This structure provides a comprehensive introduction to Ayodhya''s premier spiritual heritage and historic sights alongside authentic local food culture. ---'),
  ('ayodhya:rule:20', 'ayodhya', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_CORE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_TEA_HOUSES + RIVERSIDE_CAFES + SPAS + SUNSET_BOATS + SHOPPING + FREE_TIME ---', NULL),
  ('mumbai:rule:0', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_GATEWAY_OF_INDIA + COLABA + FORT_CST + MARINE_DRIVE AND: skip_ELEPHANTA_IF_FERRY_TIMING_CREATES_RISK', 'A very short Mumbai visit gains maximum value from a geographically concentrated South Mumbai heritage and waterfront circuit. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:1', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_SOUTH_MUMBAI_HERITAGE + ELEPHANTA_OR_BANDRA + MARINE_DRIVE AND: retain_ONE_MUMBAI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'Two nights allow Mumbai''s principal heritage core plus one major secondary experience without excessive cross-city movement. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:2', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_COLABA + ELEPHANTA + FORT_CST + KALA_GHODA + ART_DECO + MARINE_DRIVE + BANDRA AND: include_ONE_DEDICATED_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'Three to four nights provide the strongest first-time balance between UNESCO heritage, coastline, neighborhoods, food and contemporary Mumbai. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:3', 'mumbai', 'add_SANJAY_GANDHI_NATIONAL_PARK + KANHERI_CAVES OR: add_BYCULLA + WORLI_MAHALAXMI + DEEPER_BANDRA', 'Longer stays can move beyond Mumbai''s iconic South Mumbai circuit into nature, archaeology and neighborhood-level exploration. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:4', 'mumbai', 'add_SPECIALIST_FOOD + ARCHITECTURE + MARKETS + WESTERN_SUBURBS AND: consider_ONE_MUMBAI_REGION_EXTENSION', 'Mumbai has sufficient cultural depth for longer stays when additional days are thematic rather than repetitions of the headline landmarks. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:5', 'mumbai', 'prefer_SEA_VIEW_OR_PREMIUM_HOTEL + PRIVATE_CAR + MARINE_DRIVE + BANDRA + FINE_DINING AND: reduce_CROWDED_MARKET_AND_PEAK_HOUR_TRANSIT_TIME', 'Mumbai works best for honeymoon travel through premium urban experiences, waterfront evenings and dining rather than resort-style seclusion. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:6', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_CSMVS + MARINE_DRIVE + ELEPHANTA_IF_CHILDREN_CAN_HANDLE_STEPS + SANJAY_GANDHI_NATIONAL_PARK + JUHU AND: use_CAB_OR_METRO_FOR_LONGER_MOVEMENTS', 'Families benefit from mixing museums, nature, waterfronts and heritage rather than continuous architectural sightseeing. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:7', 'mumbai', 'prefer_SHORT_HERITAGE_SESSIONS + MUSEUMS + MARINE_DRIVE + JUHU + FAMILY_NATURE AND: avoid_RUSH_HOUR_LOCAL_TRAINS + EXCESSIVE_CROSS_CITY_TRAVEL', 'Mumbai''s crowds, heat and long metropolitan distances can become tiring for younger children. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:8', 'mumbai', 'prefer_LANDMARK_FIVE_STAR_HOTEL AND: increase_CHauffeured_TRANSPORT + PRIVATE_GUIDE + FINE_DINING + SPA + PREMIUM_SHOPPING', 'Mumbai is one of India''s strongest urban luxury destinations, particularly for hotels, gastronomy, shopping and private services. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:9', 'mumbai', 'prefer_PUBLIC_TRANSPORT + LOCAL_FOOD + WALKABLE_CLUSTERS + VALUE_HOTEL_NEAR_RAIL_OR_METRO AND: use_APP_CAB_SELECTIVELY', 'Mumbai can remain relatively affordable when expensive cross-city taxis and premium accommodation are controlled. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:10', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_ELEPHANTA_CAVES + CSMT + VICTORIAN_GOTHIC_AND_ART_DECO_ENSEMBLES', 'Mumbai contains three major UNESCO World Heritage components spanning ancient rock-cut art, railway architecture and nineteenth-to-twentieth-century urban design. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:11', 'mumbai', 'allocate_HALF_DAY AND: depart_FROM_GATEWAY_OF_INDIA AND: verify_FERRY_OPERATION + WEATHER + OPENING_DAY AND: do_not_schedule_ON_MONDAY', 'Elephanta is an island-based UNESCO site reached by roughly one-hour ferry travel from the Gateway of India and normally closes on Mondays. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:12', 'mumbai', 'verify_STAIR_AND_ISLAND_ACCESS_REQUIREMENTS_BEFORE_CONFIRMING AND: consider_ALTERNATIVE_SOUTH_MUMBAI_HERITAGE_IF_UNSUITABLE', 'Reaching the principal Elephanta cave complex involves steps and natural terrain after the ferry journey. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:13', 'mumbai', 'reassess_ELEPHANTA_FERRY AND: replace_WITH_CSMVS + KALA_GHODA + CST + INDOOR_HERITAGE_IF_REQUIRED', 'Marine transport and island sightseeing should remain weather-dependent rather than fixed regardless of conditions. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:14', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_CSMT + FORT + OVAL_MAIDAN + VICTORIAN_GOTHIC + ART_DECO + MARINE_DRIVE AND: include_SPECIALIST_HERITAGE_WALK_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'UNESCO identifies Mumbai''s Victorian Gothic and Art Deco ensembles as evidence of successive phases of the city''s nineteenth- and twentieth-century modernization. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:15', 'mumbai', 'combine_WITH_FORT + FLORA_FOUNTAIN + KALA_GHODA_OR_OVAL_MAIDAN', 'CSMT is most meaningful when interpreted within Mumbai''s wider historic mercantile and Gothic urban landscape. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:16', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_OVAL_MAIDAN + CHURCHGATE_PRECINCT + MARINE_DRIVE AND: allocate_WALKING_AND_PHOTOGRAPHY_TIME', 'Mumbai''s UNESCO Art Deco component is a district-scale urban ensemble rather than a single monument. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:17', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_CSMVS + KALA_GHODA AND: consider_BHAU_DAJI_LAD_MUSEUM + NGMA_BASED_ON_INTEREST', 'Kala Ghoda and nearby South Mumbai contain Mumbai''s strongest concentration of major museums and galleries. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:18', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_EARLY_COLABA + FORT_ARCHITECTURE + OVAL_ART_DECO + MARINE_DRIVE_SUNSET + BANDRA_COAST AND: include_STREET_AND_MARKET_PHOTOGRAPHY_RESPONSIBLY', 'Mumbai''s strongest photography combines architecture, street life, waterfronts and contemporary cityscape. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:19', 'mumbai', 'prefer_COLABA + FORT + MARKETS + BANDRA + TRANSIT_ENVIRONMENTS AND: respect_PERSONAL_PRIVACY + RESTRICTED_AREAS', 'Mumbai provides exceptional human and urban photography, but photography should remain respectful and operational restrictions must be followed. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:20', 'mumbai', 'allocate_AT_LEAST_ONE_DEDICATED_FOOD_SESSION AND: include_STREET_FOOD + MAHARASHTRIAN_OR_KOLI + PARSI_IRANI_OR_SPECIALIST_DINING', 'Mumbai Tourism positions food as one of the city''s defining visitor experiences, extending well beyond its best-known snacks. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:21', 'mumbai', 'consider_JUHU + GIRGAUM_CHOWPATTY + LOCAL_MARKETS + ESTABLISHED_CITY_FOOD_DISTRICTS AND: use_BASIC_FOOD_HYGIENE_JUDGEMENT', 'Street food is central to Mumbai''s identity but should be selected according to both culinary interest and hygiene conditions. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:22', 'mumbai', 'prefer_BANDRA + LOWER_PAREL + BKC + WORLI + SELECT_COLABA_VENUES AND: choose_AREA_CLOSE_TO_HOTEL_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Mumbai''s nightlife is geographically distributed, and late-night cross-city transfers can unnecessarily reduce convenience. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:23', 'mumbai', 'choose_COLABA_FOR_TOURIST_SHOPPING OR: choose_BANDRA_FOR_FASHION_AND_BOUTIQUES OR: choose_CRAWFORD_MARKET_FOR_TRADITIONAL_MARKET_EXPERIENCE OR: choose_PREMIUM_MALLS_FOR_LUXURY_RETAIL', 'Mumbai''s shopping districts serve very different traveler profiles and should not be treated as interchangeable. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:24', 'mumbai', 'prefer_LATE_AFTERNOON + SUNSET + EVENING AND: combine_WITH_ART_DECO_OR_CHOWPATTY', 'Marine Drive''s strongest visitor value comes from its coastal setting, Art Deco context and evening atmosphere. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:25', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_MARINE_DRIVE + BANDRA_WATERFRONT + PREMIUM_DINING + SEA_VIEW_HOTEL AND: reduce_MIDDAY_TRAFFIC_HEAVY_SIGHTSEEING', 'Mumbai''s romantic appeal is strongest through its coastline, dining and luxury urban atmosphere. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:26', 'mumbai', 'combine_BANDSTAND + BANDRA_FORT + MOUNT_MARY + CARTER_ROAD + CAFES_OR_DINING', 'Bandra works best as a multi-layered neighborhood experience rather than a single Bandstand photo stop. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:27', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_EVENING_BEACH_ATMOSPHERE + STREET_FOOD + DINING AND: do_not_position_AS_PRISTINE_RESORT_BEACH', 'Juhu is primarily an urban recreational beachfront and food/social district. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:28', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_SANJAY_GANDHI_NATIONAL_PARK + KANHERI_CAVES AND: allocate_HALF_OR_FULL_DAY_DEPENDING_ON_ACTIVITIES', 'Sanjay Gandhi National Park provides Mumbai''s strongest large-scale urban nature experience and combines biodiversity with important Buddhist heritage. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:29', 'mumbai', 'use_BORIVALI_SIDE_ACCESS AND: combine_NATURE + KANHERI_CAVES_WHERE_TIME_ALLOWS AND: check_CURRENT_ACTIVITY_OPERATION_BEFORE_TRAVEL', 'Maharashtra Tourism identifies Borivali as the principal practical gateway and highlights nature trails, wildlife experiences, boating and Kanheri within the park. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:30', 'mumbai', 'allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS_WITHIN_SANJAY_GANDHI_NATIONAL_PARK AND: prefer_COOLER_MORNING_HOURS AND: expect_STEPS + WALKING', 'Kanheri is an extensive Buddhist rock-cut complex with more than 100 caves and substantial outdoor exploration. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:31', 'mumbai', 'combine_SANJAY_GANDHI_NATIONAL_PARK + KANHERI_CAVES', 'This pairing provides Mumbai''s strongest integration of ancient Buddhist heritage and large-scale urban nature. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:32', 'mumbai', 'consider_FILM_CITY_OR_STRUCTURED_FILM_INDUSTRY_EXPERIENCE AND: verify_CURRENT_VISITOR_ACCESS_AND_TOUR_FORMAT', 'Mumbai is India''s principal film-industry center, but studio access depends on current permissions and organized visitor arrangements. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:33', 'mumbai', 'combine_CRAWFORD_MARKET + COLABA_OR_BANDRA_BASED_ON_SHOPPING_STYLE AND: avoid_OVERLOADING_WITH_MULTIPLE_DISTANT_MARKETS', 'Mumbai''s market experience is strongest when selected by product type and geography. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:34', 'mumbai', 'prefer_ONE_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_UNNECESSARY_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'Mumbai''s principal sightseeing can be efficiently handled from one strategically chosen base when itinerary geography is planned correctly. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:35', 'mumbai', 'prefer_COLABA + FORT + NARIMAN_POINT + MARINE_DRIVE_SIDE_LOCATION', 'South Mumbai accommodation minimizes travel friction for Gateway, Elephanta, Fort, Kala Ghoda, Art Deco and Marine Drive. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:36', 'mumbai', 'consider_BANDRA + BKC + LOWER_PAREL + WORLI', 'These districts provide stronger positioning for contemporary dining, bars, business and evening activity than heritage-focused South Mumbai alone. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:37', 'mumbai', 'prefer_AIRPORT_OR_NORTH_CENTRAL_MUMBAI_LOCATION AND: do_not_use_AS_DEFAULT_FOR_SOUTH_MUMBAI_HEAVY_ITINERARY', 'Airport-area accommodation is operationally efficient for flights but can increase repeated road travel for South Mumbai sightseeing. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:38', 'mumbai', 'prefer_SEA_VIEW_OR_LANDMARK_PREMIUM_PROPERTY AND: verify_ROOM_VIEW + DINING + SPA + EVENING_ACCESS', 'Mumbai honeymoon quality depends more on hotel atmosphere and waterfront access than on conventional resort infrastructure. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:39', 'mumbai', 'prefer_LARGE_ROOM + BREAKFAST + EASY_CAB_ACCESS + CENTRAL_LOCATION AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_DAILY_CROSS_CITY_TRANSFERS', 'Mumbai''s metropolitan scale makes location one of the most important family-hotel variables. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:40', 'mumbai', 'prefer_PREBOOKED_CAB_OR_APP_CAB_FOR_LUGGAGE_HEAVY_ARRIVALS AND: allocate_TRAFFIC_BUFFER', 'South Mumbai is a substantial cross-city transfer from Mumbai''s principal airport and journey time varies significantly with traffic. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:41', 'mumbai', 'prefer_WALKING_WITHIN_COLABA_FORT_KALA_GHODA_CLUSTERS AND: use_SHORT_CAB_OR_BUS_LINKS_BETWEEN_CLUSTERS', 'Many of Mumbai''s highest-value heritage attractions are concentrated within a relatively compact South Mumbai zone. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:42', 'mumbai', 'use_ROAD_OR_RAIL_BASED_ON_TIME_OF_DAY + TRAVELER_PROFILE AND: avoid_ASSUMING_FIXED_TRANSFER_TIME', 'Traffic conditions and traveler comfort materially affect the best transport choice between South Mumbai and Bandra. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:43', 'mumbai', 'prefer_RAIL_OR_COMBINED_TRANSIT_WHERE_SUITABLE AND: allocate_SUBSTANTIAL_CROSS_CITY_TIME', 'Sanjay Gandhi National Park lies far north of Mumbai''s principal South Mumbai sightseeing core. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:44', 'mumbai', 'prefer_DOOR_TO_DOOR_CAB + SHORT_HERITAGE_WALKS + MUSEUMS + MARINE_DRIVE AND: reduce_LOCAL_TRAIN_PEAK_HOURS + ELEPHANTA_STEPS + LONG_KANHERI_WALKS', 'Mumbai remains highly rewarding for seniors, but transport crowds, heritage terrain and long walking days require simplification. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:45', 'mumbai', 'increase_HERITAGE_WALKS + ELEPHANTA + MARINE_DRIVE + BANDRA + SANJAY_GANDHI_NATIONAL_PARK AND: allow_LONGER_OUTDOOR_DAYS', 'Maharashtra Tourism identifies October to February as Mumbai''s strongest overall sightseeing period because conditions are comparatively pleasant. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:46', 'mumbai', 'treat_AS_PRIMARY_MUMBAI_SIGHTSEEING_SEASON AND: prebook_PREMIUM_HOTELS_AND_SPECIALIST_TOURS_DURING_HIGH_DEMAND_DATES', 'This period provides the most reliable overall combination of outdoor comfort, heritage walking and city exploration. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:47', 'mumbai', 'prefer_EARLY_HERITAGE + MIDDAY_MUSEUMS_OR_HOTEL_BREAK + EVENING_WATERFRONT AND: increase_HYDRATION + SUN_PROTECTION', 'Maharashtra Tourism classifies March to May as Mumbai''s hotter and more humid period with reduced outdoor comfort. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:48', 'mumbai', 'increase_MUSEUMS + FOOD + CAFES + MONSOON_PHOTOGRAPHY AND: maintain_WEATHER_FLEXIBILITY AND: verify_FERRY_AND_OUTDOOR_OPERATIONS', 'Mumbai receives heavy monsoon rainfall during this period, creating atmospheric scenery but greater sightseeing and transport uncertainty. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:49', 'mumbai', 'reduce_RIGID_OUTDOOR_SCHEDULING AND: replace_ELEPHANTA_OR_LONG_WALKS_WITH_CSMVS + GALLERIES + DINING + OTHER_INDOOR_OPTIONS_IF_REQUIRED AND: increase_TRANSFER_BUFFER', 'Heavy monsoon rainfall can materially affect outdoor comfort, marine transport and travel times. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:50', 'mumbai', 'reassess_ELEPHANTA_FERRY + BEACHES + WATERFRONT_ACTIVITY + LONG_CROSS_CITY_TRANSFERS AND: follow_OFFICIAL_LOCAL_WEATHER + TRANSPORT + CIVIC_GUIDANCE', 'Visitor safety and operational transport conditions should take precedence over a fixed sightseeing schedule. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:51', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_GATEWAY_AND_COLABA + ELEPHANTA + FORT_CST + KALA_GHODA + ART_DECO + MARINE_DRIVE AND: include_BANDRA_OR_ONE_LOCAL_NEIGHBORHOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'This provides the strongest first introduction to Mumbai''s heritage, UNESCO identity, coastline and contemporary urban character. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:52', 'mumbai', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_HERITAGE_AND_MUSEUMS AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_MARKETS + LOCAL_FOOD + NEIGHBORHOODS + EVENING_CITY_LIFE', 'Mumbai becomes more rewarding when formal sightseeing is balanced with its living food and neighborhood culture. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:53', 'mumbai', 'prioritize_CSMVS + MARINE_DRIVE + SANJAY_GANDHI_NATIONAL_PARK + ONE_HERITAGE_CLUSTER AND: retain_HOTEL_OR_DINING_BREAKS AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_DAILY_CROSS_CITY_MOVEMENT', 'Families generally experience Mumbai more comfortably when sightseeing variety is prioritized over attraction count. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:54', 'mumbai', 'allocate_SEPARATE_DAY_OR_OVERNIGHT_EXTENSION AND: do_not_force_WITH_FULL_MUMBAI_CITY_DAY', 'Western Ghats extensions provide a contrasting landscape but require separate road or rail travel beyond Mumbai''s urban sightseeing geography. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:55', 'mumbai', 'treat_AS_SEPARATE_COASTAL_EXTENSION AND: verify_FERRY_OR_ROAD_LOGISTICS + WEATHER', 'Alibaug provides a more leisure-oriented coastal contrast to Mumbai and works better as a dedicated excursion or overnight stay. ---'),
  ('mumbai:rule:56', 'mumbai', 'use_MUMBAI_AS_MAJOR_AIR_AND_RAIL_GATEWAY AND: continue_TO_KONKAN + WESTERN_GHATS + NASHIK + PUNE_OR_OTHER_COMPLEMENTARY_REGION', 'Mumbai works effectively as both a standalone metropolitan destination and a major gateway for wider Maharashtra travel. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:0', 'jaipur', 'Treat Jaipur as a Pink City heritage express: prioritise Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal and Jantar Mantar; add Jal Mahal for a quick photography stop if timing permits.', 'Jaipur''s core heritage is concentrated around the historic walled city and Amber area. A one-day visit should focus on its signature forts, palaces and UNESCO-listed heritage rather than attempting distant or secondary attractions. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:1', 'jaipur', 'Build a classic Jaipur royal heritage circuit covering Amber Fort, Jaigarh Fort, City Palace, Jantar Mantar, Hawa Mahal, Nahargarh Fort, Jal Mahal, and Albert Hall Museum, with time for traditional food and bazaar shopping.', 'Three days provide enough time to experience Jaipur''s major architectural, historical, cultural, photographic and shopping highlights without turning the itinerary into continuous monument-hopping. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:2', 'jaipur', 'Expand Jaipur into a Rajasthan heritage gateway, combining Jaipur with nearby destinations such as Ajmer & Pushkar, Ranthambore, or other Rajasthan cities depending on traveller interests and onward route.', 'Jaipur itself can comfortably fill 3–4 days of focused sightseeing; longer stays are better used for nearby Rajasthan experiences while keeping additional time for shopping, food, leisure and cultural activities. Jaipur is also a key part of Rajasthan''s wider tourism circuit. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:3', 'jaipur', 'Build a balanced first-timer itinerary around Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal, Jantar Mantar, Nahargarh Fort and Jal Mahal, supplemented by Albert Hall Museum and Pink City bazaars.', 'These experiences provide the strongest introduction to Jaipur''s royal history, planned urban heritage, architecture, panoramic views, museums, markets and local culture. Jaipur''s walled city itself is UNESCO-listed, while Jantar Mantar is separately inscribed as a World Heritage property. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:4', 'jaipur', 'Choose a heritage palace or luxury boutique hotel, request a private balcony/terrace, schedule Nahargarh sunset, Amber Fort, Jal Mahal photography and rooftop dining, and include spa and leisure time.', 'Jaipur''s romantic appeal comes from royal architecture, illuminated monuments, heritage accommodation, rooftop dining and curated experiences rather than nightlife alone. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:5', 'jaipur', 'Base the family in a centrally located hotel, use a private vehicle, prioritise Amber Fort, City Palace, Jantar Mantar, Hawa Mahal, Albert Hall and Jal Mahal, and keep walking-heavy heritage exploration flexible.', 'Jaipur offers a strong combination of educational heritage, architecture, museums, photography and family-friendly sightseeing, while private transport makes the fort circuit considerably easier for children and older family members. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:6', 'jaipur', 'Select an exclusive heritage palace or luxury hotel with premium dining, spa and personalised service; arrange a dedicated chauffeur, private guide, curated shopping and exclusive cultural experiences.', 'Jaipur''s luxury proposition is built around royal heritage, palace hospitality, private experiences, fine dining and personalised service, making it one of Rajasthan''s strongest luxury destinations. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:7', 'jaipur', 'Stay around Bani Park, MI Road or the Old City, use autos/metro where practical, eat at local restaurants, and prioritise Hawa Mahal, Pink City walks, bazaars and selected low-cost attractions.', 'Jaipur has accommodation and food options across multiple price levels, while several major experiences can be combined efficiently within the historic city without requiring private transport throughout the trip. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:8', 'jaipur', 'Prioritise Nahargarh Fort, Jal Mahal, Man Sagar Lake, Galtaji, Sisodia Rani Garden and Aravalli viewpoints, while adding relaxed outdoor photography.', 'Jaipur is primarily a heritage destination, but its surrounding Aravalli hills, lakes, gardens and elevated forts provide useful nature and landscape experiences. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:9', 'jaipur', 'Add hot-air ballooning, cycling, hiking around the Aravallis, fort exploration and outdoor experiences, while keeping activities weather-appropriate.', 'Adventure is supplementary rather than Jaipur''s principal tourism strength; the destination works best when outdoor activities are combined with its major heritage attractions. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:10', 'jaipur', 'Choose an easily accessible hotel, use a private vehicle, prioritise City Palace, Hawa Mahal, Albert Hall, Jantar Mantar and Jal Mahal, and limit strenuous fort walking.', 'Jaipur''s main heritage circuit can be experienced comfortably with private transport and planned rest periods, although Amber, Jaigarh and Nahargarh involve more walking and uneven surfaces. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:11', 'jaipur', 'Use Jaipur as a 1-night heritage stopover, with Hawa Mahal, City Palace and Jantar Mantar in the main circuit and Amber Fort or Jal Mahal depending on arrival/departure timing.', 'Jaipur''s compact historic core allows several major landmarks to be combined efficiently, making it particularly suitable for a short Rajasthan stopover. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:12', 'jaipur', 'Prioritise Amber Fort, City Palace, Jaigarh Fort, Nahargarh Fort, Jantar Mantar and Jaipur''s historic walled city.', 'Jaipur combines Rajput royal architecture, fortified hill landscapes, planned urban heritage and scientific history. The historic walled city was founded in 1727 by Sawai Jai Singh II, while Jantar Mantar preserves one of India''s most significant historic astronomical observatories. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:13', 'jaipur', 'Choose a premium heritage hotel or resort, minimise daily transfers, incorporate spa treatments, yoga, pool time, leisurely breakfasts and sunset experiences, and keep sightseeing to selected highlights.', 'Jaipur works well for heritage-based wellness and luxury leisure when the itinerary balances sightseeing with palace-hotel relaxation, spa experiences and slow cultural exploration. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:14', 'jaipur', 'Schedule Amber Fort, City Palace and outdoor sightseeing in the morning, keep midday for museums, restaurants or hotel leisure, and reserve bazaars and viewpoints for late afternoon/evening.', 'Jaipur''s summer temperatures can become very high, making prolonged midday outdoor sightseeing uncomfortable. A split-day itinerary substantially improves traveller comfort. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:15', 'jaipur', 'Keep outdoor schedules flexible, prioritise City Palace, Jantar Mantar, Albert Hall and indoor cultural experiences during rainy periods, and use clear-weather windows for forts and viewpoints.', 'Monsoon rain can interrupt outdoor sightseeing, but Jaipur''s major architectural and museum attractions allow itineraries to remain productive even during wet periods. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:16', 'jaipur', 'Build a dedicated Rajasthani food circuit featuring Dal Baati Churma, Gatte Ki Sabzi, Laal Maas, Pyaaz Kachori, Mirchi Bada, Ghevar and Mawa Kachori.', 'Jaipur is one of Rajasthan''s strongest destinations for experiencing regional cuisine, from traditional thalis and savoury snacks to distinctive Rajasthani sweets. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:17', 'jaipur', 'Allocate dedicated time for Johari Bazaar, Bapu Bazaar, Tripolia Bazaar, MI Road and Nehru Bazaar, focusing on jewellery, gemstones, textiles, blue pottery, block prints and handicrafts.', 'Jaipur''s historic commercial identity is deeply connected with its bazaars and artisan traditions; UNESCO specifically recognises the walled city''s historic market streets and commercial character. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:18', 'jaipur', 'Prioritise Hawa Mahal, Amber Fort, City Palace, Jal Mahal, Nahargarh Fort and Pink City bazaars, with sunrise/sunset sessions and blue-hour photography.', 'Jaipur offers exceptional visual variety through pink sandstone architecture, royal courtyards, geometric façades, Aravalli landscapes, lake reflections and colourful bazaars. Hawa Mahal is officially described as Jaipur''s iconic landmark. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:19', 'jaipur', 'Combine City Palace, Jantar Mantar, Govind Dev Ji Temple, Hawa Mahal, Pink City bazaars and a Rajasthani cultural performance.', 'Jaipur''s cultural identity is strongly embedded in its planned historic city, royal institutions, temples, markets, crafts and performing traditions. ---'),
  ('jaipur:rule:20', 'jaipur', 'Allocate 3–4 days to Jaipur and connect it with Delhi and Agra, using Jaipur for the principal Rajput heritage, palace, fort, shopping and Rajasthani cultural experiences.', 'Jaipur is one of the defining destinations of India''s Golden Triangle and works particularly well as the Rajasthan heritage component of the circuit. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:0', 'jodhpur', 'Treat Jodhpur as a Blue City heritage express: prioritise Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, Clock Tower & Sardar Market, and Toorji Ka Jhalra; add Umaid Bhawan Palace if timing permits.', 'Jodhpur''s strongest attractions are concentrated around the historic city and Mehrangarh area, making a focused fort–heritage–market circuit the most efficient one-day plan. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:1', 'jodhpur', 'Build a classic Jodhpur royal heritage circuit covering Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, Umaid Bhawan Palace, Rao Jodha Desert Rock Park, Toorji Ka Jhalra, Clock Tower & Sardar Market, and Mandore Gardens, with time for Rajasthani food and shopping.', 'Three days comfortably cover Jodhpur''s principal forts, palaces, Old City landmarks, markets, gardens and photography viewpoints without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:2', 'jodhpur', 'Expand Jodhpur into a Marwar heritage and desert gateway, adding Osian, Guda Bishnoi Village, Salawas Village and surrounding desert/cultural experiences.', 'Jodhpur''s core attractions can generally be covered in 3–4 days; longer stays are better used for rural Bishnoi culture, crafts, desert landscapes and nearby temple heritage. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:3', 'jodhpur', 'Build the itinerary around Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, Umaid Bhawan Palace, Clock Tower & Sardar Market, Toorji Ka Jhalra and Rao Jodha Desert Rock Park, supplemented by Mandore Gardens.', 'These provide the strongest introduction to Jodhpur''s royal history, Blue City character, architecture, markets, landscape and Marwar culture. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:4', 'jodhpur', 'Choose a heritage palace or boutique hotel, prioritise Mehrangarh sunset, Jaswant Thada, Blue City walks, Kaylana Lake sunset and rooftop dining, with private desert experiences where suitable.', 'Jodhpur''s romantic appeal comes from royal architecture, blue-painted streets, sunset viewpoints, heritage hotels and intimate dining rather than nightlife. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:5', 'jodhpur', 'Base the family centrally, use a private vehicle, prioritise Mehrangarh Fort, Umaid Bhawan Palace, Mandore Gardens, Jaswant Thada and Machia Biological Park, and keep walking-heavy sightseeing flexible.', 'Jodhpur combines educational heritage, museums, architecture, markets and nature experiences, while private transport makes multi-attraction sightseeing easier for families. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:6', 'jodhpur', 'Select an exclusive heritage palace or luxury hotel, arrange a dedicated chauffeur and private guide, and add fine Rajasthani dining, curated shopping and private desert/village experiences.', 'Jodhpur has one of Rajasthan''s strongest heritage-luxury propositions, centred around palace architecture, royal hospitality and personalised experiences. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:7', 'jodhpur', 'Stay around the Old City or Clock Tower area, use autos/local transport, eat at traditional eateries, and prioritise Mehrangarh, Toorji Ka Jhalra, Sardar Market, Jaswant Thada and Old City walks.', 'Central Jodhpur provides affordable accommodation, inexpensive local food and several attractions that can be combined without expensive private transport. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:8', 'jodhpur', 'Prioritise Rao Jodha Desert Rock Park, Kaylana Lake, Machia Biological Park, Guda Bishnoi Village and desert landscapes around Osian.', 'Jodhpur is primarily a heritage destination, but its desert ecology, lakes, wildlife and Aravalli-edge landscapes provide worthwhile outdoor experiences. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:9', 'jodhpur', 'Add Mehrangarh Flying Fox, camel safaris, cycling, village safaris, desert excursions and nature trails.', 'Jodhpur offers soft adventure rather than extreme adventure, with its strongest outdoor experiences linked to forts, desert and rural landscapes. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:10', 'jodhpur', 'Choose an accessible central hotel, use a private vehicle, prioritise Umaid Bhawan, Jaswant Thada, Mandore Gardens, Clock Tower and selected museum visits, and limit strenuous fort walking.', 'Jodhpur''s heritage can be experienced comfortably with planned transport and rest, although Mehrangarh and other historic sites may involve stairs and uneven surfaces. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:11', 'jodhpur', 'Use Jodhpur as a 1-night Blue City stopover, prioritising Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada and Clock Tower & Sardar Market, with Toorji Ka Jhalra if timing permits.', 'The Mehrangarh–Old City area allows several signature experiences to be combined efficiently during a short stay. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:12', 'jodhpur', 'Prioritise Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, Umaid Bhawan Palace, Mandore Gardens, Toorji Ka Jhalra and Osian.', 'Jodhpur combines Marwar royal history, hilltop fortifications, palace architecture, historic cenotaphs, stepwells and ancient temple heritage. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:13', 'jodhpur', 'Choose a premium heritage hotel, reduce daily transfers and incorporate spa treatments, leisurely breakfasts, pool time, sunset experiences and relaxed heritage sightseeing.', 'Jodhpur works well for heritage-based wellness and slow luxury, particularly when palace accommodation is combined with limited sightseeing. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:14', 'jodhpur', 'Schedule Mehrangarh, Jaswant Thada and outdoor sightseeing early morning, keep midday for museums, restaurants or hotel leisure, and reserve markets and viewpoints for late afternoon.', 'Jodhpur experiences intense summer heat, making prolonged midday outdoor sightseeing uncomfortable. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:15', 'jodhpur', 'Keep outdoor activities flexible, prioritise Umaid Bhawan, Mehrangarh Museum, Toorji Ka Jhalra and indoor cultural experiences during rain, and use clear periods for parks and viewpoints.', 'Rain can disrupt outdoor schedules, but Jodhpur''s forts, palaces, museums and markets provide useful weather-flexible alternatives. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:16', 'jodhpur', 'Build a Jodhpur food circuit featuring Makhaniya Lassi, Mirchi Bada, Pyaaz Kachori, Mawa Kachori, Dal Baati Churma, Gatte Ki Sabzi and Laal Maas.', 'Jodhpur is particularly strong for Marwari snacks, Rajasthani cuisine, sweets and traditional street food. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:17', 'jodhpur', 'Allocate dedicated time for Sardar Market, Clock Tower, Nai Sarak and local craft shops, focusing on Bandhani, textiles, mojari, handicrafts, spices, jewellery and traditional products.', 'Jodhpur''s historic markets provide an authentic shopping experience centred on Rajasthani textiles, crafts, food products and traditional merchandise. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:18', 'jodhpur', 'Prioritise Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, Blue City lanes, Toorji Ka Jhalra, Umaid Bhawan, Rao Jodha Park and Clock Tower, with dedicated sunrise/sunset sessions.', 'Jodhpur offers exceptional visual variety through blue-painted houses, sandstone architecture, palace details, dramatic fort walls and desert landscapes. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:19', 'jodhpur', 'Combine Mehrangarh Museum, Mandore Gardens, Clock Tower & Sardar Market, Bishnoi Village, Salawas Village and Osian temples.', 'These experiences showcase Jodhpur''s Marwar history, crafts, rural traditions, religion, markets and living cultural heritage. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:20', 'jodhpur', 'Add Osian, camel rides, desert sunset, village experiences and traditional Rajasthani dinner, preferably as a dedicated half/full-day excursion.', 'Osian provides Jodhpur''s strongest combination of ancient temples, desert scenery and camel-based experiences, and is better treated as an excursion than a quick city stop. ---'),
  ('jodhpur:rule:21', 'jodhpur', 'Allocate 3–4 days to Jodhpur and use it as the central Marwar heritage stop before continuing toward Jaisalmer, Udaipur, Jaipur or other Rajasthan destinations.', 'Jodhpur''s position, railway/road connectivity and concentration of Marwar heritage make it an effective anchor for a wider Rajasthan itinerary. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:0', 'jaisalmer', 'Treat Jaisalmer as a Golden City heritage–desert express: prioritise Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon Ki Haveli, Gadisar Lake, Bada Bagh and Sam Sand Dunes; add Nathmal Ki Haveli if timing permits.', 'Jaisalmer''s signature experiences combine its living fort, historic havelis, lake heritage and Thar Desert, allowing a compact but experience-rich short visit. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:1', 'jaisalmer', 'Build a classic Jaisalmer heritage + desert circuit covering Jaisalmer Fort, Jain Temples, Patwon Ki Haveli, Nathmal Ki Haveli, Salim Singh Ki Haveli, Gadisar Lake, Bada Bagh, Kuldhara and Sam Sand Dunes, with time for Rajasthani food and cultural evenings.', 'Three days provide enough time for the Old City heritage circuit, major monuments, desert excursion and sunset/camp experience without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:2', 'jaisalmer', 'Expand Jaisalmer into a Thar Desert and western Rajasthan cultural experience, adding Desert National Park, Lodurva, Amar Sagar, Khuri, village experiences and additional desert activities.', 'The core Jaisalmer attractions can be covered in around 3–4 days; longer stays are better used for desert ecology, Jain heritage, rural landscapes and slower desert experiences. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:3', 'jaisalmer', 'Build the itinerary around Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon Ki Haveli, Gadisar Lake, Bada Bagh and Sam Sand Dunes, supplemented by Nathmal Ki Haveli and Jain Temples.', 'These provide the strongest introduction to Jaisalmer''s Golden City architecture, royal history, living heritage and Thar Desert character. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:4', 'jaisalmer', 'Choose a heritage haveli or luxury desert camp, prioritise Sam sunset, private desert dinner, Jaisalmer Fort, Gadisar Lake sunrise, Bada Bagh and rooftop dining, with stargazing where available.', 'Jaisalmer''s romantic appeal comes from golden architecture, desert sunsets, heritage accommodation, private dining and intimate cultural experiences rather than conventional nightlife. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:5', 'jaisalmer', 'Base the family centrally, use a private vehicle, prioritise Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon Ki Haveli, Gadisar Lake, Bada Bagh and Sam Sand Dunes, and keep desert activities flexible.', 'Jaisalmer combines educational heritage, architecture, markets, cultural shows and soft adventure, while private transport makes outer-site visits easier. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:6', 'jaisalmer', 'Select an exclusive heritage hotel or premium desert camp, arrange a dedicated chauffeur and private guide, and add fine Rajasthani dining, curated shopping, private desert experiences and personalised cultural performances.', 'Jaisalmer has a strong experiential luxury proposition, particularly through heritage stays and high-end desert camping. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:7', 'jaisalmer', 'Stay around the Fort/Old City area, use walking and autos, eat at traditional local eateries, and prioritise Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon Ki Haveli, Gadisar Lake and Old City markets; use shared transport for the desert.', 'The historic core allows several major experiences to be combined with limited local transport costs, while desert activities can be selected according to package inclusions. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:8', 'jaisalmer', 'Prioritise Desert National Park, Sam Sand Dunes, Amar Sagar, Gadisar Lake and desert landscapes around Kuldhara/Lodurva.', 'Jaisalmer offers distinctive Thar ecology, desert landscapes, lakes and wildlife, including blackbuck, chinkara, desert fox and the Great Indian Bustard. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:9', 'jaisalmer', 'Add camel safari, jeep/dune bashing, quad biking, parasailing, desert camping and Desert National Park excursions.', 'Jaisalmer is strongest for soft-to-moderate desert adventure, with Rajasthan Tourism specifically highlighting camel safari, dune bashing, quad biking and camping. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:10', 'jaisalmer', 'Choose an accessible central hotel, use a private vehicle, prioritise Gadisar Lake, Patwon Ki Haveli, Nathmal Ki Haveli, Amar Sagar and selected Fort areas, and limit strenuous walking.', 'Jaisalmer''s heritage sites include uneven historic lanes, steps and exposed outdoor areas, so comfortable transport and shorter sightseeing blocks improve the experience. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:11', 'jaisalmer', 'Use Jaisalmer as a 1-night Golden City stopover, prioritising Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon Ki Haveli and Gadisar Lake, with Sam Sand Dunes if arrival/departure timing permits.', 'The Fort–Old City area provides several signature experiences efficiently, while the desert requires additional transfer time. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:12', 'jaisalmer', 'Prioritise Jaisalmer Fort, Jain Temples, Patwon Ki Haveli, Nathmal Ki Haveli, Salim Singh Ki Haveli, Bada Bagh and Kuldhara.', 'Jaisalmer combines Rajput fortification, Jain heritage, merchant havelis, royal memorials and historic desert settlements. Jaisalmer Fort remains a living fort and is recognised as part of the UNESCO-listed Hill Forts of Rajasthan. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:13', 'jaisalmer', 'Choose a premium heritage hotel or desert camp, reduce daily transfers and incorporate spa time, leisurely breakfasts, sunset experiences, pool time, rooftop dining and relaxed heritage walks.', 'Jaisalmer works well for slow desert luxury, especially when sightseeing is balanced with private hotel/camp time. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:14', 'jaisalmer', 'Schedule Jaisalmer Fort and outdoor sightseeing early morning, keep midday for hotel/restaurants, and reserve markets and desert experiences for late afternoon/evening.', 'Rajasthan''s Thar region experiences particularly harsh summer conditions, with April–June temperatures reaching very high levels. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:15', 'jaisalmer', 'Keep outdoor activities flexible, prioritise Jaisalmer Fort, havelis, museums and indoor cultural experiences during weather disruptions, and use clear periods for Gadisar Lake, Bada Bagh and desert excursions.', 'Monsoon can provide comparatively pleasant temperatures, but desert and outdoor schedules should remain flexible. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:16', 'jaisalmer', 'Build a Jaisalmer food circuit featuring Dal Baati Churma, Ghotua Ladoo, Makhaniya Lassi, Pyaaz Kachori, Mirchi Bada, Ker Sangri, Gatte Ki Sabzi and Rajasthani Thali.', 'Jaisalmer provides a strong introduction to traditional Rajasthani and Marwari flavours, best experienced through local eateries, sweets, rooftop restaurants and desert-camp dinners. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:17', 'jaisalmer', 'Allocate dedicated time for Sadar Bazaar, Manak Chowk, Fort markets and local artisan shops, focusing on Bandhani textiles, mirror-work, embroidered products, handicrafts, jewellery, puppets and traditional souvenirs.', 'Jaisalmer''s historic markets complement its heritage experience with Rajasthani crafts and desert-region handicrafts. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:18', 'jaisalmer', 'Prioritise Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon Ki Haveli, Gadisar Lake, Bada Bagh, Sam Sand Dunes, Kuldhara and the Old City lanes, with dedicated sunrise and sunset sessions.', 'Jaisalmer offers exceptional visual variety through golden sandstone architecture, carved havelis, desert dunes, historic ruins and dramatic sunset light. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:19', 'jaisalmer', 'Combine Jaisalmer Fort, Jain Temples, Patwon Ki Haveli, Kuldhara, Lodurva, local markets and desert folk performances.', 'These experiences showcase Jaisalmer''s Rajput history, Jain heritage, merchant culture, traditional crafts and living desert traditions. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:20', 'jaisalmer', 'Make Sam Sand Dunes the centrepiece and add camel safari, jeep/dune bashing, desert camping, sunset, folk performances and traditional Rajasthani dinner.', 'Sam provides Jaisalmer''s most recognisable combination of Thar landscapes, adventure, cultural entertainment and overnight desert camping. ---'),
  ('jaisalmer:rule:21', 'jaisalmer', 'Allocate 3–5 days to Jaisalmer and use it as the western Rajasthan desert base before continuing toward Jodhpur, Barmer, Bikaner or other Rajasthan destinations.', 'Jaisalmer''s position as a gateway to the Thar Desert, combined with its living fort, heritage architecture and desert experiences, makes it an effective anchor for a wider western Rajasthan itinerary. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:0', 'ranthambore', 'Treat Ranthambore as a wildlife + heritage express: prioritise one safari, Ranthambore Fort and Trinetra Ganesh Temple; add Padam Talao/Raj Bagh only through the safari route if timing permits.', 'Ranthambore''s signature combination is tiger safari + historic Fort + forest landscapes, making a short visit possible but tightly paced. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:1', 'ranthambore', 'Build a classic Ranthambore wildlife + heritage circuit with 2–3 safaris, Ranthambore Fort, Trinetra Ganesh Temple, Padam Talao, Raj Bagh Ruins and Shilpgram, while keeping time for resort relaxation.', 'Three days provide enough time for multiple safari attempts while allowing the major heritage experience without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:2', 'ranthambore', 'Expand Ranthambore into a wildlife, wetland and heritage experience, adding additional safari zones, Surwal Lake, Kachida Valley, Mansarovar Wetland, Shilpgram and local craft experiences.', 'Longer stays are best used for repeat wildlife drives, photography, birdwatching and slower resort experiences, rather than simply adding distant attractions. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:3', 'ranthambore', 'Build the itinerary around Ranthambore National Park, Ranthambore Fort, Trinetra Ganesh Temple, Padam Talao and Raj Bagh Ruins.', 'These provide the strongest introduction to Ranthambore''s wildlife, tiger habitat, historic heritage and dramatic forest landscapes. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:4', 'ranthambore', 'Choose a luxury jungle lodge, prioritise private Gypsy safari, forest-view accommodation, private dining, sunset, spa time and stargazing, with Ranthambore Fort as the principal heritage excursion.', 'Ranthambore''s romantic appeal comes from wilderness, privacy, luxury resorts and intimate nature experiences rather than conventional nightlife. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:5', 'ranthambore', 'Base the family at a comfortable resort, use a private vehicle, prioritise safari, Ranthambore Fort, Trinetra Ganesh Temple and Shilpgram, and keep the schedule flexible.', 'Ranthambore combines wildlife, education, history and nature, while private transport makes family logistics easier. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:6', 'ranthambore', 'Select an exclusive jungle lodge, arrange a dedicated chauffeur/private Gypsy and naturalist, and add premium dining, spa, curated wildlife experiences and private resort activities.', 'Ranthambore has a strong experiential luxury proposition centred on wilderness hospitality and personalised safari experiences. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:7', 'ranthambore', 'Stay around Sawai Madhopur/Ranthambore Road, use local transport, choose Canter safari where appropriate, and prioritise one or two safaris + Fort + Trinetra Ganesh Temple.', 'Accommodation and local sightseeing can be managed economically, while safari permits are the principal unavoidable destination expense. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:8', 'ranthambore', 'Prioritise Ranthambore National Park, Padam Talao, Raj Bagh Ruins, Malik Talao, Kachida Valley, Surwal Lake and Mansarovar Wetland.', 'Ranthambore combines dry-deciduous forest, lakes, wetlands, hills and diverse wildlife, including tiger, leopard, sloth bear, sambar and numerous bird species. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:9', 'ranthambore', 'Add Gypsy safari, Canter safari, wildlife photography, birdwatching, forest exploration and multiple safari drives.', 'Ranthambore is strongest for wildlife-based soft adventure, rather than extreme adventure sports. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:10', 'ranthambore', 'Choose a comfortable resort, use a private vehicle, prioritise selected safari, Fort/Temple and Shilpgram, and limit strenuous walking.', 'Safari vehicles and the Fort can involve rough movement, steps and uneven terrain, so comfortable pacing is important. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:11', 'ranthambore', 'Use Ranthambore as a 1-night wildlife stopover, prioritising one safari + Ranthambore Fort/Trinetra Ganesh Temple according to train/road timing.', 'Sawai Madhopur is the principal gateway, but a meaningful safari requires careful timing. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:12', 'ranthambore', 'Prioritise Ranthambore Fort, Trinetra Ganesh Temple, Raj Bagh Ruins and historic forest structures.', 'Ranthambore combines Chauhan-era fortification, temples, ruins and Rajput history. The Fort is part of UNESCO''s Hill Forts of Rajasthan World Heritage property. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:13', 'ranthambore', 'Choose a premium jungle resort, reduce daily transfers and incorporate spa time, pool, leisurely meals, nature views, sunset and relaxed evenings.', 'Ranthambore works particularly well for slow wilderness luxury, where safari is balanced with resort downtime. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:14', 'ranthambore', 'Schedule early-morning safari and sightseeing, keep midday for resort/rest, and use late afternoon for the second safari where available.', 'April–June can become extremely hot; wildlife also tends to concentrate around remaining water sources during the hotter months. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:15', 'ranthambore', 'Treat Ranthambore primarily as a resort + heritage destination, using Fort, temple, Shilpgram and indoor/local experiences, because the main Ranthambore National Park tourism season is closed during July–September.', 'The core park is officially open October–June, making monsoon unsuitable for a standard tiger-safari itinerary. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:16', 'ranthambore', 'Build a Sawai Madhopur/Ranthambore food experience around Rajasthani thali, dal baati churma, gatte ki sabzi, ker sangri, bajra roti, kachori and lassi, with one quality resort dinner.', 'Food is a supporting experience in Ranthambore rather than its primary destination draw. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:17', 'ranthambore', 'Allocate limited time to Shilpgram, Dastkar Ranthambore, Ranthambore School of Art and local craft shops, focusing on handicrafts, textiles, embroidery and wildlife-themed art.', 'Ranthambore''s shopping appeal is primarily local crafts and wildlife art, rather than large-scale retail. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:18', 'ranthambore', 'Prioritise multiple safaris, Padam Talao, Raj Bagh Ruins, Malik Talao, Kachida Valley, Ranthambore Fort and wildlife landscapes.', 'Ranthambore offers exceptional photographic variety through tigers, birds, lakes, ruins, forests, hills and dramatic light. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:19', 'ranthambore', 'Combine Ranthambore Fort, Trinetra Ganesh Temple, Shilpgram, Dastkar Ranthambore and local craft experiences with one wildlife safari.', 'This balances Rajput heritage, religious culture, local crafts and wilderness. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:20', 'ranthambore', 'Make 2–3 safari drives the centrepiece and combine them with Padam Talao, Raj Bagh Ruins, Malik Talao and Kachida Valley where safari routes permit.', 'Multiple drives increase the opportunity to experience different landscapes, zones and wildlife behaviour, although sightings remain unpredictable. ---'),
  ('ranthambore:rule:21', 'ranthambore', 'Allocate 2–4 days to Ranthambore and use it as the wildlife anchor before continuing toward Jaipur, Bharatpur, Sariska, Bundi or other Rajasthan destinations.', 'Ranthambore''s combination of tiger habitat, accessible rail gateway, Fort heritage and quality wildlife resorts makes it a strong anchor for a wider Rajasthan wildlife circuit. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:0', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_AKAL_TAKHT + JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM AND: include_ATTARI_WAGAH_IF_SCHEDULE_ALLOWS + ONE_AMRITSARI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'Very short stays gain more value from Amritsar''s strongest spiritual and historical core plus one defining Punjabi or border experience than from attempting many scattered secondary attractions. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:1', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + AKAL_TAKHT + JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM + ATTARI_WAGAH AND: add_ONE_OF_GOBINDGARH_FORT_RAM_BAGH_OR_FOOD_AND_MARKET_TRAIL', 'This creates a balanced first introduction to Sikh spirituality, colonial history, Partition memory, Punjabi culture and the border experience. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:2', 'amritsar', 'prefer_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + JALLIANWALA_PARTITION + ATTARI_WAGAH + GOBINDGARH_FORT + DURGIANA_TEMPLE AND: add_RAM_BAGH + PUL_KANJARI + PUNJABI_FOOD_TRAILS + RURAL_PUNJAB', 'Longer stays should move beyond Amritsar''s headline attractions and reveal the city through Sikh Empire history, religious diversity, food, markets and rural Punjabi culture. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:3', 'amritsar', 'prefer_PREMIUM_RANJIT_AVENUE_OR_HERITAGE_STYLE_HOTEL + PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER + EVENING_GOLDEN_TEMPLE AND: increase_PRIVATE_GUIDING + QUALITY_PUNJABI_DINING + CULTURAL_EXPERIENCES + SPA + FREE_TIME', 'Amritsar works best for honeymooners as a cultural and culinary short break rather than a conventional resort-based romantic destination. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:4', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + JALLIANWALA_BAGH + GOBINDGARH_FORT + ATTARI_WAGAH AND: include_PARTITION_MUSEUM + FOOD + SHOPPING_EXPERIENCES AND: reduce_LONG_MARKET_WALKS + PEAK_HEAT + EXCESSIVE_WAITING', 'Amritsar works particularly well for families when spiritual and historical sightseeing is balanced with fort experiences, food and comfortable road transport. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:5', 'amritsar', 'prefer_SHORT_HERITAGE_VISITS + PRIVATE_CAR + E_RICKSHAW + EARLY_OR_EVENING_SIGHTSEEING AND: include_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + GOBINDGARH_FORT + SIMPLE_PUNJABI_FOOD + SELECTED_ATTARI_VISIT AND: reduce_LONG_MUSEUM_BLOCKS + EXTREME_HEAT + PROLONGED_BORDER_WAITING', 'Young children generally benefit from varied experiences and transport breaks rather than continuous museums, crowded heritage lanes and long ceremonial waiting periods. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:6', 'amritsar', 'prefer_FIVE_STAR_RANJIT_AVENUE_OR_PREMIUM_CENTRAL_HOTEL AND: increase_CHAUFFEURED_CAR + PRIVATE_GUIDE + PERSONALIZED_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_CONTEXT + PREMIUM_ATTARI_TRANSFER + CURATED_FOOD + PREMIUM_CRAFT_SHOPPING', 'Amritsar luxury travel is strongest through personalized transportation, expert interpretation, premium accommodation, food and curated cultural experiences. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:7', 'amritsar', 'prefer_CENTRALLY_CONNECTED_BUDGET_HOTEL + WALKING + E_RICKSHAW_AUTO AND: balance_PAID_EXPERIENCES_WITH_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + HERITAGE_STREETS + LOCAL_FOOD + MARKETS', 'Amritsar is exceptionally suitable for budget travel because many of its most important spiritual and historical experiences are free or inexpensive. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:8', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + AKAL_TAKHT + LANGAR_AND_SAROVAR_EXPERIENCE AND: include_RELEVANT_GURDWARAS + SIKH_HISTORY + SELECTED_MAHARAJA_RANJIT_SINGH_HERITAGE', 'Amritsar''s primary destination identity is inseparable from Sri Harmandir Sahib, Sikh religious history, community traditions and the city''s role as a major Sikh pilgrimage centre. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:9', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_EARLY_MORNING_VISIT + AKAL_TAKHT + AMRIT_SAROVAR + LANGAR AND: return_FOR_EVENING_ILLUMINATION_IF_TIME_ALLOWS AND: respect_HEAD_COVERING + SHOE_REMOVAL + RELIGIOUS_ETIQUETTE', 'The Golden Temple is a functioning sacred complex and is significantly more rewarding when visitors experience its religious practices, atmosphere and changing light rather than only photographing the central shrine. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:10', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_PARTITION_MUSEUM AND: include_JALLIANWALA_BAGH + HISTORIC_TOWN_HALL_CONTEXT', 'The Partition Museum presents the Partition through survivor stories, artefacts, archival material and oral histories and should receive dedicated interpretive time. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:11', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM AND: include_RELEVANT_OLD_CITY_AND_COLONIAL_HISTORY', 'Jallianwala Bagh commemorates one of the defining episodes of India''s freedom struggle, while the Partition Museum provides broader twentieth-century historical context. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:12', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOBINDGARH_FORT + RAM_BAGH AND: include_MAHARAJA_RANJIT_SINGH_CONTEXT + PUL_KANJARI_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'These sites provide a stronger understanding of Maharaja Ranjit Singh and the Sikh Empire than an itinerary focused only on modern pilgrimage landmarks. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:13', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + JALLIANWALA_PARTITION + OLD_CITY + GOBINDGARH_FORT AND: include_RAM_BAGH + FOOD + PHULKARI + TRADITIONAL_MARKETS', 'Amritsar''s cultural importance extends beyond monuments into Sikh traditions, Punjabi cuisine, crafts, bazaars, historical memory and living religious practice. ---');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('amritsar:rule:14', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_AKAL_TAKHT AND: include_DURGIANA_TEMPLE + SELECTED_SIKH_RELIGIOUS_SITES', 'Amritsar is primarily defined by Sikh sacred geography but also contains important Hindu and wider Punjabi religious traditions. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:15', 'amritsar', 'allocate_HALF_DAY AND: prefer_PRIVATE_CAR_OR_ORGANIZED_TRANSFER AND: allow_BUFFER_FOR_SECURITY + TRAFFIC + ENTRY + CEREMONY_WAITING', 'The Attari–Wagah border lies well outside central Amritsar and the evening flag-lowering ceremony requires significantly more time than the ceremony itself. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:16', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_ATTARI_WAGAH AND: include_PUL_KANJARI_IF_TIME_AND_TRANSPORT_ALLOW', 'The Attari region combines contemporary India–Pakistan border symbolism with deeper historical and rural context. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:17', 'amritsar', 'prefer_OLD_CITY + LAWRENCE_ROAD + SELECTED_TRADITIONAL_DHABAS AND: include_AMRITSARI_KULCHA + LASSI + PUNJABI_DHABA_FOOD + TRADITIONAL_SWEETS AND: add_AMRITSARI_FISH_OR_TANDOORI_SPECIALTIES_IF_DIET_ALLOWS', 'Amritsar''s culinary identity is much broader than one signature dish and is strongest through breakfast traditions, dhabas, tandoori cooking, sweets and Punjabi hospitality. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:18', 'amritsar', 'include_AMRITSARI_KULCHA + CHOLE + DAL + PANEER + LASSI + PUNJABI_SWEETS + LANGAR AND: do_not_assume_AMRITSAR_REQUIRES_NON_VEGETARIAN_FOOD_FOR_A_COMPLETE_CULINARY_EXPERIENCE', 'Amritsar provides exceptionally strong vegetarian Punjabi cuisine and the Golden Temple langar adds an important community-food experience. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:19', 'amritsar', 'include_AMRITSARI_FISH + TANDOORI_DISHES + TRADITIONAL_DHABA_SPECIALTIES AND: balance_WITH_KULCHA + LASSI + SWEETS + VEGETARIAN_PUNJABI_FOOD', 'Amritsar has notable non-vegetarian culinary traditions, but these should complement rather than replace the city''s broader Punjabi food culture. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:20', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_HALL_BAZAAR + KATRA_JAIMAL_SINGH + REPUTABLE_TRADITIONAL_RETAILERS AND: include_PHULKARI + PUNJABI_JUTTIS + TEXTILES + PAPAD_WADIYAN + LOCAL_FOOD_PRODUCTS', 'Amritsar''s strongest shopping identity comes from Punjabi textiles, embroidery, footwear, traditional clothing and regional food products. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:21', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_REPUTABLE_TEXTILE_AND_CRAFT_SELLERS AND: compare_HANDWORK + FABRIC + STITCH_DENSITY + DESIGN + FINISHING + PRICE AND: do_not_assume_EVERY_PHULKARI_LABEL_MEANS_IDENTICAL_HAND_EMBROIDERED_QUALITY', 'Phulkari quality and production method vary significantly, particularly between handmade, machine-assisted and mass-produced merchandise. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:22', 'amritsar', 'prefer_ESTABLISHED_SPECIALIST_RETAILERS AND: compare_LEATHER_OR_BASE_MATERIAL + EMBROIDERY + COMFORT + FINISHING + SIZE', 'Punjabi juttis vary considerably in craftsmanship and comfort, and purchase decisions should not be based only on decorative appearance. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:23', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_EARLY_MORNING + GOLDEN_TEMPLE_BLUE_HOUR + OLD_CITY + ATTARI_REGION AND: include_JALLIANWALA_HERITAGE + RAM_BAGH + MARKETS + RURAL_PUNJAB_WHEN_RELEVANT AND: prioritize_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + BLUE_HOUR', 'Amritsar provides exceptional combinations of reflective architecture, religious atmosphere, Punjabi street life, food, markets and rural landscapes. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:24', 'amritsar', 'prefer_HERITAGE_STREET + HALL_BAZAAR + OLD_CITY + SELECTED_FOOD_MARKETS AND: respect_RELIGIOUS_SENSITIVITY + LOCAL_PRIVACY + SECURITY_RESTRICTIONS', 'Amritsar provides excellent human-interest and market photography, but sacred spaces and security-sensitive border areas require greater restraint. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:25', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_COMPLEX + DURGIANA_TEMPLE + KHALSA_COLLEGE_IF_ACCESSIBLE + HISTORIC_OLD_CITY AND: include_GOBINDGARH_FORT + RAM_BAGH', 'Amritsar combines Sikh religious architecture, colonial-era institutions, fortified heritage and twentieth-century temple architecture. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:26', 'amritsar', 'choose_PREMIUM_RANJIT_AVENUE_OR_COMFORTABLE_CENTRAL_HOTEL AND: combine_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_EARLY_OR_EVENING + QUALITY_DINING + LIGHT_HERITAGE_WALKING + SPA + FREE_TIME', 'Relaxation-oriented Amritsar itineraries work best when old-city congestion and intensive sightseeing are deliberately reduced. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:27', 'amritsar', 'prefer_RANJIT_AVENUE + LAWRENCE_ROAD + SELECTED_HOTELS_AND_CAFES AND: focus_ON_RESTAURANTS + CAFES + HOTEL_LOUNGES + CULTURAL_EVENINGS + GOLDEN_TEMPLE_AT_NIGHT AND: do_not_position_AMRITSAR_AS_A_MAJOR_CLUBBING_DESTINATION', 'Amritsar''s evening appeal comes primarily from food, social dining, cafés, hotels and illuminated cultural sites rather than large-scale nightlife. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:28', 'amritsar', 'prefer_ONE_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_EXCESSIVE_HOTEL_CHANGES_BETWEEN_HERITAGE_CORE_RANJIT_AVENUE_AND_OUTER_CITY', 'Amritsar''s major attractions are sufficiently concentrated that hotel changes usually create more luggage and transfer friction than sightseeing benefit. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:29', 'amritsar', 'prefer_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_ACCESSIBLE_CORE_OR_WELL_CONNECTED_CENTRAL_LOCATION', 'A central base reduces transport time to the Golden Temple, Jallianwala Bagh and Partition Museum while retaining reasonable road access to Attari–Wagah. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:30', 'amritsar', 'consider_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_WALKING_PROXIMITY AND: verify_FINAL_VEHICLE_ACCESS + LUGGAGE_TRANSFER + LANE_WIDTH + STAIRS + CROWD_CONDITIONS', 'Very close Golden Temple accommodation can minimize pilgrimage travel time but may increase last-mile access complexity. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:31', 'amritsar', 'consider_RANJIT_AVENUE_OR_PREMIUM_CITY_HOTELS AND: retain_PRIVATE_CAR_FOR_HERITAGE_CORE_APPROACH + ATTARI + OUTER_CITY', 'Modern premium districts provide stronger hotel infrastructure and road access even though they require transportation to the old-city heritage core. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:32', 'amritsar', 'prefer_RANJIT_AVENUE_OR_WELL_CONNECTED_MODERN_CENTRAL_HOTEL AND: verify_ELEVATOR + VEHICLE_ACCESS + FAMILY_ROOM_CONFIGURATION + BREAKFAST + AIR_CONDITIONING', 'Families generally benefit from easier road access and larger modern hotel infrastructure rather than the most congested old-city lanes. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:33', 'amritsar', 'consider_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_PERIPHERY + RAILWAY_STATION_AREA + WELL_CONNECTED_CENTRAL_GUESTHOUSES AND: verify_CLEANLINESS + ACCESS + AIR_CONDITIONING + NIGHT_ARRIVAL_PRACTICALITY', 'Amritsar has broad budget accommodation inventory, but extreme proximity to the heritage core should not outweigh practical access and comfort. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:34', 'amritsar', 'choose_BETWEEN_APP_CAB + TAXI + PRIVATE_CAR_OR_HOTEL_TRANSFER ACCORDING_TO: HOTEL_LOCATION + LUGGAGE + TRAVELER_COUNT + ARRIVAL_TIME + FINAL_OLD_CITY_ACCESS', 'Airport transfers are straightforward by road, but the final approach to deeply located heritage-core accommodation may still require walking or local transport. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:35', 'amritsar', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR_OR_ORGANIZED_TRANSFER', 'The border lies outside the central city and a dedicated road transfer provides the most practical solution for ceremony timing and return travel. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:36', 'amritsar', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR_WITH_LOCAL_NAVIGATION', 'Pul Kanjari is a specialist outer-city heritage site with substantially weaker public-tourism connectivity than central Amritsar. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:37', 'amritsar', 'prefer_E_RICKSHAW_OR_WALKING_WHERE_TRAFFIC_RESTRICTIONS_APPLY', 'The pedestrianized and congested heritage environment around the Golden Temple makes small local transport and walking more efficient than attempting continuous car access. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:38', 'amritsar', 'prefer_WALKING', 'These headline attractions are located within the same compact heritage core and should normally be combined rather than treated as separate vehicle-based excursions. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:39', 'amritsar', 'prefer_WALKING', 'The Partition Museum is housed in Amritsar''s historic Town Hall and is only a short walk from the Golden Temple, making it one of the easiest geographic combinations in the city. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:40', 'amritsar', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_HOTEL + PRIVATE_CAR + SHORT_WALKING_BLOCKS + E_RICKSHAW_WHERE_USEFUL AND: reduce_DENSE_MARKET_WALKS + PEAK_HEAT + LONG_ATTARI_WAITING + PEAK_PILGRIMAGE_CROWDS', 'Amritsar remains highly rewarding for seniors, but heat, crowds, old-city congestion and border-ceremony logistics require itinerary adaptation. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:41', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_EARLY_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + AIR_CONDITIONED_MIDDAY_BREAK + INDOOR_MUSEUMS + EVENING_ACTIVITY AND: reduce_MIDDAY_ATTARI_WAITING + OLD_CITY_WALKING + EXPOSED_HERITAGE_TOURING', 'Late spring and early summer heat can make prolonged outdoor sightseeing physically demanding and requires strong day-part planning. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:42', 'amritsar', 'increase_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + PARTITION_MUSEUM + FOOD + SHOPPING + SELECTED_INDOOR_EXPERIENCES AND: reduce_TIGHTLY_TIMED_WALKING_AND_RURAL_PLANS AND: allow_BUFFER_FOR_TRAFFIC + WATERLOGGING + LOCAL_WEATHER_DISRUPTION', 'Monsoon rainfall and humidity can slow road movements and make extensive outdoor sightseeing less comfortable. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:43', 'amritsar', 'allow_BUFFER_FOR_AIRPORT + RAILWAY + INTERCITY_TRANSFERS AND: avoid_TIGHT_EARLY_MORNING_CONNECTIONS AND: shift_PHOTOGRAPHY_OR_LONG_ROAD_EXCURSIONS_IF_VISIBILITY_IS_POOR', 'Punjab winter fog can occasionally affect road visibility, flights and train operations even during otherwise excellent sightseeing weather. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:44', 'amritsar', 'increase_HOTEL_LOCATION_PRIORITY + WALKING_E_RICKSHAW_DEPENDENCE + TIME_BUFFERS AND: reduce_CROSS_CITY_MOVEMENTS + TIGHT_CONNECTIONS', 'Major Sikh festivals and pilgrimage periods can create exceptional Golden Temple crowds, traffic controls, accommodation demand and longer movement times. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:45', 'amritsar', 'expect_HIGH_RELIGIOUS_AND_DOMESTIC_VISITOR_PRESSURE AND: prioritize_ADVANCE_HOTEL_BOOKING + EARLY_SIGHTSEEING + EXTRA_TRANSIT_BUFFER', 'Baisakhi is deeply important to Sikh history and Punjabi culture and can substantially increase pilgrimage and festival demand in Amritsar. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:46', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM AND: add_ATTARI_WAGAH + ONE_AMRITSARI_FOOD_AND_MARKET_EXPERIENCE', 'This provides the strongest balanced introduction to Amritsar through Sikh spirituality, colonial history, Partition memory, border culture and Punjabi food. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:47', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_EARLY_OR_LATE + OLD_CITY + HALL_BAZAAR + TRADITIONAL_FOOD AND: reduce_TOTAL_TIME_SPENT_ONLY_IN_MODERN_HOTELS_AND_PRIVATE_CARS', 'Amritsar''s strongest sense of place comes from its religious life, heritage streets, markets, Punjabi food and everyday urban culture. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:48', 'amritsar', 'allocate_50_TO_60_PERCENT_TO_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_JALLIANWALA_PARTITION_AND_ATTARI AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_GOBINDGARH_FORT + FOOD + SHOPPING + HOTEL_REST + FREE_TIME', 'Families generally enjoy Amritsar more when intensive spiritual and historical sightseeing is balanced with fort experiences, food, shopping and rest. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:49', 'amritsar', 'allocate_60_TO_70_PERCENT_TO_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_HISTORY_AND_PUNJABI_CULTURE AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_PREMIUM_DINING + LIGHT_MARKET_WALKING + HOTEL_REST + SPA + FREE_TIME', 'Amritsar becomes more rewarding when travelers have time to observe the Golden Temple, eat slowly and experience Punjabi culture rather than continuously moving between attractions. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:50', 'amritsar', 'combine_GOLDEN_TEMPLE + JALLIANWALA_PARTITION + ONE_MAJOR_FOOD_EXPERIENCE_PER_DAY AND: spread_KULCHA + LASSI + DHABA + SWEETS + OPTIONAL_AMRITSARI_FISH_ACROSS_MULTIPLE_MEALS', 'Amritsari cuisine is rich and substantial, so spreading major dishes across the trip creates a stronger culinary experience than concentrating everything into one food tour. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:51', 'amritsar', 'prioritize_JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM + GOBINDGARH_FORT + RAM_BAGH AND: include_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_SIKH_HISTORY + PUL_KANJARI_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Amritsar supports a much deeper historical itinerary than its headline Golden Temple image suggests, spanning Sikh history, empire, colonial rule, the freedom struggle and Partition. ---'),
  ('amritsar:rule:52', 'amritsar', 'allocate_GOLDEN_TEMPLE_AND_SIKH_HERITAGE_AS_PRIMARY AND: combine_WITH_JALLIANWALA_BAGH + PARTITION_MUSEUM + MAHARAJA_RANJIT_SINGH_CONTEXT', 'This creates a more complete understanding of Amritsar as both a sacred Sikh centre and one of modern India''s most historically consequential cities. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:0', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + ROCK_GARDEN + SUKHNA_LAKE AND: include_SECTOR_17_OR_ONE_PUNJABI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Very short Chandigarh stays gain the greatest value from the city''s strongest modernist, artistic and recreational landmarks. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:1', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + ROCK_GARDEN + SUKHNA_LAKE + GOVERNMENT_MUSEUM_COMPLEX + ROSE_GARDEN AND: add_LE_CORBUSIER_CENTRE + SECTOR_17 + ONE_PUNJABI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'This creates the strongest balanced introduction to Chandigarh through modern architecture, public art, gardens, museums, lakefront recreation and urban culture. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:2', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + ROCK_GARDEN + SUKHNA_LAKE + GOVERNMENT_MUSEUM + LE_CORBUSIER_HERITAGE AND: add_ROSE_GARDEN + PANJAB_UNIVERSITY + BIRD_PARK + LEISURE_VALLEY + LOCAL_FOOD_AND_SHOPPING', 'Longer stays should move beyond headline attractions into Chandigarh''s architecture, museums, gardens, university heritage and everyday urban culture. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:3', 'chandigarh', 'consider_CHANDIGARH_CITY + PANCHKULA_PINJORE + MORNI_HILLS_OR_KASAULI', 'Chandigarh''s core sightseeing is relatively compact, so longer itineraries usually benefit from nearby regional additions. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:4', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_PREMIUM_CENTRAL_OR_LUXURY_HOTEL + PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER + SUKHNA_LAKE_SUNSET AND: increase_FINE_DINING + GARDEN_WALKS + SPA + PRIVATE_DRIVES + FREE_TIME', 'Chandigarh works best for honeymooners as a relaxed premium city break and Himalayan gateway rather than a conventional secluded honeymoon resort. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:5', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_ROCK_GARDEN + SUKHNA_LAKE + BIRD_PARK + ROSE_GARDEN AND: include_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + SELECTED_MUSEUMS + FAMILY_DINING AND: reduce_LONG_ARCHITECTURE_ONLY_BLOCKS + PEAK_SUMMER_HEAT', 'Families generally enjoy Chandigarh most when educational sightseeing is balanced with gardens, birds, boating and open recreational spaces. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:6', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_SHORT_SIGHTSEEING_BLOCKS + CAB + GARDENS + RECREATIONAL_STOPS AND: include_ROCK_GARDEN + SUKHNA_LAKE + BIRD_PARK + DOLLS_MUSEUM AND: reduce_LONG_MUSEUM_VISITS + MIDDAY_SUMMER_WALKING', 'Young children benefit from Chandigarh''s visual attractions, open spaces and short road-connected sightseeing blocks. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:7', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_FIVE_STAR_CHANDIGARH_HOTEL AND: increase_CHAUFFEURED_CAR + PRIVATE_ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE + PREMIUM_DINING + SPA + CURATED_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS', 'Chandigarh luxury travel is strongest through premium accommodation, comfortable private transport, expert architectural interpretation and onward foothill experiences. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:8', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_CENTRALLY_CONNECTED_BUDGET_HOTEL + CITY_BUS + AUTO_RICKSHAW + SELECTIVE_APP_CAB AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_SUKHNA_LAKE + GARDENS + CAPITOL_COMPLEX + SECTOR_WALKING', 'Chandigarh is highly suitable for budget travel because many important public spaces and attractions are free or inexpensive. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:9', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + LE_CORBUSIER_CENTRE + CHANDIGARH_ARCHITECTURE_MUSEUM AND: include_PIERRE_JEANNERET_MUSEUM + PANJAB_UNIVERSITY + GANDHI_BHAWAN', 'Chandigarh is internationally important for twentieth-century modernism, and UNESCO recognizes the Capitol Complex as part of the Architectural Work of Le Corbusier. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:10', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + LE_CORBUSIER_CENTRE AND: include_ARCHITECTURE_MUSEUM + CITY_PLANNING_CONTEXT + SELECTED_MODERNIST_BUILDINGS', 'Le Corbusier''s architecture and planning principles are fundamental to Chandigarh''s global identity. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:11', 'chandigarh', 'allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS AND: verify_CURRENT_GUIDED_TOUR + ENTRY_PROCEDURE + IDENTIFICATION_REQUIREMENTS AND: include_OPEN_HAND + ASSEMBLY + HIGH_COURT + SECRETARIAT_CONTEXT', 'The Capitol Complex is Chandigarh''s most significant architectural site and operates as an active governmental and protected heritage environment. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:12', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_ROCK_GARDEN + GOVERNMENT_MUSEUM_AND_ART_GALLERY AND: include_LE_CORBUSIER_CENTRE + ARCHITECTURE_MUSEUM', 'Chandigarh combines formal modernist architecture and museum collections with Nek Chand''s highly distinctive recycled-material environment. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:13', 'chandigarh', 'allocate_2_TO_3_HOURS AND: combine_WITH_SUKHNA_LAKE_OR_CAPITOL_COMPLEX', 'Rock Garden belongs to the same northern sightseeing zone and combines efficiently with Chandigarh''s other highest-priority attractions. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:14', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING_OR_SUNSET AND: include_WALKING + BOATING_IF_OPERATIONAL + GARDEN_OF_SILENCE', 'Sukhna Lake is most enjoyable during cooler periods and functions as Chandigarh''s primary recreational waterfront. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:15', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_ROSE_GARDEN + LEISURE_VALLEY AND: include_JAPANESE_GARDEN + SELECTED_SPECIALIST_GARDENS_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Landscape planning and interconnected green spaces are central to Chandigarh''s City Beautiful identity. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:16', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_GOVERNMENT_MUSEUM_AND_ART_GALLERY + CHANDIGARH_ARCHITECTURE_MUSEUM AND: include_NATURAL_HISTORY_MUSEUM + LE_CORBUSIER_CENTRE', 'These institutions provide the strongest combination of art, natural history, architecture and city-development interpretation. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:17', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_SUKHNA_LAKE + BIRD_PARK + ROSE_GARDEN AND: include_LEISURE_VALLEY + SELECTED_NATURE_TRAILS', 'Chandigarh provides unusually strong urban greenery and recreational nature for a planned Indian city. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:18', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + ROCK_GARDEN + SUKHNA_LAKE + ROSE_GARDEN AND: include_PANJAB_UNIVERSITY + MODERNIST_GEOMETRY + LEISURE_VALLEY AND: prefer_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + SUNSET', 'Chandigarh offers strong contrasts between monumental concrete architecture, geometric urban design, public art, gardens and Shivalik-facing landscapes. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:19', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_SECTOR_17 + SECTOR_MARKETS + PANJAB_UNIVERSITY + SELECTED_PUBLIC_SPACES AND: respect_GOVERNMENT_BUILDING + SECURITY + PRIVATE_PHOTOGRAPHY_RESTRICTIONS', 'Chandigarh''s strongest street photography comes from planned public spaces, market life and modernist urban geometry. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:20', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_SECTOR_7_8_17_26_35 + SELECTED_LOCAL_MARKETS_AND_RESTAURANTS AND: include_PUNJABI_FOOD + NORTH_INDIAN_DINING + CHOLE_BHATURE + KULCHA + LASSI + MODERN_CAFE_CULTURE', 'Chandigarh''s food identity combines Punjabi traditions with a broad modern Tricity dining scene. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:21', 'chandigarh', 'include_PANEER + DAL + CHOLE + KULCHA + PARATHA + LASSI + CHAAT + INDIAN_SWEETS AND: do_not_assume_CHANDIGARH_REQUIRES_NON_VEGETARIAN_FOOD_FOR_A_COMPLETE_CULINARY_EXPERIENCE', 'Punjabi and North Indian vegetarian food is widely available and forms a major part of Chandigarh''s dining culture. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:22', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_SECTOR_17 + SECTOR_22 AND: include_ELANTE_MALL_IF_MODERN_BRANDS_OR_INDOOR_SHOPPING_IS_REQUIRED', 'Sector 17 offers the classic Chandigarh shopping environment, while Sector 22 provides stronger local-market value and Elante provides large-scale modern retail. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:23', 'chandigarh', 'choose_PREMIUM_CENTRAL_HOTEL AND: combine_SUKHNA_LAKE + GARDENS + QUALITY_DINING + SPA + LIGHT_SIGHTSEEING + FREE_TIME', 'Chandigarh works particularly well for relaxed urban breaks because of its green spaces, broad avenues and relatively low sightseeing friction. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:24', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_SECTOR_7_8_26_35 + INDUSTRIAL_AREA + SELECTED_HOTELS AND: focus_ON_RESTAURANTS + CAFES + BREWERIES + BARS + HOTEL_LOUNGES', 'Chandigarh''s nightlife is strongest through dining, breweries, cafés and social evenings rather than destination-scale clubbing. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:25', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_ONE_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_UNNECESSARY_HOTEL_CHANGES_BETWEEN_SECTORS', 'Chandigarh''s road network makes most major attractions easy to reach from a single centrally located hotel. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:26', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_SECTOR_17_22_35_OR_OTHER_WELL_CONNECTED_CENTRAL_LOCATION', 'A central hotel provides efficient road access to both northern architecture attractions and southern commercial districts. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:27', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_PREMIUM_CENTRAL_OR_INDUSTRIAL_AREA_FIVE_STAR_HOTEL AND: retain_CHAUFFEURED_CAR_FOR_SIGHTSEEING + REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS', 'Modern premium hotels provide stronger facilities, dining, vehicle access and onward road-transfer convenience. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:28', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_WELL_CONNECTED_MODERN_HOTEL AND: verify_FAMILY_ROOM + ELEVATOR + BREAKFAST + PARKING + AIR_CONDITIONING', 'Families benefit more from modern hotel infrastructure and easy road access than from selecting accommodation only by attraction proximity. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:29', 'chandigarh', 'choose_APP_CAB + TAXI + PRIVATE_CAR_OR_HOTEL_TRANSFER ACCORDING_TO: HOTEL_LOCATION + LUGGAGE + TRAVELER_COUNT + ARRIVAL_TIME', 'Airport transfers are primarily road-based and straightforward compared with destinations requiring complex last-mile access. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:30', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_SHORT_CAB_TRANSFER_OR_PLANNED_CLUSTER_MOVEMENT', 'The two attractions are geographically close and should usually be combined within the same northern sightseeing block. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:31', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_SHORT_ROAD_TRANSFER_OR_WALKING_WHERE_COMFORTABLE', 'These attractions form one of Chandigarh''s most efficient first-time sightseeing combinations. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:32', 'chandigarh', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_HOTEL + PRIVATE_CAR + SHORT_WALKING_BLOCKS AND: reduce_ROCK_GARDEN_UNEVEN_PATHS + PEAK_HEAT + LONG_GARDEN_WALKS', 'Chandigarh is comparatively senior-friendly, but individual landscaped and heritage attractions still require mobility-specific planning. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:33', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_EARLY_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + EARLY_OR_EVENING_SUKHNA_LAKE + INDOOR_MUSEUMS + HOTEL_BREAK AND: reduce_MIDDAY_ROCK_GARDEN + GARDEN_WALKS + EXPOSED_ARCHITECTURE_TOURING', 'Chandigarh''s official climate pattern includes a hot season from approximately mid-March to mid-June, making day-part planning essential. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:34', 'chandigarh', 'increase_MUSEUMS + LE_CORBUSIER_CENTRE + SHOPPING + FOOD + SELECTED_INDOOR_ACTIVITY AND: reduce_TIGHTLY_TIMED_GARDEN_AND_OUTDOOR_PLANS AND: allow_TRAFFIC_AND_WEATHER_BUFFER', 'The late-June to mid-September monsoon can bring humidity and heavy rainfall that disrupt outdoor sightseeing. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:35', 'chandigarh', 'allow_BUFFER_FOR_AIRPORT + RAILWAY + INTERCITY_ROAD_TRANSFERS AND: shift_PHOTOGRAPHY_OR_LONG_ROAD_EXCURSIONS_IF_VISIBILITY_IS_POOR', 'Winter is otherwise excellent for Chandigarh sightseeing, but northern Indian fog can occasionally affect transport and visibility. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:36', 'chandigarh', 'prioritize_CAPITOL_COMPLEX + ROCK_GARDEN + SUKHNA_LAKE AND: add_GOVERNMENT_MUSEUM + ROSE_GARDEN + LE_CORBUSIER_CENTRE + ONE_FOOD_AND_SHOPPING_EXPERIENCE', 'This provides the strongest introduction to Chandigarh through architecture, planning, art, recreation, gardens and urban culture. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:37', 'chandigarh', 'allocate_50_TO_60_PERCENT_TO_CAPITOL_COMPLEX_LE_CORBUSIER_AND_MUSEUMS AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_SUKHNA_LAKE + GARDENS + DINING + FREE_TIME', 'Chandigarh becomes more rewarding when intensive architecture sightseeing is balanced with its lakefront and green-space character. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:38', 'chandigarh', 'allocate_50_PERCENT_TO_CAPITOL_COMPLEX_ROCK_GARDEN_AND_MUSEUMS AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_SUKHNA_LAKE + BIRD_PARK + GARDENS + FOOD + FREE_TIME', 'Families generally enjoy Chandigarh more when architecture and cultural learning are balanced with recreational attractions and open spaces. ---'),
  ('chandigarh:rule:39', 'chandigarh', 'use_CHANDIGARH_AS_ARRIVAL_AND_SHORT_SIGHTSEEING_BASE AND: continue_BY_PRIVATE_CAR_TO_KASAULI_SHIMLA_OR_OTHER_HIMALAYAN_DESTINATION', 'Chandigarh''s location at the Shivalik foothills and strong road connectivity make it an important gateway for onward Himalayan travel. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:0', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_OLD_CITY_HERITAGE + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE AND: include_RIVERFRONT_OR_ONE_GUJARATI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Very short Ahmedabad stays gain the greatest value from the city''s UNESCO heritage, Gandhi history, distinctive architecture and Gujarati cultural identity. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:1', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_OLD_CITY_HERITAGE_WALK + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + JAMA_MASJID + SABARMATI_RIVERFRONT AND: add_KANKARIA_OR_SCIENCE_CITY + ONE_GUJARATI_FOOD_AND_SHOPPING_EXPERIENCE', 'This creates the strongest balanced introduction to Ahmedabad through UNESCO heritage, Gandhi history, Sultanate architecture, contemporary recreation, Gujarati food and everyday city culture. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:2', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SULTANATE_HERITAGE + RIVERFRONT + KANKARIA_OR_SCIENCE_CITY AND: add_CALICO_MUSEUM + SARKHEJ_ROZA + DADA_HARIR + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE + TEXTILE_SHOPPING_AND_LOCAL_FOOD', 'Longer stays should move beyond headline attractions into Ahmedabad''s textiles, stepwells, specialist architecture, museums, religious heritage and neighborhood culture. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:3', 'ahmedabad', 'consider_AHMEDABAD_CITY + ADALAJ_GANDHINAGAR + MODHERA_OR_PATAN', 'Ahmedabad has substantial depth, but longer Gujarat itineraries become stronger when the city is combined with important nearby stepwell, temple, museum and regional heritage destinations. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:4', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_PREMIUM_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_OR_HERITAGE_STYLE_HOTEL + PRIVATE_AIRPORT_TRANSFER + RIVERFRONT_EVENING AND: increase_PRIVATE_HERITAGE_TOUR + FINE_DINING + SPA + ADALAJ_OR_SARKHEJ + FREE_TIME', 'Ahmedabad works best for honeymooners as a culturally rich premium city break with food, architecture and private sightseeing rather than as a conventional secluded resort destination. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:5', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA_LAKE + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + RIVERFRONT AND: include_SHORT_OLD_CITY_HERITAGE + SELECTED_MUSEUM_OR_RELIGIOUS_SITE + FAMILY_DINING AND: reduce_LONG_HERITAGE_WALKS + PEAK_SUMMER_HEAT', 'Families generally enjoy Ahmedabad most when heritage and education are balanced with Science City, recreational attractions, lakefront activity and comfortable food breaks. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:6', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_SHORT_SIGHTSEEING_BLOCKS + CAB + SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA + RECREATIONAL_STOPS AND: include_AQUATIC_GALLERY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + RIVERFRONT + CHILD_FRIENDLY_FOOD AND: reduce_LONG_OLD_CITY_WALKS + MULTIPLE_STEPWELLS + MIDDAY_SUMMER_SIGHTSEEING', 'Young children benefit from Ahmedabad''s interactive science attractions and recreational areas more than from long architecture-heavy walking schedules. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:7', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_FIVE_STAR_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_HOTEL AND: increase_CHAUFFEURED_CAR + PRIVATE_HERITAGE_GUIDE + SPECIALIST_ARCHITECTURE_OR_TEXTILE_EXPERIENCE + PREMIUM_DINING + SPA + CURATED_REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS', 'Ahmedabad luxury travel is strongest through premium accommodation, private transport, expert cultural interpretation, textile and architecture experiences and high-quality dining. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:8', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_WELL_CONNECTED_BUDGET_HOTEL + METRO_BRTS_AMTS + AUTO_RICKSHAW + SELECTIVE_APP_CAB AND: balance_PAID_ATTRACTIONS_WITH_OLD_CITY_WALKING + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + PUBLIC_HERITAGE + RIVERFRONT + LOCAL_FOOD', 'Ahmedabad is highly suitable for budget travelers because its historic neighborhoods, public spaces, local food and public transport can provide substantial destination value at relatively low cost. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:9', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_OLD_CITY_POLS + JAMA_MASJID + BHADRA + TEEN_DARWAZA AND: include_SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + TRADITIONAL_HAVELIS + HINDU_AND_JAIN_HERITAGE', 'UNESCO recognizes Ahmedabad''s historic walled city for its surviving urban structure, Sultanate architecture, traditional pol settlement pattern and multicultural religious heritage. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:10', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_OFFICIAL_OR_SPECIALIST_GUIDED_HERITAGE_WALK AND: include_KALUPUR_SWAMINARAYAN_TEMPLE + POLS + KAVI_DALPATRAM_CHOWK + MANEK_CHOWK + JAMA_MASJID', 'Ahmedabad''s heritage value lies not only in individual monuments but in the interconnected streets, pols, community spaces, religious structures and domestic architecture of the historic city. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:11', 'ahmedabad', 'allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS AND: prefer_EARLY_MORNING_OR_OFFICIAL_WALK_TIMING AND: verify_CURRENT_BOOKING + MEETING_POINT + DURATION + OPERATIONAL_STATUS', 'The municipal Morning Heritage Walk follows an interpreted route from the Kalupur area through pol neighborhoods and historic landmarks toward Jama Masjid and is considerably more informative than unguided monument hopping. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:12', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_SABARMATI_ASHRAM AND: include_HRIDAY_KUNJ + GANDHI_MUSEUM_CONTEXT + DANDI_MARCH_HISTORY + KHADI_AND_FREEDOM_MOVEMENT_INTERPRETATION', 'Sabarmati Ashram was Gandhi''s home from 1917 until 1930 and functioned as one of the principal centres of India''s freedom movement. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:13', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_JAMA_MASJID + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + BHADRA + TEEN_DARWAZA AND: include_SARKHEJ_ROZA + DADA_HARIR_STEPWELL_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Ahmedabad preserves an exceptional concentration of Gujarat Sultanate architecture and a distinctive architectural synthesis visible across mosques, tombs, gateways and water structures. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:14', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_JAMA_MASJID + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + SARKHEJ_ROZA AND: include_BHADRA + TEEN_DARWAZA + DADA_HARIR', 'These sites provide the strongest introduction to Ahmedabad''s Sultanate-era religious and civic architecture. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:15', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_HUTHEESING_JAIN_TEMPLE + OLD_CITY_JAIN_TEMPLES AND: include_POL_ARCHITECTURE + CALICO_MUSEUM_JAIN_COLLECTIONS_WHERE_RELEVANT', 'Jain religious institutions and mercantile communities form an important component of Ahmedabad''s multicultural historic urban fabric. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:16', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_DADA_HARIR_STEPWELL + ADALAJ_STEPWELL AND: allocate_ROAD_TRANSFER + WALKING_AND_STAIR_TIME', 'The Ahmedabad region contains exceptional historic water architecture, but stepwell visits involve stairs and should not be treated as universally accessible attractions. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:17', 'ahmedabad', 'allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS_WITH_TRANSFERS AND: combine_WITH_GANDHINAGAR_OR_NORTHERN_AHMEDABAD_IF_ROUTING_IS_EFFICIENT', 'Adalaj lies outside Ahmedabad''s central sightseeing core and works most efficiently as part of a northern regional excursion. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:18', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_CALICO_MUSEUM + TRADITIONAL_TEXTILE_SHOPPING AND: include_LAW_GARDEN + OLD_CITY_MARKETS + SELECTED_SPECIALIST_TEXTILE_STORES', 'Ahmedabad''s historic relationship with textile production, merchant patronage, handloom traditions and textile scholarship is fundamental to the city''s cultural identity. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:19', 'ahmedabad', 'verify_PRE_REGISTRATION + CURRENT_TOUR_AVAILABILITY + WEEKLY_CLOSURE AND: allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS_DEPENDING_ON_SELECTED_GALLERY_TOUR AND: do_not_treat_AS_DROP_IN_MUSEUM', 'The Calico Museum operates through structured guided gallery tours, with visitor numbers and access procedures controlled through advance registration. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:20', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_MILL_OWNERS_ASSOCIATION_BUILDING + SELECTED_BV_DOSHI_AND_MODERNIST_CONTEXT AND: include_SANSKAR_KENDRA + TAGORE_HALL + CEPT_ARCHITECTURAL_ENVIRONMENT_WHERE_ACCESSIBLE', 'Ahmedabad occupies an internationally important position in twentieth-century architecture through buildings and institutions associated with Le Corbusier, B. V. Doshi and other leading architects. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:21', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_MILL_OWNERS_ASSOCIATION_BUILDING AND: include_OTHER_ACCESSIBLE_MODERNIST_ARCHITECTURE + SPECIALIST_ARCHITECTURAL_CONTEXT AND: verify_CURRENT_BUILDING_ACCESS_BEFORE_VISIT', 'Le Corbusier''s Ahmedabad work forms a major part of the city''s modern architectural identity, but individual buildings may have restricted or institution-specific visitor access. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:22', 'ahmedabad', 'combine_UNESCO_OLD_CITY + SULTANATE_MONUMENTS + STEPWELLS + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE', 'Ahmedabad is unusually strong because its architectural narrative extends from medieval Sultanate and vernacular pol architecture through Jain heritage, stepwells and internationally important modernism. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:23', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_CALICO_MUSEUM + TEXTILES + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE AND: include_POL_WOODWORK + STONE_CARVING + SELECTED_CONTEMPORARY_DESIGN_SPACES', 'Ahmedabad''s design identity combines textiles, carved historic architecture, traditional craftsmanship and major twentieth-century architectural experimentation. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:24', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_GUJARAT_SCIENCE_CITY AND: include_AQUATIC_GALLERY + ROBOTICS_GALLERY + ASTRONOMY_AND_SPACE_SCIENCE_GALLERY', 'Gujarat Science City provides Ahmedabad''s strongest concentration of interactive science attractions and includes major aquatic, robotics, astronomy, nature and educational facilities. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:25', 'ahmedabad', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_TO_FULL_DAY AND: preselect_AQUATIC + ROBOTICS + ASTRONOMY_OR_OTHER_PRIORITY_GALLERIES AND: verify_CURRENT_FEES + LAST_ENTRY + SHOW_TIMINGS + TEMPORARY_CLOSURES', 'Science City extends over more than 107 hectares and contains numerous separate galleries, making unrealistic attraction stacking a common planning mistake. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:26', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_SCIENCE_CITY_AQUATIC_GALLERY AND: allow_SEPARATE_ENTRY_AND_VISIT_TIME', 'Science City''s Aquatic Gallery is a major standalone visitor experience with numerous aquatic zones and hundreds of species, so it should not be treated as a brief incidental exhibit. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:27', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_SCIENCE_CITY AND: combine_WITH_KANKARIA_OR_RIVERFRONT_ON_A_SEPARATE_HALF_DAY', 'Science City is substantial enough to require dedicated time, while Kankaria and the Riverfront provide complementary outdoor and recreational experiences. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:28', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_LATE_AFTERNOON_OR_EVENING AND: include_LAKEFRONT + SELECTED_FAMILY_ATTRACTIONS AND: verify_CURRENT_WEEKLY_CLOSURES + INDIVIDUAL_ACTIVITY_STATUS', 'Kankaria is most rewarding as a recreational family and evening cluster rather than as an exposed midday sightseeing stop during hotter months. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:29', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_LATE_AFTERNOON_OR_EVENING AND: include_WALKING + PHOTOGRAPHY + RECREATION_IF_OPERATIONAL', 'The Riverfront functions primarily as Ahmedabad''s contemporary outdoor leisure and public-space experience and is more comfortable outside peak daytime heat. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:30', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA + RIVERFRONT AND: include_SHORT_SABARMATI_ASHRAM_OR_HERITAGE_VISIT', 'Ahmedabad''s strongest family itineraries balance cultural education with interactive and recreational attractions. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:31', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_OLD_CITY_POLS + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + SARKHEJ_ROZA + STEPWELLS AND: include_RIVERFRONT + TRADITIONAL_MARKETS + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE AND: prefer_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + EVENING', 'Ahmedabad offers unusually diverse photographic subjects including carved wood, stone latticework, pol streets, religious architecture, stepwells, markets, modernist geometry and contemporary riverfront landscapes. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:32', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_OLD_CITY_POLS + MANEK_CHOWK + BHADRA_MARKETS + LAW_GARDEN AND: respect_RELIGIOUS_SITE + RESIDENTIAL_POL + PEOPLE_PHOTOGRAPHY_RESTRICTIONS', 'The strongest street photography comes from Ahmedabad''s living neighborhoods and markets, but the historic city remains a residential and religious environment rather than an open-air photography set. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:33', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_OLD_CITY + MANEK_CHOWK + TRADITIONAL_GUJARATI_RESTAURANTS + SELECTED_WESTERN_CITY_DINING AND: include_GUJARATI_THALI + FARSAN + FAFDA_JALEBI + KHAMAN + KHANDVI + SEASONAL_LOCAL_DISHES', 'Ahmedabad is one of India''s strongest vegetarian city-food destinations and rewards travelers who explore both traditional Gujarati cuisine and contemporary dining. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:34', 'ahmedabad', 'include_GUJARATI_THALI + KHAMAN + DHOKLA + KHANDVI + THEPLA + HANDVO + DAL_DHOKLI + FARSAN + SWEETS AND: do_not_assume_NON_VEGETARIAN_FOOD_IS_REQUIRED_FOR_A_COMPLETE_AHMEDABAD_CULINARY_EXPERIENCE', 'Vegetarian traditions are central rather than peripheral to Ahmedabad''s culinary identity. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:35', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_MANEK_CHOWK + SELECTED_LOCAL_FARSAN_AND_SNACK_SHOPS AND: balance_POPULAR_NIGHT_FOOD_WITH_TRADITIONAL_DAYTIME_GUJARATI_FOOD', 'Ahmedabad''s culinary identity extends well beyond late-night Manek Chowk and includes breakfast foods, farsan, thalis, sweets and neighborhood specialties. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:36', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_LAW_GARDEN + DHALGARWAD + SELECTED_OLD_CITY_MARKETS AND: include_CG_ROAD_OR_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_IF_MODERN_BRANDS_ARE_REQUIRED', 'Ahmedabad shopping is strongest when traditional textiles and handicrafts are combined with contemporary urban retail. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:37', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_LAW_GARDEN + DHALGARWAD + SPECIALIST_TEXTILE_STORES AND: include_BANDHANI + EMBROIDERY + BLOCK_PRINTS + TRADITIONAL_GUJARATI_CLOTHING', 'Textiles are one of Ahmedabad and Gujarat''s defining shopping categories and deserve dedicated market selection rather than generic mall shopping. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:38', 'ahmedabad', 'choose_PREMIUM_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_HOTEL AND: combine_RIVERFRONT + QUALITY_DINING + SPA + LIGHT_HERITAGE + FREE_TIME', 'Ahmedabad can support a relaxed urban break, but itineraries become tiring when dense Old City walking and distant attractions are scheduled continuously. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:39', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_SINDHU_BHAVAN_ROAD + PRAHLAD_NAGAR + BODAKDEV + SG_HIGHWAY + SELECTED_PREMIUM_HOTELS AND: focus_ON_RESTAURANTS + CAFES + DESSERTS + LATE_EVENING_FOOD + SOCIAL_SPACES AND: do_not_position_AHMEDABAD_AS_ALCOHOL_CENTRIC_NIGHTLIFE_DESTINATION', 'Ahmedabad''s evening economy is strongest through dining, cafés, dessert culture, shopping and social venues, while Gujarat''s prohibition framework substantially shapes conventional nightlife. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:40', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_ONE_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_UNNECESSARY_HOTEL_CHANGES_BETWEEN_OLD_AND_WEST_AHMEDABAD', 'Ahmedabad''s major tourism areas can be covered effectively from one well-connected hotel using Metro, BRTS, cabs and geographically clustered sightseeing. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:41', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_ASHRAM_ROAD + NAVRANGPURA + ELLISBRIDGE + PALDI_OR_OTHER_WELL_CONNECTED_CENTRAL_WESTERN_LOCATION', 'Central-western Ahmedabad provides practical access to the old city, Sabarmati Ashram, Riverfront and western dining / commercial districts without requiring accommodation inside congested heritage lanes. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:42', 'ahmedabad', 'consider_OLD_CITY_OR_HERITAGE_STYLE_ACCOMMODATION AND: verify_VEHICLE_ACCESS + LUGGAGE_HANDLING + ELEVATOR + PARKING + NIGHT_ACCESS', 'Historic-city accommodation can provide stronger atmosphere but may involve narrow access, pedestrian segments and less convenient vehicle movement. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:43', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_PREMIUM_WESTERN_AHMEDABAD_OR_SG_HIGHWAY_FIVE_STAR_HOTEL AND: retain_CHAUFFEURED_CAR_FOR_HERITAGE + SCIENCE_CITY + SARKHEJ + REGIONAL_EXCURSIONS', 'Western Ahmedabad generally provides stronger premium hotel infrastructure, road access, modern dining and airport / highway convenience. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:44', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_WELL_CONNECTED_MODERN_HOTEL AND: verify_FAMILY_ROOM + ELEVATOR + BREAKFAST + PARKING + AIR_CONDITIONING + POOL_IF_REQUIRED', 'Families benefit more from modern infrastructure, air-conditioning and convenient transport than from choosing accommodation solely for old-city atmosphere. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:45', 'ahmedabad', 'choose_APP_CAB + TAXI + PRIVATE_CAR_OR_HOTEL_TRANSFER ACCORDING_TO: HOTEL_LOCATION + LUGGAGE + TRAVELER_COUNT + ARRIVAL_TIME', 'As of September 2026, Ahmedabad''s direct Metro airport extension is a sanctioned / developing project rather than an operational airport-rail connection, so road transfer remains the simplest general visitor option. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:46', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_METRO_BRTS_OR_CAB_WITH_LAST_MILE_CONNECTION', 'The two clusters should normally be treated as separate sightseeing blocks rather than as one continuous heritage walk. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:47', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_SHORT_CAB_AUTO_OR_METRO_BASED_CONNECTION_DEPENDING_ON_EXACT_POINT', 'The Riverfront extends over a substantial north–south corridor, so transport should be selected according to the exact promenade segment rather than treating it as one single access point. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:48', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_METRO_PLUS_LAST_MILE_OR_DIRECT_CAB', 'Science City lies well west of Ahmedabad''s historic core and should not be combined with dense Old City sightseeing through repeated short transfers. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:49', 'ahmedabad', 'avoid_PLANNING_AS_SHORT_SAME_CLUSTER_TRANSFER AND: use_PRIVATE_CAR_IF_COMBINING_WITH_OTHER_REGIONAL_SIGHTSEEING', 'Sarkhej and Adalaj lie on different sides of the metropolitan region and are better handled through deliberate road routing than casual attraction stacking. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:50', 'ahmedabad', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_MODERN_HOTEL + PRIVATE_CAR + SHORT_OLD_CITY_WALKING_BLOCKS AND: reduce_LONG_POL_WALKS + STEPWELL_STAIRS + PEAK_HEAT + EXTENDED_MARKET_WALKING', 'Ahmedabad can work well for senior travelers with private transport, but its most historically significant environments include narrow lanes, uneven surfaces, stairs and substantial heat exposure. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:51', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_EARLY_OLD_CITY + EARLY_SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SCIENCE_CITY + CALICO_OR_OTHER_INDOOR_EXPERIENCE + HOTEL_BREAK AND: shift_RIVERFRONT + KANKARIA + MARKETS_TO_EVENING AND: reduce_MIDDAY_HERITAGE_WALKS + SARKHEJ + STEPWELLS + EXPOSED_OUTDOOR_TOURING', 'IMD climate data show Ahmedabad''s mean maximum temperature rising to approximately 39.8°C in April, 42.2°C in May and 39.4°C in June, making day-part planning essential. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:52', 'ahmedabad', 'increase_SCIENCE_CITY + CALICO_MUSEUM + SHOPPING + FOOD + SELECTED_INDOOR_ARCHITECTURE AND: reduce_TIGHTLY_TIMED_OLD_CITY + RIVERFRONT + STEPWELL + OUTDOOR_PHOTOGRAPHY_PLANS AND: allow_TRAFFIC + WATERLOGGING + WEATHER_BUFFER', 'Monsoon rainfall and humidity can affect pedestrian comfort, old-city streets and road travel, so Ahmedabad itineraries should retain weather flexibility. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:53', 'ahmedabad', 'increase_OLD_CITY_WALKING + SARKHEJ + STEPWELLS + RIVERFRONT + REGIONAL_DAY_TRIPS', 'Ahmedabad''s winter months provide the strongest general conditions for long outdoor heritage days and extended walking. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:54', 'ahmedabad', 'increase_GARBA_AND_CULTURAL_EVENINGS AND: book_HOTELS + PREMIUM_EVENTS + PRIVATE_TRANSPORT_EARLY AND: reduce_OVERLOADED_DAYTIME_SIGHTSEEING_IF_LATE_NIGHT_GARBA_IS_PLANNED', 'Navratri is one of Gujarat''s defining cultural periods and can significantly change Ahmedabad''s evening schedule, accommodation demand and traveler energy requirements. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:55', 'ahmedabad', 'increase_KITE_FESTIVAL_AND_LOCAL_CULTURAL_PLANNING AND: expect_CROWD + ROAD + ROOFTOP_ACTIVITY_CHANGES AND: use_LOCAL_GUIDANCE_FOR_SAFE_VIEWING', 'Ahmedabad''s January kite-flying culture creates a distinctive seasonal experience but requires crowd, mobility and safety-aware planning. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:56', 'ahmedabad', 'prioritize_OLD_CITY_HERITAGE_WALK + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SIDI_SAIYYED_MOSQUE + JAMA_MASJID AND: add_RIVERFRONT + ONE_GUJARATI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE + KANKARIA_OR_SCIENCE_CITY', 'This provides the strongest introduction to Ahmedabad through UNESCO heritage, Gandhi history, Sultanate architecture, Gujarati cuisine and contemporary urban recreation. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:57', 'ahmedabad', 'allocate_50_TO_60_PERCENT_TO_OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SELECTED_ARCHITECTURE AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_RIVERFRONT + DINING + SHOPPING + SPA + FREE_TIME', 'Ahmedabad becomes more enjoyable when intensive heritage walking is balanced with food, modern public spaces and relaxed evening experiences. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:58', 'ahmedabad', 'allocate_40_TO_50_PERCENT_TO_OLD_CITY + SABARMATI_ASHRAM + SELECTED_HERITAGE AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_SCIENCE_CITY + KANKARIA + RIVERFRONT + FOOD + FREE_TIME', 'Families generally enjoy Ahmedabad more when UNESCO and Gandhi heritage are balanced with interactive science, recreation and relaxed food experiences. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:59', 'ahmedabad', 'allocate_OLD_CITY + SULTANATE_ARCHITECTURE + STEPWELL_DAY AND: include_CALICO_MUSEUM + MODERN_ARCHITECTURE + TEXTILE_OR_DESIGN_CONTEXT', 'Ahmedabad''s greatest architectural strength comes from the ability to connect vernacular, Sultanate, Jain, water, textile and modernist design traditions within one destination. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:60', 'ahmedabad', 'use_AHMEDABAD_AS_PRIMARY_HOTEL_BASE AND: combine_ADALAJ + GANDHINAGAR_ATTRACTIONS_AS_NORTHERN_EXCURSION', 'Ahmedabad and Gandhinagar are increasingly integrated through road and Metro connectivity, making a single Ahmedabad base practical for many short combined itineraries. ---'),
  ('ahmedabad:rule:61', 'ahmedabad', 'use_AHMEDABAD_AS_ARRIVAL_AND_CITY_SIGHTSEEING_BASE AND: continue_BY_PRIVATE_CAR_TO_ADALAJ + MODHERA + PATAN_OR_OTHER_NORTH_GUJARAT_DESTINATIONS', 'Ahmedabad''s airport, hotel inventory and road connectivity make it one of the strongest gateways for wider Gujarat heritage circuits. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:0', 'jabalpur', 'Treat Jabalpur as a Narmada + waterfall + heritage express: prioritise Bhedaghat Marble Rocks, Dhuandhar Falls and Chausath Yogini Temple; add Madan Mahal Fort if time permits.', 'Jabalpur''s strongest short-visit combination is Narmada scenery + marble landscapes + waterfalls + heritage. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:1', 'jabalpur', 'Build a classic Jabalpur nature + heritage + spiritual circuit with Bhedaghat, Dhuandhar Falls, Chausath Yogini Temple, Madan Mahal Fort, Gwarighat and Dumna Nature Reserve.', 'Three days allow a comfortable mix of nature, Narmada experiences, heritage and local culture without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:2', 'jabalpur', 'Expand Jabalpur into a regional nature-and-wildlife gateway, combining Jabalpur + Bhedaghat + Bargi Dam with onward excursions toward Kanha or Bandhavgarh.', 'Jabalpur works well as a base for exploring Mahakoshal, Narmada landscapes and nearby national parks. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:3', 'jabalpur', 'Prioritise Bhedaghat Marble Rocks, Dhuandhar Falls, Chausath Yogini Temple, Madan Mahal Fort and Gwarighat.', 'These provide the strongest introduction to Jabalpur''s natural, spiritual, historical and Narmada identity. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:4', 'jabalpur', 'Choose a comfortable premium hotel, arrange private transport and prioritise Bhedaghat boating, Marble Rocks, Dhuandhar Falls, Narmada evenings and relaxed hotel leisure.', 'Jabalpur''s romantic appeal comes from river scenery, dramatic landscapes, photography and peaceful experiences rather than nightlife. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:5', 'jabalpur', 'Use private transport and prioritise Bhedaghat, Dhuandhar Falls, Dumna Nature Reserve, Gwarighat and Bargi Dam.', 'Jabalpur offers a useful combination of nature, sightseeing, boating, education and outdoor experiences for families. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:6', 'jabalpur', 'Select the best available premium hotel, arrange a chauffeur-driven vehicle and private guide, and emphasise private sightseeing, premium dining, Narmada experiences and curated nature excursions.', 'Jabalpur has a moderate luxury fit, strongest for private experiences rather than ultra-luxury resorts. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:7', 'jabalpur', 'Stay in central Jabalpur, use budget hotels and local transport, and prioritise Bhedaghat, Dhuandhar Falls, Madan Mahal and Gwarighat.', 'Core sightseeing is relatively economical; the main budget increase comes from private cabs and longer excursions. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:8', 'jabalpur', 'Prioritise Bhedaghat Marble Rocks, Dhuandhar Falls, Dumna Nature Reserve and Bargi Dam.', 'Jabalpur combines Narmada landscapes, waterfalls, forests and reservoir scenery. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:9', 'jabalpur', 'Add Narmada boating, reservoir activities, nature walks and wildlife excursions, depending on season and operating conditions.', 'Jabalpur is stronger for soft adventure and nature experiences than extreme adventure. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:10', 'jabalpur', 'Choose a comfortable central hotel, use private transport and prioritise Dhuandhar Falls, Gwarighat, museums and easier sightseeing; avoid excessive stairs and rushed circuits.', 'Temple steps, walking distances and summer heat should be considered when pacing the itinerary. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:11', 'jabalpur', 'Use Jabalpur as a 1-night gateway stop, prioritising Dhuandhar Falls + Bhedaghat or Madan Mahal + Gwarighat before continuing onward.', 'Jabalpur is a practical rail, air and road gateway for Mahakoshal and nearby wildlife destinations. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:12', 'jabalpur', 'Prioritise Madan Mahal Fort, Rani Durgavati Museum, Chausath Yogini Temple and regional Gond heritage.', 'Jabalpur has strong connections with Gond history, Rani Durgavati and the wider Mahakoshal region. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:13', 'jabalpur', 'Choose a quiet premium stay, reduce transfers and focus on Narmada riverside time, nature, spa/leisure facilities and relaxed dining.', 'Jabalpur''s wellness strength is based on nature, river ambience and slow-paced stays. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:14', 'jabalpur', 'Prioritise early-morning sightseeing and evening river experiences, keeping hot afternoon hours flexible.', 'Jabalpur becomes very hot during peak summer, making midday outdoor sightseeing less comfortable. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:15', 'jabalpur', 'Prioritise Dhuandhar Falls, Bhedaghat viewpoints and scenic nature experiences while keeping weather and river-activity buffers.', 'Monsoon can enhance waterfall flow and greenery but may affect boating and road conditions. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:16', 'jabalpur', 'Build a local food experience around poha, jalebi, samosa, kachori, sabudana dishes, thali and Central Indian snacks.', 'Jabalpur offers an accessible Central Indian food experience with strong local snack culture. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:17', 'jabalpur', 'Prioritise Bhedaghat marble/soapstone handicrafts, statues, decorative items, textiles and local sweets.', 'Marble craftsmanship is one of Jabalpur-Bhedaghat''s most distinctive shopping experiences. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:18', 'jabalpur', 'Prioritise Marble Rocks, Dhuandhar Falls, Narmada River, Madan Mahal, Gwarighat and Bargi Dam.', 'Jabalpur provides strong photographic variety through waterfalls, marble cliffs, rivers, heritage and landscapes. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:19', 'jabalpur', 'Combine Chausath Yogini Temple, Madan Mahal Fort, Rani Durgavati Museum and Gwarighat with local food and handicrafts.', 'This creates a balanced introduction to Jabalpur''s spiritual, Gond, regional and Narmada culture. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:20', 'jabalpur', 'Use Jabalpur as a wildlife gateway and extend the itinerary toward Kanha or Bandhavgarh National Park for dedicated safari experiences.', 'Jabalpur itself offers nature experiences, while Kanha and Bandhavgarh provide substantially stronger dedicated wildlife safaris. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:21', 'jabalpur', 'Combine Jabalpur + Bhedaghat with onward travel toward Kanha, Bandhavgarh, Pachmarhi or other Madhya Pradesh destinations according to route.', 'Jabalpur is strategically useful as a Mahakoshal and central Madhya Pradesh gateway. ---'),
  ('jabalpur:rule:22', 'jabalpur', 'Allow sufficient time for airport/rail transfers, traffic and regional road conditions before onward travel.', 'Travel times to surrounding destinations can be longer than expected, especially when combining wildlife parks and regional circuits. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:0', 'pachmarhi', 'Treat Pachmarhi as a Satpura hill + waterfall + cave express: prioritise Bee Falls, Pandava Caves, Jata Shankar Cave and Dhoopgarh sunset.', 'Pachmarhi''s strongest short-visit combination is waterfall swimming + mythological cave heritage + highest peak sunset. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:1', 'pachmarhi', 'Build a classic Pachmarhi nature + heritage + spiritual circuit with Dhoopgarh, Bee Falls, Apsara Vihar, Rajat Prapat, Jata Shankar, Pandava Caves, Handi Khoh and Reechgarh.', 'Three days allow a comfortable mix of waterfalls, viewpoint drives, natural caves, local heritage and pine forest walks without excessive rushing. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:2', 'pachmarhi', 'Expand Pachmarhi into a regional Biosphere Reserve and eco-adventure circuit, combining Pachmarhi hill sightseeing + Chauragarh trek + Satpura National Park safaris (Madai/Panaarpani).', 'Pachmarhi works well as a base for exploring Satpura Tiger Reserve, deep wilderness treks, and regional waterfalls. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:3', 'pachmarhi', 'Prioritise Dhoopgarh, Bee Falls, Jata Shankar Cave, Pandava Caves and Handi Khoh.', 'These provide the strongest introduction to Pachmarhi''s natural, mythological, geological and high-altitude identity. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:4', 'pachmarhi', 'Choose an MP Tourism heritage bungalow or quiet forest resort, arrange a private 4x4 Gypsy, and prioritise Dhoopgarh sunsets, Rajendragiri gardens, pine forest walks and relaxed resort leisure.', 'Pachmarhi''s romantic appeal comes from misty landscapes, quiet forest trails, dramatic sunsets and peaceful hill climate rather than nightlife. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:5', 'pachmarhi', 'Rent a private 4x4 Gypsy and prioritise Apsara Vihar, Bee Falls, Pandava Caves, Pachmarhi Lake boating and Rajendragiri.', 'Pachmarhi offers a useful combination of gentle nature pools, boating, garden walks and child-friendly cave exploration for families. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:6', 'pachmarhi', 'Select the best MP Tourism heritage bungalow or boutique forest resort, arrange a private chauffeur-driven 4x4 Gypsy and naturalist guide, and emphasise custom forest tours, private safaris and heritage resort dining.', 'Pachmarhi has a moderate luxury fit, strongest for colonial heritage charm and private forest experiences rather than 5-star mega-resorts. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:7', 'pachmarhi', 'Stay near Pachmarhi main market, use budget guesthouses and shared Gypsies, and prioritise Jata Shankar, Pandava Caves, Handi Khoh, Bee Falls and Dhoopgarh.', 'Core attraction entry fees are minimal; the main budget increase comes from private Gypsy rentals and deep forest permits. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:8', 'pachmarhi', 'Prioritise Bee Falls, Rajat Prapat, Handi Khoh, Dhoopgarh and Satpura Tiger Reserve.', 'Pachmarhi combines Satpura biosphere forests, deep ravines, perennial waterfalls and highest peak vistas. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:9', 'pachmarhi', 'Add Chauragarh mountain trek, Duchess Falls steep forest hike, Reechgarh boulder scrambling and Satpura jeep/boat safaris.', 'Pachmarhi is exceptionally strong for eco-trekking, mountain climbs and jungle wilderness adventures. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:10', 'pachmarhi', 'Choose a comfortable cantonment hotel, use private 4x4 Gypsy transfers, and prioritise Pandava Caves gardens, Rajendragiri, Bison Lodge Museum and Pachmarhi Lake; avoid steep waterfall descents and Chauragarh stairs.', 'Steep stairs at Bee Falls (400+ steps), Chauragarh (1,300+ steps) and slippery cave approaches should be considered when pacing the itinerary. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:11', 'pachmarhi', 'Prioritise Pandava Caves, Bison Lodge Museum, Christ Church and colonial British-era cantonment architecture.', 'Pachmarhi offers a unique mix of ancient rock-cut cave heritage, tribal history and 19th-century British cantonment legacy. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:12', 'pachmarhi', 'Choose a quiet forest retreat, reduce daily transfers, and focus on pine forest walks, mountain air, spa/leisure facilities and peaceful nature spots.', 'Pachmarhi''s wellness strength is based on pine-scented air, serene nature, altitude and slow-paced hill living. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:13', 'pachmarhi', 'Prioritise early-morning waterfall visits and evening sunset drives to Dhoopgarh, keeping hot afternoon hours flexible.', 'Pachmarhi experiences warm daytime temperatures during peak summer, making midday step-climbing tiring. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:14', 'pachmarhi', 'Prioritise Bee Falls, Apsara Vihar, Rajat Prapat and misty viewpoints while checking trail safety and road conditions.', 'Monsoon transforms Pachmarhi into a misty, verdant waterfall paradise, though Satpura National Park core safaris remain closed. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:15', 'pachmarhi', 'Build a local food experience around poha-jalebi, dal bafti, sabudana dishes, Central Indian thalis and market street snacks.', 'Pachmarhi offers a simple, comforting Central Indian hill station food experience. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:16', 'pachmarhi', 'Prioritise pure forest honey, herbal oils, wooden handicrafts, tribal Gond art and local souvenirs at the town bazaar.', 'Organic forest products and indigenous handicrafts are Pachmarhi''s most distinctive shopping items. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:17', 'pachmarhi', 'Prioritise Dhoopgarh sunset, Handi Khoh canyon, Rajat Prapat Silver Falls, Bee Falls stream and Reechgarh rock formations.', 'Pachmarhi provides strong photographic variety through dramatic ravines, cascading waterfalls, ancient rocks and sunset peak panoramas. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:18', 'pachmarhi', 'Combine Jata Shankar Cave, Gupt Mahadev, Pandava Caves, Bison Lodge and local tribal art shops.', 'This creates a balanced introduction to Pachmarhi''s Shaivite mythology, Mahabharata legends and regional forest culture. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:19', 'pachmarhi', 'Combine Pachmarhi hill visits with a dedicated safari at Satpura National Park (Madai or Panaarpani gates) for tiger, leopard, and sloth bear tracking.', 'Pachmarhi sits within the Satpura Biosphere Reserve, offering direct access to one of Central India''s finest tiger reserves. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:20', 'pachmarhi', 'Combine Pachmarhi with onward travel toward Bhopal, Bhimbetka, Sanchi, Jabalpur or Kanha National Park.', 'Pachmarhi is strategically positioned as a central hill and nature anchor on wider Madhya Pradesh travel routes. ---'),
  ('pachmarhi:rule:21', 'pachmarhi', 'Allow sufficient time for winding mountain roads, Pipariya railway transfers, and forest checkpost buffers before onward travel.', 'Ghat roads leading down from the plateau can take longer than expected, especially when connecting to trains at Pipariya or flights at Bhopal/Jabalpur. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:0', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Pick ONE park only (either Bandhavgarh or Kanha) and focus strictly on 3–4 core zone safaris (e.g., Tala/Magadhi in Bandhavgarh OR Kanha/Mukki in Kanha).', 'Splitting 2 days between both parks results in excessive transit time (5–6 hours driving) and missed morning safari gates. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:1', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Build a classic Bandhavgarh + Kanha Tiger Reserve Circuit (2–3 nights Bandhavgarh + 2–3 nights Kanha) with 6–8 total safaris.', 'Five to six days allow a complete Central Indian wildlife odyssey, balancing Bandhavgarh''s high tiger density with Kanha''s Sal forests and Barasingha meadows. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:2', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Expand the circuit into a Grand Central Indian Wilderness Experience combining Bandhavgarh + Kanha + Pench National Park or adding buffer night safaris and village cultural walks.', 'Extended trips allow full multi-zone coverage, night buffer tracking, and relaxed downtime without safari fatigue. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:3', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Combine Bandhavgarh (Tala / Magadhi zones) and Kanha (Kanha / Mukki zones) using registered open 4x4 Gypsies and expert naturalists.', 'Delivers the highest probability of tiger sightings, varied landscapes, and iconic Central Indian wildlife for first-timers. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:4', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Book private high-end luxury wilderness lodges (e.g., Taj Safaris, Pugdundee Safaris), reserve exclusive private Gypsies, and arrange private bush dinners, nature walks, and infinity pool downtime.', 'The circuit offers secluded wilderness, colonial-style tented camps, and intimate outdoor luxury away from crowded tourist centers. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:5', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Select resorts with large lawns, swimming pools, and in-house naturalists, alternate morning core safaris with afternoon buffer drives/nature walks, and book contiguous resort rooms.', 'Keeps children engaged while managing the physical demands of 4-hour pre-dawn open-Gypsy safari drives. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:6', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Stay at ultra-luxury lodges near Tala Gate (Bandhavgarh) and Mukki/Khatia Gates (Kanha), book private Gypsies with senior naturalists, and charter private air/road transfers from Jabalpur or Raipur.', 'Both parks host world-class luxury eco-lodges offering bespoke safari hosting and gourmet dining. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:7', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Stay in MP Tourism resorts or local homestays near Khatia (Kanha) and Tala (Bandhavgarh), utilize single-seat / shared Gypsy permits, and opt for buffer zone drives.', 'Main costs are driven by permit fees and private Gypsy rentals; shared options and budget stays keep costs manageable. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:8', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Spend at least 3 nights in Bandhavgarh (Tala & Magadhi zones) with a dedicated private Gypsy and custom camera lens mounts.', 'Bandhavgarh''s rugged terrain and high predator density provide exceptional close-range tiger photography opportunities. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:9', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Prioritize Kanha National Park (Mukki and Sarhi zones) and add a guided nature walk along the park periphery.', 'Kanha''s vast Sal forests, wetlands, and open meadows host over 300 bird species and the rare Hard Ground Barasingha. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:10', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Request Gypsies with backrest cushions and step-stools, choose lodges within 10 minutes of safari gates, and limit to one safari per day with rest afternoons.', 'Open-Gypsy rides over bumpy forest tracks for 4+ hours can cause physical strain and fatigue. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:11', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Prioritize Bandhavgarh National Park and include viewpoints of Bandhavgarh Fort, Shesh Shaiya (reclining Vishnu statue), and ancient rock-cut caves.', 'Bandhavgarh uniquely integrates ancient 2,000-year-old archaeological heritage directly within a active tiger reserve. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:12', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Book Night Buffer Safaris in Bandhavgarh (Dhamokhar/Panpatha) or Kanha (Khatia buffer).', 'Core zones close at sunset; buffer night drives offer chances to spot nocturnal predators, sloth bears, Indian civets, and owls. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:13', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Advise heavy thermal layering, windcheaters, gloves, and caps for pre-dawn open-Gypsy drives, transitioning to lighter clothes by midday.', 'Temperatures in open jungle meadows can plunge to 2°C–5°C during early morning drives. ---');
INSERT INTO decision_rule (id, place_id, action, reason) VALUES
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:14', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Book morning core safaris, carry heavy dust protection (scarves/masks), stay hydrated, and focus on waterhole animal tracking.', 'Rising heat (38°C–44°C) forces wildlife to frequent open waterholes, dramatically increasing sighting probability despite dust and warmth. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:15', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Restrict itinerary to Buffer Zone Safaris only or pivot to non-wildlife destinations.', 'All core safari gates across Bandhavgarh and Kanha remain strictly closed from July 1 to September 30 for animal breeding and forest regeneration. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:16', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Add a guided Baiga or Gond tribal village walk, visit local weekly haat markets near Kanha, and purchase authentic Gond paintings.', 'The regions surrounding Kanha and Bandhavgarh are rich in indigenous tribal heritage, art, and traditional forest lifestyles. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:17', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Secure private Gypsies for full mobility, carry dust-proof camera covers, and focus on Kanha''s misty golden morning meadows and Bandhavgarh''s sandstone cliffs.', 'Combines dramatic landscape geometry with diverse wildlife portrait opportunities. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:18', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Route travel seamlessly as Jabalpur → Bandhavgarh → Kanha → Pench / Nagpur or reverse.', 'Optimizes ground transfer logistics along clean highway corridors without backtracking. ---'),
  ('bandhavgarh-and-kanha:rule:19', 'bandhavgarh-and-kanha', 'Pre-book reliable private AC cabs and allow 5–6 hours for Bandhavgarh to Kanha and 4–5 hours for Kanha to Jabalpur/Nagpur.', 'Highway conditions vary and pre-dawn or late-night forest drives require experienced drivers. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:0', 'omkareshwar', 'Focus strictly on the Core Dual-Jyotirlinga Circuit (Omkareshwar Temple on Mandhata Island + Mamleshwar Temple on the South Bank), crossing via Jhula Pul or Mamleshwar Setu suspension bridges, and attending the evening Narmada Aarti at Nagar Ghat.', 'Allows first-time visitors and pilgrimage travelers to complete primary religious darshans and riverfront rituals without rushing. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:1', 'omkareshwar', 'Build a complete Omkareshwar Island & River Heritage Itinerary combining the 7 km Omkar Parvat Parikrama walk, visits to Siddhanath Temple ruins and Govindeshwar Cave, and a private sunset boat ride to Narmada-Kaveri Sangam.', 'Multi-day stays provide adequate time to explore the island''s 10th-century Parmar-era architecture, spiritual caves, and peaceful river vistas at a relaxed pace. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:2', 'omkareshwar', 'Expand into a Malwa Sacred Heritage Circuit combining Omkareshwar + Maheshwar (fort & ghats) + Mandu (Afghani architecture) or adding an extension to Ujjain Mahakaleshwar.', 'Extended durations allow seamless travel along the scenic Narmada river corridor without repeating local island sightseeing. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:3', 'omkareshwar', 'Combine Omkareshwar Temple + Mamleshwar Temple + Jhula Pul Bridges + Nagar Ghat Aarti + Narmada River boat ride.', 'Delivers the essential dual-Jyotirlinga experience, iconic suspension bridge photography, and immersive spiritual riverfront atmosphere. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:4', 'omkareshwar', 'Book a riverfront suite at MP Tourism Narmada Resort, arrange a private sunset motorboat charter to Narmada-Kaveri Sangam, and plan quiet evening walks along Ahilya Ghat.', 'Offers secluded river vistas, scenic golden-hour boating, and a serene atmosphere away from crowded temple queues. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:5', 'omkareshwar', 'Select hotels with easy step-free bridge access, include a Narmada motorboat ride, walk across the Jhula Pul suspension bridge, and schedule afternoon rest breaks.', 'Keeps children engaged with boat transfers and suspension bridge views while managing physical exertion on steep stone stairs. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:6', 'omkareshwar', 'Stay at top-tier riverfront properties or premium 5-star hotels in Indore (80 km away), charter private AC SUVs, arrange VIP temple darshan assistance, and hire private motorboats.', 'Omkareshwar is a modest pilgrimage town; high-end luxury travelers benefit from private transfers, curated boat charters, and VIP queue management. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:7', 'omkareshwar', 'Stay in dharamshalas or budget guest houses near Mamleshwar Setu, utilize free public temple queues, walk the pedestrian bridges, and enjoy local Malwa street food (Poha-Jalebi).', 'Baseline costs for temple entry, ghat access, and walking trails are free, making it exceptionally budget-friendly. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:8', 'omkareshwar', 'Complete the 7 km Omkar Parvat Parikrama trek during early morning hours, visiting hillside shrines like Gauri Somnath and Siddhanath.', 'Navigating the OM-shaped island on foot provides an authentic pilgrimage experience with panoramic views of the Narmada River. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:9', 'omkareshwar', 'Prioritize Siddhanath Temple ruins, 24 Avatars group of temples, and Govindeshwar Cave.', 'Showcases exceptional 10th-century Parmar stone carving, intricate elephant friezes, and Adi Shankaracharya''s historical monk heritage. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:10', 'omkareshwar', 'Route movement via Mamleshwar Setu or motorboats, prioritize Mamleshwar Temple on the south bank (fewer stairs), and schedule early morning temple visits.', 'Reduces physical strain from climbing steep, uneven stone staircases leading to upper island shrines. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:11', 'omkareshwar', 'Schedule outdoor activities, temple visits, and the 7 km Parikrama trek during pleasant, sunny mornings and afternoons.', 'Daytime temperatures (12°C–28°C) are ideal for walking open stone trails and taking river cruises. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:12', 'omkareshwar', 'Plan temple darshans and ghat visits strictly during early morning (6:00 AM – 9:00 AM) or late evening hours, avoiding midday sun.', 'Extreme heat (38°C–42°C) makes walking on open stone steps and unshaded hill trails uncomfortably hot. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:13', 'omkareshwar', 'Verify Narmada River water levels and dam release status, carry non-slip footwear for wet stone ghats, and plan for heavy festival crowds during the sacred Shravan month.', 'Heavy rain enriches surrounding hill scenery, but swollen river currents can temporarily suspend boat operations. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:14', 'omkareshwar', 'Capture golden-hour vistas from Jhula Pul suspension bridge, detailed stone carvings at Siddhanath Temple, and the evening Aarti reflection at Nagar Ghat.', 'Combines dramatic river landscapes, historic temple geometry, and vibrant devotional cultural moments. ---'),
  ('omkareshwar:rule:15', 'omkareshwar', 'Route ground travel as Indore → Ujjain → Omkareshwar → Maheshwar → Mandu → Indore.', 'Optimizes regional highway connectivity along NH 347BG and state corridors without backtracking. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:0', 'raipur', 'Focus strictly on the Core City Cultural Circuit (Mahant Ghasidas Memorial Museum + Dudhadhari Math + Swami Vivekananda Sarovar), enjoy a Chhattisgarhi snack break at Gadh Kaleva, and end with an evening walk along Telibandha Lake (Marine Drive).', 'Allows first-time visitors and transit travelers to experience Raipur''s primary historical, spiritual, and regional culinary highlights without rushing. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:1', 'raipur', 'Build a complete Raipur & Naya Raipur Heritage & Nature Itinerary combining Purkhauti Muktangan, an open-gypsy safari at Nandan Van Jungle Safari, shopping for Dhokra metalware at Pandri or Sadar Bazaar, and evening light shows at Naya Raipur Central Park.', 'Multi-day stays provide adequate time to explore the planned capital’s open-air tribal art museum, urban wildlife, and artisan markets at a comfortable pace. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:2', 'raipur', 'Expand into a Central Chhattisgarh Regional Circuit combining Raipur + Sirpur Archaeological Site (84 km) + Barnawapara Wildlife Sanctuary (95 km) or adding day trips to Ghatarani & Jatmai Waterfalls.', 'Extended durations allow seamless exploration of 7th-century brick architecture, dense teak forest safaris, and natural waterfall escapes beyond the urban core. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:3', 'raipur', 'Combine Mahant Ghasidas Memorial Museum + Purkhauti Muktangan + Nandan Van Jungle Safari + Dudhadhari Math + Gadh Kaleva.', 'Delivers the quintessential introduction to Chhattisgarhi tribal art, ancient Kalachuri heritage, local wildlife, and authentic regional gastronomy. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:4', 'raipur', 'Stay at a 5-star luxury resort in Naya Raipur (e.g., Mayfair Lake Resort or Courtyard by Marriott), arrange a private evening sunset stroll at Telibandha Lake, and take a romantic nature day trip to Jatmai & Ghatarani Waterfalls.', 'Offers tranquil lake views, premium spa facilities, serene waterfall scenery, and peaceful atmosphere away from city traffic. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:5', 'raipur', 'Include Nandan Van Jungle Safari, interactive exhibits at Chhattisgarh Science Centre, toy train rides at Energy Park (Urja Park), and water fun at MM Fun City.', 'Keeps children engaged with live animal safaris, hands-on science displays, solar-powered rides, and recreational water slides. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:6', 'raipur', 'Stay at flagship 5-star properties in Naya Raipur or Central Raipur, charter private AC SUVs, arrange VIP guided tours at Sirpur and Purkhauti Muktangan, and enjoy curated fine-dining Chhattisgarhi tasting menus.', 'Ensures high-end comfort, expert historical commentary, smooth transit logistics, and exclusive cultural dining experiences. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:7', 'raipur', 'Stay near Raipur Junction Railway Station or GE Road, utilize local auto-rickshaws and city buses, explore free/low-cost public parks and lake promenades, and dine at local eateries for affordable Chhattisgarhi Thalis.', 'Baseline entry fees for state museums, public parks, and local street food are exceptionally low, making Raipur very budget-friendly. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:8', 'raipur', 'Dedicate extended time to Purkhauti Muktangan, state handicraft emporiums (Shabari / Sanjhi), and local artisan markets in Pandri and Sadar Bazaar.', 'Showcases world-famous Chhattisgarhi Bell Metal (Dhokra) casting, terracotta sculptures, wood carvings, and handloom Kosa silk textiles. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:9', 'raipur', 'Prioritize a day trip to Sirpur to examine the 7th-century Laxman Temple, Surang Tila, and ancient Buddhist Monasteries, paired with the Mahant Ghasidas Memorial Museum in Raipur.', 'Highlights rare red-brick temple architecture, anti-seismic ancient engineering, and rich Kalachuri-era stone inscriptions. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:10', 'raipur', 'Focus on paved, level attractions like Swami Vivekananda Sarovar, Naya Raipur Central Park, and Dudhadhari Math, utilizing private AC cars for all point-to-point transfers.', 'Minimizes physical fatigue and avoids steep steps while offering peaceful lake views, accessible temple grounds, and comfortable transit. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:11', 'raipur', 'Schedule open-air activities, such as exploring Purkhauti Muktangan, open-top jungle safaris, and Sirpur archaeological walks, throughout sunny mornings and afternoons.', 'Daytime temperatures (13°C–28°C) are ideal for walking expansive open-air museum grounds and taking nature drives. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:12', 'raipur', 'Schedule outdoor sightseeings strictly during early mornings (6:30 AM – 9:30 AM) or late evenings, reserving afternoons for indoor museum galleries, AC malls, or hotel relaxation.', 'Midday heat (39°C–42°C) makes walking along open stone ruins and unshaded parks physically uncomfortable. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:13', 'raipur', 'Plan day excursions to Ghatarani and Jatmai Waterfalls, carry rain gear for city parks, and confirm track accessibility before heading to Barnawapara Wildlife Sanctuary.', 'Heavy monsoon rains revive regional waterfalls and forest canopy, though deep forest safari tracks may experience seasonal closures. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:14', 'raipur', 'Capture life-sized tribal relief murals at Purkhauti Muktangan, lit night vistas at Telibandha Lake, ancient brick relief at Laxman Temple (Sirpur), and wildlife during Nandan Van Safaris.', 'Combines vibrant folk-art geometry, modern urban light reflections, ancient temple textures, and central Indian fauna. ---'),
  ('raipur:rule:15', 'raipur', 'Route ground travel as Raipur → Sirpur → Barnawapara → Bilaspur → Kanger Valley / Jagdalpur (Bastar) → Raipur.', 'Optimizes highway connectivity along NH 53 and NH 30 for a comprehensive Central-to-South Chhattisgarh exploration without backtracking. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:0', 'puri', 'prioritize_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_IF_ELIGIBLE + BADA_DANDA + PURI_BEACH AND: include_GOLDEN_BEACH_OR_ONE_ODIA_FOOD_EXPERIENCE_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Very short Puri stays gain the greatest destination value from its Jagannath pilgrimage identity, sacred-city atmosphere and Bay of Bengal coastline. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:1', 'puri', 'prioritize_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE + BADA_DANDA + PURI_BEACH + GOLDEN_BEACH + RAGHURAJPUR AND: add_KONARK + CHANDRABHAGA_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'This creates the strongest balanced introduction to Puri through pilgrimage, beach, crafts, Kalinga architecture and Odia culture. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:2', 'puri', 'prefer_JAGANNATH_AND_LOCAL_PILGRIMAGE + BEACHES + RAGHURAJPUR + KONARK_CHANDRABHAGA AND: add_SATAPADA_CHILIKA + RAMACHANDI + RELAXED_BEACH_TIME', 'Longer stays should move beyond central Puri into Odisha''s internationally important heritage, crafts, lagoon ecology and coastal landscapes. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:3', 'puri', 'consider_PURI + KONARK + CHILIKA + BHUBANESWAR_OR_WIDER_ODISHA', 'Puri has substantial pilgrimage and coastal appeal, but longer Odisha itineraries become stronger when combined with major regional heritage, nature and cultural destinations. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:4', 'puri', 'prefer_PREMIUM_SEAFRONT_HOTEL + PRIVATE_BHUBANESWAR_AIRPORT_TRANSFER + GOLDEN_BEACH AND: increase_MARINE_DRIVE + CHANDRABHAGA + PRIVATE_KONARK_EXCURSION + SPA + DINING + FREE_TIME', 'Puri works best for honeymooners as a relaxed coastal and cultural break rather than as a secluded luxury-resort destination. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:5', 'puri', 'prioritize_PURI_BEACH + GOLDEN_BEACH + RAGHURAJPUR + KONARK AND: include_SHORT_PILGRIMAGE_BLOCK + CHILIKA_IF_CHILDREN_ENJOY_BOATING_AND_NATURE AND: reduce_PEAK_HEAT + LONG_TEMPLE_QUEUES + EXCESSIVE_ROAD_TRIPS', 'Families generally enjoy Puri most when pilgrimage and heritage are balanced with beach, crafts, nature and recreational experiences. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:6', 'puri', 'prefer_SHORT_SIGHTSEEING_BLOCKS + CAB + GOLDEN_BEACH + RAGHURAJPUR + RESORT_BREAKS AND: include_PURI_BEACH + SAND_ART + SHORT_KONARK_VISIT_IF_SUITABLE AND: reduce_RATH_YATRA_CROWDS + LONG_DARSHAN_QUEUES + MIDDAY_SUMMER_BEACH_ACTIVITY', 'Young children benefit from visual, recreational and craft-based experiences more than from continuous temple and heritage scheduling. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:7', 'puri', 'prefer_PREMIUM_SEAFRONT_RESORT_OR_FIVE_STAR_STYLE_HOTEL AND: increase_CHAUFFEURED_CAR + PRIVATE_CULTURAL_GUIDE + CURATED_KONARK + RAGHURAJPUR + PREMIUM_CHILIKA_EXCURSION + SPA + DINING', 'Puri luxury travel is strongest through sea-facing accommodation, private transport, expert cultural interpretation and curated regional excursions. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:8', 'puri', 'prefer_CENTRAL_BUDGET_HOTEL_OR_DHARMASHALA + AUTO_E_RICKSHAW + LOCAL_BUS + SELECTIVE_CAB AND: balance_PAID_EXCURSIONS_WITH_JAGANNATH_AREA + PURI_BEACH + LOCAL_FOOD + MARKETS', 'Puri is highly suitable for budget travelers because pilgrimage areas, public beaches, inexpensive food and broad accommodation choices provide considerable value. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:9', 'puri', 'prioritize_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE + BADA_DANDA AND: include_GUNDICHA_TEMPLE + NARENDRA_TANK + LOKANATH_TEMPLE + SELECTED_SACRED_SITES', 'Puri''s primary cultural identity is inseparable from the Jagannath tradition, associated rituals, sacred geography and major annual festivals. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:10', 'puri', 'verify_CURRENT_DARSHAN_RULES + RELIGIOUS_ENTRY_ELIGIBILITY + SECURITY_RESTRICTIONS AND: allocate_SUFFICIENT_QUEUE_AND_SECURITY_TIME AND: deposit_MOBILE_PHONE + CAMERA + PROHIBITED_ELECTRONICS_BEFORE_ENTRY', 'Shree Jagannath Temple is a functioning pilgrimage institution rather than a conventional tourist monument, and current visitor procedures must shape itinerary planning. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:11', 'puri', 'do_not_position_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_INTERIOR_ENTRY_AS_AVAILABLE AND: replace_WITH_BADA_DANDA + EXTERIOR_TEMPLE_CONTEXT + GUNDICHA + RAGHURAJPUR + BEACH + KONARK', 'Official Odisha Tourism itineraries state that non-Hindus are not permitted inside Shree Jagannath Temple. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:12', 'puri', 'combine_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_CONTEXT + BADA_DANDA + GUNDICHA_TEMPLE + NARENDRA_TANK AND: include_MAHAPRASAD + RAGHURAJPUR_PATTACHITRA', 'Jagannath culture extends beyond the principal temple into festivals, sacred routes, food traditions and visual arts. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:13', 'puri', 'prioritize_BADA_DANDA + JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_CONTEXT + GUNDICHA_TEMPLE + FESTIVAL_PROCESSION AND: book_HOTELS + TRANSPORT + GUIDED_ASSISTANCE_EARLY AND: expect_EXTREME_CROWDING + ROAD_RESTRICTIONS + LONG_WALKING + SECURITY_CONTROLS', 'Rath Yatra transforms Puri into one of India''s largest religious gathering environments, with the deities travelling from Shree Jagannath Temple toward Gundicha Temple. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:14', 'puri', 'reduce_GENERAL_SIGHTSEEING AND: increase_FESTIVAL_LOGISTICS + CROWD_BUFFER + WALKING_BUFFER + HOTEL_PROXIMITY_PLANNING AND: avoid_TIGHT_TRAIN_FLIGHT_CONNECTIONS_AFTER_MAJOR_PROCESSIONS', 'Festival-day movement can differ radically from normal Puri traffic and sightseeing conditions. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:15', 'puri', 'prioritize_AUTHENTIC_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_FOOD_CONTEXT AND: include_ANAND_BAZAAR_WHERE_CURRENT_ACCESS_AND_PROCEDURES_ALLOW', 'Mahaprasad is a central component of Puri''s Jagannath pilgrimage and culinary identity rather than merely another restaurant meal. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:16', 'puri', 'prioritize_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_CONTEXT + KONARK_SUN_TEMPLE AND: include_SELECTED_LOCAL_TEMPLES + GUNDICHA + LOKANATH', 'The Puri region provides a powerful introduction to Odisha''s Kalinga architectural traditions across living pilgrimage and monumental heritage environments. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:17', 'puri', 'prioritize_KONARK_SUN_TEMPLE AND: allocate_DEDICATED_INTERPRETATION_AND_WALKING_TIME AND: combine_CHANDRABHAGA_IF_SCHEDULE_ALLOWS', 'UNESCO recognizes the 13th-century Sun Temple at Konark as an exceptional culmination of Kalinga temple architecture and monumental sculptural art. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:18', 'puri', 'allocate_HALF_DAY AND: combine_WITH_CHANDRABHAGA + RAMACHANDI_OR_MARINE_DRIVE AND: avoid_TREATING_AS_QUICK_PHOTO_STOP', 'Konark''s architectural scale, sculpture and UNESCO significance justify considerably more time than a brief roadside visit. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:19', 'puri', 'combine_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_CONTEXT + KONARK + GUNDICHA + SELECTED_OLD_PURI_TEMPLES', 'Puri and its surrounding region provide an unusually strong living-to-monumental narrative of Odisha''s religious and Kalinga architectural heritage. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:20', 'puri', 'prioritize_RAGHURAJPUR AND: include_PATTACHITRA + PALM_LEAF_ENGRAVING + ARTISAN_HOMES + GOTIPUA_CONTEXT', 'Raghurajpur is Odisha''s best-known heritage crafts village and contains a dense community of artists associated particularly with Pattachitra. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:21', 'puri', 'allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS_WITH_TRANSFERS AND: prefer_DIRECT_ARTISAN_INTERACTION + QUALITY_CRAFT_PURCHASES AND: do_not_treat_AS_ONLY_SOUVENIR_MARKET', 'Raghurajpur lies roughly 12 km from Puri and offers living craft traditions, artist households, palm-leaf work and Gotipua heritage. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:22', 'puri', 'prioritize_RAGHURAJPUR_ARTISAN_HOMES AND: include_CLOTH_PAINTING + PALM_LEAF_ART + JAGANNATH_ICONOGRAPHY', 'Raghurajpur''s Pattachitra tradition is closely connected with the Jagannath cult and represents one of Odisha''s defining visual-art traditions. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:23', 'puri', 'prioritize_PURI_BEACH + GOLDEN_BEACH AND: include_CHANDRABHAGA_OR_BALIGHAI_IF_QUIETER_COASTAL_SCENERY_IS_DESIRED AND: prefer_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON + EVENING', 'Puri provides several different beach environments, ranging from highly active pilgrimage-town beachfronts to managed and quieter coastal stretches. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:24', 'puri', 'prefer_SUNRISE_OR_EVENING AND: include_BEACH_WALK + MARKET + LOCAL_FOOD AND: follow_NULIA_OR_LIFEGUARD_GUIDANCE_BEFORE_ENTERING_SEA', 'Odisha Tourism specifically recommends lifeguard assistance before sea bathing and highlights dawn as one of the strongest beach experiences. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:25', 'puri', 'prioritize_RELAXED_WALKING + FAMILY_BEACH_TIME + SUNRISE + MANAGED_BEACH_ENVIRONMENT', 'Golden Beach has been developed around higher standards of cleanliness, environmental management, visitor facilities and beach safety. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:26', 'puri', 'verify_CURRENT_SURF + WEATHER + LIFEGUARD_GUIDANCE AND: use_DESIGNATED_OR_MANAGED_BATHING_AREAS AND: do_not_assume_CALM_APPEARANCE_EQUALS_SAFE_SEA', 'Bay of Bengal conditions vary, and official tourism guidance recommends taking assistance from Nulia lifeguards before entering the water. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:27', 'puri', 'consider_MARINE_DRIVE + RAMACHANDI + CHANDRABHAGA AND: verify_CURRENT_OPERATOR + WEATHER + SEA_CONDITION + SAFETY_EQUIPMENT', 'Odisha Tourism identifies kayaking, surfing, jet skiing, boating and other water activities along portions of the Puri–Konark coastal corridor. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:28', 'puri', 'prioritize_WATER_SPORTS + BOATING + BEACH_WALKS + CHILIKA_CRUISE + MARINE_DRIVE', 'Puri is better positioned for soft coastal recreation than for high-adrenaline adventure tourism. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:29', 'puri', 'prioritize_SATAPADA AND: allocate_HALF_DAY_TO_FULL_DAY AND: include_BOAT_CRUISE + DOLPHIN_ZONE + SEA_MOUTH_IF_CURRENT_ROUTE_ALLOWS', 'Satapada is positioned on the south-eastern side of Chilika Lagoon and is one of the principal visitor bases for Irrawaddy dolphin and sea-mouth excursions. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:30', 'puri', 'choose_SATAPADA_CHILIKA AND: treat_SIGHTING_AS_WILDLIFE_OPPORTUNITY_NOT_GUARANTEE AND: avoid_PROMISING_FULL_CLOSE_RANGE_DOLPHIN_VIEWS', 'The Chilika Development Authority notes that Irrawaddy dolphins are shy and often only portions of the head, back or tail are visible. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:31', 'puri', 'increase_CHILIKA_WETLAND_TIME AND: match_ITINERARY_TO_CURRENT_SEASON + LOCAL_BIRD_ACTIVITY', 'Chilika Lagoon is one of Odisha''s major wetland ecosystems and adds substantial nature depth to an otherwise pilgrimage-and-beach-focused Puri itinerary. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:32', 'puri', 'combine_PURI + RAMACHANDI + CHANDRABHAGA + KONARK AND: allocate_PHOTOGRAPHY_AND_BEACH_STOPS', 'The Puri–Konark coastal road provides one of the strongest geographically coherent scenic day routes from Puri. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:33', 'puri', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING_OR_LATE_AFTERNOON AND: combine_WITH_KONARK AND: follow_LIFEGUARD_AND_SEA_SAFETY_GUIDANCE', 'Chandrabhaga provides a scenic coastal complement to Konark and supports beach, sunrise, photography and selected water-sport experiences. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:34', 'puri', 'combine_WITH_MARINE_DRIVE + KONARK_OR_CHANDRABHAGA AND: include_RIVER_MOUTH + TEMPLE + COASTAL_RECREATION', 'Ramachandi lies on the Kushabhadra river-mouth landscape along the Puri–Konark road and works best as part of the coastal excursion rather than a separate long transfer. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:35', 'puri', 'prioritize_BADA_DANDA + PURI_BEACH_SUNRISE + RAGHURAJPUR + KONARK + CHANDRABHAGA AND: include_GOLDEN_BEACH + MARINE_DRIVE + FESTIVAL_CONTEXT_WHERE_RELEVANT AND: respect_TEMPLE_PHOTOGRAPHY_AND_ELECTRONIC_RESTRICTIONS', 'Puri offers highly diverse photography through sacred streets, chariot-festival culture, crafts, monumental sculpture and coastal landscapes. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:36', 'puri', 'prefer_BADA_DANDA + OLD_PURI + RAGHURAJPUR + BEACH_MARKETS AND: respect_RELIGIOUS_RITUALS + PEOPLE_PHOTOGRAPHY + ARTISAN_PERMISSION', 'Puri''s strongest cultural photography comes from functioning religious and residential environments rather than staged tourist settings. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:37', 'puri', 'prefer_MAHAPRASAD + TRADITIONAL_ODIA_RESTAURANTS + LOCAL_SWEETS + SEAFOOD AND: include_DALMA + KHAJA + CHHENA_BASED_SWEETS + SEASONAL_ODIA_DISHES', 'Puri''s culinary identity combines Jagannath temple-food traditions with distinctive Odia cooking and Bay of Bengal seafood. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:38', 'puri', 'prioritize_MAHAPRASAD + ODIA_VEGETARIAN_THALI + DALMA + BESARA + KHATTA + KHAJA AND: do_not_assume_SEAFOOD_IS_REQUIRED_FOR_COMPLETE_PURI_FOOD_EXPERIENCE', 'Sacred vegetarian food traditions form one of Puri''s most culturally important culinary experiences. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:39', 'puri', 'prefer_REPUTABLE_COASTAL_RESTAURANTS + FRESH_LOCAL_PREPARATIONS AND: balance_WITH_ONE_TRADITIONAL_ODIA_OR_MAHAPRASAD_EXPERIENCE', 'Seafood is an important coastal component of Puri dining but should complement rather than replace its distinctive temple and Odia food traditions. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:40', 'puri', 'prioritize_RAGHURAJPUR + BADA_DANDA + SWARGADWAR_MARKET AND: include_GOVERNMENT_OR_REPUTABLE_HANDICRAFT_OUTLET_FOR_HIGHER_VALUE_PURCHASES', 'Puri shopping is strongest when religious souvenirs and beach markets are combined with authentic Odisha arts and handicrafts. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:41', 'puri', 'prefer_RAGHURAJPUR + SELECTED_REPUTABLE_ODISHA_HANDICRAFT_STORES AND: include_PATTACHITRA + PALM_LEAF_ART + WOODCRAFT + STONECRAFT + HANDLOOM', 'The Puri region provides direct access to some of Odisha''s most recognizable traditional craft forms. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:42', 'puri', 'prefer_PURI_BEACH + SWARGADWAR + BEACHFRONT_HOTELS + SELECTED_CAFES_AND_RESTAURANTS AND: focus_ON_BEACH_WALKS + DINING + MARKETS + HOTEL_SOCIAL_SPACES AND: do_not_position_PURI_AS_MAJOR_CLUBBING_DESTINATION', 'Puri''s evening identity is stronger through beachfront activity, dining, pilgrimage atmosphere and markets than conventional metropolitan nightlife. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:43', 'puri', 'choose_SEAFRONT_OR_QUIETER_BEACH_HOTEL AND: combine_GOLDEN_BEACH + SUNRISE + SPA + LIGHT_SIGHTSEEING + FREE_TIME', 'Puri supports excellent coastal relaxation when pilgrimage, road excursions and temple queues are not scheduled continuously. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:44', 'puri', 'prefer_ONE_PURI_HOTEL_BASE AND: avoid_UNNECESSARY_HOTEL_CHANGES_BETWEEN_TEMPLE_AND_BEACH_AREAS', 'Most central attractions plus Raghurajpur, Konark and Chilika can be covered efficiently from one appropriately located Puri base. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:45', 'puri', 'prefer_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_OR_BADA_DANDA_ACCESS AND: verify_VEHICLE_DROP_POINT + WALKING_DISTANCE + FESTIVAL_TRAFFIC_RESTRICTIONS', 'Temple-focused travelers benefit from reducing repeated travel to Puri''s sacred core, particularly during high-demand pilgrimage periods. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:46', 'puri', 'prefer_PURIBEACH_GOLDENBEACH_OR_CHAKRA_TIRTHA_SEAFRONT AND: verify_ACTUAL_SEA_VIEW + BEACH_ACCESS + ROAD_NOISE + SWIMMING_CONDITIONS', 'A sea-facing address can significantly strengthen Puri''s relaxation value, but beachfront quality and access vary by exact property. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:47', 'puri', 'prefer_PREMIUM_SEAFRONT_RESORT_OR_HIGH_END_HOTEL AND: retain_PRIVATE_CAR_FOR_RAGHURAJPUR + KONARK + CHILIKA', 'Puri''s premium travel experience depends strongly on accommodation quality, sea access and efficient private regional touring. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:48', 'puri', 'prefer_MODERN_BEACH_OR_CENTRAL_HOTEL AND: verify_FAMILY_ROOM + ELEVATOR + BREAKFAST + AIR_CONDITIONING + POOL_IF_REQUIRED + VEHICLE_ACCESS', 'Families generally benefit more from modern facilities and straightforward road access than from choosing accommodation solely for pilgrimage atmosphere. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:49', 'puri', 'choose_PREBOOKED_CAB + TAXI + PRIVATE_CAR_OR_HOTEL_TRANSFER ACCORDING_TO: TRAVELER_COUNT + LUGGAGE + HOTEL_LOCATION + ARRIVAL_TIME', 'Puri does not have a commercial airport; Biju Patnaik International Airport in Bhubaneswar, roughly 60 km away, is its primary aviation gateway. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:50', 'puri', 'choose_AUTO + E_RICKSHAW + LOCAL_CAB_OR_HOTEL_TRANSFER ACCORDING_TO: HOTEL_LOCATION + LUGGAGE + MOBILITY', 'Puri Railway Station serves the city directly, making rail particularly convenient for travelers arriving from major Indian cities. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:51', 'puri', 'prefer_AUTO_E_RICKSHAW_OR_CAB_WHEN_HEAT_OR_MOBILITY_IS_A_CONCERN AND: allow_WALKING_ONLY_IF_DISTANCE + WEATHER + CROWD_CONDITIONS_ARE_SUITABLE', 'Central Puri is relatively compact, but heat, pilgrimage crowds and luggage or mobility considerations can make short road transfers preferable. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:52', 'puri', 'prefer_AUTO_CAB_OR_PRIVATE_CAR AND: allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS_TOTAL_VISIT_WINDOW', 'Raghurajpur lies approximately 12 km from Puri and is best treated as a dedicated cultural excursion rather than a central-city walking attraction. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:53', 'puri', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR + TAXI + TOURIST_BUS_WHERE_SUITABLE AND: combine_RAMACHANDI + CHANDRABHAGA + MARINE_DRIVE', 'The coastal route becomes considerably more valuable when the journey itself is treated as part of the sightseeing experience. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:54', 'puri', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR_OR_STRUCTURED_TOUR AND: allocate_HALF_DAY_TO_FULL_DAY', 'Satapada is a substantial excursion from central Puri and should include adequate road, boat and weather buffer rather than being treated as a short local transfer. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:55', 'puri', 'prefer_ACCESSIBLE_MODERN_HOTEL + PRIVATE_CAR + SHORT_TEMPLE_AND_BEACH_BLOCKS AND: reduce_LONG_QUEUES + HEAVY_FESTIVAL_CROWDS + DEEP_SAND_WALKING + MIDDAY_HEAT', 'Puri can work well for senior pilgrims and leisure travelers, but dense temple crowds, beach sand and prolonged standing can significantly increase physical strain. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:56', 'puri', 'prioritize_EARLY_TEMPLE_VISIT + EARLY_BEACH + AIR_CONDITIONED_HOTEL_BREAK + EVENING_MARKETS AND: shift_RAGHURAJPUR + COASTAL_WALKS_TO_COOLER_PERIODS_WHERE_POSSIBLE AND: reduce_MIDDAY_KONARK + BEACH + LONG_WALKING', 'Puri''s coastal climate becomes hot and humid through the summer period, reducing comfort during exposed daytime sightseeing. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:57', 'puri', 'increase_TEMPLE_CONTEXT + FOOD + SHOPPING + HOTEL_RELAXATION + FLEXIBLE_SHORT_SIGHTSEEING AND: reduce_TIGHTLY_TIMED_BEACH + WATER_SPORT + CHILIKA + OUTDOOR_PHOTOGRAPHY_PLANS AND: allow_ROAD + RAIN + SEA_CONDITION_BUFFER', 'Puri experiences heavy seasonal rainfall and humid coastal conditions, particularly during the monsoon period. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:58', 'puri', 'cancel_OR_REASSESS_BEACH + BOATING + WATER_SPORTS + CHILIKA_EXCURSIONS AND: follow_IMD + DISTRICT_ADMINISTRATION + HOTEL + LOCAL_AUTHORITY_GUIDANCE', 'Puri''s Bay of Bengal location exposes the district to cyclonic storms, strong winds, heavy rain and associated coastal disruption. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:59', 'puri', 'increase_PURI_BEACH + KONARK + RAGHURAJPUR + CHILIKA + WALKING + MARINE_DRIVE', 'Official Puri district guidance identifies October through April as the strongest general travel period because winters are more pleasant than the hot, humid summer and wet monsoon months. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:60', 'puri', 'prioritize_JAGANNATH_TEMPLE_IF_ELIGIBLE + BADA_DANDA + PURI_BEACH + RAGHURAJPUR AND: add_KONARK + CHANDRABHAGA_IF_TRIP_LENGTH_ALLOWS', 'This provides the strongest first introduction to Puri through Jagannath pilgrimage, coastline, Odia visual culture and Kalinga architectural heritage. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:61', 'puri', 'allocate_40_TO_50_PERCENT_TO_JAGANNATH + LOCAL_SACRED_SITES AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_BEACH + FOOD + RAGHURAJPUR + FREE_TIME', 'Puri becomes considerably more comfortable when temple queues and pilgrimage activity are balanced with slower coastal experiences. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:62', 'puri', 'allocate_30_TO_40_PERCENT_TO_JAGANNATH_CONTEXT + KONARK AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_BEACH + RAGHURAJPUR + CHILIKA + FOOD + FREE_TIME', 'Families generally enjoy Puri most when religious and monumental heritage is balanced with crafts, beach recreation and nature. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:63', 'puri', 'prioritize_JAGANNATH_CONTEXT + KONARK AND: include_RAGHURAJPUR + PATTACHITRA + GUNDICHA_OR_OLD_PURI', 'Puri''s greatest cultural strength comes from connecting living Jagannath traditions, monumental Kalinga architecture and Odisha''s craft heritage. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:64', 'puri', 'use_PURI_AS_PRIMARY_HOTEL_BASE AND: combine_RAMACHANDI + CHANDRABHAGA + KONARK_AS_ONE_COASTAL_EXCURSION', 'Puri provides the stronger hotel and pilgrimage base, while the Konark corridor forms a geographically efficient heritage-and-coast day trip. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:65', 'puri', 'use_PURI_AS_PRIMARY_HOTEL_BASE AND: allocate_SEPARATE_SATAPADA_HALF_OR_FULL_DAY AND: do_not_combine_WITH_FULL_KONARK_DAY_UNLESS_ITINERARY_IS_INTENTIONALLY_FAST_PACED', 'Satapada requires meaningful road and boat time, so combining it casually with the Konark corridor usually weakens both experiences. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:66', 'puri', 'use_PURI_FOR_PILGRIMAGE + BEACH + KONARK_OR_RAGHURAJPUR AND: use_BHUBANESWAR_FOR_AIRPORT + URBAN_HOTELS + MAJOR_TEMPLE_AND_MUSEUM_SIGHTSEEING', 'Puri and Bhubaneswar complement each other well and form the core of Odisha''s most established heritage and pilgrimage touring circuits. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:67', 'puri', 'combine_BHUBANESWAR + PURI + KONARK AND: add_DHAULI + PIPILI + RAGHURAJPUR_WHERE_TRIP_LENGTH_ALLOWS', 'Official Odisha Tourism itineraries repeatedly combine Bhubaneswar, Puri and Konark, often adding Odisha''s craft, Buddhist and coastal attractions along the route. ---'),
  ('puri:rule:68', 'puri', 'use_PURI_AS_JAGANNATH_AND_COASTAL_BASE AND: continue_TO_BHUBANESWAR + KONARK + RAGHURAJPUR + PIPILI + CHILIKA_OR_OTHER_REGIONAL_DESTINATIONS', 'Puri is one of Odisha''s strongest gateways because its pilgrimage, art, food, coastline and road connections integrate naturally with the state''s wider cultural circuit. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:0', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_NATURE_PARK + HILL_VIEW_POINT + PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN AND: include_SUNSET_POINT_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Very short Daringbadi stays gain the greatest value from its immediately accessible forests, plantations and hill scenery. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:1', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_NATURE_PARK + HILL_VIEW_POINT + PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + DOLURI_RIVER + LOVERS_POINT + DARINGBADI_WATERFALL AND: retain_ONE_RELAXED_EVENING', 'Odisha Tourism''s own standard Daringbadi itineraries use a 2-night / 3-day structure around these principal local attractions. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:2', 'daringbadi', 'add_MANDASARU AND: consider_PUTUDI_IF_ROUTE_AND_DRIVE_TIME_ARE_SUITABLE', 'Longer stays can move beyond local sightseeing into Kandhamal''s deeper gorge, waterfall and forest landscapes. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:3', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_DARINGBADI + MANDASARU + ONE_WIDER_KANDHAMAL_EXCURSION AND: consider_BELGHAR_OR_PHULBANI_BASED_ROUTE', 'The broader Kandhamal region adds significantly more nature depth than repeatedly covering central Daringbadi. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:4', 'daringbadi', 'consider_DARINGBADI + MANDASARU + BELGHAR + PHULBANI_OR_JIRANG_CHANDRAGIRI', 'Daringbadi itself is compact enough that extended trips become stronger when converted into a wider southern Odisha circuit. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:5', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_VALLEY_OR_FOREST_RESORT + PRIVATE_CAR + PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + SUNSET_POINT AND: increase_LOVERS_POINT + SCENIC_DRIVES + RESORT_TIME + MANDASARU_IF_TRIP_LENGTH_ALLOWS', 'Daringbadi''s romantic strength comes from cool weather, forest scenery, privacy and relaxed pacing rather than luxury entertainment. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:6', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_NATURE_PARK + PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + VIEWPOINTS AND: include_WATERFALLS_WITH_SUPERVISION AND: reduce_LONG_REMOTE_ROAD_EXCURSIONS', 'Families benefit most from visual nature experiences, parks and short sightseeing blocks rather than continuous driving. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:7', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_NATURE_PARK + HILL_VIEW_POINT + PINE_FOREST + RESORT_BREAKS AND: include_COFFEE_GARDEN + EASY_RURAL_STOPS AND: reduce_SLIPPERY_WATERFALL_APPROACHES + LONG_FOREST_WALKS', 'Easy nature experiences are more suitable for young children than difficult waterfall and remote-forest terrain. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:8', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_BEST_AVAILABLE_PREMIUM_RESORT_OR_ECO_STAY AND: increase_CHAUFFEURED_SUV + PRIVATE_SIGHTSEEING + FLEXIBLE_MEALS + CURATED_MANDASARU_EXCURSION', 'Daringbadi luxury is primarily nature-based and service-driven rather than destination-scale five-star luxury. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:9', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_BUDGET_HOTEL_OR_HOMESTAY + LOCAL_FOOD + SHARED_TRANSPORT_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: use_ONE_CLUSTERED_SIGHTSEEING_VEHICLE_FOR_REMOTE_ATTRACTIONS', 'Accommodation and natural attractions can be inexpensive, but scattered sightseeing makes selective vehicle spending worthwhile. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:10', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + DOLURI_RIVER + WATERFALLS + VIEWPOINTS AND: add_MANDASARU_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Odisha Tourism primarily positions Daringbadi around forests, valleys, plantations, waterfalls and Eastern Ghats landscapes. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:11', 'daringbadi', 'allocate_RELAXED_WALKING_AND_PHOTOGRAPHY_TIME AND: combine_WITH_COFFEE_GARDEN', 'The pine landscape is one of Daringbadi''s defining visual experiences and works naturally with nearby plantation sightseeing. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:12', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_COFFEE_AND_PEPPER_GARDEN AND: include_PLANTATION_WALK + LOCAL_PRODUCE_CONTEXT AND: do_not_position_AS_LARGE_COMMERCIAL_COFFEE_ESTATE_TOUR', 'Coffee and pepper cultivation are important parts of Daringbadi''s tourism identity, but the experience is primarily scenic and agricultural. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:13', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_DARINGBADI_WATERFALL AND: consider_PUTUDI_ON_LONGER_KANDHAMAL_ITINERARY AND: verify_CURRENT_RAINFALL + ROAD + TRAIL_CONDITIONS', 'Waterfalls are a major regional strength but accessibility and flow vary seasonally. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:14', 'daringbadi', 'combine_WITH_DOLURI_RIVER + PINE_COFFEE_CORRIDOR_WHERE_ROUTING_ALLOWS AND: verify_ROAD_CONDITION', 'The river-and-rock landscape is strongest as part of a broader nature circuit rather than a standalone long transfer. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:15', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + SUNRISE_OR_SUNSET_VIEWPOINT + LOVERS_POINT + WATERFALLS AND: add_MANDASARU_FOR_WIDER_LANDSCAPE_PHOTOGRAPHY', 'Daringbadi''s strongest photography comes from forests, plantations, mist, valleys, rivers and Eastern Ghats scenery. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:16', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON AND: include_HILL_VIEW_POINT + SUNSET_POINT + MANDASARU_IF_AVAILABLE', 'Low-angle light and clearer hill visibility generally provide stronger landscape conditions than midday sightseeing. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:17', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_TREKKING + NATURE_WALKS + BIRDING + WATERFALL_EXPLORATION AND: consider_GUIDED_JUNGLE_EXPERIENCES_WHERE_OFFICIALLY_AVAILABLE', 'Odisha Tourism specifically positions trekking, bird watching and jungle-oriented experiences among Daringbadi''s activities. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:18', 'daringbadi', 'increase_FOREST_TRAILS + MANDASARU AND: verify_LOCAL_ROUTE + WEATHER + GUIDE_REQUIREMENT', 'Daringbadi and Mandasaru offer hilly forest terrain, but route conditions should shape trekking plans. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:19', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING_FOREST_AND_NATURE_CAMP_TIME AND: reduce_NOISY_GROUP_SIGHTSEEING', 'Official Odisha Tourism includes birding among the recommended nature activities around Daringbadi. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:20', 'daringbadi', 'allocate_HALF_DAY_TO_FULL_DAY AND: prioritize_GORGE_VIEWPOINTS + FOREST + NATURE_CAMP AND: avoid_COMBINING_WITH_TOO_MANY_LOCAL_DARINGBADI_STOPS', 'Mandasaru is a substantial gorge ecosystem surrounded by dense tropical moist deciduous forest and is promoted as the “Silent Valley of Odisha”. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:21', 'daringbadi', 'combine_WITH_PHULBANI_OR_WIDER_KANDHAMAL_ROUTE AND: allocate_ROAD_AND_WALKING_BUFFER', 'Putudi lies near Phulbani and features a roughly 60-ft Salunki River waterfall surrounded by dense forest. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:22', 'daringbadi', 'treat_AS_OFFBEAT_REGIONAL_EXTENSION AND: use_PRIVATE_OR_PREARRANGED_TRANSPORT AND: allow_LONGER_ROAD_BUFFER', 'Belghar belongs to the wider Daringbadi–Belghar forest and tribal-region tourism landscape rather than the compact local sightseeing loop. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:23', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_RESPECTFUL_COMMUNITY_CONTEXT + LOCAL_GUIDANCE AND: avoid_INTRUSIVE_PHOTOGRAPHY + STAGED_EXPECTATIONS', 'Official Odisha Tourism positions Daringbadi as a combination of nature, cultural and tribal tourism linked to the wider Kandhamal region. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:24', 'daringbadi', 'choose_FOREST_OR_VALLEY_RESORT AND: combine_SHORT_SIGHTSEEING + RESORT_TIME + COFFEE + SUNSET', 'Daringbadi''s strongest destination advantage is escaping dense urban environments for cool, green and relatively quiet surroundings. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:25', 'daringbadi', 'focus_ON_RESORT_DINNER + CAMPFIRE_WHERE_PERMITTED + QUIET_EVENING + STARGAZING AND: do_not_position_DARINGBADI_AS_BAR_OR_CLUB_DESTINATION', 'Daringbadi is fundamentally a nature and hill-station destination with limited conventional nightlife. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:26', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_LOCAL_COFFEE + PEPPER + TURMERIC + REGIONAL_PRODUCE AND: keep_EXPECTATIONS_MODEST', 'Shopping is a secondary activity and works best around local agricultural and regional products. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:27', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_ONE_DARINGBADI_HOTEL_OR_RESORT_BASE AND: avoid_UNNECESSARY_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'The main local attractions and Mandasaru can generally be handled through road excursions from one Daringbadi base. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:28', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_FOREST_OR_VALLEY_VIEW_PROPERTY AND: verify_PRIVACY + HOT_WATER + ROOM_HEATING_OR_WINTER_COMFORT + ROAD_ACCESS', 'Accommodation atmosphere and winter comfort materially affect a romantic Daringbadi stay. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:29', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_EASY_ROAD_ACCESS + PARKING + RESTAURANT + FAMILY_ROOM AND: verify_HOT_WATER + POWER_BACKUP + CHILD_SAFETY', 'Practical property facilities are more important than remote scenic positioning for many family travelers. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:30', 'daringbadi', 'consider_DARINGBADI_NATURE_CAMP + MANDASARU_NATURE_CAMP_OR_APPROVED_ECO_STAYS', 'Odisha Tourism officially positions nature camps as part of the forest-tourism experience around Daringbadi and Mandasaru. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:31', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_PREBOOKED_CAR_OR_STRUCTURED_TRANSFER AND: allocate_APPROX_4_HOURS_WITH_BUFFER', 'Official Odisha Tourism itineraries use Brahmapur as the principal rail arrival point and describe the road journey to Daringbadi at roughly 150 km / 4 hours. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:32', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR_OR_PREARRANGED_TRANSFER AND: treat_AS_LONG_ROAD_TRANSFER AND: keep_ARRIVAL_DAY_LIGHT', 'Official Odisha Tourism lists Bhubaneswar as Daringbadi''s nearest major airport gateway and places the destination roughly 248 km away by its tourism routing. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:33', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR + LOCAL_CAB_OR_SUV AND: group_ATTRACTIONS_GEOGRAPHICALLY', 'Daringbadi''s principal sights are spread across forest, plantation, river and waterfall locations rather than a walkable urban centre. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:34', 'daringbadi', 'use_PRIVATE_ROAD_TRANSPORT AND: allocate_HALF_DAY_TO_FULL_DAY AND: avoid_TIGHT_DEPARTURE_CONNECTIONS_AFTER_EXCURSION', 'Mandasaru is a dedicated regional nature excursion rather than a central Daringbadi attraction. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:35', 'daringbadi', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR + ROAD_ACCESSIBLE_VIEWPOINTS + NATURE_PARK + COFFEE_GARDEN AND: reduce_WATERFALL_DESCENTS + UNEVEN_RIVER_ROCKS + LONG_TRAILS', 'Daringbadi can work well for relaxed senior travel, but natural attraction terrain varies significantly. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:36', 'daringbadi', 'increase_VIEWPOINTS + PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + RESORT_STAY + PHOTOGRAPHY AND: pack_COLD_WEATHER_CLOTHING AND: do_not_guarantee_SNOWFALL', 'Daringbadi is famous for very cold winter conditions, but travel planning should position frost and cold mornings more conservatively than guaranteed snow. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:37', 'daringbadi', 'use_DARINGBADI_AS_COOLER_HILL_ESCAPE AND: prefer_MORNING + LATE_AFTERNOON_SIGHTSEEING AND: retain_MIDDAY_RESORT_BREAKS', 'Official sources explicitly position Daringbadi as a summer resort because its elevation keeps it cooler than much of lowland Odisha. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:38', 'daringbadi', 'increase_FOREST_SCENERY + WATERFALLS + RESORT_TIME AND: reduce_TIGHT_ROAD_SCHEDULES + DIFFICULT_TRAILS AND: verify_CURRENT_ROAD_AND_WATER_CONDITIONS', 'Rain strengthens Daringbadi''s greenery and waterfalls but also increases slippery terrain, cloud and road uncertainty. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:39', 'daringbadi', 'reassess_WATERFALLS + RIVER_EDGES + FOREST_TRAILS + REMOTE_ROADS AND: follow_DISTRICT_ADMINISTRATION + LOCAL_AUTHORITY + HOTEL_GUIDANCE', 'Natural sightseeing should remain secondary to road, river and weather safety during severe conditions. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:40', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + NATURE_PARK + HILL_VIEW_POINT AND: include_LOVERS_POINT + DARINGBADI_WATERFALL_IF_CONDITIONS_ALLOW', 'This provides the strongest first introduction to Daringbadi''s defining forests, plantations, valleys and water landscapes. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:41', 'daringbadi', 'allocate_50_TO_60_PERCENT_TO_LOCAL_NATURE_SIGHTSEEING AND: allocate_REMAINING_TIME_TO_RESORT + FOOD + SUNSET + FREE_TIME', 'Daringbadi becomes considerably more enjoyable when its landscapes are experienced slowly rather than through continuous road transfers. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:42', 'daringbadi', 'prioritize_NATURE_PARK + PINE_FOREST + COFFEE_GARDEN + VIEWPOINTS AND: include_ONE_EASY_WATERFALL_OR_RIVER_EXPERIENCE AND: retain_RESORT_BREAKS', 'Families generally enjoy Daringbadi most when scenic sightseeing is balanced with rest and short outdoor experiences. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:43', 'daringbadi', 'use_DARINGBADI_AS_PRIMARY_HOTEL_BASE AND: allocate_SEPARATE_MANDASARU_HALF_OR_FULL_DAY', 'Official Odisha Tourism already uses this pattern in its longer Daringbadi itinerary, separating Mandasaru from the main local sightseeing day. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:44', 'daringbadi', 'consider_MANDASARU + PUTUDI_ON_LONGER_ITINERARY AND: do_not_force_WITH_FULL_DARINGBADI_LOCAL_DAY', 'Odisha Tourism''s longer Daringbadi itinerary treats Mandasaru Valley and Putudi Waterfall as a separate excursion day. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:45', 'daringbadi', 'use_BRAHMAPUR_AS_RAIL_GATEWAY AND: include_TAPTAPANI_OR_JIRANG_CHANDRAGIRI_ONLY_IF_ROUTE_AND_TRIP_LENGTH_SUPPORT_THEM', 'Brahmapur provides Daringbadi''s most practical major rail connection and works naturally within wider southern Odisha road circuits. ---'),
  ('daringbadi:rule:46', 'daringbadi', 'use_DARINGBADI_AS_PRIMARY_HILL_STATION_BASE AND: continue_TO_MANDASARU + BELGHAR + PHULBANI + PUTUDI_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Daringbadi is only one component of Kandhamal''s broader landscape of forests, waterfalls, valleys, tribal-region tourism and eco-tourism. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:0', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_MANGROVE_BOAT_SAFARI + DANGAMAL + SALTWATER_CROCODILES AND: include_SHORT_BIRDING_OR_NATURE_WALK_IF_TIME_ALLOWS', 'Very short Bhitarkanika stays gain the greatest value from one high-quality creek safari and the principal Dangamal wildlife experience. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:1', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_KHOLA_OR_GUPTI_BOAT_SAFARI + DANGAMAL + CROCODILE_CONSERVATION + BIRDING + NATURE_TRAIL AND: retain_ONE_RELAXED_ECO_CAMP_EVENING', 'Two to three nights provide the strongest balance between mangrove boating, wildlife observation and comfortable pacing. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:2', 'bhitarkanika', 'add_SECONDARY_CREEK_OR_EXTENDED_BIRDING AND: consider_HABALIKHATI_OR_EKAKULA_IF_ACCESS_AND_WEATHER_ALLOW', 'Longer stays can move beyond the principal Dangamal circuit into quieter waterways and coastal ecosystems. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:3', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_BHITARKANIKA + ONE_COASTAL_OR_ODISHA_NATURE_EXTENSION AND: consider_HABALIKHATI + EKAKULA_OR_OTHER_REGIONAL_WETLAND_ROUTE', 'Bhitarkanika''s core wildlife circuits are compact enough that extended trips become stronger when combined with broader coastal Odisha nature travel. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:4', 'bhitarkanika', 'consider_BHITARKANIKA + CHILIKA_MANGALAJODI_OR_OTHER_ODISHA_WILDLIFE_DESTINATION', 'A longer Odisha nature itinerary gains more ecological diversity by combining mangroves with additional wetlands or wildlife landscapes. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:5', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_QUIET_NATURE_CAMP + PRIVATE_BOAT + PRIVATE_CAR + RELAXED_WILDLIFE_SCHEDULE AND: increase_MANGROVE_SCENERY + PHOTOGRAPHY + QUIET_EVENINGS', 'Bhitarkanika''s romantic strength comes from seclusion, waterways and nature rather than conventional resort entertainment. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:6', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_SHORT_BOAT_SAFARI + DANGAMAL + CROCODILE_VIEWING + BIRDING AND: maintain_CLOSE_CHILD_SUPERVISION AND: reduce_LONG_REMOTE_CRUISES', 'Families benefit most from visually engaging wildlife experiences without excessive boat duration or difficult logistics. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:7', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_SHORT_STABLE_BOAT_RIDE + DANGAMAL + WILDLIFE_INTERPRETATION AND: reduce_LONG_CREEK_ROUTES + DIFFICULT_JETTY_TRANSFERS + LONG_TRAILS', 'Young children generally handle shorter wildlife experiences better than prolonged remote boat journeys. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:8', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_BEST_AVAILABLE_ECO_STAY AND: increase_PRIVATE_CAR + PRIVATE_BOAT + NATURALIST_GUIDE + FLEXIBLE_SAFARI_TIMING', 'Bhitarkanika luxury is primarily service-driven and nature-based rather than conventional five-star resort luxury. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:9', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_SIMPLE_ECO_STAY + SHARED_ROAD_TRANSFER_WHERE_AVAILABLE AND: share_BOAT_COST_WITH_SMALL_GROUP_WHERE_PRACTICAL', 'Accommodation and park entry can remain affordable, but road and boat transfers form a meaningful part of total trip cost. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:10', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_DANGAMAL + SALTWATER_CROCODILES + MANGROVE_CREEKS + SPOTTED_DEER AND: use_EARLY_BOAT_TIMING_WHERE_AVAILABLE', 'Bhitarkanika''s wildlife identity is built around estuarine crocodiles, mangrove fauna and creek-based observation. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:11', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_CREEK_BOAT_SAFARI + DANGAMAL AND: maintain_SAFE_DISTANCE + FOLLOW_FOREST_AND_BOATMAN_INSTRUCTIONS AND: do_not_guarantee_CLOSE_SIGHTINGS', 'Bhitarkanika is one of India''s most important estuarine-crocodile landscapes, but sightings remain natural wildlife encounters. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:12', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_KHOLA_OR_GUPTI_CREEK_SYSTEM AND: allocate_EXTENDED_BOAT_TIME', 'Odisha Tourism explicitly identifies Bhitarkanika as a major mangrove ecosystem structured around creeks and canals fed by the Brahmani, Baitarani, Dhamra and Patasala river systems. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:13', 'bhitarkanika', 'prebook_AUTHORIZED_BOAT_WHERE_PRACTICAL AND: choose_ROUTE_BASED_ON_JETTY + TIDE + WEATHER + WILDLIFE_INTEREST', 'Boating is the primary method of exploring Bhitarkanika''s mangrove ecosystem. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:14', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_WINTER + EARLY_MORNING + QUIET_CREEKS AND: include_BAGAGAHANA_OR_RELEVANT_HERONRY_ZONE_WHERE_ACCESS_IS_PERMITTED AND: reduce_NOISY_GROUP_ACTIVITY', 'Bhitarkanika supports substantial resident and migratory birdlife, while winter is particularly strong for bird-oriented tourism. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:15', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_EARLY_MORNING_BOAT + CROCODILES + KINGFISHERS + MANGROVE_REFLECTIONS + BIRDING AND: use_LONGER_PRIVATE_BOAT_IF_BUDGET_ALLOWS', 'Bhitarkanika''s strongest photography combines wildlife, tidal creeks, mangrove textures and birdlife. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:16', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_PRIVATE_OR_SMALL_GROUP_BOAT AND: carry_BINOCULARS + TELEPHOTO_EQUIPMENT AND: avoid_PRESSURING_BOATMEN_FOR_UNSAFE_WILDLIFE_APPROACHES', 'Wildlife photography improves with patience, quiet movement and responsible observation rather than close pursuit. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:17', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_MANGROVES + CREEKS + DANGAMAL + BIRDING + SHORT_FOREST_TRAILS', 'Bhitarkanika''s primary destination value is ecological rather than architectural or urban. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:18', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_OFFICIAL_OR_APPROVED_NATURE_CAMP + AUTHORIZED_BOAT + RESPONSIBLE_WASTE_PRACTICES AND: minimize_SINGLE_USE_PLASTIC', 'Bhitarkanika is a protected wetland and wildlife landscape where low-impact tourism should take priority. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:19', 'bhitarkanika', 'prioritize_SHORT_DESIGNATED_NATURE_TRAILS AND: do_not_expect_LONG_MOUNTAIN_TREKS', 'Odisha Tourism includes trekking among Bhitarkanika activities, but the destination is fundamentally a mangrove wetland rather than a mountain-trekking region. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:20', 'bhitarkanika', 'allocate_ONE_FULL_WILDLIFE_DAY AND: combine_EARLY_BIRDING + CREEK_CRUISE + DANGAMAL', 'These two wildlife strengths are most effectively experienced together through a dedicated boat-based day. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:21', 'bhitarkanika', 'allocate_2_TO_4_HOURS_EXCLUDING_MAJOR_BOAT_TRANSFER_TIME AND: include_CROCODILE_CONSERVATION + WILDLIFE_INTERPRETATION + SHORT_NATURE_WALK', 'Official Odisha Tourism itineraries specifically combine Dangamal with crocodile viewing, wildlife interpretation and forest walking. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:22', 'bhitarkanika', 'use_AS_PRIMARY_BOAT_GATEWAY_WHERE_ROUTE_AND_HOTEL_LOCATION_SUPPORT_IT AND: prioritize_CREEK_SAFARI + MANGROVE_WILDLIFE', 'Khola is one of the principal practical gateways for exploring Bhitarkanika''s creek network. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:23', 'bhitarkanika', 'consider_GUPTI_AS_BOAT_ENTRY_AND_ECO_STAY_BASE AND: combine_WITH_DANGAMAL', 'Official tourism itineraries use Gupti as an access point for boat travel to Dangamal and crocodile-rich mangrove waterways. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:24', 'bhitarkanika', 'treat_AS_REMOTE_COASTAL_EXTENSION AND: verify_CURRENT_ACCESS + TIDE + WEATHER + ACCOMMODATION_OPERATION AND: allow_EXTRA_LOGISTICS_BUFFER', 'Habalikhati is better treated as an extended eco-tourism experience than as a mandatory first-time Bhitarkanika stop. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:25', 'bhitarkanika', 'treat_AS_SPECIALIST_COASTAL_EXTENSION AND: use_PREARRANGED_TRANSPORT_OR_BOAT AND: verify_TIDE + WEATHER + CURRENT_LOCAL_ACCESS', 'Ekakula involves greater coastal and estuarine logistics than the standard Dangamal circuit. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:26', 'bhitarkanika', 'choose_NATURE_CAMP_OR_QUIET_ECO_STAY AND: combine_ONE_MAJOR_BOAT_SAFARI + FREE_TIME + BIRDING', 'Bhitarkanika works particularly well when wildlife activities are balanced with quiet riverside or forest time. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:27', 'bhitarkanika', 'focus_ON_ECO_CAMP_DINNER + QUIET_EVENING + EARLY_SLEEP AND: do_not_position_BHITARKANIKA_AS_BAR_OR_CLUB_DESTINATION', 'Bhitarkanika is fundamentally a wilderness destination with negligible conventional nightlife. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:28', 'bhitarkanika', 'keep_EXPECTATIONS_LOW AND: use_BHADRAK_OR_OTHER_GATEWAY_TOWNS_FOR_REGIONAL_SHOPPING', 'Shopping is peripheral to Bhitarkanika''s wildlife and eco-tourism experience. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:29', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_ONE_ECO_STAY_OR_GATEWAY_BASE AND: avoid_UNNECESSARY_HOTEL_CHANGES', 'The principal creek, Dangamal and birding experiences can normally be handled from one strategically chosen access base. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:30', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_QUIET_RIVERSIDE_OR_FOREST_ECO_PROPERTY AND: verify_PRIVACY + ROOM_COMFORT + FOOD + ROAD_OR_BOAT_ACCESS', 'Property atmosphere and logistical convenience strongly affect a romantic Bhitarkanika stay. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:31', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_EASY_JETTY_ACCESS + FAMILY_ROOM + MEALS + SAFE_PROPERTY_LAYOUT AND: verify_POWER_BACKUP + CHILD_SAFETY + BOAT_BOARDING_ARRANGEMENT', 'Practical facilities are more important than extreme remoteness for most families. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:32', 'bhitarkanika', 'consider_OFFICIAL_NATURE_CAMP_OR_APPROVED_ECO_STAY', 'Odisha Tourism specifically positions nature camps as part of the Bhitarkanika visitor experience. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:33', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_PREBOOKED_PRIVATE_CAR_OR_STRUCTURED_TRANSFER AND: allocate_APPROX_4_TO_5_HOURS_WITH_BUFFER_DEPENDING_ON_ENTRY_GATE AND: keep_ARRIVAL_DAY_LIGHT', 'Odisha Tourism lists Bhubaneswar as the nearest airport gateway and places Bhitarkanika at roughly 172 km by its tourism routing. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:34', 'bhitarkanika', 'use_BHADRAK_AS_RAIL_GATEWAY_WHERE_ROUTING_IS_SUITABLE AND: continue_BY_CAB_OR_LOCAL_ROAD_TRANSFER', 'Odisha Tourism lists Bhadrak as the nearest railway station and notes onward road connections toward Bhitarkanika. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:35', 'bhitarkanika', 'use_BOAT AND: allocate_WILDLIFE_VIEWING_TIME_DURING_TRANSFER', 'Official Odisha Tourism itineraries use Gupti-to-Dangamal boat routing specifically for viewing estuarine crocodiles, mangroves and wildlife. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:36', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_AUTHORIZED_BOAT + SHORT_DESIGNATED_WALKS AND: do_not_expect_ROAD_ACCESS_TO_ALL_MANGROVE_AREAS', 'Odisha Tourism states that boating is the principal way to tour Bhitarkanika''s mangrove ecosystem. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:37', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_PRIVATE_CAR + STABLE_BOAT + SHORT_CRUISES + EASY_DANGAMAL_WALKING AND: reduce_DIFFICULT_JETTY_TRANSFERS + LONG_NATURE_TRAILS', 'Bhitarkanika can work for seniors, but boat boarding and natural terrain require itinerary simplification. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:38', 'bhitarkanika', 'increase_BIRDING + BOAT_SAFARI + CROCODILE_WATCHING + PHOTOGRAPHY AND: prefer_LONGER_OUTDOOR_WILDLIFE_DAYS', 'Odisha Tourism identifies September to March as the preferred Bhitarkanika travel season, while migratory birds add particular value during winter. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:39', 'bhitarkanika', 'treat_AS_PRIMARY_WILDLIFE_SEASON AND: prebook_ECO_STAY + BOAT_DURING_BUSY_DATES', 'Drier and more comfortable conditions generally support stronger wildlife touring and longer boat excursions. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:40', 'bhitarkanika', 'prefer_EARLY_MORNING_BOATING AND: reduce_MIDDAY_HEAT_EXPOSURE AND: verify_UPCOMING_CLOSURE_DATE', 'April becomes substantially hotter and directly precedes Bhitarkanika''s annual crocodile-breeding closure. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:41', 'bhitarkanika', 'do_not_schedule_STANDARD_BHITARKANIKA_NATIONAL_PARK_VISIT AND: verify_CURRENT_FOREST_DEPARTMENT_NOTIFICATION_BEFORE_TRAVEL', 'Bhitarkanika was closed to visitors from May 1 through July 31 in 2026 to provide undisturbed nesting conditions for estuarine crocodiles, continuing the protected area''s annual breeding-season closure practice. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:42', 'bhitarkanika', 'treat_AS_POST_CLOSURE_MONSOON_PERIOD AND: increase_WEATHER_FLEXIBILITY + MANGROVE_GREENERY AND: verify_CURRENT_REOPENING + RIVER + ROAD_CONDITIONS', 'The park normally reopens after the breeding closure, but monsoon conditions can still affect access and visitor comfort. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:43', 'bhitarkanika', 'increase_MANGROVE_SCENERY AND: reduce_LONG_REMOTE_BOAT_SCHEDULES_IF_CONDITIONS_ARE_POOR AND: verify_RIVER + ROAD + BOAT_OPERATIONS', 'Monsoon enhances mangrove greenery but creates greater uncertainty around roads, waterways and outdoor comfort. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:44', 'bhitarkanika', 'reassess_BOAT_SAFARI + REMOTE_CREEKS + COASTAL_EXTENSIONS + ROAD_TRANSFERS AND: follow_FOREST_DEPARTMENT + DISTRICT_ADMINISTRATION + LOCAL_OPERATOR_GUIDANCE', 'Marine and estuarine weather safety must take precedence over wildlife sightseeing. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:45', 'bhitarkanika', 'modify_BOAT_ROUTE + DEPARTURE_TIME AND: follow_AUTHORIZED_BOAT_OPERATOR_GUIDANCE', 'Bhitarkanika''s creek network is tidal, so water conditions materially affect boat operations and routing. ---');
