  ('bhitarkanika:rule:50', 'bhitarkanika', 'allocate_SEPARATE_COASTAL_EXCURSION AND: use_PREARRANGED_ROUTE AND: do_not_force_WITH_FULL_DANGAMAL_DAY', 'Ekakula''s remote estuarine setting requires more logistical planning than Bhitarkanika''s principal wildlife circuit. ---'),
  ('bhitarkanika:rule:51', 'bhitarkanika', 'use_BHUBANESWAR_AS_PRIMARY_AIR_GATEWAY AND: keep_AT_LEAST_ONE_OVERNIGHT_NEAR_OR_WITHIN_BHITARKANIKA_FOR_BETTER_WILDLIFE_TIMING', 'Although Odisha Tourism publishes day-trip patterns from Bhubaneswar, overnight stays allow more relaxed and wildlife-oriented scheduling. ---'),
